# MountTransient
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: マイチョコボに騎乗する。<br>グランドカンパニーから支給された軍用チョコボ
#. de: Rufe deinen von deiner Staatlichen Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft ausgegebenen Kampf-Chocobo herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez le chocobo de bataille que votre grande compagnie vous a alloué.
#. column 1: Born and bred in the city<hyphen>state of Ishgard, the majority of company chocobos are geldings of the rouncey variety; however, massive destriers and miniature Belah'dian jennets are also raised to accommodate the builds of Roegadyn and Lalafellin riders respectively.
#. column 2: Chocobos are stout-<br>hearted creatures, but<br>they have their limits.<br>  - Mimigun
msgctxt "MountTransient:1:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Grand Company-issued battle chocobo."
msgstr "Призовите боевого чокобо, выданного вашей Великой компанией."

#. ja: イシュガルド産の軍用チョコボ。一般的なラウンシー種だけでなく、ルガディン族の騎乗にも堪えられる大柄のデストリア種や、ララフェル族用に品種改良されたベラフディアン・ジェニット種などが存在する
#. de: Diese Tiere wachsen im Stadt<shy>staat von Ishgard auf und eignen sich sowohl zum Reiten als auch für die Schlacht. Um dem Körperbau von Roegadyn und Lalafell gerecht zu werden, werden auch besonders kräftige und sehr kleine Varianten gezüchtet.
#. fr: Les grandes compagnies se fournissent auprès des meilleurs haras ishgardais pour obtenir leurs montures. Les roussins sont destinés aux soldats de taille moyenne, les robustes destriers aux Roegadyns, et les petits genets belahdiens aux Lalafells.
#. column 0: Summon your Grand Company-issued battle chocobo.
#. column 2: Chocobos are stout-<br>hearted creatures, but<br>they have their limits.<br>  - Mimigun
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:1:0:1"
msgid "Born and bred in the city<hyphen>state of Ishgard, the majority of company chocobos are geldings of the rouncey variety; however, massive destriers and miniature Belah'dian jennets are also raised to accommodate the builds of Roegadyn and Lalafellin riders respectively."
msgstr "Большинство чокобо великих рот — кастрированные самцы породы раунси, выведенные в Ишгарде. Но для рогадинов разводят крупных дестриеров, а для лалафеллов — миниатюрных белахдийских женетов."

#. ja: クエーッ！
#. de: Schlafende Chocobos soll man nicht wecken. Warum? Weil<br>sie einen noch strengeren Körpergeruch entwickeln, wenn<br>sie nicht ausgeschlafen sind.<br><i>Volksmund</i>
#. fr: Kwé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your Grand Company-issued battle chocobo.
#. column 1: Born and bred in the city<hyphen>state of Ishgard, the majority of company chocobos are geldings of the rouncey variety; however, massive destriers and miniature Belah'dian jennets are also raised to accommodate the builds of Roegadyn and Lalafellin riders respectively.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:1:0:2"
msgid "Chocobos are stout-<br>hearted creatures, but<br>they have their limits.<br>  - Mimigun"
msgstr "Чокобо, конечно, крепкие птицы,<br>но и у их терпения есть предел.<br>  — Мимигун"

#. ja: グゥーブーに騎乗する。<br>不思議なホルンによって呼び出されるグゥーブー
#. de: Benutz dein Goobbue-Horn, das dir der Fahrende Sänger gab, um dein moosiges Reittier herbeizurufen.
#. fr: La corne de forme étrange que vous a donnée le ménestrel errant vous permet d'appeler un énorme goobbue.
#. column 1: Traded for a song by the High Satrap of a distant land, the secret to taming these creatures once thought to be unbreakable was introduced to Eorzea by a mysterious wandering minstrel who journeyed through the realm in the final days before the Calamity.
#. column 2: Would that I had the<br>girth of a goobbue!<br>  - Nanamo Ul Namo
msgctxt "MountTransient:4:0:0"
msgid "Use the odd-shaped horn gifted to you by the wandering minstrel to call a massive goobbue to your side."
msgstr "С помощью причудливого рога, подаренного странствующим менестрелем, призовите огромного губбу."

#. ja: 異邦の詩人が冒険者に感謝の印として贈った「魔法の角笛」によって、呼び寄せることができるグゥーブー。本来、温厚ではない獣だが、詩人が紡ぐ詩を気に入ったらしく、エオルゼアに迷い込んだ彼と共に旅を続けていた
#. de: Wie diese wilde Kreaturen zu zähmen sind, war lange Zeit ein Mysterium. Bis ein sagenumwobener fahrender Sänger in den letzten Tagen vor der Katastrophe durch Eorzea wanderte und es dessen Bewohnern näherbrachte.
#. fr: Le ménestrel errant vous a offert en gage de recon<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ce une corne magique permettant d'appeler un goobbue. Ces animaux ne sont généralement pas dociles, mais celui-ci est semble-t-il un mélomane qui a suivi le barde durant ses voyages dans tout Éorzéa, charmé par sa musique.
#. column 0: Use the odd-shaped horn gifted to you by the wandering minstrel to call a massive goobbue to your side.
#. column 2: Would that I had the<br>girth of a goobbue!<br>  - Nanamo Ul Namo
msgctxt "MountTransient:4:0:1"
msgid "Traded for a song by the High Satrap of a distant land, the secret to taming these creatures once thought to be unbreakable was introduced to Eorzea by a mysterious wandering minstrel who journeyed through the realm in the final days before the Calamity."
msgstr "Когда-то секрет приручения этих зверей, которых считали совершенно неукротимыми, открыл Эорзее загадочный странствующий менестрель. В последние дни перед Бедствием он путешествовал по миру и обменял это знание на песню от высокого сатрапа далёкой страны."

#. ja: ンゴォォォ
#. de: Mmmm, was für Delikatessen! Wenn ich<br>doch nur den Magen einer Goobbue hätte,<br>dann könnte ich noch mehr essen.<br><i>Nanamo</i>
#. fr: (bâillement)
#. column 0: Use the odd-shaped horn gifted to you by the wandering minstrel to call a massive goobbue to your side.
#. column 1: Traded for a song by the High Satrap of a distant land, the secret to taming these creatures once thought to be unbreakable was introduced to Eorzea by a mysterious wandering minstrel who journeyed through the realm in the final days before the Calamity.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:4:0:2"
msgid "Would that I had the<br>girth of a goobbue!<br>  - Nanamo Ul Namo"
msgstr "Эх, вот бы мне<br>размером с губбу быть!<br>  — Нанамо Ул Намо"

#. ja: レガシーチョコボに騎乗する。<br>時を越えて巡り会った名チョコボ
#. de: Fünf Jahre und eine erschütternde Katastrophe konnten die Bande zwischen euch nicht sprengen: Ein Pfiff, und dein treuer Chocobo ist zur Stelle wie in alten Zeiten.
#. fr: Le ravage du continent par le Fléau et cinq longues années n'ont pas réussi à affecter ce courageux animal. Il sera à vos côtés d'un simple coup de sifflet.
#. column 1: In the five years following your sudden disappearance from the Carteneau Flats, your ever-faithful chocobo spent each waking moment galloping across the realm in search of his lost master. His myriad adventures are nothing less than fantastical and heartbreaking...but that is a story for another day.
#. column 2: Go find the chocobo you<br>rode in on, and ride on out.<br>  - Sevrin
msgctxt "MountTransient:5:0:0"
msgid "Five years and a realm-shaking Calamity were not enough to break the bonds between you and your loyal steed. A single whistle and he will be at your side once again."
msgstr "Пять лет и Бедствие, потрясшее весь мир, не смогли разорвать связь между вами и верным скакуном. Достаточно свистнуть — и он снова будет рядом."

#. ja: 賢者ルイゾワの秘術によって、次元の狭間へと送られていた冒険者が、5年の時を越えて巡り会った名チョコボ。長らく主なしで放浪の旅を続けていたらしく、たくましさと独特の風格を兼ね備えている
#. de: In den fünf Jahren nach deinem plötzlichen Verschwinden in Carteneau hat dieser treue Chocobo jeden Moment damit zugebracht, auf der Suche nach seinem verlorenen Meister durch die Lande zu streifen. Seine zahlreichen Abenteuer sind fantastisch und herzzerreißend ...
#. fr: Vous ne pensiez pas revoir votre chère monture après votre saut dans l'avenir. C'était sans compter sur la fidélité et la ténacité de votre chocobo, qui a su vous retrouver après avoir erré cinq ans sans jamais accepter d'autre maître.
#. column 0: Five years and a realm-shaking Calamity were not enough to break the bonds between you and your loyal steed. A single whistle and he will be at your side once again.
#. column 2: Go find the chocobo you<br>rode in on, and ride on out.<br>  - Sevrin
msgctxt "MountTransient:5:0:1"
msgid "In the five years following your sudden disappearance from the Carteneau Flats, your ever-faithful chocobo spent each waking moment galloping across the realm in search of his lost master. His myriad adventures are nothing less than fantastical and heartbreaking...but that is a story for another day."
msgstr "Пять лет после вашего внезапного исчезновения с равнин Картено верный чокобо неустанно скакал по всему миру в поисках пропавшего хозяина. Его многочисленные приключения — история удивительная и трогательная... но это уже совсем другая история."

#. ja: クエーッ！！
#. de: Bis vor kurzem wurde die Chocobo-Zucht nur in Ishgard betrieben. Dort wurde<br>alles sehr streng reguliert. Es gab zum Beispiel ein striktes Exportverbot für<br>weibliche Chocobos, um die Monopolstellung Ishgards nicht zu gefährden.<br><i>Keitha</i>
#. fr: Kwéé<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Five years and a realm-shaking Calamity were not enough to break the bonds between you and your loyal steed. A single whistle and he will be at your side once again.
#. column 1: In the five years following your sudden disappearance from the Carteneau Flats, your ever-faithful chocobo spent each waking moment galloping across the realm in search of his lost master. His myriad adventures are nothing less than fantastical and heartbreaking...but that is a story for another day.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:5:0:2"
msgid "Go find the chocobo you<br>rode in on, and ride on out.<br>  - Sevrin"
msgstr "Отыщи чокобо, на котором сюда примчался,<br>и уезжай на нём восвояси.<br>  — Севрин"

#. ja: 魔導アーマーに騎乗する。<br>シドが改良したガーロンド・アイアンワークスカスタム
#. de: Rufe deine von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken modifizierte Magitek-Kampfmaschine herbei.
#. fr: Vous pouvez appeler à vous une armure magitek, qui a été modifiée par les ingénieurs des Forges de Garlond sous la direction de Cid.
#. column 1: This suit of Garlean-developed reaper-class magitek battle armor has had its original control systems purged and replaced with a new, modified core built by Cid of the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: At last, our very own<br>suit of magitek armor!<br>  - Cid Garlond
msgctxt "MountTransient:6:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your suit of Garlond Ironworks-modified magitek armor."
msgstr "Призовите в бой магическую броню, модернизированную мастерской «Гарлонд Айронворкс»."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍が制式採用している騎乗型魔導アーマー「リーパー」。これを鹵獲したシドたちが、魔法人形のコアを制御装置として組み込むなど改造を施し、ガーロンド・アイアンワークスカスタムとして新生させた
#. de: Dieser garleischen Magitek-Kampfrüstung wurde das ursprüngliche Kontrollsystem entfernt und durch einen neuen, modifizierten Kern ersetzt, den Cid von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken entwickelt hat.
#. fr: Une armure magitek impériale de type faucheuse. Cid et ses ingénieurs l'ont modifiée, en incorporant notamment un noyau magnétique similaire à ceux utilisés dans la fabrication des pantins.
#. column 0: Call into battle your suit of Garlond Ironworks-modified magitek armor.
#. column 2: At last, our very own<br>suit of magitek armor!<br>  - Cid Garlond
msgctxt "MountTransient:6:0:1"
msgid "This suit of Garlean-developed reaper-class magitek battle armor has had its original control systems purged and replaced with a new, modified core built by Cid of the Garlond Ironworks."
msgstr "Эту боевую магическую броню класса «жнец», разработанную в Гарлемальде, лишили исходной системы управления и установили вместо неё новое усовершенствованное ядро, созданное Сидом из мастерской «Гарлонд Айронворкс»."

#. ja: ウィーン、ガシャン！
#. de: Der Pfirsichduft weckt auch in mir wohlige Erinnerungen. Ganz Doma war im<br>Frühling bedeckt von der Pracht rosafarbener Blüten. Nun, bis die Garlear mit ihren<br>Magitek-Kampf<shy>maschinen alles niedertraten, was in unserem schönen Land wuchs.<br><i>Houzan</i>
#. fr: Identification en cours...
#. column 0: Call into battle your suit of Garlond Ironworks-modified magitek armor.
#. column 1: This suit of Garlean-developed reaper-class magitek battle armor has had its original control systems purged and replaced with a new, modified core built by Cid of the Garlond Ironworks.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:6:0:2"
msgid "At last, our very own<br>suit of magitek armor!<br>  - Cid Garlond"
msgstr "Наконец-то у нас<br>своя магическая броня!<br>  — Сид Гарлонд"

#. ja: クァールに騎乗する。<br>訓練された若く俊敏なクァール
#. de: Rufe deinen flinken Coeurl herbei, der darauf trainiert wurde, dich als <if $gn4>seine Meisterin<else>seinen Meister</if> zu erkennen und nicht als Mahlzeit.
#. fr: Vous pouvez appeler un coeurl de combat, entraîné depuis son plus jeune âge pour voir en vous un<if $gn4>e</if> ami<if $gn4>e</if>... et non pas de la nourriture.
#. column 1: Native to the jungles of the Near East, coeurls were only recently introduced to Eorzea, brought over from faraway lands such as Thavnair by Ul'dahn nobles who thought to breed them as pets. Now, but a handful of skilled tamers living in recluse on the Pearl are<br>said to be able to train them.
#. column 2: Hey, good lookin'!<br>Catch my coeurl yet?<br>  - Swygrael
msgctxt "MountTransient:8:0:0"
msgid "Summon your fleet-footed battle coeurl, trained from a pup to recognize you as a friend...not food."
msgstr "Призовите быстроногого боевого курла, с детства приученного видеть в вас друга... а не обед."

#. ja: 若く俊敏なクァール。野生のクァールは非常に獰猛な魔獣として知られる存在だが、原産地である近東では独自の調教法が確立されているという。この個体は、サベネア島で騎獣として訓練されたものらしい
#. de: Diese Spezies stammt aus dem Nahen Osten und hat sich erst vor kurzem auch in Eorzea verbreitet. Die Tiere wurden von Adeligen aus Ul'dah aus fernen Ländern wie Thavnair importiert, um sie als Haustiere zu halten. Jedoch gibt es nur eine Handvoll ausgebildeter Bändiger, die sie abzurichten vermögen.
#. fr: À l'état sauvage, ces félins sont redoutés pour leur incroyable rapidité et leur férocité. Mais au Proche-Orient, dont ils sont originaires, ils sont dressés grâce à des méthodes par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>res inconnues des Éorzéens et sont utilisés comme monture. Le vôtre aurait été élevé à Thavnair.
#. column 0: Summon your fleet-footed battle coeurl, trained from a pup to recognize you as a friend...not food.
#. column 2: Hey, good lookin'!<br>Catch my coeurl yet?<br>  - Swygrael
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:8:0:1"
msgid "Native to the jungles of the Near East, coeurls were only recently introduced to Eorzea, brought over from faraway lands such as Thavnair by Ul'dahn nobles who thought to breed them as pets. Now, but a handful of skilled tamers living in recluse on the Pearl are<br>said to be able to train them."
msgstr "Курлы родом из джунглей Ближнего Востока. В Эорзею они попали совсем недавно: ульдские аристократы привозили их из далёких земель, вроде Тавнаира, чтобы разводить как домашних питомцев. Теперь же говорят, что дрессировать их умеют лишь несколько опытных укротителей, затворников с острова Жемчужина.<br>"

#. ja: グルルルル…
#. de: Erst letzte Woche wurde ein Neuling von einem Coeurl<br>in Stücke gerissen. Kein schöner Anblick, das sage ich dir.<br><i>Orwen</i>
#. fr: (feulement)
#. column 0: Summon your fleet-footed battle coeurl, trained from a pup to recognize you as a friend...not food.
#. column 1: Native to the jungles of the Near East, coeurls were only recently introduced to Eorzea, brought over from faraway lands such as Thavnair by Ul'dahn nobles who thought to breed them as pets. Now, but a handful of skilled tamers living in recluse on the Pearl are<br>said to be able to train them.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:8:0:2"
msgid "Hey, good lookin'!<br>Catch my coeurl yet?<br>  - Swygrael"
msgstr "Эй, красавчик!<br>Уже поймал моего курла?<br>  — Суигрель"

#. ja: アーリマンに騎乗する。<br>魔法によって操ることを可能にした妖異アーリマン
#. de: Rufe deinen Ahriman herbei, den mächtige Magie dazu brachte, sich ohne Murren von dir reiten zu lassen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ahriman, une entité entraînée pour garder toujours l'œil sur vous.
#. column 1: Though little is known of the void and the creatures which call the extra-dimensional realm home, scholars have discovered that there is a strict hierarchy amongst voidsent consisting of twelve distinct tiers. Ahrimans are believed to fall into the fifth, making them formidable foes...when not enthralled by curses.
#. column 2: Ye'd 'ave t' be blinder'n an<br>ahriman wi' an eyepatch t'<br>miss the camp.<br>  - Baderon Tenfingers
msgctxt "MountTransient:9:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a riding ahriman, bound to this realm with powerful magicks guaranteed to never fade."
msgstr "Призовите ездового ахримана, навеки привязанного к этому миру могучей магией."

#. ja: 単眼有翼の魔物。妖異学者が分類するところによると、妖異十二階位の第五位に位置する中位の妖異らしい。動物の眼を依代に異界から召喚したものを、強力な呪術によって縛り付けることで、操ることを可能にしている
#. de: Obwohl man wenig über das Reich des Nichts und dessen Kreaturen weiß, haben Gelehrte entdeckt, dass es eine strikte Hierarchie unter den Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten gibt, die aus zwölf Rängen besteht. Ahriman gehören mutmaßlich zum fünften davon, was sie zu formidablen Gegnern macht.
#. fr: Le néant est une dimension par nature méconnue, mais les savants s'accordent généralement pour hiérarchiser les créatures qui l'habitent sur douze rangs. Les ahrimans feraient partie du cinquième.
#. column 0: Summon forth a riding ahriman, bound to this realm with powerful magicks guaranteed to never fade.
#. column 2: Ye'd 'ave t' be blinder'n an<br>ahriman wi' an eyepatch t'<br>miss the camp.<br>  - Baderon Tenfingers
msgctxt "MountTransient:9:0:1"
msgid "Though little is known of the void and the creatures which call the extra-dimensional realm home, scholars have discovered that there is a strict hierarchy amongst voidsent consisting of twelve distinct tiers. Ahrimans are believed to fall into the fifth, making them formidable foes...when not enthralled by curses."
msgstr "О Пустоте и её обитателях известно мало, но учёные выяснили, что у демонов есть строгая иерархия из двенадцати ступеней. Ахриманов относят к пятой, поэтому они весьма опасны... если только не скованы проклятием."

#. ja: ギロリ！
#. de: Sprachforscher vermuten, dass gefräßige Ahriman der<br>Ursprung für die Redensart „Das Auge isst mit.“ sind.<br><i>Enzyklopädie Eorzea</i>
#. fr: (regard fixe)
#. column 0: Summon forth a riding ahriman, bound to this realm with powerful magicks guaranteed to never fade.
#. column 1: Though little is known of the void and the creatures which call the extra-dimensional realm home, scholars have discovered that there is a strict hierarchy amongst voidsent consisting of twelve distinct tiers. Ahrimans are believed to fall into the fifth, making them formidable foes...when not enthralled by curses.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:9:0:2"
msgid "Ye'd 'ave t' be blinder'n an<br>ahriman wi' an eyepatch t'<br>miss the camp.<br>  - Baderon Tenfingers"
msgstr "Чтобы не заметить лагерь,<br>надо быть слепее ахримана<br>с повязкой на глазу!<br>  — Бадерон Десятипалый"

#. ja: ユニコーンに騎乗する。<br>黒衣森で出会った純白の一角獣
#. de: Rufe dein weißes, elegant gehörntes Reittier herbei, mit dem du dich im Finsterwald befreundet hast.
#. fr: Vous appelez l'étrange licorne que vous avez rencontrée dans la Sylve, peut-être une des dernières de son espèce.
#. column 1: Not long ago, Eorzean unicorns numbered in the thousands, and could oft be seen roaming the Coerthas highlands in great majestic herds that would render the mountains white as snow. Poaching has caused the population to decline, and if it were not for your act of kindness, there would be one fewer.
#. column 2: Your precious horses,<br>they're just unicorns with<br>a big empty forehead.<br>  - Chief Chocowacker
msgctxt "MountTransient:15:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the single-horned steed you befriended in the Black Shroud."
msgstr "Призовите однорогого скакуна, с которым подружились в Чёрной чаще."

#. ja: 黒衣森で出会った純白の一角獣。ユニコーンは、原産地のクルザス地方でも滅多に目にしない珍しい獣だが、何らかの要因で山を下り、森に迷い込んでしまったらしい。怪我を治療したことで懐き、頼れる友となった
#. de: Vor gar nicht allzu langer Zeit gab es in Eorzea noch Tausende von Einhörnern, die oft in großen Herden über das Hochland von Coerthas zogen und die Berge so schneeweiß färbten. Die Wilderei hat den Bestän-<br>den jedoch arg zugesetzt, und wenn du nicht gewesen wärest, gäbe es nun noch eins weniger.
#. fr: Rares sont ceux qui ont l'occasion d'apercevoir un de ces nobles équidés, même dans leur Coerthas natal. Cette licorne a décidé de rester à vos côtés après que vous l'avez soignée.
#. column 0: Summon forth the single-horned steed you befriended in the Black Shroud.
#. column 2: Your precious horses,<br>they're just unicorns with<br>a big empty forehead.<br>  - Chief Chocowacker
msgctxt "MountTransient:15:0:1"
msgid "Not long ago, Eorzean unicorns numbered in the thousands, and could oft be seen roaming the Coerthas highlands in great majestic herds that would render the mountains white as snow. Poaching has caused the population to decline, and if it were not for your act of kindness, there would be one fewer."
msgstr "Не так давно в Эорзее водились тысячи единорогов. Их величественные стада часто бродили по нагорьям Коэртаса, белея на фоне гор словно снег. Из-за браконьеров их стало куда меньше. Не прояви вы доброты, их осталось бы ещё на одного меньше."

#. ja: ブルルルル…
#. de: Einhörner sind klug und dafür bekannt, sich für<br>gute Taten bei ihren Gönnern zu bedanken.<br><i>Braya</i>
#. fr: Hiiiiiii<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth the single-horned steed you befriended in the Black Shroud.
#. column 1: Not long ago, Eorzean unicorns numbered in the thousands, and could oft be seen roaming the Coerthas highlands in great majestic herds that would render the mountains white as snow. Poaching has caused the population to decline, and if it were not for your act of kindness, there would be one fewer.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:15:0:2"
msgid "Your precious horses,<br>they're just unicorns with<br>a big empty forehead.<br>  - Chief Chocowacker"
msgstr "Ваши драгоценные лошади —<br>просто единороги<br>с пустой башкой!<br>  — Вождь Чоковакер"

#. ja: ベヒーモスに騎乗する。<br>幼獣の頃から人の手で育てた若く堅強なベヒーモス
#. de: Rufe deinen kraftstrotzenden Behemoth.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture béhémoth. Ce jeune béhémoth vigoureux a été élevé par l'homme, il est apprivoisé.
#. column 1: Immediately following the Calamity, an adventurer returning to Gridania from Falcon's Nest in Coerthas claims to have happened upon a den of baby behemoths who had lost their mother. Despite objections from friends and family alike, she kept the beasts, eventually training them to serve as mounts.
#. column 2: Do not presume to<br>provoke the behemoth to<br>battle. You will die.<br>  - Meurise
msgctxt "MountTransient:18:0:0"
msgid "Summon your mighty behemoth, trained from birth to carry you...not trample you underfoot like an ant."
msgstr "Призовите могучего бегемота, с рождения приученного носить вас... а не топтать, как муравья."

#. ja: 冒険者ギルドから贈られた屈強な騎獣。霊災直後にある冒険者が、クルザスの山奥で親獣から見捨てられたベヒーモスの幼獣を発見。これを手塩にかけて育てたところ、奇跡的に人に懐くようになったらしい
#. de: Unmittelbar nach der Katastrophe stieß eine Abenteurerin bei ihrer Rückkehr von Falkenhorst nach Gridania auf eine Höhle mit Baby-Behemoths, die ihre Mutter im Flammenmeer von Bahamut verloren hatten. Trotz energischer Einwände von Freunden und Familie behielt sie die kleinen Bestien und richtete sie als Reittiere ab.
#. fr: Immédiatement après le Fléau, un aventurier voyageant dans une région reculée du Coerthas a trouvé des bébés béhémoth dont la mère avait péri dans les flammes de Bahamut. Il les a élevés et est parvenu à les dresser, à la surprise de tous ses proches.
#. column 0: Summon your mighty behemoth, trained from birth to carry you...not trample you underfoot like an ant.
#. column 2: Do not presume to<br>provoke the behemoth to<br>battle. You will die.<br>  - Meurise
msgctxt "MountTransient:18:0:1"
msgid "Immediately following the Calamity, an adventurer returning to Gridania from Falcon's Nest in Coerthas claims to have happened upon a den of baby behemoths who had lost their mother. Despite objections from friends and family alike, she kept the beasts, eventually training them to serve as mounts."
msgstr "Сразу после Бедствия искательница приключений, возвращавшаяся из Соколиного гнезда в Гриданию, якобы наткнулась на логово детёнышей бегемотов, потерявших мать. Несмотря на возражения друзей и родных, она оставила зверей у себя и со временем выдрессировала их для верховой езды."

#. ja: グガアァァッ！
#. de: Und vergiss nicht: Egal, was passieren sollte,<br>leg dich auf keinen Fall mit dem Behemoth an!<br><i>Meurise</i>
#. fr: Grrr...
#. column 0: Summon your mighty behemoth, trained from birth to carry you...not trample you underfoot like an ant.
#. column 1: Immediately following the Calamity, an adventurer returning to Gridania from Falcon's Nest in Coerthas claims to have happened upon a den of baby behemoths who had lost their mother. Despite objections from friends and family alike, she kept the beasts, eventually training them to serve as mounts.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:18:0:2"
msgid "Do not presume to<br>provoke the behemoth to<br>battle. You will die.<br>  - Meurise"
msgstr "Не вздумайте<br>вызывать бегемота<br>на бой. Умрёте.<br>  — Мериз"

#. ja: キャバルリー・ドレイクに騎乗する。<br>灰の一党が育て上げた騎乗用バトルドレイク
#. de: Besteige deinen kampfstarken Drakon, den die Bruderschaft der Asche herangezogen hat.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture draconide. Élevé par la Ligue des cendres, ce draconide de combat est habitué à la présence humaine.
#. column 1: Training a cavalry drake is a long and arduous process that begins the moment the scalekin hatches. Never allowed to see its mother, the creature is raised solely in the presence of a drake whisperer while being weaned on the incendiary glands of aged battle drakes to ensure it is both submissive and deadly.
#. column 2: You are as a lost kitten<br>that has wandered into<br>the drake's lair.<br>  - Zagozz Teh
msgctxt "MountTransient:19:0:0"
msgid "Summon your cavalry drake, trained by the drake whisperer of the Brotherhood of Ash."
msgstr "Призовите боевого дрейка, выращенного дрейковым пастухом из Братства Эша."

#. ja: 灰の一党が育て上げた騎乗用バトルドレイク。幼き頃から、アマルジャ族の獣牧士が厳しい訓練を施し、かつ老成したバトルドレイクの火炎袋を食べさせて育てたため、従順さと野性味を併せ持つ騎獣となっている
#. de: Einen Reit-Drakon abzurichten ist ein langer und mühseliger Prozess, der schon kurz nach dem Schlüpfen des Jungtieres beginnt. Er bekommt seine Mutter nie zu Gesicht und wird von einem Drakon-Flüsterer aufgezogen, um sicherzustellen, dass er sowohl unterwürfig als auch tödlich ist.
#. fr: Le dressage d'un draconide de cavalerie est un processus long et ardu. Séparés im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment de leur mère, ils sont rapidement sevrés par leur dresseur, qui les nourrit de glandes calorifères de vieux draconides pour s'assurer qu'ils soient à la fois dociles et meurtriers.
#. column 0: Summon your cavalry drake, trained by the drake whisperer of the Brotherhood of Ash.
#. column 2: You are as a lost kitten<br>that has wandered into<br>the drake's lair.<br>  - Zagozz Teh
msgctxt "MountTransient:19:0:1"
msgid "Training a cavalry drake is a long and arduous process that begins the moment the scalekin hatches. Never allowed to see its mother, the creature is raised solely in the presence of a drake whisperer while being weaned on the incendiary glands of aged battle drakes to ensure it is both submissive and deadly."
msgstr "Вырастить кавалерийского дрейка — долгий и трудный процесс, который начинается сразу после вылупления. Малышу не дают видеть мать: его растит только дрейковый пастух и с ранних лет кормит огненными железами старых боевых дрейков, чтобы тот вырос послушным и смертоносным."

#. ja: フシュウウウウ…
#. de: Drakons schubsen ihre Jungen in einen Abgrund,<br>aus dem sie aus eigener Kraft emporklettern müssen.<br>Genau so ist es auch bei den Amalj'aa.<br><i>Hamujj Gah</i>
#. fr: Ssss...
#. column 0: Summon your cavalry drake, trained by the drake whisperer of the Brotherhood of Ash.
#. column 1: Training a cavalry drake is a long and arduous process that begins the moment the scalekin hatches. Never allowed to see its mother, the creature is raised solely in the presence of a drake whisperer while being weaned on the incendiary glands of aged battle drakes to ensure it is both submissive and deadly.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:19:0:2"
msgid "You are as a lost kitten<br>that has wandered into<br>the drake's lair.<br>  - Zagozz Teh"
msgstr "Ты словно котёнок, потерявшийся<br>в логове дрейка.<br>  — Загоз Тэ"

#. ja: ローレル・グゥーブーに騎乗する。<br>仮宿のシルフたちの大きなお友達
#. de: Klettere auf deine hünenhafte Waldkreatur, die dir die Sylphen anvertraut haben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture goobbue couronné. Ce goobbue est un bon ami des Sylphes.
#. column 1: After having the moss and flowers growing upon his head pulled up and tossed aside like common weeds by a band of sylvan ne'er-do-wells, this quiet-mannered goobbue was taken in and cared for by the sylphs of Little Solace whose elders crafted for him a magnificent laurel with which to hide his scars.
#. column 2: Naught is as exhilarating<br>as a romp through the<br>forest on goobbueback.<br>  - Unknown
msgctxt "MountTransient:20:0:0"
msgid "Summon your laurel goobbue, towering friend to the sylphs."
msgstr "Призовите венценосного губбу — высокого друга сильфов."

#. ja: 仮宿のシルフたちの大きなお友達。悪い子シルフが悪戯として植物を引っこ抜きまくったため、見事に頭頂部がハゲてしまった。これを哀れに思った長ちゃまが、草で編んだ冠をかぶせてあげたことで仲良くなったらしい
#. de: Nachdem ihr das Moos und die Blumen vom Kopf entfernt wurden, nahmen die Sylphen von der Sylphen-Zuflucht diese sanftmütige Goobbue bei sich auf und fertigten für sie einen beeindruckenden Lorbeerkranz an, um ihre Narben zu kaschieren.
#. fr: Les Dénaturés se sont méchamment amusés à arracher la mousse qui recouvrait le crâne de ce goobbue. Le chef des Sylphes du Refuge a eu pitié de lui et l'a soigné, puis lui a con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né une couronne de lauriers pour cacher ses cicatrices.
#. column 0: Summon your laurel goobbue, towering friend to the sylphs.
#. column 2: Naught is as exhilarating<br>as a romp through the<br>forest on goobbueback.<br>  - Unknown
msgctxt "MountTransient:20:0:1"
msgid "After having the moss and flowers growing upon his head pulled up and tossed aside like common weeds by a band of sylvan ne'er-do-wells, this quiet-mannered goobbue was taken in and cared for by the sylphs of Little Solace whose elders crafted for him a magnificent laurel with which to hide his scars."
msgstr "Когда лесные негодники выдрали с головы этого тихого губбу мох и цветы, словно обычные сорняки, сильфы из Малого Утешения приютили его и позаботились о нём. Старейшины сплели для него великолепный лавровый венок, чтобы скрыть шрамы."

#. ja: ンゴォォォ
#. de: Die Goobbueige der Meinigen riecht wie<br>eine alte Milchwurzel, hihi. So süß!<br><i>Nyxia</i>
#. fr: Hmph...
#. column 0: Summon your laurel goobbue, towering friend to the sylphs.
#. column 1: After having the moss and flowers growing upon his head pulled up and tossed aside like common weeds by a band of sylvan ne'er-do-wells, this quiet-mannered goobbue was taken in and cared for by the sylphs of Little Solace whose elders crafted for him a magnificent laurel with which to hide his scars.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:20:0:2"
msgid "Naught is as exhilarating<br>as a romp through the<br>forest on goobbueback.<br>  - Unknown"
msgstr "Нет ничего лучше, чем<br>носиться верхом на губбу<br>по лесу!<br>  — Неизвестное существо"

#. ja: C式魔導アーマーに騎乗する。<br>耐魔法コーティングを施した魔導リーパー
#. de: Rufe deine antimagisch beschichtete Magitek-Kampfmaschine (Typ C) herbei.
#. fr: Vous pouvez appeler à vous une armure magitek. Ce modèle de type faucheuse bénéficie d'un revêtement spécial résistant à la magie.
#. column 1: It only took a few heated skirmishes with the allied city<hyphen>states for Garlemald to realize that the magicks wielded by the realm's mages were too much for even the thickest of magitek armor plating. Alloyed gilding has since been discovered to dampen the effects of elemental charges and is now standard-issue.
#. column 2: You ditched your magitek<br>armor!? Fool of a Lalafell!<br>  - Biggs
msgctxt "MountTransient:21:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your gilded suit of magitek armor. Its golden coating serves to resist magicks while impressing members of the opposite sex."
msgstr "Призовите позолоченную магическую броню. Её золотое покрытие защищает от магии и, заодно, впечатляет особ противоположного пола."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍が密かに開発していた改良型「リーパー」。金色に輝く装甲は、新開発の特殊塗料によるもの。これはエオルゼア同盟軍が多用する魔法攻撃に備えた、耐魔法コーティングであるらしい
#. de: Nach nur wenigen Gefechten mit den alliierten Stadt<shy>staaten musste Garlemand feststellen, dass die Zauber der Magier des Reiches selbst die dickste Magitek-Rüstung durchdrangen. Daraufhin wurde eine spezielle Bronzelegierung erfunden, um elementaren Angriffen besser standhalten zu können.
#. fr: Garlemald a vite réalisé après quelques combats contre l'Alliance éorzéenne que ses armures ne faisaient pas le poids face à la puissance des mages. L'Empire a alors mis au point ce prototype revêtu d'un enduit doré capable de résister aux attaques magiques.
#. column 0: Call into battle your gilded suit of magitek armor. Its golden coating serves to resist magicks while impressing members of the opposite sex.
#. column 2: You ditched your magitek<br>armor!? Fool of a Lalafell!<br>  - Biggs
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:21:0:1"
msgid "It only took a few heated skirmishes with the allied city<hyphen>states for Garlemald to realize that the magicks wielded by the realm's mages were too much for even the thickest of magitek armor plating. Alloyed gilding has since been discovered to dampen the effects of elemental charges and is now standard-issue."
msgstr "После нескольких жарких стычек с союзными государствами Гарлемальд понял: магия местных чародеев пробивает даже самую толстую броню магических машин. Позже нашли способ ослабить действие стихийных заклинаний с помощью сплава с позолотой — теперь такое покрытие ставят на всю броню."

#. ja: ウィーン、ガシャン！
#. de: Was ist das? Ein verbesserter Typ von Magitek-Kampfmaschine?<br><i>Biggs</i>
#. fr: Autorisation en cours...
#. column 0: Call into battle your gilded suit of magitek armor. Its golden coating serves to resist magicks while impressing members of the opposite sex.
#. column 1: It only took a few heated skirmishes with the allied city<hyphen>states for Garlemald to realize that the magicks wielded by the realm's mages were too much for even the thickest of magitek armor plating. Alloyed gilding has since been discovered to dampen the effects of elemental charges and is now standard-issue.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:21:0:2"
msgid "You ditched your magitek<br>armor!? Fool of a Lalafell!<br>  - Biggs"
msgstr "Ты бросил магическую броню!?<br>Глупый лалафелл!<br>  — Биггс"

#. ja: ナイトメアに騎乗する。<br>調教された妖馬。性格は非常に好戦的かつ執念深い
#. de: Rufe dein freundliches Pferd Albtraum herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez l'alicorne de jais. Cette licorne fauve a été apprivoisée, mais elle reste ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment belliqueuse et implacable.
#. column 1: While it is no secret that it was the enigmatic Ascians who provided the beast tribes with nightmares, their reasons for doing so remain shrouded in mystery. Otherwise untamable, the single piercing tone of a magicked whistle is the only method known to soothe<br>the savage beasts.
#. column 2: See the nightmare for<br>reality, and ready thyself<br>for the coming chaos!<br>  - Urianger
msgctxt "MountTransient:22:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the single-horned steed with a temperament as black as his coat."
msgstr "Призовите однорогого скакуна с таким же чёрным нравом, как и его шерсть."

#. ja: 調教された妖馬「ナイトメア」。闇の勢力「アシエン」が、蛮族たちに与えた存在らしいが、詳細については明らかになっていない。その性格は非常に好戦的かつ執念深いが、魔法の笛の持ち主には絶対的に服従する
#. de: Es ist kein Geheimnis, dass es die Ascians waren, die die Wilden Stämme mit Albträumen versorgten, aber die Gründe dafür sind nach wie vor unklar. Die wilden Bestien gelten als unzähmbar und einzig der schrille Ton einer magischen Pfeife vermag sie zu beruhigen.
#. fr: Personne ne sait pourquoi les Asciens ont décidé d'offrir ces bêtes féroces aux tribus barbares. Elles sont de nature agressive et tenace, mais également com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment loyales à ceux qui possèdent une flûte enchantée.
#. column 0: Summon forth the single-horned steed with a temperament as black as his coat.
#. column 2: See the nightmare for<br>reality, and ready thyself<br>for the coming chaos!<br>  - Urianger
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:22:0:1"
msgid "While it is no secret that it was the enigmatic Ascians who provided the beast tribes with nightmares, their reasons for doing so remain shrouded in mystery. Otherwise untamable, the single piercing tone of a magicked whistle is the only method known to soothe<br>the savage beasts."
msgstr "Не секрет, что загадочные асциане одарили племена зверолюдей кошмарами. Но зачем — по-прежнему загадка. Этих необузданных зверей может усмирить лишь пронзительный звук зачарованного свистка.<br>"

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich hörte die eindringlichen Stimmen der Gebieter in ungewohnter<br>Klarheit rufen: „Der Albtraum ist erwacht!“ So viel Schrecken<br>schwang in ihren Worten mit, wie ich es nie zuvor erlebt habe.<br><i>A-Ruhn-Senna</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth the single-horned steed with a temperament as black as his coat.
#. column 1: While it is no secret that it was the enigmatic Ascians who provided the beast tribes with nightmares, their reasons for doing so remain shrouded in mystery. Otherwise untamable, the single piercing tone of a magicked whistle is the only method known to soothe<br>the savage beasts.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:22:0:2"
msgid "See the nightmare for<br>reality, and ready thyself<br>for the coming chaos!<br>  - Urianger"
msgstr "Явись кошмар во плоти<br>и приготовься к хаосу!<br>  — Урианже"

#. ja: でぶチョコボに騎乗する。<br>食い意地の張ったチョコボの親分。こんなとこで笛吹くなよ
#. de: Rufe deinen Chocomoppel herbei. Obwohl ihm frisches Futter eigentlich mehr bedeutet als deine Beförderung.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture gros chocobo. Assurez-vous qu'il y ait assez de place afin qu'il ne reste pas coincé dans le décor.
#. column 1: Playfully described by some as “large and in charge,” in truth, when summoned, this gluttonous gourmand will flap nary a feather unless a garland of gysahl greens is dangled before him─in which case not even the laws of nature can slow the fat chocobo down.
#. column 2: Huff...huff...heave...heave...<br>  - Fat Chocobo
msgctxt "MountTransient:25:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your fat chocobo mount. Take care that there is sufficient room for his ample girth."
msgstr "Призовите толстого чокобо. Убедитесь, что для его внушительной туши хватит места."

#. ja: 食い意地の張ったチョコボの親分。笛を吹いて呼び寄せても、「こんなとこで笛吹くなよ」と言わんばかりの態度で接してくる。しかし、目の前に大好物のギサールの野菜をつり下げると様子が一変。一心不乱に走り出す
#. de: Dieser gefräßige Gourmet wird kaum eine Feder schwingen, solange nicht ein Bündel Gizar-Blätter vor seinem Schnabel baumelt. Dann jedoch kennt er kein Halten mehr und es gibt nichts, was ihn stoppen könnte.
#. fr: Gros est un euphémisme pour décrire cet animal. Sa gloutonnerie n'est jamais satisfaite, et il ne bougera pas une plume pour vous... à moins que vous ne lui  promettiez des légumes de Gysahl, auquel cas rien ne l'arrêtera<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your fat chocobo mount. Take care that there is sufficient room for his ample girth.
#. column 2: Huff...huff...heave...heave...<br>  - Fat Chocobo
msgctxt "MountTransient:25:0:1"
msgid "Playfully described by some as “large and in charge,” in truth, when summoned, this gluttonous gourmand will flap nary a feather unless a garland of gysahl greens is dangled before him─in which case not even the laws of nature can slow the fat chocobo down."
msgstr "Некоторые в шутку зовут его «большим начальником», но на деле этот обжора и пером не пошевелит, пока перед ним не помашут гирсальской зеленью. А уж завидев её, толстый чокобо помчится так, что никакие законы природы его не остановят."

#. ja: うーん、もう食えない
#. de: \<keuch> K...weh... \<keuch><br><i>Choco-Fettwanst</i>
#. fr: Kwouf... Kwouf...
#. column 0: Summon forth your fat chocobo mount. Take care that there is sufficient room for his ample girth.
#. column 1: Playfully described by some as “large and in charge,” in truth, when summoned, this gluttonous gourmand will flap nary a feather unless a garland of gysahl greens is dangled before him─in which case not even the laws of nature can slow the fat chocobo down.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:25:0:2"
msgid "Huff...huff...heave...heave...<br>  - Fat Chocobo"
msgstr "Фух... фух... тяжело... тяжело...<br>  — Толстый чокобо"

#. ja: キャバルリー・エルブストに騎乗する。<br>海獣使いのパァアが育て上げた騎乗用エルブスト
#. de: Rufe deinen Kavallerie-Elbst herbei, der aus einem Ei von Pahh von Novvs Sippe stammt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture elbst. Élevé par Pahh de la Couvée de Novv, cet elbst est habitué à la présence humaine.
#. column 1: To ensure his elbst do not find themselves at a disadvantage to swift-running chocobos, Pahh of Novv's Clutch clips the webbing on their feet at a young age, rendering them more capable of achieving high speeds on land─though they will ever be slower than their brethren while underwater.
#. column 2: My elbst is your elbst.<br>  - Pahh
msgctxt "MountTransient:26:0:0"
msgid "Summon your cavalry elbst, raised from an egg by Pahh of Novv's Clutch."
msgstr "Призовите кавалерийского элбста, выращенного из яйца Па-а из Захвата Новв."

#. ja: ノォヴ一味の海獣使い、パァアが育て上げた騎乗用エルブスト。陸上歩行に邪魔となる水かきに切れ目を入れてあるため、チョコボに劣らぬ素早さで、地上を走ることができる。ただし、代償として泳ぐ速度は低下している
#. de: Damit seine Elbste mit den flinken Chocobos mithalten können, stutzt Pahh von Novvs Sippe ihre Schwimmhäute schon in jungen Jahren. Auch wenn sie dadurch schneller laufen, büßen sie doch einen Teil ihrer Schwimmfähigkeit ein.
#. fr: Pahh à la Couvée de Novv coupe la palmure de ces elbsts lorsqu'ils sont jeunes afin qu'ils soient capables de courir sur terre aussi vite que les chocobos. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, ce procédé réduit leur vitesse de nage.
#. column 0: Summon your cavalry elbst, raised from an egg by Pahh of Novv's Clutch.
#. column 2: My elbst is your elbst.<br>  - Pahh
msgctxt "MountTransient:26:0:1"
msgid "To ensure his elbst do not find themselves at a disadvantage to swift-running chocobos, Pahh of Novv's Clutch clips the webbing on their feet at a young age, rendering them more capable of achieving high speeds on land─though they will ever be slower than their brethren while underwater."
msgstr "Чтобы элбсты не уступали в скорости стремительным чокобо, Па-а из Захвата Новв ещё в юности подрезает им перепонки на лапах. Так они быстрее бегают по суше — но под водой всё равно уступают своим сородичам."

#. ja: キシャアァァ…
#. de: Auf dem Rücken dieser stolzen Tiere meisterst du<br>selbst das stürmischste aller Meere! Sssssh ...<br><i>Novv</i>
#. fr: Splrrr...
#. column 0: Summon your cavalry elbst, raised from an egg by Pahh of Novv's Clutch.
#. column 1: To ensure his elbst do not find themselves at a disadvantage to swift-running chocobos, Pahh of Novv's Clutch clips the webbing on their feet at a young age, rendering them more capable of achieving high speeds on land─though they will ever be slower than their brethren while underwater.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:26:0:2"
msgid "My elbst is your elbst.<br>  - Pahh"
msgstr "Мой элбст — твой элбст.<br>  — Па-а"

#. ja: ボムバルーンに騎乗する。<br>ガス生物ボムに牽引させたゴンドラ。騎乗時は火気厳禁
#. de: Rufe einen Schwarm von explosiven Sänftenträgern für dich herbei. Angenehme Reise!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre balancelle bombo. Ce banc suspendu est tracté par des bombos gazeux. Ne pas appeler en présence de flammes.
#. column 1: Upon learning that his creations were forever lacking the power to combust, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go did what any master of explosives would─attach the bombs to the corners of an iron bench and create a floating coach.
#. column 2: Hack and slash and<br>tossy-boom. Bang and<br>boom and slashy-doom.♪<br>  - Goblin Diddy
msgctxt "MountTransient:27:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a bevy of bombs who will bear you in comfort upon a hovering palanquin."
msgstr "Призовите стайку бомбов, которые с комфортом прокатят вас в подвесном паланкине."

#. ja: アコライト789 バ・ゴが作ったボムのうち、イマイチ爆発力に優れなかった失敗作たちを集め、ゴンドラの牽引役として転用したもの。それでも元爆弾であることには変わらないため、騎乗時は火気厳禁である
#. de: Als er erfuhr, dass seine Schöpfungen nicht die Fähigkeit besaßen, sich selbst zu entflammen, tat Ba Go, was jeder gute Sprengmeister tun würde<nbsp>- er brachte die Bomber an den Ecken eines bestickten Seidenkissens an und erschuf eine schwebende Kutsche.
#. fr: Après avoir compris que ses bombos ne seraient jamais des explosifs satisfaisants, l'acolyte du 789e ordre Ba Go a décidé de faire la seule chose raisonnable<nbsp>: attacher les créatures à un banc pour en faire un véhicule.
#. column 0: Summon forth a bevy of bombs who will bear you in comfort upon a hovering palanquin.
#. column 2: Hack and slash and<br>tossy-boom. Bang and<br>boom and slashy-doom.♪<br>  - Goblin Diddy
msgctxt "MountTransient:27:0:1"
msgid "Upon learning that his creations were forever lacking the power to combust, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go did what any master of explosives would─attach the bombs to the corners of an iron bench and create a floating coach."
msgstr "Узнав, что его творения так и не научились взрываться, послушник 789-го звена Ба Го поступил как любой уважающий себя взрывник: прикрепил бомбов к углам железной скамьи и соорудил летающую повозку."

#. ja: ギギ、ギギギギ！
#. de: Hihihi, Bomber zur Explosion geboren. Für einen<br>kurzen Moment sie leben. In einem Augenblick<br>des Glanzes sie vergehen.<br><i>Ba Go, Akolyth des 789. Ordens</i>
#. fr: (crépitement)
#. column 0: Summon forth a bevy of bombs who will bear you in comfort upon a hovering palanquin.
#. column 1: Upon learning that his creations were forever lacking the power to combust, 789th Order Acolyte Ba Go did what any master of explosives would─attach the bombs to the corners of an iron bench and create a floating coach.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:27:0:2"
msgid "Hack and slash and<br>tossy-boom. Bang and<br>boom and slashy-doom.♪<br>  - Goblin Diddy"
msgstr "Руби-кромсай, бум-бросай,<br>бах да бум, и снова кромсай!♪<br>  — Гоблин Дидди"

#. ja: アイトーンに騎乗する。<br>焔神に祝福された妖馬。その息すらも熱気を放つ
#. de: Rufe das legendäre Ross Aithon herbei, welches dem Primae Ifrit zugerechnet wird. Sein Atem ist so heiß wie die Sieben Höllen zusammen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Aithon, le destrier légendaire d'Ifrit. Son souffle est empreint de flammes brûlantes comme la braise.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of the Inferno, Ifrit, forged this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Amalj'aa in sacrifice.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:28:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Aithon, the legendary steed favored of the primal Ifrit. Its breath is said to be as hot as the seventh hell."
msgstr "Призовите Айтона, легендарного скакуна праймала Ифрита. Говорят, его дыхание жарче седьмого ада."

#. ja: 焔神「イフリート」による祝福を受け、燃え盛る劫火をまとった妖馬。おそらくアマルジャ族が妖馬「ナイトメア」を蛮神に供物として捧げた結果、誕生したものと思われる。その息すらも、地獄の業火のような熱気を放つ
#. de: Der Legende nach schuf der Herr des Infernos, Ifrit, dieses magische Ross aus einem Albtraum, der von den Amalj'aa geopfert wurde.
#. fr: On raconte que le Primordial Ifrit, le Seigneur des flammes, a forgé ce destrier à partir d'une alicorne de jais offerte en sacrifice par les Amalj'aa.
#. column 0: Summon forth Aithon, the legendary steed favored of the primal Ifrit. Its breath is said to be as hot as the seventh hell.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:28:0:1"
msgid "Legend states that the Lord of the Inferno, Ifrit, forged this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Amalj'aa in sacrifice."
msgstr "Легенда гласит, что Ифрит, Владыка Инферно, создал этого волшебного скакуна из принесённого амалджа в жертву кошмара."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich frage mich, wer wohl schneller galoppieren kann: Chocobos<br>oder Pferde? Bestimmt Pferde, die haben schließlich doppelt so<br>viele Beine!<br><i>Yozan</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Aithon, the legendary steed favored of the primal Ifrit. Its breath is said to be as hot as the seventh hell.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of the Inferno, Ifrit, forged this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Amalj'aa in sacrifice.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:28:0:2"
msgid "Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "И-го-го — и до ржания<br>всего один скачок!<br>  — Ума-бугё"

#. ja: クサントスに騎乗する。<br>嵐神に祝福された妖馬。風に乗り舞うように駆ける
#. de: Rufe das legendäre Ross Xanthos herbei, welches dem Primae Garuda zugerechnet wird. In vollem Galopp ist es so schnell wie der Wind.
#. fr: Vous appelez Xanthos, le destrier légendaire de Garuda. Il file comme le vent, ou plutôt les rafales cinglantes de sa maîtresse.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lady of the Vortex, Garuda, created this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Ixal in sacrifice.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:29:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Xanthos, the legendary steed favored of the primal Garuda. At full gallop, it is said to be the very wind itself."
msgstr "Призовите Ксанфа, легендарного скакуна праймала Гаруды. Говорят, на полном скаку он не уступает самому ветру."

#. ja: 嵐神「ガルーダ」による祝福を受け、荒れ狂う烈風をまとった妖馬。おそらくイクサル族が妖馬「ナイトメア」を蛮神に供物として捧げた結果、誕生したものと思われる。一陣の風の如く、大地を疾走する
#. de: Der Legende nach schuf die Herrin der Winde, Garuda, dieses magische Ross aus einem Albtraum, der von den Ixal geopfert wurde.
#. fr: On raconte que la Primordiale Garuda, la Souffleuse de rafales, a créé ce destrier à partir d'une alicorne de jais offerte en sacrifice par les Ixali.
#. column 0: Summon forth Xanthos, the legendary steed favored of the primal Garuda. At full gallop, it is said to be the very wind itself.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:29:0:1"
msgid "Legend states that the Lady of the Vortex, Garuda, created this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Ixal in sacrifice."
msgstr "Легенда гласит, что Гаруда, Повелительница Вихря, создала этого волшебного скакуна из принесённого иксалами в жертву кошмара."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich frage mich, wer wohl schneller galoppieren kann: Chocobos<br>oder Pferde? Bestimmt Pferde, die haben schließlich doppelt so<br>viele Beine!<br><i>Yozan</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Xanthos, the legendary steed favored of the primal Garuda. At full gallop, it is said to be the very wind itself.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lady of the Vortex, Garuda, created this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Ixal in sacrifice.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:29:0:2"
msgid "Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "И-го-го — и до ржания<br>всего один скачок!<br>  — Ума-бугё"

#. ja: グルファクシに騎乗する。<br>岩神に祝福された妖馬。逞しき脚で大地を踏みしめる
#. de: Rufe das legendäre Ross Gullfaxi herbei, welches dem Primae Titan zugerechnet wird. Das Stampfen seiner kräftigen Beine ruft Erschütterungen hervor, die noch malmenweit weg spürbar sind.
#. fr: Vous appelez Gullfaxi, le destrier légendaire de Titan. Il frappe la terre de ses sabots avec conviction.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of Crags, Titan, wrought this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the kobolds in sacrifice.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:30:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Gullfaxi, the legendary steed favored of the primal Titan. Its powerful legs set off tremors that can be felt from malms away."
msgstr "Призовите Гуллфакси, легендарного скакуна праймала Титана. Его мощные копыта вызывают сотрясения, которые чувствуются за много миль."

#. ja: 岩神「タイタン」による祝福を受け、胎動する溶岩をまとった妖馬。おそらくコボルド族が妖馬「ナイトメア」を蛮神に供物として捧げた結果、誕生したものと思われる。たくましき脚が踏みしめるたび、大地が震え上がる
#. de: Der Legende nach schuf der Herr der Felsen, Titan, dieses magische Ross aus einem Albtraum, der von den Kobolden geopfert wurde.
#. fr: On raconte que le Primordial Titan, l'Ébranleur des terres, a conçu ce destrier à partir d'une alicorne de jais offerte en sacrifice par les Kobolds.
#. column 0: Summon forth Gullfaxi, the legendary steed favored of the primal Titan. Its powerful legs set off tremors that can be felt from malms away.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:30:0:1"
msgid "Legend states that the Lord of Crags, Titan, wrought this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the kobolds in sacrifice."
msgstr "Легенда гласит, что Титан, Повелитель скал, создал этого волшебного скакуна из принесённого кобольдами в жертву кошмара."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich frage mich, wer wohl schneller galoppieren kann: Chocobos<br>oder Pferde? Bestimmt Pferde, die haben schließlich doppelt so<br>viele Beine!<br><i>Yozan</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Gullfaxi, the legendary steed favored of the primal Titan. Its powerful legs set off tremors that can be felt from malms away.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of Crags, Titan, wrought this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the kobolds in sacrifice.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:30:0:2"
msgid "Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "И-го-го — и до ржания<br>всего один скачок!<br>  — Ума-бугё"

#. ja: エンバールに騎乗する。<br>水神に祝福された妖馬。魔力の泡より産まれたという
#. de: Rufe das legendäre Ross Enbarr herbei, welches dem Primae Leviathan zugerechnet wird. Die tosenden Wellen selbst sollen es an Land geworfen haben.
#. fr: Vous appelez Enbarr, le destrier légendaire de Léviathan. La légende dit qu'il serait né d'une écume magique.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of the Whorl, Leviathan, birthed this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Sahagin in sacrifice.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:31:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Enbarr, the legendary steed favored of the primal Leviathan. It is said to have been born of the surging waves."
msgstr "Призовите Энбарра, легендарного скакуна праймала Левиафана. Говорят, он родился в бушующих волнах."

#. ja: 水神「リヴァイアサン」による祝福を受け、渦巻く水流をまとった妖馬。おそらくサハギン族が妖馬「ナイトメア」を蛮神に供物として捧げた結果、誕生したものと思われる。魔力の泡より、生まれ出でたと伝えられる
#. de: Der Legende nach schuf der Herr der Wogen, Leviathan, dieses magische Ross aus einem Albtraum, der von den Sahagin geopfert wurde.
#. fr: On raconte que le Primordial Léviathan, le Déchaîneur des marées, a donné naissance à ce destrier à partir d'une alicorne de jais offerte en sacrifice par les Sahuagins.
#. column 0: Summon forth Enbarr, the legendary steed favored of the primal Leviathan. It is said to have been born of the surging waves.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:31:0:1"
msgid "Legend states that the Lord of the Whorl, Leviathan, birthed this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Sahagin in sacrifice."
msgstr "Легенда гласит, что Левиафан, Владыка Вихря, породил этого волшебного скакуна из принесённого сахагинами в жертву кошмара."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich frage mich, wer wohl schneller galoppieren kann: Chocobos<br>oder Pferde? Bestimmt Pferde, die haben schließlich doppelt so<br>viele Beine!<br><i>Yozan</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Enbarr, the legendary steed favored of the primal Leviathan. It is said to have been born of the surging waves.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of the Whorl, Leviathan, birthed this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the Sahagin in sacrifice.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:31:0:2"
msgid "Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "И-го-го — и до ржания<br>всего один скачок!<br>  — Ума-бугё"

#. ja: ウォーライオンに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍獅子。百獣の王の風格を持つ
#. de: Rufe deinen furchtlosen Kriegslöwen herbei, der über das Schlachtfeld herrschen wird wie über das Reich der Tiere.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture lion de guerre. Ce fauve majestueux a été entraîné au combat. Il a la prestance d'un roi des animaux.
#. column 1: Early in the Sixth Astral Era, lions were brought over from the Near East and trained to serve as battle mounts for the Sultansworn of Ul'dah. Deemed unbreakable, those not sold to the Coliseum for venationes were released into the deserts of Thanalan where they eventually reverted back to a feral state.
#. column 2: I, too, see the friends<br>I lost in the lions and<br>spinners...<br>  - Gregory
msgctxt "MountTransient:32:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your fearless warlion to rule over the battlefield, such is his station as king of the beasts."
msgstr "Призовите бесстрашного боевого льва, царя зверей, которому самое место на поле боя."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍獅子。ザナラーンに野生のライオンは存在しないが、かつては交易を通じて近東から輸入されていたこともあり、近衛兵団「銀冑団」が騎獣としていたこともあった。近年では、珍しい存在といえる
#. de: In der Sechsten Ära des Lichts wurden Löwen aus dem Nahen Osten nach Ul'dah gebracht, um dort als Kampfreittiere der Palastwache zu dienen. Man hielt sie jedoch für unzähmbar, und so wurden die Tiere, die man nicht für Tierhetzen ans Kolosseum verkaufte, in den Wüsten von Thanalan wieder ausgesetzt.
#. fr: Les lions ont été importés du Proche-Orient afin de servir de montures aux casques d'argent. Jugés trop im<shy>pré<shy>vi<shy>si<shy>bles, ceux qui n'ont pas été vendus au Colisée ont été relâchés dans le Thanalan, et ils sont finalement retournés à l'état sauvage.
#. column 0: Summon forth your fearless warlion to rule over the battlefield, such is his station as king of the beasts.
#. column 2: I, too, see the friends<br>I lost in the lions and<br>spinners...<br>  - Gregory
msgctxt "MountTransient:32:0:1"
msgid "Early in the Sixth Astral Era, lions were brought over from the Near East and trained to serve as battle mounts for the Sultansworn of Ul'dah. Deemed unbreakable, those not sold to the Coliseum for venationes were released into the deserts of Thanalan where they eventually reverted back to a feral state."
msgstr "В начале Шестой астральной эры львов привезли с Ближнего Востока и обучили служить боевыми скакунами султанской гвардии Ульды. Их сочли неукротимыми, и тех, кого не продали Колизею для звериных боёв, выпустили в пустыни Таналана. Там они со временем снова одичали."

#. ja: グオオオーッ！
#. de: Ich soll mich auf diesen abgemagerten Löwen setzen? Hat<br>der heute überhaupt schon etwas zu futtern bekommen?<br><i>Furchtsame Palastwache</i>
#. fr: Grooaaar<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your fearless warlion to rule over the battlefield, such is his station as king of the beasts.
#. column 1: Early in the Sixth Astral Era, lions were brought over from the Near East and trained to serve as battle mounts for the Sultansworn of Ul'dah. Deemed unbreakable, those not sold to the Coliseum for venationes were released into the deserts of Thanalan where they eventually reverted back to a feral state.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:32:0:2"
msgid "I, too, see the friends<br>I lost in the lions and<br>spinners...<br>  - Gregory"
msgstr "И я вижу друзей,<br>что погибли в пасти львов<br>и пауков...<br>  — Грегори"

#. ja: ウォーベアーに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍熊。数々の戦場を生き抜いてきた
#. de: Rufe deinen furchtlosen Kriegsbären herbei, der schon Tausende Schlachten geschlagen hat. Sein Anblick wird deine Gegner erzittern lassen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ours de guerre. Cet ursidé imposant a été entraîné au combat. Il a tenu tête à de nombreux adversaires.
#. column 1: In generations past, warriors seeking fame and glory would journey out into the untamed wilds of Abalathia's Spine in search of the giant grizzled bears that roamed the mountains, and would wrestle the beasts into submission, riding their prizes back to civilization. That is, or die trying.
#. column 2: How do you like my<br>pets? Not too playful<br>for you, I hope?<br>  - Beast Trainer
msgctxt "MountTransient:33:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your fearless warbear, veteran of a thousand battles, to fill your enemies with dread."
msgstr "Призовите бесстрашного боевого медведя, закалённого в тысяче сражений. Пусть ваши враги содрогнутся от страха."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍熊。北アバラシア山脈の奥地では、戦って打ち負かし力でねじ伏せた野生の熊を、騎獣とする風習があったという。それゆえ、戦場で勇名を馳せた古の戦士の武勇伝には、多くの軍熊が登場する
#. de: Krieger vergangener Generationen reisten auf der Suche nach Ruhm und Ehre zuweilen in die Wildnis von Abalathia, um einen der riesigen Grizzlybären aufzuspüren. Sie versuchten dann, ihn niederzuringen und voller Stolz den Ritt auf ihm zurück in die Zivilisation anzutreten. Oder sie kamen bei dem Versuch ums Leben.
#. fr: Autrefois, les guerriers en quête de gloire avaient coutume de s'aventurer dans les montagnes septentrionales d'Abalathia à la recherche de féroces grizzlys pour les combattre et les soumettre par la force. Ceux qui survivaient revenaient dans leur village en chevauchant fièrement leur nouvelle monture.
#. column 0: Summon forth your fearless warbear, veteran of a thousand battles, to fill your enemies with dread.
#. column 2: How do you like my<br>pets? Not too playful<br>for you, I hope?<br>  - Beast Trainer
msgctxt "MountTransient:33:0:1"
msgid "In generations past, warriors seeking fame and glory would journey out into the untamed wilds of Abalathia's Spine in search of the giant grizzled bears that roamed the mountains, and would wrestle the beasts into submission, riding their prizes back to civilization. That is, or die trying."
msgstr "В былые времена воины, жаждавшие славы и почёта, отправлялись в дикие края Хребта Абалатии на поиски огромных медведей гризли. Они боролись со зверями, пока те не сдавались, а затем возвращались в цивилизацию верхом на своей добыче. Или погибали, пытаясь."

#. ja: ガオォォォ！！
#. de: Haben Sie keine Angst, der will nur spielen.<br><i>Urgh, Bärentrainer von Halatali</i>
#. fr: Grrr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your fearless warbear, veteran of a thousand battles, to fill your enemies with dread.
#. column 1: In generations past, warriors seeking fame and glory would journey out into the untamed wilds of Abalathia's Spine in search of the giant grizzled bears that roamed the mountains, and would wrestle the beasts into submission, riding their prizes back to civilization. That is, or die trying.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:33:0:2"
msgid "How do you like my<br>pets? Not too playful<br>for you, I hope?<br>  - Beast Trainer"
msgstr "Ну как вам мои<br>питомцы? Надеюсь, они<br>не слишком игривые?<br>  — Дрессировщик зверей"

#. ja: グランチョコボに騎乗する。<br>体格に優れた大型チョコボ。2人乗りが可能
#. de: Rufe deinen Tandem-Chocobo herbei. Ein gewaltiger Vogel, der stark genug ist, um zwei Reiter zu tragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un robuste chocobo capable de supporter le poids de deux cavaliers.
#. column 1: This heretofore unseen breed of chocobo was said to have been discovered by chocobo hunters searching for the legendary Chocobo Forest. Its enormous size would make it a fine pack chocobo, but its foul temper prevents it from completing even the simplest of tasks without the injury of some poor rider.
#. column 2: The thing was thrice my<br>size and had already<br>maimed several keeps.<br>  - Battlewarden Ribald
msgctxt "MountTransient:34:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your draught chocobo, a massive bird large and strong enough to bear two riders."
msgstr "Призовите тяглового чокобо — огромную и сильную птицу, способную везти двоих."

#. ja: クルザス出身のチョコボハンターが、秘境「チョコボの森」で捕獲してきた野生種。牧場生まれのチョコボより体格に優れ、運搬能力も高いが、気性が荒く乗用には不向き。これを苦心の末に、2人乗り用に訓練したようだ
#. de: Diese bisher unbekannte Rasse wurde angeblich von Chocobo-Jägern auf der Suche nach dem legendären Chocobo-Wald entdeckt. Seine enorme Größe würde ihn zu einem idealen Last-Chocobo machen, aber sein Temperament führt häufig zu Verletzungen bei unvorsichtigen Reitern.
#. fr: Les premiers chocobos de cette race ont été découverts et capturés par des chasseurs ishgardais en quête de la légendaire forêt des chocobos. Leur taille et leur robustesse en font d'excellents animaux de bât, mais leur tempérament violent les rend impropres à la monte.
#. column 0: Summon forth your draught chocobo, a massive bird large and strong enough to bear two riders.
#. column 2: The thing was thrice my<br>size and had already<br>maimed several keeps.<br>  - Battlewarden Ribald
msgctxt "MountTransient:34:0:1"
msgid "This heretofore unseen breed of chocobo was said to have been discovered by chocobo hunters searching for the legendary Chocobo Forest. Its enormous size would make it a fine pack chocobo, but its foul temper prevents it from completing even the simplest of tasks without the injury of some poor rider."
msgstr "Говорят, эту невиданную прежде породу чокобо нашли охотники, искавшие легендарный Лес чокобо. Благодаря огромным размерам птица отлично подошла бы для перевозки грузов, но из-за скверного нрава даже простое дело оборачивается травмами для бедного всадника."

#. ja: クエッ、クエーッ！
#. de: Das war vielleicht ein Kaventsmann, von doppeltem Umfang<br>wie ein Roegadyn würd ich sagen, und tatsächlich trug er auch<br>gleich zwei davon auf seinem Rücken, als wären es Küken.<br><i>Kommandeur Ribald</i>
#. fr: Kwé Kwé Kwééé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your draught chocobo, a massive bird large and strong enough to bear two riders.
#. column 1: This heretofore unseen breed of chocobo was said to have been discovered by chocobo hunters searching for the legendary Chocobo Forest. Its enormous size would make it a fine pack chocobo, but its foul temper prevents it from completing even the simplest of tasks without the injury of some poor rider.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:34:0:2"
msgid "The thing was thrice my<br>size and had already<br>maimed several keeps.<br>  - Battlewarden Ribald"
msgstr "Эта штука была в три раза<br>больше меня и успела<br>искалечить нескольких стражников.<br>  — Боевой страж Рибальд"

#. ja: ダイアウルフに騎乗する。<br>古代種の血を引く軍狼。戦場でも動じない心を持つ
#. de: Rufe deinen tödlichen Düsterwolf herbei. Einer von fünf Welpen, die man im tiefen Schnee an den Körper ihrer erschlagenen Mutter geschmiegt auffand.
#. fr: Vous appelez un terrifiant loup sinistre, descendant d'une ancienne race de loup de guerre.
#. column 1: Mass cullings of the beasts during the Sixth Astral Era prompted naturalists to deem the species extinct. However, this claim was proved false when Ixali scouts discovered a lone pack roaming the sparsely inhabited mountains of Xelphatol.
#. column 2: I lost two good men<br>to these wolves.<br>  - Corentiaux the Colder
msgctxt "MountTransient:35:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your deadly direwolf, one of five pups found huddling together in the snow near the corpse of their slain mother."
msgstr "Призовите смертоносного лютоволка — одного из пяти волчат, найденных в снегу рядом с телом убитой матери."

#. ja: イクサル族の獣牧士が調教した軍狼。絶滅したと思われていた古代種「ダイアウルフ」を、ゼルファトルの奥地で発見したイクサル族が、苦心の末に家畜化したもの。人を乗せられるほど大きく、かつ主に従順である
#. de: Während der Sechsten Ära des Lichts führten Massenkeulungen dieser Bestien dazu, dass Naturforscher die Spezies für ausgestorben hielten. Sie wurden jedoch widerlegt, als Aufklärer der Ixal auf ein Rudel in den dünn besiedelten Bergen von Xelphatol stießen.
#. fr: Les loups sinistres étaient considérés comme une race éteinte jusqu'à ce que des Ixali découvrent une meute isolée dans les vallées de Xelphatol. Après avoir capturé quelques louveteaux, ils les ont élevés, non sans difficultés, pour en faire des montures de guerre. Ils sont énormes, et ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment loyaux.
#. column 0: Summon forth your deadly direwolf, one of five pups found huddling together in the snow near the corpse of their slain mother.
#. column 2: I lost two good men<br>to these wolves.<br>  - Corentiaux the Colder
msgctxt "MountTransient:35:0:1"
msgid "Mass cullings of the beasts during the Sixth Astral Era prompted naturalists to deem the species extinct. However, this claim was proved false when Ixali scouts discovered a lone pack roaming the sparsely inhabited mountains of Xelphatol."
msgstr "Из-за массового истребления лютоволков в Шестую астральную эру натуралисты сочли вид вымершим. Но разведчики иксалов опровергли это, обнаружив стаю в малонаселённых горах Кселфатола."

#. ja: ウォォォーン！
#. de: Zwei gute Ritter habe ich an diese Wölfe verloren.<br><i>Ritter Corentiaux aus dem Haus Fortemps</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your deadly direwolf, one of five pups found huddling together in the snow near the corpse of their slain mother.
#. column 1: Mass cullings of the beasts during the Sixth Astral Era prompted naturalists to deem the species extinct. However, this claim was proved false when Ixali scouts discovered a lone pack roaming the sparsely inhabited mountains of Xelphatol.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:35:0:2"
msgid "I lost two good men<br>to these wolves.<br>  - Corentiaux the Colder"
msgstr "Я потерял из-за этих волков<br>двух хороших людей.<br>  — Корентьо Холодный"

#. ja: ロミンサン・スティードに騎乗する。<br>ひんがしの国原産の軍馬。たくましい脚で大地を駆ける
#. de: Rufe dein vom Mahlstrom ausgegebenes Schlachtross herbei und versuche den Gedanken zu verdrängen, dass dein Chocobo nun ganz allein und hungrig irgendwo herumsitzt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre cheval de guerre du Maelstrom, en prétendant que votre chocobo ne se sent pas délaissé.
#. column 1: After witnessing dazzling demonstrations of how a warsteed might turn the tide of battle, the Grand Companies of Eorzea emptied their coffers at the feet of the Far Eastern uma bugyo, each seeking to put themselves at an advantage during Frontline campaigns.
#. column 2: Hoof to neigh, Eorzea<br>knows not the horse for<br>one reason: the horsebird.<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:36:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Maelstrom-issued warhorse and try to push from your mind the fact that your chocobo is sitting somewhere hungry and alone."
msgstr "Призовите боевого коня, выданного Водоворотом, и постарайтесь не думать о том, что где-то ваш чокобо сидит голодный и одинокий."

#. ja: 黒渦団が試験的に採用した軍馬。ひんがしの国から渡来した「馬奉行」の売り込みが功を奏し、冒険者の間で「馬」が評価され始めたため、導入に踏み切ったようだ。エオルゼアの気候に合った品種が選ばれている
#. de: Nachdem sie beeindruckenden Demonstrationen beiwohnten, wie ein Schlachtross das Blatt auf dem Schlachtfeld wenden kann, ließen sich die Staatlichen Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaften von Eorzea nicht lumpen und zahlten der Pferdeministerin ordentliche Summen, um sich an der Carteneauer Front einen Vorteil zu verschaffen.
#. fr: Après une campagne réussie de promotion des chevaux par l'uma bugyô venu de l'Est, la popularité de ces animaux n'a cessé de croître parmi les aventuriers. Les grandes compagnies ont décidé d'offrir ces nobles montures aux soldats se distinguant au combat.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Maelstrom-issued warhorse and try to push from your mind the fact that your chocobo is sitting somewhere hungry and alone.
#. column 2: Hoof to neigh, Eorzea<br>knows not the horse for<br>one reason: the horsebird.<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:36:0:1"
msgid "After witnessing dazzling demonstrations of how a warsteed might turn the tide of battle, the Grand Companies of Eorzea emptied their coffers at the feet of the Far Eastern uma bugyo, each seeking to put themselves at an advantage during Frontline campaigns."
msgstr "Заворожённые тем, как боевой конь способен переломить ход сражения, великие роты Эорзеи высыпали золото к ногам дальневосточного ума-бугё. Каждая хотела получить преимущество в походах на Передовой."

#. ja: ヒヒィーン！
#. de: Hm? Ob ich Pferde schön finde? Bist du jetzt völlig übergeschnappt?<br><i>Anonymer Chocobo-Züchter</i>
#. fr: Brrr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Maelstrom-issued warhorse and try to push from your mind the fact that your chocobo is sitting somewhere hungry and alone.
#. column 1: After witnessing dazzling demonstrations of how a warsteed might turn the tide of battle, the Grand Companies of Eorzea emptied their coffers at the feet of the Far Eastern uma bugyo, each seeking to put themselves at an advantage during Frontline campaigns.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:36:0:2"
msgid "Hoof to neigh, Eorzea<br>knows not the horse for<br>one reason: the horsebird.<br>  - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "Копыто — и вот уже ржание!<br>В Эорзее коней не знают<br>по одной причине: чокобо!<br>  — Ума-бугё"

#. ja: グリダニアン・スティードに騎乗する。<br>ひんがしの国原産の軍馬。たくましい脚で大地を駆ける
#. de: Rufe dein von der Bruderschaft ausgegebenes Schlachtross herbei und versuche den Gedanken zu verdrängen, dass dein Chocobo nun ganz allein und hungrig irgendwo herumsitzt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre cheval de guerre de l'ordre des Deux Vipères, en prétendant que votre chocobo ne se sent pas délaissé.
#. column 1: After witnessing dazzling demonstrations of how a warsteed might turn the tide of battle, the Grand Companies of Eorzea emptied their coffers at the feet of the Far Eastern uma bugyo, each seeking to put themselves at an advantage during Frontline campaigns.
