#. ja: マルカブに騎乗する。<br>雷神に祝福された妖馬。そのいななきは雷気を発する
#. de: Ruf das legendäre Ross Markab herbei, welches dem Primae Ramuh zugerechnet wird. Es soll durch einen einzelnen Blitz zum Leben erweckt worden sein.
#. fr: Vous appelez Markab, le destrier légendaire de Ramuh. Son hennissement crépite comme la foudre.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of Levin, Ramuh, drew forth this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the sylphs in sacrifice.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:40:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Markab, the legendary steed favored of the primal Ramuh. It is said to have been born of a single thunderbolt."
msgstr "Призовите Маркаба, легендарного скакуна праймала Раму. Говорят, его породила единственная молния."

#. ja: 雷神「ラムウ」による祝福を受け、天を切り裂く稲妻をまとった妖馬。おそらくシルフ族が妖馬「ナイトメア」を蛮神に供物として捧げた結果、誕生したものと思われる。そのいななきは、空気を震わせ雷気を発する
#. de: Der Legende nach schuf der Herr der Blitze, Ramuh, dieses magische Ross aus einem Albtraum, der von den Sylphen geopfert wurde.
#. fr: On raconte que le Primordial Ramuh, le Patriarche fulgurant, a engendré ce destrier à partir d'une alicorne de jais offerte en sacrifice par les Sylphes.
#. column 0: Summon forth Markab, the legendary steed favored of the primal Ramuh. It is said to have been born of a single thunderbolt.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:40:0:1"
msgid "Legend states that the Lord of Levin, Ramuh, drew forth this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the sylphs in sacrifice."
msgstr "Легенда гласит, что Раму, Повелитель молний, извлёк этого волшебного скакуна из принесённого сильфами в жертву кошмара."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich frage mich, wer wohl schneller galoppieren kann: Chocobos<br>oder Pferde? Bestimmt Pferde, die haben schließlich doppelt so<br>viele Beine!<br><i>Yozan</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Markab, the legendary steed favored of the primal Ramuh. It is said to have been born of a single thunderbolt.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lord of Levin, Ramuh, drew forth this magicked steed from a nightmare offered by the sylphs in sacrifice.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:40:0:2"
msgid "Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "И-го-го — и до ржания<br>всего один скачок!<br>  — Ума-бугё"

#. ja: エターナルチョコボに騎乗する。<br>セレモニーの正装をした大型チョコボ。2人乗りが可能
#. de: Rufe deinen prachtvoll mit reinem Weiß geschmückten Chocobo herbei. Das passende Reittier für einen ganz besonderen Anlass.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre chocobo de cérémonie. Cette monture parée d'une barde destinée au lien éternel permet de monter à deux.
#. column 1: Raised by Ishgard's master breeders for beauty and purity of stock, its snow white feathers are natural and, though fully developed, as soft as down. Temperament-wise, the bird is remarkably docile and one of few breeds who will allow dual riders upon its back.
#. column 2: Don't stand on ceremony,<br>tick-tock, tick-tock!<br>  - Helmhart
msgctxt "MountTransient:41:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your ceremony chocobo, large enough to bear both you and your special someone."
msgstr "Призовите свадебного чокобо — большого, чтобы прокатить и вас, и вашу половинку."

#. ja: イシュガルド産の儀式用チョコボ。美しさを追求した交配が重ねられた種で、生まれつき純白の羽根を持つ。特別な飼育と調教の結果、賢くて穏やかな性格と優れた体格に育っており、2人乗りにも対応できる
#. de: Ein Chocobo mit von Natur aus schneeweißem Gefieder, der in Ishgard gezüchtet wurde. Tiere dieser Rasse sind außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>lich sanft und gelehrig und dulden auch zwei Reiter auf ihrem Rücken.
#. fr: Ce fier volatile élevé dans l'un des meilleurs haras ishgardais a été dressé pour parader lors de cérémonies. Issus de croisements précis, il possède un plumage d'un blanc immaculé et un caractère des plus dociles.
#. column 0: Summon forth your ceremony chocobo, large enough to bear both you and your special someone.
#. column 2: Don't stand on ceremony,<br>tick-tock, tick-tock!<br>  - Helmhart
msgctxt "MountTransient:41:0:1"
msgid "Raised by Ishgard's master breeders for beauty and purity of stock, its snow white feathers are natural and, though fully developed, as soft as down. Temperament-wise, the bird is remarkably docile and one of few breeds who will allow dual riders upon its back."
msgstr "Этого чокобо вывели лучшие заводчики Ишгарда, стремясь к красоте и чистоте породы. Его белоснежное оперение от природы мягкое, словно пух, хотя птица уже взрослая. Он на удивление кроток и относится к редким породам, готовым везти сразу двух всадников."

#. ja: ク、ク、クエーッ！！
#. de: Hübsch? Sicher. Aber wenn dir einer im Schnee ausbüxt, wünsche ich viel Spaß bei der Suche.<br><i>Ishgarder Züchter</i>
#. fr: Kwé...
#. column 0: Summon forth your ceremony chocobo, large enough to bear both you and your special someone.
#. column 1: Raised by Ishgard's master breeders for beauty and purity of stock, its snow white feathers are natural and, though fully developed, as soft as down. Temperament-wise, the bird is remarkably docile and one of few breeds who will allow dual riders upon its back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:41:0:2"
msgid "Don't stand on ceremony,<br>tick-tock, tick-tock!<br>  - Helmhart"
msgstr "Не церемонься,<br>тик-так, тик-так!<br>  — Хельмхарт"

#. ja: スレイプニルに騎乗する。<br>闘神に祝福された妖馬。魔力を帯びた眼が真紅に輝く
#. de: Rufe das legendäre Ross Sleipnir herbei, welches dem Primae Odin als Reittier dient. Seine glühend roten Augen stechen aus der nachtschwarzen Mähne hervor.
#. fr: Vous appelez Sleipnir, le terrible destrier d'Odin. Ses yeux brillent d'un éclat rouge malveillant.
#. column 1: Blessed by the elder primal himself, Sleipnir will forever remain loyal to those who have proven themselves worthy. In addition to being fearless in battle, the dark steed is also able to manipulate his corporeal form to accommodate any rider, large or small.
#. column 2: If it hadn't been<br>for that horse...<br>   - Erik
msgctxt "MountTransient:42:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Sleipnir─undying steed of the elder primal Odin. His coat is as dark as void, while his eyes glow a sanguine red."
msgstr "Призовите Слейпнира — бессмертного скакуна старшего праймала Одина. Его шерсть черна, как сама пустота, а глаза горят кроваво-красным."

#. ja: 闘神「オーディン」による祝福を受け、闘気をまとった妖馬。鮮血の如き紅色に染まったタテガミをたなびかせ、力強く大地を疾駆する。噂によると、主と認めた者の体格に合わせ、自在に馬体の大きさを変化させるらしい
#. de: Gesegnet von Odin höchstselbst, ist Sleipnir denen auf ewig treu ergeben, die sich seiner als würdig erwiesen haben. Das schwarze Ross ist nicht nur furchtlos im Kampf, sondern kann seine Größe auch der des Reiters anpassen.
#. fr: Ce destrier à l'allure terrifiante aurait reçu ses pouvoirs surnaturels d'Odin, le Chevalier des ombres. Lorsqu'il galope, sa crinière rouge sang ondule comme pour annoncer leur trépas à ceux qui ont la malchance de croiser son chemin.
#. column 0: Summon forth Sleipnir─undying steed of the elder primal Odin. His coat is as dark as void, while his eyes glow a sanguine red.
#. column 2: If it hadn't been<br>for that horse...<br>   - Erik
msgctxt "MountTransient:42:0:1"
msgid "Blessed by the elder primal himself, Sleipnir will forever remain loyal to those who have proven themselves worthy. In addition to being fearless in battle, the dark steed is also able to manipulate his corporeal form to accommodate any rider, large or small."
msgstr "Благословлённый самим старшим праймалом, Слейпнир навеки останется верен тому, кто докажет, что достоин его. Этот тёмный скакун не ведает страха в бою и может менять облик, подстраиваясь под любого всадника, большого или маленького."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Da steht ein<br>Pferd in Rankenflur.<br><i>Erik</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Sleipnir─undying steed of the elder primal Odin. His coat is as dark as void, while his eyes glow a sanguine red.
#. column 1: Blessed by the elder primal himself, Sleipnir will forever remain loyal to those who have proven themselves worthy. In addition to being fearless in battle, the dark steed is also able to manipulate his corporeal form to accommodate any rider, large or small.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:42:0:2"
msgid "If it hadn't been<br>for that horse...<br>   - Erik"
msgstr "Если бы не тот конь...<br>  — Эрик"

#. ja: ボレアスに騎乗する。<br>氷神に祝福された妖馬。空気さえ凍て付かせる
#. de: Rufe das legendäre Ross Boreas herbei, welches dem Primae Shiva als Reittier dient. Sein Atem soll Schneestürme entfachen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Boréas, le destrier légendaire de Shiva. Il glace l'air de son souffle.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lady of Frost, Shiva, birthed this magicked steed from a unicorn offered by her followers in sacrifice.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:43:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Boreas, the legendary steed favored of the primal Shiva. His breath is said to beget the winter's storms."
msgstr "Призовите Борея, легендарного скакуна праймала Шивы. Говорят, его дыхание приносит зимние бури."

#. ja: 氷神「シヴァ」による祝福を受け、寒々しい冷気をまとった妖馬。おそらく、クルザスに生息するユニコーンに対し、蛮神が祝福を与えたことで変容した存在だと思われる。空気さえ凍て付かせながら、大地を駆ける
#. de: Legenden erzählen davon, dass Shiva Boreas aus einem Einhorn schuf, das ihr ihre Anhänger opferten.
#. fr: On raconte que Shiva, la Furie des neiges, aurait choisi une licorne du Coerthas pour souffler un froid glacial sur les terres qu'elle parcourait. C'est en recevant ce pouvoir que la créature aurait changé d'apparence.
#. column 0: Summon forth Boreas, the legendary steed favored of the primal Shiva. His breath is said to beget the winter's storms.
#. column 2: Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:43:0:1"
msgid "Legend states that the Lady of Frost, Shiva, birthed this magicked steed from a unicorn offered by her followers in sacrifice."
msgstr "Легенда гласит, что Шива, Повелительница мороза, породила этого волшебного скакуна из единорога, принесённого ей в жертву последователями."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Du gibst dich als Pferd<br>aus, um die Vorzüge der<br>Pferde anzupreisen?<br>Haha, was für ein Blödsinn!<br><i>Ul'dahner</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Boreas, the legendary steed favored of the primal Shiva. His breath is said to beget the winter's storms.
#. column 1: Legend states that the Lady of Frost, Shiva, birthed this magicked steed from a unicorn offered by her followers in sacrifice.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:43:0:2"
msgid "Nay is but a hoofbeat<br>away from neigh!<br>  - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "И-го-го — и до ржания<br>всего один скачок!<br>  — Ума-бугё"

#. ja: パレードチョコボに騎乗する。<br>凱旋パレード用に装飾されたでぶチョコボ。堂々と練り歩く
#. de: Rufe deinen Parade-Chocobo herbei, der - seinem Aussehen nach zu urteilen - noch nicht in vielen Paraden mitmarschiert ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez un gros chocobo à la démarche gracieuse et paré élégamment pour parader.
#. column 1: Originally purchased by the Adventurers' Guild for use in festival parades, this portly steed quickly wore out his welcome by devouring a moon's worth of fodder in a single turn of the sun. Unable to pay the price of upkeep, the guild passed the reins to someone more “commendable.”
#. column 2:  I'll be at the parade with<br>whomever else I can drag along.<br>  - Botulf
msgctxt "MountTransient:44:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your parade chocobo who, by the looks of him, has not marched in many parades."
msgstr "Призовите парадного чокобо. Судя по виду, он нечасто участвовал в парадах."

#. ja: 冒険者ギルドが用意した凱旋パレード用のチョコボ。商人に「堂々たる体躯のチョコボ」を注文したら、これが届いたらしい。あまりの食いっぷりに維持費が高くつくことから、偉業を成した優秀冒険者への賞品に変更された
#. de: Ursprünglich von der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde erworben, um ihn in Paraden einzusetzen, verspielte dieser stämmige Chocobo alle Sympathien, als er gleich bei der ersten Fütterung eine ganze Mondration Gizar-Blätter verschlang. Danach marschierte er direkt aufs Abstellgleis.
#. fr: Ce volatile à l'appétit insatiable aurait été livré à la guilde des aventuriers lorsque celle-ci commanda des chocobos de stature imposante à un marchand. Bien trop coûteux à entretenir, la guilde décida de les offrir à certains aventuriers pour saluer leurs exploits.
#. column 0: Summon forth your parade chocobo who, by the looks of him, has not marched in many parades.
#. column 2:  I'll be at the parade with<br>whomever else I can drag along.<br>  - Botulf
msgctxt "MountTransient:44:0:1"
msgid "Originally purchased by the Adventurers' Guild for use in festival parades, this portly steed quickly wore out his welcome by devouring a moon's worth of fodder in a single turn of the sun. Unable to pay the price of upkeep, the guild passed the reins to someone more “commendable.”"
msgstr "Гильдия искателей приключений купила этого упитанного скакуна для праздничных парадов. Но он быстро всех утомил, съев за один день месячный запас корма. Гильдия не могла позволить себе его содержать и передала поводья кому-то более «достойному»."

#. ja: なんかようかーい？
#. de: Psst! Lust auf 'ne Parade?<br><i>Windiger Gaukler</i>
#. fr: Kwa, kwa<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon forth your parade chocobo who, by the looks of him, has not marched in many parades.
#. column 1: Originally purchased by the Adventurers' Guild for use in festival parades, this portly steed quickly wore out his welcome by devouring a moon's worth of fodder in a single turn of the sun. Unable to pay the price of upkeep, the guild passed the reins to someone more “commendable.”
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:44:0:2"
msgid " I'll be at the parade with<br>whomever else I can drag along.<br>  - Botulf"
msgstr "На параде буду я<br>и все, кого удастся туда затащить.<br>  — Ботульф"

#. ja: 黒チョコボに騎乗する。<br>フライヤー種のチョコボ。幼い頃から飛行訓練を重ねてきた
#. de: Rufe deinen schwarzen Flug-Chocobo herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre chocobo noir. Cet oiseau de la race des volants a été entraîné au vol dès son plus jeune âge.
#. column 1: A purebred Ishgardian black chocobo, trained from birth by House Fortemps knight, Ser Haurchefant, and presented to you in a gesture of true friendship. The bird is slightly more muscular than you expected and exhibits the strange habit of squatting when left to itself.
#. column 2: Black chocobos are all well and<br>good, but the true reward is the<br>exoneration of your comrades.<br>   - Haurchefant
msgctxt "MountTransient:45:0:0"
msgid "Summon de forth your black de chocobo. "
msgstr "Призовите чёрного чокобо."

#. ja: イシュガルド産の黒チョコボ。飛行を得意とするフライヤー種で、羽毛は生まれた時から黒い。フォルタン家の騎士、オルシュファン卿が愛してやまない友のために、手ずからに調教したチョコボで、なかなかに筋肉質である
#. de: Dieser schwarzgefiederte Chocobo wurde dir von Haurchefant als Zeichen seiner Freund<shy>schaft übergeben.
#. fr: Un chocobo noir natif d'Ishgard, de la race des “volants”. Sire Haurchefant de la maison Fortemps a élevé lui-même ce spécimen, qu'il destinait à un ami cher, et lui a fait subir un en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment de son cru. Curieusement, l'animal semble musclé...
#. column 0: Summon de forth your black de chocobo.
#. column 2: Black chocobos are all well and<br>good, but the true reward is the<br>exoneration of your comrades.<br>   - Haurchefant
msgctxt "MountTransient:45:0:1"
msgid "A purebred Ishgardian black chocobo, trained from birth by House Fortemps knight, Ser Haurchefant, and presented to you in a gesture of true friendship. The bird is slightly more muscular than you expected and exhibits the strange habit of squatting when left to itself."
msgstr "Чистокровный ишгардский чёрный чокобо, которого с рождения дрессировал рыцарь дома Фортамов сэр Оршефан. Он подарил его вам в знак искренней дружбы. Птица оказалась чуть мускулистее, чем вы ожидали, и, оставшись без дела, почему-то любит приседать."

#. ja: ウッ！！
#. de: Dann schnappst du dir besser einen schwarzen Chocobo, dann bist du im Nu dort.<br><i>Redwald</i>
#. fr: Kwékwé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon de forth your black de chocobo.
#. column 1: A purebred Ishgardian black chocobo, trained from birth by House Fortemps knight, Ser Haurchefant, and presented to you in a gesture of true friendship. The bird is slightly more muscular than you expected and exhibits the strange habit of squatting when left to itself.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:45:0:2"
msgid "Black chocobos are all well and<br>good, but the true reward is the<br>exoneration of your comrades.<br>   - Haurchefant"
msgstr "Чёрные чокобо — это, конечно,<br>хорошо, но настоящая награда —<br>оправдать своих товарищей.<br>  — Оршефан"

#. ja: アダマンタスに騎乗する。<br>近東原産の巨大陸亀。見た目に反して意外と素早い
#. de: Rufe deine Reit-Taimai herbei. Keine Sorge, sie ist schneller, als sie aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez une adamankhélone. Malgré sa taille imposante, cette tortue originaire du Proche-Orient est très véloce.
#. column 1: Native to the Near Eastern island of Thavnair, adamantoises were long thought to be impossible to domesticate. However, through the efforts of both Ul'dahn naturalists and thaumaturges, a handful have been successfully trained not only to accept riders, but also wield ancient magicks which allow the colossal scalekin to fly.
#. column 2: M-Me? Perfectly fine!<br>S-Solid as an adamantoise!<br>  - Cocobezi
msgctxt "MountTransient:46:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your adamantoise mount. He(?) is actually quite faster than he appears."
msgstr "Призовите верховую адамантовую черепаху. Она куда быстрее, чем кажется."

#. ja: 近東のサベネア島原産の巨大陸亀。野生化したアダマンタスの有効利用策として、ウルダハで家畜化が進められた結果、駄獣としての訓練に成功。さらに呪術士ギルドによる古代魔法再現実験により、飛翔能力さえ身に付けた
#. de: Die auf der nah-östlichen Insel Thavnair heimische Riesenschildkröte wurde lange Zeit für unzähmbar gehalten, doch gelang es ul'dhischen Zoologen, eine kleine Anzahl von ihnen als Reittiere abzurichten. Die Thaumaturgen-Gilde vollbrachte es zudem, die unbeweglichen Riesen mithilfe uralter Rituale mit Flugfähigkeiten auszustatten.
#. fr: Les adamankhélones proviennent de la lointaine île de Thavnair. Les scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques uldiens ont longtemps cherché à les apprivoiser afin de pouvoir profiter de leur force prodigieuse. Grâce au concours des occultistes, de nombreux spécimens ont été dressés à être montés, et certains sont même désormais capables de voyager dans les airs.
#. column 0: Summon forth your adamantoise mount. He(?) is actually quite faster than he appears.
#. column 2: M-Me? Perfectly fine!<br>S-Solid as an adamantoise!<br>  - Cocobezi
msgctxt "MountTransient:46:0:1"
msgid "Native to the Near Eastern island of Thavnair, adamantoises were long thought to be impossible to domesticate. However, through the efforts of both Ul'dahn naturalists and thaumaturges, a handful have been successfully trained not only to accept riders, but also wield ancient magicks which allow the colossal scalekin to fly."
msgstr "Адамантовые черепахи родом с острова Тавнаир на Ближнем Востоке. Долгое время их считали неукротимыми, но ульдские натуралисты и тауматурги сумели приручить нескольких. Теперь черепахи не только спокойно возят всадников, но и благодаря древней магии умеют летать."

#. ja: ドスン、ドスン…
#. de: Man bringe mir einen<br>geräucherten Wellwick-<br>Wurm, ein weichgekochtes<br>Adaman-Taimai-Ei und ein<br>Goblinkäse-Soufflé. Aber<br>dalli dalli!<br><i>Gegeruju</i>
#. fr: Badam, badam...
#. column 0: Summon forth your adamantoise mount. He(?) is actually quite faster than he appears.
#. column 1: Native to the Near Eastern island of Thavnair, adamantoises were long thought to be impossible to domesticate. However, through the efforts of both Ul'dahn naturalists and thaumaturges, a handful have been successfully trained not only to accept riders, but also wield ancient magicks which allow the colossal scalekin to fly.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:46:0:2"
msgid "M-Me? Perfectly fine!<br>S-Solid as an adamantoise!<br>  - Cocobezi"
msgstr "Я? Д-да всё в порядке!<br>К-крепок, как адамантовая черепаха!<br>  — Кокобези"

#. ja: 麒麟に騎乗する。<br>東方由来の魔笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣
#. de: Rufe dein Kirin herbei, den unumschränkten König der Tiere im Fernen Osten.
#. fr: Vous appelez Kirin, un destrier légendaire venu des contrées orientales.
#. column 1: Ask any man in Othard who rules the realm of beasts, and you will receive the same answer─Kirin. It is believed that the lionlike creature has walked the eastern lands for over a thousand years and will only answer the call of a hero it has deemed worthy.
#. column 2: Even folk in the Far East<br>'eard that tale, I reckon.<br>  - Trachraet
msgctxt "MountTransient:47:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Kirin, Far Eastern king of the beasts."
msgstr "Призовите Кирина — царя зверей с Дальнего Востока."

#. ja: 東方地域に伝わる幻獣。1000年の時を生きる存在であり、獣たちの王とも伝えられている。隠棲の仙人が精魂込めて作り上げた「魔笛」を、才気に溢れる英雄の器を持つ者が吹き鳴らすことで、呼び出すことができるらしい
#. de: Wen man in Othard auch nach der mächtigsten Kreatur fragt, die Antwort ist immer dieselbe: Kirin. Es heißt, das löwenartige Wesen streife schon über tausend Jahre durch den Fernen Osten und erkenne nur einen wahren Helden als seinen Herrn an.
#. fr: Ce destrier légendaire, qui règne sur les autres créatures, a vécu des millénaires. Un ermite a fabriqué le “cor oriental” nécessaire pour l'appeler, mais on dit que seul un héros aussi vaillant que sage verra cette monture se présenter devant lui.
#. column 0: Summon forth Kirin, Far Eastern king of the beasts.
#. column 2: Even folk in the Far East<br>'eard that tale, I reckon.<br>  - Trachraet
msgctxt "MountTransient:47:0:1"
msgid "Ask any man in Othard who rules the realm of beasts, and you will receive the same answer─Kirin. It is believed that the lionlike creature has walked the eastern lands for over a thousand years and will only answer the call of a hero it has deemed worthy."
msgstr "Спроси любого жителя Отарда, кто правит царством зверей, и услышишь один и тот же ответ — Кирин. Говорят, это львиноподобное создание уже больше тысячи лет бродит по восточным землям и откликается лишь на зов героя, которого сочтёт достойным."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Wenn ich Ferner Osten sage,<br>dann mein ich übrigens auch fern.<br><i>Gerolt</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Kirin, Far Eastern king of the beasts.
#. column 1: Ask any man in Othard who rules the realm of beasts, and you will receive the same answer─Kirin. It is believed that the lionlike creature has walked the eastern lands for over a thousand years and will only answer the call of a hero it has deemed worthy.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:47:0:2"
msgid "Even folk in the Far East<br>'eard that tale, I reckon.<br>  - Trachraet"
msgstr "Да и на Дальнем Востоке<br>слыхали эту байку, я так думаю.<br>  — Трахраэт"

#. ja: 騎乗システムに騎乗する。<br>古代アラグ帝国時代に設計された汎用球形防衛システム
#. de: Rufe dein allagisches Logistiksystem herbei. Zu deiner Sicherheit und der von Passanten wurden alle Waffensysteme deaktiviert.
#. fr: Vous appelez un module de déplacement sphérique. Cet appareil a été conçu dans l'ancien empire d'Allag à des fins multiples, mais surtout défensives.
#. column 1: One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to maintain and protect their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere was modified by Nero tol Scaeva into a personal transportation device.
#. column 2: Her report also mentions a<br>violent encounter with a<br>sentry heavily augmented<br>by Allagan technology...<br>  - Rammbroes
msgctxt "MountTransient:48:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your Allagan logistics system. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled."
msgstr "Призывает на помощь аллаганскую систему снабжения. Ради вашей безопасности и безопасности окружающих всё оружие отключено."

#. ja: 聖コイナク財団が発掘した古代アラグ帝国の汎用球形防衛システム。調査後、ネロの手で無害な乗り物に再調整され、研究費確保のため、ロウェナ商会に売り払われた。ただし、調整不足だったのか、ときどきビリビリする
#. de: Eine der automatisierten Drohnen, die die Allager zum Schutz ihrer Festung einsetzten. Nachdem sie von den Forschern der Sankt Coinach-Stiftung gefunden wurde, modifizierte Nero tol Scaeva sie zu seinem persönlichen Transportmittel.
#. fr: Les archéologues de la Fondation de Saint-Coinach ont découvert ce module, dont le désarmement a été confié aux bons soins de Nero tol Scaeva. Les frais ont été remboursés lors de la revente de l'appareil, mais les réglages semblent avoir été faits à la va-vite. L'appareil s'agite parfois, comme s'il se préparait à abattre sa cible...
#. column 0: Call into battle your Allagan logistics system. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled.
#. column 2: Her report also mentions a<br>violent encounter with a<br>sentry heavily augmented<br>by Allagan technology...<br>  - Rammbroes
msgctxt "MountTransient:48:0:1"
msgid "One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to maintain and protect their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere was modified by Nero tol Scaeva into a personal transportation device."
msgstr "Один из автоматических дронов, которых аллаганы использовали для охраны своих крепостей и обслуживания их систем. Механическую сферу раскопали Сыны Святого Койнака, а Неро тол Скаева переделал её в личное средство передвижения."

#. ja: 更新プログラムを構築中<br>電源を切らないでください
#. de: Bescheidenheit war den<br>Allagern anscheinend fremd.<br><i>G'raha Tia</i>
#. fr: Mise à jour en cours...<br>Ne pas éteindre le module.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Allagan logistics system. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled.
#. column 1: One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to maintain and protect their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere was modified by Nero tol Scaeva into a personal transportation device.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:48:0:2"
msgid "Her report also mentions a<br>violent encounter with a<br>sentry heavily augmented<br>by Allagan technology...<br>  - Rammbroes"
msgstr "В её отчёте упоминается и<br>жестокая схватка с часовым,<br>усиленным аллаганскими<br>технологиями...<br>  — Раммброэс"

#. ja: フェンリルに騎乗する。<br>アバラシア山脈の奥地に生息する幻の古代獣
#. de: Rufe einen reinrassigen abalathischen Höllenhund herbei, der nach seinem legendären Rudelführer benannt ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez Fenrir, le loup gigantesque qui erre dans les régions reculées des montagnes d'Abalathia.
#. column 1: Following the rise of Ishgard, hoarhounds all but disappeared from the Coerthas highlands. However, the shift in climate caused by the Calamity has seen the legendary beasts descend from their mountain dens once more.
#. column 2: A good hound keeps<br>his maw shut.<br>   - Latata
msgctxt "MountTransient:49:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a purebred Abalathian hoarhound named after its pack's legendary leader."
msgstr "Призывает чистокровного абалатийского хладопса, названного в честь легендарного вожака стаи."

#. ja: かつてエオルゼアに君臨した古代獣、ホアハウンド。既に絶滅したと信じられてきたが、近年、アバラシア山脈の奥深くで再発見されるに至った。その雄々しい姿から、伝説の幻獣、月狼「フェンリル」の名で呼ばれている
#. de: Zu Ishgards Hochzeiten waren die Hochebenen von Coerthas so gut wie befreit von den gefährlichen Höllenhunden. Doch die Klimaänderungen der Katastrophe haben die legendären Raubtiere erneut aus ihren Höhlen in besiedelte Gebiete getrieben.
#. fr: Ce canidé sauvage, dont les Éorzéens croyaient l'espèce disparue depuis longtemps, régnait autrefois en Éorzéa. On l'appelle “Fenrir” de par sa ressemblance avec la créature légendaire du même nom. Le froid des montagnes d'Abalathia aurait-il ressuscité ces bêtes<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon forth a purebred Abalathian hoarhound named after its pack's legendary leader.
#. column 2: A good hound keeps<br>his maw shut.<br>   - Latata
msgctxt "MountTransient:49:0:1"
msgid "Following the rise of Ishgard, hoarhounds all but disappeared from the Coerthas highlands. However, the shift in climate caused by the Calamity has seen the legendary beasts descend from their mountain dens once more."
msgstr "После возвышения Ишгарда эрдельтерьеры почти исчезли с нагорий Коэртаса. Но климатические перемены, вызванные Бедствием, вновь согнали легендарных зверей с гор в долины."

#. ja: ウォォォォン！
#. de: Alle hundertausend<br>heulende Höllenhunde!<br><i>Unbekannter Seefahrer</i>
#. fr: Aouuuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth a purebred Abalathian hoarhound named after its pack's legendary leader.
#. column 1: Following the rise of Ishgard, hoarhounds all but disappeared from the Coerthas highlands. However, the shift in climate caused by the Calamity has seen the legendary beasts descend from their mountain dens once more.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:49:0:2"
msgid "A good hound keeps<br>his maw shut.<br>   - Latata"
msgstr "Хороший пёс держит<br>пасть на замке.<br>   — Латата"

#. ja: ミドガルズオルムに騎乗する。
#. de: Rufe Midgardsormr herbei - maßstabsgetreu, aber nicht in Originalgröße.
#. fr: Vous appelez Midgardsormr.
#. column 1: Only after proving your bravery in the face of countless perils has the Father of Dragons found you to be a worthy heir to the Light, and granted you a place upon his back.
#. column 2: Correct me if I'm wrong, but<br>if Midgardsormr had roared,<br>wouldn't we have heard it?<br>   - Moenbryda
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:50:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Midgardsormr, the slightly bigger one, but still not <i>the</i> big one."
msgstr "Призывает Мидгардсормра — того, что побольше, но всё же не <i>самого</i> большого."

#. ja: すべてのドラゴン族の始祖、幻龍「ミドガルズオルム」が創りだした幻体。試練に耐え抜き、すべての竜の爪を砕いた光の戦士を、己の背に乗るに相応しい存在と認めた。ゆえに幻体を騎乗に適した形状へと変えたのである
#. de: Nachdem du dich in zahllosen Abenteuern behauptet hast, gestattet der Urvater aller Drachen dir, auf seinem Rücken Platz zu nehmen.
#. fr: Une progéniture engendrée par Midgardsormr, le père de tous les dragons. Un Guerrier de la Lumière ayant vaincu tous les dragons est, d'après lui, digne de le chevaucher. Il a changé de forme de façon à pouvoir être monté.
#. column 0: Summon forth Midgardsormr, the slightly bigger one, but still not <i>the</i> big one.
#. column 2: Correct me if I'm wrong, but<br>if Midgardsormr had roared,<br>wouldn't we have heard it?<br>   - Moenbryda
msgctxt "MountTransient:50:0:1"
msgid "Only after proving your bravery in the face of countless perils has the Father of Dragons found you to be a worthy heir to the Light, and granted you a place upon his back."
msgstr "Лишь после того, как вы доказали свою храбрость в бесчисленных опасностях, Отец драконов признал вас достойным наследником Света и позволил взобраться себе на спину."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Doch sagt, glaubt Ihr wirklich,<br>Midgardsormr könnte wiederauferstehen?<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Midgardsormr, the slightly bigger one, but still not <i>the</i> big one.
#. column 1: Only after proving your bravery in the face of countless perils has the Father of Dragons found you to be a worthy heir to the Light, and granted you a place upon his back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:50:0:2"
msgid "Correct me if I'm wrong, but<br>if Midgardsormr had roared,<br>wouldn't we have heard it?<br>   - Moenbryda"
msgstr "Поправьте, если я ошибаюсь, но<br>разве мы не услышали бы рёв,<br>если бы Мидгардсорм зарычал?<br>   — Моэнбрида"

#. ja: 赤グランチョコボに騎乗する。<br>体格に優れた大型チョコボ。2人乗りが可能
#. de: Rufe einen bernsteinfarbenen Riesen-Chocobo herbei. Stark genug, um zwei Reiter zu tragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un robuste chocobo rouge, capable de supporter le poids de deux cavaliers.
#. column 1: To Ishgardians, red represents true love and loyalty. To this wild chocobo from the Dravanian forelands, it meant capture at the hands of hunters who easily found a red chocobo sticking out like a sore thumb in the midst of all his yellow brethren.
#. column 2: What about my forty<br>acres and a chocobo?<br>   - Imme
msgctxt "MountTransient:52:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your amber draught chocobo, a rare breed large and strong enough to bear two riders."
msgstr "Призывает янтарного чокобо особой породы — редкого, крупного и сильного, чтобы выдержать двух всадников."

#. ja: 高地ドラヴァニアの秘境「チョコボの森」で捕獲されたグランチョコボ。しかも、野生種としては極めて珍しい赤毛である。イシュガルドにおいて赤は、純愛や博愛の象徴とされるだけに、親友と共に乗るに相応しい存在といえる
#. de: Rot-glänzender Bernstein ist den Ishgardern ein Symbol der Liebe und Loyalität. Für in der Natur lebende Chocobos bedeutet ein rotes Federkleid, dass sich bald eine Schar Jäger blicken lässt.
#. fr: Oiseau de grande taille capturé dans la forêt des chocobos de Dravania, il arbore un ton rouge rare chez les spécimens sauvages. Cette couleur étant celle de l'amour et de la fraternité à Ishgard, c'est la monture idéale pour les in<shy>sé<shy>pa<shy>ra<shy>bles.
#. column 0: Summon forth your amber draught chocobo, a rare breed large and strong enough to bear two riders.
#. column 2: What about my forty<br>acres and a chocobo?<br>   - Imme
msgctxt "MountTransient:52:0:1"
msgid "To Ishgardians, red represents true love and loyalty. To this wild chocobo from the Dravanian forelands, it meant capture at the hands of hunters who easily found a red chocobo sticking out like a sore thumb in the midst of all his yellow brethren."
msgstr "Для ишгардцев красный цвет — символ истинной любви и верности. А этому дикому чокобо из Драванских предгорий он сулил плен: охотники без труда заметили его среди жёлтых сородичей."

#. ja: クエッ、クエーッ！！
#. de: Nanu?! Was macht denn dieser<br>süße Chocoboige hier?<br><i>Diluxio</i>
#. fr: Kwé, kwéééh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your amber draught chocobo, a rare breed large and strong enough to bear two riders.
#. column 1: To Ishgardians, red represents true love and loyalty. To this wild chocobo from the Dravanian forelands, it meant capture at the hands of hunters who easily found a red chocobo sticking out like a sore thumb in the midst of all his yellow brethren.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:52:0:2"
msgid "What about my forty<br>acres and a chocobo?<br>   - Imme"
msgstr "А как же мои сорок<br>акров и чокобо?<br>   — Имме"

#. ja: サヌワに騎乗する。<br>グンド族の商人ルナバヌが、心を込めて育てたサヌワ
#. de: Rufe eine Sanuwa herbei, die von dem Händler Luna Vanu mit viel Hingabe trainiert worden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre sanuwa personnel, spé<shy>cia<shy>le<shy>ment entraîné pour la monte par le marchand gundu Luna Vanu.
#. column 1: Countless turns of the sun did Luna Vanu train this wild sanuwa to obey the orders of man, and for many moons did he wait for one he deemed worthy of taking up this noble cloudkin's reins. Wait, he did, until you arrived.
#. column 2: Wild sanuwa fierce<br>as monsoon rains.<br>   - Gunu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:53:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your sanuwa, specially bred and trained for riding by Gundu merchant Luna Vanu."
msgstr "Призывает вашего сануву, которого торговец гунду Луна Вану специально вырастил и обучил для верховой езды."

#. ja: グンド族の商人のルナバヌが、心を込めて育てたサヌワ。荒れ狂う嵐のように猛々しく、そして力強く雲海の空を舞う。ルナバヌとしては、乗り手に相応しい勇者が現れるまで、決して売るまいと心に決めていたらしい
#. de: Luna Vanu hängt sehr an seiner Sanuwa, die er mit viel Liebe und Hingabe trainiert hat. Er hatte sich geschworen, sie nur an einen würdigen Helden zu verkaufen, der auf ihr wie ein Sturmwind durch die Lüfte rasen sollte.
#. fr: Luna Vanu a passé plusieurs lunes à entraîner ce farouche sanuwa à obéir à l'homme en attendant qu'un aventurier digne de le monter se présente. Il est si puissant qu'il peut voler sans difficultés même face à la plus terrible des tempêtes.
#. column 0: Summon forth your sanuwa, specially bred and trained for riding by Gundu merchant Luna Vanu.
#. column 2: Wild sanuwa fierce<br>as monsoon rains.<br>   - Gunu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:53:0:1"
msgid "Countless turns of the sun did Luna Vanu train this wild sanuwa to obey the orders of man, and for many moons did he wait for one he deemed worthy of taking up this noble cloudkin's reins. Wait, he did, until you arrived."
msgstr "Луна Вану долго приучал дикого сануву повиноваться людям и много лун ждал того, кого сочтёт достойным оседлать это благородное дитя облаков. Ждал — пока не появились вы."

#. ja: ブオオオオオ！
#. de: Sanuwa wird Na-Vanu-eeh tragen<br>geschwind wie Sausewind.<br><i>Luna Vanu</i>
#. fr: Guuuoooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your sanuwa, specially bred and trained for riding by Gundu merchant Luna Vanu.
#. column 1: Countless turns of the sun did Luna Vanu train this wild sanuwa to obey the orders of man, and for many moons did he wait for one he deemed worthy of taking up this noble cloudkin's reins. Wait, he did, until you arrived.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:53:0:2"
msgid "Wild sanuwa fierce<br>as monsoon rains.<br>   - Gunu Vanu"
msgstr "Дикий санува свиреп,<br>как муссонный ливень.<br>   — Гуну Вану"

#. ja: グリフィンに騎乗する。<br>アバラシア山脈原産の有翼の魔獣
#. de: Rufe deinen Greifen herbei. Halb Adler, halb Löwe, aber ganz schön wild.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre griffon, un animal ailé originaire des montagnes d'Abalathia.
#. column 1: Fantastical winged beasts native to the unscalable peaks of Abalathia's Spine, griffins actually have a long history of serving as mounts. Indeed, before the city<hyphen>state's fall, the Ala Mhigan army maintained a regiment of griffin<hyphen>back soldiers who would harry opposing forces.
#. column 2: “Spread your wings and soar”<br>   - Highwind Skyways Slogan
msgctxt "MountTransient:54:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your griffin─half eagle, half lion, all business."
msgstr "Призывает грифона — наполовину орла, наполовину льва, целиком делового."

#. ja: アバラシア山脈原産の有翼の魔獣。非常に獰猛な存在だが、城塞都市「アラミゴ」では、幼獣の頃から厳しく躾けることで、騎獣として利用してきた歴史がある。特にグリフィン騎兵で構成された、アラミゴ魔獣軍団は有名
#. de: Die auf den unerklimmbaren Gipfeln von Abalathias Rückgrat nestenden Greifen dienten einst den un<shy>er<shy>schro<shy>cke<shy>nen Soldaten Ala Mhigos als kampfwütige Reittiere.
#. fr: Cet animal ailé originaire des montagnes d'Abalathia est ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment féroce. La Cité d'Ala Mhigo a cependant réussi par le passé à l'utiliser comme monture en le dressant strictement dès son plus jeune âge. Cette nation avait même constitué un escadron monté utilisant ces animaux.
#. column 0: Summon forth your griffin─half eagle, half lion, all business.
#. column 2: “Spread your wings and soar”<br>   - Highwind Skyways Slogan
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:54:0:1"
msgid "Fantastical winged beasts native to the unscalable peaks of Abalathia's Spine, griffins actually have a long history of serving as mounts. Indeed, before the city<hyphen>state's fall, the Ala Mhigan army maintained a regiment of griffin<hyphen>back soldiers who would harry opposing forces."
msgstr "Крылатые чудовища с неприступных вершин Хребта Абалатии давно служат верховыми животными. До падения города-государства армия Ала Миго держала целый полк грифоньих всадников, которые изводили вражеские войска."

#. ja: クワッ、クワッ！
#. de: So hoch wie nie jemand zuvor!<br><i>Slogan der Highwind-Fluggesellschaft</i>
#. fr: Groaaahr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your griffin─half eagle, half lion, all business.
#. column 1: Fantastical winged beasts native to the unscalable peaks of Abalathia's Spine, griffins actually have a long history of serving as mounts. Indeed, before the city<hyphen>state's fall, the Ala Mhigan army maintained a regiment of griffin<hyphen>back soldiers who would harry opposing forces.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:54:0:2"
msgid "“Spread your wings and soar”<br>   - Highwind Skyways Slogan"
msgstr "«Расправь крылья и взмывай ввысь»<br>   — лозунг авиакомпании «Хайвинд»"

#. ja: マナカッターに騎乗する。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社製の小型飛空艇
#. de: Rufe deinen Manaschnitter herbei, das einsitzige Luftschiff der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke.
#. fr: Vous appelez le Manacutter, un aéronef miniature mis au point par les Forges de Garlond.
#. column 1: Supervised (in spirit) by the ever-absent Cid, Biggs and Wedge (with a little bending over by Biggs) put their heads together to create this flight-ready miniature airship, powered by the realm's first corrupted crystal engine.
#. column 2: There are more of these<br>“manacutters” to be had,<br>yes?<br>   - Aymeric
msgctxt "MountTransient:55:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your manacutter, a single-rider airship constructed at the Garlond Ironworks."
msgstr "Призывает манакуттер — одноместный дирижабль, созданный в мастерских «Гарлонд»."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社製の小型飛空艇。同社に所属する気鋭の機工師、ビッグスとウェッジが共同設計を担当し、シドが監修することで完成させた。偏属性クリスタル式浮行装置を搭載した、史上初の機体である
#. de: Dieser Einsitzer ist eine Gemeinschaftsarbeit der Chef-Ingenieure Biggs und Wedge und trägt den ersten Motor auf Basis denaturierter Kristalle unter der Haube.
#. fr: Le Manacutter est un aéronef de petite taille conçu par Wedge et Biggs des Forges de Garlond sur une supervision de Cid nan Garlond. C'est le tout premier modèle embarquant un convertisseur fon<shy>ction<shy>nant au moyen de cristaux corrompus.
#. column 0: Call into battle your manacutter, a single-rider airship constructed at the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: There are more of these<br>“manacutters” to be had,<br>yes?<br>   - Aymeric
msgctxt "MountTransient:55:0:1"
msgid "Supervised (in spirit) by the ever-absent Cid, Biggs and Wedge (with a little bending over by Biggs) put their heads together to create this flight-ready miniature airship, powered by the realm's first corrupted crystal engine."
msgstr "Пока Сид вечно отсутствовал и лишь присматривал за ними духом, Биггс и Ведж объединили усилия и построили этот миниатюрный дирижабль. (Ну, Биггсу пришлось немного поднапрячься.) Его приводит в движение первый в мире двигатель на искажённых кристаллах."

#. ja: ブロロロロ
#. de: Mit unserer neuesten Erfindung haben<br>wir uns mal wieder selbst übertroffen!<br><i>Wedge</i>
#. fr: VRRRH...
#. column 0: Call into battle your manacutter, a single-rider airship constructed at the Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 1: Supervised (in spirit) by the ever-absent Cid, Biggs and Wedge (with a little bending over by Biggs) put their heads together to create this flight-ready miniature airship, powered by the realm's first corrupted crystal engine.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:55:0:2"
msgid "There are more of these<br>“manacutters” to be had,<br>yes?<br>   - Aymeric"
msgstr "А ещё такие<br>«манакуттеры» бывают?<br>Правда?<br>   — Эймерик"

#. ja: ウォーパンサーに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍豹。影のように静かに走る
#. de: Rufe deinen Kriegspanther herbei. Dieser lautlose Killer ist darauf abgerichtet, alles und jeden zu zerfleischen - außer dich, versteht sich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture panthère de guerre. Ce félin énigmatique a été entraîné au combat. Il fond sur sa proie en un instant, discret comme une ombre.
#. column 1: While more difficult to train than their cousins the coeurls, panthers bring their riders much more advantage on the field due to the beasts' inherent affinity to various magic. It is also believed that many dark knight battle techniques were conceived by watching panthers hunt.
#. column 2: I have seen you<br>move like a shadow.<br>   - Daimbert
msgctxt "MountTransient:56:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your war panther─a silent killer trained to maim anyone and everything...excepting you, of course."
msgstr "Призывает боевую пантеру — бесшумного убийцу, обученного калечить всех и вся... кроме вас, разумеется."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍豹。クァールの近縁種「パンサー」は、本能的に魔力を利用し、身体能力を高める。その狩りの様子を観察することで、初代暗黒騎士は、魔力を応用する暗黒剣の戦技の着想を得たと伝えられている
#. de: Die schwarzen Raubkatzen sind wesentlich schwieriger abzurichten als ihre nahen Verwandten, die Coeurl, doch verschaffen ihre angeborenen magischen Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten dem Reiter einen erheblichen kämpferischen Vorteil.
#. fr: Ce félin proche du coeurl a été dressé pour le combat. Il possède la capacité naturelle d'augmenter ses ca<shy>rac<shy>té<shy>ris<shy>ti<shy>ques physiques grâce à la magie pour chasser. On raconte qu'il aurait ainsi inspiré les premiers chevaliers noirs pour leurs techniques d'épée.
#. column 0: Summon forth your war panther─a silent killer trained to maim anyone and everything...excepting you, of course.
#. column 2: I have seen you<br>move like a shadow.<br>   - Daimbert
msgctxt "MountTransient:56:0:1"
msgid "While more difficult to train than their cousins the coeurls, panthers bring their riders much more advantage on the field due to the beasts' inherent affinity to various magic. It is also believed that many dark knight battle techniques were conceived by watching panthers hunt."
msgstr "Пантер сложнее приручить, чем их родичей к'уалов, зато на поле боя они дают всадникам большое преимущество благодаря врождённой близости к магии. Считается, что наблюдения за охотой пантер вдохновили тёмных рыцарей на создание многих боевых приёмов."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ein Jäger ohne Krallen ist nichts weiter als wehrlose Beute.<br><i>Pawah Mujuuk</i>
#. fr: Rawrh...
#. column 0: Summon forth your war panther─a silent killer trained to maim anyone and everything...excepting you, of course.
#. column 1: While more difficult to train than their cousins the coeurls, panthers bring their riders much more advantage on the field due to the beasts' inherent affinity to various magic. It is also believed that many dark knight battle techniques were conceived by watching panthers hunt.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:56:0:2"
msgid "I have seen you<br>move like a shadow.<br>   - Daimbert"
msgstr "Я видел, как ты<br>двигался словно тень.<br>   — Даймберт"

#. ja: ゴブリウォーカーに騎乗する。<br>科学者集団「青の手」が開発した騎乗用ウォーカーマシン
#. de: Rufe deinen Stampfer herbei, eine dampfbetriebene Kriegsmaschine der berüchtigten Indigohand.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre gobblindé, un engin mis au point par l'or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tion scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>que gobeline de la Main indigo.
#. column 1: Originally designed to be a less-fickle replacement for pack raptors, the gobwalker was quickly reoutfitted into a tool of war after it took twenty goblins to chase down and topple a walker that had gone out of control and destroyed an entire workshop.
#. column 2: Ye would have more luck<br>findin'...well, a gobmachine<br>bangplate on a tree!<br>   - Papana
msgctxt "MountTransient:58:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your gobwalker, a steam-powered war vehicle designed by the infamous Illuminati."
msgstr "Призывает гобходок — паровую боевую машину, созданную печально известной организацией «Синяя рука»."

#. ja: ゴブリン族の科学者集団「青の手」が開発した騎乗用ウォーカーマシン。ラプトルに代わる荷駄として開発されていた歩行型機械に対し、武装を施すことで戦闘用にしたもの。鹵獲品であるため、武装までは再現されていない
#. de: Dieses Modell ist wesentlich zuverlässiger als die ersten Prototypen, die häufig außer Kontrolle gerieten und dabei ganze Werkstätten verwüsteten.
#. fr: Conçu à l'origine pour remplacer les raptors de trait, cet engin a rapidement été transformé en machine de guerre par les Gobelins de la Main indigo. Ce modèle ne dispose pas de munition et ne peut, par conséquent, pas attaquer.
#. column 0: Call into battle your gobwalker, a steam-powered war vehicle designed by the infamous Illuminati.
#. column 2: Ye would have more luck<br>findin'...well, a gobmachine<br>bangplate on a tree!<br>   - Papana
msgctxt "MountTransient:58:0:1"
msgid "Originally designed to be a less-fickle replacement for pack raptors, the gobwalker was quickly reoutfitted into a tool of war after it took twenty goblins to chase down and topple a walker that had gone out of control and destroyed an entire workshop."
msgstr "Гобходок изначально задумывался как более надёжная замена вьючным рапторам. Но вскоре его переделали в боевую машину: однажды вышедший из-под контроля ходок разнёс целую мастерскую, и двадцати гоблинам пришлось ловить его и валить на землю."

#. ja: ガチョンガチョン
#. de: Macht Vielebumm. Muzzu gucken!<br><i>Unbekannter Goblin-Tüftler</i>
#. fr: Kling klang<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your gobwalker, a steam-powered war vehicle designed by the infamous Illuminati.
#. column 1: Originally designed to be a less-fickle replacement for pack raptors, the gobwalker was quickly reoutfitted into a tool of war after it took twenty goblins to chase down and topple a walker that had gone out of control and destroyed an entire workshop.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:58:0:2"
msgid "Ye would have more luck<br>findin'...well, a gobmachine<br>bangplate on a tree!<br>   - Papana"
msgstr "Вам бы скорее удалось найти... да хоть<br>гоблинскую железяку на дереве!<br>   — Папана"

#. ja: ツインタニアに騎乗する。<br>アラグ文明の秘術により操作されたエルダーワイバーン
#. de: Rufe Twintania herbei, ein legendärer Wyvern, der insgeheim davon träumt, frei zu sein ... und dich zu verschlingen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Gémellia. Cette wyverne ancienne originaire de Méracydia rêve secrètement de retrouver sa liberté... et de vous dévorer.
#. column 1: Bound to eternal thralldom via an Allagan neurolink, this ancient wyvern from the southern continent of Meracydia will remain a loyal servant as long as you possess its identification key.
#. column 2: There are wyverns.<br>Wyverns everywhere.<br>   - Vath Drone
msgctxt "MountTransient:59:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Twintania, an ancient wyvern who secretly dreams of freedom...and devouring you."
msgstr "Призывает Твинтанию — древнего виверна, который тайком мечтает обрести свободу... и сожрать вас."

#. ja: アラグ文明の秘術により操作された、南方大陸メラシディア生まれのエルダーワイバーン。リング状拘束具「ニューロリンク」によって、精神を拘束されているため、認証鍵の保有者に対しては、決して逆らわない
#. de: Dank einer allagischen Gedankenfessel ist dir dieser uralte Wyvern aus dem südlichen Kontinent Meracydia ein treuer Diener<nbsp>- solange die Gedankenfessel hält.
#. fr: Vouée à la servitude éternelle grâce au dispositif qu'elle porte autour du cou, cette wyverne ancienne originaire de Méracydia restera un fidèle serviteur aussi longtemps que vous posséderez la clef d'identification de son neurolien.
#. column 0: Summon forth Twintania, an ancient wyvern who secretly dreams of freedom...and devouring you.
#. column 2: There are wyverns.<br>Wyverns everywhere.<br>   - Vath Drone
msgctxt "MountTransient:59:0:1"
msgid "Bound to eternal thralldom via an Allagan neurolink, this ancient wyvern from the southern continent of Meracydia will remain a loyal servant as long as you possess its identification key."
msgstr "С помощью аллаганского нейролинка этот древний виверн с южного континента Мерасидия обречён на вечное рабство. Он будет послушно вам служить, пока у вас есть ключ опознавания."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Da sind Wyvern. Überall Wyvern.<br><i>Vath-Drohne</i>
#. fr: Grrrh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Twintania, an ancient wyvern who secretly dreams of freedom...and devouring you.
#. column 1: Bound to eternal thralldom via an Allagan neurolink, this ancient wyvern from the southern continent of Meracydia will remain a loyal servant as long as you possess its identification key.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:59:0:2"
msgid "There are wyverns.<br>Wyverns everywhere.<br>   - Vath Drone"
msgstr "Виверны.<br>Везде одни виверны.<br>   — Дрон ваатов"

#. ja: ウィッチズブルームに騎乗する。<br>魔力が吹き込まれた魔法のホウキ。サッサカサー
#. de: Rufe den Hexenbesen herbei, um durch die Lüfte zu fegen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre balai de sorcière. Tenez-le bien ou il s'envolera en un “fschuiii”<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Once an ordinary household cleaning tool, relegated to such menial tasks as sweeping and...sweeping, this broom's life changed upon being enchanted by the ogre pumpkinhead. Now the skies are its dusty floors.
#. column 2: Are you going to introduce<br>yourself to that broom or not?<br>   - Matoya
msgctxt "MountTransient:62:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your witch's broom. Here is to hoping it refrains from “flipping you over, flip flip” while flying."
msgstr "Призывает ведьминскую метлу. Надеемся, в полёте она не станет «переворачивать вас вверх тормашками, верть-верть»."

#. ja: パンプキンヘッドの魔人によって、膨大な魔力を吹き込まれたホウキ。またがることで、フワリと浮き上がり、空をも飛ぶことができる。おちこんだ時に乗って大空へと飛び立てば、元気になること請け合い
#. de: Der große Kürbiskopf soll dem einst gewöhnlichen Haushaltsbesen Zauberkräfte verliehen haben. Obwohl er das Fliegen bevorzugt, ist er sich dennoch nicht zu schade dafür, schmutzige Böden zu fegen.
#. fr: Autrefois relégué à des tâches de second ordre comme le balayage et... le balayage, ce balai a vu sa vie prendre un tournant décisif le jour où il a été enchanté par la femme à tête de citrouille. Depuis, ce ne sont plus les déchets qu'il chasse, mais les nuages<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your witch's broom. Here is to hoping it refrains from “flipping you over, flip flip” while flying.
#. column 2: Are you going to introduce<br>yourself to that broom or not?<br>   - Matoya
msgctxt "MountTransient:62:0:1"
msgid "Once an ordinary household cleaning tool, relegated to such menial tasks as sweeping and...sweeping, this broom's life changed upon being enchanted by the ogre pumpkinhead. Now the skies are its dusty floors."
msgstr "Когда-то это была обычная домашняя метла, которой поручали скучнейшее занятие: подметать и... подметать. Но всё изменилось, когда её заколдовал огр с тыквенной головой. Теперь вместо пола она подметает небеса."

#. ja: サッサカサー！
#. de: Die Besen, sie fegen und sie sprechen und sind sehr fleißig, ja.<br><i>Toro Roggo</i>
#. fr: Fschuiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your witch's broom. Here is to hoping it refrains from “flipping you over, flip flip” while flying.
#. column 1: Once an ordinary household cleaning tool, relegated to such menial tasks as sweeping and...sweeping, this broom's life changed upon being enchanted by the ogre pumpkinhead. Now the skies are its dusty floors.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:62:0:2"
msgid "Are you going to introduce<br>yourself to that broom or not?<br>   - Matoya"
msgstr "Ты собираешься с метлой<br>поздороваться или нет?<br>   — Матоя"

#. ja: ペガサスに騎乗する。<br>雲海の果てに棲まうという幻の天翔る馬
#. de: Rufe einen Pegasus herbei, ein sagenumwobenes Pferdewesen, dessen Existenz lange Zeit angezweifelt wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez Pégase, le légendaire cheval ailé.
#. column 1: While rumors of a winged horse have graced ancient tomes for centuries, until recently, very little in the way of proof of their existence remained save the random feather or horseshoe housed in some remote monastery's reliquary.
#. column 2: Sprout wings, I will!<br>   - You
msgctxt "MountTransient:67:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a pegasus─winged white horse of legend."
msgstr "Призывает пегаса — легендарного белого крылатого коня."

#. ja: ディアデム諸島で友となった幻の天翔る馬。ペガサスは、これまで伝説上の存在と考えられてきたが、大飛空時代の到来によって実在が証明された。雲海で遭難した空賊を、背に乗せて助けたという逸話も残されている
#. de: Über viele Jahrhunderte hinweg galten Pegasus als Fabelwesen, doch seit zahlreiche Luftschiffe jeden Winkel des Wolkenmeeres erforschen, werden ab und zu einzelne Exemplare gesichtet. Es gibt sogar Gerüchte, in Not geratene Luftpiraten wären von Pegasus gerettet worden.
#. fr: Bien que des rumeurs d'un cheval ailé soient apparues dans divers écrits à travers les siècles, jusqu'à récemment, il n'y avait aucune preuve de son existence, si l'on excepte les quelques plumes et fers à cheval pré<shy>cieu<shy>se<shy>ment gardés dans les reliquaires de monastères oubliés.
#. column 0: Summon forth a pegasus─winged white horse of legend.
#. column 2: Sprout wings, I will!<br>   - You
msgctxt "MountTransient:67:0:1"
msgid "While rumors of a winged horse have graced ancient tomes for centuries, until recently, very little in the way of proof of their existence remained save the random feather or horseshoe housed in some remote monastery's reliquary."
msgstr "О крылатых конях веками слагали легенды. До недавних пор доказательствами их существования служили разве что случайные перья да подковы в реликвариях далёких монастырей."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich will aber einen Pegasus<br>zum Geburtstag!<br><i>Mädchen aus Ishgard</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth a pegasus─winged white horse of legend.
#. column 1: While rumors of a winged horse have graced ancient tomes for centuries, until recently, very little in the way of proof of their existence remained save the random feather or horseshoe housed in some remote monastery's reliquary.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:67:0:2"
msgid "Sprout wings, I will!<br>   - You"
msgstr "Вырастут крылья —<br>и взлечу!<br>   — Вы"

#. ja: リウィア専用魔導アーマーに騎乗する。<br>リウィア・サス・ユニウス用にカスタマイズされた魔導アーマー
#. de: Rufe die Magitek-Kampfmaschine vom Typ „Weißer Teufel“ herbei, die eigens für Livia sas Junius entwickelt und gebaut worden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous l'armure magitek personnelle de Livia sas Junius.
#. column 1: This masterpiece of imperial ingenuity is the selfsame suit of warmachina operated by XIVth Legion tribunus Livia sas Junius in the Garlean Empire's subjugation of Othard's southern reaches.
#. column 2: Ever the pessimist,<br>my dear Livia.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:68:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle the White Devil─Livia sas Junius's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor."
msgstr "Призывает Белого дьявола — боевую броню Ливии сакс Юний, созданную специально для неё, а теперь — специально для <i>вас</i>."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍第XIV軍団分遣隊長、リウィア・サス・ユニウス用にカスタマイズされた魔導アーマー。北州の領土拡大戦争にて多大な活躍をした「ダルマスカの魔女」の愛機として知られる。通称「ホワイトデビル」
#. de: Die Magitek-Kampfmaschine vom Typ „Weißer Teufel“ wurde speziell für Livia sas Junius, Tribunus der XIV. Legion des Garleischen Kaiserreichs, gebaut. Die Effektivität ihres Lieblings hat die Hexe von Dalmasca eindrucksvoll bei der Eroberung der nördlichen Territorien Ilsabards unter Beweis gestellt.
#. fr: Ce chef-d'œuvre de l'ingénierie impériale est l'armure de combat personnelle de Livia sas Junius, commandante de la 14e légion, et celle qu'elle pilotait pendant l'invasion de l'empire de Garlemald.
#. column 0: Call into battle the White Devil─Livia sas Junius's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor.
#. column 2: Ever the pessimist,<br>my dear Livia.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
msgctxt "MountTransient:68:0:1"
msgid "This masterpiece of imperial ingenuity is the selfsame suit of warmachina operated by XIVth Legion tribunus Livia sas Junius in the Garlean Empire's subjugation of Othard's southern reaches."
msgstr "Этот шедевр имперской инженерии — та самая боевая машина, которой командовала трибун Ливия сакс Юний из XIV легиона, покоряя южные земли Отарда для Гарлемальдской империи."

#. ja: ピキーン！
#. de: Die Hexe von Dalmasca<br>bringt Tod und Zerstörung!<br><i>Kriegsflüchtling</i>
#. fr: Clang, clang<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle the White Devil─Livia sas Junius's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor.
#. column 1: This masterpiece of imperial ingenuity is the selfsame suit of warmachina operated by XIVth Legion tribunus Livia sas Junius in the Garlean Empire's subjugation of Othard's southern reaches.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:68:0:2"
msgid "Ever the pessimist,<br>my dear Livia.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva"
msgstr "Ты вечно во всём сомневаешься,<br>милая Ливия.<br>   — Неро тол Скаева"

#. ja: ネロ専用魔導アーマーに騎乗する。<br>ネロ・トル・スカエウァ用にカスタマイズされた魔導アーマー
#. de: Rufe die Magitek-Kampfmaschine vom Typ „Roter Baron“ herbei, die eigens für Nero tol Scaeva entwickelt und gebaut worden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous l'armure magitek personnelle de Nero tol Scaeva.
#. column 1: Constantly modified and improved by Nero himself, this warmachina of Garlean construct barely resembles the suit issued to tol Scaeva on the day of his promotion to tribunus.
#. column 2: That mechanical monstrosity represented<br>a feat of engineering far beyond aught<br>Garlemald can presently achieve.<br>   - Cid
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:69:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle the Red Baron─Nero tol Scaeva's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor."
msgstr "Призвать Красного барона — боевую броню, созданную специально для Неро тол Скаева, а теперь и для <i>вас</i>."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍第XIV軍団幕僚長、ネロ・トル・スカエウァ用にカスタマイズされた魔導アーマー。優れた機工師でもあるネロ自身の手で、青燐機関の出力向上と足回りの強化が図られている。通称「レッドバロン」
#. de: Die Magitek-Kampfmaschine vom Typ „Roter Baron“ wurde speziell für Nero tol Scaeva, Tribunus der XIV. Legion des Garleischen Kaiserreichs, gebaut. Als versierter Maschinist hat Nero persönlich an der Optimierung des Erdseim-Antriebs mitgewirkt und im laufenden Betrieb ständig die Mechanik verbessert.
#. fr: Sans cesse modifiée et améliorée par Nero lui-même, cette machine de guerre garlemaldaise ressemble à peine à l'armure magitek reçue par tol Scaeva le jour de sa promotion au rang de commandant.
#. column 0: Call into battle the Red Baron─Nero tol Scaeva's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor.
#. column 2: That mechanical monstrosity represented<br>a feat of engineering far beyond aught<br>Garlemald can presently achieve.<br>   - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:69:0:1"
msgid "Constantly modified and improved by Nero himself, this warmachina of Garlean construct barely resembles the suit issued to tol Scaeva on the day of his promotion to tribunus."
msgstr "Неро постоянно переделывал и улучшал эту гарлеанскую боевую машину. Теперь она едва напоминает броню, которую ему выдали, когда он стал трибуном."

#. ja: シャー、シャー、シャー
#. de: Dieser mechanische Koloss<br>ist ein Wunderwerk der Technik!<br><i>Cid</i>
#. fr: Vuuuuiiiiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle the Red Baron─Nero tol Scaeva's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor.
#. column 1: Constantly modified and improved by Nero himself, this warmachina of Garlean construct barely resembles the suit issued to tol Scaeva on the day of his promotion to tribunus.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:69:0:2"
msgid "That mechanical monstrosity represented<br>a feat of engineering far beyond aught<br>Garlemald can presently achieve.<br>   - Cid"
msgstr "Этот механический монстр —<br>чудо инженерной мысли,<br>которое Гарлемальду пока<br>не под силу создать.<br>   — Сид"

#. ja: ワイバーンに騎乗する。<br>雲海を舞う忠義のワイバーン。魔物退治を己の使命とする
#. de: Rufe einen Wyvern herbei, der dir treu ergeben ist und mit dir zusammen Monster jagen möchte.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre terrifiante mais loyale wyverne.
#. column 1: Fifty score years ago, this wyvern made a pact with a knight to aid in vanquishing evil from the skies. Even now, long after the knight's passing, the wyvern has kept that promise, ever circling the heavens─ignoring the calls of his brethren to take up arms against mankind.
#. column 2: A wyvern... I'd only ever<br>heard stories about them.<br>   - Saintrelmaux
msgctxt "MountTransient:70:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wyvern, master of the skies and forever-loyal servant."
msgstr "Призывает вашего виверна — повелителя небес и вернейшего слугу."

#. ja: 雲海を舞う忠義のワイバーン。千年の昔、友である騎士と誓いを立て、数々の悪しき魔物を討ち倒してきた。竜詩戦争の勃発により、人との交流が途絶えたことを悲しみつつ、新たな魔物狩りの相棒を捜し求めていたようだ
#. de: Vor vielen Jahren schloss dieser Wyvern einen Pakt mit einem Ritter und diente ihm als treues Reittier bei der Jagd auf Monster. Der Ritter ist lange verstorben, doch der Wyvern hält seinen Schwur und widersteht dem Ruf seiner Artgenossen, im Drachenkrieg gegen Ishgard zu kämpfen.
#. fr: Cette wyverne reste fidèle à la promesse qu'elle a faite à un chevalier il y a plus d'un millénaire et continue à protéger les cieux des forces du mal, ignorant l'appel de ses congénères pour lutter contre les humains.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wyvern, master of the skies and forever-loyal servant.
#. column 2: A wyvern... I'd only ever<br>heard stories about them.<br>   - Saintrelmaux
msgctxt "MountTransient:70:0:1"
msgid "Fifty score years ago, this wyvern made a pact with a knight to aid in vanquishing evil from the skies. Even now, long after the knight's passing, the wyvern has kept that promise, ever circling the heavens─ignoring the calls of his brethren to take up arms against mankind."
msgstr "Пятьсот лет назад этот виверн заключил договор с рыцарем и помогал ему очищать небеса от зла. Рыцаря давно нет в живых, но виверн сдержал клятву и по-прежнему кружит в небесах, не внимая призывам сородичей поднять оружие против людей."

#. ja: 征くぞ、新たな友よ！
#. de: Trau keinem Wyvern!<br><i>Saintrelmaux</i>
#. fr: Vers les cieux, compagnon<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your wyvern, master of the skies and forever-loyal servant.
#. column 1: Fifty score years ago, this wyvern made a pact with a knight to aid in vanquishing evil from the skies. Even now, long after the knight's passing, the wyvern has kept that promise, ever circling the heavens─ignoring the calls of his brethren to take up arms against mankind.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:70:0:2"
msgid "A wyvern... I'd only ever<br>heard stories about them.<br>   - Saintrelmaux"
msgstr "Виверн... Я о них<br>только в сказках слышал.<br>   — Сантрельмо"

#. ja: SDSフェンリルに騎乗する。<br>幻獣フェンリルの名を持つ戦闘バイク
#. de: Rufe die SKD-Fenrir herbei, ein zweirädriges Kampfgefährt, das wirkt, als stamme es aus einer weit entfernten Welt.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous le véhicule à deux roues SLE Fenrir, un artefact venu d'un autre âge, peut-être même d'un autre monde.
#. column 1: Manufactured for use by the now-defunct Strife Delivery Service, this two-wheeled monstrosity's ceruleum engine howls like the silver wolf of legend as it propels its rider across desert and plain.
#. column 2: Misfortune is no excuse<br>for failing a delivery!<br>   - Hildeyerd
msgctxt "MountTransient:71:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle the SDS Fenrir, a lore-bending battlebike that looks as if it was driven straight from an age unknown."
msgstr "Призывает SDS «Фенрир» — боевой мотоцикл, словно явившийся прямиком из неведомой эпохи."

#. ja: 伝説の幻獣「フェンリル」の名を与えられた戦闘バイク。その名称にふさわしく大排気量を誇り、高速で地上を疾走することが可能だ。なお、SDSとは、ストライフ・デリバリーサービスの略称である
#. de: Der Name dieses gepanzerten Kampfgefährts kommt nicht von ungefähr. Schon im unteren Drehzahl-<br>bereich faucht der Motor wie ein waschechter Drache. Die Abkürzung SKD steht übrigens für „Strife Kurierdienst“.
#. fr: Ce véhicule tire son nom du légendaire loup argenté Fenrir. Son incroyable puissance en chocobos-vapeur lui permettent d'atteindre des vitesses im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nantes. Le sigle apposé viendrait d'un service de convoyage “Strife - Livraison Express”.
#. column 0: Call into battle the SDS Fenrir, a lore-bending battlebike that looks as if it was driven straight from an age unknown.
#. column 2: Misfortune is no excuse<br>for failing a delivery!<br>   - Hildeyerd
msgctxt "MountTransient:71:0:1"
msgid "Manufactured for use by the now-defunct Strife Delivery Service, this two-wheeled monstrosity's ceruleum engine howls like the silver wolf of legend as it propels its rider across desert and plain."
msgstr "Этот двухколёсный монстр был создан для ныне прекратившей работу службы доставки «Страйф». Его двигатель на церулеуме воет, как легендарный серебряный волк, пока мчится с всадником через пустыни и равнины."

#. ja: SDS！
#. de: Unglück ist keine Ausrede<br>für eine verpasste Lieferung!<br><i>Hildeyard</i>
#. fr: SLE！
#. column 0: Call into battle the SDS Fenrir, a lore-bending battlebike that looks as if it was driven straight from an age unknown.
#. column 1: Manufactured for use by the now-defunct Strife Delivery Service, this two-wheeled monstrosity's ceruleum engine howls like the silver wolf of legend as it propels its rider across desert and plain.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:71:0:2"
msgid "Misfortune is no excuse<br>for failing a delivery!<br>   - Hildeyerd"
msgstr "Несчастье — не оправдание,<br>если сорвана доставка!<br>   — Хильдейерд"

#. ja: コンガマトーに騎乗する。<br>アキンドが育てたコンガマトー。素顔は謎に包まれている
#. de: Rufe einen Kongamato herbei, der von einem Vath-Krämer großgezogen wurde. Ein Muschelpuster ist aus Sicherheitsgründen nicht montiert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre kongamato, élevé avec amour par Moucham.
#. column 1: After hatching from an egg laid near the riverbanks, the kongamato larva spends its early life as a water-dwelling insect. Its maturity is signified by metamorphosis, during which its wings sprout forth and it takes to the skies.
#. column 2: Kongamato can be fickle─yes,<br>very fickle─but they always<br>return home to us.<br>    - Vath Kintamer
msgctxt "MountTransient:72:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your kongamato, raised with care by the Vath stickpeddler."
msgstr "Призывает вашего конгамато, заботливо выращенного ваатским торговцем посохами."

#. ja: ヴァスの塚のアキンドが、幼虫から育てあげたコンガマトー。水辺に産卵されたタマゴから孵化した幼虫は、しばらく水棲昆虫として過ごす。その後、成虫になると、見事に形状が変わり羽根が生えて飛行可能になるのだ
#. de: Kongamato-Weibchen legen ihre Eier an Flusssäumen ab, und die geschlüpften Larven verbringen ihren ersten Lebensabschnitt überwiegend im Wasser. Erst mit einsetzender Geschlechtsreife öffnen sie ihre Flügel und erheben sich in die Lüfte.
#. fr: Après son éclosion sur les bords d'une rivière, le kongamato passe le début de sa vie sur les eaux. Sa maturité est marquée par le début de sa transformation, durant laquelle ses ailes poussent et il apprend à s'élever dans les airs.
#. column 0: Summon forth your kongamato, raised with care by the Vath stickpeddler.
#. column 2: Kongamato can be fickle─yes,<br>very fickle─but they always<br>return home to us.<br>    - Vath Kintamer
msgctxt "MountTransient:72:0:1"
msgid "After hatching from an egg laid near the riverbanks, the kongamato larva spends its early life as a water-dwelling insect. Its maturity is signified by metamorphosis, during which its wings sprout forth and it takes to the skies."
msgstr "Вылупившись из яйца у речного берега, личинка конгамато проводит первую часть жизни в воде. Когда она созревает, то превращается и отращивает крылья, чтобы взмыть в небо."

#. ja: ブーン
#. de: Du willst den Kongamato besteigen?<br>Sei ohne Furcht. Das zornige Schnauben<br>bedeutet nicht, dass er dich nicht mag.<br><i>Flohflüsterer</i>
#. fr: Vzuuun<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your kongamato, raised with care by the Vath stickpeddler.
#. column 1: After hatching from an egg laid near the riverbanks, the kongamato larva spends its early life as a water-dwelling insect. Its maturity is signified by metamorphosis, during which its wings sprout forth and it takes to the skies.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:72:0:2"
msgid "Kongamato can be fickle─yes,<br>very fickle─but they always<br>return home to us.<br>    - Vath Kintamer"
msgstr "Конгамато бывают капризными — да,<br>очень капризными, — но всегда<br>возвращаются домой.<br>    — ваатский укротитель"

#. ja: ズーに騎乗する。<br>近東から飛来する怪鳥ズー。大空を悠然と羽ばたく
#. de: Rufe einen Montisaurus herbei. Seine schweren Schwingen haben ihn aus dem Nahen Osten hierher getragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre féroce zu. Ses lourdes ailes l'ont transporté ici depuis le Proche-Orient.
#. column 1: This massive bird hunts by grasping its prey within its saw-like beak, and finishes it off with a few violent shakes of its long neck before swallowing the now-dead quarry whole.
#. column 2: Could you imagine how noisy<br>it'd be with even more<br>anzu flying around, kupo?<br>    - Mogoon
msgctxt "MountTransient:73:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your zu. Its weighty wings have carried it from the Near East."
msgstr "Призывает зу. Его могучие крылья принесли его сюда с Ближнего Востока."

#. ja: 近東原産の怪鳥ズーの成鳥。嘴がノコギリ状になっており、牙が生えているようにも見えるが、これは暴れる獣をガッチリと捕らえるためにある。獲物をくわえると、長い首をしならせて振り回し、絶命させてから丸呑みするのだ
#. de: Dieser gewaltige Vogel fängt seine Beute mit einem sägeartigen Schnabel und tötet sie mit schnellen, ruckhaften Bewegungen seines Halses, bevor er sie in einem Stück verschlingt.
#. fr: Cet oiseau massif chasse en saisissant sa proie dans son bec semblable à une scie. Il l'achève ensuite en secouant violemment son long cou, avant de l'avaler goulûment.
#. column 0: Summon forth your zu. Its weighty wings have carried it from the Near East.
#. column 2: Could you imagine how noisy<br>it'd be with even more<br>anzu flying around, kupo?<br>    - Mogoon
msgctxt "MountTransient:73:0:1"
msgid "This massive bird hunts by grasping its prey within its saw-like beak, and finishes it off with a few violent shakes of its long neck before swallowing the now-dead quarry whole."
msgstr "Эта огромная птица хватает добычу зазубренным, словно пила, клювом. Потом несколько раз резко встряхивает длинной шеей и проглатывает мёртвую жертву целиком."

#. ja: ギャオォォォ！
#. de: Die Montisaurier werden immer trauriger.<br><i>Sigan</i>
#. fr: Graoooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your zu. Its weighty wings have carried it from the Near East.
#. column 1: This massive bird hunts by grasping its prey within its saw-like beak, and finishes it off with a few violent shakes of its long neck before swallowing the now-dead quarry whole.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:73:0:2"
msgid "Could you imagine how noisy<br>it'd be with even more<br>anzu flying around, kupo?<br>    - Mogoon"
msgstr "Представляешь, какой шум<br>поднялся бы, будь здесь ещё<br>анзу, купо?<br>    — Мугун"

#. ja: ベンヌに騎乗する。<br>魔力を帯びた角笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣
#. de: Rufe einen legendären Bennu herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre terrible bénou. Rares sont ceux qui ont eu la chance d'admirer cette créature de près.
#. column 1: This bird was reborn after drinking deep of the aether that flowed forth from the immortal Phoenix, who appeared in the skies of Carteneau during the Calamity. Named after a legendary bird, bennu means “a shining object, rising in brilliance.”
#. column 2: 'Twixt this world and the next<br>do the aetherial currents swirl,<br>bearing the very essence of life.<br>    - Urianger
msgctxt "MountTransient:74:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the mythical bennu. Very few have had the privilege of viewing this bird up close."
msgstr "Призывает легендарного бенну. Немногим довелось увидеть эту птицу вблизи."

#. ja: 第七霊災時にカルテノーの空に現れた、不死鳥「フェニックス」のエーテルを浴び、転生を遂げた怪鳥。その姿が、幻の霊鳥を思わせたことから、「鮮やかに舞い、光輝くもの」を意味する「ベンヌ」と呼ばれるようになった
#. de: Dieser Vogel trank vom Äther, der dem unsterblichen Phönix entstieg, als er während der sechsten Katastrophe über Carteneau gesichtet wurde. Von vielen wird er als heilig verehrt, und sein Name bedeutet „glänzendes Flügelwesen in blendendem Glanz“.
#. fr: Cet oiseau est devenu plus puissant que jamais après avoir baigné dans l'éther qui ruisselait du corps de l'immortel Phénix, lors de la bataille de Carteneau. Son nom lui vient d'un ancien oiseau légendaire. Il signifie “celui qui s'élève et brille de mille feux”.
#. column 0: Summon forth the mythical bennu. Very few have had the privilege of viewing this bird up close.
#. column 2: 'Twixt this world and the next<br>do the aetherial currents swirl,<br>bearing the very essence of life.<br>    - Urianger
msgctxt "MountTransient:74:0:1"
msgid "This bird was reborn after drinking deep of the aether that flowed forth from the immortal Phoenix, who appeared in the skies of Carteneau during the Calamity. Named after a legendary bird, bennu means “a shining object, rising in brilliance.”"
msgstr "Эта птица возродилась, испив эфира, излившегося из бессмертного Феникса, появившегося в небе над Картено во время Бедствия. В честь легендарной птицы её назвали бенну — «сияющее создание, восходящее во всём блеске»."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich wurde zur Verkörperung des Phönix,<br>des uralten Symbols der Auferstehung.<br><i>Louisoix Leveilleur</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth the mythical bennu. Very few have had the privilege of viewing this bird up close.
#. column 1: This bird was reborn after drinking deep of the aether that flowed forth from the immortal Phoenix, who appeared in the skies of Carteneau during the Calamity. Named after a legendary bird, bennu means “a shining object, rising in brilliance.”
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:74:0:2"
msgid "'Twixt this world and the next<br>do the aetherial currents swirl,<br>bearing the very essence of life.<br>    - Urianger"
msgstr "Между этим миром и тем,<br>кружат потоки эфира,<br>несущие самую суть жизни.<br>    — Урианже"

#. ja: ホワイトラナーに騎乗する。<br>雲神に祝福された大隼。雲のように悠々と空を舞う
#. de: Rufe den Weißlanner herbei. Er steht unter dem Schutz von Bismarck selbst und herrscht über die Lüfte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre faucon des brumes, béni par le Primordial Bismarck.
#. column 1: These birds are clad in roiling clouds, and noble Vanu Vanu warriors would sit astride them as part of Bismarck's retinue. The grace with which they glide through the skies evokes the image of a flower petal being carried by gentle western winds.
#. column 2: From what we have observed,<br>Bismarck is a creature of pure<br>instinct, driven primarily by hunger.<br>    - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:75:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the white lanner. Favored of the primal Bismarck, he soars the skies unchallenged."
msgstr "Призывает белого ланнера. Любимец праймала Бисмарка, он безраздельно властвует в небесах."

#. ja: 雲神「ビスマルク」による祝福を受け、沸き立つ雲をまとった大隼。どうやら衛士たるバヌバヌ族の戦士を、サヌワと共に雲神の側に送るための存在だったようだ。雲のように悠然と空を舞う姿は、吹き抜ける東風のように美しい
#. de: Dieser Vogel steht unter Bismarcks persönlichem Schutz und ist in wirbelnde Wolken gehüllt. Mutige Krieger der Vanu Vanu, die auf eine Audienz beim Herrscher der Wolken hoffen, sitzen auf sie auf und lassen sich einem ungewissen Schicksal entgegen-<br>tragen.
#. fr: Chevauchés par les fiers guerriers vanu vanu, ces oiseaux virevoltent au milieu des épais nuages de L'Écume des cieux, dans la suite de Bismarck. La grâce avec laquelle ils planent dans les airs évoque un pétale de fleur porté par les délicats vents du ponant.
#. column 0: Summon forth the white lanner. Favored of the primal Bismarck, he soars the skies unchallenged.
#. column 2: From what we have observed,<br>Bismarck is a creature of pure<br>instinct, driven primarily by hunger.<br>    - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:75:0:1"
msgid "These birds are clad in roiling clouds, and noble Vanu Vanu warriors would sit astride them as part of Bismarck's retinue. The grace with which they glide through the skies evokes the image of a flower petal being carried by gentle western winds."
msgstr "Этих птиц окутывают клубящиеся облака. Благородные воины вану-вану ездили на них, сопровождая Бисмарка. Их плавный полёт напоминает лепесток, который ласково несёт западный ветер."

#. ja: …………
#. de: In der Legende ist Bismarck also ein guter Gott,<br>der das Wolkenmeer frei von Krieg und Streit<br>geschaffen hat?<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth the white lanner. Favored of the primal Bismarck, he soars the skies unchallenged.
#. column 1: These birds are clad in roiling clouds, and noble Vanu Vanu warriors would sit astride them as part of Bismarck's retinue. The grace with which they glide through the skies evokes the image of a flower petal being carried by gentle western winds.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:75:0:2"
msgid "From what we have observed,<br>Bismarck is a creature of pure<br>instinct, driven primarily by hunger.<br>    - Cid"
msgstr "Судя по нашим наблюдениям,<br>Бисмарк живёт одним лишь<br>инстинктом и главным образом<br>думает о еде.<br>    — Сид"

#. ja: ラースラナーに騎乗する。<br>武神に祝福された大隼。月剣の如く、鋭く風を切る
#. de: Rufe den Rotlanner herbei. Er steht unter dem Schutz von Ravana selbst und durchschneidet die Luft wie die Chandraha-Klingen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre faucon des lames, béni par le Primordial Ravana.
#. column 1: The ferocity of these birds is enough to give pause to the bravest warrior, and their keen talons cut through flesh as cleanly the Chandrahas themselves. Any who endeavor to mount the rose lanner must possess the savagery that defines the Wrath of the Colony.
#. column 2: Master of the Sacred Blades!<br>Wrath of the Colony! Conqueror<br>of the World! Hear our prayer!<br>    - Gnath Priest
msgctxt "MountTransient:76:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the rose lanner. Favored of the primal Ravana, his wings pierce the night sky like a blade of moonlight."
msgstr "Призывает розового ланнера. Любимец праймала Раваны, он рассекает ночное небо крыльями, словно лезвиями лунного света."

#. ja: 武神「ラーヴァナ」による祝福を受け、震えるほどの闘気をまとった大隼。鋭く風を切り裂いて、猛然と天を舞う姿は、月剣「チャンドラハース」の鋭い刃を連想させる。乗りこなすには、武神と並ぶほどの覇気が必要だろう
#. de: Diese Vögel stehen unter Ravanas persönlichem Schutz und ihre bloße Anwesenheit kann auch hartgesottenen Kriegern das Blut in den Adern gefrieren lassen. Ihre Schwingen durchschneiden die Luft wie die mächtigen Chandraha-Klingen des Herrn des Krieges.
#. fr: Ces faucons sont assez féroces pour inspirer la peur aux plus braves guerriers, et leurs serres tranchent la chair aussi facilement que les Chandrahas elles-mêmes. Quiconque voudrait monter un de ces oiseaux se doit d'avoir en lui la sauvagerie qui définit le Maître des lames.
#. column 0: Summon forth the rose lanner. Favored of the primal Ravana, his wings pierce the night sky like a blade of moonlight.
#. column 2: Master of the Sacred Blades!<br>Wrath of the Colony! Conqueror<br>of the World! Hear our prayer!<br>    - Gnath Priest
msgctxt "MountTransient:76:0:1"
msgid "The ferocity of these birds is enough to give pause to the bravest warrior, and their keen talons cut through flesh as cleanly the Chandrahas themselves. Any who endeavor to mount the rose lanner must possess the savagery that defines the Wrath of the Colony."
msgstr "Этих птиц боятся даже отважнейшие воины, а их острые когти режут плоть не хуже самих Чандрахасов. Оседлать розового ланнера под силу лишь тому, в ком есть свирепость, достойная Гнева колонии."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Oh, großer Eroberer! Die Kolonie benötigt<br>deinen göttlichen Beistand!<br><i>Gnath-Priester</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth the rose lanner. Favored of the primal Ravana, his wings pierce the night sky like a blade of moonlight.
#. column 1: The ferocity of these birds is enough to give pause to the bravest warrior, and their keen talons cut through flesh as cleanly the Chandrahas themselves. Any who endeavor to mount the rose lanner must possess the savagery that defines the Wrath of the Colony.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:76:0:2"
msgid "Master of the Sacred Blades!<br>Wrath of the Colony! Conqueror<br>of the World! Hear our prayer!<br>    - Gnath Priest"
msgstr "Владыка священных клинков!<br>Гнев колонии! Завоеватель<br>мира! Услышь нашу молитву!<br>    — жрец гнатов"

#. ja: ラナー・オブ・ラウンドに騎乗する。<br>騎神に祝福された大隼。聖騎士たちに従い、獲物を狩る
#. de: Rufe den Rundlanner herbei. Er steht unter dem Schutz von König Thordan selbst und dient ergeben seinen Rittern.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre faucon de la Table ronde, béni par le roi Thordan.
#. column 1: These birds are possessed of dignity equal to the noble personages whom they serve. Ancient Ishgardian knights often indulged themselves in falconry, and lanners were revered for their abilities, their lyncean eyes being well suited for sighting prey on the ground.
#. column 2: For the glory of King Thordan...<br>    - Zephirin
msgctxt "MountTransient:77:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the round lanner. Favored of the primal King Thordan, he serves his master's knights dutifully."
msgstr "Призывает круглого ланнера. Любимец праймала короля Тордана, он верно служит рыцарям своего господина."

#. ja: 騎神「トールダン」による祝福を受け、聖騎士を思わせる風格をまとった大隼。イシュガルドでは、古来より騎士は鷹狩りをたしなむものとされるが、その伝統に則ったのだろうか。地表の獲物を探す眼光は鋭い
#. de: Diese Vögel, die unter dem Schutz von König Thordan stehen, sind würdevolle Geschöpfe. Ishgards Ritter, die sich in Falkenhorst und anderswo der Falknerei widmeten, machten sich vor langer Zeit auch diese scharfsichtigen Flugtiere zu nutze.
#. fr: L'allure de ces faucons leur confère une dignité au moins égale à celle du noble roi qu'ils servent. Les anciens chevaliers ishgardais pratiquaient souvent la fauconnerie, et ces oiseaux ont depuis toujours été prisés pour leur ex<shy>traor<shy>di<shy>nai<shy>re habileté à la chasse.
#. column 0: Summon forth the round lanner. Favored of the primal King Thordan, he serves his master's knights dutifully.
#. column 2: For the glory of King Thordan...<br>    - Zephirin
msgctxt "MountTransient:77:0:1"
msgid "These birds are possessed of dignity equal to the noble personages whom they serve. Ancient Ishgardian knights often indulged themselves in falconry, and lanners were revered for their abilities, their lyncean eyes being well suited for sighting prey on the ground."
msgstr "Эти птицы исполнены достоинства, под стать знатным хозяевам, которым служат. В старину ишгардские рыцари увлекались соколиной охотой и высоко ценили ланнеров: их зоркие, словно у рыси, глаза помогали высматривать добычу на земле."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Für König Thordan!<br><i>Zephirin</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth the round lanner. Favored of the primal King Thordan, he serves his master's knights dutifully.
#. column 1: These birds are possessed of dignity equal to the noble personages whom they serve. Ancient Ishgardian knights often indulged themselves in falconry, and lanners were revered for their abilities, their lyncean eyes being well suited for sighting prey on the ground.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:77:0:2"
msgid "For the glory of King Thordan...<br>    - Zephirin"
msgstr "Во славу короля Тордана...<br>    — Зефирин"

#. ja: ウォーリングラナーに騎乗する。<br>魔神に祝福された大隼。世界樹の種を運ぶという
#. de: Rufe den Kriegslanner herbei. Er steht unter dem Schutz von Sephirot selbst und trägt den Samen der Eiche in sich, die als Sternenbild am Firmament prangt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre faucon séphirotique, béni par la divinité Sephirot.
#. column 1: These birds are enveloped in an aura radiating a majesty that belies the savage nature of their master. According to the ancient legends of a treelike people native to Meracydia, the lanners bore the seeds of the World Tree across the seas, planting the verdant forests that dot the realm today.
#. column 2: The trunk of the World Tree, or<br>the Bole, offers protection to the<br>weak, defending them from harm.<br>    - Mace
msgctxt "MountTransient:78:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the warring lanner. Favored of the primal Sephirot, it carries the seeds of the World Tree."
msgstr "Призывает боевого ланнера. Любимец праймала Сефирота, он несёт семена Мирового древа."

#. ja: 魔神「セフィロト」による祝福を受け、堂々たる威風をまとった大隼。南方大陸メラシディアの樹状種族の神話によれば、原初の樹たる「世界樹」の種を霊鳥が各地に運んだことで、この世に木々が茂ることになったのだという
#. de: Diese Vögel stehen unter Sephirots Schutz und sind in eine majestätische Aura gehüllt. Uralte Legenden besagen, dass die Baumwesen, die einst Meracydia bevölkerten, die Saat der Himmelseiche über die Meere trugen und die prächtigen Wälder Eorzeas pflanzten.
#. fr: Ces faucons sont enveloppés d'une aura verdoyante qui révèle la nature sauvage de leur maître. D'après les légendes d'une ancienne tribu d'êtres végétaux de Méracydia, ce sont eux qui ont transporté les graines qui ont fait naître les forêts sur les continents.
#. column 0: Summon forth the warring lanner. Favored of the primal Sephirot, it carries the seeds of the World Tree.
#. column 2: The trunk of the World Tree, or<br>the Bole, offers protection to the<br>weak, defending them from harm.<br>    - Mace
msgctxt "MountTransient:78:0:1"
msgid "These birds are enveloped in an aura radiating a majesty that belies the savage nature of their master. According to the ancient legends of a treelike people native to Meracydia, the lanners bore the seeds of the World Tree across the seas, planting the verdant forests that dot the realm today."
msgstr "Этих птиц окружает величественная аура, которая скрывает свирепую натуру их господина. Согласно древним преданиям древесного народа, жившего в Мерасидии, ланнеры разнесли семена Мирового древа по морям и подарили миру густые леса."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Nophica, die Göttin der Erde, pflanzte die Eiche;<br>Althyk, der Gott der Zeit, ließ sie gedeihen;<br>nun glüht sie in alle Zeiten überdauernder Kraft<br>hoch am Nachthimmel.<br><i>Mace</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth the warring lanner. Favored of the primal Sephirot, it carries the seeds of the World Tree.
#. column 1: These birds are enveloped in an aura radiating a majesty that belies the savage nature of their master. According to the ancient legends of a treelike people native to Meracydia, the lanners bore the seeds of the World Tree across the seas, planting the verdant forests that dot the realm today.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:78:0:2"
msgid "The trunk of the World Tree, or<br>the Bole, offers protection to the<br>weak, defending them from harm.<br>    - Mace"
msgstr "Ствол Мирового древа<br>защищает слабых,<br>оберегая их от бед.<br>    — Мейс"

#. ja: グローリア号に騎乗する。<br>単座の小型飛空艇。その名は、とある小説に由来する
#. de: Rufe ein schnittiges Luftschiff der Gloria-Klasse herbei. Dieser Einsitzer macht bei Männern und Frauen gleichermaßen Eindruck.
#. fr: Vous appelez le Gloria, aéronef monoplace véritable bijou de technologie.
#. column 1: Taking inspiration from the half-remembered dream of his grandfather Tatanora, Tataramu used his encyclopedic knowledge to design a small-scale version of a rotary-winged airship. Its name derives from an airship that appears in an obscure novel of unknown origins.
#. column 2: No, it must be one made to<br>extremely exacting specifications.<br>    - Tataramu
msgctxt "MountTransient:80:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Gloria-class airship. This single-occupancy airship is a singular feat of engineering."
msgstr "Призывает дирижабль «Глория». Это одноместное судно — настоящее чудо инженерной мысли."

#. ja: 新進気鋭の技師、タタラムによって設計された小型単座式飛空艇。彼の祖父、タタノラが夢見た回転翼型飛空艇を、最新の技術により小型化したもの。なお、名称はとある小説に登場する「自由の空を駆ける船」に由来する
#. de: Tataramu ließ sich in einem Traum von seinem Großvater Tatanora zum Bau dieser verkleinerten Ausführung eines Luftschiffs inspirieren. Seinen Namen hat es von einer Gestalt aus einer der weniger bekannten Legenden des Landes.
#. fr: S'inspirant du récit hésitant d'un rêve de son grand-père Tatanora, Tataramu a mis en pratique son savoir encyclopédique pour concevoir un petit modèle d'aéronef à rotors multiples. Son nom lui vient d'un obscur roman oublié.
#. column 0: Summon forth the Gloria-class airship. This single-occupancy airship is a singular feat of engineering.
#. column 2: No, it must be one made to<br>extremely exacting specifications.<br>    - Tataramu
msgctxt "MountTransient:80:0:1"
msgid "Taking inspiration from the half-remembered dream of his grandfather Tatanora, Tataramu used his encyclopedic knowledge to design a small-scale version of a rotary-winged airship. Its name derives from an airship that appears in an obscure novel of unknown origins."
msgstr "Вдохновившись смутно запомнившимся сном деда Татаноры, Татараму применил свои энциклопедические познания и создал уменьшенную модель дирижабля с поворотными крыльями. Название он позаимствовал у воздушного корабля из малоизвестного романа неведомого происхождения."

#. ja: ブロブロブロロ！
#. de: Nanu? Ein Luftschiff ...?<br><i>Tataramu</i>
#. fr: BRRZZZ...
#. column 0: Summon forth the Gloria-class airship. This single-occupancy airship is a singular feat of engineering.
#. column 1: Taking inspiration from the half-remembered dream of his grandfather Tatanora, Tataramu used his encyclopedic knowledge to design a small-scale version of a rotary-winged airship. Its name derives from an airship that appears in an obscure novel of unknown origins.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:80:0:2"
msgid "No, it must be one made to<br>extremely exacting specifications.<br>    - Tataramu"
msgstr "Нет, он должен быть сделан<br>с необычайной точностью.<br>    — Татараму"

#. ja: 筋斗雲に騎乗する。<br>東方の仙人が編み出した秘術。魔法の雲を創り出す
#. de: Rufe den fliegenden Kumulus herbei. Es ist nicht genau überliefert, ob der Erschaffer ein Junge mit einem Affenschwanz war oder ein Affe mit einem Jungengesicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre nuage magique. Son précédent pro<shy>prié<shy>taire était-il un petit garçon avec une queue, ou tout simplement un singe<nbsp>?
#. column 1: There is but one man in all of Hydaelyn who can create such a mystical masterpiece, and it is said he resides upon a misty peak hidden within the mountain ranges of Doma. Crafted by stitching together dozens of smaller clouds, the cumulus allows a single rider to explore the skies...but only if she has an inherent affinity for magicks.
#. column 2: Mental note: pick no<br>quarrel with Domans.<br>    - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:81:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the flying cumulus. It is unclear whether its previous owner was a boy with a tail or simply a monkey."
msgstr "Призывает летающее облако. Неизвестно, кто был его прежним хозяином: мальчик с хвостом или просто обезьяна."

#. ja: 東州オサード大陸辺境の山深くに棲まうという、偉大なる仙人が編み出した秘術。魔力によって雲を束ね、これに飛び乗って空を舞うことができるという。生まれながらに優れた魔法の才がある者にしか、扱うことができない
#. de: Ein mächtiger Zaubergelehrter, der zurückgezogen in den Bergen von Doma lebte, erschuf diese magische Wolke, indem er viele kleine Wolken miteinander verknüpfte.
#. fr: Il n'est qu'un seul homme qui soit capable de créer un tel prodige, et on dit qu'il réside au sommet d'un pic couvert de brume dans la région extrême-orientale de Doma. Seuls ceux qui ont le cœur pur parviendront à monter sur ce nuage...
#. column 0: Summon forth the flying cumulus. It is unclear whether its previous owner was a boy with a tail or simply a monkey.
#. column 2: Mental note: pick no<br>quarrel with Domans.<br>    - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:81:0:1"
msgid "There is but one man in all of Hydaelyn who can create such a mystical masterpiece, and it is said he resides upon a misty peak hidden within the mountain ranges of Doma. Crafted by stitching together dozens of smaller clouds, the cumulus allows a single rider to explore the skies...but only if she has an inherent affinity for magicks."
msgstr "Во всём Хайделине лишь один человек способен создать такое чудо. Говорят, он живёт на туманной вершине, затерянной среди гор Домы. Сшитое из десятков маленьких облаков, это облачко позволяет одному всаднику парить в небесах... но только если от рождения он наделён даром к магии."

#. ja: オッス！
#. de: Freust du dich nicht auch auf den<br>Valentiontag? Er hüllt die gaaanze Welt<br>in eine rosarote Wolke des Glücks und<br>der Liiiebe!<br><i>Lisette von Valention</i>
#. fr: Fuuuiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the flying cumulus. It is unclear whether its previous owner was a boy with a tail or simply a monkey.
#. column 1: There is but one man in all of Hydaelyn who can create such a mystical masterpiece, and it is said he resides upon a misty peak hidden within the mountain ranges of Doma. Crafted by stitching together dozens of smaller clouds, the cumulus allows a single rider to explore the skies...but only if she has an inherent affinity for magicks.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:81:0:2"
msgid "Mental note: pick no<br>quarrel with Domans.<br>    - Thancred"
msgstr "На заметку: с доманами<br>лучше не ссориться.<br>    — Танкрет"

#. ja: 初代でぶチョコボに騎乗する。<br>食い意地の張ったチョコボの大親分。初代は白かった
#. de: Rufe einen Original-Chocomoppel herbei. Nur echt mit 52 Zähnen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture gros chocobo original. Les autres ne seraient-ils que de pâles copies<nbsp>?
#. column 1: Maybe not larger, but definitely more in charge, this most gluttonous of gluttons inspired the others to great weights. Although most modern chocobos have yellow plumage, historic tomes portray birds covered in feathers whiter than the whitest snowfall─ All the better to see the stains of its many meals.
#. column 2: Heave...heave...huff...huff... <br>   - Original Fat Chocobo
msgctxt "MountTransient:82:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the original fat chocobo. Of course, being the original, it can eat much more than its peers."
msgstr "Призывает самого первого толстого чокобо. Будучи первопроходцем, он, конечно, может съесть куда больше сородичей."

#. ja: でぶチョコボ登場！　食い意地の張ったチョコボの大親分。最近は黄色い羽毛の個体が多いが、大先輩である初代でぶチョコボは白かった。与える物は拒まない性格で、限界まで武器だろうが何だろうが食べてくれる
#. de: Der Original-Chocomoppel stellt in Sachen Gefräßigkeit sogar noch seinen Namensvetter in den Schatten. Sein weißes Federkleid gibt ihn als Chocobo der ersten Stunde zu erkennen, doch trägt es häufig Spuren der letzten Mahlzeiten.
#. fr: C'est le chocobo pionnier, celui-là même qui a inspiré des générations entières de volatiles en surpoids. Même si la plupart des chocobos modernes ont un plumage jaune, celui-ci est d'une blancheur immaculée, du moins quand il ne s'est pas taché en avalant goulûment son repas.
#. column 0: Summon forth the original fat chocobo. Of course, being the original, it can eat much more than its peers.
#. column 2: Heave...heave...huff...huff... <br>   - Original Fat Chocobo
msgctxt "MountTransient:82:0:1"
msgid "Maybe not larger, but definitely more in charge, this most gluttonous of gluttons inspired the others to great weights. Although most modern chocobos have yellow plumage, historic tomes portray birds covered in feathers whiter than the whitest snowfall─ All the better to see the stains of its many meals."
msgstr "Он, может, и не крупнее остальных, зато точно тут главный. Этот прожорливейший из чокобо вдохновил сородичей на новые гастрономические рекорды. Сегодня большинство чокобо жёлтые, но старинные книги изображают первых толстых чокобо белее белого снега. Зато на их перьях лучше видны следы от бесчисленных трапез."

#. ja: なにをくれるんだーい？
#. de: Wie?! Das ist nicht das Original? Aber er<br>sieht absolut identisch aus.<br><i>Severian</i>
#. fr: Kwouf... Kwouuuf...
#. column 0: Summon forth the original fat chocobo. Of course, being the original, it can eat much more than its peers.
#. column 1: Maybe not larger, but definitely more in charge, this most gluttonous of gluttons inspired the others to great weights. Although most modern chocobos have yellow plumage, historic tomes portray birds covered in feathers whiter than the whitest snowfall─ All the better to see the stains of its many meals.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:82:0:2"
msgid "Heave...heave...huff...huff... <br>   - Original Fat Chocobo"
msgstr "Пых... пых... фух... фух... <br>   — Первый толстый чокобо"

#. ja: アストロペに騎乗する。<br>世にも珍しい大型のペガサス。2人乗りが可能
#. de: Rufe Astrope herbei, einen seltenen Pegasus, der so groß und stark ist, dass zwei Personen auf ihm reiten können.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Astérope. Ce cheval ailé géant peut être chevauché à deux.
#. column 1: The emergent studies of winged horses had to be rewritten with a single sighting of Astrope, confirming that adult pegasi are not only enormous in size, but also possessed of a horn. Wary of most, Astrope only allows those of gentle heart to climb upon its back─a back large enough to seat two!
#. column 2: Spread our wings and<br>soar, we shall!<br>   - Sezul Totoloc
msgctxt "MountTransient:83:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Astrope. A fully grown pegasus large enough to bear you and a companion across gentle skies."
msgstr "Призывает Астропу. Взрослый пегас, достаточно крупный, чтобы унести вас и спутника под небеса."

#. ja: 長き時を経ることで、2人乗りが可能なほどに成長を遂げた、大型のペガサス。本来であれば、非常に獰猛な獣であるため、近づくことさえ難しい。しかし、献身的な心優しき者に対しては、心を開くことがあるらしい
#. de: Astrope ist ein altehrwürdiger und besonders großer Pegasus, auf dem bequem zwei Reiter Platz finden. Lass dich von seiner Anmut nicht täuschen! Er ist ein gefährliches Wildtier, dem man sich nicht leichtfertig näher sollte. Man sagt, nur wer ein reines Herz hat, dem öffnet Astrope das seine.
#. fr: Ce spécimen de cheval ailé s'est développé au fil des temps au point de pouvoir supporter deux cavaliers. Malgré son caractère farouche, il accepte de prendre sur son dos ceux en qui il ressent une gentillesse désintéressée.
#. column 0: Summon forth Astrope. A fully grown pegasus large enough to bear you and a companion across gentle skies.
#. column 2: Spread our wings and<br>soar, we shall!<br>   - Sezul Totoloc
msgctxt "MountTransient:83:0:1"
msgid "The emergent studies of winged horses had to be rewritten with a single sighting of Astrope, confirming that adult pegasi are not only enormous in size, but also possessed of a horn. Wary of most, Astrope only allows those of gentle heart to climb upon its back─a back large enough to seat two!"
msgstr "Исследования крылатых коней пришлось переписать после единственной встречи с Астропой: выяснилось, что взрослые пегасы не только огромны, но и единороги. Астропа сторонится большинства и позволяет взобраться на спину, просторную для двоих, лишь тем, чьё сердце исполнено доброты."

#. ja: ヒヒィーン！！
#. de: Papa, ich will auch so einen Pegasus<br>für mich und meine Freundin!<br><i>Mädchen aus Ishgard</i>
#. fr: Hihiiiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Astrope. A fully grown pegasus large enough to bear you and a companion across gentle skies.
#. column 1: The emergent studies of winged horses had to be rewritten with a single sighting of Astrope, confirming that adult pegasi are not only enormous in size, but also possessed of a horn. Wary of most, Astrope only allows those of gentle heart to climb upon its back─a back large enough to seat two!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:83:0:2"
msgid "Spread our wings and<br>soar, we shall!<br>   - Sezul Totoloc"
msgstr "Расправим крылья<br>и взмоем ввысь!<br>   — Сезул Тотолок"

#. ja: でぶモーグリに騎乗する。<br>食い意地の張ったモーグリの大親分、飛べるのは魔法のおかげ。2人乗りが可能
#. de: Rufe einen Moppel-Mogry herbei, der so kupomäßig groß ist, dass sogar zwei Personen auf ihm reiten können. In der Luft hält sich der dicke Mops nur mithilfe von Magie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture gros Mog. Si gros, qu'on peut le chevaucher à deux. Et non, ce ne sont pas ses petites ailes qui permettent à ce gourmand de voler... c'est la magie.
#. column 1: This plus-sized patrician epitomizes the ancient moogle proverb regarding kupo nuts that says, “Once you kupop, you cannot stop.” Basic laws of physics suggest that wings as small as the fat moogle's should not provide enough lift for true flight...yet here we are.
#. column 2: Yet what was thin must<br>eventually grow fat again.<br>   - Aurelle
msgctxt "MountTransient:84:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the fat moogle. How can he fly? Because magic. How can he fly bearing two riders? MAGIC."
msgstr "Призывает толстого мугла. Как он летает? Благодаря магии. А как он летает с двумя всадниками? МАГИЯ."

#. ja: でぶモーグリ登場！　食い意地の張ったモーグリの大親分。森の恵みを喰らい尽くして、まれに見る巨体を手に入れた。それでも、空を舞うことができるのは、翼ではなく魔法の力で浮行しているためとのこと
#. de: Der Moppel-Mogry hat sich immer fleißig den Bauch vollgeschlagen, sodass er groß und stark geworden ist, und sehr, sehr dick! Erstaunlich, dass er überhaupt noch fliegen kann, geschweige denn mit zwei Reitern auf seinem Rücken. Da muss Magie im Spiel sein!
#. fr: Ce Mog a un appétit insatiable digne... d'un gros chocobo. Théoriquement, il devrait être incapable de se déplacer dans les airs avec de si petites ailes, mais la magie mog semble capable de défier les lois de la gravité.
#. column 0: Summon forth the fat moogle. How can he fly? Because magic. How can he fly bearing two riders? MAGIC.
#. column 2: Yet what was thin must<br>eventually grow fat again.<br>   - Aurelle
msgctxt "MountTransient:84:0:1"
msgid "This plus-sized patrician epitomizes the ancient moogle proverb regarding kupo nuts that says, “Once you kupop, you cannot stop.” Basic laws of physics suggest that wings as small as the fat moogle's should not provide enough lift for true flight...yet here we are."
msgstr "Этот дородный аристократ воплощает древнюю поговорку муглов о купо-орехах: «Начнёшь купопать — уже не остановишься». По законам физики его крохотных крыльев не должно хватать для полёта... но вот же он, летит."

#. ja: グボォ…
#. de: Wenn du groß und stark werden willst,<br>musst du gaaanz viele Kupo-Nüsse essen, kupo!<br><i>Mogek Schlaubommel</i>
#. fr: Kubbooo...
#. column 0: Summon forth the fat moogle. How can he fly? Because magic. How can he fly bearing two riders? MAGIC.
#. column 1: This plus-sized patrician epitomizes the ancient moogle proverb regarding kupo nuts that says, “Once you kupop, you cannot stop.” Basic laws of physics suggest that wings as small as the fat moogle's should not provide enough lift for true flight...yet here we are.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:84:0:2"
msgid "Yet what was thin must<br>eventually grow fat again.<br>   - Aurelle"
msgstr "Был худым, да должен<br>снова растолстеть.<br>   — Орель"

#. ja: クラウドマロウに騎乗する。<br>雲海に自生する浮行性植物。モーグリの魔法により操作できる
#. de: Rufe einen Bommelin herbei, der aus Bommelblumen besteht, wahnsinnig flauschig ist und sanft durch die Wolken gleitet. Gesteuert wird er durch Mogry-Magie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mogrette. Ce végétal qui se laisse généralement flotter dans les airs a été rendu contrôlable grâce à la magie mog.
#. column 1: While cloud mallows grow naturally in the Churning Mists, some of the inhabitants of Moghome have spent generations cultivating their own seeds to allow for stronger stems and larger yields of mallow puffs, a sprinkling of which can stimulate even the most lethargic of moogles to work with unbridled joy.
#. column 2: Without my cloud mallows,<br>I can't do anything, kupopo!<br>   - Moggzia
msgctxt "MountTransient:86:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a cloud mallow. It will carry you wherever the wind blows. Or, wherever you steer it."
msgstr "Призывает облачную мальву. Она понесёт вас туда, куда дует ветер. Или туда, куда вы её направите."

#. ja: 雲海に自生する浮行性植物「フワフワ浮草」。モグモグホームに住まうモーグリ族が、魔法をかけたことにより、乗り物として利用できるようになっている。なお、その綿毛には、モーグリ族を癒やす効果があるらしい
#. de: In den Wallenden Nebeln wachsen flauschige Bommelblumen, die von den Mogrys durch Magie in Fluggeräte verwandelt werden. Die Bommelwatte der Bommelin macht müde Mogrys munter!
#. fr: Ce végétal qui flotte généralement dans L'Écume des cieux a semble-t-il des vertus apaisantes pour les Mogs célestes. Et alliant l'utile à l'agréable, ces derniers l'ont transformé en moyen de transport aérien grâce à leur magie.
#. column 0: Summon forth a cloud mallow. It will carry you wherever the wind blows. Or, wherever you steer it.
#. column 2: Without my cloud mallows,<br>I can't do anything, kupopo!<br>   - Moggzia
msgctxt "MountTransient:86:0:1"
msgid "While cloud mallows grow naturally in the Churning Mists, some of the inhabitants of Moghome have spent generations cultivating their own seeds to allow for stronger stems and larger yields of mallow puffs, a sprinkling of which can stimulate even the most lethargic of moogles to work with unbridled joy."
msgstr "Облачная мальва растёт в Бушующих туманах. Жители Могдома поколениями выводили сорта с крепкими стеблями и пышными соцветиями. Стоит посыпать ими даже самого ленивого мугла — и он с радостью примется за работу."

#. ja: ポワワワワン
#. de: Klar, der Bommelin ist kupo-bequem, aber du solltest nicht mitten im Flug einschlafen!<br><i>Flausch-Mogry</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth a cloud mallow. It will carry you wherever the wind blows. Or, wherever you steer it.
#. column 1: While cloud mallows grow naturally in the Churning Mists, some of the inhabitants of Moghome have spent generations cultivating their own seeds to allow for stronger stems and larger yields of mallow puffs, a sprinkling of which can stimulate even the most lethargic of moogles to work with unbridled joy.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:86:0:2"
msgid "Without my cloud mallows,<br>I can't do anything, kupopo!<br>   - Moggzia"
msgstr "Без моих облачных мальв<br>я ничего не могу, купопо!<br>   — Моггзия"

#. ja: ウィスパー号に騎乗する。<br>妖怪ウィスパーを模した小型飛空艇。うぃす！
#. de: Rufe eine schwebende Gondel herbei, die dem Yo-kai Whisper nachempfunden ist und die dich wie ein Reittier über Stock und Stein tragen wird.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture le Whisper. Ce petit aéronef monoplace ressemble à s'y méprendre à un Yo-kai.
#. column 1: Taken in by the vibrant sights of the Gold Saucer, the wandering executive sought out the plaza's architect to design him a vessel of transportation similar in flamboyance to its myriad attractions. The seats are so finely upholstered riders swear it is as if they are floating on air.
#. column 2: So this is how<br>man flies without<br>wings? But it is<br>so strange-looking!<br>   - Dragonet
msgctxt "MountTransient:87:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Whisper-go. A small, flying vessel designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Whisper."
msgstr "Призывает «Уиспер-го» — небольшой летающий корабль, созданный по образу ёкая по имени Уиспер."

#. ja: 妖怪執事ウィスパーを模した小型飛空艇。ゴールドソーサーのアトラクションをイメージして設計され、可動パーツも多く高性能との噂。座席は小さく見えるが、乗り心地はかなり快適
#. de: Der fahrende Geschäftsmann war so beeindruckt von der prächtigen Innenausstattung des Gold Saucers, dass er den verantwortlichen Innenausstatter anheuerte, um ihm ein großspuriges Gefährt zu entwerfen, das seinem Status gerecht ist.
#. fr: Ce petit aéronef, conçu pour ressembler au Yo-kai Whisper, serait digne de figurer comme attraction du Gold Saucer. Ses composants sont paraît-il d'excellente qualité, et bien que le siège semble étroit, il est en réalité très confortable.
#. column 0: Summon forth the Whisper-go. A small, flying vessel designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Whisper.
#. column 2: So this is how<br>man flies without<br>wings? But it is<br>so strange-looking!<br>   - Dragonet
msgctxt "MountTransient:87:0:1"
msgid "Taken in by the vibrant sights of the Gold Saucer, the wandering executive sought out the plaza's architect to design him a vessel of transportation similar in flamboyance to its myriad attractions. The seats are so finely upholstered riders swear it is as if they are floating on air."
msgstr "Очарованный яркими видами Золотого блюдца, странствующий делец обратился к создателю площади и заказал транспортное средство под стать здешним аттракционам. Сиденья обиты так искусно, что всадникам кажется, будто они парят в воздухе."

#. ja: うぃす！
#. de: Vorwärts, kha! Machen wir Kleinholz aus ihrem billigen Schiff!<br><i>Ixal-Häuptling</i>
#. fr: Fwhiiisss<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the Whisper-go. A small, flying vessel designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Whisper.
#. column 1: Taken in by the vibrant sights of the Gold Saucer, the wandering executive sought out the plaza's architect to design him a vessel of transportation similar in flamboyance to its myriad attractions. The seats are so finely upholstered riders swear it is as if they are floating on air.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:87:0:2"
msgid "So this is how<br>man flies without<br>wings? But it is<br>so strange-looking!<br>   - Dragonet"
msgstr "Так вот как люди<br>летают без крыльев?<br>Странная штуковина!<br>   — дракончик"

#. ja: ダークラナーに騎乗する。<br>邪竜の魔力を浴びた大隼。暗き翼を得て、大空を舞う
#. de: Rufe einen Düsterlanner herbei, ein riesiger Falke, der Nidhoggs dunkle Magie in sich aufgenommen hat. Lass dich auf seinen düsteren Schwingen durch die Luft tragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture faucon des ombres. S'il est si sombre, c'est parce qu'il a reçu l'influence maléfique de Nidhogg.
#. column 1: Consumed by malice, these birds roost in Nidhogg's lair, and regularly bathe themselves in the aetheric tempests surrounding the Aery. Sight of their glowing wings outside the Churning Mists can set the commonfolk into a panic, as they are thought to be the Horde's harbingers of death.
#. column 2: The minions of Nidhogg shall<br>not lightly suffer your presence<br>on that sacred mount.<br>   - Vidofnir
msgctxt "MountTransient:90:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the dark lanner. Favored of Nidhogg, it fearlessly soars the skies of the Churning Mists."
msgstr "Призывает тёмного ланнера. Любимец Нидхёгга, он бесстрашно парит в небесах Бушующих туманов."

#. ja: 邪竜「ニーズヘッグ」の魔力を浴び、暗き翼を得た大隼。雷雲を切り裂いて大空を舞う姿は、ドラゴン族の王として君臨した七大天竜を思わせる。ある目撃者は、邪竜の再来だと勘違いし、大慌てで逃げ出す準備を始めたほど
#. de: Der Düsterlanner ist von Nidhoggs dunkler Magie verdorben, die ihm gewaltige Macht verleiht. Seine imposante Gestalt kann aus der Ferne leicht mit einem Hohen Drachen verwechselt werden. Manch einer hat schon panisch die Flucht ergriffen, weil er glaubte, Nidhogg persönlich zu sehen.
#. fr: L'influence du dragon maléfique qu'est Nidhogg ne s'arrête pas au conflit qui dure depuis un millénaire entre Dravania et Ishgard. La faune et la flore ont également été touchées, comme le prouve ce faucon dont l'apparence cause parfois la peur chez les humains.
#. column 0: Summon forth the dark lanner. Favored of Nidhogg, it fearlessly soars the skies of the Churning Mists.
#. column 2: The minions of Nidhogg shall<br>not lightly suffer your presence<br>on that sacred mount.<br>   - Vidofnir
msgctxt "MountTransient:90:0:1"
msgid "Consumed by malice, these birds roost in Nidhogg's lair, and regularly bathe themselves in the aetheric tempests surrounding the Aery. Sight of their glowing wings outside the Churning Mists can set the commonfolk into a panic, as they are thought to be the Horde's harbingers of death."
msgstr "Поглощённые злобой птицы гнездятся в логове Нидхёгга и часто купаются в эфирных бурях вокруг Драконьего гнезда. Завидев их сияющие крылья за пределами Бушующих туманов, простолюдины могут запаниковать: считается, что это предвестники смерти, посланные Ордой."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Flieht, ihr Narren!<br>Der schwarze Drache kommt über uns!<br><i>Ängstlicher Bauer</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth the dark lanner. Favored of Nidhogg, it fearlessly soars the skies of the Churning Mists.
#. column 1: Consumed by malice, these birds roost in Nidhogg's lair, and regularly bathe themselves in the aetheric tempests surrounding the Aery. Sight of their glowing wings outside the Churning Mists can set the commonfolk into a panic, as they are thought to be the Horde's harbingers of death.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:90:0:2"
msgid "The minions of Nidhogg shall<br>not lightly suffer your presence<br>on that sacred mount.<br>   - Vidofnir"
msgstr "Приспешники Нидхёгга не потерпят<br>твоего присутствия на этой<br>священной горе.<br>   — Видофнир"

#. ja: 浮行システムに騎乗する。<br>古代アラグ帝国時代に設計された汎用球形防衛システム
#. de: Rufe ein aerodynamisches System herbei, eine technische Errungenschaft der Allager, die sich gut als Fortbewegungsmittel eignet.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture sphère de lévitation. Malgré le temps, cette ancienne machine allagoise semble pouvoir supporter le poids d'une personne.
#. column 1: Unearthed in the eastern lowlands of Coerthas, engineers surmise that this particular Allagan drone would likely have been used in aerial defense, although its weaponry functions are now beyond repair. Even so, it is still quite convenient as a transportation device.
#. column 2: This node turned out to<br>be rather more useful than<br>I expected!<br>   - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:91:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your aerodynamics system─marvel of ancient Allagan ingenuity."
msgstr "Призывает аэродинамическую систему — чудо древней аллаганской инженерии."

#. ja: クルザス東部低地にて発掘された古代アラグ帝国の汎用球形防衛システム。兵器類は故障しているが、乗用としてはそれなりに使える。起動するたびに、制御システムのアップグレードを推奨してくるのが玉にキズ
#. de: Im östlichen Tiefland von Coerthas wurde eine Maschine ausgegraben, die von den alten Allagern zu Verteidigungszwecken erbaut wurde. Ihre Waffen- systeme sind defekt, aber sie eignet sich noch als Fortbewegungsmittel. Dass sie beharrlich nach einer Inspektion verlangt, damit lässt sich leben.
#. fr: Cette machine de guerre allagoise a été découverte dans les Basses terres du Coerthas oriental, et bien que son armement soit hors d'état de marche, elle peut encore servir de moyen de transport.
#. column 0: Summon forth your aerodynamics system─marvel of ancient Allagan ingenuity.
#. column 2: This node turned out to<br>be rather more useful than<br>I expected!<br>   - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:91:0:1"
msgid "Unearthed in the eastern lowlands of Coerthas, engineers surmise that this particular Allagan drone would likely have been used in aerial defense, although its weaponry functions are now beyond repair. Even so, it is still quite convenient as a transportation device."
msgstr "Инженеры предполагают, что этот аллаганский дрон, найденный в восточных низинах Коэртаса, предназначался для противовоздушной обороны. Его оружейные системы уже не починить, но как транспорт он всё ещё очень удобен."

#. ja: 無償アップグレードは<br>期間限定です…
#. de: Inspektion fällig.<br>Umgehend Servicetechniker kontaktieren!<br><i>Aerodynamisches System</i>
#. fr: Bip bip... Mise à niveau des systèmes recommandée...
#. column 0: Summon forth your aerodynamics system─marvel of ancient Allagan ingenuity.
#. column 1: Unearthed in the eastern lowlands of Coerthas, engineers surmise that this particular Allagan drone would likely have been used in aerial defense, although its weaponry functions are now beyond repair. Even so, it is still quite convenient as a transportation device.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:91:0:2"
msgid "This node turned out to<br>be rather more useful than<br>I expected!<br>   - Cid"
msgstr "Этот узел оказался<br>куда полезнее, чем<br>я ожидал!<br>   — Сид"

#. ja: ヘッドマウントに騎乗する。<br>巨大な顔の彫像に、魔法を込めた浮行式ゴーレム
#. de: Rufe einen geflügelten Steinkopf herbei. Sitzkissen muss separat erworben werden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture tête ailée. Ce morceau de statue a été modifié par magie afin de pouvoir se mouvoir dans les airs.
#. column 1: E-Una-Kotor created this winged monstrosity using stone hewn from the very walls of the Palace of the Dead in an attempt to better understand the guardian golems which watch over the Lost City of Amdapor. That the face chosen for the design bears an uncanny likeness to a certain someone is one stone best left unturned.
#. column 2: Unggghhh, my head...<br>   - Lewenhart
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:92:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your disembodied head. Not <i>your</i> disembodied head. <i>A</i> disembodied head. That's yours."
msgstr "Призывает отдельную голову. Не <i>вашу</i> отдельную голову. Просто <i>отдельную</i> голову. Но теперь она ваша."

#. ja: 巨大な顔の彫像に、魔法を込めた浮行式ゴーレム。角尊のエ・ウナが、アムダプール文明の彫像型守護者を研究する過程で創った実験作らしい。そのモチーフが何であるのか知る者は皆、一様に口を閉ざすという
#. de: E-Una-Kotor schlug dieses geflügelte Monstrum aus Mauersteinen, die aus dem Palast der Toten geborgen wurden, um ein besseres Verständnis für die Wächtergolems von Amdapor zu gewinnen. Nach wessen Antlitz er den Kopf schuf, ist ein unaussprechliches Geheimnis.
#. fr: Cette monture pour le moins étrange et terrifiante a été créée expérimentalement par le Padjal E-Una-Kotor alors qu'il s'intéressait à la statue que les gens d'Amdapor avaient chargée de protéger leur cité.
#. column 0: Summon forth your disembodied head. Not <i>your</i> disembodied head. <i>A</i> disembodied head. That's yours.
#. column 2: Unggghhh, my head...<br>   - Lewenhart
msgctxt "MountTransient:92:0:1"
msgid "E-Una-Kotor created this winged monstrosity using stone hewn from the very walls of the Palace of the Dead in an attempt to better understand the guardian golems which watch over the Lost City of Amdapor. That the face chosen for the design bears an uncanny likeness to a certain someone is one stone best left unturned."
msgstr "Э-Уна-Котор создал это крылатое чудовище из камня, добытого прямо в стенах Дворца мёртвых, пытаясь лучше понять големов-стражей, охраняющих Затерянный город Амдапор. Почему для изваяния выбрано лицо, так похожее на одного человека, лучше не выяснять."

#. ja: ADDEEVOLI…
#. de: Kopf hoch, Leute! Ist doch halb so wild.<br><i>Wedge</i>
#. fr: ADDEEMIAJ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your disembodied head. Not <i>your</i> disembodied head. <i>A</i> disembodied head. That's yours.
#. column 1: E-Una-Kotor created this winged monstrosity using stone hewn from the very walls of the Palace of the Dead in an attempt to better understand the guardian golems which watch over the Lost City of Amdapor. That the face chosen for the design bears an uncanny likeness to a certain someone is one stone best left unturned.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:92:0:2"
msgid "Unggghhh, my head...<br>   - Lewenhart"
msgstr "У-у-у-у, голова...<br>   — Левенхарт"

#. ja: マーナガルムに騎乗する。<br>アバラシア山脈の奥地に生息する幻の古代獣
#. de: Rufe Managarm, den Mondhund, herbei, eine uralte Bestie, die versteckt in den Tiefen von Abalathias Rückgrat haust.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture managarm, un féroce canidé ancien vivant au fin fond des montagnes d'Abalathia.
#. column 1: Some say that Managarm is merely a myth. Others believe it to be an extinct beast. Both are wrong, as you well know. According to Abalathian legend, this fearsome hound roams the celestial sphere in pursuit of the moon, whose light it relishes─or so it may appear to those who witness it soaring the skies, spawning spectral flames.
#. column 2: I should have been<br>the one to feed your<br>dark hound with light!<br>   - From an Ancient Epic
msgctxt "MountTransient:93:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Managarm, a legendary hound said to dwell in the hidden depths of Abalathia's Spine."
msgstr "Призовите Манагарма — легендарного пса, который, по преданиям, обитает в укромных глубинах Хребта Абалатии."

#. ja: 絶滅したと考えられていた古の幻獣。アバラシア山脈に伝わる民間伝承によれば、月を追い太陽光を喰らう存在とされている。事実、非常に優れた魔力を持ち、幻の炎を造り出して、天をも駆けるという
#. de: Eine uralte Bestie, die eigentlich als ausgestorben galt. Einer abalathischen Legende zufolge folgt sie dem Mond und verschlingt das Sonnenlicht. Unbestreitbar stark ist ihre magische Kraft: Sie erschafft Feuer und fliegt frei durch die Lüfte.
#. fr: D'après une croyance populaire des habitants des montagnes d'Abalathia, cette créature, qu'on avait longtemps pensé disparue, se nourrit de la lumière du soleil pour poursuivre la lune. Ceci est sûrement dû à la traînée de flammes qu'elle laisse derrière elle en courant dans le ciel.
#. column 0: Summon forth Managarm, a legendary hound said to dwell in the hidden depths of Abalathia's Spine.
#. column 2: I should have been<br>the one to feed your<br>dark hound with light!<br>   - From an Ancient Epic
msgctxt "MountTransient:93:0:1"
msgid "Some say that Managarm is merely a myth. Others believe it to be an extinct beast. Both are wrong, as you well know. According to Abalathian legend, this fearsome hound roams the celestial sphere in pursuit of the moon, whose light it relishes─or so it may appear to those who witness it soaring the skies, spawning spectral flames."
msgstr "Одни считают Манагарма всего лишь мифом. Другие — вымершим зверем. И те и другие ошибаются, как вы знаете. Согласно легендам Абалатии, этот свирепый пёс носится по небесам в погоне за луной, упиваясь её светом… По крайней мере, так кажется тем, кто видит его в небе среди призрачных языков пламени."

#. ja: ウォォ～ン！
#. de: Blitzattacke! Wir müssen die feindliche Linie durchbrechen!<br><i>K'lyhia</i>
#. fr: Aouuuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Managarm, a legendary hound said to dwell in the hidden depths of Abalathia's Spine.
#. column 1: Some say that Managarm is merely a myth. Others believe it to be an extinct beast. Both are wrong, as you well know. According to Abalathian legend, this fearsome hound roams the celestial sphere in pursuit of the moon, whose light it relishes─or so it may appear to those who witness it soaring the skies, spawning spectral flames.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:93:0:2"
msgid "I should have been<br>the one to feed your<br>dark hound with light!<br>   - From an Ancient Epic"
msgstr "Я должен был<br>кормить твоего<br>мрачного пса светом!<br>   — Из древней поэмы"

#. ja: ウィスパー号改に騎乗する。<br>妖怪ウィスパーを模した改良型の小型飛空艇。うぃす！
#. de: Rufe eine Spezialausfertigung einer schwebenden Gondel herbei, die dem Yo-kai Whisper nachempfunden ist und die dich wie ein Reittier über Stock und Stein tragen wird.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture le Whisper II.  Cette version améliorée du petit aéronef monoplace est pourvue d'un deuxième Yo-kai.
#. column 1: Moved by your unyielding dedication and patronage, the wandering executive once again commissioned the architects of the Gold Saucer, this time to upgrade the Whisper-go as a gift from himself and his friend, the wandering minstrel.
#. column 2: Ye gads! What was that<br>flash from the heavens?<br>It nearly blinded me!<br>   - Gilgamesh
msgctxt "MountTransient:94:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Whisper A-go-go. A flashy upgrade to a small flying vessel designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Whisper."
msgstr "Призовите Уиспер-го-го — броскую версию небольшого летающего судна, созданного по образу йокая по имени Уиспер."

#. ja: 妖怪執事ウィスパーを模した改良型の小型飛空艇。多くの妖怪とともだちになり、ともに試練に耐え抜いた者の偉業を称えるために、ど派手な装飾が施されている。異邦の詩人と異邦の社長からの贈り物らしい
#. de: Der fahrende Geschäftsmann bat den Innenausstatter des Gold Saucers ein weiteres Mal, ein auffälliges Gefährt zu entwerfen, und gab ihm die spezielle Anweisung, alle vorhergehenden Bemühungen noch zu übertreffen.
#. fr: Cette version améliorée du petit aéronef inspiré par le majordome Yo-kai Whisper a été créée à la demande des ménestrel et patron errants, pour récompenser les aventuriers qui se sont liés d'amitié avec de nombreux Yo-kai et ont surmonté des épreuves en leur compagnie.
#. column 0: Summon forth the Whisper A-go-go. A flashy upgrade to a small flying vessel designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Whisper.
#. column 2: Ye gads! What was that<br>flash from the heavens?<br>It nearly blinded me!<br>   - Gilgamesh
msgctxt "MountTransient:94:0:1"
msgid "Moved by your unyielding dedication and patronage, the wandering executive once again commissioned the architects of the Gold Saucer, this time to upgrade the Whisper-go as a gift from himself and his friend, the wandering minstrel."
msgstr "Тронутый вашей преданностью и щедрой поддержкой, бродячий делец вновь поручил мастерам Золотого блюдца доработать Уиспер-го. На этот раз — в подарок от себя и своего друга, странствующего менестреля."

#. ja: うぃす！　うぃす！
#. de: Ich hoffe, Ihr habt Euch für diesen Schrott nicht von zu vielen Münzen trennen müssen!<br><i>Syntgoth</i>
#. fr: Miaouwhiiisss<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the Whisper A-go-go. A flashy upgrade to a small flying vessel designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Whisper.
#. column 1: Moved by your unyielding dedication and patronage, the wandering executive once again commissioned the architects of the Gold Saucer, this time to upgrade the Whisper-go as a gift from himself and his friend, the wandering minstrel.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:94:0:2"
msgid "Ye gads! What was that<br>flash from the heavens?<br>It nearly blinded me!<br>   - Gilgamesh"
msgstr "Ё-моё! Что это<br>за вспышка с небес?<br>Чуть меня не ослепила!<br>   — Гильгамеш"

#. ja: 轟天に騎乗する。<br>黄金に輝く装甲をまとった存在
#. de: Rufe Goten herbei, ein künstlich geschaffenes Reittier, das aus dem Skelett eines toten Pferdes und einer goldenen Rüstung besteht. Sein Name bedeutet angeblich „Ruf des Himmels“.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Gôten, un destrier d'un autre monde revêtu d'une armure dorée.
#. column 1: This otherworldly mount, cobbled together from the carcasses of noble beasts and armored in elaborate gold plate, is said only to accept as riders those who have proven their might and mettle on the fields of battle.
#. column 2: The horse is merciful<br>and generous in victory.<br>   - Golden Uma Doshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:95:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Goten. A man-made aberration from a land that exists only in whispers. Its name is said to mean “roaring heavens.”"
msgstr "Призовите Готэна — искусственное чудовище из края, о котором ходят лишь шёпотки. Говорят, его имя означает «грохот небес»."

#. ja: 黄金に輝く装甲をまとった存在。戦いによって強さを示した者が、命がけの試練を超えた時にのみ、呼び寄せることができると伝えられている
#. de: Die goldene Rüstung verbirgt weitgehend den Blick auf das Skelett in seinem Inneren. Der Legende nach kann Goten nur von großen Helden gerufen werden, die sich in einem Kampf auf Leben und Tod bewiesen haben.
#. fr: Cet étrange destrier revêtu d'une armure dorée ne répond qu'à l'appel des guerriers les plus puissants. Seuls ceux qui ont montré leur valeur au bout d'un en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment au seuil de la mort sont en mesure de le chevaucher.
#. column 0: Summon forth Goten. A man-made aberration from a land that exists only in whispers. Its name is said to mean “roaring heavens.”
#. column 2: The horse is merciful<br>and generous in victory.<br>   - Golden Uma Doshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:95:0:1"
msgid "This otherworldly mount, cobbled together from the carcasses of noble beasts and armored in elaborate gold plate, is said only to accept as riders those who have proven their might and mettle on the fields of battle."
msgstr "Это создание из иного мира собрано из останков благородных животных и заковано в затейливые золотые доспехи. Говорят, на его спину он пускает лишь тех, кто доказал свою силу и отвагу в бою."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Selten tritt der Tod so schön in Erscheinung.<br><i>Urianger</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Goten. A man-made aberration from a land that exists only in whispers. Its name is said to mean “roaring heavens.”
#. column 1: This otherworldly mount, cobbled together from the carcasses of noble beasts and armored in elaborate gold plate, is said only to accept as riders those who have proven their might and mettle on the fields of battle.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:95:0:2"
msgid "The horse is merciful<br>and generous in victory.<br>   - Golden Uma Doshin"
msgstr "Конь милостив<br>и щедр в победе.<br>   — Золотой ума-до:син"

#. ja: 銀牙に騎乗する。<br>銀色に輝く装甲をまとった存在
#. de: Rufe Ginga herbei, ein künstlich geschaffenes Reittier, das aus dem Skelett eines toten Pferdes und einer silbernen Rüstung besteht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Ginga, un destrier d'un autre monde revêtu d'une armure argentée.
#. column 1: This otherworldly mount, cobbled together from the carcasses of noble beasts and armored in elaborate silver plate, is said only to accept as riders those who have proven their might and mettle on the fields of battle.
#. column 2: Be as the horse, and leave<br>behind all doubts and bafflement!<br>   - Black Uma Doshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:96:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Ginga. A man-made aberration from a land that exists only in whispers. Its name is said to mean “silver fang.”"
msgstr "Призовите Гингу — искусственное чудовище из края, о котором ходят лишь шёпотки. Говорят, его имя означает «серебряный клык»."

#. ja: 銀色に輝く装甲をまとった存在。幾多の敵を斃してきた者のみが、命がけの試練を超えた時にのみ、呼び寄せることができると伝えられている
#. de: Die silberne Rüstung verbirgt weitgehend den Blick auf das Skelett in seinem Inneren. Der Legende nach kann Ginga nur von großen Helden gerufen werden, die sich in einem Kampf auf Leben und Tod bewiesen haben.
#. fr: Cet étrange destrier revêtu d'une armure argentée ne répond qu'à l'appel des guerriers ne comptant plus leurs ennemis terrassés. Seuls ceux qui ont montré leur valeur au bout d'un en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment au seuil de la mort sont en mesure de le chevaucher.
#. column 0: Summon forth Ginga. A man-made aberration from a land that exists only in whispers. Its name is said to mean “silver fang.”
#. column 2: Be as the horse, and leave<br>behind all doubts and bafflement!<br>   - Black Uma Doshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:96:0:1"
msgid "This otherworldly mount, cobbled together from the carcasses of noble beasts and armored in elaborate silver plate, is said only to accept as riders those who have proven their might and mettle on the fields of battle."
msgstr "Это создание из иного мира собрано из останков благородных животных и заковано в затейливые серебряные доспехи. Говорят, на его спину он пускает лишь тех, кто доказал свою силу и отвагу в бою."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Du bist anmutig, tapfer und schön!<br>Ganz so, wie ein Pferd zu sein hat.<br><i>Pferdeleutnant</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Ginga. A man-made aberration from a land that exists only in whispers. Its name is said to mean “silver fang.”
#. column 1: This otherworldly mount, cobbled together from the carcasses of noble beasts and armored in elaborate silver plate, is said only to accept as riders those who have proven their might and mettle on the fields of battle.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:96:0:2"
msgid "Be as the horse, and leave<br>behind all doubts and bafflement!<br>   - Black Uma Doshin"
msgstr "Будь как конь — отбрось<br>сомнения и растерянность!<br>   — Чёрный ума-до:син"

#. ja: 仙術熊猫に騎乗する。<br>千年の時を生き、仙術を体得したと噂される
#. de: Rufe einen mystischen Panda herbei. Aus Doma. Von vor tausend Jahren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture panda mystique. Ce mystérieux animal, malgré son poids conséquent, serait capable de léviter.
#. column 1: Armed with the unexplainable ability to levitate...and little else, this thousand-year-old creature (age unconfirmed) has descended the ancient peaks of the Othardian Fanged Crescent in search of a hero to help Doma wrench free from the iron clutches of the Garlean Empire.
#. column 2: Used to be prime huntin' grounds...<br>that is, till the bears moved in.<br>   - Tailfeather Hunter
msgctxt "MountTransient:97:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your mystic panda. From Doma. From a thousand years ago."
msgstr "Призовите мистическую панду. Из Домы. Из тысячелетней давности."

#. ja: 東州オサード小大陸の山岳地帯「蛇ノ口」の奧地からやって来た、謎めいたパンダ。千年の時を生き、仙術を体得したとも噂され、不可思議な力で宙を舞うらしい。東州の危機を救う英雄を探し求めているようだ
#. de: Diese tausend Jahre alte Kreatur (geschätzt) besitzt unerklärlicherweise die Fähigkeit zu schweben. Sie schwebte von den höchsten Berggipfeln auf dem Kontinent Othard herab, um einen Held zu finden, der Doma aus den Klauen der Garlear befreit.
#. fr: Ce mystérieux panda aurait vécu plus de mille ans en ermite dans les montagnes du continent oriental d'Othard et acquit des pouvoirs surnaturels. Il chercherait le héros qui viendra sauver l'Orient de la poigne de fer de Garlemald.
#. column 0: Summon forth your mystic panda. From Doma. From a thousand years ago.
#. column 2: Used to be prime huntin' grounds...<br>that is, till the bears moved in.<br>   - Tailfeather Hunter
msgctxt "MountTransient:97:0:1"
msgid "Armed with the unexplainable ability to levitate...and little else, this thousand-year-old creature (age unconfirmed) has descended the ancient peaks of the Othardian Fanged Crescent in search of a hero to help Doma wrench free from the iron clutches of the Garlean Empire."
msgstr "Эта тысячелетняя тварь (возраст не подтверждён) обладает необъяснимой способностью левитировать… и почти ничем больше. Она спустилась с древних вершин Клыкастого полумесяца Отарда в поисках героя, который поможет Доме вырваться из железной хватки Гарлемальда."

#. ja: メェェェェ
#. de: Waren mal tolle Jagdgründe hier ...<br>Bis die Bären kamen.<br><i>Fiederhag-Jäger</i>
#. fr: Miiii<nbsp>! Miiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your mystic panda. From Doma. From a thousand years ago.
#. column 1: Armed with the unexplainable ability to levitate...and little else, this thousand-year-old creature (age unconfirmed) has descended the ancient peaks of the Othardian Fanged Crescent in search of a hero to help Doma wrench free from the iron clutches of the Garlean Empire.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:97:0:2"
msgid "Used to be prime huntin' grounds...<br>that is, till the bears moved in.<br>   - Tailfeather Hunter"
msgstr "Когда-то тут были отменные места для охоты...<br>пока не объявились медведи.<br>   — Охотник Хвостового пера"

#. ja: ゴッデスラナーに騎乗する。<br>女神に祝福された大隼。天秤に調和の分銅を落とすという
#. de: Rufe den Sophia-Lanner herbei. Ein goldenes Licht umhüllt diesen erhabenen Falken, der den Segen Sophias empfing.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture faucon sophique, béni par la divinité Sophia.
#. column 1: History tells us that disruption in balance 'twixt good and evil will invariably result in suffering. The noble lanner serves to restore that balance by placing upon the goddess Sophia's scales the weights of equilibrium─most commonly depicted as our heroes of legend.
#. column 2: “A heartbeat without harmony<br>Is moonlight without dark.”<br>   - From <i>The Sophic Canticles</i>
msgctxt "MountTransient:98:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Sophic lanner. A once faithful servant to a fickle goddess."
msgstr "Призовите софийского ланнера — некогда верного слугу непостоянной богини."

#. ja: 女神「ソフィア」による祝福を受け、神々しい気をまとった大隼。伝説によると、世が乱れると女神は神鳥を使わし、天秤に分銅を落として均衡を保つという。そして、この分銅こそが人の世に生まれる「英雄」なのだと語られている
#. de: Der Legende zufolge lässt er ein Gewichtsstück der Harmonie auf Sophias Waage fallen, wann immer das Gleichgewicht der Welt in Gefahr ist. Es heißt, beim Auftreffen des Gewichts werde ein neuer Held geboren.
#. fr: D'après la légende, lorsque le monde a sombré dans le chaos, la divinité Sophia a envoyé un oiseau divin afin de rapporter l'équilibre. On dit que les héros seraient les poids dont elle s'est servie pour ajuster la balance.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Sophic lanner. A once faithful servant to a fickle goddess.
#. column 2: “A heartbeat without harmony<br>Is moonlight without dark.”<br>   - From <i>The Sophic Canticles</i>
msgctxt "MountTransient:98:0:1"
msgid "History tells us that disruption in balance 'twixt good and evil will invariably result in suffering. The noble lanner serves to restore that balance by placing upon the goddess Sophia's scales the weights of equilibrium─most commonly depicted as our heroes of legend."
msgstr "История учит: когда нарушается равновесие между добром и злом, страдания неизбежны. Благородный ланнер восстанавливает равновесие, помещая на весы богини Софии уравновешивающие гири. Чаще всего в легендах их изображают героями."

#. ja: …………
#. de: „Endgültige Gerechtigkeit erfahren wir weder im Licht noch in der Dunkelheit. Gerecht ist alles, was uns vor dem Untergang bewahrt.„<br><i>Kapitel 3: Sophia</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Sophic lanner. A once faithful servant to a fickle goddess.
#. column 1: History tells us that disruption in balance 'twixt good and evil will invariably result in suffering. The noble lanner serves to restore that balance by placing upon the goddess Sophia's scales the weights of equilibrium─most commonly depicted as our heroes of legend.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:98:0:2"
msgid "“A heartbeat without harmony<br>Is moonlight without dark.”<br>   - From <i>The Sophic Canticles</i>"
msgstr "«Сердце без гармонии —<br>как лунный свет без тьмы».<br>   — Из <i>Софийских песнопений</i>"

#. ja: スターライト・ベアーに騎乗する。<br>星芒祭のため芸を学んだ熊
#. de: Rufe einen Sternenlicht-Bären herbei. Er beherrscht ein tolles Kunststück passend zum Sternenlicht-Fest.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ours de la fête des étoiles, un animal très intelligent et dressé pour l'occasion.
#. column 1: Unlike his wild cousins, <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> the bear can be relied upon to delight folk rather than tear them apart. Raised from a cub by Celebrant Baenfaeld, he has mastered the art of Starburst-lobbing, a skill that proved useful in hunting down thieving treants.
#. column 2: I never knew bears<br>could be so adorable!<br>   - Festival-goer
msgctxt "MountTransient:99:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Starlight bear, and delight the younglings to no end."
msgstr "Призовите медведя Звёздного света и порадуйте детишек до невозможности."

#. ja: 星芒祭実行委員のベーンフェールドが育てた熊。名前は、<switch $gn71><case>コカブ<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>フェルカド<case>コカブ<case>ポラリス<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>ポラリス<case>コカブ</switch>。子どもたちを楽しませるため、プレゼントクラッカーを投げる芸を修得している。その芸を用いて、星芒祭の飾りを盗んだトレントをとっちめた
#. de: Der Bär wurde von dem Komiteemitglied Baenfaeld für das Sternenlichtfest dressiert. Als Kunststück kann er Sternenknaller werfen, ursprünglich um damit den Kindern eine Freude zu bereiten, doch gegen die diebischen Baumschrate hat es sich als wirkungsvolle Kampftechnik erwiesen.
#. fr: Cet ours nommé <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> a été dressé par Baenfaeld pour lancer des pétards et amuser les enfants. Il s'est même servi de ce talent pour attraper les tréants qui volaient les décorations de la fête des étoiles.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Starlight bear, and delight the younglings to no end.
#. column 2: I never knew bears<br>could be so adorable!<br>   - Festival-goer
#. macro: <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 71 (the player character's race, a Race row) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:99:0:1"
msgid "Unlike his wild cousins, <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> the bear can be relied upon to delight folk rather than tear them apart. Raised from a cub by Celebrant Baenfaeld, he has mastered the art of Starburst-lobbing, a skill that proved useful in hunting down thieving treants."
msgstr "В отличие от диких сородичей, <switch $gn71><case>Кохаб<case><if $gn4>Кохаб<else>Полярис</if><case>Феркад<case>Кохаб<case>Полярис<case><if $gn4>Кохаб<else>Полярис</if><case>Полярис<case>Кохаб</switch> не станет рвать людей на части, а будет их забавлять. С детства его растил распорядитель Бенфельд, и он освоил искусство метания Звёздных взрывов. Это умение пригодилось, когда пришлось ловить древесных великанов, воровавших праздничные украшения."

#. ja: グガ、グルル……
#. de: Roooah!
#. fr: Graaaor<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Starlight bear, and delight the younglings to no end.
#. column 1: Unlike his wild cousins, <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> the bear can be relied upon to delight folk rather than tear them apart. Raised from a cub by Celebrant Baenfaeld, he has mastered the art of Starburst-lobbing, a skill that proved useful in hunting down thieving treants.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:99:0:2"
msgid "I never knew bears<br>could be so adorable!<br>   - Festival-goer"
msgstr "И не думал, что медведи<br>могут быть такими милыми!<br>   — Гость праздника"

#. ja: ブラックペガサスに騎乗する。<br>世にも珍しい黒色のペガサス。「黒死馬」の別名でも知られる
#. de: Rufe einen schwarzen Pegasus herbei. Im Volksmund wird er auch „schwarzes Todespferd“ genannt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture pégase des ténèbres. Cette espèce de couleur noire est ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelle parmi les pégases. Son pelage lui vaut son surnom de “La mort noire”.
#. column 1: While uncommon, tales of pegasi black as ink can be found amongst the folklore of countless tribes. One similarity, however, can be observed in nearly all the renditions─that those unworthy of the steed will have their very life essence sapped the moment they climb upon its back.
#. column 2: What is this malaise<br>which plagues me?<br>   - Beatin
msgctxt "MountTransient:100:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a black pegasus─winged horse of legend and bringer of death."
msgstr "Призовите чёрного пегаса — легендарного крылатого коня, несущего смерть."

#. ja: 世にも珍しい黒色のペガサス。かつて魔大陸の一部だったという伝承が残る場所で、発見されたらしい。力なき者がその背に乗ると全身の血が濁り、やがて死に至るという伝説から、「黒死馬」の別名でも知られている
#. de: Ein äußerst seltenes geflügeltes Pferd ganz in Schwarz. Augenzeugen sollen eines in Azys Lla gesichtet haben. Nur wer über genügend Kraft verfügt, kann es besteigen. Schwingt sich eine schwache Person auf seinen Rücken, verklumpt ihr Blut und sie stirbt unverzüglich.
#. fr: On les trouverait à Azys Lla, mais rares sont ceux à en avoir aperçu un. On raconte que seuls les puissants peuvent les chevaucher. Si un être ordinaire venait à le faire, son sang purulerait et il mourrait. On a donc donné à ce destrier le surnom “La mort noire”.
#. column 0: Summon forth a black pegasus─winged horse of legend and bringer of death.
#. column 2: What is this malaise<br>which plagues me?<br>   - Beatin
msgctxt "MountTransient:100:0:1"
msgid "While uncommon, tales of pegasi black as ink can be found amongst the folklore of countless tribes. One similarity, however, can be observed in nearly all the renditions─that those unworthy of the steed will have their very life essence sapped the moment they climb upon its back."
msgstr "Пегасы с шерстью чернее чернил встречаются редко, но о них слагают легенды многие народы. Почти во всех историях есть одно общее: стоит недостойному сесть на такого коня, как тот высосет из него жизненные силы."

#. ja: ブラックペガサス！！
#. de: „Mein Blut, es fließt nicht mehr ... \<röchel>„<br><i>Unbekannter Narr</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth a black pegasus─winged horse of legend and bringer of death.
#. column 1: While uncommon, tales of pegasi black as ink can be found amongst the folklore of countless tribes. One similarity, however, can be observed in nearly all the renditions─that those unworthy of the steed will have their very life essence sapped the moment they climb upon its back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:100:0:2"
msgid "What is this malaise<br>which plagues me?<br>   - Beatin"
msgstr "Что за хворь<br>меня одолела?<br>   — Битен"

#. ja: アリダイオスに騎乗する。<br>アレキサンダー製の攻撃端末。武装解除を受け、乗用に利用されることになった
#. de: Rufe Arrhidaios herbei, eine aus dem Innern Alexanders stammende Vernichtungsmaschine.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture messager d'Arrhabée. Le programme d'usine de cette main armée d'Alexander a été entièrement purgé et réécrit pour en faire un véhicule de transport.
#. column 1: Fabricated within Alexander's internal manufactories, Arrhidaeus was primarily used to wreak temporal disruption on any and all invaders. This particular construct saw its weapons systems overridden following capture, and now serves as a glorified transport module.
#. column 2: You are implying that<br>the Illuminati are aware<br>of this temporal disruption?<br>   - Mide
msgctxt "MountTransient:101:0:0"
msgid "Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Oh, oh, oh, Arrhidaeus. Summon forth your Arrhidaeus."
msgstr "Арридайос, Арридайос. Арридайос. Арридайос, Арридайос. Арридайос. Арридайос, Арридайос. О-о-о, Арридайос. Призовите своего Арридайоса."

#. ja: 機工城「アレキサンダー」内のプラントで自動生成された攻撃端末。どうやら時間干渉攻撃のために、製造されたものらしい。激しい戦いの後、武装解除に応じたため、乗用浮行機として利用されることになった
#. de: Ursprünglich mit der Absicht erschaffen, zeitmanipulative Angriffe zu tätigen, wurde es gründlich umprogrammiert, um nun als harmloses Luftfahrtvehikel zivilen Zwecken zu dienen.
#. fr: Cette unité d'attaque spécialiste des interférences spatio-temporelles sort tout droit des chaînes de production automatisées du géant mécanique Alexander. Sa programmation a été entièrement revue et corrigée pour en faire un véhicule de transport.
#. column 0: Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Oh, oh, oh, Arrhidaeus. Summon forth your Arrhidaeus.
#. column 2: You are implying that<br>the Illuminati are aware<br>of this temporal disruption?<br>   - Mide
msgctxt "MountTransient:101:0:1"
msgid "Fabricated within Alexander's internal manufactories, Arrhidaeus was primarily used to wreak temporal disruption on any and all invaders. This particular construct saw its weapons systems overridden following capture, and now serves as a glorified transport module."
msgstr "Арридайос создан на заводах внутри Александра и предназначался главным образом для воздействия на время и борьбы с захватчиками. После поимки у него отключили оружие, и теперь он служит этаким транспортным модулем."

#. ja: 安全運転開始…！
#. de: Chef, <i>die</i> Zeitbombe wurde entschärft.„<br><i>Wedge</i>
#. fr: Protocole de conduite responsable engagé !
#. column 0: Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus. Arrhidaeus, Arrhidaeus. Oh, oh, oh, Arrhidaeus. Summon forth your Arrhidaeus.
#. column 1: Fabricated within Alexander's internal manufactories, Arrhidaeus was primarily used to wreak temporal disruption on any and all invaders. This particular construct saw its weapons systems overridden following capture, and now serves as a glorified transport module.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:101:0:2"
msgid "You are implying that<br>the Illuminati are aware<br>of this temporal disruption?<br>   - Mide"
msgstr "Вы хотите сказать,<br>что Иллюминаты знают<br>о вмешательстве во время?<br>   — Майде"

#. ja: 雷剛に騎乗する。<br>幾多の戦場を駆け抜けてきた真の強者のみが従え得る魔導馬
#. de: Rufe Raigo herbei, ein magisches Pferd, das nur die stärksten Helden, die zahllose Schlachten geschlagen haben, auf seinen Rücken lässt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Raigo, un destrier Mado qui ne répond qu'au guerrier suprême.
#. column 1: The most daunting of Mado horses, Raigo eclipses its unholy brethren Goten and Ginga in both size and ferocity. As such, the creature will not suffer the burden of carrying a soul unbloodied, and therefore unworthy.
#. column 2: Your inner horse,<br>my dear adventurer,<br>must be a steed of rare beauty.<br>   - Golden Uma Yoriki
msgctxt "MountTransient:102:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Raigo. Whether or not he heeds the call depends entirely on the number of bloodied laurels in your crown."
msgstr "Призовите Райго. Он откликнется лишь в том случае, если ваша корона украшена множеством окровавленных лавров."

#. ja: 幾多の戦場を駆け抜けてきた真の強者のみが、従えることができると伝えられる魔導馬。その馬体は、他の魔導馬を凌ぐほど大きく逞しい。その装甲が漆黒に輝くのは、業を背負っている故か……
#. de: Raigo ist noch größer und wilder als seine ohnehin schon beeindruckenden Artverwandten Goten und Ginga. Er lässt niemanden auf sich reiten, der kein Blut an seinen Händen hat und somit unwürdig ist.
#. fr: Cet étrange destrier à l'armure noire, signe du lourd karma qu'il porte, ne répond qu'à l'appel du guerrier suprême. Devant sa puissance, même Gôten et Ginga font presque pâle figure et courbent l'échine.
#. column 0: Summon forth Raigo. Whether or not he heeds the call depends entirely on the number of bloodied laurels in your crown.
#. column 2: Your inner horse,<br>my dear adventurer,<br>must be a steed of rare beauty.<br>   - Golden Uma Yoriki
msgctxt "MountTransient:102:0:1"
msgid "The most daunting of Mado horses, Raigo eclipses its unholy brethren Goten and Ginga in both size and ferocity. As such, the creature will not suffer the burden of carrying a soul unbloodied, and therefore unworthy."
msgstr "Самый грозный из магических коней, Райго превосходит своих нечестивых собратьев Готэна и Гингу и размерами, и свирепостью. Он не потерпит на себе того, чьи руки не запятнаны кровью: такой всадник недостоин его."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Sei wie das Pferd, frei von Zweifel und Hintergedanken!<br><i>Schwarzer Pferdeleutnant</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Raigo. Whether or not he heeds the call depends entirely on the number of bloodied laurels in your crown.
#. column 1: The most daunting of Mado horses, Raigo eclipses its unholy brethren Goten and Ginga in both size and ferocity. As such, the creature will not suffer the burden of carrying a soul unbloodied, and therefore unworthy.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:102:0:2"
msgid "Your inner horse,<br>my dear adventurer,<br>must be a steed of rare beauty.<br>   - Golden Uma Yoriki"
msgstr "Твой внутренний конь,<br>мой дорогой искатель приключений,<br>должно быть, редкой красоты.<br>   — Золотой ума-ёрики"

#. ja: ネロ専用魔導アーマーに騎乗する。<br>ネロ・トル・スカエウァ用にカスタマイズされた魔導アーマー
#. de: Rufe die Magitek-Kampfmaschine vom Typ „Roter Baron“ herbei, die eigens für Nero tol Scaeva entwickelt und gebaut worden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous l'armure magitek personnelle de Nero tol Scaeva.
#. column 1: Constantly modified and improved by Nero himself, this warmachina of Garlean construct barely resembles the suit issued to tol Scaeva on the day of his promotion to tribunus.
#. column 2: That mechanical monstrosity represented<br>a feat of engineering far beyond aught<br>Garlemald can presently achieve.<br>   - Cid
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:103:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle the Red Baron─Nero tol Scaeva's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor."
msgstr "Призвать Красного барона — боевую броню, созданную специально для Неро тол Скаева, а теперь и для <i>вас</i>."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍第XIV軍団幕僚長、ネロ・トル・スカエウァ用にカスタマイズされた魔導アーマー。優れた機工師でもあるネロ自身の手で、青燐機関の出力向上と足回りの強化が図られている。通称「レッドバロン」
#. de: Die Magitek-Kampfmaschine vom Typ „Roter Baron“ wurde speziell für Nero tol Scaeva, Tribunus der XIV. Legion des Garleischen Kaiserreichs, gebaut. Als versierter Maschinist hat Nero persönlich an der Optimierung des Erdseim-Antriebs mitgewirkt und im laufenden Betrieb ständig die Mechanik verbessert.
#. fr: Sans cesse modifiée et améliorée par Nero lui-même, cette machine de guerre garlemaldaise ressemble à peine à l'armure magitek reçue par tol Scaeva le jour de sa promotion au rang de commandant.
#. column 0: Call into battle the Red Baron─Nero tol Scaeva's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor.
#. column 2: That mechanical monstrosity represented<br>a feat of engineering far beyond aught<br>Garlemald can presently achieve.<br>   - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:103:0:1"
msgid "Constantly modified and improved by Nero himself, this warmachina of Garlean construct barely resembles the suit issued to tol Scaeva on the day of his promotion to tribunus."
msgstr "Неро постоянно переделывал и улучшал эту гарлеанскую боевую машину. Теперь она едва напоминает броню, которую ему выдали, когда он стал трибуном."

#. ja: シャー、シャー、シャー
#. de: Dieser mechanische Koloss<br>ist ein Wunderwerk der Technik!<br><i>Cid</i>
#. fr: Vuuuuiiiiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle the Red Baron─Nero tol Scaeva's custom-made battle armor, now <i>your</i> custom-made battle armor.
#. column 1: Constantly modified and improved by Nero himself, this warmachina of Garlean construct barely resembles the suit issued to tol Scaeva on the day of his promotion to tribunus.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:103:0:2"
msgid "That mechanical monstrosity represented<br>a feat of engineering far beyond aught<br>Garlemald can presently achieve.<br>   - Cid"
msgstr "Эта железная громадина —<br>инженерное чудо, какого<br>Гарлемальду пока не создать.<br>   — Сид"

#. ja: デモンラナーに騎乗する。<br>鬼神に祝福された大隼。先触れとして正義の執行を告げる
#. de: Rufe einen Dämonen-Lanner herbei. Er steht unter dem Schutz des grimmigen Gottes und ist der Vorbote vollstreckter Gerechtigkeit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture faucon zurvanique, béni par la divinité Zurvan.
#. column 1: The centaurs of ancient Meracydia believed that their mighty god Zurvan would send out his lanner before a battle to inform his enemies of their impending defeat.
#. column 2: Watched me like a<br>bloody hawk, he did.<br>   - Austere Adventurer
msgctxt "MountTransient:104:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Demonic lanner─a symbol of justice for the Zurvan-worshipping races which once thrived on the southern continent of Meracydia."
msgstr "Призовите демонического ланнера — символ справедливости для поклонявшихся Зурвану народов, некогда населявших южный континент Мерасидию."

#. ja: 鬼神「ズルワーン」による祝福を受け、燃え盛る鬼気をまとった大隼。南方大陸の人馬種族に伝わる神話によると、悪しき者との戦いに赴く際に、鬼神は先触れとして霊鳥を使わし、正義の執行を宣言するのだという
#. de: Diese Vögel stehen unter Zurvans Schutz. Uralten Legenden vom südlichen Kontinent Meracydia zufolge, schickt der grimmige Gott sie seinen Feinden als Vorboten des nahenden Urteils, das er selbst wenig später vollstreckt.
#. fr: D'après les légendes centaures du continent austral de Méracydia, Zurvan enverrait cet oiseau funeste avant de partir en guerre contre le mal afin d'annoncer l'imminence de son jugement.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Demonic lanner─a symbol of justice for the Zurvan-worshipping races which once thrived on the southern continent of Meracydia.
#. column 2: Watched me like a<br>bloody hawk, he did.<br>   - Austere Adventurer
msgctxt "MountTransient:104:0:1"
msgid "The centaurs of ancient Meracydia believed that their mighty god Zurvan would send out his lanner before a battle to inform his enemies of their impending defeat."
msgstr "Кентавры древней Мерасидии верили, что их могучий бог Зурван перед битвой посылает ланнера предупредить врагов о скором поражении."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich ertrage den durchdringenden Blick dieses höllischen Vogels nicht länger!<br><i>Ängstlicher Abenteurer</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Demonic lanner─a symbol of justice for the Zurvan-worshipping races which once thrived on the southern continent of Meracydia.
#. column 1: The centaurs of ancient Meracydia believed that their mighty god Zurvan would send out his lanner before a battle to inform his enemies of their impending defeat.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:104:0:2"
msgid "Watched me like a<br>bloody hawk, he did.<br>   - Austere Adventurer"
msgstr "Уставился на меня,<br>как ястреб, чтоб его.<br>   — Суровый искатель приключений"

#. ja: 鳳凰に騎乗する。<br>東方由来の魔笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣
#. de: Rufe einen Feuervogel herbei. Das legendäre Fabelwesen lässt sich mit einer Pfeife aus dem Fernen Osten herbeirufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Hôô, une créature légendaire venue des contrées orientales.
#. column 1: The Far East is home to numerous legends concerning birds of flame who sacrifice their lives to save the world, only to rise from the ashes of destruction to rule the skies once again. The Firebird is one of those legends...made a mount.
#. column 2: I was hoping for a fine bird.<br>   - Grimold
msgctxt "MountTransient:105:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Firebird. Not Phoenix. Definitely not Phoenix."
msgstr "Призовите феникса. Не Феникса. Точно не Феникса."

#. ja: 東方地域に伝わる幻獣。自らの命を太陽のごとく黄金に燃え盛らせ、その炎によって自らを焼き尽くしては、蘇るという不滅の伝説が語り継がれてきた。英雄の器を持つ者でなければ、呼び寄せることは叶わないという
#. de: Die Legenden aus dem Fernen Osten besagen, dass die Lebenskraft in diesem Fabelwesen heiß wie Feuer brennt, und dass er im Tode von seinen eigenen Flammen verzehrt wird, worauf er aus der eigenen Asche wieder neu ersteht. Es heißt, er erkenne nur einen wahren Helden als seinen Herrn an.
#. fr: Cet animal mythique, resplendit tel le soleil et consume son énergie vitale pour s'immoler par le feu, lui permettant ainsi de renaître de ses cendres. Seul un héros digne de lui serait en mesure de le chevaucher.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Firebird. Not Phoenix. Definitely not Phoenix.
#. column 2: I was hoping for a fine bird.<br>   - Grimold
msgctxt "MountTransient:105:0:1"
msgid "The Far East is home to numerous legends concerning birds of flame who sacrifice their lives to save the world, only to rise from the ashes of destruction to rule the skies once again. The Firebird is one of those legends...made a mount."
msgstr "На Дальнем Востоке ходит множество легенд о птицах, которые жертвуют собой ради спасения мира, а затем восстают из пепла и вновь правят небесами. Феникс — одна из таких легенд... сделанная верховым животным."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Von solch einem Vogel habe ich immer geträumt.<br><i>Grimold</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Firebird. Not Phoenix. Definitely not Phoenix.
#. column 1: The Far East is home to numerous legends concerning birds of flame who sacrifice their lives to save the world, only to rise from the ashes of destruction to rule the skies once again. The Firebird is one of those legends...made a mount.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:105:0:2"
msgid "I was hoping for a fine bird.<br>   - Grimold"
msgstr "Я-то надеялся на птицу получше.<br>   — Гримольд"

#. ja: エッグシステムに騎乗する。<br>空飛ぶ不思議な飾りタマゴ
#. de: Rufe ein Wundereisystem herbei. Ein komisches Wunderei, das fliegen kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez le Lévitœuf, qui comme son nom l'indique est un œuf capable de flotter dans les airs.
#. column 1: After learning of the latest of the Dreamer's visions─a giant floating ovoid delivering eggs to all the good boys and girls of the realm─Nonotta and friends literally scrambled to find a means of bringing her dream to life. All it required was a little aid from the Sons of Saint Coinach...and the remnants of some ancient Allagan technology.
#. column 2: Why do the Qiqirn suck eggs?<br>   - Acolyte Ba Go
msgctxt "MountTransient:106:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your eggshilaration system. Egg puns required for propulsion."
msgstr "Призовите яйцевосторгатор. Для движения необходимы каламбуры про яйца."

#. ja: 空飛ぶ不思議な飾りタマゴ。エッグハントの祝祭を成功に導くために、ノノッタたちがジリ・アリアポーが夢で見たというタマゴを再現するために造った。どうやら聖コイナク財団が発見した古代文明の遺物を改造したものらしい
#. de: Ein Nachbau des Wundereies, das Jihli Aliapoh im Traum erschien. Nonotta hat es geschaffen, um die Wundereiersuche zu einem erfolgreichen Abschluss zu führen. Es handelt sich wohl um ein umgebautes Relikt einer von der Sankt Coinach-Stiftung entdeckten, uralten Kultur.
#. fr: Ce drôle d'œuf est en réalité une machine volante conçue par Nonotta et ses amis afin de rejouer le rêve de Jihli Aliapoh. Il aurait été construit à partir de reliques ancestrales fournies par la Fondation de Saint-Coinach.
#. column 0: Call into battle your eggshilaration system. Egg puns required for propulsion.
#. column 2: Why do the Qiqirn suck eggs?<br>   - Acolyte Ba Go
msgctxt "MountTransient:106:0:1"
msgid "After learning of the latest of the Dreamer's visions─a giant floating ovoid delivering eggs to all the good boys and girls of the realm─Nonotta and friends literally scrambled to find a means of bringing her dream to life. All it required was a little aid from the Sons of Saint Coinach...and the remnants of some ancient Allagan technology."
msgstr "Узнав о новом видении Мечтательницы — огромном парящем яйце, разносящем подарки всем хорошим мальчикам и девочкам королевства, — Нонотта с друзьями буквально засуетились, чтобы воплотить её мечту. Им понадобилась лишь небольшая помощь исследователей Сынов святого Койнаха... и остатки древних аллаганских технологий."

#. ja: エッグラホ♪
#. de: Warum bloß schlürfen die Qiqirn so gerne Eier?<br><i>Ba Go</i>
#. fr: Un petit œuf, deux petits œufs...♪
#. column 0: Call into battle your eggshilaration system. Egg puns required for propulsion.
#. column 1: After learning of the latest of the Dreamer's visions─a giant floating ovoid delivering eggs to all the good boys and girls of the realm─Nonotta and friends literally scrambled to find a means of bringing her dream to life. All it required was a little aid from the Sons of Saint Coinach...and the remnants of some ancient Allagan technology.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:106:0:2"
msgid "Why do the Qiqirn suck eggs?<br>   - Acolyte Ba Go"
msgstr "Почему кикирны<br>сосут яйца?<br>   — Послушник Ба Го"

#. ja: ローン・ヘルハウンドに騎乗する。<br>異界ヴォイドに棲まう凶暴な魔獣。孤高の存在！
#. de: Rufe einen Höllenhund-Einzelgänger herbei. Dieses grausame Monster stammt aus dem Nichts. Es meidet Kontakt zu anderen seiner Art.
#. fr: Vous appelez un limier des enfers solitaire, une terrifiante créature du néant sans la moindre pitié ni compassion.
#. column 1: Having survived, alone, the hellish darkness that is the void, this demonic beast will not soon suffer the presence of others, choosing typically to attack before he himself becomes a victim. Which is why it is all the more surprising that the hound would allow someone on his back.
#. column 2: What in the seven unholy hells<br>are those gruesome things!?<br>   - Laraina
msgctxt "MountTransient:108:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lone hellhound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours."
msgstr "Призовите одинокого адского пса — порождение Пустоты, которое хранит верность только вам и вашим близким."

#. ja: 異界ヴォイドに棲まう凶暴な魔獣。どんな妖異にも従うことなく、たった一匹で危険な世界を生き抜いてきただけあって、その眼光は鋭い。背に跨がることを許されるのは、熱い闘気を放つ歴戦の猛者のみであろう
#. de: Dieses Wesen hat es geschafft, auf sich allein gestellt im Nichts zu überleben, ohne sich den Gefahren zu beugen, die wir als Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te fürchten. Es akzeptiert nur jene auf seinem Rücken, die sich in unzähligen Schlachten bewiesen haben.
#. fr: Ce redoutable molosse traîne d'ordinaire sa silhouette solitaire et menaçante le long des plaines hostiles du néant, où il ne doit sa survie qu'à son regard par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement perçant. Animal fier, il n'admet sur son dos que les âmes les plus farouches.
#. column 0: Summon forth your lone hellhound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 2: What in the seven unholy hells<br>are those gruesome things!?<br>   - Laraina
msgctxt "MountTransient:108:0:1"
msgid "Having survived, alone, the hellish darkness that is the void, this demonic beast will not soon suffer the presence of others, choosing typically to attack before he himself becomes a victim. Which is why it is all the more surprising that the hound would allow someone on his back."
msgstr "В одиночку пережив адскую тьму Пустоты, этот демон-зверь не терпит рядом чужаков и обычно нападает первым, чтобы самому не стать жертвой. Вот почему так удивительно, что пёс позволяет кому-то сесть себе на спину."

#. ja: グオーン！
#. de: Auf eigene Faust handeln ist viel zu gefährlich.<br>Ich verbiete dir hiermit, alleine zu helfen, kupo!<br><i>Mogloo</i>
#. fr: Grrraouaaar<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your lone hellhound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 1: Having survived, alone, the hellish darkness that is the void, this demonic beast will not soon suffer the presence of others, choosing typically to attack before he himself becomes a victim. Which is why it is all the more surprising that the hound would allow someone on his back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:108:0:2"
msgid "What in the seven unholy hells<br>are those gruesome things!?<br>   - Laraina"
msgstr "Семью преисподними, что это<br>за жуткие твари!?<br>   — Ларейна"

#. ja: パック・ヘルハウンドに騎乗する。<br>異界ヴォイドに棲まう凶暴な魔獣。群れのリーダー！
#. de: Rufe ein Höllenhund-Alphatier herbei. Dieses grausame Monster stammt aus dem Nichts. Es führt ein Rudel anderer Höllenhunde an.
#. fr: Vous appelez un limier des enfers de meute, une terreur canine crainte de tous y compris des créatures du néant.
#. column 1: Having commanded armies in the hellish darkness that is the void, this demonic beast will not soon submit at the feet of another. Which is why it is all the more surprising that the hound would allow someone on her back.
#. column 2: A good hound keeps<br>her maw shut.<br>   - Latata
msgctxt "MountTransient:109:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your pack hellhound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours."
msgstr "Призовите стайного адского пса — порождение Пустоты, которое хранит верность только вам и вашим близким."

#. ja: 異界ヴォイドに棲まう凶暴な魔獣。多くの魔獣を従えて、危険な世界で勝ち残ってきただけあって、他者を畏怖させる威圧感に満ちている。背に跨がることを許されるのは、冷たい殺気を放つ歴戦の猛者のみであろう
#. de: Dieses Wesen strahlt eine Aura des Schreckens aus, die es ihm ermöglicht, selbst im Nichts anderen seinen Willen aufzuzwingen. Es akzeptiert nur jene auf seinem Rücken, bei denen es eine Mordlust spürt, die seiner eigenen ebenbürtig ist.
#. fr: Originaire du néant, ce limier des enfers évolue d'ordinaire accompagné de la meute dont il est le chef. Survivant d'un monde impitoyable, sa seule présence suffit à instiller l'effroi chez ses ennemis. Ceux qui grimpent sur son dos ont en général autant soif de sang que lui.
#. column 0: Summon forth your pack hellhound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 2: A good hound keeps<br>her maw shut.<br>   - Latata
msgctxt "MountTransient:109:0:1"
msgid "Having commanded armies in the hellish darkness that is the void, this demonic beast will not soon submit at the feet of another. Which is why it is all the more surprising that the hound would allow someone on her back."
msgstr "Командуя целыми армиями в адской тьме Пустоты, этот демон-зверь вряд ли склонится перед кем-либо. Вот почему так удивительно, что пёс позволяет кому-то сесть себе на спину."

#. ja: ガオーン！
#. de: Hunderttausend heulende Höllenhunde!<br><i>Rostnsthal</i>
#. fr: Grrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your pack hellhound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 1: Having commanded armies in the hellish darkness that is the void, this demonic beast will not soon submit at the feet of another. Which is why it is all the more surprising that the hound would allow someone on her back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:109:0:2"
msgid "A good hound keeps<br>her maw shut.<br>   - Latata"
msgstr "Хороший пёс<br>пасть не раскрывает.<br>   — Латата"

#. ja: アルコンズ・チェアーに騎乗する。<br>プカプカと空中に浮かぶ不可思議な椅子
#. de: Rufe einen Exegeten-Thron herbei. Ob dich das zum Herrscher der Exegeten macht?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre chaise des Preux. Un siège aussi léger qu'une feuille de papier, capable de léviter.
#. column 1: Despite claims that it was once the chair of Louisoix Leveilleur, former residents of Sharlayan have confirmed that it is naught more than an ordinary furnishing enchanted by a Great Gubal Library bibliophile who was tired of not being able to reach the upper shelves.
#. column 2: There's a chair over there<br>just cryin' out to be sat on.<br>   - Baderon
msgctxt "MountTransient:110:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Archon throne. Don't call it a high chair."
msgstr "Призовите трон архонта. Только не называйте его детским стульчиком."

#. ja: プカプカと空中に浮かぶ不可思議な椅子。低地ドラヴァニアの植民都市シャーレアンの遺構から発見されたもの。どうやらグブラ幻想図書館にて、書棚の高所にある本を出し入れするために造られた魔具のひとつらしい
#. de: Angeblich soll dieser Stuhl Louisoix Leveilleur gehört haben, aber ehemalige Bewohner von Sharlayan haben bezeugt, dass es sich um ein verzaubertes Möbelstück aus der Großen Gubal-Bibliothek handelt, um leichter an die Bücher in den hohen Regalen zu gelangen.
#. fr: Cette étrange chaise volante fut découverte lors de fouilles conduites dans l'Arrière-pays dravanien à Sharlayan. On suppose qu'elle permettait aux visiteurs de la Grande bibliothèque de Gubal, parfois âgés, d'atteindre les ouvrages placés en haut des étagères sans effort.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Archon throne. Don't call it a high chair.
#. column 2: There's a chair over there<br>just cryin' out to be sat on.<br>   - Baderon
msgctxt "MountTransient:110:0:1"
msgid "Despite claims that it was once the chair of Louisoix Leveilleur, former residents of Sharlayan have confirmed that it is naught more than an ordinary furnishing enchanted by a Great Gubal Library bibliophile who was tired of not being able to reach the upper shelves."
msgstr "Несмотря на слухи, будто кресло принадлежало Луизуа Левейлёру, бывшие жители Шарлаяна подтвердили: это всего лишь обычная мебель, зачарованная любителем Большой библиотеки Губала, которому надоело не дотягиваться до верхних полок."

#. ja: ギシギシギシ…
#. de: Da, bitte, nimm doch Platz!<br><i> Baderon</i>
#. fr: Gniii... gniii... gniii...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Archon throne. Don't call it a high chair.
#. column 1: Despite claims that it was once the chair of Louisoix Leveilleur, former residents of Sharlayan have confirmed that it is naught more than an ordinary furnishing enchanted by a Great Gubal Library bibliophile who was tired of not being able to reach the upper shelves.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:110:0:2"
msgid "There's a chair over there<br>just cryin' out to be sat on.<br>   - Baderon"
msgstr "Вон там стул стоит,<br>так и просится, чтоб на него сели.<br>   — Бадерон"

#. ja: シルドラに騎乗する。<br>大洋に棲まうと伝えられる幻の海竜。やさしい子だね……
#. de: Rufe Syldra herbei. Sie würde dich jederzeit wieder retten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Syldra, un dragon de mer qui vit dans les profondeurs.
#. column 1: Legends say there once lived a kindly sea dragon who befriended a pirate, and that their friendship knew no bounds. This is not that sea dragon; however, with a little time and caring, who is to say that a similar relationship cannot be forged?<br>※Sea dragons have no relation to actual dragons.
#. column 2: I said, get off!<br>   - Faris
msgctxt "MountTransient:111:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Syldra. Even in death, she would want to help."
msgstr "Призовите Сильдру. Даже после смерти она хотела бы помочь."

#. ja: 大洋に棲まうと伝えられる幻の海竜。その姿は、友である女海賊のため、海賊船を牽引したとされる伝説の海竜に瓜ふたつ。ドラゴン族のように言葉を発することはできないが、友と認めた者とは心で通じ合うという
#. de: Längst vergessene Legenden berichten von einem Seedrachen, der mit einer Piratin befreundet war und ihr Schiff über die Meere zog. Dieser Begleiter hat nicht die gleiche Kraft, aber was nicht ist, kann ja noch werden.
#. fr: Il ne faut pas se fier aux apparences, ce monstre des mers est en fait très gentil. La légende veut que cette créature ressemble à une autre, qui s'était liée d'amitié avec une femme pirate et l'avait même aidée en tirant son bateau. À la différence des dragons, elle ne parle pas, mais elle deviendra peut-être une grande amie.
#. column 0: Summon forth Syldra. Even in death, she would want to help.
#. column 2: I said, get off!<br>   - Faris
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:111:0:1"
msgid "Legends say there once lived a kindly sea dragon who befriended a pirate, and that their friendship knew no bounds. This is not that sea dragon; however, with a little time and caring, who is to say that a similar relationship cannot be forged?<br>※Sea dragons have no relation to actual dragons."
msgstr "Легенды гласят, что когда-то жил добрый морской дракон, подружившийся с пираткой. Их дружбе не было границ. Но это не он. А кто знает, вдруг со временем и заботой удастся завести такого же друга?<br>※Морские драконы не имеют отношения к настоящим драконам."

#. ja: サンダーストーム！
#. de: Ich sagte, lasst mich los! Syldra!!!<br><i>Faris</i>
#. fr: Grrraouaaar<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Syldra. Even in death, she would want to help.
#. column 1: Legends say there once lived a kindly sea dragon who befriended a pirate, and that their friendship knew no bounds. This is not that sea dragon; however, with a little time and caring, who is to say that a similar relationship cannot be forged?<br>※Sea dragons have no relation to actual dragons.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:111:0:2"
msgid "I said, get off!<br>   - Faris"
msgstr "Я сказала, слезь!<br>   — Фарис"

#. ja: ファルコン号に騎乗する。<br>単座の小型飛空艇。目指すは世界最速！
#. de: Rufe den <i>Falken</i> herbei, das (inoffiziell) schnellste einsitzige Luftschiff von ganz Eorzea.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mini aéronef Faucon, un véhicule monoplace conçu pour se déplacer plus vite.
#. column 1: An independent project of Garlond Ironworks engineer Wedge, this single-rider airship allegedly recorded some of the fastest flight speeds ever...until a tragic accident following an attempt to see how high the ship could soar convinced its creator that perhaps a modicum of restraint was necessary.
#. column 2: All you have to do<br>is follow the falcon.<br>He knows where to go.<br>   - Baurendouin de Haillenarte
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:112:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle the <i>Falcon</i>, (unofficially) the fastest single-rider airship ever built in Eorzea."
msgstr "Призовите <i>Сокола</i> — неофициально самого быстрого одноместного воздушного судна в истории Эорзеи."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社製の小型試作飛空艇。同社に所属する気鋭の機工師、ウェッジが単座式飛空艇世界最速を目指して開発した。だが、限界に挑むテスト飛行にて墜落。現在はリミッターが付けられている
#. de: Wedge von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken begann die Konstruktion am <i>Falken</i> als Hobbyprojekt. Nachdem er sämtliche Ge<shy>schwindig<shy>keitsrekorde brach, kam es bei dem Versuch, die maximale Flughöhe auszuloten, zu einem tragischen Unfall. Seitdem lässt der Konstrukteur etwas mehr Bescheidenheit walten.
#. fr: Ce prototype est né dans les ateliers des Forges de Garlond. Wedge, un machiniste assez énergique, n'en pouvait plus des aéronefs lents, ce qui l'a poussé à concevoir ce petit modèle monoplace. Cet appareil est cependant bridé, car un autre prototype est allé si vite qu'il a fini par s'écraser.
#. column 0: Call into battle the <i>Falcon</i>, (unofficially) the fastest single-rider airship ever built in Eorzea.
#. column 2: All you have to do<br>is follow the falcon.<br>He knows where to go.<br>   - Baurendouin de Haillenarte
msgctxt "MountTransient:112:0:1"
msgid "An independent project of Garlond Ironworks engineer Wedge, this single-rider airship allegedly recorded some of the fastest flight speeds ever...until a tragic accident following an attempt to see how high the ship could soar convinced its creator that perhaps a modicum of restraint was necessary."
msgstr "Этот одноместный дирижабль — личный проект инженера Веджа из Гарлондских мастерских. Говорят, он развил одну из самых высоких скоростей среди летательных аппаратов... пока трагическая авария во время испытания высоты не убедила создателя: пожалуй, стоит быть посдержаннее."

#. ja: ファルコン号浮上！
#. de: Ich hab's dir doch gesagt. Es ist das schnellste Luftschiff der Welt.<br><i>Setzer Gabbiani</i>
#. fr: Bzzzzz...
#. column 0: Call into battle the <i>Falcon</i>, (unofficially) the fastest single-rider airship ever built in Eorzea.
#. column 1: An independent project of Garlond Ironworks engineer Wedge, this single-rider airship allegedly recorded some of the fastest flight speeds ever...until a tragic accident following an attempt to see how high the ship could soar convinced its creator that perhaps a modicum of restraint was necessary.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:112:0:2"
msgid "All you have to do<br>is follow the falcon.<br>He knows where to go.<br>   - Baurendouin de Haillenarte"
msgstr "Просто следуй<br>за соколом.<br>Он знает дорогу.<br>   — Борендюэн де Эйнхарт"

#. ja: ローン・フェイハウンドに騎乗する。<br>異界ヴォイドに棲まう凶暴な魔獣。孤高の存在！
#. de: Rufe einen Feenhund-Einzelgänger herbei. Dieses grausame Monster stammt aus dem Nichts. Es meidet Kontakt zu anderen seiner Art.
#. fr: Vous appelez un limier fantasmagorique solitaire, une créature du néant par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement violente que seuls les plus téméraires se risquent à dompter.
#. column 1: Covered from muzzle to tail in an otherworldly silver coat, the faehound appears more akin to something out of a faerie tale than from the nether-reaches of the void. Yet do not be fooled by the beast's appearance, for he is an equal in strength to all but the highest ranking voidsent, his heart swollen with savagery from a lifetime hunting alone.
#. column 2: Dogs is loyal.<br>   - Latata
msgctxt "MountTransient:113:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lone faehound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours."
msgstr "Призовите одинокого фей-пса — порождение Пустоты, которое хранит верность только вам и вашим близким."

#. ja: 異界ヴォイドに棲まう獰猛な魔獣。銀色に輝く毛並みは獲物の血で染まり、妖しい色合いを帯びている。一匹狼として危険な世界を渡り歩いてきたが、熱い闘気を放つ歴戦の猛者には、背に跨がることを許すという
#. de: Dieses Wesen stammt aus dem Nichts und sein silbern glänzendes Fell ist oft mit dem Blut seiner Opfer besudelt, was ihm ein wahrhaft gespenstisches Aussehen verleiht. Es durchstreift die Welt wie ein einsamer Wolf und duldet nur jene auf seinem Rücken, die eine flammende Kampfeslust versprühen.
#. fr: Ce chien enragé venu tout droit du néant arbore d'inquiétants reflets pourpres sur son pelage argenté, en réalité des traces de sang de ses proies passées. Du genre solitaire, il ne reconnaît comme maîtres que les guerriers les plus acharnés.
#. column 0: Summon forth your lone faehound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 2: Dogs is loyal.<br>   - Latata
msgctxt "MountTransient:113:0:1"
msgid "Covered from muzzle to tail in an otherworldly silver coat, the faehound appears more akin to something out of a faerie tale than from the nether-reaches of the void. Yet do not be fooled by the beast's appearance, for he is an equal in strength to all but the highest ranking voidsent, his heart swollen with savagery from a lifetime hunting alone."
msgstr "С головы до хвоста фей-пёс покрыт серебристой шерстью, и больше похож на сказочное существо, чем на чудовище из глубин Пустоты. Но не обманывайтесь его видом: по силе ему уступают лишь самые могущественные пусторожденные. За долгие годы одиночной охоты его сердце переполнилось свирепостью."

#. ja: グオーン！
#. de: Graouuuh!
#. fr: Graouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your lone faehound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 1: Covered from muzzle to tail in an otherworldly silver coat, the faehound appears more akin to something out of a faerie tale than from the nether-reaches of the void. Yet do not be fooled by the beast's appearance, for he is an equal in strength to all but the highest ranking voidsent, his heart swollen with savagery from a lifetime hunting alone.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:113:0:2"
msgid "Dogs is loyal.<br>   - Latata"
msgstr "Псы верны.<br>   — Латата"

#. ja: パック・フェイハウンドに騎乗する。<br>異界ヴォイドに棲まう凶暴な魔獣。群れのリーダー！
#. de: Rufe ein Feenhund-Alphatier herbei. Dieses grausame Monster stammt aus dem Nichts. Es führt ein Rudel anderer Feenhunde an.
#. fr: Vous appelez un limier fantasmagorique de meute, un imposant molosse à la fois meneur et tueur né.
#. column 1: Covered from muzzle to tail in an otherworldly silver coat, the faehound appears more akin to something out of a faerie tale than from the nether-reaches of the void. Yet do not be fooled by the beast's appearance, for she is an equal in strength to all but the highest ranking voidsent, her heart swollen with savagery from a lifetime leading a pack of her own.
#. column 2: Are you inclined to<br>think them faerie tales?<br>   - Alberic
msgctxt "MountTransient:114:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your pack faehound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours."
msgstr "Призовите стайного фей-пса — порождение Пустоты, которое хранит верность только вам и вашим близким."

#. ja: 異界ヴォイドに棲まう獰猛な魔獣。銀色に輝く毛並みは深い闇で染まり、不気味な色合いを帯びている。群れの長として危険な世界を渡り歩いてきたが、冷たい殺気を放つ歴戦の猛者には、背に跨がることを許すという
#. de: Dieses Wesen stammt aus dem Nichts und fällt durch die dunklen Schattierungen auf seinem silbern glänzenden Fell auf, die es wahrhaft unheilvoll wirken lassen. Dieses Exemplar hat sich lange als Anführer eines Rudels durchgebissen und lässt nur kampf-<br>erprobte Recken auf seinen Rücken.
#. fr: L'instinct meurtrier de cette bête sauvage venue du néant est si fort que son pelage dégage une aura ténébreuse, ce qui ne manque pas d'inspirer la crainte dans les rangs de sa meute. Pour grimper sur son dos, il faut être capable de tuer de sang-froid.
#. column 0: Summon forth your pack faehound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 2: Are you inclined to<br>think them faerie tales?<br>   - Alberic
msgctxt "MountTransient:114:0:1"
msgid "Covered from muzzle to tail in an otherworldly silver coat, the faehound appears more akin to something out of a faerie tale than from the nether-reaches of the void. Yet do not be fooled by the beast's appearance, for she is an equal in strength to all but the highest ranking voidsent, her heart swollen with savagery from a lifetime leading a pack of her own."
msgstr "С головы до хвоста фей-пёс покрыт серебристой шерстью, и больше похож на сказочное существо, чем на чудовище из глубин Пустоты. Но не обманывайтесь его видом: по силе ей уступают лишь самые могущественные пусторожденные. За долгие годы во главе собственной стаи её сердце переполнилось свирепостью."

#. ja: ガオーン！
#. de: Grrr ... Grrr ...
#. fr: Grrr... Grrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your pack faehound, void-spawned aberration loyal to none save you and yours.
#. column 1: Covered from muzzle to tail in an otherworldly silver coat, the faehound appears more akin to something out of a faerie tale than from the nether-reaches of the void. Yet do not be fooled by the beast's appearance, for she is an equal in strength to all but the highest ranking voidsent, her heart swollen with savagery from a lifetime leading a pack of her own.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:114:0:2"
msgid "Are you inclined to<br>think them faerie tales?<br>   - Alberic"
msgstr "Ты и правда считаешь,<br>что это сказки?<br>   — Альберик"

#. ja: 美のカムイに騎乗する。<br>美神に祝福された大狼。美しく天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen gepflegten Kamuy herbei. Der gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy de la grâce, une créature bénie par une déesse à la beauté envoûtante.
#. column 1: Believe it or not, this monstrous canine did not always glow, only achieving its heavenly effulgence upon receiving the blessing of Lakshmi after being offered to the Lady of Bliss by her loyal Ananta dreamers.
#. column 2: This is no lone<br>coywolf you'll be facing.<br>   - Hetzkin
msgctxt "MountTransient:115:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your blissful kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics."
msgstr "Призовите блаженного камуи — благословенного волка, которому неведомы такие телесные законы, как гравитация и аэродинамика."

#. ja: 美神「ラクシュミ」による祝福を受け、高貴なる光をまとった大狼。おそらくアナンタ族が大狼を蛮神に供物として捧げた結果、誕生したものと思われる
#. de: Der einst gewöhnliche Wolf, den die Ananta ihrem Primae Lakshmi opfern wollten, wurde von der Gottheit mit besonderen Kräften ausgestattet.
#. fr: Certaines personnes pensent que ce loup serait en fait une créature ordinaire que les Anantas auraient tenté de donner en offrande à leur déesse, et qui aurait été touché par la grâce de Lakshmi.
#. column 0: Summon forth your blissful kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 2: This is no lone<br>coywolf you'll be facing.<br>   - Hetzkin
msgctxt "MountTransient:115:0:1"
msgid "Believe it or not, this monstrous canine did not always glow, only achieving its heavenly effulgence upon receiving the blessing of Lakshmi after being offered to the Lady of Bliss by her loyal Ananta dreamers."
msgstr "Верите или нет, этот здоровенный пёс не всегда сиял. Небесное сияние он обрёл, когда Лакшми благословила его, подношение верных мечтателей-ананта, преподнесённое Владычице блаженства."

#. ja: ワォーン！
#. de: Du bist schon ganz begeistert, dem Rudel<br>zu zeigen, wer hier das Alphatier ist?<br><i>Berkoeya</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your blissful kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 1: Believe it or not, this monstrous canine did not always glow, only achieving its heavenly effulgence upon receiving the blessing of Lakshmi after being offered to the Lady of Bliss by her loyal Ananta dreamers.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:115:0:2"
msgid "This is no lone<br>coywolf you'll be facing.<br>   - Hetzkin"
msgstr "Тут тебе не одинокий<br>койот попадётся.<br>   — Хетцкин"

#. ja: 豪のカムイに騎乗する。<br>豪神に祝福された大狼。猛々しく天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen verspielten Kamuy herbei. Der gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy de la splendeur, une créature féroce bénie par un kami opulent et fort.
#. column 1: Upon receiving from his Kojin worshipers the offering of a sad, orphaned wolf pup, Susano proceeded to grant him the gift of flight, as well as an impressive coat of glowing fur, that he might be worthy of the revel.
#. column 2: I ain't got words to mince with<br>whelps...unless that is, you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>   - Curious Gorge
msgctxt "MountTransient:116:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your reveling kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics."
msgstr "Призовите буйного камуи — благословенного волка, которому неведомы такие телесные законы, как гравитация и аэродинамика."

#. ja: 豪神「スサノオ」による祝福を受け、豪放なる気をまとった大狼。おそらくコウジン族が大狼を蛮神に供物として捧げた結果、誕生したものと思われる
#. de: Der einst gewöhnliche Wolf, der dem Primae Susano geopfert werden sollte, wurde von der Gottheit mit besonderen Kräften ausgestattet.
#. fr: On raconte que cette créature magnanime aurait été touchée par la splendeur de Susano le jour où les Kojin avaient cherché à la donner en offrande à leur kami.
#. column 0: Summon forth your reveling kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 2: I ain't got words to mince with<br>whelps...unless that is, you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>   - Curious Gorge
msgctxt "MountTransient:116:0:1"
msgid "Upon receiving from his Kojin worshipers the offering of a sad, orphaned wolf pup, Susano proceeded to grant him the gift of flight, as well as an impressive coat of glowing fur, that he might be worthy of the revel."
msgstr "Получив в дар от почитателей-кодзинов несчастного осиротевшего волчонка, Сусано одарил его способностью летать и роскошной сияющей шерстью, чтобы тот достоин был празднества."

#. ja: ウォーン！
#. de: Mein Magen knurrt wie ein<br> Rudel Wölfe bei Vollmond!<br><i>Gegeruju</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your reveling kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 1: Upon receiving from his Kojin worshipers the offering of a sad, orphaned wolf pup, Susano proceeded to grant him the gift of flight, as well as an impressive coat of glowing fur, that he might be worthy of the revel.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:116:0:2"
msgid "I ain't got words to mince with<br>whelps...unless that is, you're<br>here to become a wolf.<br>   - Curious Gorge"
msgstr "Не стану я подбирать слов<br>для щенков... разве что ты<br>сам хочешь стать волком.<br>   — Любопытное Ущелье"

#. ja: 魔導プレデターに騎乗する。<br>格闘アームを備えた次期主力魔導アーマー
#. de: Rufe deinen Magitek-Prädator herbei und stampf drauf los.
#. fr: Vous appelez un prédateur magitek, une machine dotée de bras qui lui permettent de se battre.
#. column 1: Predator series warmachina were originally designed to improve magitek reaper killing potential via the addition of close-quarter weaponry. While the extra firepower led to a higher kill ratio, the weight it added hampered maneuverability. This unique model appears to have had its weapons removed and replaced with an experimental propulsion engine.
#. column 2: I ain't got time to bleed.<br>   - Ancient Adage
msgctxt "MountTransient:121:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek predator, and have you some fun."
msgstr "Призовите магитех-хищника — и повеселитесь от души."

#. ja: アラミゴ城郭内に放棄されていた魔導プレデター。「リーパー」を原形に、接近戦能力と生産性を向上させたタイプだが、この機体は武装をオミットすることで、余剰出力を飛行機能に割り当てた、試作モデルのようだ
#. de: Die Prädator-Kampf<shy>maschinen sind eine Fortentwicklung der Schlitzer-Serie. Die verbesserte Feuerkraft hat einen Verlust an Beweglichkeit zum Preis. Dieses Modell hat keine Waffen, dafür einen experimentellen Antrieb mit hohem Verpuffungsdurchlauf.
#. fr: Cet appareil a été abandonné dans l'enceinte du château d'Ala Mhigo. Il s'agit d'un prototype de modèle “faucheuse” amélioré, qui aurait dû être facile à produire et idéal pour le combat rapproché, mais le fuselage ne comporte pas d'armement et a été remplacé par un système de propulsion qui lui permet de voler.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek predator, and have you some fun.
#. column 2: I ain't got time to bleed.<br>   - Ancient Adage
msgctxt "MountTransient:121:0:1"
msgid "Predator series warmachina were originally designed to improve magitek reaper killing potential via the addition of close-quarter weaponry. While the extra firepower led to a higher kill ratio, the weight it added hampered maneuverability. This unique model appears to have had its weapons removed and replaced with an experimental propulsion engine."
msgstr "Боевые машины серии «Хищник» создавали, чтобы усилить смертоносность магитех-жнецов, снабдив их оружием для ближнего боя. Дополнительная огневая мощь повысила число убийств, но утяжелила машину и снизила её манёвренность. Похоже, у этой модели сняли оружие и установили экспериментальный двигатель."

#. ja: ガシャン、ガシャン！
#. de: Knatter, knatter, knatter ...
#. fr: Klonk... Klonk...
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek predator, and have you some fun.
#. column 1: Predator series warmachina were originally designed to improve magitek reaper killing potential via the addition of close-quarter weaponry. While the extra firepower led to a higher kill ratio, the weight it added hampered maneuverability. This unique model appears to have had its weapons removed and replaced with an experimental propulsion engine.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:121:0:2"
msgid "I ain't got time to bleed.<br>   - Ancient Adage"
msgstr "Мне некогда истекать кровью.<br>   — Старая поговорка"

#. ja: バトルライオンに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍獅子。専用の獣甲冑で身を包む
#. de: Rufe deinen vollgepanzerten Kampflöwen herbei, der dich mit kraftvollem Brüllen in den Kampf trägt!
#. fr: Vous appelez un lion de combat, couvert d'une solide armure pour le protéger en cas d'attaque.
#. column 1: There was a time when members of Ul'dah's elite Sultansworn strode the Steps of Nald and Thal atop silver-plated lions, striking fear and awe into the mewling masses. An effort to return to those days of glory has seen the summoning of several of Thavnair's most prominent beast tamers to the Rose of the Desert.
#. column 2: Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga
msgctxt "MountTransient:122:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your battle lion, fully armored to protect the majestic beast from the dangers of close combat."
msgstr "Призовите боевого льва в полных доспехах, защищающих величественного зверя в опасной схватке."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍獅子。ウルダハの近衛兵団「銀冑団」が、かつての伝統を復活させ、騎獣として採用したもの。近東のサベネアから招かれた獣使いの手で調教されており、完璧な所作を身に付けている
#. de: Kampflöwen waren die bevorzugten Reittiere der uld'hischen Palastwache und ihre die Wüstensonne gleißend hell reflektierende Rüstung ihr gefürchtetes Markenzeichen. Heute werden Tierführer aus Thavnair angeworben, um die Tradition wiederzubeleben.
#. fr: Les casques d'argent d'Ul'dah s'entouraient autrefois de lions comme celui-ci, mais la pratique ayant disparu, ils se sont adressés à des dresseurs de l'île proche-orientale de Thavnair pour les aider à dompter ce magnifique animal.
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle lion, fully armored to protect the majestic beast from the dangers of close combat.
#. column 2: Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga
msgctxt "MountTransient:122:0:1"
msgid "There was a time when members of Ul'dah's elite Sultansworn strode the Steps of Nald and Thal atop silver-plated lions, striking fear and awe into the mewling masses. An effort to return to those days of glory has seen the summoning of several of Thavnair's most prominent beast tamers to the Rose of the Desert."
msgstr "Было время, когда элитные султанские гвардейцы Ульды разъезжали по ступеням Нальда и Тала на львах в серебряной броне, внушая страх и трепет простолюдинам. Чтобы вернуть былую славу, в Пустынную розу пригласили лучших укротителей зверей из Тавнаира."

#. ja: ガオォォォ！！
#. de: Polieren! Poliert die Rüstung, bis sie<br>hell wie die Sonne strahlt!<br><i>Palastwachen-Gardist Aubelet</i>
#. fr: Groar<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle lion, fully armored to protect the majestic beast from the dangers of close combat.
#. column 1: There was a time when members of Ul'dah's elite Sultansworn strode the Steps of Nald and Thal atop silver-plated lions, striking fear and awe into the mewling masses. An effort to return to those days of glory has seen the summoning of several of Thavnair's most prominent beast tamers to the Rose of the Desert.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:122:0:2"
msgid "Bright as a lamp,<br>brave as a lion.<br>   - Haermaga"
msgstr "Яркий, как лампа,<br>смелый, как лев.<br>   — Хаэрмага"

#. ja: バトルベアーに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍熊。専用の獣甲冑で身を包む
#. de: Rufe deinen vollgepanzerten Kampfbären herbei, der dich mit donnernden Schritten in den Kampf trägt!
#. fr: Vous appelez un ours de combat, couvert d'une solide armure pour le protéger en cas d'attaque.
#. column 1: The bears of Abalathia's Spine are not known to suffer the presence of man in their territory, let alone allow one to mount their backs and command them hither and yon. Then what, pray tell, has come over this particular specimen? Perhaps one look into your inner beast convinced the creature that submission spelled survival.
#. column 2: We're after a bear this time!?<br>Oh boy, this should be fun!<br>   - Enion
msgctxt "MountTransient:123:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your battle bear, fully armored to protect the savage beast from singeing its lustrous fur on the smoldering carnage left in its wake."
msgstr "Призовите боевого медведя в полных доспехах, которые уберегут его роскошную шерсть от искр пылающих развалин, оставленных им за собой."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍熊。北アバラシア山脈のヌシとも呼ばれた存在だが、原初の力を手懐けた真の戦士に対しては、視線を交わしただけで従うという。野生の直感にて、一瞬にして上下関係を受け入れるのだろう
#. de: Die Bären in Abalathias Rückgrat sind nicht für ihre Neigung bekannt, als Reittiere zu dienen. Das dieses Exemplar sich dennoch dazu überreden ließ, muss an deinem unwiderstehlichen Charme liegen.
#. fr: Ce spécimen appartiendrait à la terrible race des ours qui vivent dans les montagnes septentrionales d'Abalathia. On raconte qu'il n'obéit qu'aux guerriers dont il a pu lire la force dans le regard. Ceux qui montent cette créature peuvent être fiers, car rares sont les ours d'Abalathia qui se laissent dominer par des humains.
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle bear, fully armored to protect the savage beast from singeing its lustrous fur on the smoldering carnage left in its wake.
#. column 2: We're after a bear this time!?<br>Oh boy, this should be fun!<br>   - Enion
msgctxt "MountTransient:123:0:1"
msgid "The bears of Abalathia's Spine are not known to suffer the presence of man in their territory, let alone allow one to mount their backs and command them hither and yon. Then what, pray tell, has come over this particular specimen? Perhaps one look into your inner beast convinced the creature that submission spelled survival."
msgstr "Медведи Хребта Абалатии не терпят людей на своей территории, не говоря уже о том, чтобы позволить кому-то оседлать себя и помыкать ими. Так что же случилось с этим экземпляром? Быть может, одного взгляда на вашего внутреннего зверя хватило, чтобы он понял: покорность — залог выживания."

#. ja: グオオオーッ！
#. de: Bauch von Muna Vanu-ooh wird vor Vorfreude<br>knurren wie Bär in Höhle.<br><i>Luna Vanu</i>
#. fr: Graaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle bear, fully armored to protect the savage beast from singeing its lustrous fur on the smoldering carnage left in its wake.
#. column 1: The bears of Abalathia's Spine are not known to suffer the presence of man in their territory, let alone allow one to mount their backs and command them hither and yon. Then what, pray tell, has come over this particular specimen? Perhaps one look into your inner beast convinced the creature that submission spelled survival.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:123:0:2"
msgid "We're after a bear this time!?<br>Oh boy, this should be fun!<br>   - Enion"
msgstr "В этот раз мы охотимся на медведя!?<br>Вот это будет весело!<br>   — Энион"

#. ja: バトルパンサーに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍豹。専用の獣甲冑で身を包む
#. de: Rufe deinen vollgepanzerten Kampfpanther herbei, der dich mit wehenden Maulbarteln in den Kampf trägt!
#. fr: Vous appelez une panthère de combat, couverte d'une solide armure pour la protéger en cas d'attaque.
#. column 1: History tells us that no dark hero's story is complete without the companionship of a wily panther. Their sable coat, their savage nature, their attunement with the umbral, their thirst for blood. It is as if the gods created these creatures in the image of a dark knight...or perhaps it was the other way around.
#. column 2: If you help me out, I will<br>tell you more about my<br>feline friend here.<br>   - Hinoshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:124:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your battle panther, fully armored to protect the stealthy beast from the occasional poison dart, poison arrow, poison-tipped spear, poison spell, and any poison words directed its way."
msgstr "Призовите боевую пантеру в полных доспехах, которые защитят скрытного зверя от случайного отравленного дротика, отравленной стрелы, отравленного копья, ядовитого заклинания и любых ядовитых слов в её адрес."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍豹。本能的に魔力を操るパンサーは、暗黒騎士にとって、自然界の師とも言える存在である。歴代の暗黒騎士の中には、黒き獣を友として、影のように走り、正義の遂行を行った者もいるらしい
#. de: Nichts schmückt einen Helden der Dunkelheit mehr als ein Panther an seiner Seite. Der unzähmbare Überlebensinstinkt, die blutdürstige Kehle, das lichtschluckende Fell<nbsp>- dieses Tier ist eine pechschwarze Killermaschine.
#. fr: Ces panthères, capables de manipuler d'instinct la magie, règneraient selon certains sur toute créature dans la nature. Les chevaliers noirs s'en entouraient pour se déplacer en toute discrétion et faire régner la justice dans l'ombre.
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle panther, fully armored to protect the stealthy beast from the occasional poison dart, poison arrow, poison-tipped spear, poison spell, and any poison words directed its way.
#. column 2: If you help me out, I will<br>tell you more about my<br>feline friend here.<br>   - Hinoshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:124:0:1"
msgid "History tells us that no dark hero's story is complete without the companionship of a wily panther. Their sable coat, their savage nature, their attunement with the umbral, their thirst for blood. It is as if the gods created these creatures in the image of a dark knight...or perhaps it was the other way around."
msgstr "В истории любого тёмного героя непременно есть хитрая пантера. Чёрная шерсть, свирепый нрав, связь с тьмой, жажда крови... Словно боги создали этих зверей по образу тёмного рыцаря. Или, может, всё было наоборот."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Miau, miau ♪<br><i>Schwarze Katze</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle panther, fully armored to protect the stealthy beast from the occasional poison dart, poison arrow, poison-tipped spear, poison spell, and any poison words directed its way.
#. column 1: History tells us that no dark hero's story is complete without the companionship of a wily panther. Their sable coat, their savage nature, their attunement with the umbral, their thirst for blood. It is as if the gods created these creatures in the image of a dark knight...or perhaps it was the other way around.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:124:0:2"
msgid "If you help me out, I will<br>tell you more about my<br>feline friend here.<br>   - Hinoshin"
msgstr "Поможешь мне —<br>расскажу побольше<br>о моей кошке.<br>   — Хиносин"

#. ja: ヨルに騎乗する。<br>アジムステップに棲まう怪鳥。ゼラの戦士の証
#. de: Rufe deinen Yol herbei. Die Raubvögel gestatten nur echten Kriegern der Xaela, auf ihnen zu reiten.
#. fr: Vous appelez un yol, un oiseau de la Steppe d'Azim que les guerriers xaela domptent pour prouver leur valeur.
#. column 1: High atop the granite peaks of Othard's Fanged Crescent do the yol claim their demesne, descending to the Azim Steppe to prey upon warriors who pretend not to fear the monsters of their ancestor's tales. Rare indeed is it that a yol might cede its back to man, though to those who have proved their mettle, the creatures have been known to make exception.
#. column 2: I must have faith in<br>myself and my yol...<br>   - Zealous Mol Warrior
msgctxt "MountTransient:125:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your yol, proof of your recognition by the Azim Steppe Xaela as a true warrior."
msgstr "Summon — знак того, что зайла из Степи Азим признали вас настоящим воином. Призовите его."

#. ja: アジムステップの山岳部に棲まう怪鳥。バルダム覇道を縄張りとしており、訪れる者を狩ろうとする。非常に獰猛な猛禽ではあるが、実力を認めた者に対しては、狩りの友として背に乗せることを認めるのだという
#. de: Wie Blitze stürzen die Yol auf die Krieger herab, die sich einreden, keine Angst vor den Raubvögeln zu haben. Wer Bardams Probe bestanden hat, den tragen die Yol auf ihrem Rücken empor<nbsp>- die anderen in ihren messerscharfen Krallen.
#. fr: Un oiseau gigantesque qui vit dans la partie montagneuse de la Steppe d'Azim. Il niche à la Force de Bardam et attaque quiconque s'introduit sur son territoire. C'est un oiseau de proie féroce, mais il sait reconnaître la valeur de certains humains et accepte même de les laisser grimper sur son dos.
#. column 0: Summon forth your yol, proof of your recognition by the Azim Steppe Xaela as a true warrior.
#. column 2: I must have faith in<br>myself and my yol...<br>   - Zealous Mol Warrior
msgctxt "MountTransient:125:0:1"
msgid "High atop the granite peaks of Othard's Fanged Crescent do the yol claim their demesne, descending to the Azim Steppe to prey upon warriors who pretend not to fear the monsters of their ancestor's tales. Rare indeed is it that a yol might cede its back to man, though to those who have proved their mettle, the creatures have been known to make exception."
msgstr "Ёлы обитают высоко в гранитных вершинах Клыкастого полумесяца Отарда, а на Степь Азим спускаются охотиться на воинов, которые делают вид, будто не боятся чудовищ из сказаний предков. Ёл крайне редко позволяет человеку сесть себе на спину, но для тех, кто доказал свою доблесть, делает исключение."

#. ja: …………
#. de: I-Ich habe keine Angst. Von einem Yol<br>bin ich noch nie heruntergeflogen!<br><i>Heißblütiger Mol-Krieger</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your yol, proof of your recognition by the Azim Steppe Xaela as a true warrior.
#. column 1: High atop the granite peaks of Othard's Fanged Crescent do the yol claim their demesne, descending to the Azim Steppe to prey upon warriors who pretend not to fear the monsters of their ancestor's tales. Rare indeed is it that a yol might cede its back to man, though to those who have proved their mettle, the creatures have been known to make exception.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:125:0:2"
msgid "I must have faith in<br>myself and my yol...<br>   - Zealous Mol Warrior"
msgstr "Надо верить в себя<br>и своего ёла...<br>   — Воин мол, полный рвения"

#. ja: アルテ・ロイテに騎乗する。<br>オメガによって創造された疑似生物
#. de: Rufe Alte Roite, den legendären Drachen, herbei!
#. fr: Vous appelez un Alte Roite, une créature de synthèse née d'Oméga.
#. column 1: While none can be certain the exact intentions of a self-aware interdimensional construct, logic suggests this winged aberration is a reimagination of Alte Roite─a legendary wizard who is said could take the shape of a dragon at will.
#. column 2: That knowledge is my ticket<br>straight to glory. I can't go<br>telling any old person about it.<br>   - Bonifoix
msgctxt "MountTransient:126:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Alte Roite, fantastical ur-being generated by Omega within the Deltascape."
msgstr "Призовите Альте Ройте — фантастическое первосущество, созданное Омегой в Дельтаскейпе."

#. ja: オメガによって創造された疑似生物。その名は、とある古典小説に登場する老魔道士のものと一致する。竜のような姿に変化するという記述もあることから、その姿を模して創造されたものと推測されるが……
#. de: Eine von Omega erschaffene, künstliche Lebensform. Die Herkunft des Namens ist nicht eindeutig geklärt, doch in uralten Heldenerzählungen finden sich Hinweise auf einen alten Magier, der sich in einen Drachen verwandeln konnte und Omega als Inspiration gedient haben könnte.
#. fr: Cette créature tiendrait son nom d'un vieux mage qui apparaît dans un roman classique. Il aurait même été créé à son image, car le vieil homme pouvait en effet se changer en monstre.
#. column 0: Summon forth Alte Roite, fantastical ur-being generated by Omega within the Deltascape.
#. column 2: That knowledge is my ticket<br>straight to glory. I can't go<br>telling any old person about it.<br>   - Bonifoix
msgctxt "MountTransient:126:0:1"
msgid "While none can be certain the exact intentions of a self-aware interdimensional construct, logic suggests this winged aberration is a reimagination of Alte Roite─a legendary wizard who is said could take the shape of a dragon at will."
msgstr "Никто не знает, каковы были истинные намерения самосознающего межпространственного конструкта. Но логика подсказывает, что это крылатое чудовище — переосмысление образа Альте Ройте, легендарного мага, который, как говорят, мог по желанию принимать облик дракона."

#. ja: 記憶を消された！
#. de: Dass alte Leute immer so<br>peinlich sein müssen<nbsp>...<br><i>Oboro</i>
#. fr: Kiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Alte Roite, fantastical ur-being generated by Omega within the Deltascape.
#. column 1: While none can be certain the exact intentions of a self-aware interdimensional construct, logic suggests this winged aberration is a reimagination of Alte Roite─a legendary wizard who is said could take the shape of a dragon at will.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:126:0:2"
msgid "That knowledge is my ticket<br>straight to glory. I can't go<br>telling any old person about it.<br>   - Bonifoix"
msgstr "Это знание — мой билет<br>к славе. Нельзя же<br>рассказывать всем подряд.<br>   — Бонифуа"

#. ja: セントリオタイガーに騎乗する。<br>リスキーモブの血を引く猛虎
#. de: Rufe deinen Centurio-Tiger herbei und gehe für den Clan auf Jagd!
#. fr: Vous appelez un tigre centurio, le terrible descendant d'une cible d'élite.
#. column 1: In a rare display of misguided compassion, a member of Clan Centurio returned from a Hunt with the cub of a slain S-rank mark. Unable to grant it mercy, the veteran took to caring for the beast until his deceit was discovered and his membership revoked. But by then, not a single member could bring themselves to harm the pet they had all come to love.
#. column 2: This game of cat and mouse<br>continued for what seemed<br>an eternity.<br>   - Alberic
msgctxt "MountTransient:127:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Centurio tiger, one mark the Clan actually does not want seen slain."
msgstr "Призовите тигра-центурио — цель, которую сам клан вовсе не желает видеть убитой."

#. ja: クランセントリオにて訓練された猛虎。リスキーモブとして登録されていた人喰い虎を討伐した時、その幼子を発見したモブハンターが、哀れに思い保護、クラン員たちの手で飼育された。魔法的訓練も積んでおり、空をも翔る
#. de: In einem seltenen Anflug von Mitleid brachte ein Jäger des Clans Centurio den Welpen eines Rang S-Ziels mit von der Hochwildjagd. Für seine milde Tat wurde er aus dem Clan ausgeschlossen, doch auch die anderen Mitglieder brachten es nicht über das Herz, das Tigerjunge zu töten.
#. fr: Un chasseur a découvert cet animal alors qu'il venait d'abattre un dangereux tigre tueur d'hommes. Il ne savait pas que la créature avait un petit et s'en est rendu compte à sa mort. Pris de remords, il a ramené le petit au camp et a décidé de l'élever lui-même. En l'entraînant à la magie, il lui a même appris à voler<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Centurio tiger, one mark the Clan actually does not want seen slain.
#. column 2: This game of cat and mouse<br>continued for what seemed<br>an eternity.<br>   - Alberic
msgctxt "MountTransient:127:0:1"
msgid "In a rare display of misguided compassion, a member of Clan Centurio returned from a Hunt with the cub of a slain S-rank mark. Unable to grant it mercy, the veteran took to caring for the beast until his deceit was discovered and his membership revoked. But by then, not a single member could bring themselves to harm the pet they had all come to love."
msgstr "В редком приступе неверно понятого милосердия член клана Центурио вернулся с Охоты с детёнышем убитой цели S-ранга. Не сумев лишить зверя жизни, ветеран взялся заботиться о нём, пока его обман не раскрыли и не исключили из клана. Но к тому времени ни у кого из клановцев не поднялась рука на любимца, которого все успели полюбить."

#. ja: グルルルル…
#. de: Ob ich 'ne frohe Magd kenne ...?<br>Na klar, aber die werd ich dir nicht ...<br>Ach, Hohe Jagd!<br><i>Ardolain</i>
#. fr: Grrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Centurio tiger, one mark the Clan actually does not want seen slain.
#. column 1: In a rare display of misguided compassion, a member of Clan Centurio returned from a Hunt with the cub of a slain S-rank mark. Unable to grant it mercy, the veteran took to caring for the beast until his deceit was discovered and his membership revoked. But by then, not a single member could bring themselves to harm the pet they had all come to love.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:127:0:2"
msgid "This game of cat and mouse<br>continued for what seemed<br>an eternity.<br>   - Alberic"
msgstr "Эта игра в кошки-мышки<br>тянулась, казалось,<br>целую вечность.<br>   — Альберик"

#. ja: イクシオンに騎乗する。<br>ギラバニア地方で語り継がれてきた古の幻獣
#. de: Rufe Ixion herbei, Rhalgrs mächtiges Streitross!
#. fr: Vous appelez Ixion, une créature légendaire en Gyr Abania.
#. column 1: Ask any Gyr Abanian youth, and she will tell you the story of Ixion, Rhalgr's steed─swift as a levinbolt and strong as thunderclap. However, the discovery of several ancient Mhachi texts suggests that the creature may simply be a stallion augmented by ancient technologies that have granted it life eternal...and the ability to shoot lightning from its eyes.
#. column 2: He said what?<br>“Horses are that strong”?<br>   - Red Uma Doshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:130:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth mighty Ixion, legend of the Gyr Abanian highlands."
msgstr "Призовите могучего Иксиона — легенду Гир-Абании."

#. ja: ギラバニア地方で語り継がれてきた古の幻獣。星導教の教えでは、壊神ラールガーの愛馬とされるが、マハ由来の魔術書には、魔具によって強化された生物と記されている。確かなのは雷気を操る性質を持つという点のみ
#. de: Schneller als Blitz und Donner prescht Ixion über das Hochland von Gyr Abania. Altertümliche Texte aus Mhach legen nahe, dass das Tier mechanisch verstärkt wurde<nbsp>- was die aus seinen Augen schießenden Lichtstrahlen erklären könnte.
#. fr: Le Poing de Rhalgr dit qu'il s'agissait du destrier du Destructeur, mais un grimoire de sorcellerie mhachois raconte qu'il s'agit en fait d'une créature qui aurait été modifiée à l'aide de la magie. Tout ce que l'on sait finalement, c'est que cette créature manipule l'électricité.
#. column 0: Summon forth mighty Ixion, legend of the Gyr Abanian highlands.
#. column 2: He said what?<br>“Horses are that strong”?<br>   - Red Uma Doshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:130:0:1"
msgid "Ask any Gyr Abanian youth, and she will tell you the story of Ixion, Rhalgr's steed─swift as a levinbolt and strong as thunderclap. However, the discovery of several ancient Mhachi texts suggests that the creature may simply be a stallion augmented by ancient technologies that have granted it life eternal...and the ability to shoot lightning from its eyes."
msgstr "Спросите любого гир-абанийского ребёнка, и он расскажет вам об Иксионе, коне Ралгра — быстром, как молния, и сильном, как гром. Однако найденные древние махские тексты наводят на мысль, что это всего лишь жеребец, усиленный древними технологиями, которые даровали ему вечную жизнь... и способность стрелять молниями из глаз."

#. ja: ビリリリリリリ！
#. de: Jetzt hakt's aber! Chocobos sind viel hübscher als Pferde!<br><i>Chefin der Chocobo-Transportgewerkschaft</i>
#. fr: Gzzzzzt<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth mighty Ixion, legend of the Gyr Abanian highlands.
#. column 1: Ask any Gyr Abanian youth, and she will tell you the story of Ixion, Rhalgr's steed─swift as a levinbolt and strong as thunderclap. However, the discovery of several ancient Mhachi texts suggests that the creature may simply be a stallion augmented by ancient technologies that have granted it life eternal...and the ability to shoot lightning from its eyes.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:130:0:2"
msgid "He said what?<br>“Horses are that strong”?<br>   - Red Uma Doshin"
msgstr "Что он сказал?<br>«Кони такие сильные»?<br>   — Красный ума-до:син"

#. ja: 龍のカムイに騎乗する。<br>神龍に祝福された大狼。神々しく天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen legendären Kamuy herbei. Der gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy de la divinité, une créature implacable bénie par un dragon divin.
#. column 1: Perpetually enveloped in a divine glow, it is said to have been born when an Ala Mhigan war hound chanced to bathe in Shinryu's light in the moment of the primal's birth.
#. column 2: It is a delicate dance...<br>and one which asks<br>much of my hounds.<br>   - Zenos yae Galvus
msgctxt "MountTransient:133:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the legendary kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics."
msgstr "Призовите легендарного камуи — благословенного волка, которому неведомы такие телесные законы, как гравитация и аэродинамика."

#. ja: 神龍による祝福を受け、神々しい光をまとった大狼。おそらくアラミゴにて飼育されていた軍用犬が、神龍の光を浴びたことで誕生したものと思われる
#. de: Ein einst gewöhnlicher Wolf, der vermutlich im Dienst der mhigischen Be<shy>freiungs<shy>armee stand und bei dem Kampf gegen Shinryu in dessen Licht gebadet und mit besonderen Kräften ausgestattet wurde.
#. fr: Cet énorme loup a vraisemblablement été élevé à Ala Mhigo à des fins militaires, avant d'être touché par la lumière divine de Shinryu et de recevoir ses puissants pouvoirs magiques qui lui permettent de courir dans le ciel.
#. column 0: Summon forth the legendary kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 2: It is a delicate dance...<br>and one which asks<br>much of my hounds.<br>   - Zenos yae Galvus
msgctxt "MountTransient:133:0:1"
msgid "Perpetually enveloped in a divine glow, it is said to have been born when an Ala Mhigan war hound chanced to bathe in Shinryu's light in the moment of the primal's birth."
msgstr "Говорят, этот волк, всегда окутанный божественным сиянием, появился, когда боевой пёс из Ала Миго случайно омылся светом Синрю в миг рождения праймала."

#. ja: グォーン！
#. de: Ooh! Meine Vorzeigewölfe!<br><i>Windiger Gaukler</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the legendary kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 1: Perpetually enveloped in a divine glow, it is said to have been born when an Ala Mhigan war hound chanced to bathe in Shinryu's light in the moment of the primal's birth.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:133:0:2"
msgid "It is a delicate dance...<br>and one which asks<br>much of my hounds.<br>   - Zenos yae Galvus"
msgstr "Удивительный танец...<br>и от моих псов<br>он требует немалого.<br>   — Зенос яэ Галвус"

#. ja: 風火二輪に騎乗する。<br>天を駆ける神器。風と火を噴き出す
#. de: Rufe deinen Feuerwind herbei, ein göttliches Gefährt, das Wind und Feuer speit.
#. fr: Vous appelez les roues Feu-et-Vent, une relique divine permettant de vous mouvoir en éjectant des gerbes de flammes sur votre passage.
#. column 1: Yanxian legend tells of a chariot that would carry gods and heroes across the heavens that they might keep watch over their earthbound children. Surprisingly, the realm's flora and fauna are unscathed by the fire and wind belched forth by the divine carriage.
#. column 2: You look to me like<br>a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in need of a nice,<br>relaxin' carriage ride!<br>   - Bremondt
msgctxt "MountTransient:135:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Nezha chariot and travel the skies like a god."
msgstr "Призовите колесницу Нэчжи и неситесь по небесам, словно бог."

#. ja: ヤンサの地に伝わる神器のひとつ。伝承によれば、ふたつの車輪から成り、風と火を噴き出しながら英雄を運び、天を駆けたという。だが、不思議とその焔は草木を焼くことはなく、大地の命を奪うことはなかったとされる
#. de: Ein göttliches Gefährt aus den Legenden Yanxias. Gefertigt aus zwei Rädern, soll der Feuerwind einen großen Helden durch die Lüfte getragen haben. Und obwohl er sengendes Feuer speit, kam dabei auf wundersame Weise niemand zu Schaden.
#. fr: Les légendes de Yanxia parlent d'un héros qui arpentait les cieux sur ce véhicule formé d'une paire de roues crachant des bourrasques enflammées. Étonnamment, on raconte aussi que l'herbe était épargnée par ce brasier.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Nezha chariot and travel the skies like a god.
#. column 2: You look to me like<br>a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in need of a nice,<br>relaxin' carriage ride!<br>   - Bremondt
msgctxt "MountTransient:135:0:1"
msgid "Yanxian legend tells of a chariot that would carry gods and heroes across the heavens that they might keep watch over their earthbound children. Surprisingly, the realm's flora and fauna are unscathed by the fire and wind belched forth by the divine carriage."
msgstr "Согласно легендам Янсии, колесница переносила богов и героев по небесам, чтобы они могли присматривать за своими земными детьми. Удивительно, но огонь и ветер, вырывающиеся из божественной колесницы, не вредят ни растениям, ни животным."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ein gewöhnlicher Puk, eigentlich nicht mehr als<br>eine geflügelte Echse, wird dann schon mal zu einem<br>Feuer speienden, Knaben verschlingenden Drachen.<br><i>Alberic</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Nezha chariot and travel the skies like a god.
#. column 1: Yanxian legend tells of a chariot that would carry gods and heroes across the heavens that they might keep watch over their earthbound children. Surprisingly, the realm's flora and fauna are unscathed by the fire and wind belched forth by the divine carriage.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:135:0:2"
msgid "You look to me like<br>a <if $gn4>woman<else>man</if> in need of a nice,<br>relaxin' carriage ride!<br>   - Bremondt"
msgstr "Ты похож<if $gn4>а<else></if> на <if $gn4>женщину<else>мужчину</if>, которым не помешала бы спокойная прогулка в удобной коляске!<br>   — Бремондт"

#. ja: シマエイに騎乗する。<br>紅玉海に棲息する海洋生物。コウジン族のエイ飼いが調教した
#. de: Rufe deinen Streifenrochen herbei. Er stammt aus der Rubinsee und wurde vom Rochenflüsterer der Kojin persönlich abgerichtet.
#. fr: Vous appelez une raie rayée, une majestueuse créature de la Mer de Rubis.
#. column 1: Raised and trained by the Kojin, this striped ray has the same mellow temperament as its original masters. Its flat body works in like fashion to the aether-imbued wings of an airship, allowing it to catch water- and wind-aspected aether to glide through both sea and sky with ease.
#. column 2: I advise you to<br>stand back when he<br>regurgitates everything.<br>   - Zukin
msgctxt "MountTransient:136:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your striped ray, a majestic creature native to the Ruby Sea."
msgstr "Призовите полосатого ската — величественного обитателя Рубинового моря."

#. ja: コウジン族のエイ飼いが調教したシマエイ。扁平な身体全体が、飛空艇のエーテル翼のような役割を果たし、水と風のエーテルを受けて水中と空中を泳ぐ。のんびりとした碧甲羅に育てられただけあって、性格は温厚そのもの
#. de: Dieser Streifenrochen wurde vom Rochenflüsterer der Kojin höchstselbst abgerichtet und ist die Gelassenheit in Person. Sein flacher Körper übernimmt eine ähnliche Funktion wie die Äthertragflächen von Luftschiffen, wodurch er schwerelos gleiten kann.
#. fr: Élevée et entraînée par Makura, cette raie rayée a le même caractère doux que les pacifiques Kojin verts. Elle aspire de l'eau ou du vent et l'énergie éthérée qu'ils contiennent afin de se déplacer avec grâce en mer ou dans les airs.
#. column 0: Summon forth your striped ray, a majestic creature native to the Ruby Sea.
#. column 2: I advise you to<br>stand back when he<br>regurgitates everything.<br>   - Zukin
msgctxt "MountTransient:136:0:1"
msgid "Raised and trained by the Kojin, this striped ray has the same mellow temperament as its original masters. Its flat body works in like fashion to the aether-imbued wings of an airship, allowing it to catch water- and wind-aspected aether to glide through both sea and sky with ease."
msgstr "Кодзин вырастили и обучили этого полосатого ската. Его спокойный нрав — под стать первым хозяевам. Плоское тело, словно крылья воздушного корабля, улавливает эфир воды и ветра, позволяя ему легко скользить и в море, и в небесах."

#. ja: ポワーン……
#. de: Die jungen Rochen sind noch etwas schüchtern. Wir sollten ihnen ein bisschen Mut<nbsp>...... machen.<br><i>Zukin</i>
#. fr: Fsssshhh...
#. column 0: Summon forth your striped ray, a majestic creature native to the Ruby Sea.
#. column 1: Raised and trained by the Kojin, this striped ray has the same mellow temperament as its original masters. Its flat body works in like fashion to the aether-imbued wings of an airship, allowing it to catch water- and wind-aspected aether to glide through both sea and sky with ease.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:136:0:2"
msgid "I advise you to<br>stand back when he<br>regurgitates everything.<br>   - Zukin"
msgstr "Советую<br>отойти подальше, когда он<br>начнёт всё это отрыгивать.<br>   — Дзюкин"

#. ja: カーバンクル・アクアマリンに騎乗する。<br>アクアマリンの神秘を解き明かした魔紋から生まれた騎乗用魔法生物
#. de: Rufe dein Aquamarin-Karfunkel herbei, geboren aus einem Äthergramm erfüllt von der Kraft eines Aquamarins.
#. fr: Vous appelez Carbuncle aigue-marine, une entité arcanique née de l'énergie mystérieuse de la pierre précieuse du même nom.
#. column 1: Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large aquamarine, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima.
#. column 2: What have we here?<br>An admirer of the arcane?<br>A connoisseur of Carbuncles?<br>   - Ulan
msgctxt "MountTransient:138:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Aquamarine Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of aquamarine geometry."
msgstr "Призовите карбункула Аквамарин — магическое создание, обретшее форму благодаря тайнам геометрии аквамарина."

#. ja: 自称天才巴術士、ウランが創り上げた騎乗型魔法生物。大型カーバンクル「ダイヤ」の育成で培った知識を応用して生成した。大粒のアクアマリンを心核として利用しているため、巴術士でなくても召喚できる
#. de: Ein magisches Reittier, das von dem selbst<shy>er<shy>nann<shy>ten Hermetikergenie Ulan auf Grundlage ihres bei der Züchtung des Riesenkarfunkels Diama gewonnenen Wissens geschaffen wurde. Dank des mit Aquamarin-<br>körnern gefüllten Kerns kann es auch von Nicht-Hermetikern beschworen werden.
#. fr: Grâce à l'expérience acquise en s'occupant de Diamant, son Carbuncle adoré, Ulan a réussi à créer un Carbuncle de taille suffisante pour être chevauché. L'aquamarine de grande taille dont il provient permet même aux non-arcanistes de l'invoquer.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Aquamarine Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of aquamarine geometry.
#. column 2: What have we here?<br>An admirer of the arcane?<br>A connoisseur of Carbuncles?<br>   - Ulan
msgctxt "MountTransient:138:0:1"
msgid "Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large aquamarine, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima."
msgstr "Всем, кто мечтал прокатиться верхом на карбункуле, стоит поблагодарить призывателя Улана. Её исследования карбункула Алмаз помогли создать магическое существо достаточно крупным для верховой езды. Его форму поддерживает большой аквамарин, поэтому призвать его может даже тот, кто не знаком с искусством призыва."

#. ja: キュッ！
#. de: Fiep, fiep!<br><i>Karfunkel</i>
#. fr: Kyuuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Aquamarine Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of aquamarine geometry.
#. column 1: Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large aquamarine, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:138:0:2"
msgid "What have we here?<br>An admirer of the arcane?<br>A connoisseur of Carbuncles?<br>   - Ulan"
msgstr "Кто это у нас?<br>Любитель магии?<br>Знаток карбункулов?<br>   — Улан"

#. ja: カーバンクル・シトリンに騎乗する。<br>シトリンの神秘を解き明かした魔紋から生まれた騎乗用魔法生物
#. de: Rufe dein Citrin-Karfunkel herbei, geboren aus einem Äthergramm erfüllt von der Kraft eines Citrins.
#. fr: Vous appelez Carbuncle citrine, une entité arcanique née de l'énergie mystérieuse de la pierre précieuse du même nom.
#. column 1: Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large citrine, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima.
#. column 2: My, what a splendid<br>thing you are.<br>   - Ulan
msgctxt "MountTransient:139:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Citrine Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of citrine geometry."
msgstr "Призовите карбункула Цитрин — магическое создание, обретшее форму благодаря тайнам геометрии цитрина."

#. ja: 自称天才巴術士、ウランが創り上げた騎乗型魔法生物。大型カーバンクル「ダイヤ」の育成で培った知識を応用して生成した。大粒のシトリンを心核として利用しているため、巴術士でなくても召喚できる
#. de: Ein magisches Reittier, das von dem selbst<shy>er<shy>nann<shy>ten Hermetikergenie Ulan auf Grundlage ihres bei der Züchtung des Riesenkarfunkels Diama gewonnenen Wissens geschaffen wurde. Dank des mit Citrin-<br>körnern gefüllten Kerns kann es auch von Nicht-Hermetikern beschworen werden.
#. fr: Grâce à l'expérience acquise en s'occupant de Diamant, son Carbuncle adoré, Ulan a réussi à créer un Carbuncle de taille suffisante pour être chevauché. La citrine de grande taille dont il provient permet même aux non-arcanistes de l'invoquer.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Citrine Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of citrine geometry.
#. column 2: My, what a splendid<br>thing you are.<br>   - Ulan
msgctxt "MountTransient:139:0:1"
msgid "Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large citrine, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima."
msgstr "Всем, кто мечтал прокатиться верхом на карбункуле, стоит поблагодарить призывателя Улана. Её исследования карбункула Алмаз помогли создать магическое существо достаточно крупным для верховой езды. Его форму поддерживает большой цитрин, поэтому призвать его может даже тот, кто не знаком с искусством призыва."

#. ja: ウニュッ！？
#. de: Fiep, fiep!<br><i>Karfunkel</i>
#. fr: Nyuuu...<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon forth your Citrine Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of citrine geometry.
#. column 1: Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large citrine, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:139:0:2"
msgid "My, what a splendid<br>thing you are.<br>   - Ulan"
msgstr "Ну и красавец же ты!<br>   — Улан"

#. ja: フライング・チェアーに騎乗する。<br>魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ椅子。さらに高高度に。でも品質はそのままに
#. de: Rufe deinen fliegenden Sessel herbei, ein magisch behandeltes Möbelstück. Damit kommst du höher hinaus - wenn er nicht aus dem Leim geht.
#. fr: Vous appelez un fauteuil volant, capable de flotter dans les airs comme par magie.
#. column 1: Featuring elegant lines and designed to minimize waste, this lovingly crafted chair is bound to fly into the hearts of adventurers the world over. No assembly required.
#. column 2: Maximum load: 240 pz.
msgctxt "MountTransient:140:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a flying chair to bear you in high style."
msgstr "Призовите летающее кресло — и путешествуйте с шиком."

#. ja: 魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ椅子。さらに高高度に。でも品質はそのままに。ムダのないデザインとレシピを常に開発し、手作業でクラフトして世界中の冒険者さまにお届けしています。六角レンチが余るのはご愛敬
#. de: Ein Sessel, der dank magischem Lack fliegen kann. Fliegst du schon oder sitzt du noch? Im schlichten zeitlosen Design, kostensparend zum selber Zusammenbauen. Inbusschlüssel und Nervenzusammenbrüche inklusive!
#. fr: Grâce à un dispositif magique, ce luxueux fauteuil est capable de s'élever dans les airs, sans pour autant sacrifier le confort de celui ou celle qui s'y asseoit. (Poids maximum conseillé<nbsp>: 240 ponz)
#. column 0: Summon forth a flying chair to bear you in high style.
#. column 2: Maximum load: 240 pz.
msgctxt "MountTransient:140:0:1"
msgid "Featuring elegant lines and designed to minimize waste, this lovingly crafted chair is bound to fly into the hearts of adventurers the world over. No assembly required."
msgstr "Элегантное кресло с продуманным дизайном и без лишних деталей — такой подарок наверняка покорит сердца искателей приключений по всему миру. Сборка не требуется."

#. ja: 最大荷重：240Pz
#. de: Wenn er rausbekommt, dass ich mir seinen lederbezogenen Bürosessel geliehen habe, bin ich geliefert!<br><i>Cyr</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth a flying chair to bear you in high style.
#. column 1: Featuring elegant lines and designed to minimize waste, this lovingly crafted chair is bound to fly into the hearts of adventurers the world over. No assembly required.
msgctxt "MountTransient:140:0:2"
msgid "Maximum load: 240 pz."
msgstr "Максимальная нагрузка: 240 пз."

#. ja: 魔導アヴェンジャー騎乗型に騎乗する。<br>ゴブリン族が改良した帝国製無人魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe deinen Magitek-Rächer herbei, eine von den Goblins zu einem Reitgefährt umgebaute imperiale Kampfmaschine, die ursprünglich autark agierte.
#. fr: Vous appelez un vengeur magitek, appareil impérial amélioré par les soins des Gobelins.
#. column 1: The goblins have carried out extensive work on this magitek avenger, among other things changing it from an autonomous killing machine to one requiring a pilot. After all, there's no substituting the satisfaction of dealing vengeance with one's own hands. Sort of.
#. column 2: Pshkohhh! Revenge!<br>   - Moundrinx Eightclinks
msgctxt "MountTransient:141:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek avenger, an imperial warmachina made mightier by goblin hands."
msgstr "Призовите магитехнического мстителя — имперскую боевую машину, усовершенствованную гоблинами."

#. ja: ゴブリン族が改良した帝国製無人魔導兵器。本来、無人機である本機を手に入れたゴブリン族が、騎乗用として利用するために改造を施した結果、このようになった。ハイテクなのかローテクなのか、イマイチわからない
#. de: Eine ursprünglich führerlose Kampfmaschine der Garlear, die von den Goblins zu einem Reitgefährt umgebaut wurde. Ob Hochtechnologie oder Schrotthaufen, vermag niemand mehr wirklich zu sagen.
#. fr: Ce suiveur autonome impérial a été modifié et amélioré de fond en comble par le génie mécanique gobelin. Il requiert désormais un conducteur, qui pourra être aux premières loges au moment de se venger des Garlemaldais.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek avenger, an imperial warmachina made mightier by goblin hands.
#. column 2: Pshkohhh! Revenge!<br>   - Moundrinx Eightclinks
msgctxt "MountTransient:141:0:1"
msgid "The goblins have carried out extensive work on this magitek avenger, among other things changing it from an autonomous killing machine to one requiring a pilot. After all, there's no substituting the satisfaction of dealing vengeance with one's own hands. Sort of."
msgstr "Гоблины основательно переделали этого магитехнического мстителя: в частности, превратили автономную машину для убийств в управляемую. Ведь ничто не сравнится с удовольствием самому вершить возмездие. Ну, почти."

#. ja: ヴホッ！
#. de: Gute Arbeit! Jetzt haben wir unsere Magitek-Kampfmaschine!<br><i>Cid Garlond</i>
#. fr: Pshhh... Identification en cours...
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek avenger, an imperial warmachina made mightier by goblin hands.
#. column 1: The goblins have carried out extensive work on this magitek avenger, among other things changing it from an autonomous killing machine to one requiring a pilot. After all, there's no substituting the satisfaction of dealing vengeance with one's own hands. Sort of.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:141:0:2"
msgid "Pshkohhh! Revenge!<br>   - Moundrinx Eightclinks"
msgstr "Пшкох! Месть!<br>   — Маундринкс Восьмизвон"

#. ja: ハコボックルに騎乗する。<br>大きく成長したコロポックル。ルガディン族をも易々と運ぶ
#. de: Rufe deinen Koloss-Korpokkur herbei, der dank seiner Größe auch Roegadyn mit Leichtigkeit transportiert.
#. fr: Vous appelez un poro-korpokkur, une imposante créature végétale dotée d'une force supérieure.
#. column 1: In search of an ideal home, this korpokkur journeyed long malms before finally coming to a stop at the Gold Saucer. The trek across the scorching Sagolii had reduced it to a withered husk, but when next it drank, it experienced what could only be described as an epic rebound.
#. column 2: What have you been<br>feeding this thing?<br>   - Forward Maiden
msgctxt "MountTransient:142:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your korpokkur kolossus, a veritable colossus among its kind."
msgstr "Призовите коропоккура-колосса — настоящего великана среди себе подобных."

#. ja: 大きく成長したコロポックル。理想の住まいを探し続け、ついに遊技場「ゴールドソーサー」に辿り着いた。なお、サゴリー砂漠を渡る最中に、限界まで干からびた結果、吸水後にリバウンド。驚くほどの巨体を手に入れた
#. de: Ein riesiger Korpokkur. Die Hoffnung auf das große Geld brachte ihn zum Gold Saucer. Unterwegs trocknete er in der Sagolii-Wüste fast vollständig aus, trank sich danach aber zu seinen heutigen Dimensionen dick.
#. fr: Un korpokkur ayant poussé dans des proportions ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelles. Après avoir longtemps erré pour trouver un foyer adapté à sa taille, il s'est finalement installé au Gold Saucer. Son passage par le désert de Sagolii lui avait fait perdre un poids important, qu'il a im<shy>mé<shy>dia<shy>te<shy>ment regagné dès qu'il a pu s'hydrater.
#. column 0: Summon forth your korpokkur kolossus, a veritable colossus among its kind.
#. column 2: What have you been<br>feeding this thing?<br>   - Forward Maiden
msgctxt "MountTransient:142:0:1"
msgid "In search of an ideal home, this korpokkur journeyed long malms before finally coming to a stop at the Gold Saucer. The trek across the scorching Sagolii had reduced it to a withered husk, but when next it drank, it experienced what could only be described as an epic rebound."
msgstr "В поисках идеального дома этот коропоккур прошёл долгий путь и наконец остановился у Золотого блюдца. Переход через палящую пустыню Саголии иссушил его до состояния сморщенной оболочки. Но стоило ему снова напиться, как он пережил нечто вроде невероятного набора веса."

#. ja: ゴロリン、ゴロリン……
#. de: Damals ist Aura-Forschengruppe zu Thaliak kommen und hat Koloss in Fluss durchsuchen mit Schnüffelnase.<br><i>Rückblix</i>
#. fr: Dum dum dum...
#. column 0: Summon forth your korpokkur kolossus, a veritable colossus among its kind.
#. column 1: In search of an ideal home, this korpokkur journeyed long malms before finally coming to a stop at the Gold Saucer. The trek across the scorching Sagolii had reduced it to a withered husk, but when next it drank, it experienced what could only be described as an epic rebound.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:142:0:2"
msgid "What have you been<br>feeding this thing?<br>   - Forward Maiden"
msgstr "Чем же вы<br>кормите эту громадину?<br>   — Дева передовой"

#. ja: 赤兎馬に騎乗する。<br>紅い毛を持つ名馬。兎のように大地を駆ける
#. de: Rufe dein Feuerross herbei und wandle in den Hufstapfen des großen Geomanten und Kriegers Ganen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Lièvre rouge, un puissant destrier à la crinière pourpre.
#. column 1: Ganen was known for his imposing presence on the battlefield, a trait that can partially be attributed to his mount, the Red Hare─a lightning-swift steed magicked to stride the very heavens. This horse is said to be a direct descendant of the awe-inspiring stallion. Probably.
#. column 2: ...I spring across the<br>battlefield with the<br>swiftness of the rabbit!<br>   - Gyosei
msgctxt "MountTransient:143:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Red Hare─legendary steed known for both its unmatchable speed and its fiery red coat."
msgstr "Призовите Красного зайца — легендарного скакуна, знаменитого неповторимой скоростью и огненно-рыжей шерстью."

#. ja: 赤兎とは、ヤンサ統一を成した名将「ガンエン」の愛馬として知られる存在。ガンエンは自ら編み出した風水術により、赤兎に天を駆ける術を教えたという。この馬は、その血統を受け継いでいるらしいが、真偽の程は不明である
#. de: Das Feuerross verdankt seinen Namen seiner feuerroten Mähne. In ganz Yanxia ist es als das treue Kriegsross des großen Ganen bekannt, der ihm mit einem geomantischen Trick das Fliegen beibrachte. Ob dieses Pferd wirklich einmal Ganen gehörte oder nicht, ist ungeklärt.
#. fr: Ce fier destrier à la longue crinière pourpre descend vraisemblablement de la monture de Ganen, unificateur de Yanxia et fondateur de la nation de Doma. On dit qu'il est capable de galoper dans les airs grâce à un sort de géomancie jeté à son ancêtre par le grand général.
#. column 0: Summon forth the Red Hare─legendary steed known for both its unmatchable speed and its fiery red coat.
#. column 2: ...I spring across the<br>battlefield with the<br>swiftness of the rabbit!<br>   - Gyosei
msgctxt "MountTransient:143:0:1"
msgid "Ganen was known for his imposing presence on the battlefield, a trait that can partially be attributed to his mount, the Red Hare─a lightning-swift steed magicked to stride the very heavens. This horse is said to be a direct descendant of the awe-inspiring stallion. Probably."
msgstr "Ганэн был грозой на поле боя — отчасти благодаря своему скакуну Красному зайцу. Этот молниеносный конь, по легенде, умел взмывать в небеса благодаря магии. Говорят, нынешний конь — прямой потомок того самого легендарного жеребца. Наверное."

#. ja: 馬中有赤兎！
#. de: Alte Ver<shy>zweif<shy>lung reitet auf neuem Ross.<br><i>Fahrender Sänger</i>
#. fr: Hi hiiiiin<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the Red Hare─legendary steed known for both its unmatchable speed and its fiery red coat.
#. column 1: Ganen was known for his imposing presence on the battlefield, a trait that can partially be attributed to his mount, the Red Hare─a lightning-swift steed magicked to stride the very heavens. This horse is said to be a direct descendant of the awe-inspiring stallion. Probably.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:143:0:2"
msgid "...I spring across the<br>battlefield with the<br>swiftness of the rabbit!<br>   - Gyosei"
msgstr "…Мчусь по полю боя<br>быстрее зайца!<br>   — Гёсэй"

#. ja: 白のカムイに騎乗する。<br>白虎の神通力を受けた大狼。風を巻き上げ天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen glücklichen Kamuy herbei. Der von Byakko gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy de l'ouest, une créature ayant hérité du pouvoir de Byakko, le légendaire Tigre blanc.
#. column 1: Said to be swaddled in the very winds of heaven, this majestic creature was once a brutal killer of man. A chance meeting with auspice lord Byakko, however, saw the bloodlust in its heart fade.
#. column 2: I did not anticipate<br>the arrival of that<br>fearsome hound.<br>   - X'rhun Tia
msgctxt "MountTransient:144:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the auspicious kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics."
msgstr "Призовите благословенного камуи — величественного волка, не знающего земных законов вроде гравитации и сопротивления воздуха."

#. ja: 四聖獣「白虎」の神通力を受け、天つ風の力をまとった大狼。おそらく人に害なす存在に墜ちた大狼を、白虎が鎮めたことで、誕生したものと思われる
#. de: Einst eine blutrünstige Bestie, die von dem Tier-<br>heiligen Byakko besänftigt und gesegnet wurde. Seither gebietet er über die Himmelswinde.
#. fr: Le pelage de ce loup est parcouru de vents célestes témoignant du pouvoir qu'il a hérité de Byakko, l'un des quatre animaux sacrés. D'après les croyances, il serait autrefois devenu agressif envers les humains, et c'est le Tigre blanc lui-même qui aurait alors apaisé son âme.
#. column 0: Summon forth the auspicious kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 2: I did not anticipate<br>the arrival of that<br>fearsome hound.<br>   - X'rhun Tia
msgctxt "MountTransient:144:0:1"
msgid "Said to be swaddled in the very winds of heaven, this majestic creature was once a brutal killer of man. A chance meeting with auspice lord Byakko, however, saw the bloodlust in its heart fade."
msgstr "Говорят, это величественное создание окутано ветрами небес. Когда-то оно было безжалостным убийцей людей, но случайная встреча с владыкой священных зверей Бякко уняла его жажду крови."

#. ja: ガルルルル！
#. de: Wenn er dich anheult, gefriert das Blut in deinen Adern!<br><i>X'rhun Tia</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the auspicious kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 1: Said to be swaddled in the very winds of heaven, this majestic creature was once a brutal killer of man. A chance meeting with auspice lord Byakko, however, saw the bloodlust in its heart fade.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:144:0:2"
msgid "I did not anticipate<br>the arrival of that<br>fearsome hound.<br>   - X'rhun Tia"
msgstr "Не думал, что появится<br>эта грозная псина.<br>   — Экс'рун Тиа"

#. ja: 魔導デスクロー拘束型に騎乗する。<br>身柄拘束用に改良された帝国製無人魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe deine Magitek-Todesklaue herbei. Aus dem Griff dieser unbemannten Kriegsmaschine gibt es kein Entkommen.
#. fr: Vous appelez une griffe d'arrestation magitek, une arme autonome impériale dédiée à la capture de criminels.
#. column 1: Ancient Allagan weaponry known as an “iron claw” is believed to be the inspiration for this deadly example of imperial ingenuity. While most of the death claws deployed in battle are used for logistical purposes, this particular model has been customized by stationarii units for enemy capture.
#. column 2: Only so many of us find<br>machina pretty, my dear.<br>   - Mide
msgctxt "MountTransient:145:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek death claw, an imperial warmachina based on ancient Allagan technology."
msgstr "Призовите магитехническую когтистую машину — имперскую боевую машину на основе древних технологий аллагов."

#. ja: アラグの古代兵器「アイアンクロー」をベースに、ガレマール帝国軍が再設計した魔導兵器。拘束型と呼ばれる本機は、特務憲兵隊に配備するために調整されたモデルで、制圧した人物の身柄を拘束し、連行することができる
#. de: Diese Weiterentwicklung der antiken allagischen Magitek-Waffe „Eisenklaue“ wird von Spezialeinheiten der Garlear genutzt, um gesuchte Verbrecher oder Feinde lebend gefangen zu nehmen.
#. fr: À partir d'une griffe de fer allagoise, les ingénieurs impériaux ont mis au point ce modèle spécialisé dans l'immobilisation et le déplacement de cibles. Pensé pour la police militaire garlemaldaise, il a fait ses preuves au cours de nombreuses arrestations musclées.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek death claw, an imperial warmachina based on ancient Allagan technology.
#. column 2: Only so many of us find<br>machina pretty, my dear.<br>   - Mide
msgctxt "MountTransient:145:0:1"
msgid "Ancient Allagan weaponry known as an “iron claw” is believed to be the inspiration for this deadly example of imperial ingenuity. While most of the death claws deployed in battle are used for logistical purposes, this particular model has been customized by stationarii units for enemy capture."
msgstr "Считается, что прообразом этой смертоносной машины послужило древнее аллагское оружие, известное как «железный коготь». Большинство боевых когтистых машин используют для перевозки грузов, но эту модель специальные подразделения приспособили для захвата врагов."

#. ja: 犯人、確保ッ！
#. de: Ergreift sie!<br><i>Garleischer Offizier</i>
#. fr: Cible capturée<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek death claw, an imperial warmachina based on ancient Allagan technology.
#. column 1: Ancient Allagan weaponry known as an “iron claw” is believed to be the inspiration for this deadly example of imperial ingenuity. While most of the death claws deployed in battle are used for logistical purposes, this particular model has been customized by stationarii units for enemy capture.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:145:0:2"
msgid "Only so many of us find<br>machina pretty, my dear.<br>   - Mide"
msgstr "Не всем же нравятся<br>машины, милая.<br>   — Майде"

#. ja: マーリドに騎乗する。<br>アナンタ族が使役する大型獣。魔法の絨毯をまとっている
#. de: Rufe deinen Mariden herbei, ausgebildet von den Ananta und mit einem magischen Teppich zum Fliegen ausgestattet.
#. fr: Vous appelez un marid, le meilleur ami des Anantas.
#. column 1: There was once a time when if someone told you they witnessed a marid aloft, you could have had them committed to a sanatorium. Now, marids crisscross the skies thanks, in part, to magicked carpets which the Ananta affix to the backs of beasts they train for battle.
#. column 2: A rampaging marid is<br>absolutely unssstoppable.<br>   - Dakshina
msgctxt "MountTransient:146:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your marid, trained by the Ananta and outfitted with a magicked carpet allowing for flight."
msgstr "Призовите марид — зверя, обученного анантами и снабжённого волшебным ковром, который позволяет ему летать."

#. ja: アナンタ族が使役する大型獣。魔力を練り込んだ繊維で織った、魔法の絨毯を背にまとっており、その力で浮遊することができる。もちろん、マーリドが飛べるわけではない。耳で羽ばたくことは、断じてないのである
#. de: Wer früher vorgab, einen fliegenden Mariden am Himmel gesehen zu haben, galt als verrückt, doch dann kamen die Ananta auf die Idee, magische Teppiche auf die Rücken ihrer Reittiere zu binden, mit denen sie fliegen können. Nun werden erst recht viele Leute für verrückt erklärt.
#. fr: Bêtes de somme des Anantas, les marids dressés portent sur leur dos un tapis magique leur permettant de planer (mais pas de voler<nbsp>; les marids ne volent pas, pas plus qu'ils ne battent des oreilles).
#. column 0: Summon forth your marid, trained by the Ananta and outfitted with a magicked carpet allowing for flight.
#. column 2: A rampaging marid is<br>absolutely unssstoppable.<br>   - Dakshina
msgctxt "MountTransient:146:0:1"
msgid "There was once a time when if someone told you they witnessed a marid aloft, you could have had them committed to a sanatorium. Now, marids crisscross the skies thanks, in part, to magicked carpets which the Ananta affix to the backs of beasts they train for battle."
msgstr "Когда-то тому, кто заявил бы, что видел летающего марида, могли бы посоветовать обратиться в лечебницу. Теперь же мариды бороздят небеса благодаря волшебным коврам, которые ананты прикрепляют к спинам обученных бою зверей."

#. ja: パオーン！
#. de: Flieg, Maride, flieg!<br><i>Dakshina</i>
#. fr: Braaah<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your marid, trained by the Ananta and outfitted with a magicked carpet allowing for flight.
#. column 1: There was once a time when if someone told you they witnessed a marid aloft, you could have had them committed to a sanatorium. Now, marids crisscross the skies thanks, in part, to magicked carpets which the Ananta affix to the backs of beasts they train for battle.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:146:0:2"
msgid "A rampaging marid is<br>absolutely unssstoppable.<br>   - Dakshina"
msgstr "Разбушевавшегося марида<br>не остановить.<br>   — Дакшина"

#. ja: トゥルーグリフィンに騎乗する。<br>アバラシア山脈原産の有翼の魔獣
#. de: Rufe deinen Urgreifen herbei, ein imposantes, geflügeltes Tier, das in Abalathias Rückgrat heimisch ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez un vrai griffon, un animal ailé originaire des montagnes d'Abalathia.
#. column 1: Covered in the pristine white feathers representative of a true griffin, this native of Abalathia's Spine has been trained by Giff, one of the Ala Mhigan Resistance's most competent handlers. So tame is the creature that it will even emit powerful bursts of air on command.
#. column 2: Their meat's supposed to be<br>some of the best around.<br>   - Papin
msgctxt "MountTransient:148:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your true griffin, a noble winged beast native to the hidden reaches of Abalathia's Spine."
msgstr "Призовите истинного грифона — благородного крылатого зверя из укромных уголков Хребта Абалатии."

#. ja: アバラシア山脈原産の有翼の魔獣。アラミゴ解放軍の獣牧士、ギッフが愛情を込めて育てたもので、乗り手の指示に従い突風を吹かせることができる。なお、この個体は真白い毛並みのトゥルーグリフィン種という品種である
#. de: Niemand kennt sich besser mit den stolzen Greifen aus Abalathias Rückgrat aus als der Greifenführer Giff. Unter seiner einfühlsamen Anleitung entwickeln sie sich zu treuen Reitieren, die mit ihren kräftigen Flügeln Windstöße erzeugen können. Die Urgreife erkennt man an ihrem strahlend weißen Fell.
#. fr: Les vrais griffons sont une race de griffons reconnaissables à leur plumage entièrement blanc. Celui-ci a été élevé par Giff, le talentueux dresseur de l'armée de libération d'Ala Mhigo, et sait battre des ailes sur demande pour créer de puissantes rafales.
#. column 0: Summon forth your true griffin, a noble winged beast native to the hidden reaches of Abalathia's Spine.
#. column 2: Their meat's supposed to be<br>some of the best around.<br>   - Papin
msgctxt "MountTransient:148:0:1"
msgid "Covered in the pristine white feathers representative of a true griffin, this native of Abalathia's Spine has been trained by Giff, one of the Ala Mhigan Resistance's most competent handlers. So tame is the creature that it will even emit powerful bursts of air on command."
msgstr "Белоснежное оперение — отличительная черта истинного грифона, обитающего в Хребте Абалатии. Его обучил Гифф, один из самых искусных дрессировщиков Сопротивления Ала Миго. Зверь настолько послушен, что по команде даже выпускает мощные порывы ветра."

#. ja: キィーッ！
#. de: Greifenfleisch soll ziemlich lecker schmecken, aber sag das lieber nicht laut, wenn einer in der Nähe steht.<br><i>Papin</i>
#. fr: Kiiiiiih<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your true griffin, a noble winged beast native to the hidden reaches of Abalathia's Spine.
#. column 1: Covered in the pristine white feathers representative of a true griffin, this native of Abalathia's Spine has been trained by Giff, one of the Ala Mhigan Resistance's most competent handlers. So tame is the creature that it will even emit powerful bursts of air on command.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:148:0:2"
msgid "Their meat's supposed to be<br>some of the best around.<br>   - Papin"
msgstr "Говорят, мясо у них<br>на редкость вкусное.<br>   — Папин"

#. ja: ティラノサウルスに騎乗する。<br>「暴君」と渾名される肉食古代獣
#. de: Rufe einen Tyrannosaurus herbei. Der furcht<shy>ein<shy>flößende Fleischfresser ist ein Relikt aus einer längst vergangenen Zeit.
#. fr: Vous appelez un tyrannosaure, un animal préhistorique carnivore d'une cruauté sans pareille.
#. column 1: Alarmed scholars report that the “T-Rex”—as it is called by those short on ink—has gained the power of flight through continued exposure to the Isle of Val's turbulent aether. Despite its ferocious nature, some still approach it, insisting it can be tamed by an adventurer of great strength.
#. column 2: The tyrannosaurs have<br>become pests as of late.<br>   - Vath Keeneye
msgctxt "MountTransient:150:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your tyrannosaur and experience firsthand a lost time when scalekin ruled the world."
msgstr "Призовите тираннозавра и своими глазами увидите, как жили скальники в те времена, когда правили миром."

#. ja: 「暴君」と渾名される肉食古代獣。バル島の荒れ狂う風属性のエーテルを浴び続けた影響か、不思議なことに浮行能力を得ている。基本的には獰猛極まりない性格だが、力を認めた冒険者に対しては、従順に従うようだ
#. de: Hochkonzentrierter Wind-Äther auf der Insel Val hat anscheinend dazu geführt, dass diese riesige Echse durch die Luft schweben kann. Sie folgt ihren räuberischen Instinkten. Nur ein willensstarker Reiter vermag es, den Tyrannen zu bändigen.
#. fr: Cet animal préhistorique carnivore peut contre toute attente flotter dans les airs, sans doute une conséquence de son exposition prolongée aux courants éthérés déchaînés de l'île de Val. Extrêmement féroce et cruel, il n'obéit qu'aux rares aventuriers dont il reconnaît la force.
#. column 0: Summon forth your tyrannosaur and experience firsthand a lost time when scalekin ruled the world.
#. column 2: The tyrannosaurs have<br>become pests as of late.<br>   - Vath Keeneye
msgctxt "MountTransient:150:0:1"
msgid "Alarmed scholars report that the “T-Rex”—as it is called by those short on ink—has gained the power of flight through continued exposure to the Isle of Val's turbulent aether. Despite its ferocious nature, some still approach it, insisting it can be tamed by an adventurer of great strength. "
msgstr "Учёные встревожены: «Ти-рекс», как называют его те, кому лень писать длинное имя, научился летать после долгого пребывания в бурном эфире острова Валь. Он свиреп, но некоторые всё же пытаются его приручить — мол, сильному искателю приключений это под силу."

#. ja: ガオォォォン！
#. de: Mit Tyrannosauriern ist nicht zu spaßen!<br><i>Sucher der Vath</i>
#. fr: Groaaaaaahr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your tyrannosaur and experience firsthand a lost time when scalekin ruled the world.
#. column 1: Alarmed scholars report that the “T-Rex”—as it is called by those short on ink—has gained the power of flight through continued exposure to the Isle of Val's turbulent aether. Despite its ferocious nature, some still approach it, insisting it can be tamed by an adventurer of great strength.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:150:0:2"
msgid "The tyrannosaurs have<br>become pests as of late.<br>   - Vath Keeneye"
msgstr "Тираннозавры в последнее время<br>стали настоящей напастью.<br>   — Зоркий Вата"

#. ja: レガリアに騎乗する。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が製造したレプリカ車両
#. de: Rufe einen Regalia Typ-G herbei, ein flottes und elegantes Fahrzeug, das von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken nach einer berühmten Vorlage hergestellt wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez une réplique de la Regalia fabriquée par les Forges de Garlond.
#. column 1: To hear Cid tell it, equal parts elbow grease and gumption were all that was required to see the Type-G (for “Garlond”) fully operational...when, in all truth, the otherworldly carriage most likely required an amazing amount of reverse engineering to recreate.
#. column 2: Do they truly believe it makes them<br>look more imposing? Or are they<br>merely compensating for something?<br>   - Lalai
msgctxt "MountTransient:151:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Regalia Type-G, ceruleum-powered magitek transportation vehicle crafted by Garlond Ironworks."
msgstr "Призовите Регалию Type-G — магитехнический транспорт на церулеуме, созданный в мастерских «Топсейл»."

#. ja: ノクティスの愛車「レガリア」の修理を請け負ったシドが、その作業過程で得た解析データを元に再現したレプリカ車両。エンジンを青燐機関に置き換えるなど変更が加えられたため、ガーロンド・アイアンワークスの頭文字を取り、TYPE-Gと名付けられた
#. de: Die Modellbezeichnung Typ-G kommt von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken, denn Cid hat das Fahrzeug auf der Basis technischer Daten entwickelt, die er bei der Reparatur des Originalwagens von Noctis gesammelt hat. Er hat den Antrieb auf Erdseim-Kraftstoff umgestellt und einige weitere Verbesserungen vorgenommen.
#. fr: Cette réplique a pu être conçue grâce aux données récoltées par Cid lors de la réparation de la voiture emblématique de Noctis. Les Forges de Garlond y ont apporté divers ajustements, notamment le rem<shy>pla<shy>ce<shy>ment du moteur par un modèle au céruleum, d'où son nom de Type-G.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Regalia Type-G, ceruleum-powered magitek transportation vehicle crafted by Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 2: Do they truly believe it makes them<br>look more imposing? Or are they<br>merely compensating for something?<br>   - Lalai
msgctxt "MountTransient:151:0:1"
msgid "To hear Cid tell it, equal parts elbow grease and gumption were all that was required to see the Type-G (for “Garlond”) fully operational...when, in all truth, the otherworldly carriage most likely required an amazing amount of reverse engineering to recreate."
msgstr "По словам Сида, чтобы привести Type-G в рабочее состояние, хватило усердия да смекалки… Хотя на деле, скорее всего, пришлось провести грандиозную работу по обратной разработке, чтобы воссоздать эту иномирную повозку."

#. ja: 車を呼ぶ
#. de: Freie Fahrt für freie Abenteurer!<br><i>Rasender Abenteurer</i>
#. fr: Faire venir la voiture.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Regalia Type-G, ceruleum-powered magitek transportation vehicle crafted by Garlond Ironworks.
#. column 1: To hear Cid tell it, equal parts elbow grease and gumption were all that was required to see the Type-G (for “Garlond”) fully operational...when, in all truth, the otherworldly carriage most likely required an amazing amount of reverse engineering to recreate.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:151:0:2"
msgid "Do they truly believe it makes them<br>look more imposing? Or are they<br>merely compensating for something?<br>   - Lalai"
msgstr "И правда думают, что так<br>выглядят солиднее? Или просто<br>пытаются что-то компенсировать?<br>   — Лалай"

#. ja: フライング・ライトハートに騎乗する。<br>ヴァレンティオンデーの祝祭のために作られた空飛ぶ椅子
#. de: Rufe dein gebrochenes Herz. Der magische, fliegende Sessel in der Form eines halben Valention-Herzen lässt die Herzen höher schlagen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un fauteuil demi-cœur droit volant, spé<shy>cia<shy>le<shy>ment conçu pour la Valention.
#. column 1: Burdened with a warehouse of unsold broken heart chairs, House Valentione came up with the diabolic plan to repurpose the cushions with cloudsbreath and peddle them to the unknowing masses as flying mounts.
#. column 2: But alas...the heart<br>will not be denied.<br>   - Byakudan
msgctxt "MountTransient:152:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your broken heart─a magicked chair representing the right half of a Valentione's Day heart."
msgstr "Призовите разбитое сердце — волшебное кресло в форме правой половины сердечка ко Дню святого Валентиона."

#. ja: ヴァレンティオンデーの祝祭のために作られた空飛ぶ椅子。以前の祝祭の折、作りすぎて余っていたライトハートチェアを活かし、改良したもの。その際、ヴァレンティオン家は一族郎党を動員し、ウキグモソウの栽培に励んだという
#. de: Lisette suchte nach einer neuen Verwendung für alte Herzstühle, auf denen sie sitzen geblieben war. Sie ließ die Stühle mit Pustewolken auspolstern, damit die Liebenden darauf abheben können.
#. fr: Les messagers de l'amour ont créé ce moyen de locomotion original en modifiant un vieux fauteuil demi-cœur n'ayant pas trouvé preneur lors d'une édition précédente de la Valention. Le jasmin céleste nécessaire à ce petit miracle a été cultivé par les domestiques du clan Valention.
#. column 0: Summon forth your broken heart─a magicked chair representing the right half of a Valentione's Day heart.
#. column 2: But alas...the heart<br>will not be denied.<br>   - Byakudan
msgctxt "MountTransient:152:0:1"
msgid "Burdened with a warehouse of unsold broken heart chairs, House Valentione came up with the diabolic plan to repurpose the cushions with cloudsbreath and peddle them to the unknowing masses as flying mounts."
msgstr "У Дома Валентион скопился целый склад нераспроданных кресел-разбитых сердец. И тогда там придумали коварный план: набить подушки облачной травой и сбыть их ничего не подозревающим покупателям в качестве летающих ездовых животных."

#. ja: 右心房！
#. de: Hört auf eure Herzen!<br><i>Byakudan</i>
#. fr: Cœur à tribord<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your broken heart─a magicked chair representing the right half of a Valentione's Day heart.
#. column 1: Burdened with a warehouse of unsold broken heart chairs, House Valentione came up with the diabolic plan to repurpose the cushions with cloudsbreath and peddle them to the unknowing masses as flying mounts.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:152:0:2"
msgid "But alas...the heart<br>will not be denied.<br>   - Byakudan"
msgstr "Но увы… Сердцу<br>не прикажешь.<br>   — Бякудан"

#. ja: フライング・レフトハートに騎乗する。<br>ヴァレンティオンデーの祝祭のために作られた空飛ぶ椅子
#. de: Rufe dein gebrochenes Herz. Der magische, fliegende Sessel in der Form eines halben Valention-Herzen lässt die Herzen höher schlagen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un fauteuil demi-cœur gauche volant, spé<shy>cia<shy>le<shy>ment conçu pour la Valention.
#. column 1: Burdened with a warehouse of unsold broken heart chairs, House Valentione came up with the diabolic plan to repurpose the cushions with cloudsbreath and peddle them to the unknowing masses as flying mounts. Lady Lisette dreams of one day riding the hearts on her honeymoon.
#. column 2: But alas...the heart<br>will not be denied.<br>   - Byakudan
msgctxt "MountTransient:153:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your broken heart─a magicked chair representing the left half of a Valentione's Day heart."
msgstr "Призовите разбитое сердце — волшебное кресло в форме левой половины сердечка ко Дню святого Валентиона."

#. ja: ヴァレンティオンデーの祝祭のために作られた空飛ぶ椅子。以前の祝祭の折、作りすぎて余っていたレフトハートチェアを活かし、改良したもの。空飛ぶエターナルバンド旅行を夢見る、リゼット嬢の肝いりで開発されたようだ
#. de: Lisette suchte nach einer neuen Verwendung für alte Herzstühle, auf denen sie sitzen geblieben war. Sie ließ die Stühle mit Pustewolken auspolstern, damit die Liebenden darauf abheben können.
#. fr: Les messagers de l'amour ont créé ce moyen de locomotion original en modifiant un vieux fauteuil demi-cœur n'ayant pas trouvé preneur lors d'une édition précédente de la Valention. Le jasmin céleste nécessaire à ce petit miracle a été cultivé par les domestiques du clan Valention.
#. column 0: Summon forth your broken heart─a magicked chair representing the left half of a Valentione's Day heart.
#. column 2: But alas...the heart<br>will not be denied.<br>   - Byakudan
msgctxt "MountTransient:153:0:1"
msgid "Burdened with a warehouse of unsold broken heart chairs, House Valentione came up with the diabolic plan to repurpose the cushions with cloudsbreath and peddle them to the unknowing masses as flying mounts. Lady Lisette dreams of one day riding the hearts on her honeymoon."
msgstr "У Дома Валентион скопился целый склад нераспроданных кресел-разбитых сердец. И тогда там придумали коварный план: набить подушки облачной травой и сбыть их ничего не подозревающим покупателям в качестве летающих ездовых животных. Леди Лизетта мечтает однажды прокатиться на таком сердечке во время свадебного путешествия."

#. ja: 左心房！
#. de: Die Herzen werden euch zufliegen!<br><i>Byakudan</i>
#. fr: Cœur à bâbord<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your broken heart─a magicked chair representing the left half of a Valentione's Day heart.
#. column 1: Burdened with a warehouse of unsold broken heart chairs, House Valentione came up with the diabolic plan to repurpose the cushions with cloudsbreath and peddle them to the unknowing masses as flying mounts. Lady Lisette dreams of one day riding the hearts on her honeymoon.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:153:0:2"
msgid "But alas...the heart<br>will not be denied.<br>   - Byakudan"
msgstr "Но увы… Сердцу<br>не прикажешь.<br>   — Бякудан"

#. ja: テュポーン先生に騎乗する。<br>マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサーに勤務する謎の存在
#. de: Rufe Meister Typhon herbei, den schrecklichen Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten, der seltsamerweise im Gold Saucer angeheuert wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez Maître Typhon. Une créature étrange travaillant ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment au Gold Saucer des Manderville.
#. column 1: Since his summoning from the void by the Thaumaturges' Guild, Typhon has experienced his share of ups and downs. Through an employment opportunity at the Manderville Gold Saucer, however, the gaping-mawed horror─described by close acquaintances as quiet and reserved─has (figuratively speaking) landed back on his feet.
#. column 2: Is that your st-stomach<br>I hear rumbling?<br>   - Ultros
msgctxt "MountTransient:154:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Typhon, hideous voidsent aberration and standout employee at the Manderville Gold Saucer."
msgstr "Призовите Тифона — жуткое чудовище из пустоты и образцового сотрудника Золотого блюдца Мандервилля."

#. ja: 呪術士ギルドによる妖異召喚実験によって現れた謎の存在。紆余曲折を経て、現在はマンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサーにて鼻息荒く勤務している。無口でシャイな性格だが、意外と真面目な性格で与えられた役割はしっかりこなす
#. de: Meister Typhon ist die Ausgeburt eines missglückten Versuchs der Thaumaturgengilde. Er ist nicht sehr gesprächig und recht schüchtern, aber seine Arbeit im Gold Saucer erledigt er mit großer Hingabe.
#. fr: Ce démon a connu des hauts et des bas depuis son invocation fortuite par un maître occultiste. Aujourd'hui, il s'évertue à accomplir son travail au sein du Gold Saucer avec diligence. Bien que timide et taciturne, il remplit étonnamment son rôle comme il se doit.
#. column 0: Summon forth Typhon, hideous voidsent aberration and standout employee at the Manderville Gold Saucer.
#. column 2: Is that your st-stomach<br>I hear rumbling?<br>   - Ultros
msgctxt "MountTransient:154:0:1"
msgid "Since his summoning from the void by the Thaumaturges' Guild, Typhon has experienced his share of ups and downs. Through an employment opportunity at the Manderville Gold Saucer, however, the gaping-mawed horror─described by close acquaintances as quiet and reserved─has (figuratively speaking) landed back on his feet."
msgstr "С момента призыва из пустоты Гильдией магов-мистиков Тифону пришлось пережить немало взлётов и падений. Но благодаря работе в Золотом блюдце Мандервилля этот разинувший пасть кошмар — по словам близких, тихий и скромный — наконец-то, образно говоря, встал на ноги."

#. ja: フンガー！！
#. de: M-Meister Typhon ... Wie nett, dass Ihr gekommen seid, u-um mich anzufeuern.<br><i>Orthrus</i>
#. fr: Fungahhhhhh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Typhon, hideous voidsent aberration and standout employee at the Manderville Gold Saucer.
#. column 1: Since his summoning from the void by the Thaumaturges' Guild, Typhon has experienced his share of ups and downs. Through an employment opportunity at the Manderville Gold Saucer, however, the gaping-mawed horror─described by close acquaintances as quiet and reserved─has (figuratively speaking) landed back on his feet.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:154:0:2"
msgid "Is that your st-stomach<br>I hear rumbling?<br>   - Ultros"
msgstr "У тебя что, живот<br>урчит?<br>   — Ультрос"

#. ja: エアフォースに騎乗する。<br>被検世界「シグマ」にて生成された謎の飛行兵器
#. de: Rufe deine Luftwaffe herbei. Das tödliche Fluggerät wurde irgendwie aus Omegas Sigmametrie herausgeschmuggelt.
#. fr: Vous appelez une force aérienne, une mystérieuse arme volante issue de la dimension parallèle appelée “Sigmastice”.
#. column 1: From the amount of ordnance equipped, one can gather that this oddly shaped airship was employed in battle. However, being from the Sigmascape, who employed it and when are anyone's guess. The shark maw painted on its bow suggests an underwater civilization.
#. column 2: Transforming the wonder of air travel<br>into a means for delivering death is<br>blasphemy of the highest order!<br>   - Tataramu
msgctxt "MountTransient:156:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle Air Force, a flying weapon of masculine destruction somehow smuggled from Omega's Sigmascape."
msgstr "Призовите Воздушные силы — боевую летающую машину из измерения сигма Омеги, каким-то образом вывезенную оттуда."

#. ja: 被検世界「シグマ」にて生成された謎の飛行兵器。いずこかの国家の空軍が開発したものと思われるが、詳細は不明である。ノーズアートとして描かれた「シャークマウス」柄のせいか、どこか愛らしい顔立ちをしているのが特徴
#. de: Diese seltsam geformte Kampfmaschine stammt aus Omegas Sigmametrie und wurde vermutlich von einer fremden Macht entwickelt, deren Ursprung ein Rätsel bleibt. Das vorne aufgemalte Haimaul deutet auf eine maritime Zivilisation hin.
#. fr: De nombreuses inconnues entourent cette arme issue du Sigmastice. On sait simplement qu'elle a été conçue au sein de l'armée de l'air d'une certaine nation. Sa pointe à l'effigie d'une tête de requin lui confère un charme certain.
#. column 0: Call into battle Air Force, a flying weapon of masculine destruction somehow smuggled from Omega's Sigmascape.
#. column 2: Transforming the wonder of air travel<br>into a means for delivering death is<br>blasphemy of the highest order!<br>   - Tataramu
msgctxt "MountTransient:156:0:1"
msgid "From the amount of ordnance equipped, one can gather that this oddly shaped airship was employed in battle. However, being from the Sigmascape, who employed it and when are anyone's guess. The shark maw painted on its bow suggests an underwater civilization."
msgstr "Судя по обилию вооружения, этот странный летательный аппарат участвовал в боях. Но раз он из измерения сигма, кто и когда им пользовался — загадка. Нарисованная на носу пасть акулы намекает на подводную цивилизацию."

#. ja: カウント 6
#. de: Luftfahrttechnik als Waffe zu missbrauchen ist Häresie!<br><i>Tataramu</i>
#. fr: Compte à rebours<nbsp>: 6...
#. column 0: Call into battle Air Force, a flying weapon of masculine destruction somehow smuggled from Omega's Sigmascape.
#. column 1: From the amount of ordnance equipped, one can gather that this oddly shaped airship was employed in battle. However, being from the Sigmascape, who employed it and when are anyone's guess. The shark maw painted on its bow suggests an underwater civilization.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:156:0:2"
msgid "Transforming the wonder of air travel<br>into a means for delivering death is<br>blasphemy of the highest order!<br>   - Tataramu"
msgstr "Превращать чудо воздушных путешествий<br>в орудие смерти —<br>величайшее святотатство!<br>   — Татараму"

#. ja: 夜のカムイに騎乗する。<br>夜神に祝福された大狼。月光をまとい天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen lunarischen Kamuy herbei. Der von Tsukuyomi gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy de la nuit, une créature ayant hérité du pouvoir de Tsukuyomi, la Maîtresse de la lune et de la nuit.
#. column 1: When a wild wolf living in an abandoned imperial stronghold is bathed in the aether of a goddess reborn, amazing results are to be expected.
#. column 2: Doth the sun,<br>in her midday glory,<br>outshine the moon<br>of a night silent and solitary?<br>   - Seigetsu the Enlightened
msgctxt "MountTransient:158:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the lunar kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the Lady of the Moon."
msgstr "Призовите лунного камуи — благородного волка, благословлённого Владычицей луны."

#. ja: 夜神「ツクヨミ」の加護を受け、月光の力をまとった大狼。放棄された帝国軍施設を根城としていた野生の狼が、夜神のエーテルを浴びたことで誕生したものと思われる
#. de: Dieser Wolf streifte durch die Ruinen eines ver-<br>lassenen garleischen Stützpunktes, bis er mit dem Äther der Herrscherin der Nacht und des Mondes in Berührung kam.
#. fr: Touché par la bénédiction de Tsukuyomi, ce loup majestueux est enveloppé par l'énergie mystérieuse du clair de lune. On raconte qu'il vivait tapi dans une base impériale abandonnée jusqu'à ce qu'il soit en contact avec l'énergie éthérée de la Maîtresse de la lune et de la nuit.
#. column 0: Summon forth the lunar kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the Lady of the Moon.
#. column 2: Doth the sun,<br>in her midday glory,<br>outshine the moon<br>of a night silent and solitary?<br>   - Seigetsu the Enlightened
msgctxt "MountTransient:158:0:1"
msgid "When a wild wolf living in an abandoned imperial stronghold is bathed in the aether of a goddess reborn, amazing results are to be expected."
msgstr "Дикий волк жил в заброшенной имперской крепости. Когда он оказался под влиянием эфира переродившейся богини, результат превзошёл все ожидания."

#. ja: ウォォォン！
#. de: Haben die denn keine Brillenputztücher aus Schneewolfmähne?<br><i>Nashu</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the lunar kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the Lady of the Moon.
#. column 1: When a wild wolf living in an abandoned imperial stronghold is bathed in the aether of a goddess reborn, amazing results are to be expected.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:158:0:2"
msgid "Doth the sun,<br>in her midday glory,<br>outshine the moon<br>of a night silent and solitary?<br>   - Seigetsu the Enlightened"
msgstr "Солнце ли<br>в полуденном сиянье<br>затмит луну<br>безмолвной одинокой ночи?<br>   — Сэйгэцу Просветлённый"

#. ja: ドードーに騎乗する。<br>東方地域では、絶滅したと考えられていた幻の陸鳥。なぜか飛べる
#. de: Rufe deinen Dodo herbei. Hoffentlich nicht der Letzte seiner Art!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre dodo. Ce spécimen est étrangement capable de voler et est originaire d'Orient où l'on croyait l'espèce éteinte.
#. column 1: For centuries people of the Far East believed the dodo lost─the cloudkin hunted to extinction by poachers who would use its feathers for petticoats and its eggs for cheesy omelettes. The recent discovery of a nest in the upper echelons of Heaven<hyphen>on<hyphen>High, however, has given naturalists hope that the species may still endure.
#. column 2: Those are some interestin'-lookin'<br>dodos ye've got there.<br>   - Jacke
msgctxt "MountTransient:159:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your noble dodo─hopefully not the last one in existence."
msgstr "Призовите благородного додо — надеемся, последнего в своём роде не придётся искать."

#. ja: 東方地域では、絶滅したと考えられていた幻の陸鳥。アメノミハシラの頂上という閉鎖環境に適応するため、種の限界を超えて飛翔能力を獲得するに至った。冒険者と出会ったことで、さらなる外界に羽ばたく決意をしたようだ
#. de: Jahrhunderte hielt man den Dodo im Fernen Osten für ausgestorben. Ausgerottet von Jägern, die es auf seine glänzenden Federn und schmackhafte Riesen-<br>omelettes abgesehen hatten. Seit der Entdeckung eines Nestes, hoch oben in der Himmelssäule, schöpfen alle Naturfreunde Hoffnung.
#. fr: Les dodos ont disparu des contrées orientales, enfin presque. Vous avez découvert celui-ci enfermé au pinacle du Pilier des Cieux. Cet environnement hostile lui a permis de dépasser ses limites, et il désire maintenant relever de nouveaux défis à vos côtés.
#. column 0: Summon forth your noble dodo─hopefully not the last one in existence.
#. column 2: Those are some interestin'-lookin'<br>dodos ye've got there.<br>   - Jacke
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:159:0:1"
msgid "For centuries people of the Far East believed the dodo lost─the cloudkin hunted to extinction by poachers who would use its feathers for petticoats and its eggs for cheesy omelettes. The recent discovery of a nest in the upper echelons of Heaven<hyphen>on<hyphen>High, however, has given naturalists hope that the species may still endure."
msgstr "Веками жители Дальнего Востока считали додо вымершими. Браконьеры истребили этих пернатых, пуская их перья на юбки, а яйца — на омлеты с сыром. Но недавно на верхних ярусах Небесной твердыни обнаружили гнездо, и натуралисты снова поверили, что вид ещё можно спасти."

#. ja: パタパタパタ！
#. de: Da brat mir doch einer 'nen Dodo!<br><i>Weites Tal</i>
#. fr: FLAP FLAP FLAP<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your noble dodo─hopefully not the last one in existence.
#. column 1: For centuries people of the Far East believed the dodo lost─the cloudkin hunted to extinction by poachers who would use its feathers for petticoats and its eggs for cheesy omelettes. The recent discovery of a nest in the upper echelons of Heaven<hyphen>on<hyphen>High, however, has given naturalists hope that the species may still endure.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:159:0:2"
msgid "Those are some interestin'-lookin'<br>dodos ye've got there.<br>   - Jacke"
msgstr "Какие занятные додо<br>у вас тут водятся.<br>   — Джек"

#. ja: ホエールに騎乗する。<br>瑠璃洋に生息する大型生物
#. de: Rufe einen riesigen Wal aus indigoblauen Tiefen herbei, auf dem auch noch eine zweite Person Platz findet. Wenn das doch bloß auch mit Fischen klappen würde!
#. fr: Vous appelez une baleine, le plus grand mammifère de l'Océan de Verre.
#. column 1: Pods of these massive wavekin are believed to traverse the Indigo Deep for thousands of malms in pursuit of food. Why they would choose to limit themselves to the confines of the sea despite possessing the capacity for aether-assisted flight is a mystery scholars have pondered for centuries.
#. column 2: Why, what a whale you've<br>whisked out of the whitecaps!<br>   - Wawalago
msgctxt "MountTransient:160:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a massive whale straight from the Indigo Deep. If only you could do this with fish as well."
msgstr "Призовите огромного кита из Лазурного океана. Вот бы так же можно было вылавливать рыб!"

#. ja: 瑠璃洋に生息する大型生物。群れを成して外洋を回遊し、エサを求めてかなりの距離を移動する。シマエイ同様、身体をエーテル翼のように利用し、羽ばたくことができるようだ。かなりの巨体であるため、楽々と複数人を運べる
#. de: Herden dieses riesigen Säugers durchstreifen die Tiefen der Rubinsee tausende Malme weit auf der Suche nach Futter. Warum sie sich auf die See beschränken, obwohl sie ätherunterstützt fliegen können, ist ein Rätsel, das die Gelehrten bis heute beschäftigt.
#. fr: Ce colossal mammifère marin se déplace en groupe dans l'Océan de Verre, parcourant parfois de longues distances pour trouver de la nourriture. L'énergie éthérée contenue dans l'eau et le vent lui permet de se mouvoir aisément en mer ou dans les airs, même avec plusieurs personnes sur son dos.
#. column 0: Summon forth a massive whale straight from the Indigo Deep. If only you could do this with fish as well.
#. column 2: Why, what a whale you've<br>whisked out of the whitecaps!<br>   - Wawalago
msgctxt "MountTransient:160:0:1"
msgid "Pods of these massive wavekin are believed to traverse the Indigo Deep for thousands of malms in pursuit of food. Why they would choose to limit themselves to the confines of the sea despite possessing the capacity for aether-assisted flight is a mystery scholars have pondered for centuries."
msgstr "Считается, что стаи этих огромных морских созданий преодолевают тысячи мальмов в Лазурном океане в поисках пищи. Учёные уже веками гадают, почему они держатся моря, хотя эфир позволяет им летать."

#. ja: ♪♪♪
#. de: Ich schätze, es steht nicht zur Debatte,<br>den inselfressenden Wal einfach Wal sein zu lassen?<br><i>Cid</i>
#. fr: Wouuuh...
#. column 0: Summon forth a massive whale straight from the Indigo Deep. If only you could do this with fish as well.
#. column 1: Pods of these massive wavekin are believed to traverse the Indigo Deep for thousands of malms in pursuit of food. Why they would choose to limit themselves to the confines of the sea despite possessing the capacity for aether-assisted flight is a mystery scholars have pondered for centuries.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:160:0:2"
msgid "Why, what a whale you've<br>whisked out of the whitecaps!<br>   - Wawalago"
msgstr "Вот это кита вы<br>выловили из пены морской!<br>   — Вавалаго"

#. ja: リオレウスに騎乗する。<br>空の王者とも称される飛竜種
#. de: Rufe deinen Rathalos, einen mächtigen Wyvern, aus seinem fernen Heimatland herbei. Wegen seiner urplötzlichen Luftattacken nennt man ihn auch den „König der Lüfte“.
#. fr: Vous appelez le Rathalos, une wyverne féroce venue d'une contrée lointaine où elle est surnommée “le roi des cieux”.
#. column 1: Many a brave hunter has attempted to topple this flame-belching beast from his fiery throne atop the forest, yet only a few can claim to have conquered the King of the Skies.
#. column 2: The wyverns are scary.<br>Is there no safe place?<br>   - Wandering Gnath
msgctxt "MountTransient:161:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your mighty Rathalos─a wyvern far, far from home."
msgstr "Призовите могучего Раталоса — виверну, оказавшуюся далеко от родины."

#. ja: 空の王者とも称される飛竜種。火竜という別名が示すとおり、高熱のブレスを吐くことができる。はるか彼方の異邦の地では、多くのハンターたちが、その鱗などを求めて狩猟に挑んでいるようだ
#. de: Schon viele mutige Jäger haben sich dem feuer-<br>speienden Wyvern entgegengestellt, nur um in ein qualmendes Aschehäufchen verwandelt zu werden.
#. fr: Nombreux sont les chasseurs qui ont tenté d'ajouter le nom redouté de cette wyverne de feu à leur tableau de chasse, mais peu sont ceux qui peuvent se targuer d'avoir véritablement conquis le domaine du roi des cieux.
#. column 0: Summon forth your mighty Rathalos─a wyvern far, far from home.
#. column 2: The wyverns are scary.<br>Is there no safe place?<br>   - Wandering Gnath
msgctxt "MountTransient:161:0:1"
msgid "Many a brave hunter has attempted to topple this flame-belching beast from his fiery throne atop the forest, yet only a few can claim to have conquered the King of the Skies."
msgstr "Многие храбрые охотники пытались свергнуть огнедышащего зверя с его пламенного трона над лесом, но лишь немногие могут похвастаться, что одолели Повелителя небес."

#. ja: ひと狩りいこうぜ！
#. de: Das ist das Gebrüll des Rathalos! Deckung!!!<br><i>Felyne</i>
#. fr: Bonne chasse<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your mighty Rathalos─a wyvern far, far from home.
#. column 1: Many a brave hunter has attempted to topple this flame-belching beast from his fiery throne atop the forest, yet only a few can claim to have conquered the King of the Skies.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:161:0:2"
msgid "The wyverns are scary.<br>Is there no safe place?<br>   - Wandering Gnath "
msgstr "Виверны страшные.<br>Неужели нигде не укрыться?<br>   — Бродячий гнат"

#. ja: 魔導キャリアーに騎乗する。<br>魔導院にて開発された次世代型輸送プラットフォーム
#. de: Rufe deinen Magitek-Transporter herbei, eine Weiterentwicklung allagischer Beförderungstechnologie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre transporteur magitek, un moyen de locomotion nouvelle génération développé à l'académie magitek.
#. column 1: It is not in Garlean nature to leave well enough alone, and so for the past twenty summers, imperial magitek engineers have been perfecting the art of aerial transport. Surprisingly, it is not outfitted with an active weapons system─clearly an oversight that will be amended in the next model.
#. column 2: I cannot begin to comprehend<br>what our visitor is trying to<br>convey.<br>   - OIC Administrator
msgctxt "MountTransient:162:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek conveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics."
msgstr "Призовите магитехнический транспортёр — усовершенствованное современное средство перевозки на основе древних аллагских технологий."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国の魔導院にて開発された次世代型輸送プラットフォーム。飛空艇技術を応用しており、乗り心地は抜群。思わず「ククク……」と忍び笑いが漏れてしまいそうになる。なお、純粋な輸送用機のため戦闘能力は皆無
#. de: Es liegt nicht in der garleischen Natur, Gutes bei Gutem zu belassen. Und so haben imperiale Magitek-Ingenieure die letzten zwanzig Sommer damit verbracht, die Kunst des Lufttransports zu per<shy>fek<shy>tio<shy>nie<shy>ren. Erstaunlicherweise fehlt dem Magitek-Transporter eine Waffe. Aber sicher nicht mehr lange ...
#. fr: Entièrement conçu à l'académie magitek de l'empire de Garlemald, ce transporteur personnel met à profit la technologie des aéronefs pour offrir à son passager une mobilité et un confort inégalés. Attention, son utilisation au combat est fortement déconseillée.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek conveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics.
#. column 2: I cannot begin to comprehend<br>what our visitor is trying to<br>convey.<br>   - OIC Administrator
msgctxt "MountTransient:162:0:1"
msgid "It is not in Garlean nature to leave well enough alone, and so for the past twenty summers, imperial magitek engineers have been perfecting the art of aerial transport. Surprisingly, it is not outfitted with an active weapons system─clearly an oversight that will be amended in the next model."
msgstr "Гарлеанцам не свойственно довольствоваться достигнутым, и потому последние двадцать лет имперские магитехнические инженеры совершенствуют воздушный транспорт. Удивительно, но на нём нет активной системы вооружения. Очевидно, недочёт исправят в следующей модели."

#. ja: ククク……
#. de: Ein Magitek-Kessel zum Wasserkochen, was?<br>Jetzt wundert mich gar nichts mehr.<br><i>Nero</i>
#. fr: Bzzz... Bzzz...
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek conveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics.
#. column 1: It is not in Garlean nature to leave well enough alone, and so for the past twenty summers, imperial magitek engineers have been perfecting the art of aerial transport. Surprisingly, it is not outfitted with an active weapons system─clearly an oversight that will be amended in the next model.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:162:0:2"
msgid "I cannot begin to comprehend<br>what our visitor is trying to<br>convey.<br>   - OIC Administrator"
msgstr "Не могу даже представить,<br>что пытается нам<br>сообщить наш гость.<br>   — Администратор ОИО"

#. ja: プロトキャリアーに騎乗する。<br>魔導院にて開発された次世代型輸送プラットフォーム
#. de: Rufe deinen Proto-Transporter herbei, eine Weiterentwicklung allagischer Beförderungstechnologie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre transporteur prototype, un engin de transport en développement à l'académie magitek.
#. column 1: It is not in Garlean nature to leave well enough alone, and so, not a single moon after the completion of their new conveyor system, imperial magitek engineers returned to the drawing board to improve upon their creation─replacing existing steel exoplates with <i>high-quality</i> steel exoplates.
#. column 2: You are not <i>supposed</i><br>to be able to descend<br>of your own volition.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
msgctxt "MountTransient:163:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your prototype magitek conveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics."
msgstr "Призовите прототип магитехнического транспортёра — усовершенствованное современное средство перевозки на основе древних аллагских технологий."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国の魔導院にて開発された次世代型輸送プラットフォーム。その試作型にあたる本機は、後に量産されたモデルよりも、高品質な鋼材を利用しているらしい。ただし、基本的な性能に大きな差はないようだ
#. de: Es liegt nicht in der garleischen Natur, Gutes bei Gutem zu belassen. Und so bauten die imperialen Magitek-Ingenieure schon bald einen neuen Magitek-Transporter - wobei sie konventionelle Exopanzerplatten durch <i>hochwertige</i> Exopanzerplatten ersetzten.
#. fr: Utilisé lors d'essais à l'académie magitek de l'empire de Garlemald, ce prototype de transporteur personnel utilise des matériaux de meilleure qualité que le modèle final de production. Cependant, leurs performances semblent plus ou moins équivalentes.
#. column 0: Call into battle your prototype magitek conveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics.
#. column 2: You are not <i>supposed</i><br>to be able to descend<br>of your own volition.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:163:0:1"
msgid "It is not in Garlean nature to leave well enough alone, and so, not a single moon after the completion of their new conveyor system, imperial magitek engineers returned to the drawing board to improve upon their creation─replacing existing steel exoplates with <i>high-quality</i> steel exoplates."
msgstr "Гарлеанцы не умеют останавливаться на достигнутом. Не прошло и месяца после завершения нового транспортёра, как имперские магитехнические инженеры снова взялись за чертежи, чтобы улучшить свою разработку: заменили стальные пластины корпуса на <i>высококачественные</i> стальные пластины."

#. ja: 実験成功だ！
#. de: Brauche ich Vergleichsobjekt aus federloser Hand,<br>um zu verbessern Metallteile.<br><i>Duzal Meyean</i>
#. fr: Bzzz... Bzzz<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Call into battle your prototype magitek conveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics.
#. column 1: It is not in Garlean nature to leave well enough alone, and so, not a single moon after the completion of their new conveyor system, imperial magitek engineers returned to the drawing board to improve upon their creation─replacing existing steel exoplates with <i>high-quality</i> steel exoplates.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:163:0:2"
msgid "You are not <i>supposed</i><br>to be able to descend<br>of your own volition.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva"
msgstr "Ты вообще не <i>должен</i><br>уметь спускаться<br>по собственному желанию.<br>   — Неро тол Скаева"

#. ja: オオナマズ御輿に騎乗する。<br>ナマズオ族の祖先、オオナマズ様を祀った浮行式御輿
#. de: Dieser tragbare Schrein wurde zu Ehren des Urahns der Namazuo, der Großen Flosse, erbaut.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mikoshi, un palanquin à la gloire du grand Namazu.
#. column 1: Due to excessive zeal on the part of Gyoshin, this mikoshi was crafted with more cloudsbreath than is necessary or, indeed, safe. Thus, it not only floats atop the shoulders of its bearers, it soars aloft regardless of their presence─though that does not discourage them from clinging to its poles anyway.
#. column 2: Wasshoi! Wasshoi! Wassh─ Ow!<br>I think I pulled something...<br>   - Gyoshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:164:0:0"
msgid "Summon your team of Namazu bearers, carrying a garish mikoshi upon which to precariously perch as they waddle to your destination."
msgstr "Призовите носильщиков-намазу, которые понесут пёстрый микоси. Только держитесь крепче, пока они вразвалочку несут вас к цели!"

#. ja: 大鯰大祭で担がれている浮行式御輿。その頂には、職人ギョシンが夢で見たという、ナマズオ族の祖先、オオナマズ様の御姿を再現した飾りが輝いている。冒険者に忠誠を誓った担ぎ手ナマズオ八人衆付き！
#. de: Das Dach dieses prächtigen Wanderschreins ziert eine goldene Statue, die den Urahn aller Namazuo darstellt, und zu dessen Ehren der Mikoshi erbaut wurde. Der Schrein wird von acht treuen Namazuo getragen und ist ein Meisterwerk Gyoshins.
#. fr: Fidèle reproduction du mikoshi fabriqué par Gyoshin pour sa grande frairie, ce palanquin est porté à bout de nageoires par huit Namazu dévoués. L'un d'entre eux semble avoir quelque peu présumé de ses forces... À vous de l'encourager en criant “Oh hisse<nbsp>!” le plus fort possible<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your team of Namazu bearers, carrying a garish mikoshi upon which to precariously perch as they waddle to your destination.
#. column 2: Wasshoi! Wasshoi! Wassh─ Ow!<br>I think I pulled something...<br>   - Gyoshin
msgctxt "MountTransient:164:0:1"
msgid "Due to excessive zeal on the part of Gyoshin, this mikoshi was crafted with more cloudsbreath than is necessary or, indeed, safe. Thus, it not only floats atop the shoulders of its bearers, it soars aloft regardless of their presence─though that does not discourage them from clinging to its poles anyway."
msgstr "Из-за чрезмерного рвения Гёсина в этот микоси встроили куда больше облачного эфира, чем нужно, да и безопасно. Теперь он не просто парит над плечами носильщиков, а летает сам по себе. Впрочем, это не мешает им цепляться за шесты."

#. ja: わっしょい、わっしょい♪
#. de: Wasshoi, Wasshoi, Wasshoi ♪<br><i>Festlicher Namazuo</i>
#. fr: Oh hisse<nbsp>! Oh hisse<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your team of Namazu bearers, carrying a garish mikoshi upon which to precariously perch as they waddle to your destination.
#. column 1: Due to excessive zeal on the part of Gyoshin, this mikoshi was crafted with more cloudsbreath than is necessary or, indeed, safe. Thus, it not only floats atop the shoulders of its bearers, it soars aloft regardless of their presence─though that does not discourage them from clinging to its poles anyway.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:164:0:2"
msgid "Wasshoi! Wasshoi! Wassh─ Ow!<br>I think I pulled something...<br>   - Gyoshin"
msgstr "Вассой! Вассой! Ва... Ай!<br>Кажется, я что-то потянул...<br>   — Гёсин"

#. ja: 絶地に騎乗する。<br>地を踏まぬほど疾く駆けるという駿馬
#. de: Rufe Juedi herbei und galoppiere mit wahnsinniger Ge<shy>schwindig<shy>keit davon.
#. fr: Vous appelez Juedi, un cheval si rapide que ses sabots ne font qu'effleurer le sol.
#. column 1: Its ancient Doman name loosely translating to “ludicrously swift steed that runs so fast its feet no longer touch the ground,” Juedi is yet another horse of legend, showered with geomantic magicks to grant the creature the gift of flight.
#. column 2: How mightily <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> must have<br>toiled to <i>become</i> a horse...<br>   - Haurchefant
msgctxt "MountTransient:166:0:0"
msgid "Summon Juedi, and jump straight to ludicrous speed."
msgstr "Призовите Цзюэди и разгонитесь до безумной скорости."

#. ja: アメノミハシラにて発見されたたくましい軍馬。古の王が愛したという「地を踏まぬほど疾く駆けるという駿馬」から、「絶地」と名付けられた。実際、風水術の効果によって、空を駆けることができるという
#. de: Juedi ist ein legendäres Ross, das mit der Magie der Geomanten gesegnet wurde. Der Name bedeutet so viel wie „wahnsinnig schnelles Pferd, das im Galopp abhebt“.
#. fr: Juedi signifie dans l'ancien dialecte domien “cheval si rapide que ses sabots ne font qu'effleurer le sol”, un nom supposément trouvé par un monarque de l'époque qui le chérissait. Des enchantements géomantiques seraient à l'origine de sa capacité à voler.
#. column 0: Summon Juedi, and jump straight to ludicrous speed.
#. column 2: How mightily <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> must have<br>toiled to <i>become</i> a horse...<br>   - Haurchefant
msgctxt "MountTransient:166:0:1"
msgid "Its ancient Doman name loosely translating to “ludicrously swift steed that runs so fast its feet no longer touch the ground,” Juedi is yet another horse of legend, showered with geomantic magicks to grant the creature the gift of flight."
msgstr "Древнее доманское имя Цзюэди примерно означает «невероятно быстрый скакун, чьи ноги от скорости отрываются от земли». Ещё одна легендарная лошадь, получившая дар полёта благодаря чарам геомантии."

#. ja: 絶地！
#. de: Halt dich gut fest, Soldat.<br>Gleich hebst du ab!<br><i>Domanischer Offizier</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon Juedi, and jump straight to ludicrous speed.
#. column 1: Its ancient Doman name loosely translating to “ludicrously swift steed that runs so fast its feet no longer touch the ground,” Juedi is yet another horse of legend, showered with geomantic magicks to grant the creature the gift of flight.
#. macro: <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:166:0:2"
msgid "How mightily <if $gn4>she<else>he</if> must have<br>toiled to <i>become</i> a horse...<br>   - Haurchefant"
msgstr "Как же много <if $gn4>ей<else>ему</if> пришлось<br>потрудиться, чтобы <i>стать</i> лошадью…<br>   — Оршефан"

#. ja: 輸送システムに騎乗する。<br>古代アラグ帝国時代に設計された汎用球形運搬システム
#. de: Aktiviere ein allagisches Logistikmodul, si<shy>cher<shy>heits<shy>hal<shy>ber mit deaktiviertem Waffensystem.
#. fr: Vous appelez un module de transport sphérique. Cet appareil a été conçu dans l'ancien empire d'Allag à des fins multiples, mais surtout militaires.
#. column 1: One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to oversee logistics in their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere was off-loaded to the Eorzean Alliance and modified into a personal transportation device.
#. column 2: Allagan technology, eh?<br>   - Fyrgeiss
msgctxt "MountTransient:167:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your Allagan logistics node. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled."
msgstr "Призовите аллагский узел снабжения. Ради вашей безопасности и безопасности окружающих всё оружие отключено."

#. ja: 聖コイナク財団が発掘した古代アラグ帝国の汎用球形運搬システム。同財団からエオルゼア同盟軍へと払い下げられたもので、乗用として利用可能なように調整されている。事あるごとに、ログオン処理を求められるのが玉にキズ
#. de: Eine der automatisierten Drohnen, die die Allager zur Überwachung der Logistik in ihren Anlagen einsetzten. Die Forscher der Sankt Coinach-Stiftung fanden die Drohne und übergaben sie der  Eorzäischen Allianz, die sie zu einem persönlichen Transportmittel umbaute.
#. fr: Ce module sphérique allagois a été découvert par les archéologues de la Fondation de Saint-Coinach. Il a été concédé à l'Alliance éorzéenne, qui a effectué des réglages pour le convertir en moyen de transport. S'il ne devait avoir qu'un seul défaut, ce serait sa fâcheuse manie d'exiger une authentification à la moindre occasion.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Allagan logistics node. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled.
#. column 2: Allagan technology, eh?<br>   - Fyrgeiss
msgctxt "MountTransient:167:0:1"
msgid "One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to oversee logistics in their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere was off-loaded to the Eorzean Alliance and modified into a personal transportation device."
msgstr "Один из автоматических дронов, которых аллаги использовали для управления снабжением в своих крепостях. Исследователи Сынов святого Койнаха откопали механическую сферу и передали её Альянсу Эорзеи, где её приспособили для личного транспорта."

#. ja: ログオンするには……
#. de: Allagische Technologie also?<br><i>Fyrgeiss</i>
#. fr: Veuillez fournir vos identifiants de connexion.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Allagan logistics node. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled.
#. column 1: One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to oversee logistics in their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere was off-loaded to the Eorzean Alliance and modified into a personal transportation device.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:167:0:2"
msgid "Allagan technology, eh?<br>   - Fyrgeiss"
msgstr "Аллагские технологии, да?<br>   — Фиргейс"

#. ja: 護送システムに騎乗する。<br>古代アラグ帝国時代に設計された汎用球形運搬システム
#. de: Aktiviere ein allagisches Sicherheitssystem, si<shy>cher<shy>heits<shy>hal<shy>ber mit deaktiviertem Waffensystem.
#. fr: Vous appelez un module d'escorte sphérique. Cet appareil a été conçu dans l'ancien empire d'Allag à des fins multiples, mais surtout défensives.
#. column 1: One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to maintain and protect their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere's processing unit was updated with the aid of Garlond Ironworks engineers to improve security.
#. column 2: The system crashes...<br>   - Ardashir
msgctxt "MountTransient:168:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your Allagan safeguard system. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled."
msgstr "Призовите аллагскую систему защиты. Ради вашей безопасности и безопасности окружающих всё оружие отключено."

#. ja: 聖コイナク財団が発掘した古代アラグ帝国の汎用球形運搬システム。オペレーションシステムが更新されたことで、セキュリティ面が強化されている。既存のモデルと、インターフェースが変わってしまっているのが玉にキズ
#. de: Eine der automatisierten Drohnen, die die Allager zum Schutz ihrer Anlagen einsetzten. Die Forscher der Sankt Coinach-Stiftung fanden die Drohne, übergaben sie den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken, deren Techniker sie wieder einsatzbereit machten.
#. fr: Ce module sphérique allagois a été découvert par les archéologues de la Fondation de Saint-Coinach. Son système d'ex<shy>ploi<shy>ta<shy>tion a été mis à jour par souci de sécurité, mais ses instruments de contrôle différents des autres modèles donnent du fil à retordre aux chercheurs qui l'étudient.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Allagan safeguard system. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled.
#. column 2: The system crashes...<br>   - Ardashir
msgctxt "MountTransient:168:0:1"
msgid "One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to maintain and protect their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere's processing unit was updated with the aid of Garlond Ironworks engineers to improve security."
msgstr "Один из автоматических дронов, которыми аллаганцы охраняли свои крепости и следили за их состоянием. После того как Сыны Святого Койнака раскопали механическую сферу, инженеры Гарлондских мастерских обновили её вычислительный блок, усилив защиту."

#. ja: ……に生まれた<br>新しい高速な……
#. de: Das System ist unsicher ...<br><i>Ardashir</i>
#. fr: Mise à jour terminée, en attente d'in<shy>struc<shy>tions.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Allagan safeguard system. For your safety and the safety of those around you, all weaponry has been disabled.
#. column 1: One of the automated system drones deployed by the Allagans to maintain and protect their strongholds. After being unearthed by the Sons of Saint Coinach, the mechanical sphere's processing unit was updated with the aid of Garlond Ironworks engineers to improve security.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:168:0:2"
msgid "The system crashes...<br>   - Ardashir"
msgstr "Система дала сбой…<br>   — Ардашир"

#. ja: グラニに騎乗する。<br>異界由来の魔笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣
#. de: Rufe Grani herbei, das legendäre Fabelwesen aus einer fremden Welt.
#. fr: Vous appelez Grani. Une bête légendaire venue d'un autre monde.
#. column 1: Possessed of a strength of both mind and body that is unmatched in the First, as a mount, Grani has no peer on land nor in the heavens. It is said, however, the noble creature will only accept a rider who has pledged to restore shadow to a land bereft of night.
#. column 2: The lives of my men may depend<br>upon the swiftness of your steed...<br>   - Topher
msgctxt "MountTransient:170:0:0"
msgid "Summon Grani, heroic steed from a realm not your own."
msgstr "Призовите Грани — героического скакуна из чужого мира."

#. ja: 第一世界に由来する魔笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣。大地を蹴る健脚と、天を駆ける魔力を有す。誇り高き存在として知られ、光を払い闇をもたらす英雄、「闇の戦士」でなければ決して背に乗せることはないという
#. de: Dieses fantastische Reittier stammt aus der ersten Splitter<shy>welt. Mit seinen kräftigen Beinen gallopiert es geschwind über die Erde. Wie von Zauberhand fliegt es flink durch die Lüfte. Es gilt als überaus stolz und man sagt, es würde nur einen Krieger der Dunkelheit auf seinem Rücken dulden.
#. fr: Au galop, ses pieds violentent le sol, et son éther inonde l'atmosphère lorsqu'il s'envole. Grani est un être fier et n'accepte sur son dos que la personne capable de bannir les nuits éternelles, le Guerrier des Ténèbres.
#. column 0: Summon Grani, heroic steed from a realm not your own.
#. column 2: The lives of my men may depend<br>upon the swiftness of your steed...<br>   - Topher
msgctxt "MountTransient:170:0:1"
msgid "Possessed of a strength of both mind and body that is unmatched in the First, as a mount, Grani has no peer on land nor in the heavens. It is said, however, the noble creature will only accept a rider who has pledged to restore shadow to a land bereft of night."
msgstr "Грани нет равных в Первом осколке — ни на земле, ни в небесах. Ему подвластны и сила духа, и сила тела. Говорят, это благородное создание признаёт лишь всадника, поклявшегося вернуть тьму в мир, лишённый ночи."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Dein Leben hängt von der Schnelligkeit deines Reittiers ab.<br><i>Topher</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon Grani, heroic steed from a realm not your own.
#. column 1: Possessed of a strength of both mind and body that is unmatched in the First, as a mount, Grani has no peer on land nor in the heavens. It is said, however, the noble creature will only accept a rider who has pledged to restore shadow to a land bereft of night.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:170:0:2"
msgid "The lives of my men may depend<br>upon the swiftness of your steed...<br>   - Topher"
msgstr "От скорости твоего скакуна<br>может зависеть жизнь моих людей…<br>   — Тофер"

#. ja: ビッグ・ファットキャットに騎乗する。<br>おでぶな大猫。もはや化け猫の類な気がする
#. de: Rufe deine fette Katze herbei, die noch dicker als eine dicke Katze ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre très gros minou. Un animal si corpulent qu'on se demande s'il appartient encore à l'espèce féline.
#. column 1: Seeing as how this pursy pussy can defy the very laws of physics by propelling itself high into the firmament, it is very likely that the creature is either a voidsent using a bloated cat's corpse as its corporeal vessel, or a deceased pet reanimated by one well versed in the necromantic arts.
#. column 2: The entire city would be overrun<br>with large-testicled raccoon<br>dogs and flying rainbow cats...<br>   - Kyokuho
msgctxt "MountTransient:171:0:0"
msgid "Summon your fatter cat─fatter than a fat cat, obviously."
msgstr "Призовите толстого кота — толще толстенного кота, само собой."

#. ja: おでぶな大猫。その巨体は地を揺るがし、そして空をも揺るがしながら、縦横無尽に駆け回る。もはや化け猫の類な気もするが、脂肪も毛もフカフカのモッフモフと乗り心地は抜群なので、細かい事は気にしないでおこう
#. de: Die Fettleibigkeit dieser Katze scheint in keiner Weise ihre Beweglichkeit zu beeinträchtigen. Ganz im Gegenteil, sie kann nicht nur flott rennen, sondern tollt sogar durch die Lüfte. Außerdem hat sie ein unglaublich flauschiges Fell. Einfach zum Verlieben!
#. fr: Ce chat est tout simplement énorme. Le sol tremble sous ses gros petons, le vent souffle sur les régions qu'il survole tant il déplace de l'air. Son pelage fourni et sa couche de graisse en font toutefois une monture très confortable, alors on lui pardonne son “petit” défaut.
#. column 0: Summon your fatter cat─fatter than a fat cat, obviously.
#. column 2: The entire city would be overrun<br>with large-testicled raccoon<br>dogs and flying rainbow cats...<br>   - Kyokuho
msgctxt "MountTransient:171:0:1"
msgid "Seeing as how this pursy pussy can defy the very laws of physics by propelling itself high into the firmament, it is very likely that the creature is either a voidsent using a bloated cat's corpse as its corporeal vessel, or a deceased pet reanimated by one well versed in the necromantic arts."
msgstr "Этот пухлый кот взмывает высоко в небо, наперекор законам физики. Скорее всего, это либо исчадие пустоты, использующее труп раздувшегося кота как тело, либо оживший питомец, которого вернул к жизни знаток некромантии."

#. ja: ごろにゃーご♪
#. de: Ich hätte mir schon viel früher eine Katze anschaffen sollen.<br><i>Melkoko</i>
#. fr: MIAOÛÛÛ<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your fatter cat─fatter than a fat cat, obviously.
#. column 1: Seeing as how this pursy pussy can defy the very laws of physics by propelling itself high into the firmament, it is very likely that the creature is either a voidsent using a bloated cat's corpse as its corporeal vessel, or a deceased pet reanimated by one well versed in the necromantic arts.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:171:0:2"
msgid "The entire city would be overrun<br>with large-testicled raccoon<br>dogs and flying rainbow cats...<br>   - Kyokuho"
msgstr "Целый город заполонили бы<br>толстозадые енотовидные собаки<br>и летающие радужные коты…<br>   — Кёкухо"

#. ja: 朱のカムイに騎乗する。<br>朱雀の神通力を受けた大狼。炎をまとい天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen feurigen Kamuy herbei. Der von Suzaku gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy du sud, une créature bénie par les flammes de Suzaku.
#. column 1: Having sacrificed its life to save his master, this magnificent canine was spared the pull of the Lifestream by the auspice Suzaku and her scarlet flames of rebirth.
#. column 2: Yes, yes, that's the<br>spirit, little wolves...<br>   - Disembodied Voice
msgctxt "MountTransient:172:0:0"
msgid "Summon your euphonious kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the scarlet auspice Suzaku."
msgstr "Призовите благозвучного камуя — благородного волка, благословлённого алой авгурой Судзаку."

#. ja: 四聖獣「朱雀」の神通力を受け、朱の炎をまとった大狼。おそらく人々を救うために戦い命を散らせた大狼を、朱雀が再生させたことで、誕生したものと思われる
#. de: Der einst gewöhnliche Wolf gab sein Leben im Kampf und rettete damit Unschuldige vor dem Tod. Dafür wurde er von der Tierheiligen Suzaku wiederbelebt und mit besonderen Kräften ausgestattet.
#. fr: Tombé au cours d'un combat, cet énorme loup surnaturel aurait été ressuscité par Suzaku, l'Oiseau vermillon. Le Zuijû lui aurait conféré sa bénédiction afin qu'il puisse aider les humains à échapper à la mort.
#. column 0: Summon your euphonious kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the scarlet auspice Suzaku.
#. column 2: Yes, yes, that's the<br>spirit, little wolves...<br>   - Disembodied Voice
msgctxt "MountTransient:172:0:1"
msgid "Having sacrificed its life to save his master, this magnificent canine was spared the pull of the Lifestream by the auspice Suzaku and her scarlet flames of rebirth."
msgstr "Этот великолепный зверь пожертвовал собой, чтобы спасти хозяина. Но авгура Судзаку не позволила ему кануть в Поток жизни и возродила его в алом пламени."

#. ja: ワオォォン！
#. de: Wer hat Angst vor dem feurigen Wolf?<br><i>Großmutter</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your euphonious kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the scarlet auspice Suzaku.
#. column 1: Having sacrificed its life to save his master, this magnificent canine was spared the pull of the Lifestream by the auspice Suzaku and her scarlet flames of rebirth.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:172:0:2"
msgid "Yes, yes, that's the<br>spirit, little wolves...<br>   - Disembodied Voice"
msgstr "Вот так, вот так…<br>Ну же, маленькие волки…<br>   — Бестелесный голос"

#. ja: オメガに騎乗する。<br>オメガに似た自律飛翔体。騎乗に使うことができる
#. de: Rufe ein Modell O herbei. Dabei handelt es sich um ein flugfähiges Ebenbild von Omega.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Oméga prime, une création d'Oméga pouvant être chevauchée.
#. column 1: Though it is difficult to fathom why Omega would require a weaponless flying mount designed to comfortably accommodate a denizen of Hydaelyn, Garlond Ironworks engineers posit the construct was fabricated in an attempt to better understand its enemies.
#. column 2: 'Tis one of Omega's creations.<br>   - Midgardsormr
msgctxt "MountTransient:173:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your Model O, autonomous aerial transport device constructed in Omega's interdimensional manufactory."
msgstr "Призовите модель O — автономный летающий транспорт, созданный на межпространственной фабрике Омеги."

#. ja: 次元の狭間で回収されたオメガに似た自律飛翔体。ヒトを模倣する過程で、人々が利用するマウントの有用性を検証する目的で、生成されたものと思われる。あくまで騎乗用であるため、各種武装の類は実装されていない
#. de: Diese vollautomatische Maschine wurde vermutlich von Omega im Inter<shy>dimen<shy>sio<shy>nalen Riss als Fluggerät für die sterblichen Testsubjekte entwickelt, um ihre Gewohnheiten besser analysieren zu können.
#. fr: Cette machine dépourvue de tout armement provient de la fissure interdimensionnelle provoquée par Oméga. Cette dernière l'aurait créée afin d'étudier comment les êtres humains utilisent leurs montures et autres véhicules.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Model O, autonomous aerial transport device constructed in Omega's interdimensional manufactory.
#. column 2: 'Tis one of Omega's creations.<br>   - Midgardsormr
msgctxt "MountTransient:173:0:1"
msgid "Though it is difficult to fathom why Omega would require a weaponless flying mount designed to comfortably accommodate a denizen of Hydaelyn, Garlond Ironworks engineers posit the construct was fabricated in an attempt to better understand its enemies."
msgstr "Трудно понять, зачем Омеге понадобилось создавать безоружного летающего скакуна, рассчитанного на обитателей Хайделина. Инженеры Гарлондских мастерских предполагают, что так она пыталась лучше изучить своих врагов."

#. ja: ガガガガガ…
#. de: Eine Kopie, die Omega von sich selbst angefertigt hat.<br><i>Midgardsormr</i>
#. fr: Bzzz... Crrr...
#. column 0: Call into battle your Model O, autonomous aerial transport device constructed in Omega's interdimensional manufactory.
#. column 1: Though it is difficult to fathom why Omega would require a weaponless flying mount designed to comfortably accommodate a denizen of Hydaelyn, Garlond Ironworks engineers posit the construct was fabricated in an attempt to better understand its enemies.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:173:0:2"
msgid "'Tis one of Omega's creations.<br>   - Midgardsormr"
msgstr "Одно из творений Омеги.<br>   — Мидгардсормр"

#. ja: 魔導スカイアーマーに騎乗する。<br>ガレマール帝国軍の単座式スカイアーマー
#. de: Rufe einen Magitek-Himmelspanzer herbei, die modernste fliegende Kampfmaschine der garleischen Armee.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre armure aérienne magitek, un véhicule de combat volant développé par Garlemald.
#. column 1: After engine failure saw this single-seated warmachina abandoned on the field of battle, it was salvaged by members of the Eorzean Alliance who had the device sent to the Garlond Ironworks for research and repair.
#. column 2: MuSt... ReTrIeVe... ArMoR...<br>   - Tsukumo
msgctxt "MountTransient:174:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek sky armor, state-of-the-art Garlean flight technology at an affordable price."
msgstr "Призовите магитехническую броню — передовую лётную машину Гарлемальдской империи по доступной цене."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍が開発した単座式スカイアーマー。エンジントラブルを起こして不時着していたものを、エオルゼア同盟軍が鹵獲し、ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社の協力を得て修理。戦闘能力評価などに用いていたもの
#. de: Dieser einsitzige Himmelspanzer der garleischen Streitkräfte ist wegen seiner Wendigkeit gefürchtet. Bisherige fliegende Magitek-Kampf<shy>maschinen wie der Schlachtkreuzer waren sehr groß, doch mit der Schnitter-Technologie gelang den Garlearn die Herstellung dieses kompakten Modells.
#. fr: Ce véhicule volant monoplace a été récupéré par l'Alliance éorzéenne après qu'il s'est écrasé suite à une avarie moteur. Les ingénieurs des Forges de Garlond l'ont réparé et l'étudient à des fins de rétroconception.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek sky armor, state-of-the-art Garlean flight technology at an affordable price.
#. column 2: MuSt... ReTrIeVe... ArMoR...<br>   - Tsukumo
msgctxt "MountTransient:174:0:1"
msgid "After engine failure saw this single-seated warmachina abandoned on the field of battle, it was salvaged by members of the Eorzean Alliance who had the device sent to the Garlond Ironworks for research and repair."
msgstr "После отказа двигателя эту одноместную боевую машину бросили на поле боя. Её подобрали бойцы Альянса Эорзеи и отправили в мастерские «Топсейл» на исследование и ремонт."

#. ja: ブロロロロ…
#. de: Da haben die garleischen Ingenieure keine schlechte Arbeit abgeliefert.<br><i>Cid</i>
#. fr: Vrouuum<nbsp>! Vrrrr...
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek sky armor, state-of-the-art Garlean flight technology at an affordable price.
#. column 1: After engine failure saw this single-seated warmachina abandoned on the field of battle, it was salvaged by members of the Eorzean Alliance who had the device sent to the Garlond Ironworks for research and repair.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:174:0:2"
msgid "MuSt... ReTrIeVe... ArMoR...<br>   - Tsukumo"
msgstr "Необходимо... извлечь... доспех...<br>   — Цукумо"

#. ja: マジックカーペットに騎乗する。<br>魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ絨毯
#. de: Rufe einen fliegenden Teppich herbei und lass dich von ihm bequem durch die Luft tragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre tapis magique, une carpette enchantée capable de voler.
#. column 1: It is said an ancient king of Corvos, upon conquering a tribe of faeries, bid the faerie queen weave her magicks to forge an object the likes mankind had never seen. The queen was executed shortly after presenting the king with a flying carpet. This is not <i>that</i> carpet, but at least no one was slain in its creation.
#. column 2: Just be careful not to spill<br>any beverages on the carpets.<br>   - Choir Moogle
msgctxt "MountTransient:175:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your magicked carpet. Fantasy will set you free. Finally."
msgstr "Призовите волшебный ковёр. Наконец-то мечты сбываются!"

#. ja: 魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ絨毯。近東地域に伝わる伝承によれば、かつてコルヴォ地方を治めていた王が、調伏した妖精に命じて同様の空飛ぶ絨毯を仕立てさせたという。これは、伝説の品を近代の魔法技術によって再現したもの
#. de: Einer Legende nach brachte einst der König von Corvos einen Geist dazu, ihm einen Teppich zu verzaubern, sodass er darauf fliegen konnte. Mit modernsten Verzauberungen ist es nun gelungen, dieses Wunder nachzuahmen.
#. fr: Ce tapis enchanté peut voler dans les airs. D'après la légende proche-orientale, ce tapis aurait été fabriqué sur ordre d'un roi de la région de Corvos, par une fée qu'il avait envoûtée. Celui-ci est une reproduction de l'objet mythique par le biais de techniques modernes.
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked carpet. Fantasy will set you free. Finally.
#. column 2: Just be careful not to spill<br>any beverages on the carpets.<br>   - Choir Moogle
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:175:0:1"
msgid "It is said an ancient king of Corvos, upon conquering a tribe of faeries, bid the faerie queen weave her magicks to forge an object the likes mankind had never seen. The queen was executed shortly after presenting the king with a flying carpet. This is not <i>that</i> carpet, but at least no one was slain in its creation."
msgstr "Говорят, древний король Корвоса, покорив племя фей, приказал их королеве сотворить невиданный прежде предмет. Вскоре после того, как она подарила королю летающий ковёр, её казнили. Это не <i>тот самый</i> ковёр, но хотя бы при его создании никто не погиб."

#. ja: フランフワン♪
#. de: Der macht sich bestimmt auch gut vor dem Kamin.<br><i>Beeindruckte Hofdame</i>
#. fr: Fwaaamh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked carpet. Fantasy will set you free. Finally.
#. column 1: It is said an ancient king of Corvos, upon conquering a tribe of faeries, bid the faerie queen weave her magicks to forge an object the likes mankind had never seen. The queen was executed shortly after presenting the king with a flying carpet. This is not <i>that</i> carpet, but at least no one was slain in its creation.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:175:0:2"
msgid "Just be careful not to spill<br>any beverages on the carpets.<br>   - Choir Moogle"
msgstr "Смотрите не пролейте<br>на ковры ничего из напитков.<br>   — Хор муглов"

#. ja: 魔導マグナローダーに騎乗する。<br>人工筋肉を採用した新型魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe Magna Rotula herbei, eine mächtige Kampfmaschine, die von den Goblins umgebaut wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre magna rouleur, un nouveau type d'arme magitek utilisant de la matière organique ar<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>cielle.
#. column 1: Following their discovery of an imperial roader abandoned in Gyr Abania, several clever goblins came up with the ingenious plan to refurbish the damaged warmachina. The auto-pilot systems, however, were beyond repair, so the engineers were forced to compromise by adding a mannable cockpit.
#. column 2: We have a long<br>road ahead of us.<br>   - Mogzin
msgctxt "MountTransient:176:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magna roader and try not to think too hard on why it is called such."
msgstr "Призовите магитехнический родер. И постарайтесь не задумываться, почему он так называется."

#. ja: ギラバニアにて回収された帝国製魔導兵器の残骸を、ゴブリン族の技師が修理、改良した車両。本来は自律行動可能な戦闘兵器であったが、制御機構を再現できなかったため、有人機へと仕様変更が行われている
#. de: Aus den Trümmern der garleischen Magitek-Kampfmaschine, die in Gyr Abania geborgen werden konnten, fabrizierten die Goblins ein furcht<shy>ein<shy>flößendes Gefährt. Ursprünglich funktionierte die Kampfmaschine vollautomatisch, doch Magna Rotula muss gesteuert werden.
#. fr: Cette créature mécanique était à l'origine une carcasse d'arme impériale qu'un ingénieur gobelin a ramassée à Gyr Abania et réparée. Elle était au départ capable de se mouvoir seule, mais son système de contrôle n'ayant pu être répliqué, elle a été transformée en machine organique.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magna roader and try not to think too hard on why it is called such.
#. column 2: We have a long<br>road ahead of us.<br>   - Mogzin
msgctxt "MountTransient:176:0:1"
msgid "Following their discovery of an imperial roader abandoned in Gyr Abania, several clever goblins came up with the ingenious plan to refurbish the damaged warmachina. The auto-pilot systems, however, were beyond repair, so the engineers were forced to compromise by adding a mannable cockpit."
msgstr "Обнаружив в Гир-Абании брошенный имперский магитек-автомобиль, несколько сообразительных гоблинов придумали, как восстановить повреждённую боевую машину. Автопилот починить не удалось, так что инженерам пришлось пойти на компромисс и оборудовать кабину для пилота."

#. ja: ホイール！
#. de: Für jede Maschine gibt perfekte Reparierenwerkzeug. Aber mit Gobbihammer kannzu fast<br>alle Sache wieder funktionierenklopfen. Wunderwerkzeug für Allezweck!<br><i>Trockdox</i>
#. fr: Roule roule<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your magna roader and try not to think too hard on why it is called such.
#. column 1: Following their discovery of an imperial roader abandoned in Gyr Abania, several clever goblins came up with the ingenious plan to refurbish the damaged warmachina. The auto-pilot systems, however, were beyond repair, so the engineers were forced to compromise by adding a mannable cockpit.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:176:0:2"
msgid "We have a long<br>road ahead of us.<br>   - Mogzin"
msgstr "Нам предстоит долгий<br>путь.<br>   — Могзин"

#. ja: でぶ黒チョコボに騎乗する。<br>食い意地の張った黒チョコボの親分。いっただっきまーす
#. de: Rufe deinen schwarzen Chocomoppel herbei. Er ähnelt einem schwarzen Chocobo, allerdings ist er viel dicker.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre gros chocobo noir, le plus gras et le plus éminent parmi les siens.
#. column 1: According to those familiar with this prodigious poultry's journey from flightless fledgling to full-blown fowl, the cloudkin achieved its staggering girth after several summers of gluttonously gulping chunks of charred chicken. Though, many speculate that the chocobo is, in fact, no chocobo at all, but a heretofore unseen spirit (or demon) of Dravania's dark wood.
#. column 2: Black winds bring terrible news!<br>   - Linu Vali
msgctxt "MountTransient:177:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your fat black chocobo and marvel at its flurry of pitch-dark plumage."
msgstr "Призовите жирного чёрного чокобо и полюбуйтесь его чёрным как смоль оперением."

#. ja: 食い意地の張った黒チョコボの親分。「からあげ」が大好物で、むしゃむしゃと食べ続けたために、これほどの巨体へと成長を遂げたらしい。その正体は、チョコボではなく妖精なのではないかとも、囁かれているが……
#. de: Dieser gefräßige schwarze Chocobo liebt nicht nur Gizar-Blätter, sondern vor allem auch frittiertes Gemüse und Fleisch. Eigentlich isst er alles, was ihm unter den Schnabel kommt. Ist er vielleicht gar kein Chocobo, sondern ein Gestaltwandler?
#. fr: Si l'on est vraiment ce que l'on mange, cet oiseau doit être majoritairement composé de fritures. Face à cet embonpoint lit<shy>té<shy>ra<shy>le<shy>ment surnaturel, certains soupçonnent même qu'il s'agirait en fait d'une créature magique et non d'un chocobo.
#. column 0: Summon forth your fat black chocobo and marvel at its flurry of pitch-dark plumage.
#. column 2: Black winds bring terrible news!<br>   - Linu Vali
msgctxt "MountTransient:177:0:1"
msgid "According to those familiar with this prodigious poultry's journey from flightless fledgling to full-blown fowl, the cloudkin achieved its staggering girth after several summers of gluttonously gulping chunks of charred chicken. Though, many speculate that the chocobo is, in fact, no chocobo at all, but a heretofore unseen spirit (or demon) of Dravania's dark wood."
msgstr "Знатоки говорят, что этот удивительный птенец вырос в настоящего пернатого гиганта, потому что каждое лето жадно уплетал куски жареной курицы. Многие, впрочем, поговаривают, что перед нами вовсе не чокобо, а доселе невиданный дух (или демон) тёмных лесов Дравании."

#. ja: むしゃむしゃ…
#. de: Dein Chocobo verströmt das luftige Aroma seiner schwarzgefiederten Brüder.<br><i>Arnoulain</i>
#. fr: Scroumpf scroumpf...
#. column 0: Summon forth your fat black chocobo and marvel at its flurry of pitch-dark plumage.
#. column 1: According to those familiar with this prodigious poultry's journey from flightless fledgling to full-blown fowl, the cloudkin achieved its staggering girth after several summers of gluttonously gulping chunks of charred chicken. Though, many speculate that the chocobo is, in fact, no chocobo at all, but a heretofore unseen spirit (or demon) of Dravania's dark wood.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:177:0:2"
msgid "Black winds bring terrible news!<br>   - Linu Vali"
msgstr "Чёрные ветра несут дурные вести!<br>   — Лину Вали"

#. ja: エルドスルスに騎乗する。<br>炎のような毛に覆われた巨獣
#. de: Rufe deinen Eldthurs herbei, benannt nach einem Riesen, der einst zusammen mit seinen Artgenossen eine Welt voller Feuer beherrschte.
#. fr: Vous appelez Eldthurs, une gigantesque bête recouverte d'un pelage rougeoyant comme le feu.
#. column 1: Despite the imposing name, naturalists believe Eldthursar to be naught but yeti whose ancestors forswore their icy mountain homes, choosing instead the molten lakes of Pyros to raise their young. Though not necessarily known for their obedience, this particular specimen has been trained to accept the orders of a rider without taking a bite out of her thigh.
#. column 2: The giants were...<br>thorough in their work.<br>   - Alianne
msgctxt "MountTransient:178:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Eldthurs, named for a fiery giant who once ruled a realm of flame with his brothers."
msgstr "Призовите Эльдтурса, названного в честь огненного великана, который вместе с братьями правил царством пламени."

#. ja: 炎のような毛に覆われた巨獣。元はありふれたイエティであったようだが、火属性の力が極めて強いピューロス帯にいた影響で、炎の魔力を獲得したようだ。通常は凶暴であるが、屈服させることができれば従順になるという
#. de: Trotz ihres außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>lichen Namens halten Naturkundler die Eldthurs für gewöhnliche Yetis, die zu den Magmaseen in Pyros zogen, um dort ihre Jungen großzuziehen. Dieses Exemplar wurde zumindest so weit abgerichtet, dass es keine Reiterwaden mehr anknabbert.
#. fr: Cette bête n'était autrefois qu'un yéti comme les autres, mais a été transformée par l'influence de l'éther de feu qui abonde à Pyros. D'ordinaire féroce, il devient docile une fois forcé à la soumission.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Eldthurs, named for a fiery giant who once ruled a realm of flame with his brothers.
#. column 2: The giants were...<br>thorough in their work.<br>   - Alianne
msgctxt "MountTransient:178:0:1"
msgid "Despite the imposing name, naturalists believe Eldthursar to be naught but yeti whose ancestors forswore their icy mountain homes, choosing instead the molten lakes of Pyros to raise their young. Though not necessarily known for their obedience, this particular specimen has been trained to accept the orders of a rider without taking a bite out of her thigh."
msgstr "Несмотря на грозное имя, натуралисты считают, что Эльдтурсы — всего лишь йети. Их предки покинули ледяные горы и перебрались к раскалённым озёрам Пироса, чтобы растить там детёнышей. Послушанием они не славятся, но этого экземпляра удалось выдрессировать так, чтобы он выполнял приказы всадника и не кусал его за бедро."

#. ja: メラメラメラ！
#. de: Großegroße Riesendank!<br><i>Rundblox</i>
#. fr: Fschhhhhh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Eldthurs, named for a fiery giant who once ruled a realm of flame with his brothers.
#. column 1: Despite the imposing name, naturalists believe Eldthursar to be naught but yeti whose ancestors forswore their icy mountain homes, choosing instead the molten lakes of Pyros to raise their young. Though not necessarily known for their obedience, this particular specimen has been trained to accept the orders of a rider without taking a bite out of her thigh.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:178:0:2"
msgid "The giants were...<br>thorough in their work.<br>   - Alianne"
msgstr "Великаны...<br>поработали на славу.<br>   — Алианна"

#. ja: 魔導マグナローダー改に騎乗する。<br>人工筋肉を採用した新型魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe Magna Rotula X herbei, das absolute Meisterwerk goblinoider Ingenieurskunst.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre magna rouleur plus, un nouveau type d'arme magitek utilisant de la matière organique ar<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>cielle.
#. column 1: Following their discovery of an imperial roader abandoned in Gyr Abania, several clever goblins came up with the ingenious plan to not only refurbish the damaged warmachina, but to improve upon its design by adding cermet alloy exoplating and reorganizing synthetic musculature.
#. column 2: We've a bloody long<br>road ahead of us.<br>   - Mitsuba
msgctxt "MountTransient:179:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your maxima roader─many times mightier than the mightiest of magna roaders."
msgstr "Призовите магна-роудер максима — во много раз мощнее самого могучего магна-роудера."

#. ja: ギラバニアにて回収された帝国製魔導兵器の残骸を、ゴブリン族の技師が修理、改良した車両。外装がより強固な超硬サーメット合金に変更され、重量が増したぶん、人工筋肉の出力を上げて最高速度を維持している
#. de: Es ist kaum zu glauben, aber die Goblins haben Magna Rotula noch weiter verbessert. Für diese Spezialversion wurde die gesamte Konstruktion verstärkt und die Außenhülle mit Panzerplatten aus gehärtetem Cermet verkleidet. Das höhere Gewicht wurde durch den stärkeren Antrieb mehr als ausgeglichen.
#. fr: À l'origine une carcasse ramassée à Gyr Abania et réparée par un ingénieur gobelin, il a été consolidé avec une couche externe de cermet renforcé pour un meilleur blindage. Il est plus lourd, mais sa performance organique étant optimisée, il maintient sa vitesse de pointe plus longtemps.
#. column 0: Call into battle your maxima roader─many times mightier than the mightiest of magna roaders.
#. column 2: We've a bloody long<br>road ahead of us.<br>   - Mitsuba
msgctxt "MountTransient:179:0:1"
msgid "Following their discovery of an imperial roader abandoned in Gyr Abania, several clever goblins came up with the ingenious plan to not only refurbish the damaged warmachina, but to improve upon its design by adding cermet alloy exoplating and reorganizing synthetic musculature."
msgstr "Обнаружив в Гир-Абании брошенный имперский магитек-автомобиль, несколько сообразительных гоблинов придумали, как не только восстановить повреждённую боевую машину, но и усовершенствовать её: установить наружную обшивку из церметового сплава и перестроить искусственную мускулатуру."

#. ja: 体当たり！
#. de: Pshhh! Hazzu gesehen? Ass in Ärmel! Superass!<br><i>Brüllvolx</i>
#. fr: Collision<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your maxima roader─many times mightier than the mightiest of magna roaders.
#. column 1: Following their discovery of an imperial roader abandoned in Gyr Abania, several clever goblins came up with the ingenious plan to not only refurbish the damaged warmachina, but to improve upon its design by adding cermet alloy exoplating and reorganizing synthetic musculature.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:179:0:2"
msgid "We've a bloody long<br>road ahead of us.<br>   - Mitsuba"
msgstr "Впереди у нас чертовски<br>долгий путь.<br>   — Мицуба"

#. ja: サボテンダー・エンペラドールに騎乗する。<br>マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサーを模した空飛ぶサボテンダー像
#. de: Rufe deinen Imperator Kaktor herbei. Dabei handelt es sich um eine Kaktor-Statue, die wie das Gebäude des Gold Saucers aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre pampa emperador, une statue volante inspirée du Gold Saucer des Manderville.
#. column 1: No one knows exactly why the Manderville Gold Saucer was built to resemble a sabotender, just as no one knows why its mascot is a sabotender or why more than half of its drink menu features sabotender-themed “cact-tails.” This giant flying sabotender will not see you any closer to those answers, but it is fun to stare at.
#. column 2: Very fleet of foot,<br>those sabotenders.<br>   - Mayaru Moyaru
msgctxt "MountTransient:180:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Sabotender Emperador and bask in his desert sun radiance."
msgstr "Призовите саботендера-императора и погрейтесь в лучах его пустынного солнца."

#. ja: マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサーを模した空飛ぶサボテンダー像。「帝王」を意味する名が示すとおり、威風堂々と世界の空を駆ける。そもそも、なぜゴールドソーサーの外装がサボテンダー型なのか、その理由を知る者はいない
#. de: Diese Nachbildung des berühmt-berüchtigten Gold Saucers schwebt majestätisch wie ein Imperator durch die Lüfte. Das Geheimnis, warum der Gold Saucer in einem Kaktor-Gebäude untergebracht ist, behält jedoch auch diese Statue für sich.
#. fr: Cette statue volante de pampa a été créée à l'image du Gold Saucer des Manderville. Comme le suggère son qualificatif, il vole dans les airs avec majesté et grâce. Ce qu'on ne sait toujours pas, c'est pourquoi le Gold Saucer a cette forme à l'origine...
#. column 0: Summon forth Sabotender Emperador and bask in his desert sun radiance.
#. column 2: Very fleet of foot,<br>those sabotenders.<br>   - Mayaru Moyaru
msgctxt "MountTransient:180:0:1"
msgid "No one knows exactly why the Manderville Gold Saucer was built to resemble a sabotender, just as no one knows why its mascot is a sabotender or why more than half of its drink menu features sabotender-themed “cact-tails.” This giant flying sabotender will not see you any closer to those answers, but it is fun to stare at."
msgstr "Никто точно не знает, почему мандервильское Золотое блюдце построили в форме саботендера. Так же никто не знает, почему его талисман — саботендер и почему больше половины напитков в меню — „кактейли“ с изображениями саботендеров. Эта гигантская летающая статуя не приблизит вас к разгадке, но на неё приятно смотреть."

#. ja: ♪☆♪
#. de: Wird der Kaktor über uns herrschen?!<br><i>Besorgter Abenteurer</i>
#. fr: ♪☆♪
#. column 0: Summon forth Sabotender Emperador and bask in his desert sun radiance.
#. column 1: No one knows exactly why the Manderville Gold Saucer was built to resemble a sabotender, just as no one knows why its mascot is a sabotender or why more than half of its drink menu features sabotender-themed “cact-tails.” This giant flying sabotender will not see you any closer to those answers, but it is fun to stare at.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:180:0:2"
msgid "Very fleet of foot,<br>those sabotenders.<br>   - Mayaru Moyaru"
msgstr "Саботендеры так быстро<br>бегают!<br>   — Маяру Мояру"

#. ja: 九尾のカムイに騎乗する。<br>東方由来の魔笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣
#. de: Rufe deinen neunschwänzigen Kamuy herbei und lasse dich von ihm majestätisch durch die Lüfte tragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre kamuy à neuf queues, une créature légendaire invoquée grâce à un sifflet magique oriental.
#. column 1: Only an individual who has proven his worth by taming no less than seven kamuy might summon this fabled vulpine auspice from her burrow in the heavens. Despite obvious similarities to the <i>other</i> vulpine auspice, Kyubi of the Nine Tails, this ageless vixen has her own storied history...which is, sadly, too long to list here.
#. column 2: Most revered among the<br>kamuy, Kyubi is come!<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
msgctxt "MountTransient:181:0:0"
msgid "Summon the Kamuy of the Nine Tails, legendary auspice, completely independent from Kyubi of the Nine Tails."
msgstr "Призовите камуя девяти хвостов — легендарную авгуру, никак не связанную с Кюби, девятихвостой лисицей."

#. ja: 東方地域に伝わる幻獣。数多のカムイを従えた英雄が、魔笛を吹き鳴らした時に現れ、天上の世界へと導くとされる。その姿は、九尾の狐として知られる瑞獣「玉藻御前」に似ているが、これは偶然ではないだろう
#. de: Die legendären Kamuy des Fernen Ostens kommen in mannigfachen Gestalten vor. Diese Art ähnelt der neunschwänzigen Füchsin namens Tamamo no Gozen, was ganz bestimmt kein Zufall ist.
#. fr: Un animal fabuleux des légendes orientales. On raconte qu'un héros ayant jugulé de nombreux kamuy serait capable de le faire apparaître au moyen d'un sifflet enchanté pour le guider jusqu'au firmament. Ce n'est sûrement pas un hasard s'il ressemble à Tamamo-no-Gozen, que l'on représente comme un renard à neuf queues.
#. column 0: Summon the Kamuy of the Nine Tails, legendary auspice, completely independent from Kyubi of the Nine Tails.
#. column 2: Most revered among the<br>kamuy, Kyubi is come!<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:181:0:1"
msgid "Only an individual who has proven his worth by taming no less than seven kamuy might summon this fabled vulpine auspice from her burrow in the heavens. Despite obvious similarities to the <i>other</i> vulpine auspice, Kyubi of the Nine Tails, this ageless vixen has her own storied history...which is, sadly, too long to list here."
msgstr "Лишь тот, кто доказал свою доблесть, приручив не меньше семи камуев, может вызвать из небесного логова эту легендарную лисицу-авгуру. Она и впрямь поразительно похожа на другую лисицу-авгуру, Кюби девяти хвостов, но у этой древней красавицы своя история... Увы, слишком длинная, чтобы пересказывать её здесь."

#. ja: キュ～！
#. de: ♪ Doch am End fand zusammen ♪<br>♪ was das Schicksal als wesensgleich auserkoren ♪<br><i>Fahrender Sänger</i>
#. fr: Ouwouuuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon the Kamuy of the Nine Tails, legendary auspice, completely independent from Kyubi of the Nine Tails.
#. column 1: Only an individual who has proven his worth by taming no less than seven kamuy might summon this fabled vulpine auspice from her burrow in the heavens. Despite obvious similarities to the <i>other</i> vulpine auspice, Kyubi of the Nine Tails, this ageless vixen has her own storied history...which is, sadly, too long to list here.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:181:0:2"
msgid "Most revered among the<br>kamuy, Kyubi is come!<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel"
msgstr "Самая почитаемая<br>среди камуев, Кюби явилась!<br>   — Странствующий менестрель"

#. ja: 青のカムイに騎乗する。<br>青龍の神通力を受けた大狼。水をまとい天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen blauen Kamuy herbei. Der von Seiryu gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy de l'est, une créature bénie par l'onde de Seiryû, le légendaire dragon bleu.
#. column 1: Abandoned by its master, this loyal canine was discovered by the auspice Seiryu and granted a new life in service of the thousand-year-old lord.
#. column 2: A wolf! Or at least someone<br>what's got big ears and a long<br>fluffy tail!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:182:0:0"
msgid "Summon your hallowed kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the azure auspice Seiryu."
msgstr "Призовите священного камуя — благородного волка, благословлённого лазурным зверем-стражем Сэйрю."

#. ja: 四聖獣「青龍」の神通力を受け、青の春風をまとった大狼。おそらく人々に捨てられた大狼を、青龍が再生させたことで、誕生したものと思われる
#. de: Dieses Wolfswesen wurde gefürchtet, gejagt und erschlagen, doch von Seiryu wiederbelebt.
#. fr: Le pelage de ce loup est parcouru de vents printaniers témoignant du pouvoir qu'il a hérité de Seiryû, l'un des quatre animaux sacrés. D'après les croyances, il aurait autrefois été abandonné par les humains et aurait ressuscité grâce au pouvoir de Seiryû lui-même.
#. column 0: Summon your hallowed kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the azure auspice Seiryu.
#. column 2: A wolf! Or at least someone<br>what's got big ears and a long<br>fluffy tail!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:182:0:1"
msgid "Abandoned by its master, this loyal canine was discovered by the auspice Seiryu and granted a new life in service of the thousand-year-old lord."
msgstr "Верный пёс, брошенный хозяином, попался на глаза зверю-стражу Сэйрю. Тот подарил ему новую жизнь, чтобы он служил своему тысячелетнему владыке."

#. ja: オォ～ン！
#. de: Ist der nicht gefährlich?!<br><i>Katzenliebhaber</i>
#. fr: Kaï<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your hallowed kamuy, noble wolf blessed by the azure auspice Seiryu.
#. column 1: Abandoned by its master, this loyal canine was discovered by the auspice Seiryu and granted a new life in service of the thousand-year-old lord.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:182:0:2"
msgid "A wolf! Or at least someone<br>what's got big ears and a long<br>fluffy tail!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca"
msgstr "Волк! Хотя, может, просто кто-то<br>с большими ушами и длинным<br>пушистым хвостом!<br>   — Нашу Мхакарракка"

#. ja: ウォータイガーに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍剣虎。サーベルのような牙を持つ
#. de: Rufe deinen Säbelzahntiger herbei. Dieser Tiger wurde zum Kämpfen trainiert und hat Reißzähne, die so lang sind wie Säbel.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture tigre de guerre, un redoutable carnivore entraîné pour combattre avec ses dents aiguisées comme des lames.
#. column 1: Even among tigers, the sabertooth is said to be notoriously difficult to tame, but those creatures raised from birth may come to bear riders upon their backs and into war.
#. column 2: T-T-T-T-T-TIGERS!!!<br>- Hapless Namazu
msgctxt "MountTransient:183:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your war tiger to tear the enemy's morale to shreds with its cruel, curved fangs."
msgstr "Призовите боевого тигра, чтобы сокрушить дух врагов его острыми изогнутыми клыками."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍剣虎。最大の武器でもある長大な牙がサーベルを思わせることから、そう名付けられた。調教するのは至難の業だが、生まれたばかりの赤子から育てることで、騎乗獣として利用できるらしい
#. de: Woher der Name dieses Tigers stammt, ist auf den ersten Blick erkennbar. Das Abrichten dieser Rasse zu Reittieren gelingt nur, wenn man direkt nach ihrer Geburt damit beginnt, sie zu trainieren.
#. fr: Ce redoutable carnassier possède des canines semblables à des sabres, qui constituent sa plus grande arme. Certaines minorités du sud du continent d'Ilsabard dressent cette espèce dès son plus jeune âge pour en faire un animal d'usage militaire.
#. column 0: Summon forth your war tiger to tear the enemy's morale to shreds with its cruel, curved fangs.
#. column 2: T-T-T-T-T-TIGERS!!!<br>- Hapless Namazu
msgctxt "MountTransient:183:0:1"
msgid "Even among tigers, the sabertooth is said to be notoriously difficult to tame, but those creatures raised from birth may come to bear riders upon their backs and into war."
msgstr "Даже саблезубых тигров, говорят, невероятно трудно приручить. Но если вырастить тигрёнка с рождения, он может привыкнуть возить всадника и отправиться с ним в бой."

#. ja: ゴロゴロゴロ…
#. de: Grrrrrr<nbsp>... \<schnurr>
#. fr: Grrrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your war tiger to tear the enemy's morale to shreds with its cruel, curved fangs.
#. column 1: Even among tigers, the sabertooth is said to be notoriously difficult to tame, but those creatures raised from birth may come to bear riders upon their backs and into war.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:183:0:2"
msgid "T-T-T-T-T-TIGERS!!!<br>- Hapless Namazu"
msgstr "Т-т-т-т-т-тигры!!!<br>— Несчастный намадзу"

#. ja: エウレカスワローに騎乗する。<br>ウミツバメとも呼ばれる水生生物。優雅に空も舞う
#. de: Rufe deine Eureka-Schwalbe herbei. Geboren im Meer, bestimmt für die Lüfte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre hirondelle d'Eurêka, une créature maritime communément appelée “hirondelle des mers” et capable de fendre l'air avec une indéniable élégance.
#. column 1: Of all the species of petrels known to man, the Eurekan petrel is the only one which is not actually a petrel, but, in fact, an oversized carnivorous sea slug. Admittedly, unlike most sea slugs, this unique variety possesses the capacity for extended flight, hence the understandable misnomer.
#. column 2: I know you love me,<br>little swallow, but sometimes<br>you just have to let go!<br>   - Karasu
msgctxt "MountTransient:184:0:0"
msgid "Summon your Eurekan petrel, because who hasn't dreamed of gazing down upon all creation from the mantle of a windborne gastropod?"
msgstr "Призовите эвриканского буревестника. Ну кто не мечтал полюбоваться миром с высоты, сидя верхом на летающем брюхоногом моллюске?"

#. ja: 博物学的にはウミウシに近い種なのだが、翼のように広がる青い鰭を持つ優美な姿をしている。そのため、ツバメに喩えられるほか、青い天使と呼ばれることも。しかし、肉食性で有毒生物すら丸呑みにする恐ろしい捕食者でもある
#. de: Eureka-Schwalben, auch „blaue Engel“ genannt, sind elementare Hybride. Sie werden im Meer geboren, doch erheben sich alsbald wie Schwalben in die Lüfte. Ihre Anmut sollte jedoch nicht darüber hinwegtäu-<br>schen, dass sie auch geschickte Jäger sind, die mit ihrem potenten Gift ihre Beute schnell ausschalten.
#. fr: Les pro<shy>fes<shy>sion<shy>nels de l'histoire naturelle rapprochent cette créature de l'hirondelle des mers, mais celle-ci dispose d'élégantes nageoires bleutées qui lui permettent de voler. Certains la comparent ainsi plutôt à un ange bleu, un nom trompeur pour ce prédateur capable d'avaler tout rond des monstres parfois vénimeux.
#. column 0: Summon your Eurekan petrel, because who hasn't dreamed of gazing down upon all creation from the mantle of a windborne gastropod?
#. column 2: I know you love me,<br>little swallow, but sometimes<br>you just have to let go!<br>   - Karasu
msgctxt "MountTransient:184:0:1"
msgid "Of all the species of petrels known to man, the Eurekan petrel is the only one which is not actually a petrel, but, in fact, an oversized carnivorous sea slug. Admittedly, unlike most sea slugs, this unique variety possesses the capacity for extended flight, hence the understandable misnomer."
msgstr "Из всех известных людям буревестников эвриканский — единственный, кто на самом деле не буревестник, а огромный хищный морской слизень. Правда, в отличие от большинства слизней, этот вид умеет долго летать. Вот откуда и взялось такое название."

#. ja: すわ～♪
#. de: Was ist das für ein wundervolles blaues Leuchten am Himmel?<br><i>Aus der Sammlung „Berühmte letzte Worte“</i>
#. fr: Shouuuu<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon your Eurekan petrel, because who hasn't dreamed of gazing down upon all creation from the mantle of a windborne gastropod?
#. column 1: Of all the species of petrels known to man, the Eurekan petrel is the only one which is not actually a petrel, but, in fact, an oversized carnivorous sea slug. Admittedly, unlike most sea slugs, this unique variety possesses the capacity for extended flight, hence the understandable misnomer.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:184:0:2"
msgid "I know you love me,<br>little swallow, but sometimes<br>you just have to let go!<br>   - Karasu"
msgstr "Знаю, ты меня любишь,<br>птенчик, но иногда<br>надо отпускать!<br>   — Карасу"

#. ja: 魔導アヴェンジャー寒冷地仕様に騎乗する。<br>ゴブリン族が改良した帝国製無人魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe deinen kälteresistenten Magitek-Rächer herbei, eine von den Goblins zu einem Reitgefährt umgebaute imperiale Kampfmaschine, die in dieser Ausführung besonders für den Einsatz in kalten Gebieten geeignet ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez un vengeur magitek anti-froid, appareil impérial amélioré par les soins des Gobelins.
#. column 1: Proving once again there is naught a Garlean engineer can do that a goblin cannot do better, this magitek avenger, nicknamed the “Yeti,” has been repurposed with several layers of self-insulating exoplating, which draw on the ceruleum engine's residual heat to keep the rider warm even in the coldest of climes.
#. column 2: I'll avenge myself, kupo!<br>   - Pukla Puki
msgctxt "MountTransient:185:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek avenger A1─outfitted and optimized for alpine warfare."
msgstr "Призовите магитек-авенджера A1 — он подготовлен и настроен для войны в горах."

#. ja: ゴブリン族が改良した帝国製無人魔導兵器。寒冷地での運用を念頭に、生命維持装置を追加。外気温が一定値を下回ると、自動的に乗りてを掴む腕が発熱し、ほんのり温かくなる。その白い外装から「イエティ」とも呼ばれる
#. de: Eine ursprünglich führerlose Kampfmaschine der Garlear, die von den Goblins zu einem Reitgefährt umgebaut und nun noch zusätzlich gegen Kälte isoliert wurde.
#. fr: Ce suiveur autonome a été modifié et amélioré par le génie mécanique gobelin. Il comporte un nouveau module de survie pour les régions froides. Si la température descend sous un certain seuil, ses bras réchauffent le pilote. Sa coque blanche lui vaut le surnom de “yéti”.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek avenger A1─outfitted and optimized for alpine warfare.
#. column 2: I'll avenge myself, kupo!<br>   - Pukla Puki
msgctxt "MountTransient:185:0:1"
msgid "Proving once again there is naught a Garlean engineer can do that a goblin cannot do better, this magitek avenger, nicknamed the “Yeti,” has been repurposed with several layers of self-insulating exoplating, which draw on the ceruleum engine's residual heat to keep the rider warm even in the coldest of climes."
msgstr "Гоблины снова доказали, что умеют лучше любого гарлеанского инженера. Этот магитек-авенджер, прозванный „йети“, обшили несколькими слоями теплоизоляции. Они используют остаточное тепло церулеумного двигателя, чтобы согревать всадника даже в лютый мороз."

#. ja: ヴホヴホッ！
#. de: Willzu auf Arm nehmen?!<br><i>Trockdox</i>
#. fr: Pshhh.... Brrr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek avenger A1─outfitted and optimized for alpine warfare.
#. column 1: Proving once again there is naught a Garlean engineer can do that a goblin cannot do better, this magitek avenger, nicknamed the “Yeti,” has been repurposed with several layers of self-insulating exoplating, which draw on the ceruleum engine's residual heat to keep the rider warm even in the coldest of climes.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:185:0:2"
msgid "I'll avenge myself, kupo!<br>   - Pukla Puki"
msgstr "Сам себя отомщу, купо!<br>   — Пукла Пуки"

#. ja: デミオズマに騎乗する。<br>バルデシオン委員会の研究員が生成したプロトオズマの模造品
#. de: Rufe deinen Demi-Yadis herbei. Die Replikation eines Proto-Yadis, erschaffen von den Forschern von Baldesions Gelehrten.
#. fr: Vous appelez demi-Ozma, une imitation de Proto-Ozma élaborée par des chercheurs membres des Élèves de Baldesion.
#. column 1: After concluding that Ozma of the Weeping City was but a preliminary attempt to weave an aether-based simulacrum of the Eurekan phenomenon Proto Ozma, the Students of Baldesion endeavored to apply similar magicks in the creation of what they dubbed “Demi-Ozma,” hoping to learn what makes the entity tick.
#. column 2: Follow the sphere!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
msgctxt "MountTransient:186:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle Demi-Ozma─the round mound of spellbound."
msgstr "Призовите Деми-Озму — магический шар, что выше всяких похвал."

#. ja: バルデシオン委員会の研究員が、エウレカ製武具「プロトオズマ」の対策を練る過程で生成した模造品。彼らの見解によれば、マハの黒魔道士が生み出した「オズマ」は、プロトオズマを魔法的に再現しようとした兵器なのだという
#. de: Forscher von den Gelehrten erschufen den Demi-Yadis, um mögliche Schwachstellen des Proto-Yadis zu ergründen. Sie vermuteten, dass die Schwarz-<br>magier von Mhach mit der Erschaffung der Yadis das Aufrufen des Proto-Yadis erprobten.
#. fr: Les chercheurs membres des Élèves de Baldesion ont créé cette imitation de Proto-Ozma en cherchant une solution au problème. Leurs théories voudraient qu'Ozma, une entité créée par des mages noirs de Mhach, était en fait une arme de guerre tentant de faire réapparaître Proto-Ozma grâce à la magie.
#. column 0: Call into battle Demi-Ozma─the round mound of spellbound.
#. column 2: Follow the sphere!<br>   - X'rhun Tia
msgctxt "MountTransient:186:0:1"
msgid "After concluding that Ozma of the Weeping City was but a preliminary attempt to weave an aether-based simulacrum of the Eurekan phenomenon Proto Ozma, the Students of Baldesion endeavored to apply similar magicks in the creation of what they dubbed “Demi-Ozma,” hoping to learn what makes the entity tick."
msgstr "Решив, что Озма из Плачущего города была лишь первой попыткой создать эфирную копию феномена Эврики — Прото-Озмы, — ученики Балдесиона взялись применить те же чары для создания существа, которое назвали „Деми-Озма“. Они надеялись понять, как оно устроено."

#. ja: …………
#. de: ... ... ...
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Call into battle Demi-Ozma─the round mound of spellbound.
#. column 1: After concluding that Ozma of the Weeping City was but a preliminary attempt to weave an aether-based simulacrum of the Eurekan phenomenon Proto Ozma, the Students of Baldesion endeavored to apply similar magicks in the creation of what they dubbed “Demi-Ozma,” hoping to learn what makes the entity tick.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:186:0:2"
msgid "Follow the sphere!<br>   - X'rhun Tia"
msgstr "Следуйте за шаром!<br>   — Экс'рун Тиа"

#. ja: アマロに騎乗する。<br>ノルヴラントで幅広く活用される飛行獣
#. de: Rufe deinen Amaro herbei. Diese flugfähigen Reittiere sind in ganz Norvrandt beliebt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre amaro, une monture très populaire dans tout Norvrandt.
#. column 1: Of all the mounts seen in Norvrandt, naught is more ubiquitous than the amaro. Originally created by the mages of ancient Ronka, who selectively bred the flightless cama, present-day beasts carry the seed of their ancestors, which may manifest in the form of superior intellect.
#. column 2: That ever-so-endearing “gwee!”<br>It's enough to melt a man's heart,<br>I tell you.<br>   - Lamlyn
msgctxt "MountTransient:187:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your amaro, Norvrandt's favorite beast of burden."
msgstr "Призовите амаро — любимого вьючного зверя Норврандта."

#. ja: ノルヴラントで幅広く活用される飛行獣。かつて古代ロンカ帝国の魔道士たちが、魔法によって品種改良した家畜であり、稀にその頃の血が表に出て高い知性を発揮する。なお、原種であるキャマは翼を持たず飛行もできない
#. de: Vor langer Zeit schufen die Magier des Ronka-Kaiserreichs diese Nutztiere durch gezielte Auslesezüchtung aus dem Cama, der damals zu den intelligenteren wilden Bestien zählte. Bei den Flügeln wurde beim Züchten wohl magisch nachgeholfen.
#. fr: Principale monture volante utilisée en Norvrandt, cette créature a été améliorée magiquement par les sorciers de l'ancien empire de Ronka. Les spécimens chez lesquels les ca<shy>rac<shy>té<shy>ris<shy>ti<shy>ques anciennes persistent font preuve d'une grande in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence.
#. column 0: Summon forth your amaro, Norvrandt's favorite beast of burden.
#. column 2: That ever-so-endearing “gwee!”<br>It's enough to melt a man's heart,<br>I tell you.<br>   - Lamlyn
msgctxt "MountTransient:187:0:1"
msgid "Of all the mounts seen in Norvrandt, naught is more ubiquitous than the amaro. Originally created by the mages of ancient Ronka, who selectively bred the flightless cama, present-day beasts carry the seed of their ancestors, which may manifest in the form of superior intellect."
msgstr "В Норврандте амаро встречаются повсюду. Их вывели маги древней Ронки, скрестив нелетающих кама. Современные амаро унаследовали черты предков, и порой это проявляется в необычайном уме."

#. ja: ギュイッ！
#. de: Der Amaro spürt instinktiv das Gemüt seines Reiters.<br>Manche gehen sogar so weit zu behaupten, Amaros könnten <i>Gedanken</i> lesen!<br><i>Bethric</i>
#. fr: Gouig<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your amaro, Norvrandt's favorite beast of burden.
#. column 1: Of all the mounts seen in Norvrandt, naught is more ubiquitous than the amaro. Originally created by the mages of ancient Ronka, who selectively bred the flightless cama, present-day beasts carry the seed of their ancestors, which may manifest in the form of superior intellect.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:187:0:2"
msgid "That ever-so-endearing “gwee!”<br>It's enough to melt a man's heart,<br>I tell you.<br>   - Lamlyn"
msgstr "Это милое „гви-и!“<br>Так и сердце растает,<br>честное слово.<br>   — Ламлин"

#. ja: ホバー船に騎乗する。<br>クリスタルタワーから発見され、ミーン工芸館の職人が修復したもの
#. de: Rufe deinen Wüstengleiter herbei. Dieses Gefährt wurde im Kristallturm entdeckt und von den Handwerkern der Manufaktur der Gemeinschaft repariert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre aéroglisseur, un véhicule découvert dans la Tour de Cristal.
#. column 1: Once belonging to the imperial family, this unique craft was abandoned in a grotto by its owners due to a malfunction. It was later retrieved via airship and stored in the Crystal Tower, where it lay until its recent rediscovery and restoration by artisans of the Crystalline Mean.
#. column 2: Ready to take us wherever<br>we need to go, aye. Back again<br>too, maybe, if we ask it nicely.<br>   - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:188:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your skyslipper, the greatest mechanical marvel to ever resemble a shoe."
msgstr "Призовите небесный башмак — величайшее чудо техники, похожее на обувь."

#. ja: クリスタルタワーから発見され、ミーン工芸館の職人が修復した浮行式移動機械。元は皇族のリムジンだったが、ある洞窟の前で乗り捨てられていたため、仕方なく飛空艇で回収。以後、長らく塔内格納庫に放置されていたらしい
#. de: Diese Flugmaschine wurde einst von Mitgliedern der kaiserlichen Familie verwendet. Als sie vor einer bestimmten Höhle zurückgelassen wurde, musste sie mit einem Luftschiff geborgen werden. Danach wurde sie im Turm abgestellt und kam sehr lange Zeit nicht mehr zum Einsatz.
#. fr: Cet ancien véhicule flottant a été remis à neuf par les artisans de la halle du Juste. On raconte qu'il servait au transport de personnes fortunées, et qu'il avait été mys<shy>té<shy>rieu<shy>se<shy>ment abandonné à l'entrée d'une grotte avant d'être retrouvé et rapporté à la Tour de Cristal.
#. column 0: Summon forth your skyslipper, the greatest mechanical marvel to ever resemble a shoe.
#. column 2: Ready to take us wherever<br>we need to go, aye. Back again<br>too, maybe, if we ask it nicely.<br>   - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:188:0:1"
msgid "Once belonging to the imperial family, this unique craft was abandoned in a grotto by its owners due to a malfunction. It was later retrieved via airship and stored in the Crystal Tower, where it lay until its recent rediscovery and restoration by artisans of the Crystalline Mean."
msgstr "Когда-то этот необычный аппарат принадлежал императорской семье, но из-за поломки хозяева бросили его в пещере. Позже его забрали на дирижабле и поместили в Кристальную башню. Там он простоял до тех пор, пока его недавно не обнаружили и не восстановили мастера Кристального центра."

#. ja: フィーン！
#. de: \<knatter> \<knatter>
#. fr: Fshouoooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your skyslipper, the greatest mechanical marvel to ever resemble a shoe.
#. column 1: Once belonging to the imperial family, this unique craft was abandoned in a grotto by its owners due to a malfunction. It was later retrieved via airship and stored in the Crystal Tower, where it lay until its recent rediscovery and restoration by artisans of the Crystalline Mean.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:188:0:2"
msgid "Ready to take us wherever<br>we need to go, aye. Back again<br>too, maybe, if we ask it nicely.<br>   - Thancred"
msgstr "Отвезёт нас куда угодно,<br>куда понадобится. И обратно<br>тоже, если попросим вежливо.<br>   — Танкрет"

#. ja: ピクシーグイベルに騎乗する。<br>ティターニアの魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Pixie-Gwiber herbei. Dieses Wesen lässt sich mithilfe einer Pfeife rufen, die von der Magie des Feenkönigs Titania erfüllt ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dragon pixie, une créature qui ne peut être appelée que grâce à un sifflet chargé en magie de Titania.
#. column 1: Desiring to recreate the fantastical beast known as the dragon, a sorcerer from ages past fashioned a horn imbued with Titania's power. The creature which answers the sound is aglow with fae magicks.
#. column 2: Come to hear about<br>dragon legends, yes, yes?<br>   - Gyodo
msgctxt "MountTransient:189:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your fae gwiber, a draconic arcane entity."
msgstr "Призовите фейского вивера — волшебное существо в облике дракона."

#. ja: ティターニアの魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物。この魔笛は、古の魔道士が架空の存在である「ドラゴン」を再現するために造った品だという
#. de: Die Pfeife, mit der dieses Wesen gerufen werden kann, wurde vor langer Zeit von fähigen Magiern erschaffen. Das Wesen soll einen legendären Drachen darstellen.
#. fr: Ce dragon ne peut être appelé que grâce à un sifflet chargé de la magie de Titania, jadis fabriqué par des magiciens qui souhaitaient faire revivre les dragons.
#. column 0: Summon forth your fae gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 2: Come to hear about<br>dragon legends, yes, yes?<br>   - Gyodo
msgctxt "MountTransient:189:0:1"
msgid "Desiring to recreate the fantastical beast known as the dragon, a sorcerer from ages past fashioned a horn imbued with Titania's power. The creature which answers the sound is aglow with fae magicks."
msgstr "Давным-давно один маг решил воссоздать диковинного зверя, известного как дракон, и изготовил рог, наполненный силой Титании. На его звук откликается существо, сияющее фейской магией."

#. ja: ガオォーン！
#. de: H-Heiliger Bommel! Ein ... Drache?!<br><i>Mogzin</i>
#. fr: Graoooor<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your fae gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 1: Desiring to recreate the fantastical beast known as the dragon, a sorcerer from ages past fashioned a horn imbued with Titania's power. The creature which answers the sound is aglow with fae magicks.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:189:0:2"
msgid "Come to hear about<br>dragon legends, yes, yes?<br>   - Gyodo"
msgstr "Пришли послушать<br>драконьи легенды? Да-да?<br>   — Гёдо"

#. ja: トリケラトプスに騎乗する。<br>三本の角が特徴的な古代獣。魔法の浮遊鞍を装着済み
#. de: Rufe deinen Triceratops herbei, eine uralte Bestie mit drei charakteristischen Hörnern. Er ist bereits mit einem magischen Sattel ausgerüstet.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture tricératops, une créature ancienne à trois cornes, équipée d'une selle polyvalente.
#. column 1: In defiance of its bulk, this prehistoric horned beast has been rendered capable of flight courtesy of its saddle. Employing Ronkan ingenuity, the singular contraption was modified from an artifact discovered within ancient ruins by the moogle Nutsy, fearless leader of the clan of her namesake.
#. column 2: Can you please go and steal<br>a dinosaur egg for us?<br>   - Vath Braveheart
msgctxt "MountTransient:190:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your triceratops seemingly from a page right out of prehistory."
msgstr "Призовите трицератопса — будто сошедшего со страниц доисторической летописи."

#. ja: 三本の角が特徴的な古代獣。その背には、ロンカ文明の術式を応用した魔法の浮遊鞍が装着されている。どうやらナッツクランの創設者であるモーグリ族のナッツが、古代遺跡の探索中に発見した品を調整したものらしい
#. de: Auf dem Rücken dieser uralten Bestie ist ein Sattel befestigt, der unter Anwendung magischer Verfahren der Ronka-Zeit angefertigt wurde. Nuts, der Gründer vom Clan Kupo, entdeckte ihn während der Erforschung antiker Ruinen.
#. fr: Cette créature à trois cornes est équipée d'une selle magique inventée par les savants ronka. La rumeur veut que ce soit le Mog meneur de clan Kupo, Nuts, qui aurait trouvé cette selle lors d'une de ses expéditions dans les ruines ronka et lui en aurait fait cadeau.
#. column 0: Summon forth your triceratops seemingly from a page right out of prehistory.
#. column 2: Can you please go and steal<br>a dinosaur egg for us?<br>   - Vath Braveheart
msgctxt "MountTransient:190:0:1"
msgid "In defiance of its bulk, this prehistoric horned beast has been rendered capable of flight courtesy of its saddle. Employing Ronkan ingenuity, the singular contraption was modified from an artifact discovered within ancient ruins by the moogle Nutsy, fearless leader of the clan of her namesake."
msgstr "Несмотря на свои размеры, этот рогатый древний зверь может летать благодаря седлу. Умелый мугл Нацци, бесстрашная предводительница названного в её честь клана, усовершенствовала его с помощью ронканских технологий. За основу она взяла артефакт, найденный в древних руинах."

#. ja: ゴアァァッ！
#. de: Grrroooaaarrr!!!
#. fr: Groarrrr<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your triceratops seemingly from a page right out of prehistory.
#. column 1: In defiance of its bulk, this prehistoric horned beast has been rendered capable of flight courtesy of its saddle. Employing Ronkan ingenuity, the singular contraption was modified from an artifact discovered within ancient ruins by the moogle Nutsy, fearless leader of the clan of her namesake.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:190:0:2"
msgid "Can you please go and steal<br>a dinosaur egg for us?<br>   - Vath Braveheart"
msgstr "Пожалуйста, укради для нас<br>яйцо динозавра!<br>   — Отважное сердце Ват"

#. ja: フロッガーMに騎乗する。<br>ドワーフ族の職人が製造した中型オートマトン
#. de: Rufe deinen Eisenfrosch herbei. Diese mittelgroße Marionette wurde von Zwergenhandwerkern angefertigt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture grenouilleur M, un automate créé par un artisan nain.
#. column 1: Dwarven artisans have reinforced this automaton to improve lower body durability as well as installed a propulsion unit to enable flight. The techniques employed in its creation are a jealously guarded secret, and a blight upon the beards of they who betray it.
#. column 2: Lali-ho!<br>   - Every Single Dwarf
msgctxt "MountTransient:191:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your ironfrog mover, a dwarven-made automaton."
msgstr "Призовите железную лягушку — автомат, созданный мастерами-дварфами."

#. ja: ドワーフ族の職人が製造した中型オートマトン。常用を想定して、足回りが強化されていることに加え、飛行を可能とする推進装置が内蔵されている。しかし、その製法は掟によって秘中の秘とされ、公開されていない
#. de: Die Zwergenhandwerker haben für den alltäglichen Gebrauch nicht nur das Fahrgestell verstärkt, sondern auch ausfahrbare Triebwerke eingebaut, die den Eisenfrosch fliegen lassen. Deren Herstellungs-<br>methode würde aber kein Zwerg jemals verraten.
#. fr: Créé par un artisan nain, le système de suspension de cet automate a été pensé pour supporter une utilisation régulière, et possède un dispositif de propulsion lui permettant de voler. Ses plans de fabrication sont gardés secrets et il ne peut donc être reproduit que par les Nains.
#. column 0: Summon forth your ironfrog mover, a dwarven-made automaton.
#. column 2: Lali-ho!<br>   - Every Single Dwarf
msgctxt "MountTransient:191:0:1"
msgid "Dwarven artisans have reinforced this automaton to improve lower body durability as well as installed a propulsion unit to enable flight. The techniques employed in its creation are a jealously guarded secret, and a blight upon the beards of they who betray it."
msgstr "Дварфы укрепили нижнюю часть автомата и установили двигатель, чтобы он мог летать. Технологию его создания они ревностно хранят в тайне. Горе бородачу, который её выдаст!"

#. ja: カラカラカラカラ…
#. de: Holladriooooh!!
#. fr: Kling klang...
#. column 0: Summon forth your ironfrog mover, a dwarven-made automaton.
#. column 1: Dwarven artisans have reinforced this automaton to improve lower body durability as well as installed a propulsion unit to enable flight. The techniques employed in its creation are a jealously guarded secret, and a blight upon the beards of they who betray it.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:191:0:2"
msgid "Lali-ho!<br>   - Every Single Dwarf"
msgstr "Лали-хо!<br>   — Все до единого дварфы"

#. ja: イノセントグイベルに騎乗する。<br>イノセンスの魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Innozenz-Gwiber herbei. Dieses Wesen lässt sich mithilfe einer Pfeife beschwören, die von Innozenz' Magie erfüllt ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dragon immaculé, une créature qui ne peut être appelée que grâce à un sifflet magique imprégné de l'énergie d'Innocence.
#. column 1: Answering to a horn imbued with the almighty Innocence's power, this draconic arcane entity is enveloped in the selfsame glow as the Lightwarden whence it takes its name. Rest assured it is not a sin eater.
#. column 2: It would not do for an<br>unadorned winged lizard<br>to be the protagonist.<br>   - Alberic
msgctxt "MountTransient:192:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your innocent gwiber, a draconic arcane entity."
msgstr "Призовите невинного вивера — волшебное существо в облике дракона."

#. ja: イノセンスの魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物。その輝きは全能者を名乗ったイノセンスの姿を思わせるが、もちろんこの個体は罪喰いではない
#. de: Das Licht, welches dieses Wesen umgibt, erinnert an den allmächtigen Innozenz. Natürlich handelt es sich hierbei nicht um einen Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger.
#. fr: Ce dragon ne peut être appelé que grâce à un sifflet imprégné de l'énergie d'Innocence. À ne pas confondre avec un purgateur, son nom lui vient seulement de la brillance de ses écailles.
#. column 0: Summon forth your innocent gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 2: It would not do for an<br>unadorned winged lizard<br>to be the protagonist.<br>   - Alberic
msgctxt "MountTransient:192:0:1"
msgid "Answering to a horn imbued with the almighty Innocence's power, this draconic arcane entity is enveloped in the selfsame glow as the Lightwarden whence it takes its name. Rest assured it is not a sin eater."
msgstr "Это существо в облике дракона откликается на рог, наполненный силой всесильной Невинности. Его сияние напоминает облика Стража Света, чьё имя оно носит. Не волнуйтесь, это не пожиратель грехов."

#. ja: キラキラ…
#. de: Ich bin ohne Schuld, frei von jedem Makel! Ich bin Innozenz!<br><i>Vauthry</i>
#. fr: Swish, swish, swish<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your innocent gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 1: Answering to a horn imbued with the almighty Innocence's power, this draconic arcane entity is enveloped in the selfsame glow as the Lightwarden whence it takes its name. Rest assured it is not a sin eater.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:192:0:2"
msgid "It would not do for an<br>unadorned winged lizard<br>to be the protagonist.<br>   - Alberic"
msgstr "Неприлично же, если<br>главным героем будет<br>обычная крылатая ящерица.<br>   — Альберик"

#. ja: マジックベッドに騎乗する。<br>魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ寝台
#. de: Rufe dein Zauberbett herbei. Dieses fliegende Bett erleichtert den morgendlichen Weg zum Bäcker erheblich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre lit magique, un couchage capable de vous transporter dans les airs.
#. column 1: Once upon a time, in the Kingdom of Voeburt, there lived a member of the royal family slothful of body but quick of mind. This man desired naught more than to never be parted from his pillow, and so commissioned a bed that could fly...only to swiftly take to the sky without paying for it. He, presumably, lived happily ever after.
#. column 2: Do not your mortal bodies tire?<br>Far better to dwell in dream.<br>   - Sri Lakshmi
msgctxt "MountTransient:193:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your magicked bed, and dream a little dream of never needing to get up."
msgstr "Призовите волшебную кровать и помечтайте о том, как больше никогда не вставать."

#. ja: 魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ寝台。フッブート王国時代に、「絶対にベッドから離れたくない」という怠惰な王族の頼み事を聞き入れる形で設計した。もちろん怠け者が、相応の対価を支払えるはずもなく、発注主は天へと旅立った
#. de: Zu der Zeit, als das Königreich Voeburt noch existierte, wurde dieses Bett für einen unglaublich faulen Königssohn angefertigt. Da es ihm zu anstrengend war, sich die Steuerung erklären zu lassen, stieg er schlafend in die Wolken auf und ward nie wieder gesehen.
#. fr: Ce lit volant a été conçu à l'époque du royaume de Voeburt, à la demande d'un noble par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement paresseux qui ne souhaitait quitter sa couche sous aucun prétexte. Lorsque vint l'heure de rétribuer ses artisans, il partit faire une sieste et s'envola vers d'autres cieux...
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked bed, and dream a little dream of never needing to get up.
#. column 2: Do not your mortal bodies tire?<br>Far better to dwell in dream.<br>   - Sri Lakshmi
msgctxt "MountTransient:193:0:1"
msgid "Once upon a time, in the Kingdom of Voeburt, there lived a member of the royal family slothful of body but quick of mind. This man desired naught more than to never be parted from his pillow, and so commissioned a bed that could fly...only to swiftly take to the sky without paying for it. He, presumably, lived happily ever after."
msgstr "Давным-давно в королевстве Вёбурт жил один член королевской семьи — ленивый телом, зато быстрый умом. Он больше всего на свете хотел никогда не расставаться с подушкой, поэтому заказал летающую кровать... а потом поспешно взмыл в небо, не заплатив за неё. И, надо полагать, жил долго и счастливо."

#. ja: 夢の降る夜がある
#. de: Ich hätte nichts gegen eine heiße Tasse Tee und ein anständiges Bett einzuwenden.<br><i>Ryne</i>
#. fr: Faites de beaux rêves...
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked bed, and dream a little dream of never needing to get up.
#. column 1: Once upon a time, in the Kingdom of Voeburt, there lived a member of the royal family slothful of body but quick of mind. This man desired naught more than to never be parted from his pillow, and so commissioned a bed that could fly...only to swiftly take to the sky without paying for it. He, presumably, lived happily ever after.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:193:0:2"
msgid "Do not your mortal bodies tire?<br>Far better to dwell in dream.<br>   - Sri Lakshmi"
msgstr "Устают ваши смертные тела?<br>Лучше уж жить во сне.<br>   — Шри Лакшми"

#. ja: コンチネンタル・アーリマンに騎乗する。<br>コンチネンタル・サーカスで飼育されていた妖異アーリマン
#. de: Rufe deinen Ahriman herbei, der von einem Bändiger des Circus Continental aufgezogen und trainiert wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre ahriman du Cirque, une étrange créature élevée et entraînée par le Cirque intercontinental.
#. column 1: Raised in hopes that its Dread Gaze would reap a bountiful harvest of terror, this ahriman proved a disappointment. It has since found a new calling as an adventurer's trusty mount.
#. column 2: You have the eye of<br>an ahriman, Yda.<br>   - Y'shtola
msgctxt "MountTransient:194:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Circus ahriman, a voidsent bred by the Continental Circus."
msgstr "Призовите циркового ахримана — порождение Бездны, выведенное Цирком континентов."

#. ja: コンチネンタル・サーカスで見世物として飼育されていた妖異。「恐怖の視線」によって、人々から恐怖の力を集めることを期待されていたが、その辺りの才能はなかったらしい。今では尊敬する冒険者の従者となった
#. de: Der Impresario vom Circus Continental hatte den Plan, mithilfe dieses Ahrimans zu Allerschutzheiligen Angst und Schrecken zu verbreiten, doch der Blick des Grauens wollte ihm einfach nicht gelingen.
#. fr: Ce mystérieux ahriman a été élevé par le dresseur louche du Cirque intercontinental. Celui-ci l'avait entraîné pour épouvanter les humains et récolter l'énergie de leur frayeur avec son regard terrifiant, mais la créature n'étant pas à la hauteur, il a été décidé qu'elle vous accompagnerait dans vos aventures pour s'améliorer.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Circus ahriman, a voidsent bred by the Continental Circus.
#. column 2: You have the eye of<br>an ahriman, Yda.<br>   - Y'shtola
msgctxt "MountTransient:194:0:1"
msgid "Raised in hopes that its Dread Gaze would reap a bountiful harvest of terror, this ahriman proved a disappointment. It has since found a new calling as an adventurer's trusty mount."
msgstr "Ахримана вырастили в надежде, что его Ужасающий взгляд соберёт богатый урожай страха. Но тот подвёл ожидания. Теперь он нашёл новое призвание — верно служить приключенцу верховым ездовым зверем."

#. ja: チラリ…
#. de: Im Gegenzug möchte ich nur, dass ihr schön viele Leute mit dem Blick des Grauens erschreckt.<br><i>Impresario</i>
#. fr: (scrute scrute)
#. column 0: Summon forth your Circus ahriman, a voidsent bred by the Continental Circus.
#. column 1: Raised in hopes that its Dread Gaze would reap a bountiful harvest of terror, this ahriman proved a disappointment. It has since found a new calling as an adventurer's trusty mount.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:194:0:2"
msgid "You have the eye of<br>an ahriman, Yda.<br>   - Y'shtola"
msgstr "У тебя взгляд ахримана, Ида.<br>   — Я'штола"

#. ja: 金斗雲に騎乗する。<br>東方の仙人が編み出した秘術。魔法の雲を創り出す
#. de: Rufe den goldenen Kumulus herbei. Mithilfe einer geheimen Technik eines Einsiedlers aus dem Fernen Osten lässt sich diese magische Wolke rufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture nuage magique doré. Avez-vous le cœur assez pur pour monter dessus<nbsp>?
#. column 1: There is but one man in all of Hydaelyn who can create such a mystical masterpiece, and it is said he resides upon a misty peak hidden within the mountain ranges of Doma. Crafted by stitching together dozens of smaller clouds dyed golden by the sun, this cumulus is said to bring good fortune to its rider.
#. column 2: If you live with your head<br>in the clouds, sooner or later<br>you'll find yourself on your rear.<br>   - Brangwine
msgctxt "MountTransient:195:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the sunspun cumulus. It is unclear whether its previous owner was a boy with a tail or simply a monkey."
msgstr "Призовите солнечное облако. Никто не знает, принадлежало ли оно мальчику с хвостом или просто обезьяне."

#. ja: 東州オサード大陸辺境の山深くに棲まうという、偉大なる仙人が編み出した秘術。魔力によって雲を束ね、これに飛び乗って空を舞うことができるという。その黄金に輝く雲は、乗り手に金運を呼び込むと伝えられている
#. de: Ein mächtiger Zaubergelehrter, der zurückgezogen in den Bergen von Doma lebte, erschuf diese magische Wolke, indem er viele kleine Wolken miteinander verknüpfte. Man erzählt sich, das Glück würde jedem folgen, der auf dieser goldenen Wolke reitet.
#. fr: Ce nuage magique a été invoqué par un ermite retiré dans les montagnes du continent d'Othard. On dit que sa couleur dorée apporterait la fortune à son pro<shy>prié<shy>taire.
#. column 0: Summon forth the sunspun cumulus. It is unclear whether its previous owner was a boy with a tail or simply a monkey.
#. column 2: If you live with your head<br>in the clouds, sooner or later<br>you'll find yourself on your rear.<br>   - Brangwine
msgctxt "MountTransient:195:0:1"
msgid "There is but one man in all of Hydaelyn who can create such a mystical masterpiece, and it is said he resides upon a misty peak hidden within the mountain ranges of Doma. Crafted by stitching together dozens of smaller clouds dyed golden by the sun, this cumulus is said to bring good fortune to its rider."
msgstr "Во всём Хайделине лишь один человек способен создать такое чудо. Говорят, он живёт на туманной вершине, затерянной среди гор Домы. Сшитое из десятков маленьких облаков, позолоченных солнцем, это облачко, по слухам, приносит удачу своему всаднику."

#. ja: どっひゃー！
#. de: Du verdienst alles Glück der Welt ...<br><i>Unbekannt</i>
#. fr: Shuuuu...
#. column 0: Summon forth the sunspun cumulus. It is unclear whether its previous owner was a boy with a tail or simply a monkey.
#. column 1: There is but one man in all of Hydaelyn who can create such a mystical masterpiece, and it is said he resides upon a misty peak hidden within the mountain ranges of Doma. Crafted by stitching together dozens of smaller clouds dyed golden by the sun, this cumulus is said to bring good fortune to its rider.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:195:0:2"
msgid "If you live with your head<br>in the clouds, sooner or later<br>you'll find yourself on your rear.<br>   - Brangwine"
msgstr "Кто в облаках витает,<br>рано или поздно<br>на землю грохнется.<br>   — Брангвайн"

#. ja: バトルタイガーに騎乗する。<br>戦闘用に調教された軍剣虎。第三の剣を手に入れた
#. de: Rufe deinen vollgepanzerten Kampftiger herbei, der neben seinen Krallen und Säbelzähnen auch noch mit einem messerscharfen Horn bewaffnet ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture tigre de combat, qui peut paraître féroce à première vue, mais n'est rien d'autre qu'un gros chaton.
#. column 1: In the region of Bozja in Ilsabard, the sabertooth tiger has long been employed in warfare as part of infantry. Many soldiers developed an enduring bond with the beasts, whom they would affectionately refer to as their “kittens.”
#. column 2: Tigers! And they<br>look hungry!<br>   - Hapless Namazu
msgctxt "MountTransient:197:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your battle tiger, now with 100% more sharp things with which to terrorize your foes."
msgstr "Призовите боевого тигра — теперь в его арсенале ещё больше острых штук, чтобы пугать врагов."

#. ja: 戦闘用に調教された軍剣虎。北州イルサバード大陸のボズヤ地方では、この種の獣を軍用獣として、歩兵部隊に同行させる伝統があった。そうした部隊の兵たちは、相棒となる剣虎を親しみを込めて「猫」と呼んだという
#. de: Dieser Säbelzahntiger wurde seit seiner Geburt zum Kämpfen trainiert. Die Armee in der Bozja-Region setzt seit jeher spezielle Bataillone mit diesen gepanzerten Raubkatzen in Schlachten ein.
#. fr: Ce tigre de combat est originaire des régions méridionales d'Ilsabard, où l'on s'en servait pour protéger les unités d'infanterie lors des guerres. Beaucoup de soldats se seraient ainsi liés d'amitié avec leur tigre, qu'ils appelaient af<shy>fec<shy>tueu<shy>se<shy>ment “mon chaton”.
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle tiger, now with 100% more sharp things with which to terrorize your foes.
#. column 2: Tigers! And they<br>look hungry!<br>   - Hapless Namazu
msgctxt "MountTransient:197:0:1"
msgid "In the region of Bozja in Ilsabard, the sabertooth tiger has long been employed in warfare as part of infantry. Many soldiers developed an enduring bond with the beasts, whom they would affectionately refer to as their “kittens.”"
msgstr "В области Божья в Илсабарде саблезубых тигров издавна использовали в пехоте. Многие солдаты привязывались к своим зверям и ласково звали их „котятами“."

#. ja: ニャァ！
#. de: Sollen die kleinen Miezekätzchen sich mal etwas austoben. Umso leichter sind sie später zu handhaben.<br><i>Gegeruju</i>
#. fr: Miaou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your battle tiger, now with 100% more sharp things with which to terrorize your foes.
#. column 1: In the region of Bozja in Ilsabard, the sabertooth tiger has long been employed in warfare as part of infantry. Many soldiers developed an enduring bond with the beasts, whom they would affectionately refer to as their “kittens.”
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:197:0:2"
msgid "Tigers! And they<br>look hungry!<br>   - Hapless Namazu"
msgstr "Тигры! И, похоже,<br>они голодны!<br>   — Несчастный намадзу"

#. ja: モルボルに騎乗する。<br>大きな口が特徴的な草木綱の魔物。ちょっぴり臭い
#. de: Rufe einen ausgewachsenen Morbol als Reittier hierbei. Morbol kann man nicht wirklich zu Reittieren dressieren. Entsprechend ungewöhnlich fällt der Transport aus.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture morbol. Un monstre végétal tentaculaire au long râtelier bien affûté. Même s'il pogne bien moins qu'un de ses compères sauvages, il dégage encore un petit relent désagréable.
#. column 1: Though all it has ever wanted is to help, this morbol was found to be “too sweet” to present a challenge at the Celestium, and was transferred to the Blue Mages' Guild before it had even seen its first match─only for it to be deemed “insufficiently vile” there as well.
#. column 2: A morbol!? And things<br>were going so well...<br>   - Papalymo
msgctxt "MountTransient:200:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your morbol. Strong vines, soft heart...middling stench."
msgstr "Призовите морбола. Крепкие лозы, доброе сердце... и не слишком сильный запах."

#. ja: 元は「ブルースカイ」がマスクカーニバル用に仕入れた魔物だったが、温厚すぎて使い物にならなかった。そのため、青魔道士ギルドに譲渡されたが、臭気が弱く「臭い息」の修得にも利用できず、最終的に騎乗用になったらしい
#. de: Dieses magische Wesen war ursprünglich für die Große Maskerade in der Himmlischen Arena gedacht, aber erwies sich als etwas zu un<shy>be<shy>rechen<shy>bar. Die Blaumagiergilde beschloss kurzerhand, die wenigen Exemplare an einen windigen Händler zu veräußern.
#. fr: Capturé par le personnel du Ciel azur pour la Grande Mascarade, ce morbol bien trop docile fut offert en cadeau à la guilde des mages bleus. Cependant, sa mauvaise haleine était bien trop faible pour permettre d'être étudiée et la créature finit par être choisie comme monture.
#. column 0: Summon forth your morbol. Strong vines, soft heart...middling stench.
#. column 2: A morbol!? And things<br>were going so well...<br>   - Papalymo
msgctxt "MountTransient:200:0:1"
msgid "Though all it has ever wanted is to help, this morbol was found to be “too sweet” to present a challenge at the Celestium, and was transferred to the Blue Mages' Guild before it had even seen its first match─only for it to be deemed “insufficiently vile” there as well."
msgstr "Этот морбол хотел лишь помогать, но на арене „Целестиум“ его сочли „слишком милым“, чтобы он мог кому-то бросить вызов, и передали в гильдию синих магов, так и не выпустив на первый бой. Там его тоже забраковали — он оказался „недостаточно мерзким“."

#. ja: プワ～ン……
#. de: Keiner hat behauptet, es würde bequem werden.<br><i>Anonymer Exoten-Händler</i>
#. fr: Grooaaah...
#. column 0: Summon forth your morbol. Strong vines, soft heart...middling stench.
#. column 1: Though all it has ever wanted is to help, this morbol was found to be “too sweet” to present a challenge at the Celestium, and was transferred to the Blue Mages' Guild before it had even seen its first match─only for it to be deemed “insufficiently vile” there as well.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:200:0:2"
msgid "A morbol!? And things<br>were going so well...<br>   - Papalymo"
msgstr "Морбол?! А ведь всё<br>так хорошо шло...<br>   — Папалимо"

#. ja: ファットポークシーに騎乗する。<br>騎乗用に創られたポークシー。ほんのりソーセージの香りがする
#. de: Rufe deine stattliche Quiexie herbei. Sie ist stark genug, um dich auf ihrem Rücken zu tragen, allerdings muss man sich etwas an den strengen Geruch gewöhnen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un porxie créé spécifiquement dans le but d'être chevauché. Une légère odeur de saucisse se dégage de la charmante créature rondelette.
#. column 1: A prodigious porxie created by the Nu Mou Lugg Aenc for transportation purposes. Fond of sausages, it oft spends its free time in the curing chamber, and thus has come to take on the aroma. While comfortable to ride thanks to its soft curves, expect regular rumblings from its belly.
#. column 2: Oooh, when I get my hands<br>on those porxienappers...<br>   - Uin Nee
msgctxt "MountTransient:201:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your portly porxie. Bears you places to the tantalizing smell of cured meats."
msgstr "Призовите упитанного поркси. Он отвезёт вас куда угодно, оставляя за собой аппетитный запах копчёностей."

#. ja: ン・モゥ族のラグ＝インクが製作した騎乗用ポークシー。ソーセージの香りが大好きで、暇さえあれば燻製室に入り浸っていたため、その香りが染み付いている。乗り心地は極めて良好だが、腹が減って仕方がない
#. de: Diese Quiexie wurde von dem Nu Mou Lugg Aenc als Reittier erschaffen. Sie wühlt gerne nach Essen und liebt vor allem Würste aller Art. Aufgrund ihrer weichen Rundungen lässt es sich angenehm auf ihr sitzen. Allerdings muss man mit lautem Magenknurren rechnen.
#. fr: Ce porxie a été créé par le Nu Mou Lugg Aenc. Il passe tellement de temps dans son fumoir que l'odeur de saucisse imprègne toutes ses créations. Si cette monture est très agréable à chevaucher, elle vous laisse toujours avec l'estomac dans les talons quand vous en descendez<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your portly porxie. Bears you places to the tantalizing smell of cured meats.
#. column 2: Oooh, when I get my hands<br>on those porxienappers...<br>   - Uin Nee
msgctxt "MountTransient:201:0:1"
msgid "A prodigious porxie created by the Nu Mou Lugg Aenc for transportation purposes. Fond of sausages, it oft spends its free time in the curing chamber, and thus has come to take on the aroma. While comfortable to ride thanks to its soft curves, expect regular rumblings from its belly."
msgstr "Этот огромный поркси создан Ну Мо Лаг-Энком для перевозки людей. Он обожает сосиски и всё свободное время проводит в коптильне, поэтому пропитался их запахом. Ездить на нём удобно благодаря мягким бокам, но его живот то и дело урчит."

#. ja: ブゥブゥ…
#. de: Ein Feenkönigreich für eine Quiexie!<br><i>Uin Nee</i>
#. fr: Grouiiiik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your portly porxie. Bears you places to the tantalizing smell of cured meats.
#. column 1: A prodigious porxie created by the Nu Mou Lugg Aenc for transportation purposes. Fond of sausages, it oft spends its free time in the curing chamber, and thus has come to take on the aroma. While comfortable to ride thanks to its soft curves, expect regular rumblings from its belly.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:201:0:2"
msgid "Oooh, when I get my hands<br>on those porxienappers...<br>   - Uin Nee"
msgstr "Ох, вот доберусь я<br>до похитителей поркси...<br>   — Уин-Ни"

#. ja: エピメテウスに騎乗する。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が再現した帝国製魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe Epimetheus herbei, eine schier unaufhaltsame Kampfmaschine. Jedenfalls wäre sie es, wenn sie etwas größer wäre.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Epimetheus. La reproduction d'une arme magitek griffée des Forges de Garlond.
#. column 1: Garlond Ironworks recreated this warmachina from a blueprint acquired by a Scion operative on a covert mission to Garlemald. As the dimensions were missing from the document, however, its size had to be estimated, the resultant vehicle being rather smaller than the original.
#. column 2: I never dreamed that I would<br>have the chance to see such a<br>ferocious warmachina with my<br>own eyes!<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic
msgctxt "MountTransient:202:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Epimetheus, an unstoppable vehicle of war. Or at least it would be if it were bigger."
msgstr "Призовите Эпиметея — неудержимую боевую машину. По крайней мере, был бы неудержим, будь он побольше."

#. ja: 「暁の血盟」所属の諜報員が、帝国本土より持ち帰った図面を基に、ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が再現した魔導兵器。しかし、欠落した情報を推測で補った結果、本物よりも小さな単座式車両として完成したのだった
#. de: Die Garlond Metallwerke haben diese Kriegsmaschine nach gestohlenen Bauplänen aus Garlemald rekonstruiert. Da jedoch die exakten Ausmaße unbekannt waren, fällt diese Version etwas kleiner aus als das Original.
#. fr: Les plans de cette arme magitek ont été subtilisés par un espion des Héritiers de la Septième Aube à Garlemald. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment incomplets, les ingénieurs des Forges de Garlond ont dû extrapoler certaines données et se sont retrouvés avec un modèle monoplace bien plus petit que l'original.
#. column 0: Summon forth Epimetheus, an unstoppable vehicle of war. Or at least it would be if it were bigger.
#. column 2: I never dreamed that I would<br>have the chance to see such a<br>ferocious warmachina with my<br>own eyes!<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic
msgctxt "MountTransient:202:0:1"
msgid "Garlond Ironworks recreated this warmachina from a blueprint acquired by a Scion operative on a covert mission to Garlemald. As the dimensions were missing from the document, however, its size had to be estimated, the resultant vehicle being rather smaller than the original."
msgstr "Гарлондские мастерские воссоздали эту боевую машину по чертежу, который агент Потомков добыл во время тайной миссии в Гарлемальде. Размеры в документе не указали, поэтому их пришлось вычислять на глаз — и машина вышла куда меньше оригинала."

#. ja: ドルルルルルル…
#. de: Boooah, was für ein geiles Teil!<br><i>Kriegsmaschinen-Nerd</i>
#. fr: Vrrrrrrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth Epimetheus, an unstoppable vehicle of war. Or at least it would be if it were bigger.
#. column 1: Garlond Ironworks recreated this warmachina from a blueprint acquired by a Scion operative on a covert mission to Garlemald. As the dimensions were missing from the document, however, its size had to be estimated, the resultant vehicle being rather smaller than the original.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:202:0:2"
msgid "I never dreamed that I would<br>have the chance to see such a<br>ferocious warmachina with my<br>own eyes!<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic"
msgstr "Никогда не думал, что увижу<br>такую грозную боевую машину<br>своими глазами!<br>   — Фанат боевых машин"

#. ja: メノイティオスに騎乗する。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が試作した帝国製魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe Menoetius herbei. Ähnelt Epimetheus, ist aber ungleich komfortabler.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Epimetheus. La reproduction d'une arme magitek griffée des Forges de Garlond.
#. column 1: Following their successful recreation of Epimetheus, Garlond Ironworks set out to refine the vehicle's design. Their efforts resulted in Menoetius, a model which retains its predecessor's speed while boasting improved comfort and manufacturability.
#. column 2: Of late, all I can think about is<br>Weapons, Weapons, Weapons.<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic
msgctxt "MountTransient:203:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Menoetius. Just like Epimetheus, but more comfortable."
msgstr "Призовите Меноэтия. Такой же, как Эпиметей, только удобнее."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が試作した魔導兵器。エピメテウスの開発を通じて得られたデータを基に改良が加えられたことにより、最高速度こそ変わらないものの、乗り心地と生産性が向上しているらしい
#. de: Nach der erfolgreichen Rekonstruktion des Epimetheus haben sich die Ingenieure der Garlond Metallwerke darangemacht, das Fahrzeug zu verbessern. Das Ergebnis ist ein komfortableres und zugleich agileres Gefährt.
#. fr: Les ingénieurs des Forges de Garlond ont mis à profit les con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ces acquises lors de la reproduction de l'Epimetheus pour développer cette version améliorée baptisée Menoetius.  Sa vitesse de pointe n'a pas changé, mais de gros progrès ont été faits au niveau du confort de conduite et de la qualité de la réalisation.
#. column 0: Summon forth Menoetius. Just like Epimetheus, but more comfortable.
#. column 2: Of late, all I can think about is<br>Weapons, Weapons, Weapons.<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic
msgctxt "MountTransient:203:0:1"
msgid "Following their successful recreation of Epimetheus, Garlond Ironworks set out to refine the vehicle's design. Their efforts resulted in Menoetius, a model which retains its predecessor's speed while boasting improved comfort and manufacturability."
msgstr "После успешного воссоздания Эпиметея инженеры Гарлондских мастерских взялись усовершенствовать конструкцию. Так появился Меноэтий: он не уступает предшественнику в скорости, зато стал удобнее и проще в производстве."

#. ja: ヴロロロロロロ…
#. de: Ich glaube, ich bin verliebt ...<br><i>Kriegsmaschinen-Nerd</i>
#. fr: Vrrrrrrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth Menoetius. Just like Epimetheus, but more comfortable.
#. column 1: Following their successful recreation of Epimetheus, Garlond Ironworks set out to refine the vehicle's design. Their efforts resulted in Menoetius, a model which retains its predecessor's speed while boasting improved comfort and manufacturability.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:203:0:2"
msgid "Of late, all I can think about is<br>Weapons, Weapons, Weapons.<br>   - Warmachina Fanatic"
msgstr "В последнее время я только и думаю,<br>что об оружии, оружии, оружии.<br>   — Фанат боевых машин"

#. ja: コンストラクト07に騎乗する。<br>コボルド族が製造した装甲巨兵。それを黒渦団が鹵獲したもの
#. de: Rufe dein Konstrukt7 herbei. Ein mächtiger Stahlkoloss, der mit seinem Brummen und Zischen besonders bei den Zwergen Eindruck schinden dürfte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture constructeur 07. Cette armure de combat géante construite par les Kobolds a été capturée par des soldats du Maelstrom.
#. column 1: Having taken prisoner what they thought was an automaton during a skirmish with the kobolds, Maelstrom officers were shocked to find that it was instead a type of synthetic golem─but not so shocked as to not immediately bring it to Naldiq & Vymelli's for repair and later sale.
#. column 2: So the kobolds are at it again...<br>   - Anaoc
msgctxt "MountTransient:204:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Construct VII. Rumors that it is heavily based on an Ivalician design are entirely unfounded. Well, almost."
msgstr "Призовите конструкт VII. Слухи, что его сделали по образцу ивалицийской машины, совершенно беспочвенны. Ну, почти."

#. ja: コボルド族が製造した装甲巨兵。その実体は、機械ではなく甲冑を着込んだゴーレムの一種である。コボルド族との戦いの結果、黒渦団が鹵獲。ナルディク＆ヴィメリー社の手で修復が行われた後、冒険者部隊に支給された
#. de: Tatsächlich handelt es sich bei dem Kobold-Konstrukt nicht um eine Maschine, sondern um einen Golem. Erbeutet durch den Mahlstrom, wurden einige Exemplare bei Naldiq & Vymelli wieder Instand gesetzt und an die Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilde übergeben.
#. fr: Cette armure de combat ressemble à un robot, mais c'est en vérité une variété de golem créée par les Kobolds. Capturée par le Maelstrom lors d'une escarmouche avec la tribu barbare, elle a été réhabilitée par la société Naldiq et Vymelli pour vous servir.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Construct VII. Rumors that it is heavily based on an Ivalician design are entirely unfounded. Well, almost.
#. column 2: So the kobolds are at it again...<br>   - Anaoc
msgctxt "MountTransient:204:0:1"
msgid "Having taken prisoner what they thought was an automaton during a skirmish with the kobolds, Maelstrom officers were shocked to find that it was instead a type of synthetic golem─but not so shocked as to not immediately bring it to Naldiq & Vymelli's for repair and later sale."
msgstr "Во время стычки с кобольдами офицеры Водоворота захватили то, что приняли за автомат. Их удивило, что это оказался искусственный голем, а не машина. Но не настолько, чтобы не отнести его в Налдик и Вимелли для ремонта и последующей продажи."

#. ja: ガチャリ、ガチャリ
#. de: Huldigt Titan! Titan ist groß! Titan! Titan! Titan!!!<br><i>Gravur an der Fußsohle des Konstrukts</i>
#. fr: Clonk, clonk<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Construct VII. Rumors that it is heavily based on an Ivalician design are entirely unfounded. Well, almost.
#. column 1: Having taken prisoner what they thought was an automaton during a skirmish with the kobolds, Maelstrom officers were shocked to find that it was instead a type of synthetic golem─but not so shocked as to not immediately bring it to Naldiq & Vymelli's for repair and later sale.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:204:0:2"
msgid "So the kobolds are at it again...<br>   - Anaoc"
msgstr "Опять кобольды за своё...<br>   — Анаок"

#. ja: シャドウグイベルに騎乗する。<br>ハーデスの魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Schatten-Gwiber herbei. Dieses Wesen lässt sich mithilfe einer Pfeife rufen, die von Hades' Magie erfüllt ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dragon ombragé, une créature qui ne peut être appelée que grâce à un sifflet enchanté chargé de l'énergie magique d'Hadès.
#. column 1: Answering to a horn imbued with the power of a sorcerer of eld, this draconic arcane entity is believed to have been created by Emet-Selch on a whim─an act that would have barely taxed his powers as an ancient.
#. column 2: Are you some kind of<br>lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
msgctxt "MountTransient:205:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your shadow gwiber, a draconic arcane entity."
msgstr "Призовите теневого вивера — волшебное существо в облике дракона."

#. ja: ハーデスの魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物。おそらく、アシエン・エメトセルクが戯れに創ったものと思われる。かつて古代人は、この程度の存在であれば、いとも簡単に創造できたのだろう
#. de: Die Pfeife, mit der dieses Wesen gerufen werden kann, wurde vermutlich vor langer Zeit von dem Ascian Emet-Selch erschaffen. Für den Ursprünglichen war das wohl nicht viel mehr als eine Spielerei.
#. fr: Ce dragon ne peut être appelé que grâce à un sifflet enchanté chargé de l'énergie magique d'Hadès. Il est probable que cette créature ait été façonnée par l'ascien Emet-Selch. La magie des habitants de l'ancien monde était si puissante qu'une telle création leur était aisée.
#. column 0: Summon forth your shadow gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 2: Are you some kind of<br>lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin
msgctxt "MountTransient:205:0:1"
msgid "Answering to a horn imbued with the power of a sorcerer of eld, this draconic arcane entity is believed to have been created by Emet-Selch on a whim─an act that would have barely taxed his powers as an ancient."
msgstr "Считается, что этот драконий магический дух, отзывающийся на рог, наделённый силой древнего чародея, был создан Эмет-Селхом от скуки. Для древнего такое колдовство едва ли требовало усилий."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Bist du eine Art niederer Drache?<br><i>Mogzin</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your shadow gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 1: Answering to a horn imbued with the power of a sorcerer of eld, this draconic arcane entity is believed to have been created by Emet-Selch on a whim─an act that would have barely taxed his powers as an ancient.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:205:0:2"
msgid "Are you some kind of<br>lesser dragon, kupo?<br>   - Mogzin"
msgstr "Ты что, какой-то<br>дракон помельче, купо?<br>   — Могзин"

#. ja: スプリガン・キャリアーに騎乗する。<br>巨大なスプリガン。鉱石や卵ではなく、人を運ぶのが大好き
#. de: Rufe einen Träger-Spriggan herbei, der dich mit fluffigen Ohren und auf bequemen Kissen sanft an dein Ziel trägt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture spriggan porte-pierre, un spécimen gigantesque qui adore porter des pierres, mais aussi des œufs ou des personnes.
#. column 1: Grown to a prodigious size by virtue of its appetite, this spriggan was choking on a chunk of ore when it was found and saved by a band of miners. Seeking to repay the kindness of men, it took to carrying their burdens, which apparently includes men themselves.
#. column 2: It must be so tiring living<br>each day carrying around<br>a brain of solid stone.<br>   - Da Za
msgctxt "MountTransient:206:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your spriggan stonecarrier. Lives to carry ore, eggs, and you."
msgstr "Призовите камненосного спроггана. Он жить не может без руды, яиц и вас."

#. ja: 稀に見る巨体を誇るスプリガン。鉱石の食べすぎで太ってしまい、狭い坑道に詰まっているところを採掘師たちに助けられて以来、人に恩返しするため荷運びを続けている。近頃は、人を運ぶことに情熱を傾けているようだ
#. de: Dieser riesige Spriggan hat sich so lange an köstlichsten Erzen gütlich getan, bis er im Stollen feststeckte. Seit seiner Befreiung trägt er sowohl Waren als auch Personen mit größter Leidenschaft.
#. fr: Ce spécimen rare de spriggan a été découvert par des mineurs. Il serait entré par un orifice et devenu trop gros pour en ressortir après avoir dévoré une montagne de minerai. Il a remercié ses sauveurs en transportant leurs attirails et se passionne maintenant pour le métier de porteur.
#. column 0: Summon forth your spriggan stonecarrier. Lives to carry ore, eggs, and you.
#. column 2: It must be so tiring living<br>each day carrying around<br>a brain of solid stone.<br>   - Da Za
msgctxt "MountTransient:206:0:1"
msgid "Grown to a prodigious size by virtue of its appetite, this spriggan was choking on a chunk of ore when it was found and saved by a band of miners. Seeking to repay the kindness of men, it took to carrying their burdens, which apparently includes men themselves."
msgstr "Этот спрогган вырос просто огромным из-за своего аппетита. Когда его нашли, он давился куском руды, но шахтёры спасли его. В благодарность он стал носить их поклажу — и, похоже, теперь считает поклажей и самих людей."

#. ja: ギィ……？
#. de: Gi?
#. fr: Guiii...<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon forth your spriggan stonecarrier. Lives to carry ore, eggs, and you.
#. column 1: Grown to a prodigious size by virtue of its appetite, this spriggan was choking on a chunk of ore when it was found and saved by a band of miners. Seeking to repay the kindness of men, it took to carrying their burdens, which apparently includes men themselves.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:206:0:2"
msgid "It must be so tiring living<br>each day carrying around<br>a brain of solid stone.<br>   - Da Za"
msgstr "Наверное, тяжело каждый день<br>таскать на себе<br>каменную башку.<br>   — Да За"

#. ja: フォーギヴン・レティセンスに騎乗する。<br>世にも珍しい温厚な罪喰い。寡黙に主を運び続ける
#. de: Rufe deine Geläuterte Sprachlosigkeit herbei. Sie ist nicht gerade redselig, also erwarte keine angeregten Unterhaltungen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Réticence pardonnée, l'un des rares purgateurs apprivoisés de ce monde. Il doit son nom à sa mine évasive.
#. column 1: Alerted to its presence in the basement of Eulmore, the hunters of Clan Nutsy set out to vanquish this sin eater. Upon seeing that the creature was not aggressive, however, they decided to keep it instead.
#. column 2: Pray excuse our reticence.<br>   - Lucia
msgctxt "MountTransient:207:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your forgiven reticence. The strong and silent type, so don't expect rousing conversation."
msgstr "Призовите прощённую сдержанность. Она молчалива и немногословна, так что разговоров не ждите."

#. ja: ユールモアの地下室にて発見された罪喰い。騒ぎを聞きつけたナッツクランのモブハンターたちが討伐するために訪れたが、抵抗のそぶりさえ見せず、従属してしまった。そのため、騎乗獣として使われることになったという
#. de: Die Jäger des Clans Kupo spürten diesen Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger in den Kellergewölben von Eulmore auf und wollten ihn zunächst erschlagen, doch als sie merkten, dass er friedlich ist, verschonten sie ihn.
#. fr: Ce purgateur a été découvert dans les sous-sols d'Eulmore. Ce sont des chasseurs du clan Kupo qui réussirent à capturer ce fauve, sans qu'il ne montre aucun signe de résistance. S'il accepte d'être utilisé comme monture, il garde un air désapprobateur et réticent qui lui vaut son nom.
#. column 0: Summon forth your forgiven reticence. The strong and silent type, so don't expect rousing conversation.
#. column 2: Pray excuse our reticence.<br>   - Lucia
msgctxt "MountTransient:207:0:1"
msgid "Alerted to its presence in the basement of Eulmore, the hunters of Clan Nutsy set out to vanquish this sin eater. Upon seeing that the creature was not aggressive, however, they decided to keep it instead."
msgstr "Услышав, что в подвале Юлмора объявился пожиратель грехов, охотники клана Нацци отправились его уничтожить. Но выяснилось, что тот совсем не агрессивен, и охотники решили оставить его себе."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Vergib uns unsere Sprachlosigkeit.<br><i>Lucia</i>
#. fr: <nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your forgiven reticence. The strong and silent type, so don't expect rousing conversation.
#. column 1: Alerted to its presence in the basement of Eulmore, the hunters of Clan Nutsy set out to vanquish this sin eater. Upon seeing that the creature was not aggressive, however, they decided to keep it instead.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:207:0:2"
msgid "Pray excuse our reticence.<br>   - Lucia"
msgstr "Молитвенно просим простить наше молчание.<br>   — Люсия"

#. ja: ダルメルに騎乗する。<br>アバラシア雲海の浮島に棲息する百獣綱の草食獣
#. de: Rufe deinen Dhalmel herbei. Ein langhalsiger Pflanzenfresser, der im Abalathischen Wolkenmeer beheimatet ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dhalmel, un animal herbivore venu de L'Écume des cieux d'Abalathia.
#. column 1: While attempting to nibble at a tree on a nearby isle, this dhalmel lost its footing and fell. As it plunged towards certain death, the fervent desire to live awakened its latent ability to harness the wind, and thus did it soar to safety. This may or may not have happened, but let's say it did.
#. column 2: You've never <i>seen</i><br>a dhalmel before!?<br>   - Atelloune
msgctxt "MountTransient:208:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your dhalmel, a towering herbivore native to the Sea of Clouds."
msgstr "Призовите дальмеля — огромного травоядного зверя, обитающего в Море облаков."

#. ja: 隣の浮島にある木から葉を食べようとして、足を踏み外したダルメル。だが、落ちゆくなかで死にたくないという強い願いが、秘められた才能を目覚めさせ、風属性のエーテルを操らせ空を舞わせたのである。そういうことにしておこう
#. de: Dieser Dhalmel gierte nach den saftigen Blättern der Nachbarinsel. Als er jedoch seinen langen Hals ausstreckte, verlor er das Gleichgewicht und fiel ins Wolkenmeer ... und lernte zu fliegen. Die Theorie ist umstritten.
#. fr: Les dhalmels se tiennent sur leurs jambes arrière pour atteindre les feuilles sur les îles voisines. Ils voleraient grâce à la peur de tomber dans le vide qui leur offre un pouvoir lié au vent. Une explication qui constitue un certain aveu d'échec de la part des zoologistes.
#. column 0: Summon forth your dhalmel, a towering herbivore native to the Sea of Clouds.
#. column 2: You've never <i>seen</i><br>a dhalmel before!?<br>   - Atelloune
msgctxt "MountTransient:208:0:1"
msgid "While attempting to nibble at a tree on a nearby isle, this dhalmel lost its footing and fell. As it plunged towards certain death, the fervent desire to live awakened its latent ability to harness the wind, and thus did it soar to safety. This may or may not have happened, but let's say it did."
msgstr "Этот дальмель попытался пожевать листья на соседнем острове, но оступился и упал. Когда он летел навстречу неминуемой смерти, сильное желание жить пробудило его скрытый талант управлять ветром — и он взмыл в небо. Может, так и было, а может, нет. Но будем считать, что было."

#. ja: ヴェェ～！
#. de: Uaaah! Ein Dhalmel!!!<br><i>Enion</i>
#. fr: Bwéé...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your dhalmel, a towering herbivore native to the Sea of Clouds.
#. column 1: While attempting to nibble at a tree on a nearby isle, this dhalmel lost its footing and fell. As it plunged towards certain death, the fervent desire to live awakened its latent ability to harness the wind, and thus did it soar to safety. This may or may not have happened, but let's say it did.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:208:0:2"
msgid "You've never <i>seen</i><br>a dhalmel before!?<br>   - Atelloune"
msgstr "Ты что, никогда <i>не видел</i><br>дальмеля!?<br>   — Ателун"

#. ja: アルビノカラクールに騎乗する。<br>白い毛並みの黒羊。もはや、それは白羊である
#. de: Rufe dein Albino-Karakul herbei, wegen seiner weißen Farbe das schwarze Schaf unter seinesgleichen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture karakul albinos, un bélier noir à poil blanc. Un bélier blanc, en fait...
#. column 1: Though karakuls ordinarily have black fleece, this creature raised in the paddocks of House Haillenarte was born snowy white. This rarest of qualities spared it a fate at the dining table, and it grew to such a size as to be able to bear people upon its fluffy back.
#. column 2: A wise knight keeps her<br>own source of wool.<br>   - Yaelle
msgctxt "MountTransient:209:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your albino karakul, a black sheep among its kind. Which is to say it's white."
msgstr "Призовите альбиноса-каракуль — чёрную овцу среди сородичей. То есть белую."

#. ja: アインハルト家の所領で飼育されていた羊。黒い毛並みが特徴のカラクール種であるはずだが、白い毛並みを持って生まれてきた。その希少性から、肉にされずに済んだ結果、人を乗せることが可能なほどに成長した
#. de: Dieses Karakul, das auf dem Grundstück der Haillenarte aufgezogen wurde, kam inmitten seiner schwarzen Artgenossen mit weißer Fellfarbe zur Welt. Wegen seines Seltenheitswerts entschied man, es nicht zu schlachten, sondern es stattdessen als Reittier zu verwenden.
#. fr: Ce mouton mâle élevé sur les terres de la maison Haillenarte aurait dû être noir comme tous les autres de la race des karakuls, mais, chose rare et surprenante, il naquit avec un pelage blanc. Cette particularité lui a valu d'être sauvé du boucher, et il est désormais en âge de transporter des humains sur son dos.
#. column 0: Summon forth your albino karakul, a black sheep among its kind. Which is to say it's white.
#. column 2: A wise knight keeps her<br>own source of wool.<br>   - Yaelle
msgctxt "MountTransient:209:0:1"
msgid "Though karakuls ordinarily have black fleece, this creature raised in the paddocks of House Haillenarte was born snowy white. This rarest of qualities spared it a fate at the dining table, and it grew to such a size as to be able to bear people upon its fluffy back."
msgstr "Обычно у каракулей чёрная шерсть, но этот ягнёнок, рождённый в поместье дома Эйнхарт, оказался белоснежным. Благодаря такой редкости его не пустили на стол, и он вырос настолько, что теперь может возить на пушистой спине людей."

#. ja: メェ～ッ！
#. de: Ich frage mich, wie ein Albino-Karakul schmeckt ...<br><i>Unbekannter Gourmet</i>
#. fr: Bêêêê<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your albino karakul, a black sheep among its kind. Which is to say it's white.
#. column 1: Though karakuls ordinarily have black fleece, this creature raised in the paddocks of House Haillenarte was born snowy white. This rarest of qualities spared it a fate at the dining table, and it grew to such a size as to be able to bear people upon its fluffy back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:209:0:2"
msgid "A wise knight keeps her<br>own source of wool.<br>   - Yaelle"
msgstr "Мудрая рыцарь сама<br>обеспечит себя шерстью.<br>   — Яэль"

#. ja: ウフィティに騎乗する。<br>ディアデム諸島に棲んでいた猿人。かつて乱獲されたことがある
#. de: Rufe Ufiti herbei, eins der letzten überlebenden Affenwesen, die früher zahlreich auf dem Diadem lebten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ufiti, un des gigantopithèques résidant sur les îles du Diadème. Attention, il n'est pas très commode<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Having survived a cull of its kind by bloodthirsty adventurers on its native Diadem, this ufiti mastered the art of riding the winds, that it might set forth on a journey to find a worthy leader. Despite its brawn, it possesses a surprisingly delicate touch─and just as well it does.
#. column 2: The strong are drawn to strength.<br>   - Ywain
msgctxt "MountTransient:211:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your ufiti. May carry you to high ground for your own safety."
msgstr "Призовите уфити. Он, пожалуй, донесёт вас до возвышенности, где будет безопаснее."

#. ja: ディアデム諸島出身の猿人。過去に冒険者たちの手で乱獲されたことがある。強き者に従う習性ゆえか、かつて自分をコテンパンにしたような強き人の家来になろうと、雲海の風に乗る技を会得して旅に出たようだ
#. de: Nachdem blutrünstige Abenteurer seine Artgenossen massakriert hatten, meisterte er die Kunst des Fliegens, um sich auf die Suche nach einem würdigen Anführer zu machen.
#. fr: Ce gigantopithèque résidait sur l'archipel du Diadème. Après avoir survécu à une traque sans relâche menée par des braconniers, il apprit à utiliser les vents éthérés, et partit en direction du continent, à la recherche d'adversaires à sa taille.
#. column 0: Summon forth your ufiti. May carry you to high ground for your own safety.
#. column 2: The strong are drawn to strength.<br>   - Ywain
msgctxt "MountTransient:211:0:1"
msgid "Having survived a cull of its kind by bloodthirsty adventurers on its native Diadem, this ufiti mastered the art of riding the winds, that it might set forth on a journey to find a worthy leader. Despite its brawn, it possesses a surprisingly delicate touch─and just as well it does."
msgstr "Уфити родом с островов Диадемы. Когда-то кровожадные приключенцы истребили многих его сородичей. Этот уфити освоил искусство парить на ветру и отправился искать достойного вожака. Несмотря на силу, он на удивление ловок и бережен — и хорошо, что так."

#. ja: ウホッ！
#. de: Starke werden von Stärke angezogen.<br><i>Ywain</i>
#. fr: Groumpf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your ufiti. May carry you to high ground for your own safety.
#. column 1: Having survived a cull of its kind by bloodthirsty adventurers on its native Diadem, this ufiti mastered the art of riding the winds, that it might set forth on a journey to find a worthy leader. Despite its brawn, it possesses a surprisingly delicate touch─and just as well it does.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:211:0:2"
msgid "The strong are drawn to strength.<br>   - Ywain"
msgstr "Сильных влечёт к сильным.<br>   — Ивейн"

#. ja: ディノニクスに騎乗する。<br>イルサバード大陸南部に棲息する肉食トカゲ。意外と頭が良い
#. de: Rufe deinen Deinonychus herbei. Er ist sehr viel klüger, als er aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture deinonychus, un reptile préhistorique de la région méridionale d'Ilsabard.
#. column 1: Native to the southern regions of Ilsabard, the deinonychus is cousin to the raptors that inhabit the Twelveswood. Possessed of superior intelligence, as seen in its habit of hunting in pairs, the beasts have been employed in warfare since antiquity.
#. column 2: Clever girl...<br>   - Hunter-turned-prey
msgctxt "MountTransient:212:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your deinonychus. Cleverer than the average prehistoric carnivore."
msgstr "Призовите дейнониха — он умнее среднего доисторического хищника."

#. ja: イルサバード大陸南部に棲息する肉食トカゲ。黒衣森などで見かけるラプトルの近縁種でもある。二匹がペアで狩りをすることで知られ、見かけよりも知能が高い。そのため訓練して戦闘用に使役する者や、騎獣として利用する者もいる
#. de: Eine riesige fleischfressende Echse, die im Süden von Ilsabard beheimatet ist und mit dem Raptor aus dem Finsterwald artverwandt ist. Aufgrund seiner Intelligenz, die sich auch im Jagdverhalten äußert (Deinonychus jagen stets zu zweit), wurde er seit alters als Kampftier in Kriegen eingesetzt.
#. fr: Originaire de la région méridionale d'Ilsabard, ce reptile carnivore est un proche cousin du raptor de Sombrelinceul. Il a pour habitude de chasser en duo et se distingue par son in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence supérieure, ce qui lui vaut d'être apprivoisé aussi bien pour le combat ou la monte simple.
#. column 0: Summon forth your deinonychus. Cleverer than the average prehistoric carnivore.
#. column 2: Clever girl...<br>   - Hunter-turned-prey
msgctxt "MountTransient:212:0:1"
msgid "Native to the southern regions of Ilsabard, the deinonychus is cousin to the raptors that inhabit the Twelveswood. Possessed of superior intelligence, as seen in its habit of hunting in pairs, the beasts have been employed in warfare since antiquity."
msgstr "Дейноних обитает в южных краях Илсабарда и приходится роднёй рапторам из Чёрной чащи. Эти звери охотятся парами, что говорит об их недюжинном уме. С древности их использовали в войнах."

#. ja: グルルルルゥ……
#. de: Wer einen Deinonychus jagt, wird schnell zum Gejagten.<br><i>Anonymer Jäger</i>
#. fr: Frrrrrr<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your deinonychus. Cleverer than the average prehistoric carnivore.
#. column 1: Native to the southern regions of Ilsabard, the deinonychus is cousin to the raptors that inhabit the Twelveswood. Possessed of superior intelligence, as seen in its habit of hunting in pairs, the beasts have been employed in warfare since antiquity.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:212:0:2"
msgid "Clever girl...<br>   - Hunter-turned-prey"
msgstr "Умница...<br>   — Охотник, ставший добычей"

#. ja: 労働十四号に騎乗する。<br>帝国軍第IV軍団から鹵獲した古代兵器。ワタシハ、トテモ、ハヤイデス！
#. de: Rufe Automat Nr. 14 herbei. Dieses kampferprobte Konstrukt wurde von der IV. Legion erbeutet.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture bâtisseur n°14, un robot ancien que vous avez arraché à la 4e légion impériale.
#. column 1: During their excavation in the Clockwork City of Goug, the IVth Imperial Legion discovered a host of worker automata, which they repurposed for war. As the name suggests, this particular construct is the fourteenth to undergo such a transformation.
#. column 2: Were you able to find<br>any machina worthy of<br>sssalvaging?<br>   - Eshana
msgctxt "MountTransient:213:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Construct 14. Will dispose of friend and foe alike if so commanded, so be careful what you wish for."
msgstr "Призовите конструкт 14. По приказу он расправится и с другом, и с врагом, так что осторожнее с желаниями."

#. ja: 帝国軍第IV軍団は、機工都市ゴーグの遺構にて「労働型鉄巨人」と呼ばれる古代兵器を発掘。これを改修することで戦力化していた。十四号も、そうした例に含まれる機体であり、外装も帝国式に改められている
#. de: Die IV. Legion der garleischen Armee ließ in der Uhrwerksstadt Gog eine Kampfmaschine entwickeln, die den Transport von Soldaten und Material erleichtern sollte. Der Automat Nr.14 ist eine kampfkraftgesteigerte Weiterentwicklung des ursprünglichen Eisenkonstrukt-Modells.
#. fr: Découvert dans l'ancienne cité de Goug par la 4e légion impériale, ce bâtisseur de fer est passé entre les mains d'ingénieurs garlemaldais qui l'ont réparé et en ont fait une véritable machine de guerre, allant même jusqu'à le repeindre aux couleurs de l'Empire.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Construct 14. Will dispose of friend and foe alike if so commanded, so be careful what you wish for.
#. column 2: Were you able to find<br>any machina worthy of<br>sssalvaging?<br>   - Eshana
msgctxt "MountTransient:213:0:1"
msgid "During their excavation in the Clockwork City of Goug, the IVth Imperial Legion discovered a host of worker automata, which they repurposed for war. As the name suggests, this particular construct is the fourteenth to undergo such a transformation."
msgstr "Во время раскопок в Механическом городе Гог Четвёртый имперский легион обнаружил множество рабочих автоматов и переделал их для войны. Как и следует из названия, этот конструкт — четырнадцатый, прошедший такую переделку."

#. ja: ワタシハ、ハヤイデス！
#. de: Be-schleu-nige auf Hyper-ge-schwindig-keit. Biep.<br><i>Semi-autonomer Automat Nr. 14</i>
#. fr: REGARDEZ COMME JE COURS VITE<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Construct 14. Will dispose of friend and foe alike if so commanded, so be careful what you wish for.
#. column 1: During their excavation in the Clockwork City of Goug, the IVth Imperial Legion discovered a host of worker automata, which they repurposed for war. As the name suggests, this particular construct is the fourteenth to undergo such a transformation.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:213:0:2"
msgid "Were you able to find<br>any machina worthy of<br>sssalvaging?<br>   - Eshana"
msgstr "Удалось найти<br>что-нибудь стоящее<br>из механизмов?<br>   — Эшана"

#. ja: 王孔雀に騎乗する。<br>オサード大陸原産の大型鳥。その飾り羽根は美しい
#. de: Rufe deinen Königspfau herbei, eine Riesenpfauenart, die auf dem Kontinent Othard beheimatet ist. Schlägt er ein Rad, verschlägt es einem die Sprache, so schön ist er.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture paon roi, un gigantesque oiseau indigène d'Othard et au magnifique plumage.
#. column 1: From the Near East to the Far, the peacock has long been esteemed not only for its beauty, but also its penchant for eating harmful vilekin. This particular creature belongs to a breed created by improving a species indigenous to Othard with geomancy.
#. column 2: Don't you be taken in<br>by his peacockin'.<br>   - Rowena
msgctxt "MountTransient:214:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your kingly peacock, an avian embodiment of nobility hailing from Othard."
msgstr "Призовите царственного павлина — воплощение благородства, родом из Отарда."

#. ja: 孔雀は毒虫を捕食する益鳥であり、かつオスは美しい飾り羽根を持つため、近東から東方にかけて古来より珍重されてきた。なかでも、この王孔雀は、オサード大陸原産種を風水術によって品種改良した大型種であるという
#. de: Dieses Prachtexemplar von einem Pfau ist nicht nur schön, sondern auch äußerst nützlich, da er Unge-<br>ziefer in großen Mengen vertilgt. Er soll aus einer auf Othard heimischen Art hervorgegangen sein, deren Eigenschaften durch Geomantie verbessert wurde. Im Nahen wie im Fernen Osten gilt er als der „König der Vögel“.
#. fr: Le paon est un oiseau très prisé par les Orientaux, d'une part pour son régime à base d'insectes venimeux qui assainit les jardins, mais aussi pour ses magnifiques plumes. Cette race imposante est le résultat de croisements successifs de grands paons par les géomanciens d'Othard.
#. column 0: Summon forth your kingly peacock, an avian embodiment of nobility hailing from Othard.
#. column 2: Don't you be taken in<br>by his peacockin'.<br>   - Rowena
msgctxt "MountTransient:214:0:1"
msgid "From the Near East to the Far, the peacock has long been esteemed not only for its beauty, but also its penchant for eating harmful vilekin. This particular creature belongs to a breed created by improving a species indigenous to Othard with geomancy."
msgstr "На Востоке павлинов ценят с давних времён: они не только красивы, но и охотно поедают вредных насекомых. Эта порода выведена из отардского вида с помощью геомантии."

#. ja: イヤーン、イヤーン
#. de: Die Geomantie besitzt viele Anwendungsfelder, eines davon ist die Artenzüchtung.<br><i>Professor der angewandten Geomantie</i>
#. fr: Léon<nbsp>! Léon<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your kingly peacock, an avian embodiment of nobility hailing from Othard.
#. column 1: From the Near East to the Far, the peacock has long been esteemed not only for its beauty, but also its penchant for eating harmful vilekin. This particular creature belongs to a breed created by improving a species indigenous to Othard with geomancy.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:214:0:2"
msgid "Don't you be taken in<br>by his peacockin'.<br>   - Rowena"
msgstr "Не дайте себя<br>обмануть его перьям!<br>   — Ровена"

#. ja: 水蛇様の壺に騎乗する。<br>それは空っぽの壺のはずだった。だが、なぜか詰まっている
#. de: Rufe die Urne der Wasserschlange herbei. Sie fühlt sich schwer an, obwohl du schwören könntest, dass sie bis gerade eben noch ziemlich leer war.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre jarre du Serpent marin. Vous auriez juré que le récipient était vide, mais...
#. column 1: This ancient Ronkan urn was discovered empty save for a peculiar flute, the sound of which caused the vessel to suddenly become thus occupied. “Where did it come from?” the curious may be compelled to inquire, but the wise know better than to question the divine.
#. column 2: The great serpent<br>has spoken!<br>   - Quinfort
msgctxt "MountTransient:215:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Great Vessel of Ronka. Don't mind the contents."
msgstr "Призовите Великий сосуд Ронки. На содержимое не обращайте внимания."

#. ja: それは空っぽの壺のはずだった。だが、その中に入っていたロンカの魔笛を奏でるや、いつの間にか詰まっているのである。何故なのか。そう問われたとて、答えなど出るはずもない。水蛇様とは、そのような存在なのだから
#. de: Eine kleine Ronka-Flöte befand sich in dieser Urne, die sich wie von Zauberhand füllte, wenn man auf der Flöte spielte. Warum? Das weiß niemand, denn die Wege der Wasserschlange sind unergründlich.
#. fr: Les voies du Grand Serpent sont im<shy>pé<shy>né<shy>tra<shy>bles, tout comme cette jarre dans laquelle il a enfermé son esprit éternel. Puisse-t-elle vous porter vers de nouveaux horizons, toujours plus près de la divinité...
#. column 0: Summon forth the Great Vessel of Ronka. Don't mind the contents.
#. column 2: The great serpent<br>has spoken!<br>   - Quinfort
msgctxt "MountTransient:215:0:1"
msgid "This ancient Ronkan urn was discovered empty save for a peculiar flute, the sound of which caused the vessel to suddenly become thus occupied. “Where did it come from?” the curious may be compelled to inquire, but the wise know better than to question the divine."
msgstr "Эту древнюю ронканскую урну нашли пустой — если не считать странной флейты. Стоило заиграть на ней, и сосуд вдруг оказался полон. «Откуда оно взялось?» — спросит любопытный. Мудрый же не станет задавать вопросов богам."

#. ja: キィっ！　キィっ！
#. de: Urne ist gleichzeitig leer und voll wie Herz von Wasserschlange.<br><i>Quinfort</i>
#. fr: Kiiii<nbsp>! Kiiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the Great Vessel of Ronka. Don't mind the contents.
#. column 1: This ancient Ronkan urn was discovered empty save for a peculiar flute, the sound of which caused the vessel to suddenly become thus occupied. “Where did it come from?” the curious may be compelled to inquire, but the wise know better than to question the divine.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:215:0:2"
msgid "The great serpent<br>has spoken!<br>   - Quinfort"
msgstr "Великий змей<br>изрёк свою волю!<br>   — Квинфорт"

#. ja: プテラノドンに騎乗する。<br>古代から姿を変えない有翼の甲鱗綱
#. de: Rufe dein Pteranodon herbei, ein fliegendes Schuppentier, an dem die Evolution spurlos vorbeigegangen zu sein scheint.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ptéranodon, un animal volant qui n'a pas changé depuis la préhistoire.
#. column 1: In the course of feeding upon food scraps discarded at the <i>Bounty</i>, this creature grew so familiar with men as to allow riders upon its back. This goes to show that the way to a prehistoric creature's heart is through its stomach.
#. column 2: With what powerful magicks<br>did they tame this dread fiend?<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:216:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your pteranodon, a winged scalekin that has existed since ancient times."
msgstr "Призовите птеранодона — крылатого ящера, существовавшего ещё в древности."

#. ja: ディアデム諸島にて捕獲された有翼の甲鱗綱。バウンティ号の漂着地から投棄される獣骨や残飯を漁るうちに、いつの間にか人に懐いてしまったらしい。今では、雲海に慣れた冒険者なら、背に乗せることもできるほど
#. de: Dieses Schuppentier, das auf dem Diadem behei-<br>matet ist, schloss Freund<shy>schaft mit dem Piloten der <i>Bounty</i>, der ihm ab und an Essensreste hinwarf. Mittlerweile ist es so zahm, dass es geübte Flug-<br>tierreiter wie dich auf seinem Rücken duldet.
#. fr: Ce reptile volant originaire du Diadème s'est nourri des détritus jetés par les aventuriers à La Bonté. Peu à peu, il s'est laissé apprivoisé par ses derniers et permet maintenant à ceux qu'il apprécie le plus de les laisser monter sur son dos.
#. column 0: Summon forth your pteranodon, a winged scalekin that has existed since ancient times.
#. column 2: With what powerful magicks<br>did they tame this dread fiend?<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:216:0:1"
msgid "In the course of feeding upon food scraps discarded at the <i>Bounty</i>, this creature grew so familiar with men as to allow riders upon its back. This goes to show that the way to a prehistoric creature's heart is through its stomach."
msgstr "Питаясь объедками, которые выбрасывают с <i>«Баунти»</i>, птеранодон так привык к людям, что позволяет им кататься на себе. Вот что значит найти путь к сердцу доисторического зверя через желудок."

#. ja: クエァーッ！
#. de: Freund<shy>schaft geht durch den Magen.<br><i>Pilot der Bounty</i>
#. fr: Kéwaa<nbsp>! Kéwaa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your pteranodon, a winged scalekin that has existed since ancient times.
#. column 1: In the course of feeding upon food scraps discarded at the <i>Bounty</i>, this creature grew so familiar with men as to allow riders upon its back. This goes to show that the way to a prehistoric creature's heart is through its stomach.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:216:0:2"
msgid "With what powerful magicks<br>did they tame this dread fiend?<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca"
msgstr "Какими же чарами<br>укротили эту тварь?<br>   — Нашу Мхакарракка"

#. ja: ルビーグイベルに騎乗する。<br>未知の蛮神の魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Rubin-Gwiber herbei. Dieses Wesen lässt sich mithilfe einer Pfeife rufen, die von der Magie eines unbekannten Primae erfüllt ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre dragon rubis, une créature magique apparue lorsque le cor empli de l'énergie d'un Primordial inconnu a retenti.
#. column 1: Believed to have been absorbed into the Ruby Weapon, this plate-clad being answers the call of a horn imbued with the power of an unknown primal. How the secrets of the horn came to be passed on to its summoner remains a mystery.
#. column 2: A jeweler's daughter must be<br>refined─<i>resplendent</i>. A ruby<br>amongst the riffraff.<br>   - Babawai
msgctxt "MountTransient:217:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your ruby gwiber, a draconic arcane entity."
msgstr "Призовите рубинового гвейбера — драконье магическое создание."

#. ja: ルビーウェポンが吸収したと思しき、未知の蛮神の魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物。甲殻類のような紅色の装甲を有している。この魔笛の知識が、何者によって召喚者に共有されていたのか謎が多い
#. de: Die Pfeife, mit der dieses rötlich schimmernde Schuppentier herbeigerufen werden kann, soll von der Magie jenes Primae erfüllt sein, den die Rubin-Waffe absorbiert haben soll. Wie der Beschwörer in den Besitz der Pfeife kam und wie er Kenntnis über ihre magischen Kräfte erlangte, bleibt ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Ce dragon semble être le fruit de la magie du Primordial inconnu qu'avait absorbé l'Arme Rubis. Sa carapace rouge fait penser à celle des crustacés.
#. column 0: Summon forth your ruby gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 2: A jeweler's daughter must be<br>refined─<i>resplendent</i>. A ruby<br>amongst the riffraff.<br>   - Babawai
msgctxt "MountTransient:217:0:1"
msgid "Believed to have been absorbed into the Ruby Weapon, this plate-clad being answers the call of a horn imbued with the power of an unknown primal. How the secrets of the horn came to be passed on to its summoner remains a mystery."
msgstr "Считается, что это существо в панцире поглотило Рубиновое оружие. Оно откликается на зов рога, наделённого силой неизвестного праймала. Как тайна рога стала известна призвавшему его, остаётся загадкой."

#. ja: ゴシャァー！
#. de: Ich frage mich, ob ein ausgestopfter Rubin-Gwiber immer noch rötlich schimmert.<br><i>Enion</i>
#. fr: Gwoshaaa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your ruby gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 1: Believed to have been absorbed into the Ruby Weapon, this plate-clad being answers the call of a horn imbued with the power of an unknown primal. How the secrets of the horn came to be passed on to its summoner remains a mystery.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:217:0:2"
msgid "A jeweler's daughter must be<br>refined─<i>resplendent</i>. A ruby<br>amongst the riffraff.<br>   - Babawai"
msgstr "Дочь ювелира должна быть<br>утончённой — <i>блистательной</i>.<br>Рубин среди черни.<br>   — Бабавай"

#. ja: ヒボドゥスに騎乗する。<br>トルネドシャークの近縁種。風属性のエーテルを操り飛行する
#. de: Rufe deinen Hybodus herbei. Der nahe Verwandte des Tornadohais kann dank eines hohen Anteils an Luft-Äther fliegen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture hybodus, un cousin des requins-tornade. Il est capable de voler en manipulant l'éther de vent.
#. column 1: A close relative of the tornado shark, this fearsome fish soars the skies by means of an organ that allows it to manipulate wind-aspected aether. The four fins protruding from its head are used to deftly control its course in flight.
#. column 2: What will the morrow bring?<br>Sharks spilling from the sky in a<br>spectacular shower of scales?<br>   - Sisipu
msgctxt "MountTransient:218:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your hybodus to ride the winds and menace the skies."
msgstr "Призовите гибодуса. Он оседлает ветра и станет угрозой небесам."

#. ja: トルネドシャークの近縁種。腹の操魔器官で風属性のエーテルを操ることで飛行し、雲海魚や鳥類を捕食する。頭部に備わる四枚のヒレは、方向転換に用いるためのもので、巧みに風の流れに変化を付けるという
#. de: Der Hybodus ist ein Verwandter des Tornadohais. Er verfügt jedoch über ein magiesensitives Organ, mit dem er Luftäther beeinflussen und dadurch fliegen kann. Er ernährt sich hauptsächlich von Wolken-<br>meerfischen und Vögeln.
#. fr: Ce requin dispose d'un organe spécial lui permettant de manipuler l'éther de vent et se nourrit en général de poissons et d'oiseaux qu'il chasse dans L'Écume des Cieux. Les quatre nageoires sur sa tête lui permettent de facilement changer sa trajectoire dans les airs, ce qui lui offre une agilité sans pareille.
#. column 0: Summon forth your hybodus to ride the winds and menace the skies.
#. column 2: What will the morrow bring?<br>Sharks spilling from the sky in a<br>spectacular shower of scales?<br>   - Sisipu
msgctxt "MountTransient:218:0:1"
msgid "A close relative of the tornado shark, this fearsome fish soars the skies by means of an organ that allows it to manipulate wind-aspected aether. The four fins protruding from its head are used to deftly control its course in flight."
msgstr "Близкий родич торнадо-акулы, этот грозный хищник парит в небесах благодаря органу, позволяющему управлять эфиром ветра. Четыре плавника на голове помогают ему ловко менять направление полёта."

#. ja: ジョ～～ズ！
#. de: Das glaube ich erst, wenn Haie fliegen können!<br><i>Meister Oboro</i>
#. fr: GRAAÔÔÔ<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your hybodus to ride the winds and menace the skies.
#. column 1: A close relative of the tornado shark, this fearsome fish soars the skies by means of an organ that allows it to manipulate wind-aspected aether. The four fins protruding from its head are used to deftly control its course in flight.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:218:0:2"
msgid "What will the morrow bring?<br>Sharks spilling from the sky in a<br>spectacular shower of scales?<br>   - Sisipu"
msgstr "Что принесёт нам завтра?<br>Акулы посыплются с небес<br>чешуйчатым дождём?<br>   — Сисипу"

#. ja: ラムウに騎乗する。<br>エデンによって生成された小結晶に、魔力を注ぐことで生じた魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Ramuh herbei, ein magisches Wesen, das aus einem kleinen Kristall im Herzen von Eden schlüpfte, nachdem er mit magischer Energie übergossen wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez Ramuh, une entité magique née d'un petit cristal d'Éden dans lequel vous avez insufflé de l'énergie.
#. column 1: It is believed that Shiva's summoning in the Empty caused lightning-aspected aether left over from your battle with Ramuh to coalesce. The resultant crystal, when imbued with magic, gives rise to an entity which assumes the form of the Lord of Levin in all of his horse-legged, hulking glory.
#. column 2: Now nature sends thunder<br>and lightning against us!<br>   - Sylphie
msgctxt "MountTransient:219:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Ramuh. No, not that one. The one you fought in the Empty. But not the actual one."
msgstr "Призовите Раму. Нет, не того. Того, с кем вы сражались в Пустоши. Но не настоящего."

#. ja: 疑似神降ろしの副産物として生成された小結晶に、魔力を注ぐことで生じた魔法生物。ラムウ召喚時の残滓である雷属性のエーテルが、シヴァ召喚時に排除された結果、瞬間的に結晶化したのだろう。そのためラムウの似姿を取る
#. de: Der Kristall, aus dem dieses Wesen schlüpfte, entstand als Nebenprodukt einer Primae-Beschwörung. Als Shiva beschworen wurde, wurde Blitz-Äther, der bei der Ramuh-Beschwörung angefallen war und noch in der Luft waberte, blitzartig abgestoßen und kristallisiert.
#. fr: Les restants d'éther de foudre qui restaient après l'évocation du Primordial de la foudre ont pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment été matérialisés en cette créature lorsque vint le tour de Shiva. La taille de ce Ramuh est moins im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nante en raison de la faible quantité d'énergie qui a servi à sa création.
#. column 0: Summon forth Ramuh. No, not that one. The one you fought in the Empty. But not the actual one.
#. column 2: Now nature sends thunder<br>and lightning against us!<br>   - Sylphie
msgctxt "MountTransient:219:0:1"
msgid "It is believed that Shiva's summoning in the Empty caused lightning-aspected aether left over from your battle with Ramuh to coalesce. The resultant crystal, when imbued with magic, gives rise to an entity which assumes the form of the Lord of Levin in all of his horse-legged, hulking glory."
msgstr "Вероятно, когда в Пустоши призвали Шиву, эфир молнии, оставшийся после вашей битвы с Раму, сгустился в кристалл. Если наполнить его магией, появится существо, принявшее облик Повелителя молний во всём его могучем, коненогом великолепии."

#. ja: バチバチバチ…
#. de: Die Meinige findet den flitzenden Blitzenden einfach fabelhaft!<br><i>Sylphe</i>
#. fr: Patabzz<nbsp>! Patabzz<nbsp>! Patabzz<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Ramuh. No, not that one. The one you fought in the Empty. But not the actual one.
#. column 1: It is believed that Shiva's summoning in the Empty caused lightning-aspected aether left over from your battle with Ramuh to coalesce. The resultant crystal, when imbued with magic, gives rise to an entity which assumes the form of the Lord of Levin in all of his horse-legged, hulking glory.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:219:0:2"
msgid "Now nature sends thunder<br>and lightning against us!<br>   - Sylphie"
msgstr "И вот природа обрушивает<br>на нас гром и молнии!<br>   — Сильфи"

#. ja: カーバンクル・ルベライトに騎乗する。<br>ルベライトの神秘を解き明かした魔紋から生まれた騎乗用魔法生物
#. de: Rufe dein Rubellit-Karfunkel herbei, geboren aus einem Äthergramm erfüllt von der Kraft eines Rubellits.
#. fr: Vous appelez Carbuncle rubellite, une entité arcanique née de l'énergie mystérieuse de la pierre précieuse du même nom.
#. column 1: Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large rubellite, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima.
#. column 2: Betrayed by my own<br>Carbuncle yet again...<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:220:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Rubellite Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of rubellite geometry."
msgstr "Призовите рубеллитового карбункула — магическое создание, рождённое тайнами рубеллитовой геометрии."

#. ja: 自称天才巴術士、ウランが創り上げた騎乗型魔法生物。大型カーバンクル「ダイヤ」の育成で培った知識を応用して生成した。大粒のルベライトを心核として利用しているため、巴術士でなくても召喚できる
#. de: Ein magisches Reittier, das von dem selbst<shy>er<shy>nann<shy>ten Hermetikergenie Ulan auf Grundlage ihres bei der Züchtung des Riesenkarfunkels Diama gewonnenen Wissens geschaffen wurde. Dank des mit Rubellit-<br>körnern gefüllten Kerns kann es auch von Nicht-Hermetikern beschworen werden.
#. fr: Grâce à l'expérience acquise en s'occupant de Diamant, son Carbuncle adoré, Ulan a réussi à créer un Carbuncle de taille suffisante pour être chevauché. La rubellite de grande taille dont il provient permet même aux non-arcanistes de l'invoquer.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rubellite Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of rubellite geometry.
#. column 2: Betrayed by my own<br>Carbuncle yet again...<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:220:0:1"
msgid "Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large rubellite, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima."
msgstr "Приключенцы, мечтавшие прокатиться верхом на карбункуле, должны благодарить арканиста Улан. Её исследования Алмаза помогли создать существо, подходящее для верховой езды. Его форму поддерживает крупный рубеллит, поэтому призвать его могут даже те, кто не знаком с арканимией."

#. ja: ニュニューン♪
#. de: Die Erforschung von Karfunkeln ist ein wahrhaft schillerndes Feld!<br><i>Ulan</i>
#. fr: Nyuunyuuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rubellite Carbuncle, an arcane entity given form by the mysteries of rubellite geometry.
#. column 1: Those adventurers who have longed to hop on their Carbuncles' backs can give thanks to the arcanist Ulan, whose research into Diamond Carbuncle provided the necessary cues to create an arcane entity of ridable proportions. As its form is maintained by a large rubellite, it can be summoned even by those unversed in the ways of arcanima.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:220:0:2"
msgid "Betrayed by my own<br>Carbuncle yet again...<br>   - Tataru"
msgstr "Опять мой карбункул<br>меня предал...<br>   — Татару"

#. ja: チョコボキャリッジに騎乗する。<br>チョコボが牽引する一羽立て浮行キャリッジ
#. de: Rufe deine Chocobo-Kutsche herbei und nimm die Zügel endlich selbst in die Hand.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre chococaravane, le moyen de transport le plus approprié pour entendre piailler tout au long du voyage.
#. column 1: A ubiquitous mode of transportation in Eorzea, the chocobo carriage is kept aloft by ceruleum gas-filled bladders. This technology traces its origins to an early Ixali dirigible that crashed in the Twelveswood and was seized by Gridanian authorities.
#. column 2: We get to ride a horsebird<br>carriage? I don't know...<br>It sounds scary.<br>   - Doman Child
msgctxt "MountTransient:222:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your chocobo carriage to ferry your friends around in comfort."
msgstr "Призовите чокобо-повозку, чтобы с комфортом катать друзей."

#. ja: チョコボが牽引する一羽立て浮行キャリッジ。青燐ガスを充填した「浮き袋」によって荷台を浮かせるこの構造が確立したのは、100年ほど昔のこと。黒衣森に墜落したイクサル族の装甲気球を解析した結果なのである
#. de: Der erste Prototyp der heute so bekannten Chocobo-Kutsche wurde vor rund einhundert Jahren gebaut. Die Technologie für die schwebenden, mit Erdseim-Gas gefüllten Ballons stammt erstaunlicherweise von den Ixal, die im Finsterwald bruchgelandet sind.
#. fr: Les réservoirs de gaz au céruleum permettant à ce moyen de locomotion de léviter ont été mis au point il y a plus d'un siècle, grâce à une étude détaillée des ballons renforcés qui avaient permis aux Ixali de s'installer dans la forêt de Sombrelinceul.
#. column 0: Summon forth your chocobo carriage to ferry your friends around in comfort.
#. column 2: We get to ride a horsebird<br>carriage? I don't know...<br>It sounds scary.<br>   - Doman Child
msgctxt "MountTransient:222:0:1"
msgid "A ubiquitous mode of transportation in Eorzea, the chocobo carriage is kept aloft by ceruleum gas-filled bladders. This technology traces its origins to an early Ixali dirigible that crashed in the Twelveswood and was seized by Gridanian authorities."
msgstr "Чокобо-повозка — привычный способ передвижения в Эорзее. Её удерживают в воздухе баллоны с церулеумным газом. Эта технология появилась благодаря дирижаблю иксалов, потерпевшему крушение в Чёрном лесу и захваченному властями Гридании."

#. ja: クエエッ～！
#. de: Kweeeh!
#. fr: Kwééééé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your chocobo carriage to ferry your friends around in comfort.
#. column 1: A ubiquitous mode of transportation in Eorzea, the chocobo carriage is kept aloft by ceruleum gas-filled bladders. This technology traces its origins to an early Ixali dirigible that crashed in the Twelveswood and was seized by Gridanian authorities.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:222:0:2"
msgid "We get to ride a horsebird<br>carriage? I don't know...<br>It sounds scary.<br>   - Doman Child"
msgstr "Нас будут катать в повозке<br>на птице-лошади? Не знаю...<br>Как-то страшновато.<br>   — Доманский ребёнок"

#. ja: ドワーフ戦車に騎乗する。<br>ワッツハンマー・ガレージが開発した装輪戦車
#. de: Rufe deinen Zwergenpanzer herbei, der ganze Stolz der Zwerge der Watts-Werkstatt für Hammerprojekte.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous un automatank, un véhicule de livraison mis au point par le Garage Watts.
#. column 1: Based on a concept by the legendary Watts, this dwarven warmachina is propelled by a nine-cylinder radial ethanol engine. Its turret-mounted crystal cannon makes short work of sin eaters, while its arms can perform essential motions such as upending tankards.
#. column 2: The Rollin' Tankards,<br>at your service!<br>   - Ronitt
msgctxt "MountTransient:223:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Rolling Tankard, a mighty warmachina built by the blacksmiths of Watts's Anvil."
msgstr "Призовите «Катящуюся кружку» — могучую боевую машину, созданную кузнецами Наковальни Уоттса."

#. ja: 伝説の鍛冶師「ワッツ」の構想メモを、ワッツハンマー・ガレージの一同が最新技術によって完成させた装輪戦車。主機は、ドワーヴンエタノール式9気筒星型エンジン。対罪喰い旋回魔装砲と、メカニカルアームを装備する
#. de: Dieses Gefährt basiert auf einem Entwurf des legendären Schmieds Watts und ist mit einem neunzylindrigen Zwergenspritsternmotor, Eisenarmen und einem rotierbaren Dämonen-<br>geschütz ausgestattet.
#. fr: Ce char a été conçu par les Nains du Garage Watts à partir d'un croquis légué par le forgeron légendaire Watts. Véritable bijou de mécanique, il embarque un moteur à neuf cylindres en étoile alimenté au nano-éthanol, un canon magique antipurgateurs ainsi qu'une paire de bras mécaniques.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rolling Tankard, a mighty warmachina built by the blacksmiths of Watts's Anvil.
#. column 2: The Rollin' Tankards,<br>at your service!<br>   - Ronitt
msgctxt "MountTransient:223:0:1"
msgid "Based on a concept by the legendary Watts, this dwarven warmachina is propelled by a nine-cylinder radial ethanol engine. Its turret-mounted crystal cannon makes short work of sin eaters, while its arms can perform essential motions such as upending tankards."
msgstr "Эта гномья боевая машина создана по замыслу легендарного кузнеца Уоттса. Её приводит в движение девятицилиндровый звездообразный двигатель на этаноле. Башенная кристальная пушка расправляется с пожирателями грехов, а механические руки способны на важные дела — например, опрокинуть кружку."

#. ja: ドワワワワワ…
#. de: Dank des Zwergenpanzers ist die Welt ein kleines Stück sicherer geworden.<br><i>Lorathia</i>
#. fr: Brrrom... Brrromelebom...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rolling Tankard, a mighty warmachina built by the blacksmiths of Watts's Anvil.
#. column 1: Based on a concept by the legendary Watts, this dwarven warmachina is propelled by a nine-cylinder radial ethanol engine. Its turret-mounted crystal cannon makes short work of sin eaters, while its arms can perform essential motions such as upending tankards.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:223:0:2"
msgid "The Rollin' Tankards,<br>at your service!<br>   - Ronitt"
msgstr "«Катящиеся кружки»<br>к вашим услугам!<br>   — Ронит"

#. ja: ガブリエルαに騎乗する。<br>新型飛行型魔導アーマー「ガブリエル」の縮小実験機
#. de: Rufe deinen Gabriel α. Etwas klein, aber dafür umso schneller. Gut festhalten!
#. fr: Vous appelez Gabriel α, un modèle réduit d'une armure volante magitek.
#. column 1: Prior to building a full-sized prototype of a new transforming armor dubbed <i>Gabriel</i>, project engineers created this scale test model to perform aerodynamic testing. While it passed said tests with flying colors, it was observed that its engine may be prone to running hot.
#. column 2: It would seem there<br>is more to you than<br>meets the eye.<br>   - Yugiri
msgctxt "MountTransient:224:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Gabriel α. Magic shield not included. Armaments for decorative purposes only."
msgstr "Призовите Габриэля α. Магический щит не прилагается. Оружие — только для украшения."

#. ja: 新型飛行型魔導アーマー「ガブリエル」の開発にあたって製造された縮小実験機。どうやら技術陣は、フルスケールの試作機を建造する前に、この機体を用いて空力特性の検証を行っていたようだ
#. de: Ein experimenteller Prototyp der späteren Magitek-Flugrüstung Gabriel. Die kleinere Form diente wohl zur Optimierung der Aerodynamik.
#. fr: Réplique exacte de l'armure volante magitek Gabriel, ce modèle réduit a été développé en parallèle par les ingénieurs res<shy>pon<shy>sa<shy>bles du projet pour effectuer des tests en plein air.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Gabriel α. Magic shield not included. Armaments for decorative purposes only.
#. column 2: It would seem there<br>is more to you than<br>meets the eye.<br>   - Yugiri
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:224:0:1"
msgid "Prior to building a full-sized prototype of a new transforming armor dubbed <i>Gabriel</i>, project engineers created this scale test model to perform aerodynamic testing. While it passed said tests with flying colors, it was observed that its engine may be prone to running hot."
msgstr "Прежде чем построить полноразмерный прототип трансформирующейся брони под названием <i>«Габриэль»</i>, инженеры проекта создали эту уменьшенную модель для аэродинамических испытаний. Она показала себя блестяще, хотя, по наблюдениям, двигатель склонен перегреваться."

#. ja: キィーーーン！
#. de: Bieeeeeep.
#. fr: Piiiiiiii<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Gabriel α. Magic shield not included. Armaments for decorative purposes only.
#. column 1: Prior to building a full-sized prototype of a new transforming armor dubbed <i>Gabriel</i>, project engineers created this scale test model to perform aerodynamic testing. While it passed said tests with flying colors, it was observed that its engine may be prone to running hot.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:224:0:2"
msgid "It would seem there<br>is more to you than<br>meets the eye.<br>   - Yugiri"
msgstr "Похоже, в тебе<br>есть нечто большее,<br>чем кажется на первый взгляд.<br>   — Югири"

#. ja: メガロトラグスに騎乗する。<br>シミターを思わせる湾曲した角が特徴的な草食動物
#. de: Rufe deinen Megalotragus herbei. Gib Acht, dass du dich beim Reiten nicht an seinen riesigen Hörnern stößt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mégalotragus, un herbivore aux cornes dont la forme rappelle celle d'un cimeterre.
#. column 1: Preferring colder climes, this imposing herbivore left its original habitat in Abalathia's Spine and migrated to Coerthas, which had frozen over in the Calamity's wake. Its kind are a primitive species that has largely remained unchanged over time, with some known to awaken to magical powers.
#. column 2: If you squint just the right<br>way, it looks like it's got<br>ears! Or is it horns...?<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:225:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your megalotragus, a herbivore so intimidating it puts carnivores to shame."
msgstr "Призовите мегалотрагуса — травоядное животное, которое внушает страх даже хищникам."

#. ja: シミターを思わせる湾曲した角が特徴的な草食動物。本来は、北アバラシア山脈の山中を生息域とするが、霊災後に寒冷化したクルザスに定着した。原始的な古代種であり、稀に魔法的資質に目覚める個体もいるようだ
#. de: Mit Hörnern wie Krummschwerter stammt der Megalotragus aus den Bergen von Abalathias Rückgrat. Erst nach der Katastrophe fanden sie im erkalteten Coerthas eine neue Heimat. Eine derart alte Spezies ist außerdem selbst<shy>verständ<shy>lich von magischem Naturell.
#. fr: Originaires des montagnes septentrionales d'Abalathia, ces créatures primitives ont été contraintes à migrer et à s'installer dans le Coerthas après le Fléau. Selon certaines sources, un petit nombre d'entre elles serait capable d'user de la magie.
#. column 0: Summon forth your megalotragus, a herbivore so intimidating it puts carnivores to shame.
#. column 2: If you squint just the right<br>way, it looks like it's got<br>ears! Or is it horns...?<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:225:0:1"
msgid "Preferring colder climes, this imposing herbivore left its original habitat in Abalathia's Spine and migrated to Coerthas, which had frozen over in the Calamity's wake. Its kind are a primitive species that has largely remained unchanged over time, with some known to awaken to magical powers."
msgstr "Этот внушительный травоядный предпочитает холодный климат. После Бедствия его родные места в Хребте Абалатии сменились промёрзшим Коэртасом. Это первобытный вид, почти не изменившийся с течением времени, хотя некоторые особи пробуждают в себе магические способности."

#. ja: ブル、ブルルル…
#. de: Brrrrh<nbsp>...
#. fr: Brrrblgh... BRRRRRBFGRFH<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your megalotragus, a herbivore so intimidating it puts carnivores to shame.
#. column 1: Preferring colder climes, this imposing herbivore left its original habitat in Abalathia's Spine and migrated to Coerthas, which had frozen over in the Calamity's wake. Its kind are a primitive species that has largely remained unchanged over time, with some known to awaken to magical powers.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:225:0:2"
msgid "If you squint just the right<br>way, it looks like it's got<br>ears! Or is it horns...?<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca"
msgstr "Если хорошенько прищуриться,<br>похоже, у него уши!<br>Или рога?.. <br>   — Нашу Мхакарракка"

#. ja: グイベル・オブ・ライトに騎乗する。<br>英雄のエーテルが充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Gwiber des Lichts herbei. Zum Leben erweckt von Heldenäther ist er nun bereit, dich auf seinem Rücken zu tragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dragon de la Lumière, une créature qui ne peut être appelée que grâce à un sifflet magique imprégné de l'éther des héros.
#. column 1: This light-bathed being answers to the sound of a horn imbued with the power of a hero of eld. In another time and place, perhaps it was the mount of a valiant soul who rose up against evil. Or perhaps not. The truth lies amidst the blinding light.
#. column 2: Such radiance, such magnificence.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
msgctxt "MountTransient:226:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your gwiber of light, a draconic arcane entity."
msgstr "Призовите светлого гвейбера — драконье магическое создание."

#. ja: 英雄のエーテルが充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物。いずこかの世界に、かつていた英雄が悪を倒さんと冒険を繰り広げた際に、このような生物を相棒としたことがあったのだろうか。真相は光の中である……
#. de: Heldenäther bringt das Herz dieses mächtigen Gwibers zum Schlagen. Vielleicht gab es einst einen strahlenden Helden, der auf dem Rücken dieser magischen Kreatur ritt, um das Böse zu finden und niederzustrecken<nbsp>...
#. fr: On raconte que ce dragon était autrefois le compagnon fidèle d'un héros qui a triomphé du mal à la suite d'une grande aventure dans un autre monde, mais seule la Lumière elle-même détient la vérité à ce sujet.
#. column 0: Summon forth your gwiber of light, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 2: Such radiance, such magnificence.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
msgctxt "MountTransient:226:0:1"
msgid "This light-bathed being answers to the sound of a horn imbued with the power of a hero of eld. In another time and place, perhaps it was the mount of a valiant soul who rose up against evil. Or perhaps not. The truth lies amidst the blinding light."
msgstr "Это залитое светом существо откликается на зов рога, наполненного силой древнего героя. В другом времени и месте оно, возможно, служило верным скакуном храбреца, восставшего против зла. А может, и нет. Истина скрыта в ослепительном свете."

#. ja: キュイッ～！
#. de: Grooooh!
#. fr: Graaaah<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your gwiber of light, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 1: This light-bathed being answers to the sound of a horn imbued with the power of a hero of eld. In another time and place, perhaps it was the mount of a valiant soul who rose up against evil. Or perhaps not. The truth lies amidst the blinding light.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:226:0:2"
msgid "Such radiance, such magnificence.<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel"
msgstr "Какое сияние, какое великолепие!<br>   — Странствующий менестрель"

#. ja: ジバニャンソファに騎乗する。<br>妖怪ジバニャンを模した不思議な椅子
#. de: Rufe dein Jibanyan-Sofa herbei. Ein mysteriöses Sofa, welches dem Yo-kai Jibanyan nachempfunden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre fauteuil Jibanyan, un siège à dossier qui ressemble à s'y méprendre au célèbre Yo-kai félin.
#. column 1: Despite being modeled upon Jibanyan, an Earthbound Yo-kai, this couch is able to fly. It is said to be so comfortable as to turn men and Yo-kai alike into useless layabouts.
#. column 2: Sluggards! Layabouts!<br>Good-for-nothing reprobates!<br>   - Seigetsu the Enlightened
msgctxt "MountTransient:228:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Jibanyan couch. A mysterious piece of furniture designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Jibanyan."
msgstr "Призовите диван Джибаньяна — загадочный предмет мебели в виде ёкая по имени Джибаньян."

#. ja: 妖怪ジバニャンを模した不思議な椅子。モデルは地縛霊だが、なぜか空を飛ぶ。座り心地が抜群で人も妖怪もダメにするらしい
#. de: Dieses Sofa ist dem Yo-kai Jibanyan nachempfunden und kann im Gegensatz zu seiner gestalterischen Vorlage fliegen. Es ist so komfortabel, dass es Helden und Abenteurer jeglicher Art in Sofahelden verwandelt.
#. fr: Nul ne s'explique la capacité de ce fauteuil à voler, mais les humains comme les Yo-kai s'accordent à dire qu'il est ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment douillet, et s'y prélassent à leurs risques et périls.
#. column 0: Summon forth the Jibanyan couch. A mysterious piece of furniture designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Jibanyan.
#. column 2: Sluggards! Layabouts!<br>Good-for-nothing reprobates!<br>   - Seigetsu the Enlightened
msgctxt "MountTransient:228:0:1"
msgid "Despite being modeled upon Jibanyan, an Earthbound Yo-kai, this couch is able to fly. It is said to be so comfortable as to turn men and Yo-kai alike into useless layabouts."
msgstr "Этот диван создан по образу Джибаньяна, ёкая, привязанного к земле, но сам почему-то умеет летать. Говорят, он такой удобный, что и людей, и ёкаев превращает в бездельников."

#. ja: 座ってニャン！
#. de: So gemütlich, nyan!
#. fr: C'est confortable, chat<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the Jibanyan couch. A mysterious piece of furniture designed in the likeness of a Yo-kai named Jibanyan.
#. column 1: Despite being modeled upon Jibanyan, an Earthbound Yo-kai, this couch is able to fly. It is said to be so comfortable as to turn men and Yo-kai alike into useless layabouts.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:228:0:2"
msgid "Sluggards! Layabouts!<br>Good-for-nothing reprobates!<br>   - Seigetsu the Enlightened"
msgstr "Лентяи! Дармоеды!<br>Бесполезные бездельники!<br>   — Сэйгэцу Просветлённый"

#. ja: 魔導キャリアー改に騎乗する。<br>魔導院にて開発された次世代型輸送プラットフォーム
#. de: Rufe deinen Magitek-Transporter NEO herbei, die zweite Generation allagischer Beförderungstechnologie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre transporteur magitek amélioré, un moyen de locomotion nouvelle génération développé à l'académie magitek.
#. column 1: Guided as ever by the ethos of constant advancement, imperial magitek engineers returned to improve their conveyor system, simplifying its assembly and trimming weight by 8%. The result is enhanced fuel efficiency, demonstrating that even world-conquering empires can be environmentally minded.
#. column 2: Hah! Success!<br>   - Aulus mal Asina
msgctxt "MountTransient:229:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek hyperconveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics."
msgstr "Призовите магитековый гиперконвейер — современную версию древней аллаганской транспортной системы."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国の魔導院にて開発された次世代型輸送プラットフォーム。内部構造を見直したことで、メンテナンス性が改善されている。また、約8％の軽量化も達成し、青燐水の燃費も良くなっているらしい
#. de: Es liegt nicht in der garleischen Natur, Gutes bei Gutem zu belassen. Und so haben Magitek-Ingenieure in Doppelschichten daran gearbeitet, den Magitek-Transporter zu verbessern. Er ist nun 8<nbsp>% leichter und verbraucht 14<nbsp>% weniger Erdseim auf 100 Malmen.
#. fr: Entièrement conçu à l'académie magitek de l'empire de Garlemald, cette version améliorée du transporteur personnel est dotée de nouveaux circuits internes, d'un système de maintenance automatique plus rapide et d'une réduction de 8% de sa consommation de céruleum.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek hyperconveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics.
#. column 2: Hah! Success!<br>   - Aulus mal Asina
msgctxt "MountTransient:229:0:1"
msgid "Guided as ever by the ethos of constant advancement, imperial magitek engineers returned to improve their conveyor system, simplifying its assembly and trimming weight by 8%. The result is enhanced fuel efficiency, demonstrating that even world-conquering empires can be environmentally minded."
msgstr "Следуя принципу непрерывного развития, инженеры империи снова взялись за конвейерную систему: упростили сборку и облегчили конструкцию на 8%. Теперь она расходует меньше топлива. Вот так даже империя, покоряющая миры, может заботиться об окружающей среде."

#. ja: すばらしい、すばらしいぞ！
#. de: Wunderbar, einfach wunderbar!<br><i>Entzückter Ingenieur</i>
#. fr: Bzzz<nbsp>! Bzzz<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek hyperconveyor, a modern-day improvement on ancient Allagan logistics.
#. column 1: Guided as ever by the ethos of constant advancement, imperial magitek engineers returned to improve their conveyor system, simplifying its assembly and trimming weight by 8%. The result is enhanced fuel efficiency, demonstrating that even world-conquering empires can be environmentally minded.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:229:0:2"
msgid "Hah! Success!<br>   - Aulus mal Asina"
msgstr "Ха! Успех!<br>   — Аулус мал Асина"

#. ja: エル・トゥに騎乗する。<br>「ものづくり」に目覚めたドラゴン族。その形態は類を見ない
#. de: Rufe Ehll Tou herbei. Niemand bastelt besser als sie, zisch.
#. fr: Vous appelez Ehll Tou, une jeune dragonne qui s'est prise de passion pour l'artisanat des humains.
#. column 1: First encountered as a curious dragonet, Ehll Tou became a dragon grown during her stay in Ishgard. With her passion for crafting, she underwent an evolution heretofore unseen in her kind, developing dextrous forelimbs that allow her to deftly wield all manner of implements.
#. column 2: You have a knack<br>for this, Ehll Tou!<br>   - Hautdilong
msgctxt "MountTransient:230:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Ehll Tou, the young dragon with a passion for crafting."
msgstr "Призовите Элл Ту — юную драконицу, увлечённую ремеслом."

#. ja: 「ものづくり」に目覚めたドラゴン族。当初は、小柄なドラゴネットであったが、やがて「進化」を遂げることに。職人技に最適化するため、道具を操りやすく前肢の形状が変化するなど、その形態は類を見ないものとなっている
#. de: Hilfs<shy>bereit<shy>schaft und Neugier brachte Ehll Tou nach Ishgard. Dort fand sie nicht nur neue Freunde, sondern entdeckte auch ihre einzigartige Gabe des Handwerks. Kein anderer Drache vermag es, Werkzeuge mit derartigem Geschick zu führen.
#. fr: Cette forme évoluée de la dragonnette menue qu'était Ehll Tou à l'origine est nettement plus adaptée aux pratiques artisanales, notamment grâce à des bras musclés qui permettent une précision bien plus grande lors du maniement des outils.
#. column 0: Summon forth Ehll Tou, the young dragon with a passion for crafting.
#. column 2: You have a knack<br>for this, Ehll Tou!<br>   - Hautdilong
msgctxt "MountTransient:230:0:1"
msgid "First encountered as a curious dragonet, Ehll Tou became a dragon grown during her stay in Ishgard. With her passion for crafting, she underwent an evolution heretofore unseen in her kind, developing dextrous forelimbs that allow her to deftly wield all manner of implements."
msgstr "Когда-то Элл Ту была любознательным дракончиком. За время жизни в Ишгарде она выросла и благодаря увлечению ремеслом прошла невиданную для её народа эволюцию. Передние лапы стали ловкими, и теперь она может умело обращаться с самыми разными инструментами."

#. ja: 新しい時代の竜詩でち！
#. de: Die Ode eines neuen Zeitalters!<br><i>Ehll Tou</i>
#. fr: Laissez-vous bercer par le chant de la nouvelle ère de paix<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Ehll Tou, the young dragon with a passion for crafting.
#. column 1: First encountered as a curious dragonet, Ehll Tou became a dragon grown during her stay in Ishgard. With her passion for crafting, she underwent an evolution heretofore unseen in her kind, developing dextrous forelimbs that allow her to deftly wield all manner of implements.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:230:0:2"
msgid "You have a knack<br>for this, Ehll Tou!<br>   - Hautdilong"
msgstr "У тебя отлично<br>получается, Элль Ту!<br>   — Отдилонг"

#. ja: インキタトゥスに騎乗する。<br>ある女商人に祝福された妖馬。人語を解するらしい
#. de: Rufe Incitatus herbei. Ein legendäres Reittier, das von Mähne bis Schweif Edelmut ausdrückt.
#. fr: Vous appelez Incitatus, un destrier légendaire capable de comprendre le langage des humains.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this enchanted steed has led a pampered life. Able to comprehend language, it was often seen attending Khloe Aliapoh's storytelling sessions, her tales of high adventure inspiring it to set out on one of its own.
#. column 2: Your loyal steed awaits!<br>   - Voyce
msgctxt "MountTransient:231:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Incitatus, an enchanted steed favored of the merchant Rowena. If it could talk, it would doubtless drive a hard bargain."
msgstr "Призовите Инцитата — зачарованного скакуна, любимца купчихи Ровены. Умей он говорить, наверняка торговался бы до последнего."

#. ja: 商人「ロウェナ」による祝福を受け、贅沢な暮らしをしてきた妖馬。非常に賢く人語を解するとされ、しばしばクロ・アリアポーの物語に聞き耳を立てていた。いつしか、その冒険譚に魅了され、冒険者の従者となる決意をしたらしい
#. de: Incitatus ist die geheime Leidenschaft der Händlerin Rowena, die dieses ungewöhnlich edelmütige Pferd wie eine Kostbarkeit mit Luxus verwöhnt hat. Incitatus gilt als ein äußerst schlauer und treuer Reisebe-<br>gleiter.
#. fr: Cette licorne vit des jours heureux grâce aux faveurs et à la protection de Rowena. Elle adore en particulier écouter les contes épiques de Khloe Aliapoh, qui la motivent toujours pour accompagner les aventuriers dans leurs quêtes.
#. column 0: Summon forth Incitatus, an enchanted steed favored of the merchant Rowena. If it could talk, it would doubtless drive a hard bargain.
#. column 2: Your loyal steed awaits!<br>   - Voyce
msgctxt "MountTransient:231:0:1"
msgid "Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this enchanted steed has led a pampered life. Able to comprehend language, it was often seen attending Khloe Aliapoh's storytelling sessions, her tales of high adventure inspiring it to set out on one of its own."
msgstr "Этот зачарованный скакун живёт в роскоши под покровительством хозяйки, Ровены. Он понимает человеческую речь и часто слушал рассказы Хлои Алиапо о великих приключениях. Похоже, они так его вдохновили, что он сам решил отправиться в путь."

#. ja: ブヒヒィィン♪
#. de: \<schnaub> \<wieher> ♪
#. fr: Hiiii<nbsp>! Hiiiiiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Incitatus, an enchanted steed favored of the merchant Rowena. If it could talk, it would doubtless drive a hard bargain.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this enchanted steed has led a pampered life. Able to comprehend language, it was often seen attending Khloe Aliapoh's storytelling sessions, her tales of high adventure inspiring it to set out on one of its own.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:231:0:2"
msgid "Your loyal steed awaits!<br>   - Voyce"
msgstr "Верный скакун уже ждёт!<br>   — Войс"

#. ja: スノーマンに騎乗する。<br>星芒祭にて作られた雪だるま。永久氷晶の力で溶けることがない
#. de: Rufe deinen Schneemann herbei. Er ist mit Immerfrost-Kristallen präpariert und wird gewiss nicht unter dir wegschmelzen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture bonhomme de neige, symbole incontournable de la fête des étoiles.
#. column 1: Scholars maintain that the tradition of building snowmen originated in Gyr Abania, where they were used to encourage blessings such as “cold” and “snow.” Considering that the region is almost entirely covered in arid desert, how the snowmen were built in the first place remains a mystery.
#. column 2: Two words:<br>stupendous snowman...<br>   - Adventurer Who Shall Remain Unnamed
msgctxt "MountTransient:232:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a behatted and begloved embodiment of festive cheer."
msgstr "Призовите воплощение праздничного веселья в шапке и варежках."

#. ja: 星芒祭にて作られた雪だるま。ギラバニア地方では「寒さと雪がもたらす恵み」を招くため、初雪を使って雪像を作る風習があった。その文化を星芒祭に取り込み、かつグリダニアに伝わる幻術の知識を応用して作ったのが、この存在である
#. de: Ein für das Sternenlichtfest gebauter Schneemann. Der Brauch, Schneemänner zu bauen, wurde aus Gyr Abania übernommen. Dank gridanischer Druiden-<br>kunst bleibt er stets frisch und frostig.
#. fr: En Gyr Abania, on fabriquait jadis des bonhommes de neige pour inviter le froid, une tradition qui se perpétue encore aujourd'hui lors de la fête des étoiles. Celui-ci est l'œuvre d'élé<shy>men<shy>ta<shy>lis<shy>tes gridaniens, et a la particularité de ne jamais fondre.
#. column 0: Summon forth a behatted and begloved embodiment of festive cheer.
#. column 2: Two words:<br>stupendous snowman...<br>   - Adventurer Who Shall Remain Unnamed
msgctxt "MountTransient:232:0:1"
msgid "Scholars maintain that the tradition of building snowmen originated in Gyr Abania, where they were used to encourage blessings such as “cold” and “snow.” Considering that the region is almost entirely covered in arid desert, how the snowmen were built in the first place remains a mystery."
msgstr "Учёные полагают, что традиция лепить снеговиков зародилась в Гир-Абании. Там их создавали, чтобы привлечь благословения вроде «холода» и «снега». Но поскольку почти весь край покрыт засушливой пустыней, остаётся загадкой, откуда там вообще брали снег."

#. ja: ガクブルガクブル
#. de: Was für ein herzerwärmender Anblick!<br><i>Kleines Helferlein</i>
#. fr: Brrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth a behatted and begloved embodiment of festive cheer.
#. column 1: Scholars maintain that the tradition of building snowmen originated in Gyr Abania, where they were used to encourage blessings such as “cold” and “snow.” Considering that the region is almost entirely covered in arid desert, how the snowmen were built in the first place remains a mystery.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:232:0:2"
msgid "Two words:<br>stupendous snowman...<br>   - Adventurer Who Shall Remain Unnamed"
msgstr "Два слова:<br>изумительный снеговик...<br>   — Безымянный приключенец"

#. ja: ルナホエールに騎乗する。<br>クジラのような形状の魔導仕掛けの船。合計8人が搭乗可能
#. de: Rufe deinen Mondwal herbei, ein walförmiges Magitek-Gefährt, das Platz für 8 Personen bietet.
#. fr: Vous appelez une baleine lunaire, un vaisseau aux allures de cétacé pouvant accueillir jusqu'à huit passagers.
#. column 1: Produced by Garlond Ironworks based on mysterious tales from a distant land, it not only resembles a whale on the outside, but shares its voluminous belly. With enough room for the pilot and seven passengers, it stands─or rather, floats─in a class of its own.
#. column 2: She is risen! The promised<br>Ship of Light─the Lunar Whale!<br>   - A Man Known Simply as “Elder”
msgctxt "MountTransient:233:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Lunar Whale, which is definitely not an actual whale, but certainly large enough to warrant the name. Seats up to eight people, including the pilot."
msgstr "Призовите лунного кита. Это точно не настоящий кит, хотя он и вправду достаточно велик, чтобы носить такое имя. Вмещает до восьми человек вместе с пилотом."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が開発した魔導仕掛けの船。クジラのようにも見える独特の形状は、ミシディア地方に伝わる「伝説の船」を模したものだという。操縦士に加え、7名の客を乗せることができるなど、抜群の運搬能力を誇る
#. de: Ein von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken entwickeltes Magitek-Gefährt, das dem legendären Schiff von Mysidia nachgeformt ist und eine hohe Beför-<br>derungskapazität besitzt.
#. fr: Conçu et assemblé au sein des Forges de Garlond, ce vaisseau en forme de baleine est inspiré d'une vieille légende mysidienne. À l'image de son modèle animal, il est très large et peut transporter jusqu'à huit passagers, dont le pilote.
#. column 0: Summon forth the Lunar Whale, which is definitely not an actual whale, but certainly large enough to warrant the name. Seats up to eight people, including the pilot.
#. column 2: She is risen! The promised<br>Ship of Light─the Lunar Whale!<br>   - A Man Known Simply as “Elder”
msgctxt "MountTransient:233:0:1"
msgid "Produced by Garlond Ironworks based on mysterious tales from a distant land, it not only resembles a whale on the outside, but shares its voluminous belly. With enough room for the pilot and seven passengers, it stands─or rather, floats─in a class of its own."
msgstr "Созданный мастерской Гэрлонда по загадочным преданиям далёкой страны, этот корабль не только снаружи похож на кита, но и обладает таким же вместительным брюхом. Места хватает пилоту и семи пассажирам. Ему нет равных — точнее, он нет равных парит в небесах."

#. ja: りゅうのくちより<br>うまれしもの
#. de: Einfach genial!<br><i>Begeisterter Ingenieur</i>
#. fr: “Née de la gueule de la chimère, portée par les Ténèbres et la Lumière, vers les étoiles elle s'élèvera...”
#. column 0: Summon forth the Lunar Whale, which is definitely not an actual whale, but certainly large enough to warrant the name. Seats up to eight people, including the pilot.
#. column 1: Produced by Garlond Ironworks based on mysterious tales from a distant land, it not only resembles a whale on the outside, but shares its voluminous belly. With enough room for the pilot and seven passengers, it stands─or rather, floats─in a class of its own.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:233:0:2"
msgid "She is risen! The promised<br>Ship of Light─the Lunar Whale!<br>   - A Man Known Simply as “Elder” "
msgstr "Она восстала! Обещанный<br>корабль Света — лунный кит!<br>   — Человек, известный как «Старейшина»"

#. ja: エデンに騎乗する。<br>エデン内部で回収されたクリスタルから生成された存在
#. de: Rufe dein Eden herbei. Auf ihm zu reiten fühlt sich paradiesisch an.
#. fr: Vous appelez Éden, une entité créée à partir d'un cristal provenant du purgateur originel.
#. column 1: The existence of this miniaturized replica can be attributed─as with many, many other things─to a combination of aether and crystal, a fragment of which was discovered inside Eden itself. The result was this smaller likeness, which may be summoned at will and is <i>probably</i> less likely to trigger an apocalyptic catastrophe.
#. column 2: Eden...the first sin eater.<br>   - Gaia
msgctxt "MountTransient:234:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Eden, or rather, a considerably smaller version of the gargantuan entity."
msgstr "Призовите Эдем — точнее, его куда более миниатюрную копию."

#. ja: エデン内部で回収されたクリスタルに、魔力を流し込んだところ生成された存在。エデンそのものに似た外観を有するが、もちろん罪喰いではなく、光の氾濫を発生させる危険もない。一種の使い魔のようなものであろう
#. de: Ein mit Magie gefüllter Kristall, der im Herzen von Eden geborgen wurde. Obwohl er dem Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger Eden äußerlich gleicht, geht von ihm keinerlei Gefahr aus.
#. fr: Née d'un cristal provenant d'Éden auquel on a insufflé de l'éther, cette entité n'a du purgateur originel que son apparence, et ne risque heureusement pas de provoquer un second déluge de Lumière.
#. column 0: Summon forth Eden, or rather, a considerably smaller version of the gargantuan entity.
#. column 2: Eden...the first sin eater.<br>   - Gaia
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:234:0:1"
msgid "The existence of this miniaturized replica can be attributed─as with many, many other things─to a combination of aether and crystal, a fragment of which was discovered inside Eden itself. The result was this smaller likeness, which may be summoned at will and is <i>probably</i> less likely to trigger an apocalyptic catastrophe. "
msgstr "Эта уменьшенная копия появилась благодаря сочетанию эфира и кристалла — его фрагмент нашли внутри самого Эдема. Так возникло его малое подобие, которое можно призвать в любой момент и которое <i>вероятно</i> куда реже вызывает апокалиптические катастрофы."

#. ja: エターナル！
#. de: Eden absorbiert Unmengen an Äther!<br><i>Ryne</i>
#. fr: Otono<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Eden, or rather, a considerably smaller version of the gargantuan entity.
#. column 1: The existence of this miniaturized replica can be attributed─as with many, many other things─to a combination of aether and crystal, a fragment of which was discovered inside Eden itself. The result was this smaller likeness, which may be summoned at will and is <i>probably</i> less likely to trigger an apocalyptic catastrophe.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:234:0:2"
msgid "Eden...the first sin eater.<br>   - Gaia"
msgstr "Эдем... первый пожиратель грехов.<br>   — Гайя"

#. ja: ケルベロスに騎乗する。<br>三つ首を有する魔獣型妖異。アラグ帝国の技術で操られている
#. de: Rufe deinen Cerberus herbei. Doch wundere dich nicht, wenn die Leute etwas gucken.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Cerbère, une créature magique tricéphale, autrefois contrôlée par la technologie de l'empire d'Allag.
#. column 1: In addition to its immense strength and three gaping maws lined with razor-sharp fangs, this voidsent boasts incredible longevity, having lived since the Third Astral Era. The collars, of Allagan design, are believed to make it as tame as a puppy, though it may simply be biding its time before devouring its keeper.
#. column 2: What a nice little doggy!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:235:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Cerberus mount. Be warned, however, that riding into a peaceful village on the back of a gigantic, slavering, three-headed hellhound may cause quite a stir among the locals."
msgstr "Призовите Цербера. Учтите: если въехать верхом на гигантском слюнявом трёхголовом адском псе в тихую деревню, местные могут переполошиться."

#. ja: 第三星暦時代の遺跡に封じられていた三つ首を有する魔獣型妖異。本来は、あまりの獰猛さゆえに高位妖異ですら手懐けることが難しいとされる存在だが、アラグ帝国製の装置によって完全に制御下に置くことができる
#. de: Neben seiner unfassbaren Stärke und seinen drei gefährlichen Mäulern rühmt sich dieser Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te eines erstaunlich langen Lebens: Er stammt aus der Dritten Ära des Lichts. Es heißt, die allagischen Halsbänder halten ihn in Schach, aber vielleicht ist das auch nur ein Trick.
#. fr: Ce canidé monstrueux s'est retrouvé scellé à l'intérieur de ruines datant de la 3e ère astrale. Il faisait preuve d'une telle férocité que même les créatures les plus puissantes peinaient à canaliser sa sauvagerie. Mais grâce au savoir d'Allag, il put enfin être contrôlé.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Cerberus mount. Be warned, however, that riding into a peaceful village on the back of a gigantic, slavering, three-headed hellhound may cause quite a stir among the locals.
#. column 2: What a nice little doggy!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:235:0:1"
msgid "In addition to its immense strength and three gaping maws lined with razor-sharp fangs, this voidsent boasts incredible longevity, having lived since the Third Astral Era. The collars, of Allagan design, are believed to make it as tame as a puppy, though it may simply be biding its time before devouring its keeper."
msgstr "Этот демон поражает не только невероятной силой и тремя пастями, полными острых как бритва клыков, но и долголетием: он живёт ещё с Третьей астральной эры. Считается, что аллаганские ошейники сделали его кротким, как щеночка. А может, он просто ждёт момента, чтобы сожрать хозяина."

#. ja: グルゥ……
#. de: Was für ein niedliches Hündchen!<br><i>Nashu Mhakaracca</i>
#. fr: Grrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Cerberus mount. Be warned, however, that riding into a peaceful village on the back of a gigantic, slavering, three-headed hellhound may cause quite a stir among the locals.
#. column 1: In addition to its immense strength and three gaping maws lined with razor-sharp fangs, this voidsent boasts incredible longevity, having lived since the Third Astral Era. The collars, of Allagan design, are believed to make it as tame as a puppy, though it may simply be biding its time before devouring its keeper.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:235:0:2"
msgid "What a nice little doggy!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca"
msgstr "Какая милая собачка!<br>   — Нашу Мхакарракка"

#. ja: ビッグシェルに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったシェル。あなたの為に今日も運ぶ
#. de: Rufe deine Riesenkrabbe herbei. Sie ist dankbar, am Leben zu sein, und wird dich nicht zwicken.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture coquénorme, un crustacé surdimensionné qui se fera un plaisir de vous transporter.
#. column 1: Raised by a Qiqirn culinary connoisseur, this carefree crustacean formed a bond of friendship with its keeper, and in so doing, escaped the cookpot. Though it may not be the most obvious choice for a mount, its smooth, round shell makes it one of the more comfortable.
#. column 2: Big shells are so named for<br>the bigness of their shells,<br>which they wear most bigly.<br>Clever, yes?<br>   - Qiqirn Naturalist
msgctxt "MountTransient:236:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your big shell mount, which is ironically rather small. Still quite big for a crab, though."
msgstr "Призовите большую раковину — хоть она и не такая уж большая. Для краба, впрочем, весьма внушительная."

#. ja: ある欲張りなキキルン族が、ごちそうにする為、餌をたっぷり与えて育てていたところ、愛着が湧いて食べられなくなってしまった。その結果、見事に巨大化したこのシェルは、人の為に働くことを覚えたのである
#. de: Diese riesige Krabbe wurde von einem verfressenen Qiqirn gemästest, der es jedoch am Ende nicht über sein Herz brachte, sie zu schlachten. Aus Dankbarkeit stellt sich die Krabbe seither als Reittier zur Verfügung.
#. fr: Un Qiqirn gourmand avait engraissé ce crabe pour en faire son repas, mais fut pris de remords au moment de le passer à la casserole. Désormais libre, l'imposant crustacé adore rendre service aux humains.
#. column 0: Summon forth your big shell mount, which is ironically rather small. Still quite big for a crab, though.
#. column 2: Big shells are so named for<br>the bigness of their shells,<br>which they wear most bigly.<br>Clever, yes?<br>   - Qiqirn Naturalist
msgctxt "MountTransient:236:0:1"
msgid "Raised by a Qiqirn culinary connoisseur, this carefree crustacean formed a bond of friendship with its keeper, and in so doing, escaped the cookpot. Though it may not be the most obvious choice for a mount, its smooth, round shell makes it one of the more comfortable."
msgstr "Кикирн-гурман вырастил этого беспечного рачка, но так привязался к нему, что не смог отправить в котёл. Раковина у него гладкая и круглая, так что, хоть с виду он и не похож на скакуна, сидеть на нём довольно удобно."

#. ja: 為三
#. de: Krabbe ist fett, aber nett. Soll leben!<br><i>Anonymer Qiqirn</i>
#. fr: J'en pince pour vous.
#. column 0: Summon forth your big shell mount, which is ironically rather small. Still quite big for a crab, though.
#. column 1: Raised by a Qiqirn culinary connoisseur, this carefree crustacean formed a bond of friendship with its keeper, and in so doing, escaped the cookpot. Though it may not be the most obvious choice for a mount, its smooth, round shell makes it one of the more comfortable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:236:0:2"
msgid "Big shells are so named for<br>the bigness of their shells,<br>which they wear most bigly.<br>Clever, yes?<br>   - Qiqirn Naturalist"
msgstr "Большие раковины так зовутся,<br>потому что их раковины большие,<br>и носят они их очень по-большому.<br>Умно, да?<br>   — Кикирн-натуралист"

#. ja: アレイオンに騎乗する。<br>由来不明の魔笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣
#. de: Rufe das legendäre Fabelwesen Areion herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez Arion, un cheval fabuleux invoqué à l'aide d'un mystérieux sifflet.
#. column 1: Legends speak of a majestic and unwaveringly loyal horse who would never fail to deliver its master from peril. Such myths were founded in fact, as the divine steed has descended from the heavens to seek one possessed of a true and virtuous heart, with whom it may right the wrongs of the world.
#. column 2: The speed of the horse<br>is a grace unmatched!<br>   - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:237:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Arion, the heavenly steed of unmatched swiftness."
msgstr "Призовите Ариона — небесного скакуна, которому нет равных в скорости."

#. ja: 由来不明の魔笛により、呼び出される伝説の幻獣。大英雄の愛馬であり、どんな危地からでも、必ず乗り手を生還させたという逸話が残る。太陽の如き魂を持つ者でなければ、決して背に乗せることがないという
#. de: Dieses geflügelte Pferd soll einst einem Helden gehört haben. Es heißt, dass nur wessen Herz so heiß brennt wie die Sonne, auf ihm reiten kann.
#. fr: Selon la légende, ce destrier aurait appartenu à un illustre héros, dont il aurait sauvé la vie à maintes reprises. On dit aussi qu'il ne se laisse chevaucher que par ceux dont l'âme brille aussi intensément que le soleil.
#. column 0: Summon forth Arion, the heavenly steed of unmatched swiftness.
#. column 2: The speed of the horse<br>is a grace unmatched!<br>   - Uma Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:237:0:1"
msgid "Legends speak of a majestic and unwaveringly loyal horse who would never fail to deliver its master from peril. Such myths were founded in fact, as the divine steed has descended from the heavens to seek one possessed of a true and virtuous heart, with whom it may right the wrongs of the world."
msgstr "Легенды рассказывают о величественном и преданном коне, который всегда выручал хозяина из беды. В этих сказаниях есть доля правды: божественный скакун спустился с небес, чтобы найти обладателя чистого и добродетельного сердца и вместе с ним восстановить справедливость в мире."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ein fabelhaftes Pferd.<br><i>Anonymer Pferdezüchter</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth Arion, the heavenly steed of unmatched swiftness.
#. column 1: Legends speak of a majestic and unwaveringly loyal horse who would never fail to deliver its master from peril. Such myths were founded in fact, as the divine steed has descended from the heavens to seek one possessed of a true and virtuous heart, with whom it may right the wrongs of the world.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:237:0:2"
msgid "The speed of the horse<br>is a grace unmatched!<br>   - Uma Bugyo"
msgstr "Скорость коня<br>не знает равных!<br>   — Ума Бугё"

#. ja: エメラルドグイベルに騎乗する。<br>未知の蛮神の魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Smaragd-Gwiber herbei. Dieses Wesen lässt sich mithilfe einer Pfeife rufen, die von der Magie eines unbekannten Primae erfüllt ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre dragon émeraude, une créature magique apparue lorsque le cor empli de l'énergie d'un Primordial inconnu a retenti.
#. column 1: Called forth by a mysterious horn infused with the power of an unknown primal absorbed by the Emerald Weapon. Whether it sees through the glowing orb at the front of its snout or some other means is unclear.
#. column 2: Rubies! Emeralds! Sapphires!<br>Oh, how they sparkle!<br>   - Uin Nee
msgctxt "MountTransient:238:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your emerald gwiber, a draconic arcane entity."
msgstr "Призовите изумрудного гвейбера — драконье магическое создание."

#. ja: エメラルドウェポンが吸収したと思しき、未知の蛮神の魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物。流線型の翠玉色の装甲を有している。この魔笛の知識が、何者によって召喚者に共有されていたのか謎が多い
#. de: Die Pfeife, mit der dieses grünlich schimmernde Schuppentier herbeigerufen werden kann, soll von der Magie jenes Primae erfüllt sein, den die Smaragd-Waffe absorbiert haben soll. Wie der Beschwörer in den Besitz der Pfeife kam und wie er Kenntnis über ihre magischen Kräfte erlangte, bleibt ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Ce dragon semble être le fruit de la magie du Primordial inconnu qu'avait absorbé l'Arme Émeraude. Sa carapace verte possède une forme aérodynamique.
#. column 0: Summon forth your emerald gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 2: Rubies! Emeralds! Sapphires!<br>Oh, how they sparkle!<br>   - Uin Nee
msgctxt "MountTransient:238:0:1"
msgid "Called forth by a mysterious horn infused with the power of an unknown primal absorbed by the Emerald Weapon. Whether it sees through the glowing orb at the front of its snout or some other means is unclear."
msgstr "Его призывают загадочным рогом, пропитанным силой неизвестного праймала, поглощённого Оружием «Изумруд». Непонятно, видит ли он благодаря светящемуся шару на носу или как-то иначе."

#. ja: クシャーッ！
#. de: Ich frage mich, ob ein ausgestopfter Smaragd-Gwiber immer noch grünlich schimmert.<br><i>Enion</i>
#. fr: Kushaaa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your emerald gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 1: Called forth by a mysterious horn infused with the power of an unknown primal absorbed by the Emerald Weapon. Whether it sees through the glowing orb at the front of its snout or some other means is unclear.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:238:0:2"
msgid "Rubies! Emeralds! Sapphires!<br>Oh, how they sparkle!<br>   - Uin Nee"
msgstr "Рубины! Изумруды! Сапфиры!<br>Ах, как они сверкают!<br>   — Уин-Ни"

#. ja: プロトマグナローダーに騎乗する。<br>人工筋肉を採用した新型魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe Proto-Magna Rotula herbei, der Prototyp einer mächtigen Kampfmaschine, die von den Goblins umgebaut wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez à vous votre proto-magna rouleur, un nouveau type d'arme magitek utilisant de la matière organique ar<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>cielle.
#. column 1: Salvaged from the battlegrounds of Gyr Abania and restored by goblins, this devilishly speedy─yet decidedly unwieldy─contraption is said to have a mind of its own. In this case, however, that turn of phrase may have a ring of truth to it...
#. column 2: Gobbieflock does not go<br>looking for trouble!<br>Trouble comes looking<br>for gobbieflock! ...Honest!<br>   - Slowfix Cointoss
msgctxt "MountTransient:239:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a prototype roader, one of the fastest ways to reach your destination while scaring the seven hells out of everyone on the way."
msgstr "Призовите прототип болида — один из самых быстрых способов добраться до места назначения, попутно напугав до смерти всех вокруг."

#. ja: ギラバニアにて回収された帝国製魔導兵器の残骸を、ゴブリン族の技師が修理、改良した試作車両。より速く走る事を求めるあまり、意思を持ち始めたという噂があるが、そうだとしたら、ちょっと怖い気がする
#. de: Aus den Trümmern der garleischen Magitek-Kampfmaschine, die in Gyr Abania geborgen werden konnten, fabrizierten die Goblins ein furcht<shy>ein<shy>flößendes Gefährt. Auf Schnelligkeit programmiert, soll es eines Tages Gefallen an der Raserei gefunden haben. Seither ist es nicht mehr zu bremsen.
#. fr: Ce véhicule expérimental semi-organique a été créé par un ingénieur gobelin à partir d'une carcasse ramassée à Gyr Abania. Il aurait fini par acquérir sa propre volonté, jugeant ses conducteurs trop lents. Une histoire qui ne donne pas envie de s'asseoir à bord...
#. column 0: Summon forth a prototype roader, one of the fastest ways to reach your destination while scaring the seven hells out of everyone on the way.
#. column 2: Gobbieflock does not go<br>looking for trouble!<br>Trouble comes looking<br>for gobbieflock! ...Honest!<br>   - Slowfix Cointoss
msgctxt "MountTransient:239:0:1"
msgid "Salvaged from the battlegrounds of Gyr Abania and restored by goblins, this devilishly speedy─yet decidedly unwieldy─contraption is said to have a mind of its own. In this case, however, that turn of phrase may have a ring of truth to it..."
msgstr "Гоблины нашли на полях сражений Гир-Абании обломки имперской боевой машины и восстановили их. Получившаяся дьявольски быстрая, но весьма неуклюжая штуковина, по слухам, обладает собственным разумом. И, похоже, в данном случае это не просто фигура речи..."

#. ja: ヘイスト！
#. de: Wizzu eiligmachen, muzzu Proto-Magna Rotula nutzen. Pssssss<nbsp>...<br><i>Anonymer Goblin</i>
#. fr: Je lance Hâte<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth a prototype roader, one of the fastest ways to reach your destination while scaring the seven hells out of everyone on the way.
#. column 1: Salvaged from the battlegrounds of Gyr Abania and restored by goblins, this devilishly speedy─yet decidedly unwieldy─contraption is said to have a mind of its own. In this case, however, that turn of phrase may have a ring of truth to it...
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:239:0:2"
msgid "Gobbieflock does not go<br>looking for trouble!<br>Trouble comes looking<br>for gobbieflock! ...Honest!<br>   - Slowfix Cointoss"
msgstr "Гоблинья стая не<br>ищет неприятностей!<br>Неприятности сами идут<br>к гоблиньей стае! Честно!<br>   — Слоуфикс Монетка"

#. ja: チョコロポックルに騎乗する。<br>ビックリするほど大きく成長したコロポックル。ほっとやさしい香りがする
#. de: Rufe deinen Chokorpokkur herbei. Er ist mindestens so groß wie ein Chocobo, riecht aber bedeutend besser.
#. fr: Vous appelez un choco-korpokkur, une imposante créature végétale dégageant un doux parfum de cacao.
#. column 1: This bizarre creature is the result of an enormous korpokkur coming into contact with vast amounts of chocolate. It has since taken to journeying far and wide to deliver sweet treats to anyone who does not immediately flee at the sight of it.
#. column 2: This ambrosial aroma. This<br>couldn't possibly be...chocolate!?<br>   - Carvallain de Gorgagne
msgctxt "MountTransient:240:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth a chocorpokkur, which is... Well, perhaps you had best see it for yourself."
msgstr "Призовите чокорпоккура... Ну, лучше вам самим на него посмотреть."

#. ja: ビックリするほど大きく成長したコロポックル。いろんなマチに、美味しいチョコレートを贈り届けるため、今日も元気に駆け回る。ほっとやさしい、甘い香りを漂わせているため、発見しただけで、うれしい気持ちになれるだろう
#. de: Ein überdimensionaler Korpokkur, der herumhüpft und Schokolade verteilt. Er verströmt einen süßen Schokoladenduft, der ihn bei Groß und Klein beliebt macht.
#. fr: Cet énorme korpokkur voyage de ville en ville d'un pas guilleret pour distribuer de délicieux chocolats à qui en veut. Le doux parfum de cacao qui émane de sa feuille déclenche de nombreux sourires béats sur son passage.
#. column 0: Summon forth a chocorpokkur, which is... Well, perhaps you had best see it for yourself.
#. column 2: This ambrosial aroma. This<br>couldn't possibly be...chocolate!?<br>   - Carvallain de Gorgagne
msgctxt "MountTransient:240:0:1"
msgid "This bizarre creature is the result of an enormous korpokkur coming into contact with vast amounts of chocolate. It has since taken to journeying far and wide to deliver sweet treats to anyone who does not immediately flee at the sight of it."
msgstr "Это странное создание появилось, когда огромный корпоккур объелся шоколада. Теперь он странствует по свету и раздаёт сладости всем, кто не бросается наутёк при первом взгляде на него."

#. ja: ビックリ！
#. de: Wenn nur meine Chocobos so gut riechen würden<nbsp>...<br><i>Anonymer Chocobo-Züchter</i>
#. fr: Cho... co... lat...
#. column 0: Summon forth a chocorpokkur, which is... Well, perhaps you had best see it for yourself.
#. column 1: This bizarre creature is the result of an enormous korpokkur coming into contact with vast amounts of chocolate. It has since taken to journeying far and wide to deliver sweet treats to anyone who does not immediately flee at the sight of it.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:240:0:2"
msgid "This ambrosial aroma. This<br>couldn't possibly be...chocolate!?<br>   - Carvallain de Gorgagne"
msgstr "Какой дивный аромат. Неужели<br>это... шоколад!?<br>   — Карваллен де Горкань"

#. ja: ガブリエルIII号機に騎乗する。<br>「ガブリエル」の縮小実験機用フレームを用いて造られた機体
#. de: Rufe deinen Gabriel III herbei. Erwarte nicht zu viel von dieser „Kampfmaschine“. Die goldene Farbe reflektiert keine Laserstrahlen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Gabriel v3, un modèle d'essai miniature d'une armure volante magitek.
#. column 1: As any experienced adventurer knows, if a previously bested enemy appears again with a new color scheme, it will pose a significantly greater threat than before, or at least, take longer to kill. Luckily, this miniature prototype is on your side, or so you hope.
#. column 2: Such a beautiful golden color!<br>   - Ihase
msgctxt "MountTransient:241:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Gabriel Mark III mount, though you may find this transforming warmachina is less than meets the eye. Claims that its gold paint deflects laser beams are entirely unfounded."
msgstr "Призовите Габриэля III. Эта трансформирующаяся боевая машина может оказаться не столь впечатляющей, как кажется. Слухи о том, что золотая краска отражает лазеры, совершенно беспочвенны."

#. ja: 先行納入された「ガブリエル」の縮小実験機用フレームを用いて、第IV軍団が独自に建造した機体。内部フレームに、乗り手の魔力に反応する素材が使われているために発光するが、その詳しい原理は判明していない
#. de: Jeder erfahrene Abenteurer weiß: Wenn eine besiegte Kreatur in einer anderen Farbe wieder erscheint, ist sie wesentlich stärker. Zum Glück ist dieser Miniaturprototyp auf deiner Seite.
#. fr: Modèle réduit de l'armure volante magitek Gabriel, mis au point par les ingénieurs de la 4e légion. Son fuselage est constitué d'une matière étrange qui reflète l'énergie magique de son pilote.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Gabriel Mark III mount, though you may find this transforming warmachina is less than meets the eye. Claims that its gold paint deflects laser beams are entirely unfounded.
#. column 2: Such a beautiful golden color!<br>   - Ihase
msgctxt "MountTransient:241:0:1"
msgid "As any experienced adventurer knows, if a previously bested enemy appears again with a new color scheme, it will pose a significantly greater threat than before, or at least, take longer to kill. Luckily, this miniature prototype is on your side, or so you hope."
msgstr "Каждый опытный приключенец знает: если побеждённый враг вернулся в новой расцветке, он стал куда опаснее — или, по крайней мере, его теперь дольше убивать. К счастью, этот крошечный прототип на вашей стороне. Наверное."

#. ja: ギュイーーーン！
#. de: Diese wunderbare goldene Farbe! <br><i>Ihase</i>
#. fr: Viooouuum<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Gabriel Mark III mount, though you may find this transforming warmachina is less than meets the eye. Claims that its gold paint deflects laser beams are entirely unfounded.
#. column 1: As any experienced adventurer knows, if a previously bested enemy appears again with a new color scheme, it will pose a significantly greater threat than before, or at least, take longer to kill. Luckily, this miniature prototype is on your side, or so you hope.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:241:0:2"
msgid "Such a beautiful golden color!<br>   - Ihase"
msgstr "Какой прекрасный золотой цвет!<br>   — Ихасэ"

#. ja: アンテロープ・ドゥに騎乗する。<br>俊足で知られる草食動物。雌は青味がかった毛並みを持つ
#. de: Rufe deine Antilopenkuh herbei. Ihr weiches Fell schimmert bläulich.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture antilope biche, un herbivore agile dont le pelage présente des reflets bleutés, typiques de la femelle.
#. column 1: Denizens of grasslands, antelopes once ranged as far as Coerthas before the Calamity buried the region in snow. Though coveted for their meat and milk, the creatures have eluded full domestication owing to their ornery temperament.
#. column 2: Another day on the hunt,<br>and naught but antelope<br>meat to show for it.<br>   - Isarmoix
msgctxt "MountTransient:242:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your antelope doe, a female creature identifiable by the bluish tinge of its fur."
msgstr "Призовите антилопу-самку. Её легко узнать по голубоватому оттенку шерсти."

#. ja: 主に草原地帯に棲息する草食動物。山岳部のクルザス地方においても、第七霊災以前は数多くの個体が暮らしていた。肉や乳を目的として家畜化の試みが繰り返されてきたが、気難しく騎乗訓練には忍耐が必要だという
#. de: Ein Steppentier, das vor der Siebten Katastrophe auch in Coerthas anzutreffen war. Obwohl für ihr Fleisch und ihre Milch sehr begehrt, scheitern alle Versuche, die Antilopenkuh vollständig zu domestizieren an ihrem launischen Gemüt. Wer sie bereiten möchte, braucht Geduld und ein hartes Hinterteil.
#. fr: Cet herbivore vivant prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment dans les steppes était aussi souvent aperçu dans les montagnes du Coerthas jusqu'au septième fléau. Les multiples tentatives de domestication pour sa viande et son lait se sont révélées infructueuses en raison de son caractère farouche.
#. column 0: Summon forth your antelope doe, a female creature identifiable by the bluish tinge of its fur.
#. column 2: Another day on the hunt,<br>and naught but antelope<br>meat to show for it.<br>   - Isarmoix
msgctxt "MountTransient:242:0:1"
msgid "Denizens of grasslands, antelopes once ranged as far as Coerthas before the Calamity buried the region in snow. Though coveted for their meat and milk, the creatures have eluded full domestication owing to their ornery temperament."
msgstr "До Бедствия антилопы обитали даже в Коэртасе, пока снега не погребли этот край. Их мясо и молоко ценят высоко, но из-за скверного нрава приручить их до конца никак не удаётся."

#. ja: ズィク、ズィク！
#. de: Einen ganzen Tag auf der Jagd gewesen und es ist<br>nichts als Antilopen-Fleisch dabei rumgekommen.<br><i>Isarmoix</i>
#. fr: Hiiin<nbsp>! Hiiin<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your antelope doe, a female creature identifiable by the bluish tinge of its fur.
#. column 1: Denizens of grasslands, antelopes once ranged as far as Coerthas before the Calamity buried the region in snow. Though coveted for their meat and milk, the creatures have eluded full domestication owing to their ornery temperament.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:242:0:2"
msgid "Another day on the hunt,<br>and naught but antelope<br>meat to show for it.<br>   - Isarmoix"
msgstr "Целый день охотился,<br>а добыл только<br>антилопье мясо.<br>   — Изармуа"

#. ja: アンテロープ・スタッグに騎乗する。<br>俊足で知られる草食動物。雄は二本の鋭い角を持つ
#. de: Rufe deinen Antilopenbock herbei. Sein gestreiftes Fell und sein Geweih unterscheiden ihn von der Antilopenkuh.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture antilope cerf, un herbivore agile aux cornes acérées, typiques du mâle.
#. column 1: Swift and sure-footed, antelopes have been favored as mounts by the tribes of Abalathia's Spine since ancient times. In recent years, ancient magicks have also made it possible for the creatures to fly so long as the rider has sufficient reserves of aether.
#. column 2: A herd o' young antelope<br>stags has gone berserk.<br>   - Maximiloix
msgctxt "MountTransient:243:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your antelope stag, a male creature identifiable by its horns, striped body, and...impressive size."
msgstr "Призовите антилопу-самца. Его выдаёт полосатая шерсть, пара рогов и... внушительные размеры."

#. ja: 主に草原地帯に棲息する草食動物。俊足で知られるため、古来より、アバラシア山脈の山岳民が騎乗獣として利用してきた。近年、広まりつつある古代魔法の術式によって、乗り手に十分な魔力があれば飛翔させることも可能
#. de: Wegen seiner Schnelligkeit wird der Antilopenbock von den Bergvölkern von Abalathias Rückgrat als Reittier bevorzugt. Uralte Zauber, die gerade eine Renaissance erleben, ermöglichen außerdem seine Nutzung als Flugtier, vorausgesetzt der Reiter verfügt über genügend Äther.
#. fr: Cet herbivore agile vivant prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment dans les steppes est depuis longtemps monté par les tribus montagnardes d'Abalathia. Plus récemment, on raconte que certains cavaliers auraient su le faire voler grâce à un procédé magique complexe.
#. column 0: Summon forth your antelope stag, a male creature identifiable by its horns, striped body, and...impressive size.
#. column 2: A herd o' young antelope<br>stags has gone berserk.<br>   - Maximiloix
msgctxt "MountTransient:243:0:1"
msgid "Swift and sure-footed, antelopes have been favored as mounts by the tribes of Abalathia's Spine since ancient times. In recent years, ancient magicks have also made it possible for the creatures to fly so long as the rider has sufficient reserves of aether."
msgstr "Антилопы быстры и проворны. С давних времён племена Хребта Абалатии используют их как скакунов. Благодаря древним заклинаниям эти животные теперь могут летать, если у всадника достаточно эфира."

#. ja: 押し通る！
#. de: Eine Herde junger Antilopenböcke ist aufgeschreckt und hat panisch die Flucht ergriffen.<br><i>Maximiloix</i>
#. fr: Hohon<nbsp>! Hooon<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your antelope stag, a male creature identifiable by its horns, striped body, and...impressive size.
#. column 1: Swift and sure-footed, antelopes have been favored as mounts by the tribes of Abalathia's Spine since ancient times. In recent years, ancient magicks have also made it possible for the creatures to fly so long as the rider has sufficient reserves of aether.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:243:0:2"
msgid "A herd o' young antelope<br>stags has gone berserk.<br>   - Maximiloix"
msgstr "Стадо молодых антилоп-самцов<br>вышло из-под контроля.<br>   — Максимилуа"

#. ja: レンダーバッフェに騎乗する。<br>鋼鉄の翼を有する伝説の機竜
#. de: Rufe Mechamander herbei, den legendären mechanischen Drachen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Landerwaffe, un dragon mécanique légendaire aux ailes d'acier.
#. column 1: Armed literally to the wings, this mechanical dragon is believed to have been created by the Allagan Empire to combat the creatures whose form it mimics. Magnificent and proud, it allows none upon its back save one whom it deems a true hero.
#. column 2: Wow, you're swifter<br>than a salamander!<br>   - Pixie Flowerkeep
msgctxt "MountTransient:245:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Landerwaffe, magnificent mechanical dragon of legend, and be the envy of all the other kids."
msgstr "Призовите Ландерваффе — великолепного легендарного механического дракона. Пусть все дети вам завидуют!"

#. ja: 鋼鉄の翼を有する伝説の機竜。古代アラグ帝国が、ドラゴン族に対抗するために開発した機械兵器の一種と思われる。美しくも気高い存在であり、主の器たり得る「真の英雄」でなければ、その背に乗せることはない
#. de: Die alten Allager entwickelten dieses Stahlwesen als Waffe gegen die Drachen. Es heißt, dass nur ein wahrer Held auf seinem Rücken geduldet wird.
#. fr: La légende raconte que ce dragon mécanique aurait été conçu par les Allagois pour repousser ses homologues d'écailles et de sang. Seuls les véritables héros seraient capables de le chevaucher et de faire battre ses majestueuses ailes d'acier.
#. column 0: Summon forth Landerwaffe, magnificent mechanical dragon of legend, and be the envy of all the other kids.
#. column 2: Wow, you're swifter<br>than a salamander!<br>   - Pixie Flowerkeep
msgctxt "MountTransient:245:0:1"
msgid "Armed literally to the wings, this mechanical dragon is believed to have been created by the Allagan Empire to combat the creatures whose form it mimics. Magnificent and proud, it allows none upon its back save one whom it deems a true hero."
msgstr "Считается, что эту механическую драконью машину, вооружённую до кончиков стальных крыльев, создала Аллаганская империя для борьбы с теми, кого она изображает. Она величественна и горда, а на спину пускает лишь того, кого сочтёт истинным героем."

#. ja: ずっとはやい！！
#. de: Hut ab vor der Technik der Allager.<br><i>Garlear</i>
#. fr: Grrraaarz... GROARZZZ<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth Landerwaffe, magnificent mechanical dragon of legend, and be the envy of all the other kids.
#. column 1: Armed literally to the wings, this mechanical dragon is believed to have been created by the Allagan Empire to combat the creatures whose form it mimics. Magnificent and proud, it allows none upon its back save one whom it deems a true hero.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:245:0:2"
msgid "Wow, you're swifter<br>than a salamander!<br>   - Pixie Flowerkeep"
msgstr "Вот это скорость!<br>Быстрее саламандры!<br>   — Фея-хранительница цветов"

#. ja: イクリールに騎乗する。<br>「飛空石」の力で浮行するエアバイク。2人乗りが可能
#. de: Rufe Ikril herbei, das richtige Motorrad, um Eindruck zu schinden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Iklil, une moto volante biplace flottant dans les airs grâce au pouvoir de pierres stellaires.
#. column 1: A gift from Fran to the Bozjan Resistance, this craft hovers by the power of skystones, crystals that allow entire masses of land to levitate. Its name is said to be derived from an ancient Ivalician word meaning “crown.”
#. column 2: I'm only here to see how the<br>story unfolds. Any self-respecting<br>leading man would do the same.<br>   - Debonair Sky Pirate
msgctxt "MountTransient:246:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Al-iklil, a stylish hovering craft designed to carry up to two riders. Any more and it may not heed you."
msgstr "Призовите Аль-Иклиль — стильный парящий транспорт для двоих. Если посадить больше пассажиров, он может отказаться вас слушаться."

#. ja: フランが、ボズヤ・レジスタンスに贈る支援物資のひとつとして持ち込んだエアバイク。浮島の浮力の源としても知られるクリスタル、「飛空石」の力で浮行する。なお、その機種名は、古代イヴァリース語で「王冠」を意味するという
#. de: Dieses Flugmotorrad, das neben dem Fahrer Platz für eine weitere Person bietet, war ein Geschenk Frans an die bozianischen Widerstandstruppen. Sein Name bedeutet „Thron“ auf Hoch-Ivalisisch und tatsächlich hat der Beifahrersitz etwas Thronhaftes, was man vom Fahrersitz nicht unbedingt behaupten kann.
#. fr: Cadeau de Fran à la résistance bozjienne, cette moto peut voler dans les airs grâce au pouvoir de pierres stellaires, des minéraux possédant un mystérieux pouvoir de lévitation. Son nom signifierait “couronne” en vieil ivalicien.
#. column 0: Summon forth Al-iklil, a stylish hovering craft designed to carry up to two riders. Any more and it may not heed you.
#. column 2: I'm only here to see how the<br>story unfolds. Any self-respecting<br>leading man would do the same.<br>   - Debonair Sky Pirate
msgctxt "MountTransient:246:0:1"
msgid "A gift from Fran to the Bozjan Resistance, this craft hovers by the power of skystones, crystals that allow entire masses of land to levitate. Its name is said to be derived from an ancient Ivalician word meaning “crown.”"
msgstr "Фран подарила этот аэромотоцикл сопротивлению Божи. Он парит благодаря небесным камням — кристаллам, способным поднимать в воздух целые массивы земли. Говорят, его название происходит от древнего ивалисийского слова «корона»."

#. ja: じたばたすんなコラ！
#. de: Ikril ist der König unter den Motorrädern.<br><i>Motorradliebhaber</i>
#. fr: Vrôôôôô...
#. column 0: Summon forth Al-iklil, a stylish hovering craft designed to carry up to two riders. Any more and it may not heed you.
#. column 1: A gift from Fran to the Bozjan Resistance, this craft hovers by the power of skystones, crystals that allow entire masses of land to levitate. Its name is said to be derived from an ancient Ivalician word meaning “crown.”
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:246:0:2"
msgid "I'm only here to see how the<br>story unfolds. Any self-respecting<br>leading man would do the same.<br>   - Debonair Sky Pirate"
msgstr "Я тут только затем, чтобы<br>посмотреть, чем кончится история.<br>Любой уважающий себя герой<br>поступил бы так же.<br>   — Щеголеватый небесный пират"

#. ja: クルーズチェイサーに騎乗する。<br>青の手が開発した変形兵士。人型から飛空艇型に変形する
#. de: Rufe deinen Chaser herbei und jage deine Feinde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture croiseur-chasseur, une machine de combat transformable construite par la Main indigo.
#. column 1: Created by the genius minds of the Illuminati, this warmachina is capable of assuming bipedal and airship forms to adapt to the changing conditions of battle. Smitten by its design, it is said that a certain warmachina fanatic has a mind to produce a miniature version.
#. column 2: The chase is on!<br>   - Seserukka
msgctxt "MountTransient:247:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Cruise Chaser to cruise along in style as you give chase to your foes."
msgstr "Призовите Крейсер-охотник и стильно преследуйте врагов."

#. ja: 青の手が開発した変形兵士を、騎乗用に調整した機体。人型のガンナー形態から、飛空艇型のシューター形態へとトランスフォームする。その洗練されたフォルムゆえ、ガーロンド社の原型師が模型化を狙っているという噂もある
#. de: Diese von der Indigo-Hand entwickelte zweibeinige Kriegsmaschine verwandelt sich in ein Luftschiff, sobald sie vom Boden abhebt. Ein gewisser Ingenieur der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke soll bereits ein Modell im kleinen Maßstab in Planung haben.
#. fr: Cette machine de combat imaginée par la Main indigo peut se transformer en bipède ou en avion pour s'adapter à la situation. Impressionné par sa conception et ses capacités, un ingénieur des Forges de Garlond aurait pour projet d'en fabriquer un modèle réduit.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Cruise Chaser to cruise along in style as you give chase to your foes.
#. column 2: The chase is on!<br>   - Seserukka
msgctxt "MountTransient:247:0:1"
msgid "Created by the genius minds of the Illuminati, this warmachina is capable of assuming bipedal and airship forms to adapt to the changing conditions of battle. Smitten by its design, it is said that a certain warmachina fanatic has a mind to produce a miniature version."
msgstr "Созданная гениями Иллюминатов боевая машина может принимать человекоподобную форму и превращаться в воздушный корабль, подстраиваясь под ход сражения. Говорят, один большой поклонник боевых машин так ею восхитился, что собирается сделать уменьшенную модель."

#. ja: トランスフォーム！
#. de: Los, hinterher!<br><i>Seserukka</i>
#. fr: Transformation<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Cruise Chaser to cruise along in style as you give chase to your foes.
#. column 1: Created by the genius minds of the Illuminati, this warmachina is capable of assuming bipedal and airship forms to adapt to the changing conditions of battle. Smitten by its design, it is said that a certain warmachina fanatic has a mind to produce a miniature version.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:247:0:2"
msgid "The chase is on!<br>   - Seserukka"
msgstr "Погоня началась!<br>   — Сесерукка"

#. ja: コンストラクト06Sに騎乗する。<br>コボルド族が製造した装甲巨兵。人が搭乗可能なように改良されている
#. de: Rufe dein Konstrukt6S herbei. Ein besteigbarer Stahlkoloss, der von Kobolden erschaffen wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture constructeur 06S, une armure géante construite par les Kobolds.
#. column 1: This flashy golem was constructed by a band of commerce-minded kobolds hoping to establish regular trade with their seafaring neighbors. Coated in Lominsan red, propulsion power is apparently enhanced by as much as thirty percent.
#. column 2: No one'll tell me what the<br>bloody “S” stands for...<br>   - Lieutenant Skaetswys
msgctxt "MountTransient:248:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Construct VI-S. Painted red so it goes faster. Theoretically."
msgstr "Призовите Конструкт VI-S. Красный цвет делает его быстрее. Теоретически."

#. ja: 友好的なコボルド族の一派が、人との通商目的で製造、販売した装甲巨兵。リムサ・ロミンサのナショナルカラーである赤に塗装されているほか、推力が30％増しになっている。ただし、3倍の速さが出るわけではない
#. de: Gebaut von freundlich gesinnten Kobolden verfügt dieses Stahlgefährt über eine dreißig Prozent verbesserte Triebkraft gegenüber seinem Vorgängermodell. Das macht es zwar nicht dreimal schneller, doch der rote Anstrich verleiht ihm ein rassiges Aussehen.
#. fr: Conçue par un clan de Kobolds pacifiques, cette armure géante a été spé<shy>cia<shy>le<shy>ment assemblée pour être vendue aux Limséens, d'où sa finition carmin. Sa force de propulsion est supérieure de trente pour cent à celle des modèles du même type.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Construct VI-S. Painted red so it goes faster. Theoretically.
#. column 2: No one'll tell me what the<br>bloody “S” stands for...<br>   - Lieutenant Skaetswys
msgctxt "MountTransient:248:0:1"
msgid "This flashy golem was constructed by a band of commerce-minded kobolds hoping to establish regular trade with their seafaring neighbors. Coated in Lominsan red, propulsion power is apparently enhanced by as much as thirty percent."
msgstr "Этот яркий голем создан группой торгово настроенных кобольдов, желавших наладить регулярную торговлю с соседями-моряками. Его выкрасили в лимсийский красный, а мощность движителя, как говорят, повысили на целых тридцать процентов."

#. ja: シャーッ！
#. de: Huldigt Titan! Titan ist groß! Titan! Titan! Titan!!!<br><i>Gravur an der Fußsohle des Konstrukts</i>
#. fr: Pschhhh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Construct VI-S. Painted red so it goes faster. Theoretically.
#. column 1: This flashy golem was constructed by a band of commerce-minded kobolds hoping to establish regular trade with their seafaring neighbors. Coated in Lominsan red, propulsion power is apparently enhanced by as much as thirty percent.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:248:0:2"
msgid "No one'll tell me what the<br>bloody “S” stands for...<br>   - Lieutenant Skaetswys"
msgstr "Никто не скажет мне, что<br>значит эта чёртова «S»...<br>   — лейтенант Скейтсвис"

#. ja: ダイヤグイベルに騎乗する。<br>未知の蛮神の魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Diamant-Gwiber herbei. Dieses Wesen lässt sich mithilfe einer Pfeife rufen, die von der Magie eines unbekannten Primae erfüllt ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre dragon diamant, une créature magique apparue lorsque le cor empli de l'énergie d'un Primordial inconnu a retenti.
#. column 1: Believed to have been absorbed into the Diamond Weapon, this plate-clad being answers the call of a horn imbued with the power of an unknown primal, the summoner of whom is believed to have been a member of the Corvosi resistance.
#. column 2: Everyone here is stubborn<br>as a diamond ingot!<br>   - Glagg
msgctxt "MountTransient:249:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your diamond gwiber, a draconic arcane entity."
msgstr "Призовите алмазного гвейбера — драконье магическое создание."

#. ja: ダイヤウェポンが吸収したと思しき、未知の蛮神の魔力が充填された魔笛によって召喚された魔法生物。ウェルリトに残されていたデータによれば、件の蛮神の召喚者は、コルヴォ人の抵抗勢力であったらしい
#. de: Die Pfeife, mit der dieses Schuppentier herbeigerufen werden kann, ist von der Magie jenes Primae erfüllt, den die Diamant-Waffe absorbiert haben soll. Wie der Beschwörer in den Besitz der Pfeife kam und wie er Kenntnis über ihre magischen Kräfte erlangte, bleibt ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Ce dragon semble être le fruit de la magie du Primordial inconnu qu'avait absorbé l'Arme Diamant. D'après des données découvertes à Werlyt, ce Primordial aurait été invoqué par un membre de la résistance de Corvos.
#. column 0: Summon forth your diamond gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 2: Everyone here is stubborn<br>as a diamond ingot!<br>   - Glagg
msgctxt "MountTransient:249:0:1"
msgid "Believed to have been absorbed into the Diamond Weapon, this plate-clad being answers the call of a horn imbued with the power of an unknown primal, the summoner of whom is believed to have been a member of the Corvosi resistance."
msgstr "Считается, что это закованное в броню существо поглотило Оружие «Алмаз». Оно откликается на зов рога, наделённого силой неизвестного праймала, которого, предположительно, призвал участник корвосского сопротивления."

#. ja: グオオーン！
#. de: Ihr seid doch alle dickköpfig wie ein Rohdiamant!<br><i>Glagg</i>
#. fr: Guuuooo<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your diamond gwiber, a draconic arcane entity.
#. column 1: Believed to have been absorbed into the Diamond Weapon, this plate-clad being answers the call of a horn imbued with the power of an unknown primal, the summoner of whom is believed to have been a member of the Corvosi resistance.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:249:0:2"
msgid "Everyone here is stubborn<br>as a diamond ingot!<br>   - Glagg"
msgstr "Все тут упрямые,<br>как алмазные слитки!<br>   — Глагг"

#. ja: ポーラーベアーに騎乗する。<br>北洋からやってきたシロクマ。気は優しくて力持ち
#. de: Rufe deinen Eisbären herbei. Ein kuscheliger Freund mit einer Schwäche für Süßes.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ours polaire, un animal des contrées nordiques aussi doux que puissant.
#. column 1: In search of ice to make frozen treats, the confectioner Nekeke traveled to an isle in the northern seas, where she encountered this hulking creature. A bite of her sweets was all it took for it to follow her back to Eorzea, where it subsequently grew fond of you.
#. column 2: You're never too<br>big for sweets.<br>   - Ancient Saying
msgctxt "MountTransient:250:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your polar bear, a gentle giant with a soft spot for sweets."
msgstr "Призывает полярного медведя — доброго великана, который неравнодушен к сладкому."

#. ja: 北洋からやってきたシロクマ。氷菓の材料を求めて、北洋の島へと向かった菓子職人ネケケが、現地で出会い菓子を食べさせたことで懐いてしまったらしい。紅蓮祭を成功に導くために協力した冒険者のことを気に入ったようだ
#. de: Auf der Suche nach dem perfekten Eis verschlug es die Eiskonditorin Nekeke zu den Nordmeerinseln, wo sie auf einen Eisbären traf und ihm ein paar Süßig-<br>keiten anbot. Seither frisst er ihr aus der Hand. Seine Bewunderung für dich war jedoch noch stärker als seine Liebe für Süßes, weshalb er sich dich als neuen Meister ausgesucht hat.
#. fr: En visite sur une île nordique à la recherche d'ingrédients pour des desserts glacés, la patissière Nekeke a apprivoisé cet ours avec des gâteaux. Il s'est plus tard pris d'affection pour vous suite à vos exploits lors des Feux de la Mort.
#. column 0: Summon forth your polar bear, a gentle giant with a soft spot for sweets.
#. column 2: You're never too<br>big for sweets.<br>   - Ancient Saying
msgctxt "MountTransient:250:0:1"
msgid "In search of ice to make frozen treats, the confectioner Nekeke traveled to an isle in the northern seas, where she encountered this hulking creature. A bite of her sweets was all it took for it to follow her back to Eorzea, where it subsequently grew fond of you."
msgstr "В поисках льда для замороженных лакомств кондитер Некеке отправилась на остров в северных морях и повстречала там этого исполина. Медведю хватило попробовать её сладости, чтобы последовать за ней в Эорзею. Там он и проникся к вам симпатией."

#. ja: グオッ！
#. de: Selbst der Stärkste kann einer süßen Versuchung nicht widerstehen.<br><i>Nekeke</i>
#. fr: Groooar<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your polar bear, a gentle giant with a soft spot for sweets.
#. column 1: In search of ice to make frozen treats, the confectioner Nekeke traveled to an isle in the northern seas, where she encountered this hulking creature. A bite of her sweets was all it took for it to follow her back to Eorzea, where it subsequently grew fond of you.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:250:0:2"
msgid "You're never too<br>big for sweets.<br>   - Ancient Saying"
msgstr "Для сладкого<br>никогда не бываешь<br>слишком большим.<br>   — Старинная поговорка"

#. ja: オオナマキン御輿に騎乗する。<br>ナマズオ族の祖先、オオナマズ様を祀った金箔貼りの浮行式御輿
#. de: Rufe dein Gold-Mikoshi herbei, das von acht feucht<shy>fröhlichen Namazuo getragen wird.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mikoshi doré, un palanquin à la gloire du grand Namazu recouvert de feuilles d'or.
#. column 1: In order to secure enough coin to fund their seven-year festival, the Namazu sought the counsel of Rowena, who spoke thus: if you want to make great profit, sell wares of great worth. And what could be worth more than a gilded mikoshi borne by eight gilded Namazu?
#. column 2: Wasshoi! Wasshoi! What am I doing?<br> I do not know! I do not care! Whee!<br>   - Namazu Spectator
msgctxt "MountTransient:252:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your squad of gilded Namazu to bear you upon a gilded mikoshi─all of which is as gaudy as it sounds."
msgstr "Призывает отряд золотых Намазу, чтобы они несли вас в золочёном микоси. Всё это такое же кричащее, как и звучит."

#. ja: 大鯰大祭を七年間続行するには、莫大な金が必要だ。だが、ロウェナ著『大商人論』が打開策を教えてくれた。大きな儲けを狙うには、大きな価値のある商品を売ればいい。そう、総金箔貼りの御輿と、担ぎ手八人衆なら完璧だ
#. de: Ein vergoldeter Mikoshi zu Ehren der Großen Flosse, dem ehrwürdigen Urahnen der Namazuo. Auf die Idee, mit dem Verkauf teurer Mikoshi das Fest der Großen Flosse zu finanzieren, das ganze sieben Jahre dauert, kamen die Namazuo dank Rowenas Bestseller „Wie man Reichtum anhäuft“.
#. fr: C'est dans “Ma méthode pour s'enrichir” de Rowena que les Namazu ont trouvé comment financer leur frairie pendant sept ans<nbsp>: vendre des produits de valeur pour dégager de grands profits. Pour cela, quoi de mieux qu'un mikoshi couvert de feuilles d'or<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon forth your squad of gilded Namazu to bear you upon a gilded mikoshi─all of which is as gaudy as it sounds.
#. column 2: Wasshoi! Wasshoi! What am I doing?<br> I do not know! I do not care! Whee!<br>   - Namazu Spectator
msgctxt "MountTransient:252:0:1"
msgid "In order to secure enough coin to fund their seven-year festival, the Namazu sought the counsel of Rowena, who spoke thus: if you want to make great profit, sell wares of great worth. And what could be worth more than a gilded mikoshi borne by eight gilded Namazu?"
msgstr "Чтобы собрать достаточно гил на семилетний фестиваль, Намазу обратились за советом к Ровене. Та сказала: хочешь большой прибыли — продавай товары большой ценности. А что может быть ценнее золочёного микоси, которое несут восемь золочёных Намазу?"

#. ja: そいや、せいや♪
#. de: Wasshoi, Wasshoi, Wasshoi ♪<br>Ich weiß zwar nicht, was wir hier machen, aber es macht Spaß!<br><i>Namazuo-Festbesucher</i>
#. fr: Oh hisse<nbsp>! Oh hisse<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon forth your squad of gilded Namazu to bear you upon a gilded mikoshi─all of which is as gaudy as it sounds.
#. column 1: In order to secure enough coin to fund their seven-year festival, the Namazu sought the counsel of Rowena, who spoke thus: if you want to make great profit, sell wares of great worth. And what could be worth more than a gilded mikoshi borne by eight gilded Namazu?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:252:0:2"
msgid "Wasshoi! Wasshoi! What am I doing?<br> I do not know! I do not care! Whee!<br>   - Namazu Spectator"
msgstr "Вассой! Вассой! Что я делаю?<br>Не знаю! Да и неважно! Ура!<br>   — Намазу-зритель"

#. ja: 金蛇様の壺に騎乗する。<br>それはありふれた壺のはずだった。だが、なぜか輝いている
#. de: Rufe deine Urne der goldenen Wasserschlange herbei. Eine ganz gewöhnliche Urne der Wasserschlange, nur dass sie ein mysteriöses goldenes Leuchten von sich gibt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre jarre du Serpent doré. Un récipient tout à fait quelconque à première vue, mais il émet une lueur singulière...
#. column 1: After being stolen from ancient Ronkan ruins, this mystical urn passed through many an illicit hand before coming to be in yours. Blowing into the flute found within caused it to thus burgeon with the divine and take on a golden glow─an auspicious sign if ever there was one.
#. column 2: The great serpent...it speaks!<br>   - Chaqurl Qhotl
msgctxt "MountTransient:253:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the Resplendent Vessel of Ronka. Just like the Great Vessel of Ronka, but really shiny."
msgstr "Призывает сияющий сосуд Ронки. Точь-в-точь как Великий сосуд Ронки, только очень блестящий."

#. ja: ロンカ遺跡から盗掘されたのち、闇市を転々としてきたとされる摩訶不思議な壺。付属する魔笛に息を吹き込むや金色の輝きを放ち、そしていつの間にか、詰まっている。金蛇様の神秘の光を浴びる者には、幸福が訪れるとの噂だ
#. de: Diese Urne aus den Ronka-Ruinen gelangte durch Räuber auf den Schwarzmarkt und hat seither mehrmals ihren Besitzer gewechselt. Bläst man in die dazugehörige Pfeife, strahlt sie ein goldenes Leuchten aus, das Segen spenden soll.
#. fr: Une jarre mystérieuse obtenue par des pillards dans des ruines ronka puis revendue au marché noir. Elle se remplit par magie lorsqu'on souffle dans la flûte qui lui est associée... La lueur qu'elle émet offrirait à son possesseur la bénédiction du Serpent doré.
#. column 0: Summon forth the Resplendent Vessel of Ronka. Just like the Great Vessel of Ronka, but really shiny.
#. column 2: The great serpent...it speaks!<br>   - Chaqurl Qhotl
msgctxt "MountTransient:253:0:1"
msgid "After being stolen from ancient Ronkan ruins, this mystical urn passed through many an illicit hand before coming to be in yours. Blowing into the flute found within caused it to thus burgeon with the divine and take on a golden glow─an auspicious sign if ever there was one."
msgstr "После того как этот загадочный сосуд похитили из древних руин Ронки, он переходил из рук в руки на чёрном рынке, пока не попал к вам. Стоило подуть в найденную внутри флейту, как сосуд наполнился божественной силой и засиял золотом. Добрый знак, что и говорить."

#. ja: キュっキュ～ィ！
#. de: Wasserschlange spricht!<br><i>Chaqurl Qhotl</i>
#. fr: Kuuu ku kiiii<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the Resplendent Vessel of Ronka. Just like the Great Vessel of Ronka, but really shiny.
#. column 1: After being stolen from ancient Ronkan ruins, this mystical urn passed through many an illicit hand before coming to be in yours. Blowing into the flute found within caused it to thus burgeon with the divine and take on a golden glow─an auspicious sign if ever there was one.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:253:0:2"
msgid "The great serpent...it speaks!<br>   - Chaqurl Qhotl"
msgstr "Великий змей... он говорит!<br>   — Чакурл Кхотл"

#. ja: マジックカードに騎乗する。<br>最強の彫金師が手掛けた乗用カード
#. de: Rufe deine magische Karte herbei, geschmiedet vom größten Goldschmied unter der güldenen Sonne Thanalans.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture carte magique, un miracle d'orfèvrerie pour le moins surprenant.
#. column 1: Crafted by Eorzea's foremost goldsmith, Godbert Manderville, this enchanted card is awarded to those who have collected an unprecedented number of Triple Triad cards. May it bear you through endless diamond skies, to dazzling places you never knew, and show you new fantastic points of view.
#. column 2: Fancy a game of cards?<br>   - Iola
msgctxt "MountTransient:254:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your magicked card to take you wonder by wonder, over, sideways, and under."
msgstr "Призывает зачарованную карту, чтобы мчаться с ней по неведомым мирам, над ними, под ними и вокруг."

#. ja: エオルゼア最強の彫金師こと、ゴッドベルト・マンダヴィル氏が手掛けた乗用カード。数多のカードを集め、トリプルトライアドへの真の愛を示した者に贈られる特別な品として造られた。同氏の超絶技巧により、なぜか飛ぶ
#. de: Niemand Geringerer als Godbert Manderville schmiedete diese Karte, um sie einem wahren Triple Triad-Freund als Treuegeschenk zukommen zu lassen. Dass die Karte fliegen kann, ist einerseits verwun-<br>derlich, andererseits angesichts der Genialität seines Schöpfers auch wieder nicht.
#. fr: Œuvre de Godbert Manderville, “l'orfèvre le plus balèze d'Éorzéa”, cette carte-monture n'est offerte qu'aux plus grands col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs de cartes de Triple Triade. Seul Godbert sait par quel miracle elle est capable de s'élever dans les airs.
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked card to take you wonder by wonder, over, sideways, and under.
#. column 2: Fancy a game of cards?<br>   - Iola
msgctxt "MountTransient:254:0:1"
msgid "Crafted by Eorzea's foremost goldsmith, Godbert Manderville, this enchanted card is awarded to those who have collected an unprecedented number of Triple Triad cards. May it bear you through endless diamond skies, to dazzling places you never knew, and show you new fantastic points of view."
msgstr "Эту зачарованную карту создал лучший ювелир Эорзеи Годберт Мандервиль. Её дарят тем, кто собрал невиданное количество карт для тройной триады. Пусть она несёт вас сквозь бескрайние алмазные небеса, к ослепительным местам, которых вы прежде не знали, и открывает вам новые чудесные виды."

#. ja: リボルビング！
#. de: Ein Spielchen gefällig?<br><i>Iola</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked card to take you wonder by wonder, over, sideways, and under.
#. column 1: Crafted by Eorzea's foremost goldsmith, Godbert Manderville, this enchanted card is awarded to those who have collected an unprecedented number of Triple Triad cards. May it bear you through endless diamond skies, to dazzling places you never knew, and show you new fantastic points of view.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:254:0:2"
msgid "Fancy a game of cards?<br>   - Iola"
msgstr "Не сыграть ли в карты?<br>   — Иола"

#. ja: アイル・マンドラゴラに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったマンドラゴラ。無人島産！
#. de: Rufe deine Paradies-Mandragora herbei. Nur im Inselparadies erreichen Mandragoras derart monströse Ausmaße.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mandragore insulaire, un modèle grande taille qu'on ne trouve que dans les îles.
#. column 1: Born into an influential family in the West Mandra Empire, fabled nation of vegetables, this mandragora grew to its prodigious size thanks to fertile soil and abundant sunlight. Alas, its blessed upbringing could also be considered a curse, for it is the fate of such prime produce to go to market.
#. column 2: I'd be much obliged if<br>you could rid the field<br>of some mandragoras.<br>   - Gurcant
msgctxt "MountTransient:255:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island mandragora, a prime piece of island produce."
msgstr "Призывает островную мандрагору — отборный островной урожай."

#. ja: 無人島産のマンドラゴラ。野菜国家「西マンドラ帝国」の名家に生まれ、豊かな土壌と照りつける陽光を存分に享受し、巨大化を果たす。しかし、大きく育った野菜には、出荷という避けられぬ運命が待ち受けていたのだった
#. de: Als Spross des sagen<shy>umwobenen Hauses der Paradies-Mandragoras reifte dieses Exemplar dank bester Wetterbedingungen zu gewaltiger Größe heran. Nun bleibt zu hoffen, dass kein Gemüsehändler das Inselparadies entdeckt und sich einfallen lässt, mit der prächtigen Knolle auf dem Markt ein Vermögen zu verdienen.
#. fr: Originaire du royaume occidental des mandragores, ce spécimen a atteint une taille prodigieuse grâce aux sols fertiles et au climat ensoleillé de la Félicité insulaire. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment pour lui, avec un tel potentiel commercial, il risque d'être découpé en morceaux et mis en vente sur les marchés à tout moment.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island mandragora, a prime piece of island produce.
#. column 2: I'd be much obliged if<br>you could rid the field<br>of some mandragoras.<br>   - Gurcant
msgctxt "MountTransient:255:0:1"
msgid "Born into an influential family in the West Mandra Empire, fabled nation of vegetables, this mandragora grew to its prodigious size thanks to fertile soil and abundant sunlight. Alas, its blessed upbringing could also be considered a curse, for it is the fate of such prime produce to go to market."
msgstr "Эта мандрагора родилась в знатной семье Западной империи Мандра — легендарной страны овощей. Благодаря плодородной почве и щедрому солнцу она вымахала до исполинских размеров. Увы, счастливое детство обернулось проклятием: таким отменным овощам суждено попасть на рынок."

#. ja: 〇□◎◎▲！
#. de: 〇□◎◎▲！
#. fr: 〇□◎◎▲<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island mandragora, a prime piece of island produce.
#. column 1: Born into an influential family in the West Mandra Empire, fabled nation of vegetables, this mandragora grew to its prodigious size thanks to fertile soil and abundant sunlight. Alas, its blessed upbringing could also be considered a curse, for it is the fate of such prime produce to go to market.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:255:0:2"
msgid "I'd be much obliged if<br>you could rid the field<br>of some mandragoras.<br>   - Gurcant"
msgstr "Буду очень признателен,<br>если вы избавите поле<br>от пары мандрагор.<br>   — Гуркант"

#. ja: アイル・オニオンプリンスに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったオニオンプリンス。マンドラゴラの王子！
#. de: Rufe deinen Prinz Paradieszwiebel herbei. Eine Zwiebel, deren Durchmesser ihrem Titel alle Ehre macht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Prince oignon insulaire, dont le gabarit est à la mesure de la noblesse.
#. column 1: Royalty among mandragora, this island-bred Onion Prince knew every comfort growing up. Such a pampered life led to boredom, however, and he took to whiling away the days in mischief. Dismayed by his son's behavior, the king sent him off to squire for a renowned hero, that he might learn something of responsibility and leadership.
#. column 2: By the onion, in my rambling<br>I forgot why I called you over!<br>   - Bloezoeng
msgctxt "MountTransient:256:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island Onion Prince, a vegetable whose colossal size befits his station."
msgstr "Призывает островного Принца-Лука — овоща исполинских размеров, достойных его титула."

#. ja: 自称、無人島産マンドラゴラの王子。温厚な両親のもと何不自由なく育てられたため、刺激に飢え、いたずらを繰り返すように。そんな放蕩息子を見かねた王の判断により、このほど、英雄の従者として出荷された……らしい
#. de: Aller höfischen Erziehung zum Trotz, machte er seinen Eltern als rebellisches Junggemüse das Leben schwer. So schickten sie ihn fort aus dem komfortablen Inselparadies und verboten ihm zurückzukehren, bis er jemanden gefunden hat, von dessen Heldentaten er lernt, was es bedeutet, eine Zwiebel von wahrer Größe zu sein.
#. fr: Le Prince oignon du royaume occidental des mandragores est né avec une cuiller en argent dans la bouche, mais l'ennui s'est vite emparé de son existence. Déconcerté par son com<shy>por<shy>te<shy>ment irrévérencieux, son roi de père l'a mis au service d'<if $gn4>une héroïne<else>un héros</if> pour qu'il apprenne les bonnes manières... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Onion Prince, a vegetable whose colossal size befits his station.
#. column 2: By the onion, in my rambling<br>I forgot why I called you over!<br>   - Bloezoeng
msgctxt "MountTransient:256:0:1"
msgid "Royalty among mandragora, this island-bred Onion Prince knew every comfort growing up. Such a pampered life led to boredom, however, and he took to whiling away the days in mischief. Dismayed by his son's behavior, the king sent him off to squire for a renowned hero, that he might learn something of responsibility and leadership."
msgstr "Этот Принц-Лук с острова — особа королевских кровей. Он рос в роскоши и ни в чём не знал нужды. Но изнеженная жизнь наскучила ему, и он принялся проказничать. Король, не вынеся выходок сына, отправил его в оруженосцы к прославленному герою, чтобы тот научился ответственности и лидерству."

#. ja: ●×▼……！！
#. de: ●×▼……！！
#. fr: ●×▼...<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Onion Prince, a vegetable whose colossal size befits his station.
#. column 1: Royalty among mandragora, this island-bred Onion Prince knew every comfort growing up. Such a pampered life led to boredom, however, and he took to whiling away the days in mischief. Dismayed by his son's behavior, the king sent him off to squire for a renowned hero, that he might learn something of responsibility and leadership.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:256:0:2"
msgid "By the onion, in my rambling<br>I forgot why I called you over!<br>   - Bloezoeng"
msgstr "Клянусь луком, заболтался<br>и забыл, зачем тебя позвал!<br>   — Блёзон"

#. ja: アイル・エッグナイトに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったエッグナイト。マンドラゴラの騎士！
#. de: Rufe deinen Ritter Paradiesaubergine herbei. Der ritterliche Stolz wurde diesem gigantischen Gemüse geradezu ins Beet gelegt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Chevalier aubergine insulaire, un légume géant plein de majesté et de distinction.
#. column 1: Hailing from the selfsame land as the Tomato King, the Eggplant Knight shared a crate with the sovereign when they were shipped out. However, he fell overboard when the vessel encountered rough seas, and drifted for days before being deposited on a desert island. Among other feats, he prides himself on having played a key role in the founding of the West Mandra Empire.
#. column 2: I thought ye were a feral turnip,<br>a murderous eggplant, or summat<br>like that!<br>   - Tiny Trader
msgctxt "MountTransient:257:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island Eggplant Knight, an oversized vegetable embodiment of chivalry."
msgstr "Призывает островного Рыцаря-Баклажана — огромный овощ, воплощение рыцарской доблести."

#. ja: 自称、外来マンドラゴラの騎士。アイル・キングトマトとは同じ産地で生まれ、出荷された仲。しかし、輸送中の商船からこぼれおち、漂流の末に無人島に漂着、野菜国家「西マンドラ帝国」の建国に貢献した……らしい
#. de: Diese stattliche Aubergine schlummerte friedlich neben König Tomate in der Kiste eines Frachtschiffs, als die raue See ihn über Bord kullern ließ. Tagelang trieb er über das Meer, bevor er an den Strand einer einsamen Insel gespült wurde und beschloss, dort ein neues Gemüseimperium zu gründen.
#. fr: Ce Chevalier aubergine partage des origines communes avec le Roi tomate. Alors qu'ils voyageaient ensemble sur un bâteau de mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses, une terrible tempête les fit s'échouer sur une île déserte, et c'est ainsi qu'ils fondèrent le royaume occidental des mandragores... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Eggplant Knight, an oversized vegetable embodiment of chivalry.
#. column 2: I thought ye were a feral turnip,<br>a murderous eggplant, or summat<br>like that!<br>   - Tiny Trader
msgctxt "MountTransient:257:0:1"
msgid "Hailing from the selfsame land as the Tomato King, the Eggplant Knight shared a crate with the sovereign when they were shipped out. However, he fell overboard when the vessel encountered rough seas, and drifted for days before being deposited on a desert island. Among other feats, he prides himself on having played a key role in the founding of the West Mandra Empire."
msgstr "Рыцарь-Баклажан родом из тех же мест, что и Король-Томат. Когда их отправили на продажу, он делил ящик с самим монархом. Но в шторм баклажан выпал за борт, несколько дней дрейфовал и в конце концов оказался на необитаемом острове. Он гордится тем, что сыграл важную роль в основании Западной империи Мандра."

#. ja: ◎◎×△□！！！
#. de: ◎◎×△□！！！
#. fr: ◎◎×△□<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Eggplant Knight, an oversized vegetable embodiment of chivalry.
#. column 1: Hailing from the selfsame land as the Tomato King, the Eggplant Knight shared a crate with the sovereign when they were shipped out. However, he fell overboard when the vessel encountered rough seas, and drifted for days before being deposited on a desert island. Among other feats, he prides himself on having played a key role in the founding of the West Mandra Empire.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:257:0:2"
msgid "I thought ye were a feral turnip,<br>a murderous eggplant, or summat<br>like that!<br>   - Tiny Trader"
msgstr "Я-то думал, ты одичавшая репа,<br>кровожадный баклажан или ещё<br>какая-нибудь такая штука!<br>   — Торговец"

#. ja: アイル・ガーリックスターに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったガーリックスター。マンドラゴラの道化！
#. de: Rufe deinen Sir Paradiesknoblauch herbei, ein wahrlich lustiger Geselle!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Baron ail insulaire, une plante potagère géante par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement facétieuse.
#. column 1: Possessed of a humorous wit, this mandragora encountered the island Tomato King when they were both adrift. During that time, he amused his sovereign with dozens of droll tales, and in recognition for his services, he was appointed the court jester after the founding of the West Mandra Empire.
#. column 2: For one with a name more befitting<br>a jester, you fight with the savagery<br>of a rabid demon.<br>   - Moglin
msgctxt "MountTransient:258:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island Garlic Jester, a mandragora as pungent as it is humorous."
msgstr "Призывает островного Шута-Чеснока — мандрагору, что так же остроумна, как и пахуча."

#. ja: 自称、外来マンドラゴラの道化。アイル・キングトマトが漂流時代に出会い、波間を漂い続ける間の暇つぶしとして、百の小話を披露し続けた。この偉業により、「西マンドラ帝国」建国の後、宮廷道化師に任命された……らしい
#. de: Der selbst ernannte „Spaßvogel der Mandragora“ erreichte angeblich Ruhm und Status als Hofnarr im Gemüseimperium, indem er König Paradiestomate, als dieser auf den Wellen des Ozeans am Herumtreiben war, 100 Kurzgeschichten gegen die Langeweile präsentierte.
#. fr: Le Baron ail rencontra le Roi tomate durant ses années de vagabondage. Les deux légumes passèrent leurs journées à se laisser porter par les vagues, se racontant des anecdotes par centaines<nbsp>; un moment mémorable qui valut au Baron d'être nommé bouffon de la cour après la fondation du royaume occidental des mandragores... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Garlic Jester, a mandragora as pungent as it is humorous.
#. column 2: For one with a name more befitting<br>a jester, you fight with the savagery<br>of a rabid demon.<br>   - Moglin
msgctxt "MountTransient:258:0:1"
msgid "Possessed of a humorous wit, this mandragora encountered the island Tomato King when they were both adrift. During that time, he amused his sovereign with dozens of droll tales, and in recognition for his services, he was appointed the court jester after the founding of the West Mandra Empire."
msgstr "Эта мандрагора славилась острым языком. Во время скитаний она встретила островного Короля-Томата и развлекала его десятками забавных историй. В награду за службу после основания Западной империи Мандра её назначили придворным шутом."

#. ja: ××◎～！！
#. de: ××◎～！！
#. fr: ××◎～<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Garlic Jester, a mandragora as pungent as it is humorous.
#. column 1: Possessed of a humorous wit, this mandragora encountered the island Tomato King when they were both adrift. During that time, he amused his sovereign with dozens of droll tales, and in recognition for his services, he was appointed the court jester after the founding of the West Mandra Empire.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:258:0:2"
msgid "For one with a name more befitting<br>a jester, you fight with the savagery<br>of a rabid demon.<br>   - Moglin"
msgstr "Имя у тебя, конечно, куда<br>больше подошло бы шуту,<br>а дерёшься ты как бешеный демон.<br>   — Моглин"

#. ja: アイル・キングトマトに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったキングトマト。マンドラゴラの王！
#. de: Rufe deinen König Paradiestomate herbei. Kniet nieder vor der gigantischen Macht des Herrschers des Gemüseimperiums!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Roi tomate insulaire, le seul et unique monarque du royaume occidental des mandragores.
#. column 1: Grown in sunny Vylbrand, this king among produce was being shipped to distant lands when his crate was cast overboard in rough seas. He eventually arrived at a desert island, where he triumphed in a war with avaricious avians and won the heart of a local princess, together with whom he established the West Mandra Empire.
#. column 2: I dunno about you, but I ain't<br>so keen on the notion of callin' a<br>bloody tomato <i>Yer Grace</i>.<br>   - Tiny Trader
msgctxt "MountTransient:259:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island Tomato King, a sovereign who rules with a strong and juicy─er, just hand."
msgstr "Призывает островного Короля-Томата — правителя с твёрдой и сочной... э-э, просто твёрдой рукой."

#. ja: 自称、外来マンドラゴラの王。バイルブランド島の生まれだが、出荷後に商船からこぼれおち、漂流の末に無人島に漂着。野鳥との過酷な戦いや、島野菜の姫君との大恋愛を乗り越え、野菜国家「西マンドラ帝国」を建国した……らしい
#. de: Nachdem ein tragisches Unglück dafür sorgte, dass König Tomate nach tagelangem Herumtreiben im Inselparadies strandete, musste er sich nicht nur gegen allerlei Vogelviech behaupten, auch die Liebe seines Lebens war schwer zu ernten. Am Ende seiner Anstrengungen erhob er sich zum Gründer und Herrscher des neuen Gemüseimperiums.
#. fr: Né sur l'île de Vylbrand, le futur Roi tomate tomba du navire marchand qui le destinait à l'exportation. Au terme d'une longue dérive, il échoua sur une île déserte. Il survécut ensuite à moult attaques d'oiseaux ainsi qu'à l'amour dévorant de la fille d'une grosse légume locale, et finit par fonder le royaume occidental des mandragores... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Tomato King, a sovereign who rules with a strong and juicy─er, just hand.
#. column 2: I dunno about you, but I ain't<br>so keen on the notion of callin' a<br>bloody tomato <i>Yer Grace</i>.<br>   - Tiny Trader
msgctxt "MountTransient:259:0:1"
msgid "Grown in sunny Vylbrand, this king among produce was being shipped to distant lands when his crate was cast overboard in rough seas. He eventually arrived at a desert island, where he triumphed in a war with avaricious avians and won the heart of a local princess, together with whom he established the West Mandra Empire."
msgstr "Короля-Томата вырастили на солнечном Вильбранде. Его отправили в дальние края, но в шторм ящик смыло за борт. В конце концов он добрался до необитаемого острова, где победил жадных птиц и покорил сердце местной принцессы. Вместе они основали Западную империю Мандра."

#. ja: ■＄◎×△□◎◎…♪！
#. de: ■＄◎×△□◎◎…♪！
#. fr: ■＄◎×△□◎◎...♪<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Tomato King, a sovereign who rules with a strong and juicy─er, just hand.
#. column 1: Grown in sunny Vylbrand, this king among produce was being shipped to distant lands when his crate was cast overboard in rough seas. He eventually arrived at a desert island, where he triumphed in a war with avaricious avians and won the heart of a local princess, together with whom he established the West Mandra Empire.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:259:0:2"
msgid "I dunno about you, but I ain't<br>so keen on the notion of callin' a<br>bloody tomato <i>Yer Grace</i>.<br>   - Tiny Trader"
msgstr "Не знаю, как ты, а я не очень-то<br>горю желанием называть проклятый<br>помидор <i>вашим величеством</i>.<br>   — Торговец"

#. ja: アイル・マンドラクイーンに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったマンドラクイーン。マンドラゴラの王妃！
#. de: Rufe deine Königin Paradies-Mandragora herbei. Die größte Macht im Gemüsebeet?
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Reine mandragore insulaire, la première dame du royaume occidental des mandragores.
#. column 1: The life of this island-grown princess was forever changed when she met her future husband the island Tomato King, whom the tides had borne to her. Overcoming their difference in origin, they wed and unified the island's vegetables under the banner of the West Mandra Empire.
#. column 2: I fear a diet comprised entirely<br>of one type of root vegetable<br>will not hold up to scrutiny...<br>   - Hinageshi
msgctxt "MountTransient:260:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island Mandragora Queen, a well-cultivated vegetable fit for a king."
msgstr "Призывает островную Королеву Мандрагору — овощ, достойный короля."

#. ja: 自称、無人島産マンドラゴラの王妃。浜辺に漂着した若き日のアイル・キングトマトと運命的な出会いを果たした後、産地の違いを乗り越えて結婚。島野菜たちを支配下に置くことで、野菜国家「西マンドラ帝国」を建国した……らしい
#. de: Nach ihrer schicksalhaften Begegnung mit dem jüngst gestrandeten König Paradiestomate, gibt sie alles, um die Differenzen zwischen ihren Anbaugebieten beizulegen. Ihre Anstrengungen werden schließlich mit der Heirat ihrer großen Liebe und der Errichtung eines neuen Gemüseimperiums belohnt.
#. fr: La Reine mandragore fit la rencontre providentielle du jeune Roi tomate alors que celui-ci dérivait le long de la côte. Ce fut le coup de foudre, et elle décida de l'épouser en dépit de leur différence de terreau d'origine. Ils fondèrent ensuite ensemble le royaume occidental des mandragores, asseyant ainsi leur autorité sur tous les autres légumes de l'île... Paraît-il.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Mandragora Queen, a well-cultivated vegetable fit for a king.
#. column 2: I fear a diet comprised entirely<br>of one type of root vegetable<br>will not hold up to scrutiny...<br>   - Hinageshi
msgctxt "MountTransient:260:0:1"
msgid "The life of this island-grown princess was forever changed when she met her future husband the island Tomato King, whom the tides had borne to her. Overcoming their difference in origin, they wed and unified the island's vegetables under the banner of the West Mandra Empire."
msgstr "Жизнь островной принцессы навсегда изменилась, когда она встретила будущего мужа — островного Короля-Томата, которого прибило к её берегу. Несмотря на разное происхождение, они поженились и объединили островные овощи под знамёнами Западной империи Мандра."

#. ja: ×□♪◎×◎…！
#. de: ×□♪◎×◎…！
#. fr: ×□♪◎×◎...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Mandragora Queen, a well-cultivated vegetable fit for a king.
#. column 1: The life of this island-grown princess was forever changed when she met her future husband the island Tomato King, whom the tides had borne to her. Overcoming their difference in origin, they wed and unified the island's vegetables under the banner of the West Mandra Empire.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:260:0:2"
msgid "I fear a diet comprised entirely<br>of one type of root vegetable<br>will not hold up to scrutiny...<br>   - Hinageshi"
msgstr "Боюсь, если в рационе<br>останется один лишь корнеплод,<br>это вызовет вопросы...<br>   — Хинагэси"

#. ja: エターナルダークネス・リンクスに騎乗する。<br>星極性のエーテルを帯びた幻想生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Umbral-Luchs herbei, ein geflügeltes Fabelwesen erfüllt mit schattenelementarer Energie.
#. fr: Vous appelez un lynx des Ténèbres, un félin débordant d'énergie astrale.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards the astral. Its shadowed wings call to mind the valiance of Zodiark, eldest and mightiest of primals, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in eternal Darkness.
#. column 2: Who are you, the Warrior<br>of bleedin' Darkness!?<br>   - Gallant Guardsman
msgctxt "MountTransient:261:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lynx of eternal darkness, which could be what a certain eldest of all primals might look like as a large, winged feline."
msgstr "Призовите рысь вечной тьмы. Возможно, так выглядел бы один из древнейших праймалов, если бы стал большим крылатым котом."

#. ja: エーテルによって構成された幻想生物の一種であり、強い星極性の力を帯びている。その漆黒の翼は、最古にして最強の蛮神たるゾディアークの雄々しさを連想させるが、この使い魔の来歴は未だに判明していない
#. de: Diese Kreatur ist von schattenelementarer Energie durchdrungen. Seine geflügelte Gestalt ähnelt Zodiark, dem ältesten und mächtigsten aller Primae, doch die Herkunft des Umbral-Luchses ist ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Cette entité fantasmagorique a été créée à partir d'éther regorgeant d'énergie astrale. Ses ailes d'un noir profond font fortement penser à Zordiarche, le plus ancien des Primordiaux, ce qui soulève bien des questions quant à l'origine de cette créature...
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of eternal darkness, which could be what a certain eldest of all primals might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 2: Who are you, the Warrior<br>of bleedin' Darkness!?<br>   - Gallant Guardsman
msgctxt "MountTransient:261:0:1"
msgid "A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards the astral. Its shadowed wings call to mind the valiance of Zodiark, eldest and mightiest of primals, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in eternal Darkness."
msgstr "Это призрачное создание соткано из эфира, наделённого сильной астральной энергией. Его тёмные крылья напоминают о доблести Зодиарка, древнейшего и могущественнейшего из праймалов. Но происхождение этого фамильяра скрыто вечной Тьмой."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Bist du ein Krieger der Dunkelheit?!<br><i>Mutige Stadtwache</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of eternal darkness, which could be what a certain eldest of all primals might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards the astral. Its shadowed wings call to mind the valiance of Zodiark, eldest and mightiest of primals, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in eternal Darkness.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:261:0:2"
msgid "Who are you, the Warrior<br>of bleedin' Darkness!?<br>   - Gallant Guardsman"
msgstr "Ты кто такой, Воин<br>проклятой Тьмы!?<br>   — Отважный стражник"

#. ja: ディヴァインライト・リンクスに騎乗する。<br>霊極性のエーテルを帯びた幻想生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Astral-Luchs herbei, ein geflügeltes Fabelwesen erfüllt mit lichtelementarer Energie.
#. fr: Vous appelez un lynx de la Lumière, un félin débordant d'énergie ombrale.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards the umbral. Its radiant wings call to mind the majesty of Hydaelyn, the will and protector of the star, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in divine Light.
#. column 2: So bold, so majestic─<br>just like a Warrior of Light!<br>   - Humphrey
msgctxt "MountTransient:262:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lynx of divine light, which could be what a certain will of the star might look like as a large, winged feline."
msgstr "Призывает рысь божественного света. Возможно, так выглядела бы некая воля звезды, если бы стала большим крылатым котом."

#. ja: エーテルによって構成された幻想生物の一種であり、強い霊極性の力を帯びている。その純白の翼は、星の意思として世界を守護してきたハイデリンの神々しさを連想させるが、この使い魔の来歴は未だに判明していない
#. de: Diese Kreatur ist von lichtelementarer Energie durchdrungen. Seine geflügelte Gestalt ähnelt Hydaelyn, der Verkörperung des Planeten, doch die Herkunft des Astral-Luchses ist ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Cette entité fantasmagorique a été créée à partir d'éther regorgeant d'énergie ombrale. Ses ailes d'un blanc immaculé font fortement penser à Hydaelyn, la conscience de la planète, ce qui soulève bien des questions quant à l'origine de cette créature...
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of divine light, which could be what a certain will of the star might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 2: So bold, so majestic─<br>just like a Warrior of Light!<br>   - Humphrey
msgctxt "MountTransient:262:0:1"
msgid "A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards the umbral. Its radiant wings call to mind the majesty of Hydaelyn, the will and protector of the star, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in divine Light."
msgstr "Это призрачное создание соткано из эфира, наделённого сильной умбральной энергией. Его сияющие крылья напоминают о величии Хайделин, воле и защитнице звезды. Но происхождение этого фамильяра скрыто божественным Светом."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Diese strahlende, gottgleiche Erscheinung ... muss ein Krieger des Lichts sein!<br><i>Humphrey</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of divine light, which could be what a certain will of the star might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards the umbral. Its radiant wings call to mind the majesty of Hydaelyn, the will and protector of the star, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in divine Light.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:262:0:2"
msgid "So bold, so majestic─<br>just like a Warrior of Light!<br>   - Humphrey"
msgstr "Вот это стать, вот это величие!<br>Прямо как у Воина Света!<br>   — Хамфри"

#. ja: アルゴスに騎乗する。<br>黄金の毛並みを持つ犬のように見える使い魔
#. de: Rufe Argos herbei, Venats treuen Begleiter mit goldenem Fell.
#. fr: Vous appelez Argos, un familier aux allures de chien à poil long et doré.
#. column 1: Created by Venat, this dog-like familiar lends his back only to those who have won his favor─which you already had by the time you first met him in Mare Lamentorum owing to the quirks of time travel.
#. column 2: Gosh, he's a fast doggy!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:263:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Argos, Venat's faithful familiar, to bear you places while you marvel at the softness of his golden coat."
msgstr "Призывает Аргоса, верного фамильяра Венат. Он понесёт вас куда угодно, а вы сможете наслаждаться мягкостью его золотой шерсти."

#. ja: 古代人ヴェーネスが創造した使い魔。初めて出会ったのは、嘆きの海なのだが、時系列的にはエルピスが初対面ということになる。ともかく、その時点で信頼を得ているため、このアルゴスもまた背に乗せてくれるのだ
#. de: Argos wurde von Venat erschaffen und lässt nur jene auf seinen kräftigen Rücken, die sein Vertrauen gewonnen haben. Dir vertraut er seit eurer ersten Begegnung in Mare Lamentorum.
#. fr: Ce familier créé par Venat n'offre son dos qu'à celles et ceux qu'il estime dignes de cette faveur, ce qui est votre cas depuis votre première rencontre à Mare Lamentorum.
#. column 0: Summon forth Argos, Venat's faithful familiar, to bear you places while you marvel at the softness of his golden coat.
#. column 2: Gosh, he's a fast doggy!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca
msgctxt "MountTransient:263:0:1"
msgid "Created by Venat, this dog-like familiar lends his back only to those who have won his favor─which you already had by the time you first met him in Mare Lamentorum owing to the quirks of time travel."
msgstr "Аргоса создала Венат. Он позволяет садиться себе на спину только тем, кому благоволит. Вы завоевали его расположение ещё при первой встрече в Море Скорби — благодаря причудам путешествий во времени."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Wie brav der ist!<br><i>Nashu Mhakaracca</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth Argos, Venat's faithful familiar, to bear you places while you marvel at the softness of his golden coat.
#. column 1: Created by Venat, this dog-like familiar lends his back only to those who have won his favor─which you already had by the time you first met him in Mare Lamentorum owing to the quirks of time travel.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:263:0:2"
msgid "Gosh, he's a fast doggy!<br>   - Nashu Mhakaracca "
msgstr "Ну и шустрый пёсик!<br>   — Нашу Мхакарракка"

#. ja: ドレッドノートに騎乗する。<br>古代アラグ帝国の軍用工作機械
#. de: Rufe deinen Brummonauten herbei, eine riesige Maschine, die alles um sich herum in Schutt und Asche legt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre cuirassé Dreadnaught, une machine-outil mise au point par les Allagois.
#. column 1: Originally used as a weapon, this Allagan machina was eventually superseded by newer models and repurposed for construction. Legends tell of a young man who took one such unit on a rampage, wreaking havoc through enemy ranks.
#. column 2: What does it do?<br>   - Inquisitive Young Man
msgctxt "MountTransient:264:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your dreadnaught, a hulking machina that's equally at home on the battlefield as it is at construction sites."
msgstr "Призывает дредноут — громоздкую машину, которая пригодится и на поле боя, и на стройке."

#. ja: 古代アラグ帝国の軍用工作機械。元は陸戦兵器であったが、さまざまな新型機種が開発されたことで一線から退き、工作部隊にて重機として用いられることになったようだ。かつて、これに乗り暴れまわった少年がいたらしい
#. de: Ursprünglich wurde der Brummonaut als Kriegsmaschine entwickelt, doch als neuere Modelle aufkamen, wurde sie auf Baustellen eingesetzt. Einer Legende nach kämpfte sich ein junger Held mit einem Brummonauten durch eine Gruppe von Feinden.
#. fr: À l'origine uniquement utilisée comme arme de guerre, cette machine allagoise a été petit à petit surpassée par des modèles plus avancés et reléguée au statut d'outil de con<shy>struc<shy>tion, mais beaucoup pensent qu'elle n'a au fond rien à envier à ses cadettes.
#. column 0: Summon forth your dreadnaught, a hulking machina that's equally at home on the battlefield as it is at construction sites.
#. column 2: What does it do?<br>   - Inquisitive Young Man
msgctxt "MountTransient:264:0:1"
msgid "Originally used as a weapon, this Allagan machina was eventually superseded by newer models and repurposed for construction. Legends tell of a young man who took one such unit on a rampage, wreaking havoc through enemy ranks."
msgstr "Эта аллаганская машина сперва служила оружием, но со временем её вытеснили новые модели, и её приспособили для строительных работ. Легенды рассказывают о юноше, который пустил такую машину в ход и устроил переполох в рядах врагов."

#. ja: 言うことを聞いた…
#. de: Wofür ist die Maschine?<br><i>Neugieriger junger Mann</i>
#. fr: Kaching... Kaching...
#. column 0: Summon forth your dreadnaught, a hulking machina that's equally at home on the battlefield as it is at construction sites.
#. column 1: Originally used as a weapon, this Allagan machina was eventually superseded by newer models and repurposed for construction. Legends tell of a young man who took one such unit on a rampage, wreaking havoc through enemy ranks.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:264:0:2"
msgid "What does it do?<br>   - Inquisitive Young Man"
msgstr "А что она делает?<br>   — Любознательный юноша"

#. ja: デミフェネクスに騎乗する。<br>危険な創造生物、フェネクスを模した幻体
#. de: Rufe deinen Demi-Phoinix herbei, denn vier Flügel sind besser als zwei und drei Köpfe besser als einer.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre demi-protophénix, un oiseau de feu à trois têtes et quatre ailes.
#. column 1: This entity is a recreation of the being found imprisoned inside Pandæmonium. The original was the fruit of the ancients' research into immortal birds, but owing to its volatility, it was branded a failure.
#. column 2: How do you spell that again?<br>   - An Ancient
msgctxt "MountTransient:265:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Demi-Phoinix. Because four wings are better than two and three heads better than one."
msgstr "Призывает полуфеникса. Ведь четыре крыла лучше двух, а три головы — одной."

#. ja: パンデモニウムに収監されていた危険な創造生物、フェネクスを模した幻体。なお、フェネクスは、不死鳥創造の研究過程で生まれた存在らしいが、あまりの凶暴性により失敗作の烙印を押されたのだという
#. de: Dieses Wesen ist eine Nachbildung des Phoinix aus dem Pandæmonium. Der Phoinix entstand angeblich aus Experimenten an unsterblichen Vögeln, doch aufgrund seiner aggressiven Natur galt er als Fehlschlag.
#. fr: Cette créature est une copie du protophénix emprisonné à l'intérieur du Pandæmonium. L'original était le fruit des expériences des Anciens visant à créer des oiseaux immortels, mais après en avoir perdu le contrôle, ils l'ont considéré comme un échec.
#. column 0: Summon forth Demi-Phoinix. Because four wings are better than two and three heads better than one.
#. column 2: How do you spell that again?<br>   - An Ancient
msgctxt "MountTransient:265:0:1"
msgid "This entity is a recreation of the being found imprisoned inside Pandæmonium. The original was the fruit of the ancients' research into immortal birds, but owing to its volatility, it was branded a failure."
msgstr "Это создание — копия существа, заточённого в Пандемониуме. Оригинал появился в результате исследований древних, пытавшихся создать бессмертных птиц, но из-за буйного нрава его сочли неудачным экспериментом."

#. ja: メラメラパチパチ！
#. de: Wie buchstabiert man das?<br><i>Gelehrter der Alten</i>
#. fr: Flap flap flap<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Demi-Phoinix. Because four wings are better than two and three heads better than one.
#. column 1: This entity is a recreation of the being found imprisoned inside Pandæmonium. The original was the fruit of the ancients' research into immortal birds, but owing to its volatility, it was branded a failure.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:265:0:2"
msgid "How do you spell that again?<br>   - An Ancient"
msgstr "Как же это пишется?<br>   — Древний"

#. ja: カリュドンティスに騎乗する。<br>巨大なワイルドボア。暴れん坊だが英雄には従順
#. de: Rufe Calydontis herbei. Trotz seiner Wildheit folgt er deinem Willen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Calydontis, un énorme sanglier sauvage mais fidèle.
#. column 1: Once a dreaded presence in its forest domain, this lord among wild boars met its match in a band of dauntless adventurers. Having thus learned to bow before the strong, it found a master in you.
#. column 2: When I'm skilled enough<br>to fell a wild boar on my own,<br>I'll allow myself to indulge...<br>   - Isarmoix
msgctxt "MountTransient:266:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Calydontis. He's wild but he's yours."
msgstr "Призывает Калидонтиса. Дикий он, конечно, но теперь твой."

#. ja: 巨大なワイルドボア。生息地域のヌシとして暴れまわり、悪名を轟かせていたが、周辺地域から実力ある冒険者たちが集うことで討伐。ここで強き者に屈することを覚えたらしく、英雄には従順に従い背を貸してくれる
#. de: Als Herrscher der Wildschweine war Calydontis in seinem Wald weithin gefürchtet, bis er einer Gruppe un<shy>erschro<shy>ckener Abenteurer unterlag. So lernte er Demut und fand in dir seinen Meister.
#. fr: Après avoir longtemps semé la terreur dans sa forêt natale, Calydontis a été vaincu par une bande d'aventuriers intrépides, ce qui l'a rendu doux comme un agneau. Ou presque...
#. column 0: Summon forth Calydontis. He's wild but he's yours.
#. column 2: When I'm skilled enough<br>to fell a wild boar on my own,<br>I'll allow myself to indulge...<br>   - Isarmoix
msgctxt "MountTransient:266:0:1"
msgid "Once a dreaded presence in its forest domain, this lord among wild boars met its match in a band of dauntless adventurers. Having thus learned to bow before the strong, it found a master in you."
msgstr "Некогда этот грозный хозяин леса наводил ужас на всех окрестных кабанов. Но нашлась группа отважных искателей приключений, которая оказалась ему не по зубам. Так он усвоил, что сильным надо покоряться, и обрёл в вас хозяина."

#. ja: ブヒッ、ブルルル！
#. de: Eines Tages, wenn ich selbst erfahren genug bin, um ein Wildschwein zu erlegen, gönne ich mir vielleicht auch mal ein Stück.<br><i>Isarmoix</i>
#. fr: GROUIIIIIIK<nbsp>!!!
#. column 0: Summon forth Calydontis. He's wild but he's yours.
#. column 1: Once a dreaded presence in its forest domain, this lord among wild boars met its match in a band of dauntless adventurers. Having thus learned to bow before the strong, it found a master in you.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:266:0:2"
msgid "When I'm skilled enough<br>to fell a wild boar on my own,<br>I'll allow myself to indulge...<br>   - Isarmoix"
msgstr "Когда я стану достаточно умелым,<br>чтобы самому одолеть кабана,<br>тогда и позволю себе полакомиться...<br>   — Изарму"

#. ja: ヴィクトルに騎乗する。<br>大柄なカニス。ガレマール帝国猟犬品評会の優勝犬
#. de: Rufe Victor herbei, ein großer Canis, der bei so mancher Hundeshow in Garlemald den ersten Preis gewonnen hat.
#. fr: Vous appelez Victor, un gros chien garlemaldais réputé pour ses prouesses à la chasse.
#. column 1: Lauded by no less a personage than Emperor Varis, Victor is a perennial champion at Garlean dog shows. Being bred and trained for competition, it isn't suited to combat, though it may at least intimidate foes with its fearsome mien.
#. column 2: Hmph, all bark an' no bite!<br>   - Rabid Wives Houndkeep
msgctxt "MountTransient:267:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Victor, a dog to rule over all dogs─at dog shows, that is."
msgstr "Призывает Виктора, пса, которому нет равных... на выставках собак."

#. ja: 大柄なカニス。ガレマール帝国猟犬品評会の優勝犬であり、ヴァリス帝から表彰を受けたこともあるという。ただし、その審査項目は体格や歩き方、毛艶や従順さであり、実は戦うことが苦手。騎乗には適するが、猟には向かない
#. de: Niemand Geringeres als Kaiser Varis gehört zu den Bewunderern dieses Canis, der ein Star bei den Hundeshows in Garlemald ist. Er ist darauf trainiert, sich gut zu präsentieren, doch für den Kampf ist der Schönling weniger geeignet.
#. fr: Loué par nul autre que l'empereur Varis en personne, Victor était un habitué des podiums des concours de chiens à Garlemald. Bien qu'il n'ait jamais suivi d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment de combat, sa mâchoire proéminente est sans doute capable d'intimider nombre d'opposants.
#. column 0: Summon forth Victor, a dog to rule over all dogs─at dog shows, that is.
#. column 2: Hmph, all bark an' no bite!<br>   - Rabid Wives Houndkeep
msgctxt "MountTransient:267:0:1"
msgid "Lauded by no less a personage than Emperor Varis, Victor is a perennial champion at Garlean dog shows. Being bred and trained for competition, it isn't suited to combat, though it may at least intimidate foes with its fearsome mien."
msgstr "Сам император Варис удостоил Виктора похвалы. Тот не раз становился чемпионом выставок собак в Гарлемальде. Его вывели и обучили для состязаний, так что сражаться он не умеет. Зато грозный вид может отпугнуть врагов."

#. ja: バウバウ！
#. de: Hmpf! Hunde, die bellen, beißen nicht. Immer das Gleiche mit diesen kleinen Kläffern!<br><i>Hundeführer der Tollwütigen Tölen<i>
#. fr: Ouaf ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Victor, a dog to rule over all dogs─at dog shows, that is.
#. column 1: Lauded by no less a personage than Emperor Varis, Victor is a perennial champion at Garlean dog shows. Being bred and trained for competition, it isn't suited to combat, though it may at least intimidate foes with its fearsome mien.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:267:0:2"
msgid "Hmph, all bark an' no bite!<br>   - Rabid Wives Houndkeep"
msgstr "Хм, лает громко, а кусается слабо!<br>   — Собачница из «Бешеных жён»"

#. ja: レベルチェッカーに騎乗する。<br>謎めいた機械。レベルをチェックしてくれるらしい
#. de: Rufe einen Monitor herbei. Die mysteriöse Maschine kann deine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten analysieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre vérifiniveau, qui comme son nom l'indique est capable de vérifier votre niveau.
#. column 1: When this mysterious machine first determined your strength, the result was “level 90.” By what method it came up with its figure, and whether it is even accurate, none can possibly say.
#. column 2: You've really taken it<br>to another level with this!<br>   - Kai-Shirr
msgctxt "MountTransient:268:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your level checker, a mysterious machine that can determine your strength...and apparently also shrink and carry you inside it."
msgstr "Призывает проверяльщик уровня — загадочную машину, которая измеряет вашу силу... и, похоже, ещё может уменьшить вас и возить внутри себя."

#. ja: 謎めいた機械。レベルをチェックしてくれるらしい。この機械が言うには、あなたを最初にチェックしたときのレベルは、「Lv90」とのこと。だが、正しいのかどうかはわからない。そもそもレベルとは、一体何なのだろうか
#. de: Als der Monitor zum ersten Mal deine Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten analysierte, war das Ergebnis „Stufe 90“. Wie die Maschine zu diesem Ergebnis kam, bleibt ihr Geheimnis.
#. fr: La première fois que cette machine mystérieuse vous a examiné<if $gn4>e</if>, elle a déterminé que vous aviez atteint le “niveau 90”. Quelle était sa méthode<nbsp>? Est-elle fiable<nbsp>? Nul ne le sait.
#. column 0: Summon forth your level checker, a mysterious machine that can determine your strength...and apparently also shrink and carry you inside it.
#. column 2: You've really taken it<br>to another level with this!<br>   - Kai-Shirr
msgctxt "MountTransient:268:0:1"
msgid "When this mysterious machine first determined your strength, the result was “level 90.” By what method it came up with its figure, and whether it is even accurate, none can possibly say."
msgstr "Когда эта загадочная машина впервые измерила вашу силу, она выдала результат «ур. 90». Как она пришла к этому числу и можно ли ему верить — никто не знает."

#. ja: レベル2オールド！
#. de: Du beeindruckst mich jedes Mal mehr!<br><i>Kai-Shirr</i>
#. fr: Niveau en hausse<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your level checker, a mysterious machine that can determine your strength...and apparently also shrink and carry you inside it.
#. column 1: When this mysterious machine first determined your strength, the result was “level 90.” By what method it came up with its figure, and whether it is even accurate, none can possibly say.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:268:0:2"
msgid "You've really taken it<br>to another level with this!<br>   - Kai-Shirr"
msgstr "Ты и правда вышел<br>на новый уровень!<br>   — Кай-Ширр"

#. ja: パパ・パイッサに騎乗する。<br>特に大柄なパイッサ。実は八児の父親らしい
#. de: Rufe Papa Paissa herbei. Dieser außer<shy>ordent<shy>lich große Paissa ist Vater von acht Sprösslingen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Papa Païssa, géniteur d'une famille de huit enfants.
#. column 1: This exceptionally large paissa has sired no less than eight offspring, and in order to earn the coin to rear them, it chose to work as an adventurer's mount. By taking it into your service, you are supporting its adorable brood.
#. column 2: I can only imagine the<br>burden they bear with<br>so many mouths to feed.<br>   - Pip
msgctxt "MountTransient:269:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Papa Paissa. It's for a good cause."
msgstr "Призывает папу Пайсса. Всё ради благого дела."

#. ja: 特に大柄なパイッサ。実は八児の父親らしく、子どもたちの生活費を捻出するために、冒険者のマウントという仕事を選んだらしい。彼を雇用することで、可愛らしいパイッサの幼獣たちが、健やかに成長するはずだ
#. de: Um seine acht Kinder zu versorgen, verdient sich dieser große Paissa ein Zubrot, indem er Abenteurern als Reittier dient. Wenn du auf ihm reitest, unterstützt du seine ganze Familie.
#. fr: Ce païssa gigantesque a engendré huit enfants, et pour avoir de quoi les élever, il a résolu de se mettre au service des aventuriers. Appelez-le à chaque fois que vous en aurez l'occasion, c'est pour la bonne cause.
#. column 0: Summon forth Papa Paissa. It's for a good cause.
#. column 2: I can only imagine the<br>burden they bear with<br>so many mouths to feed.<br>   - Pip
msgctxt "MountTransient:269:0:1"
msgid "This exceptionally large paissa has sired no less than eight offspring, and in order to earn the coin to rear them, it chose to work as an adventurer's mount. By taking it into your service, you are supporting its adorable brood."
msgstr "Этот необычайно крупный Пайсса — отец целых восьми детёнышей. Чтобы прокормить их, он устроился перевозить искателей приключений. Взяв его на службу, вы поможете его очаровательному выводку."

#. ja: パパパパパ！
#. de: Es ist bestimmt nicht leicht, so viele Mäuler zu stopfen.<br><i>Pip</i>
#. fr: Papapapapa<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Papa Paissa. It's for a good cause.
#. column 1: This exceptionally large paissa has sired no less than eight offspring, and in order to earn the coin to rear them, it chose to work as an adventurer's mount. By taking it into your service, you are supporting its adorable brood.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:269:0:2"
msgid "I can only imagine the<br>burden they bear with<br>so many mouths to feed.<br>   - Pip"
msgstr "Представляю, каково им<br>с таким количеством<br>голодных ртов...<br>   — Пип"

#. ja: ウィヴルに騎乗する。<br>西方の新大陸原産の四脚獣
#. de: Rufe deine Wivre herbei, eine gehörnte Bestie aus der Neuen Welt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre wivre, une bête cornue des contrées occidentales.
#. column 1: Native to the New World, these ill-mannered scalekin are notoriously difficult to tame. Yet where others have failed, the Mamool Ja have succeeded, their people employing wivres as beasts of burden and weapons of war both.
#. column 2: I pray that you at least consider<br>a watchful trot into danger rather<br>than a headlong charge...<br>   - Iliud
msgctxt "MountTransient:273:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wivre, a mighty horned beast said to be nature's battering ram."
msgstr "Призывает вивру — могучего рогатого зверя, которого называют живым тараном."

#. ja: 西方の新大陸原産の四脚獣。獰猛で飼い慣らすのは難しいが、マムージャ族は家畜化に成功しており、利用も進んでいる。駄獣や騎獣としてはもちろん、強烈な突進力と大きな角を活かし、攻城兵器としても用いられる
#. de: Die in der Neuen Welt beheimateten Wivres sind bösartig und schwer zu zähmen. Nur den Mamool Ja ist es gelungen, einige von ihnen als Reittiere zu bändigen.
#. fr: Originaires du nouveau continent à l'ouest et aussi efficaces en tant que destriers que sur un champ de bataille, les wivres sont connues pour être très difficiles à dompter, mais la patience des Mamool Ja a finalement eu raison de leur entêtement.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wivre, a mighty horned beast said to be nature's battering ram.
#. column 2: I pray that you at least consider<br>a watchful trot into danger rather<br>than a headlong charge...<br>   - Iliud
msgctxt "MountTransient:273:0:1"
msgid "Native to the New World, these ill-mannered scalekin are notoriously difficult to tame. Yet where others have failed, the Mamool Ja have succeeded, their people employing wivres as beasts of burden and weapons of war both."
msgstr "Эти необузданные чешуйчатые обитают в Новом Свете и славятся тем, что их почти невозможно приручить. Но мамул-джа это удалось. Они используют вивр и как вьючных животных, и как боевые машины."

#. ja: バッターホーン！
#. de: Pass auf, dass du dich nicht zu tollkühn in Gefahren stürzt. Vorsicht ist besser als Nachsicht.<br><i>Iliud</i>
#. fr: Poueeeeet<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your wivre, a mighty horned beast said to be nature's battering ram.
#. column 1: Native to the New World, these ill-mannered scalekin are notoriously difficult to tame. Yet where others have failed, the Mamool Ja have succeeded, their people employing wivres as beasts of burden and weapons of war both.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:273:0:2"
msgid "I pray that you at least consider<br>a watchful trot into danger rather<br>than a headlong charge...<br>   - Iliud"
msgstr "Надеюсь, ты хотя бы подумаешь<br>о том, чтобы красться в опасность<br>осторожно, а не нестись напролом...<br>   — Илиуд"

#. ja: キングポークシーに騎乗する。<br>大きな豚型使い魔。ほんのり厚切りベーコンの香りがする
#. de: Rufe deinen Quiexie-König herbei. Dieses Prachtexemplar einer Quiexie riecht leicht nach Räucherschinken.
#. fr: Vous appelez un porxie royal, un cochon volant à la bonne odeur de jambon.
#. column 1: Unlike its kin, this porxie was born without the ability to cure the tempered. Rather than have it go to waste, however, it was made into a mount and given a crown─perhaps to evoke a sense of luxury and comfort.
#. column 2: This specimen can be<br>considered royalty<br>among them.<br>   - Martineau
msgctxt "MountTransient:274:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your porxie king. Smells like bacon that's a cut above the rest─though that might just be an effect of the crown."
msgstr "Призывает короля поркси. От него пахнет беконом высшего сорта... хотя, может, это всё корона."

#. ja: 大きな豚型使い魔。ポークシー量産計画の一環として創られたが、テンパード治療能力を持たない個体として誕生してしまった。だが、食品ロス低減の観点から、ほっとやさしい気持ちで騎乗用として再利用することにしたらしい
#. de: Anders als seine Artgenossen, verfügt diese Quiexie nicht über die Fähigkeit, andere zu heilen. Also machte man sie kurzerhand zum Reittier und setzte ihr eine Krone auf.
#. fr: À la différence de ses congénères, ce porxie n'a pas le pouvoir de guérir la subjugation, mais sa taille imposante lui permet de faire office de monture. La couronne qu'il porte sur la tête n'est qu'un simple attribut décoratif.
#. column 0: Summon forth your porxie king. Smells like bacon that's a cut above the rest─though that might just be an effect of the crown.
#. column 2: This specimen can be<br>considered royalty<br>among them.<br>   - Martineau
msgctxt "MountTransient:274:0:1"
msgid "Unlike its kin, this porxie was born without the ability to cure the tempered. Rather than have it go to waste, however, it was made into a mount and given a crown─perhaps to evoke a sense of luxury and comfort."
msgstr "В отличие от сородичей, этот поркси родился без способности исцелять порабощённых. Но вместо того, чтобы пропадать зря, его сделали скакуном и увенчали короной — должно быть, чтобы добавить ему роскоши и уюта."

#. ja: ほっと！
#. de: Ein königliches Exemplar!<br><i>Martineau</i>
#. fr: Grouik grouik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your porxie king. Smells like bacon that's a cut above the rest─though that might just be an effect of the crown.
#. column 1: Unlike its kin, this porxie was born without the ability to cure the tempered. Rather than have it go to waste, however, it was made into a mount and given a crown─perhaps to evoke a sense of luxury and comfort.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:274:0:2"
msgid "This specimen can be<br>considered royalty<br>among them.<br>   - Martineau"
msgstr "Среди своих он<br>по праву считается<br>особой королевской крови.<br>   — Мартино"

#. ja: ガーロンドGL-IIに騎乗する。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が試作した魔導二輪車
#. de: Rufe deine Garlond GL-II herbei, das neueste zweirädrige Prachtstück der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Garlond GL-II, un véhicule magitek à deux roues mis au point par les Forges de Garlond.
#. column 1: This prototype magitek vehicle was developed by Garlond Ironworks to be a mode of transportation for a new era. A compact-but-powerful twin-bank ceruleum engine provides effortless acceleration which, coupled with the rugged chassis, allows it to devour rough terrain─such as that one might see on a desert island.
#. column 2: Latest technology! Revolutionary ideas!<br>   - Razel Huizan the Stationary
msgctxt "MountTransient:277:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Garlond GL-II. For those who've got a nice place─who never wanted to be anybody else."
msgstr "Призывает Гарлонд GL-II. Для тех, у кого есть славное место... и кто никогда не хотел быть кем-то другим."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が、新時代の移動手段として試作した魔導二輪車。ツインバンク式の小型青燐機関を搭載することで、パワフルな走りを実現。無人島のような不整地であっても走行することが可能となっている
#. de: Dieser Prototyp stammt aus der Schmiede der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke und soll das Symbol einer neuen Generation moderner Magitek-Fahrzeuge sein. Der kompakte Erdseim-Motor sorgt für nahezu mühelose Beschleunigung und das robuste Fahrgestell macht die Garlond GL-II selbst im unwegsamen Gelände einsamer Inseln zu einem zuverlässigen Fortbewegungsmittel.
#. fr: Les Forges de Garlond ont développé ce prototype de moto avec l'idée d'en faire un véhicule pour une ère nouvelle. Son moteur au céruleum compact et innovant permet d'accélérer aisément sur n'importe quel type de terrain, même les sols rugeux et inexplorés d'une île déserte.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Garlond GL-II. For those who've got a nice place─who never wanted to be anybody else.
#. column 2: Latest technology! Revolutionary ideas!<br>   - Razel Huizan the Stationary
msgctxt "MountTransient:277:0:1"
msgid "This prototype magitek vehicle was developed by Garlond Ironworks to be a mode of transportation for a new era. A compact-but-powerful twin-bank ceruleum engine provides effortless acceleration which, coupled with the rugged chassis, allows it to devour rough terrain─such as that one might see on a desert island."
msgstr "Этот прототип магитехнического транспортного средства создали в Гарлондских мастерских для новой эпохи. Компактный, но мощный двухрядный двигатель на церулеуме разгоняет его без усилий, а прочное шасси позволяет преодолевать самое суровое бездорожье — например, на необитаемом острове."

#. ja: ヴォルルルルル…
#. de: Kann Highwind-Fluggesellschaft voll einpacken, sag ich dir!<br><i>Razel Huizan</i>
#. fr: Vroum<nbsp>! Vroum vroum<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Garlond GL-II. For those who've got a nice place─who never wanted to be anybody else.
#. column 1: This prototype magitek vehicle was developed by Garlond Ironworks to be a mode of transportation for a new era. A compact-but-powerful twin-bank ceruleum engine provides effortless acceleration which, coupled with the rugged chassis, allows it to devour rough terrain─such as that one might see on a desert island.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:277:0:2"
msgid "Latest technology! Revolutionary ideas!<br>   - Razel Huizan the Stationary"
msgstr "Новейшие технологии! Переворот в мире идей!<br>   — Разел Хуизан Неподвижный"

#. ja: 絡繰蓮華に騎乗する。<br>蓮の花を象った騎乗用のからくり座椅子
#. de: Rufe deinen Lotusflitzer herbei. Wer darin Platz nimmt, sieht auf einmal sehr heilig aus.
#. fr: Vous appelez un lotus mécanique, un appareil en forme de fleur de lotus avec un siège confortable.
#. column 1: Fashioned by the enigmatic Onishishu, this mechanical conveyance assumes the form of the lotus flower, a symbol of purity and sanctity in the Far East. Indeed, it gives off a distinctly spiritual aura, though how it does so is a jealously guarded secret.
#. column 2: Their purity is...astounding.<br>   - Rammbroes
msgctxt "MountTransient:279:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your mechanical lotus, a flower-shaped mode of transport with a spiritual aura."
msgstr "Призывает механический лотос — средство передвижения в форме цветка с духовной аурой."

#. ja: 謎の技術者集団「鬼師衆」が造り上げた騎乗用のからくり座椅子。東方地域において清らかさや神聖さの象徴とされる蓮の華が象られており、どこか神秘的な雰囲気が漂う。なお、その製法は秘中の秘とされている
#. de: Die geheimnisumwitterte Handwerkergilde Onishishu hat dieses anmutige Gefährt gebaut, dessen Bauweise - wie soll es anders sein - geheim ist.
#. fr: Cet appareil con<shy>fec<shy>tion<shy>né par l'Oninishu, un groupe d'ingénieurs mystérieux, est empreint d'une aura mystique grâce à sa forme de lotus, une fleur considérée sacrée dans le lointain Orient.
#. column 0: Summon forth your mechanical lotus, a flower-shaped mode of transport with a spiritual aura.
#. column 2: Their purity is...astounding.<br>   - Rammbroes
msgctxt "MountTransient:279:0:1"
msgid "Fashioned by the enigmatic Onishishu, this mechanical conveyance assumes the form of the lotus flower, a symbol of purity and sanctity in the Far East. Indeed, it gives off a distinctly spiritual aura, though how it does so is a jealously guarded secret."
msgstr "Эту механическую повозку в форме лотоса создали загадочные мастера Онисишу. На Дальнем Востоке лотос считают символом чистоты и святости, и повозка действительно словно излучает духовную силу. Но как ей это удаётся, мастера хранят в строжайшем секрете."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Pst. Das ist ein Geheimnis.<br><i>Handwerker der Onishishu</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your mechanical lotus, a flower-shaped mode of transport with a spiritual aura.
#. column 1: Fashioned by the enigmatic Onishishu, this mechanical conveyance assumes the form of the lotus flower, a symbol of purity and sanctity in the Far East. Indeed, it gives off a distinctly spiritual aura, though how it does so is a jealously guarded secret.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:279:0:2"
msgid "Their purity is...astounding.<br>   - Rammbroes"
msgstr "Их чистота... поразительна.<br>   — Раммброэс"

#. ja: フィルギャに騎乗する。<br>詩竜眷属のドラゴン族。闘争の中で輝く英傑を好むという
#. de: Rufe Fylgja herbei, eine Drachin, deren Herz sich mit epischen Sagen und Heldenliedern erweichen lässt.
#. fr: Vous appelez Fylgja, une dragonne ayant un goût prononcé pour le chant et les héros.
#. column 1: Like her noble forebear Ratatoskr, Fylgja is passing fond of mankind, and traveled the world in search of mortals worthy of immortalizing in song. During the course of her journeys, she would encounter a soul who shone most brilliantly in battle. So moved was she by the hero's selfless valor, she chose to become <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> follower.
#. column 2: Would you look at that─<br>my dulcet voice has drawn<br>yet another devoted follower!<br>   - Ulala
msgctxt "MountTransient:280:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Fylgja, a dragon with a soft spot for heroes and songs."
msgstr "Призывает Фильгью — дракона, неравнодушную к героям и песням."

#. ja: 詩竜眷属のドラゴン族。祖と同様に人を好み、竜詩を紡ぐに相応しい人物を求めて方々を巡っていた。そんな中、闘争の中で輝きを見せる英傑を発見。その戦いを見守るうちに熱心な「追従者」となり、付き従う道を選んだのである
#. de: Ebenso wie ihre Vorfahrin Ratatoskr ist auch Fylgja den Sterblichen zugetan. Auf der Suche nach einer Seele, die den Versen eines Drachenepos würdig ist, reiste sie umher und fand, wonach sie suchte. Die selbstlose Tapferkeit jener Seele berührte sie so sehr, dass sie beschloss, sie fortan zu begleiten.
#. fr: À l'image de son ancêtre Ratatosk, Fylgja a toujours éprouvé des sentiments affectueux envers les humains. Durant un de ses tours du monde à la recherche d'âmes héroïques dignes d'être célébrées dans ses chants, elle a fini par croiser la route d'un<if $gn4>e</if> aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> doté<if $gn4>e</if> d'un courage qu'elle n'aurait jamais pu imaginer. Depuis, elle ne <if $gn4>la<else>le</if> quitte plus.
#. column 0: Summon forth Fylgja, a dragon with a soft spot for heroes and songs.
#. column 2: Would you look at that─<br>my dulcet voice has drawn<br>yet another devoted follower!<br>   - Ulala
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:280:0:1"
msgid "Like her noble forebear Ratatoskr, Fylgja is passing fond of mankind, and traveled the world in search of mortals worthy of immortalizing in song. During the course of her journeys, she would encounter a soul who shone most brilliantly in battle. So moved was she by the hero's selfless valor, she chose to become <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> follower."
msgstr "Как и её благородная прародительница Рататоскр, Фильгья очень любит людей и странствовала по свету в поисках смертных, достойных вечной песни. В своих странствиях она встретила того, кто ярче всех сиял в бою. Его самоотверженная храбрость так тронула дракона, что она решила стать <if $gn4>её<else>его</if> спутницей."

#. ja: グオォーン！
#. de: Nanu, ein weiterer Fan, der ein Autogramm oder einen Handschlag von der süßen Ulala möchte?<br><i>Ulala</i>
#. fr: Grraaarrghh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Fylgja, a dragon with a soft spot for heroes and songs.
#. column 1: Like her noble forebear Ratatoskr, Fylgja is passing fond of mankind, and traveled the world in search of mortals worthy of immortalizing in song. During the course of her journeys, she would encounter a soul who shone most brilliantly in battle. So moved was she by the hero's selfless valor, she chose to become <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> follower.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:280:0:2"
msgid "Would you look at that─<br>my dulcet voice has drawn<br>yet another devoted follower!<br>   - Ulala"
msgstr "Только взгляните!<br>Мой нежный голос привлёк<br>ещё одного верного поклонника!<br>   — Улала"

#. ja: アルコノストに騎乗する。<br>イルサバード北部原産の怪鳥。鹿を思わせる蹄や角を有する
#. de: Rufe deinen Alkonost herbei. Ein mystischer Vogel mit Rehhufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un alkonost, un oiseau monstrueux aux airs de cerf originaire du nord d'Ilsabard.
#. column 1: Captured in the Bozjan wilderness, this creature was passed around as a curiosity before eventually being released again. From the start, it seemed unperturbed in the presence of men, leading some to believe it was trained by an imperial beastmaster.
#. column 2: How goes the training<br>for your avian mount?<br>   - Luquelot
msgctxt "MountTransient:281:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your alkonost, an imposing antlered avian native to northern Ilsabard."
msgstr "Призывает алконоста — величественную птицу с рогами, обитающую на севере Илсабарда."

#. ja: イルサバード北部原産の怪鳥。ボズヤの荒野にて捕獲された個体で、好事家の手に渡った後、放出された。捕獲時から人に慣れた様子であったため、元は帝国軍の魔獣使いにより訓練を施されていた可能性が指摘されている
#. de: Dieser im Norden Ilsabards beheimatete Vogel wurde in der Wildnis in Bozja eingefangen. Wegen seiner Zutraulichkeit wird angenommen, dass er einst von einem Bestienbändiger der Kaiserlichen Legion gezähmt wurde.
#. fr: Cet oiseau monstrueux originaire d'Ilsabard fut capturé à Bozja puis relâché après être passé entre les mains d'un col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neur. Il semblait habitué à la présence humaine dès sa capture, ce qui laisse supposer qu'il avait été dressé par l'armée impériale.
#. column 0: Summon forth your alkonost, an imposing antlered avian native to northern Ilsabard.
#. column 2: How goes the training<br>for your avian mount?<br>   - Luquelot
msgctxt "MountTransient:281:0:1"
msgid "Captured in the Bozjan wilderness, this creature was passed around as a curiosity before eventually being released again. From the start, it seemed unperturbed in the presence of men, leading some to believe it was trained by an imperial beastmaster."
msgstr "Эту птицу поймали в диких землях Божи. После того как она побывала у нескольких любителей диковинок, её выпустили на волю. С самого начала она спокойно относилась к людям, и потому некоторые полагают, что её обучал имперский укротитель чудовищ."

#. ja: クルルル…！
#. de: Diesen Vogel mache ich im Nu zum Piepmatz.<br><i>Pagaga</i>
#. fr: Kululu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your alkonost, an imposing antlered avian native to northern Ilsabard.
#. column 1: Captured in the Bozjan wilderness, this creature was passed around as a curiosity before eventually being released again. From the start, it seemed unperturbed in the presence of men, leading some to believe it was trained by an imperial beastmaster.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:281:0:2"
msgid "How goes the training<br>for your avian mount?<br>   - Luquelot"
msgstr "Ну как успехи с дрессировкой<br>твоего пернатого скакуна?<br>   — Люкело"

#. ja: アイル・バッファローに騎乗する。<br>いつの間にか開拓拠点に居ついていた温厚なバッファロー
#. de: Rufe deinen Inselbüffel herbei. So einen sanftmütigen Büffel findet man selten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre buffle insulaire, un sympathique ruminant qui s'est installé on ne sait trop quand dans votre base d'opérations.
#. column 1: Belonging to a species introduced by pirates as livestock, this mild-mannered beast took to living on your island one day. Though it appears to have reverted to being feral, it is easily won over with food, in gratitude for which it happily bears you upon its back.
#. column 2: It's one thing to see the buffaloes in<br>a tizzy, but another to think they could<br>have anything to do with the quakes.<br>   - P'ebaloh
msgctxt "MountTransient:282:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island buffalo. Tough on the outside but tender on the inside."
msgstr "Призывает островного буйвола. Снаружи суров, внутри мягок."

#. ja: いつの間にやら開拓拠点に居ついていたバッファロー。どうやら以前に海賊が食用として持ち込んだ家畜が、野生化したもののようだ。エサさえ提供してくれるなら誰であろうと背に乗せてくれる度量の広さがウリ、らしい
#. de: Dieser Büffel tauchte eines Tages einfach auf und ehe man sichs versah, hatte er sich auch schon im Domizil breitgemacht. Ursprünglich wurde er wohl als Vieh von einer Gruppe Piraten auf die Insel gebracht, doch aus welchem Grund auch immer ist er seitdem verwildert. Solange man ihm Futter gibt, lässt er wirklich jeden aufsitzen.
#. fr: Ce buffle s'est pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment échappé du garde-manger d'un bateau pirate avant de trouver refuge sur votre île privée. Désormais revenu à l'état sauvage, il n'en demeure pas moins très docile, et se laisse monter par quiconque lui tend un peu de nourriture. C'est d'ailleurs ce qui fait tout son charme.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island buffalo. Tough on the outside but tender on the inside.
#. column 2: It's one thing to see the buffaloes in<br>a tizzy, but another to think they could<br>have anything to do with the quakes.<br>   - P'ebaloh
msgctxt "MountTransient:282:0:1"
msgid "Belonging to a species introduced by pirates as livestock, this mild-mannered beast took to living on your island one day. Though it appears to have reverted to being feral, it is easily won over with food, in gratitude for which it happily bears you upon its back."
msgstr "Этот кроткий зверь принадлежит к виду, который пираты завезли на остров как скот. Однажды он поселился на вашем острове и, похоже, одичал. Но его легко задобрить едой, и в благодарность он охотно возит вас на спине."

#. ja: ブフーッ！
#. de: Muuuh!
#. fr: Je vous aimeeeuuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island buffalo. Tough on the outside but tender on the inside.
#. column 1: Belonging to a species introduced by pirates as livestock, this mild-mannered beast took to living on your island one day. Though it appears to have reverted to being feral, it is easily won over with food, in gratitude for which it happily bears you upon its back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:282:0:2"
msgid "It's one thing to see the buffaloes in<br>a tizzy, but another to think they could<br>have anything to do with the quakes.<br>   - P'ebaloh"
msgstr "Одно дело — увидеть, как буйволы<br>беспокоятся, а другое — думать,<br>что они могут быть причастны к землетрясениям.<br>   — П'эбало"

#. ja: ブラキオレイドスに騎乗する。<br>秘境の地で稀に目撃される超大型の古代生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Brachiosaurus herbei. Eine Kreatur der Urzeit, welche in den äußersten Wipfeln der Welt entdeckt wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez un brachiosaure, un animal ancestral issu d'un monde perdu.
#. column 1: Belonging to an ancient and enormous species, this juvenile creature was hatched from an egg found in the wilds by a hunter-scholar. As its body burgeoned, so too did its appetite for exploration, and it eventually found in you a worthy master to follow.
#. column 2: Due to unforeseen difficulties,<br>House Haillenarte has been forced to<br>suspend the expeditions to the Diadem.<br>   - Aurvael
msgctxt "MountTransient:283:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your brachiosaur, a rare prehistoric creature sighted in frontier lands."
msgstr "Призывает брахиозавра — редкое доисторическое животное, замеченное в диких землях."

#. ja: 秘境を行く探検家や冒険者が稀に目にするという、超大型の古代生物。この個体はとあるモブハンターが秘境より持ち帰った卵から孵った幼体であり、のちに旅立ちを決心し、ついていくにふさわしい主を求めていたらしい
#. de: Einer längst ausgestorben geglaubten Spezies angehörend, schlüpfte dieses Exemplar aus einem Ei, das von einem Jäger auf einer seiner Erkundungsreisen gefunden wurde. In der Zwischenzeit wuchs nicht nur sein Körper zu beachtlichen Ausmaßen heran, auch seine Abenteuerlust scheint keine Grenzen zu kennen. Wie gut also, dass ihr euch nun über den Weg gelaufen seid.
#. fr: Seuls les plus hardis des aventuriers peuvent se targuer d'avoir aperçu un de ses congénères. L'œuf abandonné de ce brachiosaure aurait été ramassé par un chasseur en expédition dans un monde perdu. Après son éclosion, il s'est attaché à son bienfaiteur et le suit partout.
#. column 0: Summon forth your brachiosaur, a rare prehistoric creature sighted in frontier lands.
#. column 2: Due to unforeseen difficulties,<br>House Haillenarte has been forced to<br>suspend the expeditions to the Diadem.<br>   - Aurvael
msgctxt "MountTransient:283:0:1"
msgid "Belonging to an ancient and enormous species, this juvenile creature was hatched from an egg found in the wilds by a hunter-scholar. As its body burgeoned, so too did its appetite for exploration, and it eventually found in you a worthy master to follow."
msgstr "Это детёныш древнего исполинского вида. Он вылупился из яйца, найденного в диких землях охотником-учёным. По мере роста в нём всё сильнее разгорался интерес к путешествиям. В конце концов он нашёл в вас достойного хозяина, за которым захотел следовать."

#. ja: グォォ……！
#. de: Gaoohhh!
#. fr: Groaar<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your brachiosaur, a rare prehistoric creature sighted in frontier lands.
#. column 1: Belonging to an ancient and enormous species, this juvenile creature was hatched from an egg found in the wilds by a hunter-scholar. As its body burgeoned, so too did its appetite for exploration, and it eventually found in you a worthy master to follow.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:283:0:2"
msgid "Due to unforeseen difficulties,<br>House Haillenarte has been forced to<br>suspend the expeditions to the Diadem.<br>   - Aurvael"
msgstr "Из-за непредвиденных трудностей<br>Дом Эйленарт вынужден<br>приостановить экспедиции в Диадему.<br>   — Орваэль"

#. ja: ポッド602に騎乗する。<br>機械遺跡で発見された白い支援随行ユニット
#. de: Rufe deinen Pod 602 herbei.<br>Der perfekte Abenteuerbegleiter, wenn er denn ordentlich funktionieren würde.
#. fr: Vous appelez un pod 602, une unité de support blanche découverte dans les ruines mécaniques.
#. column 1: Recovered from the ruins of the machine lifeforms, this diminutive white machina was created to provide YoRHa units with movement support. On account of this, it can easily transport one person...if not exactly in style or comfort.
#. column 2: Those who are ready and<br>willing to fight will never<br>want for transportation!<br>   - Grand Company Flyer
msgctxt "MountTransient:284:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your pod 602 mount. May leave you hanging, but will never let you go. Unless it malfunctions, or runs out of energy, or...you get the idea."
msgstr "Призывает капсулу 602. Может оставить вас висеть в воздухе, но никогда не отпустит. Если только не сломается, не разрядится или... вы поняли."

#. ja: 機械遺跡の奥深くにて発見された白い小型機械。支援随行ユニットとして、ヨルハ機体の移動支援も任務のひとつとして開発されていた。そのため、人ひとり程度であれば、楽々と吊り下げて移送することが可能である
#. de: Diese weiße Maschine wurde aus einer alten Fabrik-<br>ruine geborgen. Vermutlich diente sie ursprünglich dem Transport von YoRHa. Eine einzelne Person befördert sie daher mit Leichtigkeit.
#. fr: Cette unité de support blanche, découverte au fond des ruines mécaniques, a également été développée dans le but de servir de moyen de transport à l'infanterie YoRHa et peut ainsi s'utiliser comme véhicule pour une personne.
#. column 0: Summon forth your pod 602 mount. May leave you hanging, but will never let you go. Unless it malfunctions, or runs out of energy, or...you get the idea.
#. column 2: Those who are ready and<br>willing to fight will never<br>want for transportation!<br>   - Grand Company Flyer
msgctxt "MountTransient:284:0:1"
msgid "Recovered from the ruins of the machine lifeforms, this diminutive white machina was created to provide YoRHa units with movement support. On account of this, it can easily transport one person...if not exactly in style or comfort."
msgstr "Эту крошечную белую машину нашли в руинах механических форм жизни. Она была создана для поддержки подразделений «ЙорХа», в том числе для их перемещения. Поэтому она легко перевозит одного человека... хотя и не сказать, чтобы с удобством или шиком."

#. ja: …………
#. de:  Schnappen wir uns einen Pod!<br><i>Konogg</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your pod 602 mount. May leave you hanging, but will never let you go. Unless it malfunctions, or runs out of energy, or...you get the idea.
#. column 1: Recovered from the ruins of the machine lifeforms, this diminutive white machina was created to provide YoRHa units with movement support. On account of this, it can easily transport one person...if not exactly in style or comfort.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:284:0:2"
msgid "Those who are ready and<br>willing to fight will never<br>want for transportation!<br>   - Grand Company Flyer"
msgstr "Кто готов сражаться<br>и не боится трудностей,<br>тот без транспорта не останется!<br>   — листовка Великой компании"

#. ja: ムーンホッパーに騎乗する。<br>サポーターを改造したゴキゲンなマシン
#. de: Rufe deinen Mondhopper herbei, ein umgebauter Support, der für gute Laune sorgt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre bondisseur lunaire, une monture dynamique issue d'une unité d'assistance améliorée.
#. column 1: This enhanced version of the supporter was lovingly created by the ever-innovative Inventingway. Not satisfied with merely making it ridable, the Loporrit also fitted a compact speaker that can belt out Dreamingway's feel-good sounds.
#. column 2: Well, then, let's hop to it!<br>   - Dreamingway
msgctxt "MountTransient:285:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the moon-hopper. Guaranteed to instill a sense of well-being within all those in earshot."
msgstr "Призывает лунного прыгуна. Всем, кто услышит его, гарантировано отличное настроение."

#. ja: インベンティングウェイが開発した改良型サポーター。騎乗機能に加え小型スピーカーも増設されており、ドリーミングウェイが選定したミラクルなナンバーを流すことができる。これを聞けば、気分上々になることだろう
#. de: Ein von Inventingway umgebauter Support mit eingebautem Lautsprecher, aus dem eine von Dreamingway ausgesuchte fröhliche Melodie erklingt. Wer davon keine gute Laune kriegt ist ein unverbesserlicher Miesepeter!
#. fr: Cette machine sophistiquée a été mise au point par Inventingway sur la base d'un chassis d'unité d'assistance loporrite. En plus de pouvoir transporter un passager, elle est aussi dotée d'un puissant haut-parleur conçu pour jouer du dreamstep, un genre de musique électronique prisé par Dreamingway pour ses propriétés tonifiantes.
#. column 0: Summon forth the moon-hopper. Guaranteed to instill a sense of well-being within all those in earshot.
#. column 2: Well, then, let's hop to it!<br>   - Dreamingway
msgctxt "MountTransient:285:0:1"
msgid "This enhanced version of the supporter was lovingly created by the ever-innovative Inventingway. Not satisfied with merely making it ridable, the Loporrit also fitted a compact speaker that can belt out Dreamingway's feel-good sounds."
msgstr "Инвентингвей, мастер на все руки, с любовью создал улучшенную версию поддерживающего устройства. Он не просто добавил сиденье, а установил компактный динамик, из которого звучат бодрые мелодии Дримингвея."

#. ja: ピーポー！
#. de: Wer hat ihn erfunden? Superhirn Inventingway natürlich!<br><i>Inventingway</i>
#. fr: Boum boum tchak<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the moon-hopper. Guaranteed to instill a sense of well-being within all those in earshot.
#. column 1: This enhanced version of the supporter was lovingly created by the ever-innovative Inventingway. Not satisfied with merely making it ridable, the Loporrit also fitted a compact speaker that can belt out Dreamingway's feel-good sounds.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:285:0:2"
msgid "Well, then, let's hop to it!<br>   - Dreamingway"
msgstr "Ну что, пора в путь!<br>   — Дримингвей"

#. ja: アイランド・アリゲーターに騎乗する。<br>自身が貴重だという矜持を持ったアリゲーター
#. de: Rufe deinen Insel-Alligator herbei. Wenn er schauläuft, darfst du seinen Rücken zieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez un alligator insulaire à la fierté ostentatoire.
#. column 1: Hailing from unknown shores, this alligator appeared on your island one day and made itself at home. It takes pride in the fact that its kind is rare out at sea, and willingly carries a rider upon its back if only so it can parade itself in front of all and sundry.
#. column 2: A face you could kiss─if<br>it weren't covered in scales,<br>that is!<br>   - Foerzagyl
msgctxt "MountTransient:286:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island alligator. Demands to be seen not later, but always."
msgstr "Призывает островного аллигатора. Ему мало просто появиться — ему нужно, чтобы его видели всегда."

#. ja: どこから泳いできたものか、いつのまにやら無人島に居ついていたアリゲーター。無人島でアリゲーターが珍しいことを自認し、それに対して誇りと矜持を持っている。その姿を衆人に披露できるのであれば、人を背に乗せることも厭わない、らしい
#. de: Niemand weiß woher, aber dieser imposante Alligator tauchte eines Tages in deinem Inselparadies auf und machte es sich dort gemütlich. Er ist sich offensichtlich seiner Seltenheit auf dem Meer bewusst und stolz darauf. Er trägt gerne einen Reiter auf seinem Rücken, wenn auch nur, um sich vor allen anderen zu zeigen.
#. fr: Nul ne sait d'où vient cet imposant alligator, mais cela ne l'a pas empêché d'élire domicile sur votre paradis insulaire. Visiblement conscient d'être l'un des rares re<shy>pré<shy>sen<shy>tants de son espèce à avoir migré sur une île déserte, il semble en tirer une grande fierté et se laisse volontiers chevaucher s'il peut en profiter pour parader à la vue de tous.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island alligator. Demands to be seen not later, but always.
#. column 2: A face you could kiss─if<br>it weren't covered in scales,<br>that is!<br>   - Foerzagyl
msgctxt "MountTransient:286:0:1"
msgid "Hailing from unknown shores, this alligator appeared on your island one day and made itself at home. It takes pride in the fact that its kind is rare out at sea, and willingly carries a rider upon its back if only so it can parade itself in front of all and sundry."
msgstr "Неизвестно, откуда он приплыл, но однажды этот аллигатор объявился на вашем острове и обосновался там. Он гордится тем, что его сородичи редко встречаются в море, и охотно возит вас на спине, лишь бы покрасоваться перед всеми."

#. ja: ゴルルゥ…
#. de: Du trägst doch nur deine Eitelkeit zur Schau.<br><i>Jacke</i>
#. fr: Groooh...
#. column 0: Summon forth your island alligator. Demands to be seen not later, but always.
#. column 1: Hailing from unknown shores, this alligator appeared on your island one day and made itself at home. It takes pride in the fact that its kind is rare out at sea, and willingly carries a rider upon its back if only so it can parade itself in front of all and sundry.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:286:0:2"
msgid "A face you could kiss─if<br>it weren't covered in scales,<br>that is!<br>   - Foerzagyl"
msgstr "Лицо хоть целуй —<br>если бы не чешуя, конечно!<br>   — Фоэрзагил"

#. ja: ヒッポカートに騎乗する。<br>アルカソーダラ族の若者らが考案したカバが牽引する二輪車
#. de: Rufe deinen Hippowagen herbei, ein von jungen Arkasodara erschaffener Rennwagen, der von einem Flusspferd gezogen wird.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture hippochar, un véhicule à deux roues inventé par de jeunes Arkasodaras.
#. column 1: Drawing upon the design of chocobo carriages, a collective of Arkasodara youths invented this two-wheeled hippo-drawn cart. The sunshade cloth incorporates techniques used in crafting Corvosi flying carpets, and grants cart and hippo both the ability to soar the skies.
#. column 2: A hippo cart can outrun<br>most anythin' in this jungle.<br>   - Trna
msgctxt "MountTransient:287:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your hippo cart, a mean if not so lean transporting machine."
msgstr "Призывает повозку с бегемотом — грозное, хоть и не слишком изящное средство передвижения."

#. ja: ヴァナスパティ樹海に棲まう巨獣カバに牽かせた二輪車。アルカソーダラ族の若者らが、チョコボ・キャリッジを参考に考案した。日除けの布に、コルヴォ式空飛ぶ絨毯の技術を利用したことで、なんと空を翔けることもできる
#. de: Eine Chocobo-Kutsche inspirierte eine Gruppe von jungen Arkasodara zu diesem schnittigen Renn-<br>wagen. Das Sonnendach soll aus dem gleichen Stoff sein wie die fliegenden Teppiche aus Corvos, weshalb dieses Vehikel nicht nur über Stock und Stein, sondern auch durch die Wolken rasen kann.
#. fr: Ce véhicule à deux roues, tiré par des hippopotames, a été inventé par de jeunes Arkasodaras s'étant inspirés des attelages de chocobos. Son parasol utilise la technologie des tapis magiques, le rendant ainsi capable de voler à travers les cieux.
#. column 0: Summon forth your hippo cart, a mean if not so lean transporting machine.
#. column 2: A hippo cart can outrun<br>most anythin' in this jungle.<br>   - Trna
msgctxt "MountTransient:287:0:1"
msgid "Drawing upon the design of chocobo carriages, a collective of Arkasodara youths invented this two-wheeled hippo-drawn cart. The sunshade cloth incorporates techniques used in crafting Corvosi flying carpets, and grants cart and hippo both the ability to soar the skies."
msgstr "Взяв за образец экипажи чокобо, молодые аркасодара придумали эту двухколёсную повозку, запряжённую бегемотом. Для тента использовали технику изготовления летающих ковров из Корвоса, поэтому по небу может мчаться и повозка, и бегемот."

#. ja: ブォーッ！
#. de: Was einen Hippowagen ausmacht? Tempo, Tempo, Tempo!<br><i>Hipporaser</i>
#. fr: Fooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your hippo cart, a mean if not so lean transporting machine.
#. column 1: Drawing upon the design of chocobo carriages, a collective of Arkasodara youths invented this two-wheeled hippo-drawn cart. The sunshade cloth incorporates techniques used in crafting Corvosi flying carpets, and grants cart and hippo both the ability to soar the skies.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:287:0:2"
msgid "A hippo cart can outrun<br>most anythin' in this jungle.<br>   - Trna"
msgstr "На повозке с бегемотом<br>можно обогнать почти кого угодно<br>в этих джунглях.<br>   — Трна"

#. ja: トロルに騎乗する。<br>北洋地域に生息する巨獣。見た目に反して知能は高め
#. de: Rufe deinen Troll herbei. Entgegen seines dümmlichen Grinsens ein sehr intelligentes Wesen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un troll, une créature géante des mers du Nord. Il est bien plus intelligent que son apparence ne le laisse croire.
#. column 1: Contrary to their savage appearance, trolls are highly intelligent creatures. Sharlayan scholars once sought to teach them sign language, and on account of this specimen's friendly nature, it is believed that it was a subject in that experiment.
#. column 2: If I didn't know better, I could've <br>sworn that troll was talking to you...<br>   - Roegadyn Gleaner
msgctxt "MountTransient:288:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your troll mount, a gentle giant native to the northern seas."
msgstr "Призывает тролля — доброго великана из северных морей."

#. ja: 北洋地域に生息する巨獣。見た目に反して知能が高いことから、かつてシャーレアンの植民都市では手話を覚えさせようという実験が行われていた。この個体は、当時の実験体と思われ、人に対して極めて友好的である
#. de: Sharlayanische Forscher sollen einst versucht haben, einigen Trollen die Gebärdensprache beizubringen. Dieser Troll ist eines der Versuchsobjekte. Ob er sich mittels Gebärden mitteilen kann, sei dahingestellt. Sein Lächeln spricht auf jeden Fall Bände.
#. fr: Ces créatures géantes des mers du Nord sont bien plus intelligentes que leur apparence ne le laisse croire. Des expériences ont été menées à Sharlayan pour leur apprendre la langue des signes, et vu comme ce troll se montre coopératif avec les humains, on suppose qu'il y a pris part.
#. column 0: Summon forth your troll mount, a gentle giant native to the northern seas.
#. column 2: If I didn't know better, I could've <br>sworn that troll was talking to you...<br>   - Roegadyn Gleaner
msgctxt "MountTransient:288:0:1"
msgid "Contrary to their savage appearance, trolls are highly intelligent creatures. Sharlayan scholars once sought to teach them sign language, and on account of this specimen's friendly nature, it is believed that it was a subject in that experiment."
msgstr "Тролли не так свирепы, как кажутся, и обладают высоким интеллектом. Когда-то учёные Шарлая пытались научить их языку жестов. Судя по дружелюбному нраву этого экземпляра, он мог быть подопытным в том эксперименте."

#. ja: フォオォォォオォォ…
#. de: Eins, zwei, drei, Troll. Test, Test ... Könnt ihr mich verstehen?<br><i>Flauschi</i>
#. fr: Foooh...
#. column 0: Summon forth your troll mount, a gentle giant native to the northern seas.
#. column 1: Contrary to their savage appearance, trolls are highly intelligent creatures. Sharlayan scholars once sought to teach them sign language, and on account of this specimen's friendly nature, it is believed that it was a subject in that experiment.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:288:0:2"
msgid "If I didn't know better, I could've <br>sworn that troll was talking to you...<br>   - Roegadyn Gleaner"
msgstr "Если бы я не знал, то поклялся бы,<br>что этот тролль с тобой разговаривал...<br>   — Рогадин-собиратель"

#. ja: UFO？に騎乗する。<br>謎めいた飛行物体の複製体
#. de: Rufe deine fliegende Untertasse herbei. Eine Kopie jenes Wunderwerks außerætherischer Technologie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre O.V.N.I., la réplique d'une mystérieuse soucoupe volante.
#. column 1: While appearing to be identical to PuPu's starship, this replica lacks certain functionalities such as a matter duplication facility, which, in light of recent events, is probably for the best. It is also unable to shrink you to a size to fit in the cockpit, meaning you do not so much ride as you are dangled around in its tractor beam.
#. column 2: The <i>Truth</i> receives a large number<br>of reports from readers claiming to have<br>observed unidentified flying objects.<br>   - Delion
msgctxt "MountTransient:290:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your UFO, and experience the sensation of an alien abduction."
msgstr "Призывает НЛО. Почувствуйте себя похищенными пришельцами."

#. ja: 異星人コヨコヨが搭乗していた宇宙船……の複製体。ただし、複製機能に代表される超技術までは再現されていない。そのため肉体を縮小して内部に搭乗することはできず、反重力光線によって運搬してもらうことになる
#. de: Die fliegende Untertasse deines außerætherischen Freundes Koyo-Koyo<nbsp>... Oder zumindest eine Kopie. Die vervielfältigenden Funktionen des Originals konnten aufgrund ihrer Komplexität leider nicht übernommen werden. Aus selbigem Grund ist es ebenfalls nicht möglich, seinen Körper verkleinern zu lassen, um im Inneren der Untertasse Platz zu nehmen.
#. fr: Identique en apparence à la soucoupe volante de Koyo K, cette réplique ne dispose pas des technologies avancées de son modèle, notamment des fonctions de clonage ou de miniaturisation, ce qui l'oblige à tracter ses passagers par rayon antigravité.
#. column 0: Summon forth your UFO, and experience the sensation of an alien abduction.
#. column 2: The <i>Truth</i> receives a large number<br>of reports from readers claiming to have<br>observed unidentified flying objects.<br>   - Delion
msgctxt "MountTransient:290:0:1"
msgid "While appearing to be identical to PuPu's starship, this replica lacks certain functionalities such as a matter duplication facility, which, in light of recent events, is probably for the best. It is also unable to shrink you to a size to fit in the cockpit, meaning you do not so much ride as you are dangled around in its tractor beam."
msgstr "На вид этот корабль в точности повторяет НЛО Пу-Пу, но лишён некоторых функций — например, возможности дублировать материю. После недавних событий это, пожалуй, к лучшему. Он также не умеет уменьшать вас, чтобы вы поместились в кабине, так что вас не столько везут, сколько таскают на луче захвата."

#. ja: アブダクション！
#. de: Auch wenn Ihr es mir nicht glauben wollt, es ist wahr. Die Außerætherischen haben erneut zugeschlagen!<br><i>Delion</i>
#. fr: Rayon tracteur<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your UFO, and experience the sensation of an alien abduction.
#. column 1: While appearing to be identical to PuPu's starship, this replica lacks certain functionalities such as a matter duplication facility, which, in light of recent events, is probably for the best. It is also unable to shrink you to a size to fit in the cockpit, meaning you do not so much ride as you are dangled around in its tractor beam.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:290:0:2"
msgid "The <i>Truth</i> receives a large number<br>of reports from readers claiming to have<br>observed unidentified flying objects.<br>   - Delion"
msgstr "Газета <i>«Правда»</i> получает множество<br>писем от читателей, утверждающих,<br>что видели неопознанные летающие объекты.<br>   — Делион"

#. ja: ビネガロンに騎乗する。<br>鉤爪のような顎を持つ、甲鱗綱の大型肉食獣
#. de: Rufe deinen Geißelskorpion herbei. Ein riesiges Schuppentier mit einem klauenähnlichen Maul.
#. fr: Vous appelez un vinaigrier, une gigantesque créature carnivore dont la tête ressemble à une griffe.
#. column 1: While it is common for dragons to use vinegaroons as servants, men have struggled to domesticate the creatures. In recent years, however, the gleaners have developed a successful training method, allowing them to be employed as beasts of burden.
#. column 2: Those vinegaroons are always chasing<br>after us moogles, snapping their bladed<br>jaws and swinging their bladed tails.<br>   - Impatient Moogle
msgctxt "MountTransient:291:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your vinegaroon mount, a carnivorous scalekin with a jaw reminiscent of claws."
msgstr "Призывает винугаруна — плотоядного чешуйчатого зверя с клешнеподобной челюстью."

#. ja: 鉤爪のような顎を持つ、甲鱗綱の大型肉食獣。ドラゴン族の眷属となるケースは多々あれど、人が乗りこなした例は少なかった。しかし近年、グリーナーが物資調達に利用するため、訓練法を編み出したという
#. de: Klauber ersannen eine Methode, dieses wilde Geschöpf zu zähmen, um es sich für die Materialbeschaffung zunutze zu machen.
#. fr: Ces gi<shy>gan<shy>tesques créatures carnivores dont la tête ressemble à une griffe servaient souvent les Dravaniens, mais il était très rare de pouvoir les monter. Cependant, les glaneurs ont récemment mis au point une méthode d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment afin de s'en servir comme moyen de transport pour les livraisons.
#. column 0: Summon forth your vinegaroon mount, a carnivorous scalekin with a jaw reminiscent of claws.
#. column 2: Those vinegaroons are always chasing<br>after us moogles, snapping their bladed<br>jaws and swinging their bladed tails.<br>   - Impatient Moogle
msgctxt "MountTransient:291:0:1"
msgid "While it is common for dragons to use vinegaroons as servants, men have struggled to domesticate the creatures. In recent years, however, the gleaners have developed a successful training method, allowing them to be employed as beasts of burden."
msgstr "Драконы часто используют краклоу как прислугу, однако приручить этих существ людям всегда было непросто. В последние годы собиратели разработали способ успешной дрессировки, и теперь краклоу помогают перевозить грузы."

#. ja: ゴルルルル……
#. de: Ein Geißelskorpion hatte die aufgespießten Ritter als Köder benutzt. <br><i> Eustacia </i>
#. fr: Grrl<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your vinegaroon mount, a carnivorous scalekin with a jaw reminiscent of claws.
#. column 1: While it is common for dragons to use vinegaroons as servants, men have struggled to domesticate the creatures. In recent years, however, the gleaners have developed a successful training method, allowing them to be employed as beasts of burden.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:291:0:2"
msgid "Those vinegaroons are always chasing<br>after us moogles, snapping their bladed<br>jaws and swinging their bladed tails.<br>   - Impatient Moogle"
msgstr "Эти краклоу вечно гоняются<br>за нами, муглями, щёлкают<br>острыми челюстями и машут<br>хвостами с лезвиями.<br>   — Нетерпеливый мугл"

#. ja: オルト・クラックローに騎乗する。<br>オルト・エウレカで発見されたクラックロー
#. de: Rufe deinen Orthos-Kraklaw herbei. Er hat vielleicht an berühmten Schlachten teilgenommen, die in der Geschichte tatsächlich stattgefunden haben, oder auch nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez un craqulov Orthos, un crustacé vivant dans Eurêka Orthos.
#. column 1: Discovered in Eureka Orthos, this specimen of craklaw was imbued with magic in a bid to further harden its carapace. Though that experiment ended in failure, by way of a peculiar side effect, it has attained the power of flight.
#. column 2: What you after? Fish? Crab?<br>   - Eybor
msgctxt "MountTransient:292:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Orthos craklaw. May or may not have participated in famous battles which actually took place in history."
msgstr "Призовите краклоу Ортоса. Может быть, он участвовал в знаменитых битвах, которые и правда вошли в историю."

#. ja: オルト・エウレカで発見されたクラックロー。甲殻の硬度を増すための魔法を付与する実験が行われたのだが、どうやら失敗に終わったようだ。しかし、副作用として、原因不明ながら飛翔能力を獲得したらしい
#. de: Dieses in Eureka Orthos entdeckte Kraklaw-Exemplar wurde mithilfe von Magie verändert, um seinen Panzer weiter zu härten. Das Experiment schlug zwar fehl, aber durch einen merkwürdigen Nebeneffekt hat er die Fähigkeit zu fliegen erlangt.
#. fr: Cette variété de craqulov, habitant dans le dédale d'Eurêka Orthos, est issue d'une expérience allagoise visant à renforcer la solidité de leur carapace. Celle-ci fut un échec, mais eut pour effet secondaire inattendu de leur conférer la capacité de voler.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Orthos craklaw. May or may not have participated in famous battles which actually took place in history.
#. column 2: What you after? Fish? Crab?<br>   - Eybor
msgctxt "MountTransient:292:0:1"
msgid "Discovered in Eureka Orthos, this specimen of craklaw was imbued with magic in a bid to further harden its carapace. Though that experiment ended in failure, by way of a peculiar side effect, it has attained the power of flight."
msgstr "Этого краклоу нашли в Эврике-Ортос. Его наделили магией, чтобы укрепить панцирь, но эксперимент провалился. Зато из-за странного побочного эффекта краклоу научился летать."

#. ja: クラックロー！
#. de: Pssssssh, was glotzt seltsame Krabbenfreund von Großwachsener mit Telleraugen?<br><i>Schlafix</i>
#. fr: Crrraqulov<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Orthos craklaw. May or may not have participated in famous battles which actually took place in history.
#. column 1: Discovered in Eureka Orthos, this specimen of craklaw was imbued with magic in a bid to further harden its carapace. Though that experiment ended in failure, by way of a peculiar side effect, it has attained the power of flight.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:292:0:2"
msgid "What you after? Fish? Crab?<br>   - Eybor"
msgstr "Чего надо? Рыбы? Краба?<br>   — Эйбор"

#. ja: ブルーフェザー・リンクスに騎乗する。<br>不可思議な力を帯びた幻想生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Blaufeder-Luchs herbei. Ein magisches Geschöpf, von dem ein blaues Leuchten ausgeht.
#. fr: Vous appelez un lynx au pelage bleu, un félin débordant d'énergie mystérieuse.
#. column 1: A phantom creation composed of the esoteric power of dynamis. It is believed that the Endsinger brought forth this mysterious entity, but for what purpose is unclear. Could it be a tribute, perhaps, bestowed upon one who has overcome her aria of despair?
#. column 2: The light of hope shall ever<br>guide our steps so long as we<br>have the will to press onward.<br>   - Edmont de Fortemps
msgctxt "MountTransient:293:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your bluefeather lynx mount, which could be what a certain feathered familiar might look like as a large, winged feline."
msgstr "Призовите скакуна «синее перо» — кто знает, вдруг так выглядел бы один пернатый фамильяр, если бы стал огромной крылатой кошкой."

#. ja: デュナミスによって構成された幻想生物の一種。おそらく終焉を謳うものが紡いだ存在と思われるが、いかなる目的によって創造されたのかは定かでない。あるいは終極を超えしものへの賛辞であるのかもしれない
#. de: Ein magisches Geschöpf, das aus Dynamis besteht und vermutlich von der Endsängerin erschaffen wurde. Zu welchem Zweck, bleibt ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Cette entité fantasmagorique a été créée par le dynamis. Nombreux sont ceux à penser que son existence est liée à la chantre de l'ané<shy>an<shy>tis<shy>se<shy>ment, mais nul ne sait réellement dans quel but elle a été créée. Ce pourrait également être une offrande envers ceux ayant surmonté le répons final...
#. column 0: Summon forth your bluefeather lynx mount, which could be what a certain feathered familiar might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 2: The light of hope shall ever<br>guide our steps so long as we<br>have the will to press onward.<br>   - Edmont de Fortemps
msgctxt "MountTransient:293:0:1"
msgid "A phantom creation composed of the esoteric power of dynamis. It is believed that the Endsinger brought forth this mysterious entity, but for what purpose is unclear. Could it be a tribute, perhaps, bestowed upon one who has overcome her aria of despair?"
msgstr "Это фантастическое существо состоит из загадочной силы динамиса. Считается, что его создала Певица Последнего Дня, но зачем — неизвестно. Может, это подарок тому, кто одолел её скорбную арию?"

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ginu Vanu-ooh ist entzückt über Federn blau wie wolkenloser Himmel!<br><i>Ginu Vanu</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your bluefeather lynx mount, which could be what a certain feathered familiar might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 1: A phantom creation composed of the esoteric power of dynamis. It is believed that the Endsinger brought forth this mysterious entity, but for what purpose is unclear. Could it be a tribute, perhaps, bestowed upon one who has overcome her aria of despair?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:293:0:2"
msgid "The light of hope shall ever<br>guide our steps so long as we<br>have the will to press onward.<br>   - Edmont de Fortemps"
msgstr "Надежды свет будут освещать<br>нам путь, пока мы не утратим<br>воли идти вперёд.<br>   — Эдмон де Форте"

#. ja: 大柴犬に騎乗する。<br>すくすくと育って大きくなった柴犬の成犬
#. de: Rufe deinen Megashiba herbei. Offensichtlich etwas größer als der Mameshiba.
#. fr: Vous appelez un mégashiba, un shiba ayant eu une croissance ex<shy>traor<shy>di<shy>nai<shy>re.
#. column 1: Sold as a “mameshiba,” a nonexistent miniature Far Eastern dog, this creature continued to grow until it was larger than a man. But despite its prodigious size, it has somehow retained its cuteness, which it combines with the practicality of being ridable.
#. column 2: He's so fluffy!<br>   - T'maritaa
msgctxt "MountTransient:294:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your megashiba mount─fluffy, living proof that massive can still be adorable."
msgstr "Призовите мегасиба — пушистое доказательство того, что огромный размер не мешает быть очаровательным."

#. ja: 成犬になっても小さい「豆柴」として販売されていた柴犬の幼犬が、気がついたら人をも超える巨体へと成長していた。しかし、いかに大きくなろうと、その愛らしさに変わりなし。むしろ騎乗できるぶん活躍の幅は広がっている
#. de: Ursprünglich als Mameshiba-Welpe im Handel angeboten wuchs dieser Shiba zu stattlicher Größe heran. Jetzt ist er nicht mehr klein, aber dafür umso knuffiger.
#. fr: D'abord vendu en tant que mame shiba, un shiba restant de petite taille à l'âge adulte, celui-ci s'est transformé en un chien gigantesque avant même que l'on s'en aperçoive. Sa taille imposante ne l'empêche pas d'être toujours aussi adorable, et on lui trouve même un côté pratique en s'en servant comme moyen de transport.
#. column 0: Summon forth your megashiba mount─fluffy, living proof that massive can still be adorable.
#. column 2: He's so fluffy!<br>   - T'maritaa
msgctxt "MountTransient:294:0:1"
msgid "Sold as a “mameshiba,” a nonexistent miniature Far Eastern dog, this creature continued to grow until it was larger than a man. But despite its prodigious size, it has somehow retained its cuteness, which it combines with the practicality of being ridable."
msgstr "Щенков сиба-ину продавали под видом «мамэсиба» — карликовых восточных собачек, которых на самом деле не существует. Но щенок продолжал расти и в итоге стал выше человека. И всё же даже такой великан не растерял своего очарования, а теперь на нём ещё и можно ездить."

#. ja: わおーん！
#. de: Der Größte unter den Shiba!<br><i>Hundezüchter</i>
#. fr: Aouuuh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your megashiba mount─fluffy, living proof that massive can still be adorable.
#. column 1: Sold as a “mameshiba,” a nonexistent miniature Far Eastern dog, this creature continued to grow until it was larger than a man. But despite its prodigious size, it has somehow retained its cuteness, which it combines with the practicality of being ridable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:294:0:2"
msgid "He's so fluffy!<br>   - T'maritaa"
msgstr "Какой пушистый!<br>   — Т'марита"

#. ja: トラベリングサポーターに騎乗する。<br>高度なテクノロジーが用いられた二足歩行機械
#. de: Rufe deinen Reise-Support herbei. Die Wunder der Technik!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre unité de voyage accompagné, une machine bipède issue d'une technologie de pointe.
#. column 1: This advanced bipedal machina was found wandering the Carteneau Flats by a quartermaster of the Eorzean Alliance. While it bears a striking resemblance to Allagan clockwork soldiers, it appears to have been enhanced by unknown hands (or paws).
#. column 2: The supporter? I never would have<br>suspected... It's supposed to help us<br>farm carrots, not eat them!<br>   - Watchingway
msgctxt "MountTransient:297:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your traveling supporter. Proof that there is nothing a pair of bunny ears can't improve."
msgstr "Призовите странствующего помощника. Вот доказательство того, что пара заячьих ушек может сделать лучше что угодно."

#. ja: 高度なテクノロジーで作られた二足歩行機械。カルテノー平原にて彷徨っていた本機を、都市軍事同盟の物資調達担当者が発見、回収した。古代アラグ文明の機械歩兵と酷似しているが、何者かの手で改造された形跡が見られる
#. de: Diese zweibeinige Maschine ist das Ergebnis von jahrelanger Forschung und der Zusammenkunft von Technik und Handwerk. Es wurde von einem Klauber der Allianz dabei beobachtet, wie es in der Carteneauer Heide umherirrte und prompt eingesammelt. Eine Analyse ergab, dass es eine erstaunliche Ähnlichkeit mit allagischen Maschinensoldaten aufweist, jedoch durch irgendetwas oder irgendwen umgebaut wurde.
#. fr: Véritable concentré de technologie, ce robot bipède a été découvert sur la plaine de Carteneau par un ravitailleur de l'Alliance éorzéenne. Il ressemble beaucoup aux anciens soldats mécaniques allagois, mais comporte plusieurs pièces personnalisées.
#. column 0: Summon forth your traveling supporter. Proof that there is nothing a pair of bunny ears can't improve.
#. column 2: The supporter? I never would have<br>suspected... It's supposed to help us<br>farm carrots, not eat them!<br>   - Watchingway
msgctxt "MountTransient:297:0:1"
msgid "This advanced bipedal machina was found wandering the Carteneau Flats by a quartermaster of the Eorzean Alliance. While it bears a striking resemblance to Allagan clockwork soldiers, it appears to have been enhanced by unknown hands (or paws)."
msgstr "Эту высокотехнологичную двуногую машину обнаружил на равнине Картено интендант Эорзейского альянса. Она поразительно похожа на аллаганских механических солдат, но, похоже, неизвестные руки (или лапы) её усовершенствовали."

#. ja: エラー！　エラー！
#. de: Fehler! Fehler!
#. fr: Erreur<nbsp>! Erreur<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your traveling supporter. Proof that there is nothing a pair of bunny ears can't improve.
#. column 1: This advanced bipedal machina was found wandering the Carteneau Flats by a quartermaster of the Eorzean Alliance. While it bears a striking resemblance to Allagan clockwork soldiers, it appears to have been enhanced by unknown hands (or paws).
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:297:0:2"
msgid "The supporter? I never would have<br>suspected... It's supposed to help us<br>farm carrots, not eat them!<br>   - Watchingway"
msgstr "Помощник? Да я бы никогда<br>не подумал... Он же должен помогать<br>нам выращивать морковку, а не есть её!<br>   — Вотчингвей"

#. ja: ミゥ・ミーシュに騎乗する。<br>ウルティマ・トゥーレで生まれた新生命体。希望の申し子
#. de: Rufe deine Miw Miisv herbei. Ein glitzernder Beweis dafür, dass Hoffnung unerwartete Formen annehmen kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez une miw miisv, une créature née à Ultima Thulé toujours prête à donner un coup de tentacule pour vous remonter le moral.
#. column 1: Born at Elysion from the hopes of the Ea, this peculiar dynamis life-form possesses a semi-transparent body reminiscent of a jellyfish, and can deliver a sting of sorts with the lightning it harbors. There is no greater pleasure for it than to connect with others in the microcosm of its heart. Literally.
#. column 2: Just like jellyfish, they jump, jerk,<br>and jolt to jiggle themselves up.<br>   - Wawalago
msgctxt "MountTransient:298:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Miw Miisv, living proof that hope springs eternal─and in unexpected shapes."
msgstr "Призовите Мив Миисв — живое доказательство того, что надежда не умирает и принимает самые неожиданные формы."

#. ja: イーア族の想いを糧に新星エリュシオンで誕生した、新たなるデュナミス生命体。クラゲに似た半透明の肉体に、雷気放射能力を備える。好奇心旺盛で、心の小宇宙で他者の想いと触れ合うことに無垢なる喜びを感じているらしい
#. de: Das Dynamis kanalisierte die Hoffnungen der Ea auf Elysium und schuf diese quirlige, quallenartige Lebensform. Zwar besitzen sie die Fähigkeit, kräftige Stromstöße auszuteilen, viel lieber jedoch vergnügen sie sich damit, sich die Gedanken und Gefühle anderer Lebewesen im wahrsten Sinne des Wortes einzuverleiben.
#. fr: Une nouvelle forme de vie d'Élysée, issue de la réaction du dynamis aux souhaits des Éas. Ressemblant à celui d'une méduse, son corps translucide est capable de produire des décharges d'électricité. Incroyablement curieuse, elle affectionne tout par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement de partager les sentiments de ceux qui visitent son microcosme intérieur.
#. column 0: Summon forth Miw Miisv, living proof that hope springs eternal─and in unexpected shapes.
#. column 2: Just like jellyfish, they jump, jerk,<br>and jolt to jiggle themselves up.<br>   - Wawalago
msgctxt "MountTransient:298:0:1"
msgid "Born at Elysion from the hopes of the Ea, this peculiar dynamis life-form possesses a semi-transparent body reminiscent of a jellyfish, and can deliver a sting of sorts with the lightning it harbors. There is no greater pleasure for it than to connect with others in the microcosm of its heart. Literally."
msgstr "Родившись в Элизионе из надежд эа, эта необычная форма жизни из динамиса обзавелась полупрозрачным телом, похожим на медузу, и умеет жалить молниями. Больше всего на свете она любит соприкасаться с другими в микрокосме своего сердца. В буквальном смысле."

#. ja: ミミ、ミミミ！
#. de: Mi-Mimiii～♪
#. fr: Mimi, mimimi<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Miw Miisv, living proof that hope springs eternal─and in unexpected shapes.
#. column 1: Born at Elysion from the hopes of the Ea, this peculiar dynamis life-form possesses a semi-transparent body reminiscent of a jellyfish, and can deliver a sting of sorts with the lightning it harbors. There is no greater pleasure for it than to connect with others in the microcosm of its heart. Literally.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:298:0:2"
msgid "Just like jellyfish, they jump, jerk,<br>and jolt to jiggle themselves up.<br>   - Wawalago"
msgstr "Как медузы, они прыгают,<br>дёргаются, трясутся —<br>и так подпрыгивают.<br>   — Вавалаго"

#. ja: ワンダラスラナーに騎乗する。<br>ある女商人に祝福された大隼。空想帳の物語が好きらしい
#. de: Rufe deinen Wunderlanner herbei. Ein stolzer Falke mit einer Vorliebe für fantastische Erzählungen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre lanier merveilleux, un oiseau colossal friand d'histoires ex<shy>traor<shy>di<shy>nai<shy>res.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress Rowena, this enchanted falcon has led a pampered life. Able to comprehend language, it loved nothing more than to listen to Khloe Aliapoh's tales, whose heroic protagonist it aspired to bear upon its back─in contest with another of Rowena's pets.
#. column 2: I doubt even my falcons<br>could keep pace with it.<br>   - Yugiri
msgctxt "MountTransient:299:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wondrous lanner, a proud bird with a fondness for fantastical tales."
msgstr "Призовите чудесного ланнера — гордую птицу, которая обожает фантастические истории."

#. ja: 商人「ロウェナ」による祝福を受け、贅沢な暮らしをしてきた大隼。人語をよく解し、クロ・アリアポーの物語を日々の楽しみとしていた。同じ境遇の妖馬とは、どちらが冒険譚の英雄の相棒に相応しいか、競い合う関係らしい
#. de: Als ehemaliger Gefährte der Händlerin Rowena wurde dieser stolze Falke wie ein Juwel gehegt und gepflegt. Da er der Sprache seiner Halter mächtig ist, lauschte er gerne Khloe Aliapohs Geschichten von tapferen Abenteurern. Es heißt, seither strebe er danach, ein gewisses, weißes Pferd in seiner Rolle als treues Reittier zu übertreffen.
#. fr: Après avoir été longuement choyé par sa maîtresse Rowena, ce faucon géant a acquis la maîtrise de la langue des humains en écoutant les histoires de Khloe Aliapoh. Inspiré par leur résonance héroïque, il s'est ensuite décidé à porter sur son dos des aventuriers dignes d'en être les protagonistes.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wondrous lanner, a proud bird with a fondness for fantastical tales.
#. column 2: I doubt even my falcons<br>could keep pace with it.<br>   - Yugiri
msgctxt "MountTransient:299:0:1"
msgid "Under the patronage of its mistress Rowena, this enchanted falcon has led a pampered life. Able to comprehend language, it loved nothing more than to listen to Khloe Aliapoh's tales, whose heroic protagonist it aspired to bear upon its back─in contest with another of Rowena's pets."
msgstr "Этого волшебного сокола хозяйка, торговка Ровена, ни в чём не знала отказа. Он понимал человеческую речь и с удовольствием слушал истории Хлои Алиапо. Сокол мечтал носить на спине героя этих сказаний — и соперничал в этом с другим любимцем Ровены."

#. ja: ヒューッ
#. de: Umsonst bekommst du bei mir nichts.<br><i>Rowena</i>
#. fr: Piuuuuu<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your wondrous lanner, a proud bird with a fondness for fantastical tales.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress Rowena, this enchanted falcon has led a pampered life. Able to comprehend language, it loved nothing more than to listen to Khloe Aliapoh's tales, whose heroic protagonist it aspired to bear upon its back─in contest with another of Rowena's pets.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:299:0:2"
msgid "I doubt even my falcons<br>could keep pace with it.<br>   - Yugiri"
msgstr "Сомневаюсь, что даже мои соколы<br>смогли бы за ним угнаться.<br>   — Югири"

#. ja: マジックアンブレラに騎乗する。<br>ある魔女が造り出した魔法の空飛ぶ雨傘
#. de: Rufe deinen magischen Regenschirm herbei, mit dem du bei jedem Wetter sicher abheben kannst.
#. fr: Vous appelez un parapluie volant, enchanté par une sorcière talentueuse.
#. column 1: This flying umbrella was created by a certain elderly mage in her youth. It uses a black umbrella as the base, the better for blending into the night and sneaking into the Great Gubal Library from above. Its creator, it would seem, has always had a rebellious streak.
#. column 2: You can stand under<br>my umbrella.<br>   - Kindly Maiden
msgctxt "MountTransient:300:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your magicked umbrella to whisk you off your feet in the most delightful way."
msgstr "Призовите зачарованный зонт и поднимитесь в небо самым приятным образом."

#. ja: ある年老いた魔女が若き日に造り出した、魔法の飛行傘。閉館中のグブラ幻想図書館に上空から忍び込むために、闇夜に溶け込みやすい黒い雨傘を利用して作られている。どうやら製作者は今も昔も、反骨心溢れる性格だったらしい
#. de: Diesen fliegenden Regenschirm hat eine gewisse ältere Magierin in ihrer Jugend erschaffen. Als Basis dient ein schwarzer Regenschirm, der mit dem Nachthimmel verschmilzt und es ermöglicht, sich von oben in die Große Gubal-Bibliothek zu schleichen. Seine Schöpferin scheint eine rebellische Ader gehabt zu haben.
#. fr: Ce parapluie a reçu un sort de lévitation mis au point par une vénérable sorcière durant ses jeunes années. Sa toile opaque étant parfaite pour se fondre dans l'obscurité, il lui aurait servi à pénétrer furtivement dans la Grande bibliothèque de Gubal durant les horaires de fermeture. Le caractère anticonformiste de sa créatrice ne semble pas avoir disparu avec le temps...
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked umbrella to whisk you off your feet in the most delightful way.
#. column 2: You can stand under<br>my umbrella.<br>   - Kindly Maiden
msgctxt "MountTransient:300:0:1"
msgid "This flying umbrella was created by a certain elderly mage in her youth. It uses a black umbrella as the base, the better for blending into the night and sneaking into the Great Gubal Library from above. Its creator, it would seem, has always had a rebellious streak."
msgstr "Этот летающий зонт создала одна пожилая волшебница в юности. За основу она взяла чёрный зонт, чтобы тот сливался с ночной тьмой и позволял тайком проникать в Большую библиотеку Губала сверху. Похоже, бунтарский дух создательницы с годами никуда не делся."

#. ja: バサッ！
#. de: Ich habe es versäumt, Biggs und Wedge anzuweisen, meine Klimaabschirmung zu verbessern.<br><i>Omega</i>
#. fr: Fiouuu<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked umbrella to whisk you off your feet in the most delightful way.
#. column 1: This flying umbrella was created by a certain elderly mage in her youth. It uses a black umbrella as the base, the better for blending into the night and sneaking into the Great Gubal Library from above. Its creator, it would seem, has always had a rebellious streak.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:300:0:2"
msgid "You can stand under<br>my umbrella.<br>   - Kindly Maiden"
msgstr "Под моим зонтом<br>тебе найдётся место.<br>   — Добрая девушка"

#. ja: マジックパラソルに騎乗する。<br>ある魔女が造り出した魔法の空飛ぶ日傘
#. de: Rufe deinen magischen Parasol herbei und die ganze Welt wird dir zu Füßen liegen.
#. fr: Vous appelez un parasol volant, enchanté par une sorcière brillante.
#. column 1: This flying parasol was created by a certain elderly mage in her youth. Intending to sell them en masse to fund her research, she chose a pink parasol─popular in those days─as the base. Due to the need for considerable magical power and grip strength to use them, however, she experienced only modest success.
#. column 2: Perhaps you'll need a parasol<br>the next time you visit!<br>   - Sparkling-eyed Loporrit
msgctxt "MountTransient:301:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your magicked parasol, and have the whole world at your feet."
msgstr "Призовите зачарованный парасол и окажитесь у всех на виду."

#. ja: ある年老いた魔女が若き日に造り出した、魔法の飛行傘。研究費を稼ぐために、当時人気だったピンク色の日傘を利用して作られている。しかし、使いこなすには相応の魔力と握力が必要であり、大儲けとはならなかったという
#. de: Diesen fliegenden Parasol hat eine gewisse ältere Magierin in ihrer Jugend erschaffen. Sie wollte ihn massenhaft verkaufen, um ihre Forschungen zu finanzieren, und wählte als Basis einen damals sehr beliebten rosa Sonnenschirm. Da die Verwendung der Schirme jedoch erhebliche magische Kräfte und eine hohe Griffstärke erfordert, hatte sie nur mäßigen Erfolg.
#. fr: Ce parasol a reçu un sort de lévitation mis au point par une vénérable sorcière durant ses jeunes années. Sa créatrice aurait eu cette idée afin de financer ses recherches, choisissant un coloris rose, très en vogue à l'époque, afin d'augmenter ses profits. Une stratégie qui ne s'est pas avérée aussi payante que prévu, étant donné le haut degré de maîtrise magique nécessaire pour diriger l'objet.
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked parasol, and have the whole world at your feet.
#. column 2: Perhaps you'll need a parasol<br>the next time you visit!<br>   - Sparkling-eyed Loporrit
msgctxt "MountTransient:301:0:1"
msgid "This flying parasol was created by a certain elderly mage in her youth. Intending to sell them en masse to fund her research, she chose a pink parasol─popular in those days─as the base. Due to the need for considerable magical power and grip strength to use them, however, she experienced only modest success."
msgstr "Этот летающий парасол создала одна пожилая волшебница в юности. Она хотела продавать их в больших количествах, чтобы оплачивать исследования, и взяла за основу розовый парасол, модный в те времена. Но для управления им требовались немалая магическая сила и крепкие руки, так что большого успеха затея не принесла."

#. ja: パラッ！
#. de: Bringst du mir dann einen eurer ulkigen „Regenschirme“ vorbei?<br><i>Wolkenweißer Loporrit</i>
#. fr: Ziouuu<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked parasol, and have the whole world at your feet.
#. column 1: This flying parasol was created by a certain elderly mage in her youth. Intending to sell them en masse to fund her research, she chose a pink parasol─popular in those days─as the base. Due to the need for considerable magical power and grip strength to use them, however, she experienced only modest success.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:301:0:2"
msgid "Perhaps you'll need a parasol<br>the next time you visit!<br>   - Sparkling-eyed Loporrit"
msgstr "Может, когда в следующий раз<br>заглянешь, захватишь парасол?<br>   — Лопоррит с блестящими глазами"

#. ja: ミラージュ・ブリッツェンに騎乗する。<br>ブリッツェンが紡いだ幻影のトナカイ。人々に歓びをもたらす
#. de: Rufe deinen Sternenlicht-Blitzen herbei. Allein sein Anblick vermag es jung und alt mit aufrichtiger Freude zu erfüllen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Blitzen illusoire, un spectre de renne conjuré par le Blitzen original. Il adore épater la galerie.
#. column 1: The reindeer Blitzen, visiting from Sharlayan, gifted you this ridable glamour as a show of gratitude for your kind aid. From the creature itself to the presents, all is recreated in such impressive detail that it could only be considered a Starlight miracle.
#. column 2: It's a Starlight miracle!<br>   - Nalipponcque
msgctxt "MountTransient:302:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Starlight steed, which, despite being an illusion, can bring very real joy to one and all."
msgstr "Призовите звёздного коня. Он всего лишь иллюзия, но радость от него самая настоящая."

#. ja: シャーレアンからやって来たトナカイ、ブリッツェンが、心通わせた冒険者のために紡いだ幻影。姿形から子どもたちに贈るプレゼントの幻影にいたるまで、何から何まで本物そっくり。これも星芒祭が起こした奇跡なのかもしれない
#. de: Dieses prächtige Rentier stammt aus Sharlayan und bietet dir als Dank für deine Hilfe seine Dienste an. Es selbst mag eine Illusion sein, doch der Freude, die das Herz bei einem Ritt auf seinem Rücken durch den winterlichen Sternenhimmel überkommt, kann sich gewiss niemand erwehren.
#. fr: Le renne Blitzen, de passage à Gridania pour la fête des étoiles, s'est tellement pris d'affection pour vous qu'il vous a laissé ce spectre en cadeau. C'est une copie très fidèle à l'original, capable d'invoquer des illusions à son tour, pour le plaisir des grands et des petits.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Starlight steed, which, despite being an illusion, can bring very real joy to one and all.
#. column 2: It's a Starlight miracle!<br>   - Nalipponcque
msgctxt "MountTransient:302:0:1"
msgid "The reindeer Blitzen, visiting from Sharlayan, gifted you this ridable glamour as a show of gratitude for your kind aid. From the creature itself to the presents, all is recreated in such impressive detail that it could only be considered a Starlight miracle."
msgstr "Северный олень Блицен прибыл из Шарлаяна и в благодарность за вашу доброту подарил вам эту иллюзорную копию себя, на которой можно ездить верхом. И он сам, и подарки, которые раздаёт, воссозданы с поразительной точностью. Настоящее чудо Звёздного праздника!"

#. ja: ぐぅぉぉ！
#. de: Los, Blitzen! Offenbare diesem Mädchen den Geist des Sternenlichtfests!<br><i>Laurenssen</i>
#. fr: Mwuoooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Starlight steed, which, despite being an illusion, can bring very real joy to one and all.
#. column 1: The reindeer Blitzen, visiting from Sharlayan, gifted you this ridable glamour as a show of gratitude for your kind aid. From the creature itself to the presents, all is recreated in such impressive detail that it could only be considered a Starlight miracle.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:302:0:2"
msgid "It's a Starlight miracle!<br>   - Nalipponcque"
msgstr "Настоящее чудо Звёздного праздника!<br>   — Налиппонк"

#. ja: シラディン・スローンに騎乗する。<br>シラディハ遺構にて発見された空飛ぶ魔法の玉座
#. de: Rufe deinen Thron von Sil'dih herbei. Einst im Besitz der Herrscher von Sil'dih, ist er nun bereit, ein heldenhaftes Gesäß auf sich zu betten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre trône sildien, un siège flottant découvert dans les ruines d'un ancien palais.
#. column 1: Discovered in a sector of the Sil'dihn Subterrane, this magnificent throne is believed to have been a spare. It moves in response to its master's will, but whether it does so via the spirits of Sil'dihns long dead or simple magicks is unknown.
#. column 2: H-How could you mistake me for<br>that overstuffed throne-warmer!?<br>   - Moghan
msgctxt "MountTransient:303:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Sil'dihn throne. Once seating the rulers of Sil'dih, it now serves as your personal mode of transport."
msgstr "Призовите силдийский трон. Когда-то на нём восседали правители Силь'диха, а теперь он служит вам средством передвижения."

#. ja: 地下水道から続くシラディハ遺構の一画にて発見された、予備品と思しき玉座。亡国民の思念のせいなのか、あるいは元より飛行させる意図で魔法を込められていたかは定かでないが、主の想いに反応してフヨフヨと浮遊する
#. de: Ein reich verzierter Thron, der den Großteil seines Daseins in einer verstaubten Ersatzteilkammer der Unterstadt von Sil'dih abgesessen haben soll. Niemand weiß, ob es der Wille seines Reiters oder bloße Magie ist, die ihn so zielsicher durch die Lüfte lenkt.
#. fr: Ce trône (sans doute un meuble de rechange) se trouvait dans les vestiges du palais de Sil'dih, à la sortie des canalisations de l'ancienne cité. Il répondra à vos pensées en s'élevant dans les airs, sans que l'on sache s'il a été conçu ainsi, ou s'il est possédé par l'esprit des défunts...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Sil'dihn throne. Once seating the rulers of Sil'dih, it now serves as your personal mode of transport.
#. column 2: H-How could you mistake me for<br>that overstuffed throne-warmer!?<br>   - Moghan
msgctxt "MountTransient:303:0:1"
msgid "Discovered in a sector of the Sil'dihn Subterrane, this magnificent throne is believed to have been a spare. It moves in response to its master's will, but whether it does so via the spirits of Sil'dihns long dead or simple magicks is unknown."
msgstr "Этот великолепный трон нашли в одной из частей Подземелья Силь'дих; считается, что он был запасным. Он движется по воле хозяина, но неизвестно, благодаря ли этому духам давно умерших жителей Силь'диха или обычной магии."

#. ja: スローン！
#. de: Wer letztlich auf dem Thron sitzen wird, ist nicht so wichtig.<br><i>Sylvetrel</i>
#. fr: Sombre histoire, triste mélo...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Sil'dihn throne. Once seating the rulers of Sil'dih, it now serves as your personal mode of transport.
#. column 1: Discovered in a sector of the Sil'dihn Subterrane, this magnificent throne is believed to have been a spare. It moves in response to its master's will, but whether it does so via the spirits of Sil'dihns long dead or simple magicks is unknown.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:303:0:2"
msgid "H-How could you mistake me for<br>that overstuffed throne-warmer!?<br>   - Moghan"
msgstr "К-Как ты мог принять меня<br>за эту зажравшуюся сидушку!?<br>   — Моган"

#. ja: シルキーに騎乗する。<br>かつてウルダハ王宮で用いられていた、お掃除使い魔
#. de: Rufe deine Silkie herbei. Reinlich wie ein Rättchen mit seidig weichem Pelz.
#. fr: Vous appelez Silkie, l'ancien familier de ménage du palais sacré d'Ul'dah.
#. column 1: Encountered in the depths of the Sil'dihn Subterrane, this arcane entity was the familiar of former sultana Nanasha Ul Nasha, who created it to keep the royal palace squeaky clean. Contrary to its appearance, the pom on the tail is the actual being rather than the mouselike creature.
#. column 2: I'm countin' on ye to<br>clean up this mess.<br>   - Bloeidin
msgctxt "MountTransient:304:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your silkie mount. Because cleanliness is next to cuteness."
msgstr "Призовите Силки. Чистота — почти такая же прелесть, как и милота."

#. ja: シラディハ水道の奥地で遭遇した魔法生物。その正体は、綺麗好きだった先王妃ナナシャ・ウル・ナシャが、ウルダハ王宮を隅々まで清掃するために生み出した使い魔である。なお、ポンポンこそが本体であるらしい
#. de: Dieses geheimnisvolle Wesen wurde in der Unterstadt von Sil'dih gefunden und diente einst der ehemaligen Sultana Nanasha Ul Nasha als puschelige Putzhilfe. Ihr großer weicher Bommel kann nicht nur jede Menge Schaum zur Politur von Palastböden produzieren, sondern scheint auch der eigentliche Körper der Silkie sein.
#. fr: Une créature magique croisée au fond des canalisations sildiennes. Il s'agit en réalité d'un familier de ménage créé par la très maniaque ancienne sultane Nanasha Ul Nasha, afin de nettoyer le palais d'Ul'dah du sol au plafond. À noter que la plupart de ses fonctions motrices résident dans son pompon et non dans son corps.
#. column 0: Summon forth your silkie mount. Because cleanliness is next to cuteness.
#. column 2: I'm countin' on ye to<br>clean up this mess.<br>   - Bloeidin
msgctxt "MountTransient:304:0:1"
msgid "Encountered in the depths of the Sil'dihn Subterrane, this arcane entity was the familiar of former sultana Nanasha Ul Nasha, who created it to keep the royal palace squeaky clean. Contrary to its appearance, the pom on the tail is the actual being rather than the mouselike creature."
msgstr "Это магическое существо нашли в глубинах Подземелья Силь'дих. Когда-то оно служило фамильяром бывшей султанши Нанаши Ул Наши, которая создала его, чтобы вычистить королевский дворец до блеска. Вопреки внешнему виду, настоящее существо — это помпон на хвосте, а не мышеподобная зверушка."

#. ja: キュッキュッキュッ！
#. de: Damit geht die Arbeit leicht von der Hand, aber mit Putzen allein ist es noch nicht getan.<br><i>Luquelot</i>
#. fr: Squick squick squick<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your silkie mount. Because cleanliness is next to cuteness.
#. column 1: Encountered in the depths of the Sil'dihn Subterrane, this arcane entity was the familiar of former sultana Nanasha Ul Nasha, who created it to keep the royal palace squeaky clean. Contrary to its appearance, the pom on the tail is the actual being rather than the mouselike creature.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:304:0:2"
msgid "I'm countin' on ye to<br>clean up this mess.<br>   - Bloeidin"
msgstr "Рассчитываю на тебя: приберись<br>тут как следует.<br>   — Блоэйдин"

#. ja: 炎霊獣に騎乗する。<br>ヘファイストスが創造した炎の幻想生物。その炎は主を焼かない
#. de: Rufe deine Glutgeborene herbei. Aber verbrenn dich nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre bête en flammes, une créature qui calcine tout sur son passage, excepté son maître.
#. column 1: A product of the genius mind of Hephaistos, this fiery phantom creation combines two concepts─a flying snake and an immortal bird─and can shapeshift as the situation demands. Only the individual it recognizes as its master may ride it unscathed.
#. column 2: It tastes like burning...<br>   - Hapless Boy
msgctxt "MountTransient:305:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your sunforged. Its searing flames consume all─with the exception of its owner, thankfully."
msgstr "Призовите солнечного скакуна. Его палящее пламя испепеляет всё — кроме хозяина, к счастью."

#. ja: ヘファイストスが創造した炎の幻想生物。「飛蛇」と「不死鳥」という2種の幻想生物のイデアを炎の中に封じ込めてあるため、状況に応じて適した形態を採ることができる。その炎は主と認めた者を焼くことはないという
#. de: Die Glutgeborene ist eine von Hephaistos geschaffene Kreuzung aus dem Phoinix und einem Lindwurm. Das Konzept ist stark feueraspektiert, aber wen die Glutgeborene einmal als Reiter akzeptiert, den verbrennen ihre Flammen nicht.
#. fr: Issue du cerveau génial d'Héphaïstos, la bête en flammes est le résultat de la fusion de deux entités fantasmagoriques<nbsp>: le serpent volant et l'oiseau immortel. Seule la personne qu'elle reconnaît comme son maître peut la chevaucher sans être brûlée vive.
#. column 0: Summon forth your sunforged. Its searing flames consume all─with the exception of its owner, thankfully.
#. column 2: It tastes like burning...<br>   - Hapless Boy
msgctxt "MountTransient:305:0:1"
msgid "A product of the genius mind of Hephaistos, this fiery phantom creation combines two concepts─a flying snake and an immortal bird─and can shapeshift as the situation demands. Only the individual it recognizes as its master may ride it unscathed."
msgstr "Это огненное фантастическое создание — творение гения Гефеста. В нём соединились два образа: летающего змея и бессмертной птицы. Оно может менять облик по обстоятельствам. Оседлать его без ожогов может лишь тот, кого оно признаёт хозяином."

#. ja: ゴウゴウ！
#. de: Unser Leben ist kurz wie ein Funke in der Glut.<br><i>Thordan</i>
#. fr: Gwaaaah<nbsp>!!
#. column 0: Summon forth your sunforged. Its searing flames consume all─with the exception of its owner, thankfully.
#. column 1: A product of the genius mind of Hephaistos, this fiery phantom creation combines two concepts─a flying snake and an immortal bird─and can shapeshift as the situation demands. Only the individual it recognizes as its master may ride it unscathed.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:305:0:2"
msgid "It tastes like burning...<br>   - Hapless Boy"
msgstr "На вкус как горелое...<br>   — Несчастный мальчик"

#. ja: リンクス・オブ・ウィンドに騎乗する。<br>妖しき風属性のエーテルを帯びた幻想生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Sturmwind-Luchs herbei. Eine Raubkatze mit dem un<shy>be<shy>rechen<shy>baren Temperament des Windes.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre lynx des vents tempétueux, un félin ayant émergé des bourrasques malfaisantes du treizième reflet.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards astral wind. Its blustery wings call to mind the caprice of Barbariccia, archfiend of wind, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in unrelenting storms.
#. column 2: Motes against the tempest.<br>In vain do they struggle...<br>   - Sonu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:306:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lynx of imperious wind, which could be what a certain tempestuous archfiend might look like as a large, winged feline."
msgstr "Призовите рысь властного ветра — вот как могла бы выглядеть одна буйная архидемоница, будь она огромной крылатой кошкой."

#. ja: エーテルによって構成された幻想生物の一種であり、闇にも近しい風属性の力を帯びている。その荒々しい翼には異界ヴォイドの妖異に似た力も感じられるが、いずれにせよ、この使い魔の来歴は未だに判明していない
#. de: Wäre Elementarfürstin Barbarizia unter anderen Umständen geboren, womöglich sähe sie aus wie dieser aus Äther geschaffene Luchs. Ein einziger Schlag seiner Schwingen entfacht einen Wind so mächtig, als käme er direkt aus dem Nichts, doch woher genau sie ihn in diese Welt trugen, ist unbekannt.
#. fr: Ce lynx a la particularité d'être né dans les tempêtes sauvages du néant et de ses prédominantes Ténèbres. Il est ainsi logiquement devenu le chouchou de Barbariccia, la maîtresse du vent, mais ses origines concrètes sont toujours empreintes de mystère.
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of imperious wind, which could be what a certain tempestuous archfiend might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 2: Motes against the tempest.<br>In vain do they struggle...<br>   - Sonu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:306:0:1"
msgid "A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards astral wind. Its blustery wings call to mind the caprice of Barbariccia, archfiend of wind, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in unrelenting storms."
msgstr "Это фантастическое создание, в котором преобладает астральная стихия ветра. Его штормовые крылья напоминают о своенравии Барбариччи, архидемоницы ветра, но происхождение этого фамильяра скрыто за нескончаемыми бурями."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Sonu-ooh ist verblüfft wie nach Blitz in blauem Himmel!<br><i>Sonu Vanu</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of imperious wind, which could be what a certain tempestuous archfiend might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards astral wind. Its blustery wings call to mind the caprice of Barbariccia, archfiend of wind, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in unrelenting storms.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:306:0:2"
msgid "Motes against the tempest.<br>In vain do they struggle...<br>   - Sonu Vanu"
msgstr "Перед бурей — лишь пылинки.<br>Напрасно они бьются...<br>   — Сона Вану"

#. ja: アエテルナエに騎乗する。<br>生命力が非常に強い古代アラグの軍用獣
#. de: Rufe deine Aeturna herbei, eine imposante Raubkatze, die weit mehr als die üblichen neun Leben besitzt.
#. fr: Vous appelez Aeturna, un félin à l'espérance de vie très longue et utilisé au combat par les allagois.
#. column 1: During an expedition to Ilsabard in his younger years, Emperor Xande is said to have come upon this fearsome beast. As its name, meaning “eternal,” would suggest, it possesses remarkable vitality, and in addition to serving as an armored warbeast, it was also a subject in the Allagans' research into immortality.
#. column 2: Eternal life can be yours,<br>ladies and gentlemen!<br>   - Silver-tongued Broker
msgctxt "MountTransient:308:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the aeturna, an imposing feline that boasts far more than the standard nine lives."
msgstr "Призовите аэтерну — внушительную кошку, которой и девять жизней мало."

#. ja: 若かりし頃の始皇帝ザンデが、イルサバード遠征の道中で遭遇したとされる野獣。「永遠」を意味する名からもわかるように生命力が非常に強く、装甲をまとわせた上で軍用獣とされたほか、不死化の研究にも利用されたらしい
#. de: Während einer Expedition nach Ilsabard in seinen jungen Jahren soll Kaiser Xande auf diese furchterregende Bestie gestoßen sein. Wie ihr Name, der „ewig“ bedeutet, vermuten lässt, besitzt sie eine bemerkenswerte Vitalität und diente den Allaganern nicht nur als gepanzertes Kriegstier, sondern auch zur Erforschung der Unsterblichkeit.
#. fr: Le premier empereur d'Allag, Xande, aurait rencontré ce fauve lors d'une expédition en Ilsabard durant sa jeunesse. Son nom, rappelant le sens du mot “Éternité”, fut choisi à cause de sa grande longévité. Outre l'ajout d'une armure pour en faire une bête de combat, les Allagois se seraient servis de cette bête lors d'expériences tentant de percer le secret de l'immortalité.
#. column 0: Summon forth the aeturna, an imposing feline that boasts far more than the standard nine lives.
#. column 2: Eternal life can be yours,<br>ladies and gentlemen!<br>   - Silver-tongued Broker
msgctxt "MountTransient:308:0:1"
msgid "During an expedition to Ilsabard in his younger years, Emperor Xande is said to have come upon this fearsome beast. As its name, meaning “eternal,” would suggest, it possesses remarkable vitality, and in addition to serving as an armored warbeast, it was also a subject in the Allagans' research into immortality."
msgstr "Говорят, юный император Занди встретил этого свирепого зверя во время похода в Илсабард. Имя зверя означает «вечная», и жизнь у него действительно необычайно долгая. Аллагане не только облачали его в доспехи и использовали в бою, но и изучали на нём возможность обрести бессмертие."

#. ja: アエーッ！
#. de: Was? Woher ich diese Katze habe? Was geht dich das ...<br><i>Fahrender Geschäftsmann</i>
#. fr: Aéééé<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the aeturna, an imposing feline that boasts far more than the standard nine lives.
#. column 1: During an expedition to Ilsabard in his younger years, Emperor Xande is said to have come upon this fearsome beast. As its name, meaning “eternal,” would suggest, it possesses remarkable vitality, and in addition to serving as an armored warbeast, it was also a subject in the Allagans' research into immortality.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:308:0:2"
msgid "Eternal life can be yours,<br>ladies and gentlemen!<br>   - Silver-tongued Broker"
msgstr "Вечная жизнь ждёт вас,<br>дамы и господа!<br>   — Красноречивый торговец"

#. ja: セルリウム・バルーンに騎乗する。<br>気化した青燐水を充填した飛行用風船
#. de: Rufe dein Bündel bunter Erdseimballone herbei und schwebe deinen Abenteuern entgegen.
#. fr: Vous appelez une grappe de ballons propulsés grâce au céruleum.
#. column 1: Filled with gasified ceruleum, this festive assortment of balloons boasts enough buoyancy to lift a full-grown Roegadyn off the ground. However, it possesses no means of propulsion, and one is required to provide one's own wind magicks to move.
#. column 2: Squawk! Bring balloon directly<br>over unbelievers' dung heap!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain
msgctxt "MountTransient:310:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your set of ceruleum balloons. Propulsion not included."
msgstr "Призовите связку шаров с церулеумом. Двигатель не прилагается."

#. ja: 気化した青燐水を充填した飛行用風船。十分な数を用意すれば、人ひとりくらいなら軽々と空中に浮かせるだけの浮力が得られる。だが、思い通りの方向に動くには、自身の魔力で風を起こす必要があるだろう
#. de: Um diese mit gasförmigem Erdseim gefüllten Ballone in die gewünschte Richtung zu lenken, sollte der Pilot nicht nur nicht zu schwer sein, sondern auch über genügend Magie verfügen, um Winde herbei<shy>zu<shy>zaubern.
#. fr: Un ensemble de ballons gonflés au céruleum. Qui n'a jamais rêvé de s'accrocher à quelques ballons pour se laisser porter au gré des vents ? Dommage qu'il faille générer magiquement ces derniers pour se diriger réellement où l'on souhaite.
#. column 0: Summon forth your set of ceruleum balloons. Propulsion not included.
#. column 2: Squawk! Bring balloon directly<br>over unbelievers' dung heap!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain
msgctxt "MountTransient:310:0:1"
msgid "Filled with gasified ceruleum, this festive assortment of balloons boasts enough buoyancy to lift a full-grown Roegadyn off the ground. However, it possesses no means of propulsion, and one is required to provide one's own wind magicks to move."
msgstr "Эти шары наполнены газообразным церулеумом. В связке их достаточно, чтобы поднять в воздух даже взрослого рогадина. Но двигаться они сами не могут: чтобы задать направление, придётся создать ветер собственной магией."

#. ja: バルンバルーン！
#. de: Die schönste Art der Fortbewegung!<br><i>Erdseimballonfahrer</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your set of ceruleum balloons. Propulsion not included.
#. column 1: Filled with gasified ceruleum, this festive assortment of balloons boasts enough buoyancy to lift a full-grown Roegadyn off the ground. However, it possesses no means of propulsion, and one is required to provide one's own wind magicks to move.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:310:0:2"
msgid "Squawk! Bring balloon directly<br>over unbelievers' dung heap!<br>   - Ixali Chieftain  "
msgstr "Кряк! Принесите шар прямо<br>на кучу навоза неверующих!<br>   — Вождь иксалов"

#. ja: アンデンIII世に騎乗する。<br>ガサガサと葉を揺らして動く、謎の移動性植物
#. de: Rufe Anden III. herbei, ein rätselhaftes Pflanzenwesen, das sich raschelnd fortbewegt.
#. fr: Vous appelez Anden III, une mystérieuse créature feuillue.
#. column 1: In gratitude for your kindness, the pixie Eo Tyr gifted you this peculiar ambulatory plant, which they created from the leaves of the original Anden after pruning him. While it resembles its namesake, it lacks the power of speech, and there is no telling what thoughts lie behind its permanently horrified expression.
#. column 2: Kind-hearted as we pixies are,<br>we decided to turn him into<br>a lovely leafman!<br>   - Sheep-obsessed Pixie
msgctxt "MountTransient:311:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Anden III. It has a mouth, but it cannot scream."
msgstr "Призовите Андена III. Рот у него есть, а кричать он не может."

#. ja: ピクシー族のエオ＝ティルがお手伝いの「お返し」として贈ってくれた、謎の移動性植物。厩舎にいた初代アンデンを剪定したときに生じた葉っぱを集め、いろいろした結果、生じたらしい。かつてのアンデンの姿に似ている
#. de: Mit diesem veganen Geschenk wollte sich die Pixie Eo Tyr für deine Hilfe revanchieren. Erschaffen aus den Blättern, die beim Trimmen vom Anden der ersten Generation anfielen, soll dieses Geschöpf dem ursprünglichen Wesen sehr ähnlich sein.
#. fr: Une étrange créature feuillue offerte par Eo Tyr pour vos services rendus. Elle ressemble au premier Anden, le berger transformé en enfeuillé par les Pixies, cette troisième version ayant été fabriquée à partir des branches élaguées de l'original.
#. column 0: Summon forth Anden III. It has a mouth, but it cannot scream.
#. column 2: Kind-hearted as we pixies are,<br>we decided to turn him into<br>a lovely leafman!<br>   - Sheep-obsessed Pixie
msgctxt "MountTransient:311:0:1"
msgid "In gratitude for your kindness, the pixie Eo Tyr gifted you this peculiar ambulatory plant, which they created from the leaves of the original Anden after pruning him. While it resembles its namesake, it lacks the power of speech, and there is no telling what thoughts lie behind its permanently horrified expression."
msgstr "В благодарность за вашу доброту пикси Эо Тир подарил вам это странное ходячее растение. Его создали из листьев, оставшихся после обрезки первого Андена. Оно похоже на своего тёзку, но говорить не умеет, и никто не знает, какие мысли скрываются за его вечно испуганной мордочкой."

#. ja: ……、……！？
#. de: ...?!
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>!?
#. column 0: Summon forth Anden III. It has a mouth, but it cannot scream.
#. column 1: In gratitude for your kindness, the pixie Eo Tyr gifted you this peculiar ambulatory plant, which they created from the leaves of the original Anden after pruning him. While it resembles its namesake, it lacks the power of speech, and there is no telling what thoughts lie behind its permanently horrified expression.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:311:0:2"
msgid "Kind-hearted as we pixies are,<br>we decided to turn him into<br>a lovely leafman!<br>   - Sheep-obsessed Pixie"
msgstr "Мы, пикси, такие добрые,<br>что решили превратить его<br>в прекрасного лиственного человечка!<br>   — Пикси, помешанный на овцах"

#. ja: ブラックジャック号に騎乗する。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が建造した試作型飛空艇
#. de: Rufe deine Black Jack herbei. Der Prototyp eines Luftschiffs von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken.
#. fr: Vous appelez le Blackjack, un prototype d'aéronef conçu par les Forges de Garlond.
#. column 1: Commissioned by Chairman Tatabaru of Highwind Skyways to develop a new airship, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks produced this scale prototype for testing purposes. Despite its diminutive size, it boasts an impressive loading capacity, and can easily carry you and a few friends.
#. column 2: Good gods, it's the <i>Blackjack</i>!<br>   - Tataramu
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:312:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the <i>Blackjack</i>, or rather, its scale prototype. Exactly where inside it you ride is a mystery best left unanswered."
msgstr "Призовите <i>Блэкджек</i> — точнее, его уменьшенную копию. А вот где именно вы едете, лучше не спрашивать."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が建造した試作型飛空艇。ハイウィンド飛空社のタタバル社長から発注された新型飛空艇を建造するにあたって造られた縮小実験モデルらしい。小さいといっても、運搬能力は本物だ
#. de: Dieses Luftschiff wurde von Tatabaru, dem Direktor der Highwind-Fluggesellschaft, in Auftrag gegeben. Obwohl relativ klein, vermag es relativ große Lasten zu transportieren.
#. fr: Un prototype d'aéronef conçu par les Forges de Garlond. Il s'agit d'une version miniaturisée d'un des aéronefs commandés par Tatabaru, le président des Vols Hautvent. Il a beau être plus petit que l'original, il est tout aussi efficace comme moyen de transport.
#. column 0: Summon forth the <i>Blackjack</i>, or rather, its scale prototype. Exactly where inside it you ride is a mystery best left unanswered.
#. column 2: Good gods, it's the <i>Blackjack</i>!<br>   - Tataramu
msgctxt "MountTransient:312:0:1"
msgid "Commissioned by Chairman Tatabaru of Highwind Skyways to develop a new airship, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks produced this scale prototype for testing purposes. Despite its diminutive size, it boasts an impressive loading capacity, and can easily carry you and a few friends."
msgstr "По заказу председателя Татабару из авиакомпании «Хайвинд» инженеры Гарлондских мастерских создали этот уменьшенный прототип дирижабля для испытаний. Несмотря на скромные размеры, он способен перевозить немалый груз, включая вас и нескольких друзей."

#. ja: 落ちるときは落ちるもんだ
#. de: Das ...! Das ist die <i>Black Jack</i>!<br><i>Tataramu</i>
#. fr: Quand les choses tombent, elles tombent...
#. column 0: Summon forth the <i>Blackjack</i>, or rather, its scale prototype. Exactly where inside it you ride is a mystery best left unanswered.
#. column 1: Commissioned by Chairman Tatabaru of Highwind Skyways to develop a new airship, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks produced this scale prototype for testing purposes. Despite its diminutive size, it boasts an impressive loading capacity, and can easily carry you and a few friends.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:312:0:2"
msgid "Good gods, it's the <i>Blackjack</i>!<br>   - Tataramu"
msgstr "Боги милостивые, это же <i>Блэкджек</i>!<br>   — Татараму"

#. ja: ファエトンに騎乗する。<br>コルヴォ地方で語り継がれてきた炎の幻獣
#. de: Rufe dein Phaeton herbei, eine feurige Pferdegestalt aus den Mythen Corvos.
#. fr: Vous appelez Phaéton, un légendaire cheval de feu issu des mythes corvosiens.
#. column 1: According to Corvosi myth, simply being near this fiery steed is akin to bathing in hot coals, and it is only through the ingenuity of alchemy that one can ride it unscathed. A nigh-identical being, created to draw a carriage in the heavens, is said to have existed in the world unsundered, but it is uncertain what manner of connection, if any, exists between the two beasts.
#. column 2: BURN! BURN! ALL IS BURN!<br>   - Gogmagolem
msgctxt "MountTransient:313:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth fiery Phaethon, a legendary beast of Corvosi myth."
msgstr "Призовите огненного Фаэтона — легендарного зверя из корвосских сказаний."

#. ja: コルヴォ地方で語り継がれてきた炎の幻獣。錬金術を応用することで騎乗可能となったが、本来は近づくだけで火傷するほど。これと良く似た存在が、古代世界において天駆ける馬車の牽引用に創造されていたともいうが詳細は不明である
#. de: Wenn man den Mythen und Legenden von Corvos Glauben schenkt, so gleicht die bloße Nähe zu dieser majestätischen Kreatur einem Bad in glühenden Kohlen. Lediglich durch das Wunder der Alchemie lässt es sich unversehrt reiten. Ein ganz ähnliches Wesen soll schon in der Welt der Alten existiert haben, geschaffen, um eine Kutsche durch die Himmel zu ziehen. Ob jedoch eine Verbindung zwischen dem einen und dem anderen Mythos besteht, bleibt weiterhin ungeklärt.
#. fr: Une créature équine enveloppée de flammes, mentionnée dans les légendes de la région de Corvos. En temps normal, il est impossible de s'en approcher sans subir de graves brûlures, mais grâce aux prouesses de l'alchimie, il peut dorénavant servir de monture. On raconte qu'un animal similaire destiné à tirer des chariots à travers les cieux aurait existé dans l'ancien monde, cependant rien ne permet d'affirmer que ces deux bêtes sont liées d'une quelconque façon.
#. column 0: Summon forth fiery Phaethon, a legendary beast of Corvosi myth.
#. column 2: BURN! BURN! ALL IS BURN!<br>   - Gogmagolem
msgctxt "MountTransient:313:0:1"
msgid "According to Corvosi myth, simply being near this fiery steed is akin to bathing in hot coals, and it is only through the ingenuity of alchemy that one can ride it unscathed. A nigh-identical being, created to draw a carriage in the heavens, is said to have existed in the world unsundered, but it is uncertain what manner of connection, if any, exists between the two beasts."
msgstr "Согласно легендам Корвоса, даже находиться рядом с этим огненным скакуном — всё равно что купаться в раскалённых углях. Оседлать его, не обжёгшись, можно лишь благодаря искусству алхимии. Говорят, в неразделённом мире существовало почти такое же существо, созданное, чтобы возить небесную колесницу. Но связаны ли эти звери между собой — неизвестно."

#. ja: 真っ赤に燃える！
#. de: Der Himmel<nbsp>... er steht in Flammen.<br><i>Alisaie</i>
#. fr: Que tout soit consumé par les flammes !
#. column 0: Summon forth fiery Phaethon, a legendary beast of Corvosi myth.
#. column 1: According to Corvosi myth, simply being near this fiery steed is akin to bathing in hot coals, and it is only through the ingenuity of alchemy that one can ride it unscathed. A nigh-identical being, created to draw a carriage in the heavens, is said to have existed in the world unsundered, but it is uncertain what manner of connection, if any, exists between the two beasts.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:313:0:2"
msgid "BURN! BURN! ALL IS BURN!<br>   - Gogmagolem"
msgstr "ГОРИ! ГОРИ! ВСЁ ПУСТЬ ГОРИТ!<br>   — Гогмагоголем"

#. ja: ピンキーに騎乗する。<br>ヒトの幸せを願って、レポリットが造ったピンク色の象型マシン
#. de: Rufe deine Pinky herbei, eine elefantenförmige Maschine, die die Leute glücklich machen soll.
#. fr: Vous appelez Pinky, un éléphant rose mécanique qui apporte la joie et la bonne humeur.
#. column 1: Upon hearing that inebriated folk are wont to have visions of a delightful pink elephant, the Loporrits were inspired to make the creature a reality. The tale was, of course, simply a joke at their expense, but if this machine brings a smile to even one person, then their efforts will not have been in vain.
#. column 2: This pink color is perfect!<br>   - Auri Boy
msgctxt "MountTransient:314:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Pinky, an elephantine machine engineered to enrapture."
msgstr "Призовите Пинки — слоноподобную машину, созданную, чтобы восхищать."

#. ja: ヒトの幸せを願って、レポリットが造った騎乗獣型マシン。シャーレアン人から伝え聞いた「酩酊状態に陥ったヒトは、ピンク色の象を幻視することがある」とのジョークを真に受けた結果、このような存在が生み出されたようだ
#. de: Diese Elefantenmaschine wurde von den Loporrit erbaut, nachdem sie die Worte eines Sharlayaners, Betrunkene würden oft von rosa Elefanten phantasieren, für bare Münze genommen hatten. Auch wenn ihr Anblick nicht unbedingt Glücksgefühle erzeugt, so sorgt er immerhin für Heiterkeit.
#. fr: Un robot éléphantesque créé par les Loporrites pour apporter le bonheur auprès des habitants d'Ætherys. Décidément trop crédules, ces chers léporidés ont pris au pied de la lettre une plai<shy>san<shy>te<shy>rie de leurs correspondants sharlayanais, qui leur ont fait croire que les individus ivres étaient sujets à une hallucination récurrente consistant à voir apparaître devant soi un éléphant rose...
#. column 0: Summon forth Pinky, an elephantine machine engineered to enrapture.
#. column 2: This pink color is perfect!<br>   - Auri Boy
msgctxt "MountTransient:314:0:1"
msgid "Upon hearing that inebriated folk are wont to have visions of a delightful pink elephant, the Loporrits were inspired to make the creature a reality. The tale was, of course, simply a joke at their expense, but if this machine brings a smile to even one person, then their efforts will not have been in vain."
msgstr "Услышав, что пьяным людям порой мерещится милый розовый слон, лопорриты решили воплотить его в жизнь. Конечно, это была всего лишь шутка над ними, но если машина хоть кого-нибудь развеселит, значит, старались они не зря."

#. ja: ピンキー！
#. de: Pink ist das neue Orange!<br><i>Loporrit</i>
#. fr: Pinkyyyy !
#. column 0: Summon forth Pinky, an elephantine machine engineered to enrapture.
#. column 1: Upon hearing that inebriated folk are wont to have visions of a delightful pink elephant, the Loporrits were inspired to make the creature a reality. The tale was, of course, simply a joke at their expense, but if this machine brings a smile to even one person, then their efforts will not have been in vain.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:314:0:2"
msgid "This pink color is perfect!<br>   - Auri Boy"
msgstr "Какой прекрасный розовый цвет!<br>   — Аурец"

#. ja: リンクス・オブ・ファイアに騎乗する。<br>妖しき火属性のエーテルを帯びた幻想生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Fegefeuer-Luchs herbei, der wie ein gewisser ehrbarer Erzbösewicht aussieht ... in Form einer großen, geflügelten Katze.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre lynx du brasier flamboyant, un félin né des flammes maléfiques du treizième reflet.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards astral fire. Its fiery body calls to mind the ardor of Rubicante, archfiend of fire, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in impenetrable flames.
#. column 2: It is time you were purified<br>in the raging blaze of His blessing!<br>   - Zagozz Teh
msgctxt "MountTransient:315:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lynx of righteous fire, which could be what a certain honor-bound archfiend might look like as a large, winged feline."
msgstr "Призовите рысь праведного огня — вот как мог бы выглядеть один архидемон, чтящий честь, будь он огромной крылатой кошкой."

#. ja: エーテルによって構成された幻想生物の一種であり、闇にも近しい火属性の力を帯びている。その佇まいは妖異の如き荒々しさだけでなく、高潔な武人の矜持をも感じさせるが、いずれにせよ、この使い魔の来歴は未だに判明していない
#. de: Eine Phantomkreatur, deren elementarer Aspekt stark in Richtung finsterem Feuer tendiert. Sein sengender Körper erinnert an die Feuersbrunst von Rubicante, dem Fürst des Feuers, aber die Ursprünge dieses Familiars sind von undurchdringlichen Flammen umhüllt.
#. fr: Cette entité fantasmagorique a été créée à partir d'un d'éther de feu teinté d'énergie des Ténèbres. Son apparence évoque autant la férocité des bêtes du néant que la prestance du fier guerrier, ce qui n'est pas sans rappeler l'indomptable Rubicante. Les origines de sa création restent cependant aussi obscures que son ardent pelage.
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of righteous fire, which could be what a certain honor-bound archfiend might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 2: It is time you were purified<br>in the raging blaze of His blessing!<br>   - Zagozz Teh
msgctxt "MountTransient:315:0:1"
msgid "A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards astral fire. Its fiery body calls to mind the ardor of Rubicante, archfiend of fire, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in impenetrable flames."
msgstr "Это фантастическое создание, в котором преобладает астральная стихия огня. Его огненное тело напоминает о пылком духе Рубиканте, архидемона огня, но происхождение этого фамильяра скрыто за непроницаемым пламенем."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Es wird Zeit für dich, die reinigende Kraft seines feurigen Segens zu empfangen!<br><i>Zagozz Teh</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of righteous fire, which could be what a certain honor-bound archfiend might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards astral fire. Its fiery body calls to mind the ardor of Rubicante, archfiend of fire, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in impenetrable flames.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:315:0:2"
msgid "It is time you were purified<br>in the raging blaze of His blessing!<br>   - Zagozz Teh"
msgstr "Пора очиститься<br>в яростном пламени Его благословения!<br>   — Загоз Тэ"

#. ja: 魔導アヴェンジャー黄金像仕様に騎乗する。<br>ゴブリン族が改良した帝国製無人魔導兵器
#. de: Rufe deinen vergoldeten Magitek-Rächer herbei, eine von den Goblins zu einem Reitgefährt umgebaute imperiale Kampfmaschine, die in dieser Ausführung noch prächtiger aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez un vengeur magitek doré, un appareil impérial à la carrosserie modifiée par les soins des Gobelins.
#. column 1: Rumor holds that a golden sasquatch statue stands at the heart of the Garlean capital, from which magitek weapons would emerge to defend the city should it fall under attack. The veracity of the tale aside, the goblins liked it enough that they decided to create this golden avenger to match the statue.
#. column 2: I saw a golden opportunity<br>just begging to be seized...<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:316:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek avenger G1, an imperial warmachina made gaudier by goblin hands."
msgstr "Призовите магитех-мстителя G1 — имперскую боевую машину, которую гоблины сделали ещё вычурнее."

#. ja: ゴブリン族が改良した帝国製無人魔導兵器。帝都ガレマルドには、黄金のサスカッチ像が据えられており、敵軍の侵攻を受けると中から魔導兵器が現れるという出所不明の噂があった。これは、その黄金像を模したものらしい
#. de: Gerüchten zufolge steht im Herzen der Kaiserlichen Hauptstadt Garlemald eine goldene Sasquatch-Statue, die im Falle eines Angriffs die Stadt mit Magitek-Waffen verteidigen soll. Ungeachtet des Wahrheitsgehalts dieser Geschichte gefiel sie den Goblins so gut, dass sie beschlossen, passend zur Statue diesen goldenen Rächer zu erschaffen.
#. fr: Ce suiveur autonome a été modifié et amélioré par le génie mécanique gobelin. Sa couleur est inspirée d'une étonnante rumeur autour de statues de sasquatch dorées érigées à divers endroits de la capitale impériale. Selon celle-ci, ces monuments dissimuleraient un arsenal magitek qui s'active en cas d'invasion ennemie...
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek avenger G1, an imperial warmachina made gaudier by goblin hands.
#. column 2: I saw a golden opportunity<br>just begging to be seized...<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:316:0:1"
msgid "Rumor holds that a golden sasquatch statue stands at the heart of the Garlean capital, from which magitek weapons would emerge to defend the city should it fall under attack. The veracity of the tale aside, the goblins liked it enough that they decided to create this golden avenger to match the statue."
msgstr "Говорят, в центре столицы Гарлемальда стоит золотая статуя снежного человека. Если на город нападут, из неё якобы выйдет магитех-оружие, чтобы его защитить. Правдивы ли слухи — неважно: гоблинам они так понравились, что те создали золотого мстителя в том же стиле."

#. ja: ウゴゴゴゴ…
#. de: Goldener ... Goliath?<br><i>Mädchen aus Namai</i>
#. fr: Pshhh... Détection des intrus...
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek avenger G1, an imperial warmachina made gaudier by goblin hands.
#. column 1: Rumor holds that a golden sasquatch statue stands at the heart of the Garlean capital, from which magitek weapons would emerge to defend the city should it fall under attack. The veracity of the tale aside, the goblins liked it enough that they decided to create this golden avenger to match the statue.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:316:0:2"
msgid "I saw a golden opportunity<br>just begging to be seized...<br>   - Tataru"
msgstr "Я увидела золотую возможность,<br>и она так и просилась, чтобы её поймали...<br>   — Татару"

#. ja: クリュソマロスに騎乗する。<br>金色の毛並みを持つ白羊。もはや、それは金羊である
#. de: Rufe deinen Chrysomallos herbei. Die Widderversion eines Goldesels.
#. fr: Vous appelez Chrysomallos, un chatoyant bélier au pelage doré.
#. column 1: Instead of the white commonly seen in its kind, the fleece of this sheep is a remarkable golden hue. While the seller insisted that it is the golden ram of legend, as with all such claims, this should be taken with a pinch of salt. Only time and perhaps a new growth of wool will reveal the creature's true nature.
#. column 2: To think sheep can thrive in<br>so remote a place as this...<br>   - Cirina
msgctxt "MountTransient:317:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Chrysomallos, the golden ram of legend─though legend doesn't seem to say anything about illusory coins spilling forth endlessly..."
msgstr "Призовите Хрисомалоса — легендарного золотого барана. Правда, легенды ничего не говорят о бесконечном потоке призрачных монет..."

#. ja: ふわふわとした白い毛が特徴のラム種でありながら、なぜか金色の毛を有する羊。売り手は、これぞ伝説の「金羊毛の羊」であると語るが本当だろうか。季節が一巡して新しい毛に生え変わるまで、真偽の程はわからない
#. de: Ein legendärer goldener Widder. Obwohl die Legende nichts von Goldstücken erzählt, die hinten herausfallen ...
#. fr: Ce remarquable ovidé se distingue de ses congénères blancs par son éblouissante toison dorée. Son précédent pro<shy>prié<shy>taire affirme qu'il s'agit du saint bélier de la légende, mais difficile de le croire sur parole... Il n'y a qu'une façon d'en avoir le cœur net : le tondre et attendre que ses poils repoussent.
#. column 0: Summon forth Chrysomallos, the golden ram of legend─though legend doesn't seem to say anything about illusory coins spilling forth endlessly...
#. column 2: To think sheep can thrive in<br>so remote a place as this...<br>   - Cirina
msgctxt "MountTransient:317:0:1"
msgid "Instead of the white commonly seen in its kind, the fleece of this sheep is a remarkable golden hue. While the seller insisted that it is the golden ram of legend, as with all such claims, this should be taken with a pinch of salt. Only time and perhaps a new growth of wool will reveal the creature's true nature."
msgstr "Вместо привычной белой шерсти у этого барана удивительный золотой окрас. Продавец уверял, что это тот самый легендарный золотой баран, но к подобным заявлениям стоит относиться с недоверием. Лишь время — и, возможно, новая шерсть — покажет, кто он на самом деле."

#. ja: メ、メェ～ッ！
#. de: Die Inselschäfchen haben mir das Herz wahrlich höherschlagen lassen.<br><i>Cirina</i>
#. fr: Mêêêê !
#. column 0: Summon forth Chrysomallos, the golden ram of legend─though legend doesn't seem to say anything about illusory coins spilling forth endlessly...
#. column 1: Instead of the white commonly seen in its kind, the fleece of this sheep is a remarkable golden hue. While the seller insisted that it is the golden ram of legend, as with all such claims, this should be taken with a pinch of salt. Only time and perhaps a new growth of wool will reveal the creature's true nature.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:317:0:2"
msgid "To think sheep can thrive in<br>so remote a place as this...<br>   - Cirina"
msgstr "И надо же овцам водиться<br>в такой глуши...<br>   — Цирина"

#. ja: ガーロンドGL-ISに騎乗する。<br>ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が試作した側車付き魔導二輪車
#. de: Auf deine Garlond GL-IS aufsteigen. Das Prachtstück der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke ist jetzt noch prächtiger und sogar für zwei!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Garlond GL-IS, un véhicule magitek à deux roues doté d'une nacelle latérale.
#. column 1: A variant of the Garlond GL-I, this magitek vehicle is fitted with a sidecar to allow for two riders, with engine displacement increased to handle the additional weight. Comes with a life-size mascot lovingly crafted by Wedge─but strictly for a limited time only, and while stocks last!
#. column 2: It's a Garlond through and through.<br>   - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:318:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Garlond GL-IS. Fitted with a sidecar to carry a trusty sidekick."
msgstr "Призовите Гарлонд GL-IS. Коляска сбоку — чтобы взять с собой верного спутника."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社製魔導二輪車GL-Iに、側車を接続した2人乗り用モデル。重量増に対応するため、青燐機関の排気量もアップしている。今なら、購入者特典としてウェッジ手製のマスコット人形付き
#. de: Dieses Modell fügt dem Dauerbrenner unter den zweirädrigen Magitek-Fahrzeugen, der Garlond GL-I, einen Beiwagen hinzu. Um das erhöhte Gewicht auszugleichen, wurde unter anderem an dem Hubraum des Erdseim-Antriebs geschraubt. Alle, die jetzt zuschlagen, erhalten obendrauf auch noch eine Puppe, handgefertigt von keinem Geringeren als dem guten Wedge.
#. fr: La Garlond GL-IS est une déclinaison d'un précédent modèle de véhicule à deux roues, la GL-I, auquel les ingénieurs des Forges ont ajouté une nacelle latérale pouvant accueillir un second passager. Poids sup<shy>plé<shy>men<shy>tai<shy>re oblige, la puissance de son moteur au céruleum a été revue à la hausse. Cerise sur le gâteau, ses premiers acquéreurs se voient offrir une poupée cousue main à l'effigie d'Alpha.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Garlond GL-IS. Fitted with a sidecar to carry a trusty sidekick.
#. column 2: It's a Garlond through and through.<br>   - Cid
msgctxt "MountTransient:318:0:1"
msgid "A variant of the Garlond GL-I, this magitek vehicle is fitted with a sidecar to allow for two riders, with engine displacement increased to handle the additional weight. Comes with a life-size mascot lovingly crafted by Wedge─but strictly for a limited time only, and while stocks last!"
msgstr "Это вариант магитех-мотоцикла Гарлонд GL-I, оснащённый коляской для второго пассажира. Чтобы справиться с дополнительным весом, инженеры увеличили рабочий объём двигателя. А ещё в комплекте идёт ростовая кукла ручной работы от Веджа — предложение ограничено, пока товар есть в наличии!"

#. ja: バルルルルル…
#. de: Brumm, Brumm! Prächtiger wird's nich mehr!<br><i>Wedge</i>
#. fr: Vrrrr.... Vrrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Garlond GL-IS. Fitted with a sidecar to carry a trusty sidekick.
#. column 1: A variant of the Garlond GL-I, this magitek vehicle is fitted with a sidecar to allow for two riders, with engine displacement increased to handle the additional weight. Comes with a life-size mascot lovingly crafted by Wedge─but strictly for a limited time only, and while stocks last!
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:318:0:2"
msgid "It's a Garlond through and through.<br>   - Cid"
msgstr "Вылитая машина Гарлонда.<br>   — Сид"

#. ja: メガロアンビストマに騎乗する。<br>驚くほど大きく育ったアンビストマ
#. de: Rufe deinen Megalo-Ambystoma herbei. Die können so groß werden?!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre mégalo-ambystoma, un ambystoma d'une taille tout bonnement ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelle.
#. column 1: The fact that this impossibly large ambystoma is fitted with an elaborate saddle strongly suggests it was created to be ridden. However, its presence in Pandæmonium means it was flawed in some way and deemed a failure.
#. column 2: It has been an age shhhince we<br>have feashhhted on axolotl.<br>   - Seww
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:319:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your megaloambystoma. Or should that be <i>max</i>olotl? You decide."
msgstr "Призовите мегалоамбистому. Или, может, <i>макс</i>олотля? Решайте сами."

#. ja: 驚くほど大きく育ったアンビストマ。鞍が設えられているからには騎獣として創造されたものと思われる。ただし、パンデモニウムで発見されたということは、失敗作の烙印を押されるだけの欠陥を抱えているのだろう
#. de: Man glaubt fast kaum, dass es sich bei diesem Wesen um ein Ambystoma handelt, so groß ist dieses Exemplar. Da es mit einem Sattel ausgestattet ist, wurde es wohl als Reittier erschaffen. Es wurde im Pandæmonium gefunden, was wiederum bedeutet, dass es sich um das Ergebnis eines fehlgeschlagenen Versuches mit der Schöpfungsmagie handelt.
#. fr: Ce gigantesque ambystoma est sellé, ce qui laisse supposer qu'il a été créé en tant qu'animal de monte. Il provient cependant du Pandæmonium, et comporte donc cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment des tares qui l'ont empêché d'être considéré comme une réussite.
#. column 0: Summon forth your megaloambystoma. Or should that be <i>max</i>olotl? You decide.
#. column 2: It has been an age shhhince we<br>have feashhhted on axolotl.<br>   - Seww
msgctxt "MountTransient:319:0:1"
msgid "The fact that this impossibly large ambystoma is fitted with an elaborate saddle strongly suggests it was created to be ridden. However, its presence in Pandæmonium means it was flawed in some way and deemed a failure."
msgstr "Невероятно огромному амбистоме приделали замысловатое седло — похоже, его создавали как верховое животное. Но раз его нашли в Пандемониуме, значит, в нём был какой-то изъян, и его сочли неудачным творением."

#. ja: うー、ぱー、るー、ぱー！
#. de: Lustige Gesichter<nbsp>...<br><i>Mädchen am Rande des Universums</i>
#. fr: Bloup, bloup<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your megaloambystoma. Or should that be <i>max</i>olotl? You decide.
#. column 1: The fact that this impossibly large ambystoma is fitted with an elaborate saddle strongly suggests it was created to be ridden. However, its presence in Pandæmonium means it was flawed in some way and deemed a failure.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:319:0:2"
msgid "It has been an age shhhince we<br>have feashhhted on axolotl.<br>   - Seww"
msgstr "Давно не было аксолотля,<br>на который можно поохотиться.<br>   — Сью"

#. ja: リボーン・フェニックスに騎乗する。<br>光の戦士に対する感謝を込めて紡がれた不死鳥型使い魔
#. de: Rufe deinen Phönix aus der Asche herbei. Ein Reittier für die Ewigkeit!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre phénix de la Renaissance, un oiseau immortel plein de gratitude envers vous.
#. column 1: Created as a token of gratitude for the Warrior of Light, this majestic familiar assumes the likeness of the Phoenix, the immortal bird of legend. Upon death, the creature is said to rise again from its own ashes, on account of which it is revered as a symbol of rebirth.
#. column 2: The fires of Ifrit─nay─the Phoenix have<br>taken up residence in my heart, where<br>they will continue to burn forevermore!<br>   - Jude
msgctxt "MountTransient:320:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Rising Phoenix, a symbol of rebirth and gratitude both."
msgstr "Призовите Восход Феникса — символ возрождения и благодарности."

#. ja: 光の戦士に対する感謝を込めて紡がれた不死鳥型使い魔。その姿は、エオルゼア各地に伝わる不死鳥「フェニックス」に似る。死に際して激しく燃えあがるも灰から蘇るとの伝承から、「新生」の象徴と考えられているという
#. de: Dieser Schutzgeist wurde für den Krieger des Lichts als Dank für seine zahlreichen Heldentaten erschaffen. Der in ganz Eorzea heimische Phönix gilt bei den Leuten aufgrund seiner Fähigkeit, nach dem Tod aus seiner eigenen Asche wieder aufzuerstehen, als Zeichen für die Wiedergeburt und den Neuanfang.
#. fr: Cet oiseau immortel porte en lui une recon<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ce éternelle envers vous, Guerri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> de la Lumière. Il ressemble beaucoup au Phénix des légendes éorzéennes, et, tout comme son modèle, meurt dans un spectaculaire panache de flammes, avant de renaître de ses cendres. Le symbole de renouveau par excellence.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rising Phoenix, a symbol of rebirth and gratitude both.
#. column 2: The fires of Ifrit─nay─the Phoenix have<br>taken up residence in my heart, where<br>they will continue to burn forevermore!<br>   - Jude
msgctxt "MountTransient:320:0:1"
msgid "Created as a token of gratitude for the Warrior of Light, this majestic familiar assumes the likeness of the Phoenix, the immortal bird of legend. Upon death, the creature is said to rise again from its own ashes, on account of which it is revered as a symbol of rebirth."
msgstr "Этого величественного фамильяра создали в знак благодарности Воину Света. Он похож на легендарного бессмертного Феникса. Говорят, погибая, он вспыхивает и возрождается из пепла, поэтому его считают символом возрождения."

#. ja: ありがとう10周年！
#. de: 10 Jahre sind es nun,<br>doch wir werden nimmer ruhen!<br><i>Vielen Dank für die langjährige Unterstützung!</i>
#. fr: Dix ans déjà<nbsp>! Merci pour tout<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rising Phoenix, a symbol of rebirth and gratitude both.
#. column 1: Created as a token of gratitude for the Warrior of Light, this majestic familiar assumes the likeness of the Phoenix, the immortal bird of legend. Upon death, the creature is said to rise again from its own ashes, on account of which it is revered as a symbol of rebirth.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:320:0:2"
msgid "The fires of Ifrit─nay─the Phoenix have<br>taken up residence in my heart, where<br>they will continue to burn forevermore!<br>   - Jude"
msgstr "Пламя Ифрита — нет, Феникса —<br>поселилось в моём сердце<br>и будет гореть вечно!<br>   — Джуд"

#. ja: ブラブラに騎乗する。<br>六根山からついてきた提灯の怪異
#. de: Rufe deinen schaukelnden Laternengeist herbei.<br>Er ist dir den ganzen weiten Weg vom Rokkon aus gefolgt.
#. fr: Vous appelez Burabura, un esprit en forme de lanterne qui vous suit depuis votre visite au mont Rokkon.
#. column 1: Contrary to expectation, this lantern ghost did not care to haunt people, and was content to simply wander Mount Rokkon. When it saw you similarly wandering, it took you for a kindred spirit and decided to follow you wherever the wind should blow.
#. column 2: Could they be evil spirits, lying in<br>wait for hapless treasure seekers?<br>   - Zukin
msgctxt "MountTransient:321:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your burabura chochin, a kindred spirit in wandering."
msgstr "Призовите бурабура-тётин — такого же любителя бродяжничать."

#. ja: 怪異はびこる六根山で生まれたバケチョウチン。人を襲いもせずブラブラしていたら、同じくブラブラしていそうな冒険者を発見、気が合いそうだと判断し山を下りた。明日は明日の風に吹かれ舞う、それが彼のブラブラ道
#. de: Diese Geisterlaterne entspringt dem von Mythen und Mysterien umrankten Rokkon. Seine Lebensfreude besteht im Schaukeln und Baumeln, was ihn an deine Seite geführt hat.
#. fr: Ce bake-chôchin, ou lanterne fantôme, provient du mont Rokkon, où les esprits pullulent. Appréciant votre attitude aussi nonchalante que la sienne, il a jugé qu'il s'entendrait bien avec vous, et a donc dévalé la montagne pour vous accompagner. “Demain est un autre jour”, telle est sa devise.
#. column 0: Summon forth your burabura chochin, a kindred spirit in wandering.
#. column 2: Could they be evil spirits, lying in<br>wait for hapless treasure seekers?<br>   - Zukin
msgctxt "MountTransient:321:0:1"
msgid "Contrary to expectation, this lantern ghost did not care to haunt people, and was content to simply wander Mount Rokkon. When it saw you similarly wandering, it took you for a kindred spirit and decided to follow you wherever the wind should blow."
msgstr "Этот фонарь-призрак родом с горы Роккон, где полно всякой нечисти. Он не стал пугать людей, а просто бродил без дела. Увидев вас, такого же любителя шататься без цели, он решил, что вы родственные души, и отправился следом — куда ветер подует."

#. ja: ぶーらぶら
#. de: Hui-Hui!
#. fr: Buuurabura...
#. column 0: Summon forth your burabura chochin, a kindred spirit in wandering.
#. column 1: Contrary to expectation, this lantern ghost did not care to haunt people, and was content to simply wander Mount Rokkon. When it saw you similarly wandering, it took you for a kindred spirit and decided to follow you wherever the wind should blow.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:321:0:2"
msgid "Could they be evil spirits, lying in<br>wait for hapless treasure seekers?<br>   - Zukin"
msgstr "Неужто злые духи затаились<br>и поджидают незадачливых<br>охотников за сокровищами?<br>   — Дзюкин"

#. ja: 獅子王子に騎乗する。<br>瑞獣ヌエの王とも言われる怪異「獅子王」の分体
#. de: Beschwöre dein Shishioji.<br>Ein Abbild des gefürchteten Königs.
#. fr: Vous appelez Shishiôji, une forme réincarnée de Shishiô, le roi des chimères.
#. column 1: When the mighty Shishio, legendary auspice and king of the nue, was defeated, it shed a fragment of its malevolent will, which took form as this being. Possessing a will of its own, it recognizes you as its superior, and consents to bearing you upon its back.
#. column 2: Doubtless the lion's share<br>of the credit lies with me.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
msgctxt "MountTransient:322:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Shishioji, a prince who just can't wait to be king (again)."
msgstr "Призовите Сисиодзи — принца, которому не терпится снова стать королём."

#. ja: 瑞獣ヌエの王とも言われる怪異「獅子王」の分体。本体が征伐されたことで邪気の一部が抜け落ちて、分体が形成されたようだ。独自の意思を持っており、冒険者を強者と認め、付き従うことを決めたようである
#. de: Nachdem Shishio besiegt wurde, spaltete sich etwas von seinem Geist und materialisierte sich in der Form dieses Abbildes. Es hat einen eigenen Willen und folgt dir aus Respekt vor deiner Stärke.
#. fr: Lorsque Shishiô, le roi des chimères, fut vaincu, une partie de sa malveillance se détacha de son enveloppe charnelle pour former cet avatar. Shishiôji possède un caractère bien trempé<nbsp>; il a néanmoins décidé de vous suivre en son âme et conscience, ayant reconnu en vous une force hors du commun.
#. column 0: Summon forth Shishioji, a prince who just can't wait to be king (again).
#. column 2: Doubtless the lion's share<br>of the credit lies with me.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva
msgctxt "MountTransient:322:0:1"
msgid "When the mighty Shishio, legendary auspice and king of the nue, was defeated, it shed a fragment of its malevolent will, which took form as this being. Possessing a will of its own, it recognizes you as its superior, and consents to bearing you upon its back."
msgstr "Когда могучий Сисио, легендарный святой зверь и король нуэ, был побеждён, часть его злобной воли отделилась и обрела форму этого существа. У него есть собственная воля, но он признал ваше превосходство и согласился возить вас на спине."

#. ja: ヒョー！
#. de: Hyooargh!
#. fr: Hyoooh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Shishioji, a prince who just can't wait to be king (again).
#. column 1: When the mighty Shishio, legendary auspice and king of the nue, was defeated, it shed a fragment of its malevolent will, which took form as this being. Possessing a will of its own, it recognizes you as its superior, and consents to bearing you upon its back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:322:0:2"
msgid "Doubtless the lion's share<br>of the credit lies with me.<br>   - Nero tol Scaeva"
msgstr "Львиная доля заслуги,<br>несомненно, принадлежит мне.<br>   — Неро тол Скаева"

#. ja: 影の狼に騎乗する。<br>漆黒の影から生まれた魔狼
#. de: Rufe deinen Schattenwolf herbei. Die finsterste Mähne unter dem Nachthimmel.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre loup de l'ombre, un canidé surgi de l'obscurité la plus profonde.
#. column 1: A spawn of darkest shadow, this dread wolf is said to have been created by an evil king to do battle with a hero of eld. Though the truth of the tale cannot be verified, the creature's eyes betray not a hint of hatred towards the Warrior of Light, whom it serves with unfaltering obedience.
#. column 2: When brought into the light,<br>the wolf can seem less fearsome.<br>   - Pumpkin-headed Apparition
msgctxt "MountTransient:323:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your shadow wolf, a nightmare creature that could only be dreamed up by the darkest of souls."
msgstr "Призовите теневого волка — кошмарное создание, которое могло родиться лишь в душе, объятой тьмой."

#. ja: 漆黒の影から生まれた魔狼。かつて世界の支配をもくろんだ悪しき王が、英雄との戦いに備えて作り出したとも言われているが、詳細は定かでない。しかしながら、その瞳に光の戦士に対する憎しみはなく、従順に付き従う
#. de: Ein aus dem Dunkel der Schatten geborener Wolf. Man weiß nur, dass er von einem machtgierigen König vergangener Tage zur Verwirklichung dessen Pläne zur Weltherrschaft erschaffen wurde. Allerdings scheint er gegenüber dem Krieger des Lichts weder Hass noch Furcht, sondern nur Gehorsam und Demut zu verspüren.
#. fr: Né de l'ombre la plus noire, ce loup appartenait autrefois à un roi malfaisant qui projetait de conquérir le monde. On raconte que ce dernier l'aurait créé pour être son chien de garde, même si rien n'est moins sûr. Toujours est-il qu'il ne semble pas vous haïr, et vous accompagne avec docilité.
#. column 0: Summon forth your shadow wolf, a nightmare creature that could only be dreamed up by the darkest of souls.
#. column 2: When brought into the light,<br>the wolf can seem less fearsome.<br>   - Pumpkin-headed Apparition
msgctxt "MountTransient:323:0:1"
msgid "A spawn of darkest shadow, this dread wolf is said to have been created by an evil king to do battle with a hero of eld. Though the truth of the tale cannot be verified, the creature's eyes betray not a hint of hatred towards the Warrior of Light, whom it serves with unfaltering obedience."
msgstr "Говорят, этого грозного волка, порождённого самой тёмной тенью, создал злой король, чтобы сразиться с героем древности. Правда ли это, неизвестно, но во взгляде зверя нет и тени ненависти к Воину Света — он безоговорочно ему служит."

#. ja: ガルルル…
#. de: Wenn das nicht das ideale Reittier für unseren Krieger der Dunkelheit ist!<br><i>Knappe im Crystarium</i>
#. fr: Grrrrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your shadow wolf, a nightmare creature that could only be dreamed up by the darkest of souls.
#. column 1: A spawn of darkest shadow, this dread wolf is said to have been created by an evil king to do battle with a hero of eld. Though the truth of the tale cannot be verified, the creature's eyes betray not a hint of hatred towards the Warrior of Light, whom it serves with unfaltering obedience.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:323:0:2"
msgid "When brought into the light,<br>the wolf can seem less fearsome.<br>   - Pumpkin-headed Apparition"
msgstr "На свету<br>волк уже не кажется таким страшным.<br>   — Призрак с тыквенной головой"

#. ja: マジックキッズベッドに騎乗する。<br>魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ子ども用寝台
#. de: Steige auf dein magisches Kinderbett. Das leichte Schaukeln im Flug sorgt für einen tiefen und erholsamen Schlaf.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre lit enfant magique, un couchage capable de vous transporter dans les airs.
#. column 1: Crafted especially for children, this magicked bed hovers by virtue of crystals sourced from floating isles, and gives the sensation of sleeping on a cloud. The design is said to be directly inspired by the beds used at Menphina's Arms.
#. column 2: Keep that up and I'll send you<br>to bed without supper.<br>   - Y'shtola
msgctxt "MountTransient:324:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your magicked children's bed, and enjoy the carefree sleep of a child wherever you go."
msgstr "Призовите волшебную детскую кроватку и спите без забот где угодно, словно ребёнок."

#. ja: 魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ子ども用寝台。浮島で採取されたクリスタルが仕込まれており、その力によって夢心地のまま浮行することができる。なお、デザインは孤児院「メネフィナの家」で使われている寝台と同型だという
#. de: Ein Bett für Kinder, das auf magische Art und Weise durch die Lüfte fliegt. Der Grund für die Flugeigenschaften dieses Möbelstückes liegt in dem eingebauten Kristall, der auf einer der schwebenden Inseln abgebaut wurde. Das Aussehen erinnert an die Betten in dem Waisenhaus „Menphinas Zuflucht“.
#. fr: Le sommier de ce lit enfant est incrusté de cristaux provenant d'îles flottantes, ce qui lui permet d'une part de léviter, d'autre part de répondre aux pensées du dormeur ou de la dormeuse qui l'occupe. Son apparence reprend quant à elle celle des lits du Foyer de Menphina.
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked children's bed, and enjoy the carefree sleep of a child wherever you go.
#. column 2: Keep that up and I'll send you<br>to bed without supper.<br>   - Y'shtola
msgctxt "MountTransient:324:0:1"
msgid "Crafted especially for children, this magicked bed hovers by virtue of crystals sourced from floating isles, and gives the sensation of sleeping on a cloud. The design is said to be directly inspired by the beds used at Menphina's Arms."
msgstr "Эту волшебную кроватку создали специально для детей. Кристаллы с парящих островов позволяют ей летать, а спать на ней — будто на облаке. Говорят, её дизайн вдохновлён кроватями из приюта «Дом Менфины»."

#. ja: 寝る子は育つ！
#. de: Hätte ich als Kind in so einem Bett geschlafen wäre ich bestimmt auch etwas größer geraten!<br><i>Tataru</i>
#. fr: Chocobo, boulot, dodo<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your magicked children's bed, and enjoy the carefree sleep of a child wherever you go.
#. column 1: Crafted especially for children, this magicked bed hovers by virtue of crystals sourced from floating isles, and gives the sensation of sleeping on a cloud. The design is said to be directly inspired by the beds used at Menphina's Arms.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:324:0:2"
msgid "Keep that up and I'll send you<br>to bed without supper.<br>   - Y'shtola"
msgstr "Продолжишь в том же духе — отправлю спать<br>без ужина.<br>   — Я'штола"

#. ja: リンクス・オブ・ダークネスに騎乗する。<br>闇属性のエーテルを帯びた幻想生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Dunkelheits-Luchs herbei. Seine Augen sagen mehr als tausend Worte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre lynx de l'obscurité éternelle, un félin débordant d'énergie des Ténèbres.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards Darkness. The motes of Light it sheds call to mind the grim resolve of one who bears a great burden, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in fallen shadow.
#. column 2: I may deal from the shadows,<br>but I dislike shadowy dealings.<br>   - Remon
msgctxt "MountTransient:325:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lynx of fallen shadow, which is what a certain knight in black might look like as a large, winged feline."
msgstr "Призовите рысь падшей тьмы — вот так могла бы выглядеть одна темнокожая рыцарь, будь она огромной крылатой кошкой."

#. ja: エーテルによって構成された幻想生物の一種であり、闇属性の力を帯びている。その輝きからは悲壮な覚悟も感じ取れるが、いずれにせよ、この使い魔の来歴は未だに判明していない
#. de: Ein mit Schöpfungsmagie aus Äther erschaffener Luchs, der mit dem Element der Dunkelheit versehen wurde. Er strahlt eine traurig wirkende Ent<shy>schlos<shy>sen<shy>heit aus, sein bisheriger Werdegang bleibt aber weiterhin ein Rätsel.
#. fr: Cette entité fantasmagorique a été créée à partir d'éther regorgeant d'énergie des Ténèbres. Son pelage dégage une lueur violacée qui évoque un sentiment tragique de résignation. Toutefois, nul ne sait réellement ce qu'elle a vécu.
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of fallen shadow, which is what a certain knight in black might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 2: I may deal from the shadows,<br>but I dislike shadowy dealings.<br>   - Remon
msgctxt "MountTransient:325:0:1"
msgid "A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards Darkness. The motes of Light it sheds call to mind the grim resolve of one who bears a great burden, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in fallen shadow."
msgstr "Это фантастическое создание, в котором преобладает стихия Тьмы. Светящиеся искры напоминают о мрачной решимости того, кто несёт тяжёлое бремя, но происхождение этого фамильяра скрыто во мраке."

#. ja: …………
#. de: ......
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of fallen shadow, which is what a certain knight in black might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose elemental aspect is tipped strongly towards Darkness. The motes of Light it sheds call to mind the grim resolve of one who bears a great burden, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in fallen shadow.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:325:0:2"
msgid "I may deal from the shadows,<br>but I dislike shadowy dealings.<br>   - Remon"
msgstr "Я могу действовать из тени,<br>но не люблю тёмных дел.<br>   — Ремон"

#. ja: トルガルに騎乗する。<br>どんな過酷な旅路にも付き添う心強き相棒
#. de: Rufe den treuen Torgal an deine Seite. Auf seine Spürnase ist Verlass.
#. fr: Vous appelez Talgor, un loup prêt à suivre son maître jusqu'au bout du monde et au-delà.
#. column 1: According to the wandering minstrel, the beast who appeared to aid the stranded Clive was a guiding spirit born of its master's memory. So impressed was the ever-insightful musician by the creature, he decided to create this faithful facsimile in hopes that it might also serve as your loyal companion.
#. column 2: A more dependable comrade one<br>would be hard-pressed to find.<br>   - Alphinaud
msgctxt "MountTransient:326:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Torgal, a trusty hound inspired by the trusty hound inspired by the memories of the actual trusty hound."
msgstr "Призовите Торгала — верного пса, вдохновлённого верным псом, которого воспоминания о настоящем верном псе вдохновили на верность."

#. ja: クライヴの記憶に基づいて、導き手として降臨した彼の相棒。その存在を見た異邦の詩人が、魔笛の力を借りて新たに紡いだのが、このトルガルである。光の戦士の相棒として、どんな過酷な旅路にも付き添ってくれるだろう
#. de: Der Fahrende Sänger glaubt, dass dieser Vierbeiner in Eorzea erschienen ist, um dem gestrandeten Clive den Weg nach Hause zu zeigen. Er war gar so verzaubert von der treuen Natur und dem imposanten Er<shy>schei<shy>nungs<shy>bild des Tieres, dass er eine eigene Version von Torgal erschuf, die dir nun zur Seite steht.
#. fr: Issu des souvenirs embrumés de Clive, Talgor a fait irruption en Éorzéa pour ramener son maître dans leur monde. Le ménestrel errant en a été tellement im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>né qu'il vous a façonné un double de la créature, dans l'espoir que sa fidélité soit aussi in<shy>é<shy>bran<shy>la<shy>ble que celle de l'original.
#. column 0: Summon forth Torgal, a trusty hound inspired by the trusty hound inspired by the memories of the actual trusty hound.
#. column 2: A more dependable comrade one<br>would be hard-pressed to find.<br>   - Alphinaud
msgctxt "MountTransient:326:0:1"
msgid "According to the wandering minstrel, the beast who appeared to aid the stranded Clive was a guiding spirit born of its master's memory. So impressed was the ever-insightful musician by the creature, he decided to create this faithful facsimile in hopes that it might also serve as your loyal companion."
msgstr "По словам странствующего менестреля, зверь, пришедший на помощь потерявшемуся Клайву, был духом-проводником, рождённым из воспоминаний хозяина. Проницательный менестрель так впечатлился зверем, что создал его точную копию, надеясь, что она станет вам верным спутником."

#. ja: プレシジョン！
#. de: Der blickte mich so treu und flehend an, dass ich ihn sofort ins Herz schloss.<br><i>Gilgamesch</i>
#. fr: Grrrrr... Ouaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Torgal, a trusty hound inspired by the trusty hound inspired by the memories of the actual trusty hound.
#. column 1: According to the wandering minstrel, the beast who appeared to aid the stranded Clive was a guiding spirit born of its master's memory. So impressed was the ever-insightful musician by the creature, he decided to create this faithful facsimile in hopes that it might also serve as your loyal companion.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:326:0:2"
msgid "A more dependable comrade one<br>would be hard-pressed to find.<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "Надёжнее товарища<br>и не сыскать.<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: アークに騎乗する。<br>可変機能を備えた魔導仕掛けの小型飛空艇
#. de: Steige in deine Arche ein. Ein Magitek-Mecha, welcher seine Form je nach Gebrauch verändern kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Arkh, un aéronef magitek compact capable de se transformer.
#. column 1: Seeking to develop an advanced transforming airship, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks turned to the expertise of a former Illuminati scientist. The result is a machina that can convert between bipedal and assault craft forms in the blink of an eye.
#. column 2: It would seem there is more<br>to you than meets the eye.<br>   - Yugiri
msgctxt "MountTransient:327:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Ark, a bipedal warmachina disguised as an airship─or an airship disguised as a bipedal warmachina, if you prefer."
msgstr "Призовите Арк — двуногую боевую машину в облике дирижабля. Или дирижабль в облике двуногой боевой машины, если вам так больше нравится."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が開発した小型可変飛空艇。青の手出身の科学者と協力することで、人型のガンナー形態から、戦艦型のシューター形態へとトランスフォームする可変機構を実現している
#. de: Ein weiteres Prachtexemplar von den talentierten Mechanikern der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke. Die Entwicklung fand Hand in Hand mit den Wissenschaftlern von der Indigo-Hand statt, und so ist es wenig verwunderlich, dass sich dieses Meisterwerk der Handwerkskunst von einer humanoiden Kriegsmaschine in ein rasantes Luftschiff transformieren kann.
#. fr: Cet engin transformable compact a été développé par les Forges de Garlond avec le concours d'un ancien scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>que de la Main indigo. Le résultat est une machine pouvant passer du mode bipède au mode aéronef en un instant.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Ark, a bipedal warmachina disguised as an airship─or an airship disguised as a bipedal warmachina, if you prefer.
#. column 2: It would seem there is more<br>to you than meets the eye.<br>   - Yugiri
msgctxt "MountTransient:327:0:1"
msgid "Seeking to develop an advanced transforming airship, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks turned to the expertise of a former Illuminati scientist. The result is a machina that can convert between bipedal and assault craft forms in the blink of an eye."
msgstr "Желая создать совершенный трансформирующийся дирижабль, инженеры Гарлондских мастерских обратились к бывшему учёному Иллюминатов. Так появилась машина, способная в мгновение ока превращаться из двуногой боевой машины в штурмовой корабль."

#. ja: ターゲット確認、排除開始
#. de: Diamorphose ausgeführt<nbsp>... Geschütz aktiviert!
#. fr: Cible verrouillée<nbsp>! Paré à faire feu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Ark, a bipedal warmachina disguised as an airship─or an airship disguised as a bipedal warmachina, if you prefer.
#. column 1: Seeking to develop an advanced transforming airship, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks turned to the expertise of a former Illuminati scientist. The result is a machina that can convert between bipedal and assault craft forms in the blink of an eye.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:327:0:2"
msgid "It would seem there is more<br>to you than meets the eye.<br>   - Yugiri"
msgstr "В тебе, похоже,<br>есть нечто большее, чем кажется.<br>   — Югири"

#. ja: バハムート・アポクリファに騎乗する。<br>知られざる竜詩をもとに紡がれた、新たな翼
#. de: Steige auf deinen Apokryph-Bahamut auf. Der Wille des gefallenen Drachen lebt weiter, und er will dich auf seinem Sofa tragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Bahamut apocryphe, un étrange dragon désireux de vous transporter sur un canapé.
#. column 1: This draconic entity is brought forth by blowing into the horn you received from the wandering minstrel while holding in your heart Bahamut's song recorded by the Heimdall. Thus imbued with hopes and dreams, it desires nothing more than to soar the boundless skies and recognizes your free-spirited self as its master.
#. column 2: Let me examine it, that I might<br>ascertain its authenticity.<br>   - Oboro
msgctxt "MountTransient:328:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your apocryphal Bahamut, an embodiment of the fallen wyrm's burning desire to be free...and apparently carry you on a sofa."
msgstr "Призовите апокрифического Бахамута — воплощение пылкого желания павшего дракона обрести свободу... и, похоже, возить вас на диване."

#. ja: ヘイムダル級観察艇が記録していた「バハムートの竜詩」のエーテル波形を礎とし、冒険者とシンギングウェイの想いを魔笛に込めることで形作られた存在。無窮の空を翔けるべく、真に自由な冒険者を主と認めたらしい
#. de: Dank Singingways unermüdlicher Forschung über die Mysterien der Äthersignaturen gelang die Entwicklung eines speziellen Horns, dessen Klang diese Kreatur herauf<shy>be<shy>schwört. In deiner freigeistlichen Umtriebigkeit erkennt er eine Ähnlichkeit mit seinem Verlangen, die endlosen Himmel Eorzeas zu durchstreifen, und so erkennt er dich als seinen Meister an.
#. fr: Le ménestrel errant a conçu le cor permettant d'invoquer cette créature grâce à l'éther résiduel du chant de Bahamut contenu dans le Heimdall. La volonté ardente du dragon de voler libre vers le firmament s'accorde à merveille avec votre soif d'aventure.
#. column 0: Summon forth your apocryphal Bahamut, an embodiment of the fallen wyrm's burning desire to be free...and apparently carry you on a sofa.
#. column 2: Let me examine it, that I might<br>ascertain its authenticity.<br>   - Oboro
msgctxt "MountTransient:328:0:1"
msgid "This draconic entity is brought forth by blowing into the horn you received from the wandering minstrel while holding in your heart Bahamut's song recorded by the Heimdall. Thus imbued with hopes and dreams, it desires nothing more than to soar the boundless skies and recognizes your free-spirited self as its master."
msgstr "Этот дракон появляется, когда вы играете на роге, полученном от странствующего менестреля, и вспоминаете песнь Бахамута, записанную «Хеймдаллем». Наделённый надеждами и мечтами, он жаждет парить в бескрайнем небе и признаёт хозяином того, кто, как и он, по-настоящему свободен духом."

#. ja: 5　4　3　……
#. de: Lass sie mich mal sehen, damit ich ihre Echtheit bestätigen kann.<br><i>Oboro</i>
#. fr: 5... 4... 3...
#. column 0: Summon forth your apocryphal Bahamut, an embodiment of the fallen wyrm's burning desire to be free...and apparently carry you on a sofa.
#. column 1: This draconic entity is brought forth by blowing into the horn you received from the wandering minstrel while holding in your heart Bahamut's song recorded by the Heimdall. Thus imbued with hopes and dreams, it desires nothing more than to soar the boundless skies and recognizes your free-spirited self as its master.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:328:0:2"
msgid "Let me examine it, that I might<br>ascertain its authenticity.<br>   - Oboro"
msgstr "Дай-ка осмотреть. Нужно убедиться, что это подлинник.<br>   — Оборо"

#. ja: クレセントムーンに騎乗する。<br>優しげに輝く魔法仕掛けの三日月形ゴンドラ
#. de: Steige auf deinen Sichelmond, eine Gondel, welche dem lieblich scheinenden Halbmond nachempfunden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre croissant de lune, une gondole volante reprenant la forme de l'astre et brillant d'une douce lueur.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of a crescent moon, this magicked gondola was being kept in storage in Sharlayan, where it was classified as a gift. While its origin is undisclosed, the automaton that accompanies the contraption offers a telling clue.
#. column 2: Gods, I can scarcely believe we<br>went to the moon and back...<br>   - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:329:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your crescent moon mount. By all accounts more comfortable to perch upon than one shaped like a full moon."
msgstr "Призвать ездовую лунную гондолу. Говорят, на таком полумесяце сидеть удобнее, чем на полной луне."

#. ja: オールド・シャーレアンの倉庫内に「贈与品」という分類で保管されていた、魔法仕掛けの三日月形ゴンドラ。送り主は非公開となっているようだが、従者として付属する魔法人形から、ある程度は推測することができそうだ
#. de: Diese magische Gondel wurde für lange Zeit in den Tiefen des Labyrinthos' aufbewahrt. Der Sender scheint zwar anonym bleiben zu wollen, die mitverpackte magische Marionette lässt einen aber nicht umhinkommen, gewisse Vermutungen anzustellen<nbsp>...
#. fr: Cette gondole magique est restée longtemps entreposée à Sharlayan, dans une boîte marquée de la mention “cadeau”. Si son expéditeur reste inconnu, la poupée magique qui l'accompagne ne laisse aucun doute possible quant à son origine.
#. column 0: Summon forth your crescent moon mount. By all accounts more comfortable to perch upon than one shaped like a full moon.
#. column 2: Gods, I can scarcely believe we<br>went to the moon and back...<br>   - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:329:0:1"
msgid "Designed in the likeness of a crescent moon, this magicked gondola was being kept in storage in Sharlayan, where it was classified as a gift. While its origin is undisclosed, the automaton that accompanies the contraption offers a telling clue."
msgstr "Эту зачарованную гондолу в форме полумесяца хранили в Старом Шарлаяне как подарок. Кто её прислал, неизвестно, но приложенная к ней магическая кукла красноречиво намекает на отправителя."

#. ja: フライ・ミー・トゥ・ザ…
#. de: Flieg mich zum Mo...
#. fr: Envole-moi...
#. column 0: Summon forth your crescent moon mount. By all accounts more comfortable to perch upon than one shaped like a full moon.
#. column 1: Designed in the likeness of a crescent moon, this magicked gondola was being kept in storage in Sharlayan, where it was classified as a gift. While its origin is undisclosed, the automaton that accompanies the contraption offers a telling clue.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:329:0:2"
msgid "Gods, I can scarcely believe we<br>went to the moon and back...<br>   - Thancred"
msgstr "Боги, не верится, что мы<br>слетали на луну и обратно...<br>   — Танкрет"

#. ja: ライエスに騎乗する。<br>障害として設計された機械仕掛けのサイ
#. de: Rufe Rhiyes herbei. Dieses mechanische Rhinozeros hat eine besondere Abneigung gegenüber Bohnen.
#. fr: Vous appelez Rhiyes, un rhinocéros mécanique par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement irascible.
#. column 1: Created to serve as an obstacle in Blunderville, this mechanical rhinoceros has employed its ample weight and power to thwart the progress of many a hapless Bean. Fortunately for you, however, this example was programmed to shuttle you around rather than send you flying.
#. column 2: There they go again, charging off<br>before we have a chance to discuss<br>our plan of action!<br>   - Shigure
msgctxt "MountTransient:330:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Rhiyes, a vibrantly hued mechanical rhinoceros that can't say no to terrorizing the Beans of Blunderville."
msgstr "Призвать Риес — яркого механического носорога, который только и рад гонять бобы в Блундервиле."

#. ja: ブランダーヴィルの障害として設計された機械仕掛けのサイ。あふれるパワーを活かして、これまで幾多のジェリービーンズたちの進行を阻んできた。しかし、今度は景品として、冒険者の進行を助けることにしたらしい
#. de: Rhiyes wurde als Hindernis für Stolperville entworfen und hat mit seiner überwältigenden Stoßkraft schon unzähligen hilflosen Bohnen den Tag ruiniert. Dieses spezielle Exemplar jedoch wurde für Abenteurer zum Reittier umfunktioniert.
#. fr: Conçu pour terroriser les par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants du Blunderville, ce rhinocéros mécanique a déjà envoyé par-dessus bord un nombre incalculable de haricots. N'ayez crainte cependant<nbsp>: votre modèle a été reprogrammé pour vous épargner.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rhiyes, a vibrantly hued mechanical rhinoceros that can't say no to terrorizing the Beans of Blunderville.
#. column 2: There they go again, charging off<br>before we have a chance to discuss<br>our plan of action!<br>   - Shigure
msgctxt "MountTransient:330:0:1"
msgid "Created to serve as an obstacle in Blunderville, this mechanical rhinoceros has employed its ample weight and power to thwart the progress of many a hapless Bean. Fortunately for you, however, this example was programmed to shuttle you around rather than send you flying."
msgstr "Риес создали как препятствие для участников Блундервиля. Своим немалым весом и силой он не раз преграждал путь бедным бобам. Но этот экземпляр теперь не сбивает тебя с ног, а возит на себе."

#. ja: …………
#. de: ...
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Rhiyes, a vibrantly hued mechanical rhinoceros that can't say no to terrorizing the Beans of Blunderville.
#. column 1: Created to serve as an obstacle in Blunderville, this mechanical rhinoceros has employed its ample weight and power to thwart the progress of many a hapless Bean. Fortunately for you, however, this example was programmed to shuttle you around rather than send you flying.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:330:0:2"
msgid "There they go again, charging off<br>before we have a chance to discuss<br>our plan of action!<br>   - Shigure"
msgstr "И опять они рванули вперёд,<br>не дав нам даже обсудить<br>план действий!<br>   — Сигурэ"

#. ja: オプレッサーに騎乗する。<br>青の手が開発した無人兵器を、騎乗用に改造した機体
#. de: Rufe deinen Unterdrücker herbei. Umgebaut für maximalen Komfort.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre oppresseur, un automate crée par les Gobelins de la Main indigo.
#. column 1: Originally an autonomous weapon developed by the Illuminati, this oppressor underwent a conversion to be able to carry a pilot. While the process necessitated the stripping of munitions, what the machina loses in destructive capabilities, it gains in luxury and comfort.
#. column 2: What did you expect you were<br>in for, a luxurious litter ride!?<br>   - Sicard
msgctxt "MountTransient:331:0:0"
msgid "Summon your oppressor mount, a weapon of war-turned-conveyance of comfort."
msgstr "Призвать опрессора — грозное орудие войны, переделанное в уютное средство передвижения."

#. ja: 青の手が開発した無人兵器を、騎乗用に改造した機体。元が無人兵器であったため、乗用スペースを確保すべく兵装のすべてが取り外された。その甲斐あって、内部には乗り心地抜群のラグジュアリーな空間が広がっている
#. de: Diese von der Indigo-Hand entwickelte Kriegsmaschine wurde für maximalen Fahrkomfort umgebaut. Hierfür mussten allerdings alle Waffensysteme entfernt werden. Stattdessen heißt alle Piloten jetzt ein großzügig angelegtes Cockpit willkommen.
#. fr: Mis au point comme engin de guerre autonome, cet automate a ensuite été entièrement modifié afin de pouvoir accueillir un pilote. Le jeu en valait la chandelle, car la machine dispose désormais d'une cabine tout confort<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your oppressor mount, a weapon of war-turned-conveyance of comfort.
#. column 2: What did you expect you were<br>in for, a luxurious litter ride!?<br>   - Sicard
msgctxt "MountTransient:331:0:1"
msgid "Originally an autonomous weapon developed by the Illuminati, this oppressor underwent a conversion to be able to carry a pilot. While the process necessitated the stripping of munitions, what the machina loses in destructive capabilities, it gains in luxury and comfort."
msgstr "Изначально это было автономное оружие, созданное Иллюминатами. Опрессора переделали так, чтобы он мог перевозить пилота. Ради этого пришлось снять всё вооружение, зато теперь внутри роскошно и удобно."

#. ja: プシュゥゥゥゥ
#. de: Bzzzzz
#. fr: Tchouuuuuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your oppressor mount, a weapon of war-turned-conveyance of comfort.
#. column 1: Originally an autonomous weapon developed by the Illuminati, this oppressor underwent a conversion to be able to carry a pilot. While the process necessitated the stripping of munitions, what the machina loses in destructive capabilities, it gains in luxury and comfort.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:331:0:2"
msgid "What did you expect you were<br>in for, a luxurious litter ride!?<br>   - Sicard"
msgstr "И на что ты рассчитывал?<br>На роскошные носилки!?<br>   — Сикард"

#. ja: リンクス・オブ・アビスに騎乗する。<br>赤き月の底で発見された幻想生物
#. de: Rufe deinen Mondtiefen-Luchs herbei. Eine Aura der Sehnsucht umgibt diese Kreatur.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre lynx des abysses, un félin étant apparu dans les tréfonds de la lune du treizième reflet.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose being brims with the Darkness that roiled in the depths of the Thirteenth's moon. The motes of Light it sheds calls to mind the yearning for home that drove the dread voidsent Zeromus, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in abyssal grief.
#. column 2: I just...I just want to go home...<br>   - Drest
msgctxt "MountTransient:332:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your lynx of abyssal grief, which could be what a certain dread voidsent born in the depths of the moon might look like as a large, winged feline."
msgstr "Призвать рысь скорби из бездны. Возможно, именно так выглядел бы огромный крылатый кот — порождение ужасающей тьмы, рождённое в глубинах луны."

#. ja: エーテルによって構成された幻想生物の一種であり、第十三世界の月の底に渦巻くさまざまな強い闇属性の力を帯びている。その輝きは見る者に望郷の念をも抱かせるが、いずれにせよ、この使い魔の来歴は未だに判明していない
#. de: Eine Phantomkreatur, deren elementarer Aspekt stark in Richtung tiefster Dunkelheit tendiert. Dies lässt sich wohl auf die wabernde Finsternis in den Tiefen des roten Mondes zurückführen, wo sie entdeckt wurde. Sein Ursprung ist nach wie vor unbekannt, doch weckt er bei Betrachtern auf mysteriöse Weise ein Gefühl des Heimwehs.
#. fr: Ce lynx a la particularité d'être né des puissantes Ténèbres concentrées au cœur de la lune du néant. La manière dont il scintille semble témoigner d'une certaine nostalgie, mais ses origines concrètes sont toujours empreintes de mystère.
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of abyssal grief, which could be what a certain dread voidsent born in the depths of the moon might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 2: I just...I just want to go home...<br>   - Drest
msgctxt "MountTransient:332:0:1"
msgid "A phantom creation whose being brims with the Darkness that roiled in the depths of the Thirteenth's moon. The motes of Light it sheds calls to mind the yearning for home that drove the dread voidsent Zeromus, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in abyssal grief."
msgstr "Призрачное создание, в котором бурлит Тьма, клубившаяся в глубинах луны Тринадцатого мира. Сыплющиеся с него искры света навевают тоску по дому — ту самую, что гнала страшного яозуна Зеромуса. Но происхождение этого фамильяра окутано бездонной скорбью."

#. ja: …………
#. de: ...
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your lynx of abyssal grief, which could be what a certain dread voidsent born in the depths of the moon might look like as a large, winged feline.
#. column 1: A phantom creation whose being brims with the Darkness that roiled in the depths of the Thirteenth's moon. The motes of Light it sheds calls to mind the yearning for home that drove the dread voidsent Zeromus, but the origins of this familiar are shrouded in abyssal grief.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:332:0:2"
msgid "I just...I just want to go home...<br>   - Drest"
msgstr "Я просто... я просто хочу домой...<br>   — Дрест"

#. ja: サボテンダー・デラ・ルナに騎乗する。<br>ある商会主に祝福されたサボテンダー。物語を聞かされて育った
#. de: Klammere dich an deinem Kaktor de la Luna fest. Ein von der Inhaberin eines gewissen Handelshauses gesegneter Kaktor, der mit allerhand Geschichten aufgewachsen ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre pampa de la luna, une créature pomponnée par la maison des splendeurs.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this cactuar has led a pampered life. With the merchant being too busy to personally tend to it, however, its care fell to Khloe Aliapoh, whose attentive hand and rousing tales allowed it to grow into a large specimen with a luminescent blossom.
#. column 2: The smell of the sea is sending<br>needles up my nose!<br>   - Presumptuous Postmoogle
msgctxt "MountTransient:333:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your sabotender de la luna mount, a prodigious cactuar raised on a diet of rousing tales."
msgstr "Призвать ездовое растение «саботендер де ла луна» — огромного кактуса, выросшего на историях о подвигах."

#. ja: 商人「ロウェナ」による祝福を受け、贅沢な暮らしをしてきたサボテンダー。水やりを怠けがちなロウェナに代わり、クロ・アリアポーが物語を聞かせながら丹念に世話をした結果、よく伸び、光を放つ妙な個体に成長したらしい
#. de: Der Segen der Händlerin Rowena verhalf diesem Kaktor zu einem Leben frei von jeglichen Sorgen. Anstelle der vergesslichen Rowena übernahm jedoch stets Khloe Aliapoh das Wässern, und das mit voller Hingabe und immer neuen Geschichten auf den Lippen. Folglich wuchs dieser Kaktor über die Jahre zu einem beachtlichen Exemplar heran, welches ein sonderbares Licht von sich gibt.
#. fr: Cette variété de pampa a été élevée dans le luxe et l'abondance par Rowena. La patronne de la maison des splendeurs dédiant le plus clair de son temps à son entreprise, c'est Khloe Aliapoh qui s'occupa de la choyer en lui racontant ses récits d'aventures préférés. Ainsi, le pampa grandit de plus en plus, émettant également une étrange lueur.
#. column 0: Summon forth your sabotender de la luna mount, a prodigious cactuar raised on a diet of rousing tales.
#. column 2: The smell of the sea is sending<br>needles up my nose!<br>   - Presumptuous Postmoogle
msgctxt "MountTransient:333:0:1"
msgid "Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this cactuar has led a pampered life. With the merchant being too busy to personally tend to it, however, its care fell to Khloe Aliapoh, whose attentive hand and rousing tales allowed it to grow into a large specimen with a luminescent blossom."
msgstr "Этот кактус жил в роскоши под покровительством своей хозяйки Ровены. Та была слишком занята торговлей, чтобы самой за ним ухаживать, и заботу взяла на себя Хлоя Алиапо. Благодаря её вниманию и захватывающим рассказам кактус вырос до исполинских размеров, а на его цветке появилось свечение."

#. ja: 針0本！
#. de: Fehlanzeige. Keine Nadeln!
#. fr: Zéro aiguille<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your sabotender de la luna mount, a prodigious cactuar raised on a diet of rousing tales.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this cactuar has led a pampered life. With the merchant being too busy to personally tend to it, however, its care fell to Khloe Aliapoh, whose attentive hand and rousing tales allowed it to grow into a large specimen with a luminescent blossom.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:333:0:2"
msgid "The smell of the sea is sending<br>needles up my nose!<br>   - Presumptuous Postmoogle"
msgstr "От запаха моря<br>иголки в носу щекочут!<br>   — Самоуверенный почтальон-могл"

#. ja: スターチス・ミラージュに騎乗する。<br>アロアロ島で出会ったはぐれフェアリーの分体
#. de: Rufe die spektrale Statice an deine Seite, das Abbild von Schabernack und Schadenfreude aus Aloalo.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Statice illusoire, la réplique exacte d'une fée croisée sur l'île d'Aloalo
#. column 1: This mischief-loving faerie was originally companion to a scholar, but her aether refused to disperse in the wake of her master's death. After enduring a dull existence for long years, she found in you someone who could provide her with excitement, and thus did she weave an avatar of herself to join you on adventures.
#. column 2: Most serious scholars consider it<br>little more than a faerie tale.<br>   - Phillice
msgctxt "MountTransient:334:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your spectral Statice, an avatar of the mischief-loving faerie from Aloalo Island."
msgstr "Призвать призрачную Статице — воплощение озорной феи с Острова Алоало."

#. ja: いたずら好きのはぐれフェアリー。ある軍学者の相棒だったが、主の死後もエーテルが霧散せず、長い時を過ごしてきた。そんな退屈さを紛らわせてくれそうな冒険者を発見し、分体を生成して同行させることにしたらしい
#. de: Ursprünglich war diese feiste Fee die Gefährtin eines Gelehrten, doch selbst nach dessen Tod verweilte ihr Äther auf Aloalo. Nach unendlich langen Jahren der Langeweile fand sie schließlich jemanden, der ihr wahren Nervenkitzel bereiten konnte. So erschuf sie einen spektralen Avatar von sich selbst, um diese Person auf Schritt und Tritt zu begleiten.
#. fr: Cette fée malicieuse était à l'origine le familier d'un érudit militaire, mais son éther a refusé de se disperser après la mort de son maître. Après des années d'ennui, elle a enfin trouvé en vous un partenaire de jeu idéal, et c'est pourquoi elle a créé une copie d'elle-même pour vous accompagner dans vos aventures.
#. column 0: Summon forth your spectral Statice, an avatar of the mischief-loving faerie from Aloalo Island.
#. column 2: Most serious scholars consider it<br>little more than a faerie tale.<br>   - Phillice
msgctxt "MountTransient:334:0:1"
msgid "This mischief-loving faerie was originally companion to a scholar, but her aether refused to disperse in the wake of her master's death. After enduring a dull existence for long years, she found in you someone who could provide her with excitement, and thus did she weave an avatar of herself to join you on adventures."
msgstr "Эта озорная фея когда-то была спутницей учёного, но после его смерти её эфир не рассеялся. Долгие годы ей было скучно, пока она не встретила тебя — того, с кем можно повеселиться. Тогда она создала свою копию, чтобы та сопровождала тебя в приключениях."

#. ja: ふふふっ
#. de: Soso, du bist nun also in der Lage, Feen zu beschwören. Faszinierend<nbsp>...<br><i>Thubyrgeim</i>
#. fr: Hi hi hi...
#. column 0: Summon forth your spectral Statice, an avatar of the mischief-loving faerie from Aloalo Island.
#. column 1: This mischief-loving faerie was originally companion to a scholar, but her aether refused to disperse in the wake of her master's death. After enduring a dull existence for long years, she found in you someone who could provide her with excitement, and thus did she weave an avatar of herself to join you on adventures.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:334:0:2"
msgid "Most serious scholars consider it<br>little more than a faerie tale.<br>   - Phillice"
msgstr "Самые серьёзные учёные считают,<br>что это просто сказки о феях.<br>   — Филлис"

#. ja: ガーロンドGL-IITに騎乗する。<br>ガーロンドGL-IIに、耕運機を接続した開拓仕様トライク
#. de: Steige auf deine Garlond GL-IIT auf und mach dich an die Arbeit!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre Garlond GL-IIT, un engin agricole dernier cri.
#. column 1: A variant of the popular Garlond GL-II, this trike has been engineered for cultivating the land. The ceruleum-powered rotary tiller makes short work of transforming rough terrain, while the cargo tray is ideal for transporting materials and passengers both.
#. column 2: This untamed isle is yours<br>to cultivate as you see fit.<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:335:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Garlond GL-IIT, a magitek vehicle equipped with a tiller, and cultivate your isle in style."
msgstr "Призвать Гарлонд GL-IIT — магитехнический транспорт с плугом, чтобы с комфортом возделывать свой остров."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社製魔導二輪車GL-IIに、耕運機を接続した開拓仕様トライク。青燐機関を動力としてロータリーを回転させ、荒れ地をも簡単に耕耘できるほか、後部に人や物資を載せて運搬することもできる
#. de: Die Idee für dieses Trike kam den Meistern der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke, als sie an ihrem beliebten Magitek-Motorrad Garlond GL-II eine Ackerfräse anbauten. Einige Prototypen später und diese Wundermaschine der Landwirtschaft war geboren. Mit ihr kann jedes noch so verkommene Fleckchen Erde bebaubar gemacht werden und obendrein eignet sie sich bestens zum Transport von Personen und Waren.
#. fr: Cette variante du très populaire Garlond GL-II a été fabriquée avec un usage agricole en tête. Ce motoculteur alimenté au céruleum permet de retourner la terre en un temps record. Sa soute permet également de transporter facilement le personnel et matériel nécessaire pour entretenir les champs.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Garlond GL-IIT, a magitek vehicle equipped with a tiller, and cultivate your isle in style.
#. column 2: This untamed isle is yours<br>to cultivate as you see fit.<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:335:0:1"
msgid "A variant of the popular Garlond GL-II, this trike has been engineered for cultivating the land. The ceruleum-powered rotary tiller makes short work of transforming rough terrain, while the cargo tray is ideal for transporting materials and passengers both."
msgstr "Эта модель популярного Гарлонд GL-II создана для обработки земли. Роторный плуг на церулеуме быстро расправляется даже с целиной, а грузовой отсек отлично подходит для перевозки припасов и пассажиров."

#. ja: ドルルルルル…
#. de: Ich denke, es ist an der Zeit, ein neues Feld anzulegen.<br><i>Tagayasu</i>
#. fr: Vrrrrrrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Garlond GL-IIT, a magitek vehicle equipped with a tiller, and cultivate your isle in style.
#. column 1: A variant of the popular Garlond GL-II, this trike has been engineered for cultivating the land. The ceruleum-powered rotary tiller makes short work of transforming rough terrain, while the cargo tray is ideal for transporting materials and passengers both.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:335:0:2"
msgid "This untamed isle is yours<br>to cultivate as you see fit.<br>   - Tataru"
msgstr "На этом диком острове ты можешь<br>возделывать землю как пожелаешь.<br>   — Татару"

#. ja: ピティーに騎乗する。<br>桃の花が好きなグゥーブーの女の子
#. de: Rufe Pfirsina, das Goobbue-Mädchen mit dem Hang zur Pfirsichblüte, herbei.
#. fr: Vous appelez Peatie, une jeune goobbue qui adore les fleurs de pêcher.
#. column 1: Hailing from a place where the peach trees bloom, this winsome goobbue maiden was found and taken in by the traveling entertainer Aldemund. After delighting the crowds on Little Ladies' Day, she made the decision to join you on your adventures in order to spread more cheer.
#. column 2: Place these peach blossoms<br>in your hair, and become<br>as princesses!<br>   - Aldiytha
msgctxt "MountTransient:336:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Peatie, a goobbue maiden with a soft spot for peach blossoms."
msgstr "Призвать Пити — деву-губбу, неравнодушную к цветам персика."

#. ja: 桃の花の咲く美しい場所でのびのび育ったグゥーブー。旅芸人アルデムンドとともに各地をめぐり、プリンセスデーでは多くの人々に自らの芸を披露した。より多くの人に笑顔を届けるため、旅する冒険者についていくことを決めたらしい
#. de: Diese Goobbue wuchs inmitten eines Hains aus Pfirsichblüten auf. Zusammen mit dem reisenden Gaukler Aldemund durchstreifte sie bereits so einige Winkel der Welt und beglückte die Leute zum Prinzessinnenfest mit ihren Künsten. An der Seite <if $gn4>der Kriegerin<else>des Kriegers</if> des Lichts scheint sie sich nun zu erhoffen, noch mehr Freude verbreiten zu können.
#. fr: Originaire d'une région où la culture de la pêche est prédominante, cette goobbue fut adoptée par le saltimbanque itinérant Aldemund qui l'emmena aux quatre coins du monde. Après avoir ravi les passants lors de la fête des demoiselles, elle décida de se joindre à vous.
#. column 0: Summon forth Peatie, a goobbue maiden with a soft spot for peach blossoms.
#. column 2: Place these peach blossoms<br>in your hair, and become<br>as princesses!<br>   - Aldiytha
msgctxt "MountTransient:336:0:1"
msgid "Hailing from a place where the peach trees bloom, this winsome goobbue maiden was found and taken in by the traveling entertainer Aldemund. After delighting the crowds on Little Ladies' Day, she made the decision to join you on your adventures in order to spread more cheer."
msgstr "Эта губбу выросла в прекрасном краю, где цветут персиковые деревья. Её нашёл и приютил странствующий артист Алдемунд. На Празднике маленьких леди она восхитила публику своим выступлением, а теперь решила отправиться с тобой в приключения и дарить радость новым зрителям."

#. ja: グゥ、グゥゥ～♪
#. de: Wenn ich doch nur den Magen einer Goobbue besäße, dann könnte ich noch mehr essen. <br><i>Nanamo</i>
#. fr: Goo... Gooo<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon forth Peatie, a goobbue maiden with a soft spot for peach blossoms.
#. column 1: Hailing from a place where the peach trees bloom, this winsome goobbue maiden was found and taken in by the traveling entertainer Aldemund. After delighting the crowds on Little Ladies' Day, she made the decision to join you on your adventures in order to spread more cheer.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:336:0:2"
msgid "Place these peach blossoms<br>in your hair, and become<br>as princesses!<br>   - Aldiytha"
msgstr "Вплетите эти цветы персика<br>в волосы и станьте принцессами!<br>   — Алдийта"

#. ja: アルスヴィズに騎乗する。<br>虹の如き毛色を有する珍しいユニコーン
#. de: Auf Alsvid aufsteigen. Die regenbogenfarbene Mähne dieses Einhorns macht es zu einem ganz einzigartigen Exemplar.
#. fr: Vous appelez Alsvid, une licorne rarissime au crin couleur arc-en-ciel.
#. column 1: Legend holds that this unicorn, possessed of splendid rainbow hair, is destined to bear a soul who embodies the brilliance of the sun. In seeming confirmation of said legend, the creature spurns ordinary riders, and lends its back only to the Warrior of Light.
#. column 2: Spying on you is as simple<br>as sliding down the back<br>of a rainbow.<br>   - Feo Ul
msgctxt "MountTransient:337:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Alsvid, a unicorn whose rainbow hair makes it the rarest of its kind─a veritable unicorn among unicorns."
msgstr "Призвать Альсвида — единорога с радужной гривой, редчайшего из своего рода. Настоящий единорог среди единорогов."

#. ja: 虹の如き毛色を有す珍しいユニコーン。ある伝承によれば、「太陽」を象徴する者を運ぶという使命を背負っているとされる。事実、並の乗り手になびくことはなく、選ばれし光の戦士のみに背を貸すという
#. de: Den Legenden zufolge soll dieses mit einer regenbogenfarbenen Mähne gesegnete Einhorn dazu bestimmt sein, nur jene auf sich reiten zu lassen, deren Seelen so hell wie die Sonne selbst strahlen. Es kommt daher nicht von ungefähr, dass eine in allen Belangen überdurchschnittliche Persönlichkeit wie du es zu reiten vermag.
#. fr: La légende raconte que cet animal magistral n'accepterait de se laisser chevaucher que par l'élu du Soleil. En vérité, le canasson cornu préfère simplement les Guerriers de la Lumière et envoie valdinguer quiconque d'autre essayant de le monter.
#. column 0: Summon forth Alsvid, a unicorn whose rainbow hair makes it the rarest of its kind─a veritable unicorn among unicorns.
#. column 2: Spying on you is as simple<br>as sliding down the back<br>of a rainbow.<br>   - Feo Ul
msgctxt "MountTransient:337:0:1"
msgid "Legend holds that this unicorn, possessed of splendid rainbow hair, is destined to bear a soul who embodies the brilliance of the sun. In seeming confirmation of said legend, the creature spurns ordinary riders, and lends its back only to the Warrior of Light."
msgstr "По легенде, этому единорогу с прекрасной радужной гривой суждено нести на себе душу, что воплощает сияние солнца. Словно подтверждая предание, он не подпускает обычных всадников и позволяет оседлать себя лишь Воину Света."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich kann leichter in dich hineinsehen als in einen hohlen Baumstamm.<br><i>Feo Ul</i>
#. fr: .<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.<nbsp>.
#. column 0: Summon forth Alsvid, a unicorn whose rainbow hair makes it the rarest of its kind─a veritable unicorn among unicorns.
#. column 1: Legend holds that this unicorn, possessed of splendid rainbow hair, is destined to bear a soul who embodies the brilliance of the sun. In seeming confirmation of said legend, the creature spurns ordinary riders, and lends its back only to the Warrior of Light.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:337:0:2"
msgid "Spying on you is as simple<br>as sliding down the back<br>of a rainbow.<br>   - Feo Ul"
msgstr "Подсмотреть за тобой проще простого:<br>скатиться по радуге.<br>   — Фео Ул"

#. ja: クアクアに騎乗する。<br>南洋諸島にて確認された巴術由来の使い魔
#. de: Rufe deinen Quaqua herbei, der keineswegs so furchterregend ist, wie er eigentlich aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre quaqua, un familier né de la magie arcanique des îles méridionales.
#. column 1: Employed by a treasure hunter of Aloalo Island, this familiar was born of an early form of arcanima, an art which emerged in the south sea isles. The being's origin is attested by its predominantly wooden construction, a method which precedes the use of gemstones to create Carbuncles.
#. column 2: Them younglin's will be grinnin'<br>ear to ear when they see what<br>you've got in store!<br>   - Baenfaeld
msgctxt "MountTransient:338:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your quaqua, a familiar hailing from the south sea isles that has either a permanent snarl or grin, depending on one's outlook on life."
msgstr "Призвать куакуа — фамильяра с южных островов, чья вечная гримаса может показаться и оскалом, и улыбкой: смотря как взглянуть на жизнь."

#. ja: アロアロ島で出会ったトレジャーハンターが使役していた使い魔。南洋諸島で発展してきた巴術由来の使い魔であり、心核には木材が使われている。宝石を用いたカーバンクルが編み出される以前の古い形式の存在である
#. de: Dieses Familiar, das von Schatz<shy>suchern aus Aloalo beschworen wurde, entstammt einer Vorform der Hermetik, die auf den südlichen Inseln erfunden wurde. Interessanterweise besteht er ganz und gar aus Holz, entgegen den moderneren Karfunkeln, deren Körper aus Edelsteinen bestehen.
#. fr: Cette créature fut employée contre vous par des chasseurs de trésor sur l'île d'Aloalo. Manipulée grâce à une forme primitive d'arcanisme, elle possède un cœur en bois, une pratique remontant avant l'utilisation de joyaux pour la création de familiers comme Carbuncle.
#. column 0: Summon forth your quaqua, a familiar hailing from the south sea isles that has either a permanent snarl or grin, depending on one's outlook on life.
#. column 2: Them younglin's will be grinnin'<br>ear to ear when they see what<br>you've got in store!<br>   - Baenfaeld
msgctxt "MountTransient:338:0:1"
msgid "Employed by a treasure hunter of Aloalo Island, this familiar was born of an early form of arcanima, an art which emerged in the south sea isles. The being's origin is attested by its predominantly wooden construction, a method which precedes the use of gemstones to create Carbuncles."
msgstr "Этот фамильяр служил охотнику за сокровищами на Острове Алоало. Он создан с помощью ранней формы магии арканима, возникшей на южных островах. Его деревянное тело выдаёт древнее происхождение: такие фамильяры появились раньше карбункулов с самоцветным сердцем."

#. ja: クァア！
#. de: Mit den südlichen Inseln kann man nie was verkehrt machen.<br><i>Kokkol Dankkol</i>
#. fr: Qua<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your quaqua, a familiar hailing from the south sea isles that has either a permanent snarl or grin, depending on one's outlook on life.
#. column 1: Employed by a treasure hunter of Aloalo Island, this familiar was born of an early form of arcanima, an art which emerged in the south sea isles. The being's origin is attested by its predominantly wooden construction, a method which precedes the use of gemstones to create Carbuncles.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:338:0:2"
msgid "Them younglin's will be grinnin'<br>ear to ear when they see what<br>you've got in store!<br>   - Baenfaeld"
msgstr "Увидят, что ты приготовил,<br>и у молодых улыбка<br>до ушей растянется!<br>   — Бенфельд"

#. ja: アイル・ピーリフールに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったピーリフール。まだ腐ってはいない！
#. de: Steige auf deinen Paradies-Peeriefool auf. Ein etwas zu groß geratener Peeriefool. Ist noch genießbar.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre peeriefool insulaire, une créature végétale pas du tout moisie, juré<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Loaded aboard a trading vessel as part of its provisions, this mandragora decided to try her luck in the open sea rather than be added to soup. As luck would have it, the tides delivered her to a desert island, whose fertile soil and sunshine allowed her to attain enormous proportions.
#. column 2: Honestly, I've never seen<br>such foolishness!<br>   - Namono Tayamono
msgctxt "MountTransient:339:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island Peerifool. If anyone asks, it bears no relation whatsoever to a certain malicious rotting vegetable."
msgstr "Призвать островного Пирифула. Если спросят, заверяй: он ни капли не похож на одну злобную гнилую овощную особу."

#. ja: 島外産のマンドラゴラ。ある交易船に食料として在籍していた過去を持つ。スープの具にされかけた際、一か八かと海に飛び込んだ結果、無人島に漂着。肥沃な土地と太陽光を受けて大いに成長した……らしい
#. de: Diese Mandragora stammt von außerhalb der Insel. So soll sie ursprünglich im Vorrat eines Handelsschiffes gelagert gewesen sein. Doch gerade als sie zu Suppe verarbeitet werden sollte, sah sie ihre Gelegenheit und sprang in die Wellen des Ozeans, welche sie im Inselparadies an Land spülten. Die nährstoffreiche Umgebung und die energiespendende Sonne verhalfen ihr zu ungeahnter Größe.
#. fr: Cette variété de mandragore s'est retrouvée dans les cales d'un navire de commerce. Alors qu'elle allait finir dans le bouillon du jour, elle prit la fuite et se jeta dans l'océan, avant d'échouer sur une île déserte. Le climat tropical et la terre fertile des lieux lui ont permis d'atteindre des proportions inédites<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Peerifool. If anyone asks, it bears no relation whatsoever to a certain malicious rotting vegetable.
#. column 2: Honestly, I've never seen<br>such foolishness!<br>   - Namono Tayamono
msgctxt "MountTransient:339:0:1"
msgid "Loaded aboard a trading vessel as part of its provisions, this mandragora decided to try her luck in the open sea rather than be added to soup. As luck would have it, the tides delivered her to a desert island, whose fertile soil and sunshine allowed her to attain enormous proportions."
msgstr "Эту мандрагору погрузили на торговое судно как провизию. Не желая попасть в суп, она решила попытать счастья в открытом море. Волны вынесли её на необитаемый остров, где плодородная земля и солнце помогли ей вырасти до невероятных размеров."

#. ja: ％％◎▲※〇…
#. de: Bist du vielleicht ein entfernter Verwandter der Mandragoras?<br><i>Hildibrand</i>
#. fr: %%◎▲※〇...
#. column 0: Summon forth your island Peerifool. If anyone asks, it bears no relation whatsoever to a certain malicious rotting vegetable.
#. column 1: Loaded aboard a trading vessel as part of its provisions, this mandragora decided to try her luck in the open sea rather than be added to soup. As luck would have it, the tides delivered her to a desert island, whose fertile soil and sunshine allowed her to attain enormous proportions.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:339:0:2"
msgid "Honestly, I've never seen<br>such foolishness!<br>   - Namono Tayamono"
msgstr "Честное слово, никогда не видел<br>такой глупости!<br>   — Намоно Таямоно"

#. ja: アイル・アデニウムに騎乗する。<br>大きく育ったアデニウム。いつか広い世界へ！
#. de: Steige auf deine Paradies-Wüstenrose. Eine Rose der Wüst... des Paradieses!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre adenium insulaire, une variété de rose du désert qui rêve de découvrir le monde.
#. column 1: Sprouted and grown in the South Mandra Kingdom, this adenium lived what he thought was a happy life until he encountered the Peerifool. From the castaway vegetable, he learned about the great wide world beyond the island's bounds, and began to dream of embarking upon grand adventures.
#. column 2: I have oft heard it said that a blossom's beauty<br>can move a man to love and long, but I never truly<br>believed it until I met you two desert roses.<br>   - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:340:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your island adenium. Literally a desert rose by another name, and doesn't have much of a scent to brag about."
msgstr "Призвать островной адениум. Буквально пустынная роза, только запахом похвастаться не может."

#. ja: 無人島産のアデニウム。野菜国家「南マンドラ王国」にて、ぬくぬくと育ってきたが、ある日、浜辺に漂着したピーリフールと出会う。彼女によって、外に広い世界があることを知った彼は、冒険の旅を夢見るようになった……らしい
#. de: Auch im Inselparadies gibt es Wüsten...rosen! Wohlbehütet unter den schützenden Blättern des botanischen Kaiserreiches aufgewachsen, lernt diese Mandragora erst durch den jüngst angespülten Peeriefool von den Wundern der Außenwelt. Nun ist es der Wunsch nach Abenteuer, der sie antreibt.
#. fr: Cet adenium insulaire a grandi dans une zone par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement fertile, le royaume de Mandra sud, où il vivait paisiblement... Jusqu'au jour où il est tombé sur un peeriefool échoué sur la plage<nbsp>! Abreuvé des récits de son nouvel ami, il se mit en tête lui aussi de partir à l'aventure afin de découvrir le monde.
#. column 0: Summon forth your island adenium. Literally a desert rose by another name, and doesn't have much of a scent to brag about.
#. column 2: I have oft heard it said that a blossom's beauty<br>can move a man to love and long, but I never truly<br>believed it until I met you two desert roses.<br>   - Thancred
msgctxt "MountTransient:340:0:1"
msgid "Sprouted and grown in the South Mandra Kingdom, this adenium lived what he thought was a happy life until he encountered the Peerifool. From the castaway vegetable, he learned about the great wide world beyond the island's bounds, and began to dream of embarking upon grand adventures."
msgstr "Этот адениум вырос в Южном королевстве мандрагор и считал свою жизнь счастливой, пока не встретил Пирифула. От овоща, выброшенного на берег, он узнал о большом мире за пределами острова и стал мечтать о грандиозных приключениях."

#. ja: 〇▽◎×□！
#. de: Unsere Abenteuer waren immer so turbulent, so lebendig.<br><i>Alphinaud</i>
#. fr: 〇▽◎×□<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your island adenium. Literally a desert rose by another name, and doesn't have much of a scent to brag about.
#. column 1: Sprouted and grown in the South Mandra Kingdom, this adenium lived what he thought was a happy life until he encountered the Peerifool. From the castaway vegetable, he learned about the great wide world beyond the island's bounds, and began to dream of embarking upon grand adventures.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:340:0:2"
msgid "I have oft heard it said that a blossom's beauty<br>can move a man to love and long, but I never truly<br>believed it until I met you two desert roses.<br>   - Thancred"
msgstr "Говорят, красота цветка<br>может пробудить любовь и тоску. Но я поверил в это, лишь встретив вас, две пустынные розы.<br>   — Танкрет"

#. ja: チャイチャに騎乗する。<br>飛膜を広げ、木々の間を飛び回る草食動物
#. de: Rufe deinen Ty'aitya als Reittier herbei. Mit seinen Gleitfähigkeiten an deiner Seite durchquert ihr im Nu selbst das dichteste Gehölz flink und geschwind.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ty'aitya. Cet animal herbivore est capable de voler d'arbre en arbre grâce à ses membranes.
#. column 1: Its name meaning “little voices at play” in Xbr'aal, this herbivorous beastkin is capable of gliding impressive distances owing to the skin that stretches between its wrists and ankles. Fiercely territorial, it is known to attack even large predators using the bladelike cartilage protruding from the side of its hands.
#. column 2: Have you ever seen a ty'aitya?<br>   - Ty'at Roh
msgctxt "MountTransient:342:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your ty'aitya. Though its kind is ordinarily only capable of gliding, no one has apparently told this fellow, who can fly indefinitely."
msgstr "Призвать ти'айтию. Её сородичи умеют лишь парить, но, видимо, этому никто не сказал — он способен летать без остановки."

#. ja: 飛膜を広げ、木々の間を飛び回る草食動物。なわばり意識が強く、大型の捕食者にも臆さず、ブレード状に発達した針状軟骨を活かして襲いかかるほど獰猛な一面も。なお、その名はシュバラール語で「小さな遊ぶ声」を意味する
#. de: Dieser flinke Pflanzenfresser ist vor allem in den dichten Wäldern Turals anzutreffen. Mit spitzen Knochen als Klingen verteidigt er sein Revier selbst vor den größten Raubtieren. In der Sprache der Xbr'aal bedeutet Ty'aitya „kleine spielende Stimme“.
#. fr: Cette créature est très territoriale et ne se laisse pas intimider par les grands prédateurs. Elle est également féroce, et utilise son cartilage en forme de lame pour attaquer. Son nom signifie “petit cri à la cime des arbres” en langue xbr'aal.
#. column 0: Summon forth your ty'aitya. Though its kind is ordinarily only capable of gliding, no one has apparently told this fellow, who can fly indefinitely.
#. column 2: Have you ever seen a ty'aitya?<br>   - Ty'at Roh
msgctxt "MountTransient:342:0:1"
msgid "Its name meaning “little voices at play” in Xbr'aal, this herbivorous beastkin is capable of gliding impressive distances owing to the skin that stretches between its wrists and ankles. Fiercely territorial, it is known to attack even large predators using the bladelike cartilage protruding from the side of its hands."
msgstr "Название этого травоядного зверолюда на языке шбра'аал означает «маленькие голоса, играющие». Благодаря перепонкам между запястьями и лодыжками он может парить на большие расстояния. Ти'айтия ревниво охраняет свою территорию и нападает даже на крупных хищников, используя острые, похожие на лезвия хрящи по бокам кистей."

#. ja: プシュプシュ…
#. de: Puffu! Puffu!
#. fr: Frrrt...
#. column 0: Summon forth your ty'aitya. Though its kind is ordinarily only capable of gliding, no one has apparently told this fellow, who can fly indefinitely.
#. column 1: Its name meaning “little voices at play” in Xbr'aal, this herbivorous beastkin is capable of gliding impressive distances owing to the skin that stretches between its wrists and ankles. Fiercely territorial, it is known to attack even large predators using the bladelike cartilage protruding from the side of its hands.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:342:0:2"
msgid "Have you ever seen a ty'aitya?<br>   - Ty'at Roh"
msgstr "Ты когда-нибудь видел ти'айтию?<br>   — Т'ят Ро"

#. ja: エアスピナーA9に騎乗する。<br>新生アレクサンドリア連王国製の単座浮行機。武装類は付属しない
#. de: Auf deinem Luftraser A9 aufsitzen. Ein schwebender Einsitzer, ausgestattet mit der neuesten Elektrob-Technologie aus Neu-Alexandria. Bewaffnung ist nicht enthalten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Motodrone A9, un aéronef monoplace développé par le royaume de Néo-Alexandrie.
#. column 1: Designed and built in Alexandria, this single-rider flying vehicle uses electrope to convert lightning to wind energy, which it expels to produce levitation and propulsion. While air-wheelers are extensively employed by the military, the A9 is a civilian model and does not come fitted with armaments.
#. column 2: I'm looking for an air-wheeler A9.<br>Have you got any...er...smaller sizes?<br>   - Milalla Customer
msgctxt "MountTransient:343:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your air-wheeler A9. The lights aren't merely for show and actually make it go."
msgstr "Призвать аэромобиль A9. Огни на нём не для красоты — они заставляют его летать."

#. ja: 新生アレクサンドリア連王国製の単座浮行機。エレクトロープ製回転器で雷気を風属性に変換し、渦巻く風を噴出して浮行する。なお、軍にも採用されてはいるが、A9タイプは民生用であるため武装類は付属していない
#. de: Dieses in Neu-Alexandria entworfene, motorradähnliche Gefährt nutzt die vielfältige Einsetzbarkeit von Elektrob zur Erzeugung von Wind, um so zu schweben. Luftraser finden zwar auch im Militär des Königreiches Gebrauch, dieses Modell (A9) verfügt allerdings über keinerlei Waffensysteme und ist somit für den Verkauf an alle Fahrberechtigten zugelassen.
#. fr: Cet aéronef monoplace est un petit bijou de la technologie du royaume de Néo-Alexandrie. Il flotte grâce à son moteur en électrope qui convertit l'électricité en tourbillon de vent. Bien qu'il soit également utilisé par l'armée, le modèle A9 n'est pas équipé d'arme et se destine plutôt à un usage civil.
#. column 0: Summon forth your air-wheeler A9. The lights aren't merely for show and actually make it go.
#. column 2: I'm looking for an air-wheeler A9.<br>Have you got any...er...smaller sizes?<br>   - Milalla Customer
msgctxt "MountTransient:343:0:1"
msgid "Designed and built in Alexandria, this single-rider flying vehicle uses electrope to convert lightning to wind energy, which it expels to produce levitation and propulsion. While air-wheelers are extensively employed by the military, the A9 is a civilian model and does not come fitted with armaments."
msgstr "Созданный в Александрии одноместный летательный аппарат преобразует молниевую энергию в энергию ветра с помощью электропы, а затем использует потоки воздуха для подъёма и движения. Аэромобили широко применяются в армии, но A9 — гражданская модель, без вооружения."

#. ja: シュイーン…
#. de: Bzzzwusch!
#. fr: Vroaaa...
#. column 0: Summon forth your air-wheeler A9. The lights aren't merely for show and actually make it go.
#. column 1: Designed and built in Alexandria, this single-rider flying vehicle uses electrope to convert lightning to wind energy, which it expels to produce levitation and propulsion. While air-wheelers are extensively employed by the military, the A9 is a civilian model and does not come fitted with armaments.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:343:0:2"
msgid "I'm looking for an air-wheeler A9.<br>Have you got any...er...smaller sizes?<br>   - Milalla Customer"
msgstr "Я ищу аэромобиль A9.<br>У вас есть... эм... поменьше?<br>   — Покупатель из Милаллы"

#. ja: アルパカに騎乗する。<br>純白の毛が特徴の四脚獣。唾の臭いはかなりのもの
#. de: Rufe dein Alpaka als Reittier herbei. Seine weiche Wolle garantiert eine überaus angenehme Reiseerfahrung. Nimm dich nur vor seiner stinkenden Spucke in Acht<nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture alpaga. Cette créature au poil blanc éructe des crachats dont l'odeur est tout bonnement répugnante.
#. column 1: Known as a Pelupelu merchant's best friend, the alpaca has long been raised as livestock in the mountainous regions of Tural. They are prized for their wool, a staple material in traditional textiles, as well as their sure-footedness, which sees them employed as both pack animals and cavalry mounts.
#. column 2: You can take an alpaca to water,<br>but you can't make it drink.<br>   - Keshkwa
msgctxt "MountTransient:344:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your alpaca. Its foul spit is outweighed by its cuteness and utility. Mostly."
msgstr "Призвать альпаку. Её дурно пахнущая слюна не перевешивает миловидность и пользу. Почти."

#. ja: 純白の毛が特徴の四脚獣。主にトラル大陸の山岳部で家畜として飼育され、体毛は織物に加工されるほか、強靭な足腰は駄獣や騎獣として大いに役立つ。ペルペル族の行商を助けるよき友として、トラルでは広く認知されている
#. de: Ein Vierbeiner bekannt für seine weiße Wolle und kräftige Beinmuskulatur. Er lebt vorwiegend in den Bergregionen Turals und wird dort auch als Nutztier gezüchtet. Seine Wolle ist vielseitig verwendbar, während seine starken Beine ihn zum perfekten Lastentier machen. Er wird häufig mit den Pelupelu verbunden, welche viel mit ihm als reisende Händler den Kontinent durchqueren.
#. fr: Ces quadrupèdes au pelage blanc sont prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment élevés dans les régions montagneuses du continent de Tural, où leurs poils sont transformés en textile. Ils sont très prisés par les Pelupelu grâce à leurs pattes vigoureuses qui les rendent très utiles pour le transport de mar<shy>chan<shy>di<shy>ses ou en tant que montures.
#. column 0: Summon forth your alpaca. Its foul spit is outweighed by its cuteness and utility. Mostly.
#. column 2: You can take an alpaca to water,<br>but you can't make it drink.<br>   - Keshkwa
msgctxt "MountTransient:344:0:1"
msgid "Known as a Pelupelu merchant's best friend, the alpaca has long been raised as livestock in the mountainous regions of Tural. They are prized for their wool, a staple material in traditional textiles, as well as their sure-footedness, which sees them employed as both pack animals and cavalry mounts."
msgstr "Альпака — лучший друг торговца-пелупелу. Её издавна разводят в горных районах Турала. Ценят её и за шерсть, из которой ткут традиционные ткани, и за крепкие ноги: альпаки служат вьючными животными и ездовыми скакунами."

#. ja: ぷうぷう♪
#. de: Pfha!♪
#. fr: Rrrik... thfffu<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon forth your alpaca. Its foul spit is outweighed by its cuteness and utility. Mostly.
#. column 1: Known as a Pelupelu merchant's best friend, the alpaca has long been raised as livestock in the mountainous regions of Tural. They are prized for their wool, a staple material in traditional textiles, as well as their sure-footedness, which sees them employed as both pack animals and cavalry mounts.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:344:0:2"
msgid "You can take an alpaca to water,<br>but you can't make it drink.<br>   - Keshkwa"
msgstr "К воде альпаку привести можно,<br>а вот пить её не заставишь.<br>   — Кешква"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・ディザスターに騎乗する。<br>ウォーコー・ラァ・ドーで発見された魔法の翼
#. de: Rufe deine Flügel der Katastrophe als Reittier herbei. Magische Schwingen, die in Worqor Lar Dor entdeckt wurden.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes du désastre, trouvées à Worqor Lar Dor.
#. column 1: Calling to mind Valigarmanda, the dread creature dubbed the Skyruin, these magicked wings grant their wearer an aura of irrepressible might. Though they are said to manifest only for those who are worthy, the truth of their nature is shrouded in mystery.
#. column 2: The tales these walls could<br>tell of the Skyruin...<br>   - Pameka
msgctxt "MountTransient:345:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of ruin. Rest assured they won't bring destruction wherever they go."
msgstr "Призвать крылья погибели. Не бойся: куда бы ты ни отправился с ними, разрушений они не принесут."

#. ja: 幻獣ヴァリガルマンダのそれとよく似た、魔法の翼。相応しい持ち主のもとに自ら舞い降りるとも伝わるが、その来歴は謎に包まれている。いずれにせよ、この翼を授かりし者は「生ける天災」の威厳をも身に纏うことだろう
#. de: Magische Flügel, die denen des Tural Vidraal Valigarmanda sehr ähnlich sehen. Es heißt, dass sie sich ihrem auserwählten Meister zeigen, indem sie vor ihm langsam und bedächtig hinuntergleiten. Ihre wahre Herkunft ist jedoch von Mysterien umhüllt. Es ist allerdings unbestreitbar, dass ihrem Träger dieselbe Erhabenheit zuteilwird wie der geflügelten Geißel selbst.
#. fr: Des ailes magiques, semblables à celles de Valigarmanda. La légende dit qu'elles ont décidé de voler jusqu'à la personne qu'elles jugent digne d'être leur pro<shy>prié<shy>taire, mais leur histoire reste entourée de mystère. Ce qui est certain, c'est que le porteur de ces ailes aura également la prestance de la calamité incarnée.
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of ruin. Rest assured they won't bring destruction wherever they go.
#. column 2: The tales these walls could<br>tell of the Skyruin...<br>   - Pameka
msgctxt "MountTransient:345:0:1"
msgid "Calling to mind Valigarmanda, the dread creature dubbed the Skyruin, these magicked wings grant their wearer an aura of irrepressible might. Though they are said to manifest only for those who are worthy, the truth of their nature is shrouded in mystery."
msgstr "Эти зачарованные крылья напоминают Валигарманду, ужасное создание по прозвищу Небесная погибель, и наделяют своего носителя неукротимой мощью. Говорят, они являются лишь достойным, но их истинная природа окутана тайной."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Pghyaaaaaaa!<br><i>Valigarmanda</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of ruin. Rest assured they won't bring destruction wherever they go.
#. column 1: Calling to mind Valigarmanda, the dread creature dubbed the Skyruin, these magicked wings grant their wearer an aura of irrepressible might. Though they are said to manifest only for those who are worthy, the truth of their nature is shrouded in mystery.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:345:0:2"
msgid "The tales these walls could<br>tell of the Skyruin...<br>   - Pameka"
msgstr "Сколько тайн хранят эти стены<br>о Небесной погибели...<br>   — Памека"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・リゾルヴに騎乗する。<br>エバーキープ最上層で発見された魔法の翼
#. de: Rufe deine Flügel des Mutes als Reittier herbei. Magische Schwingen, die auf der höchsten Ebene des Immerfried entdeckt wurden.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes de la détermination, trouvées au sommet de la Gardienne de l'Éternité.
#. column 1: Calling to mind Zoraal Ja, King of Resolve of Alexandria, these magicked wings grant their wearer an aura of undying pride. Though they were discovered near the throne on the summit of Everkeep, the truth of their nature is shrouded in mystery.
#. column 2: When the army fails in its duty,<br>it is the charge of the King of Resolve<br>to clean up its mess.<br>   - Zoraal Ja
msgctxt "MountTransient:346:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of resolve. Their deep-blue hue exudes the burden of a lost man."
msgstr "Призвать крылья решимости. Их тёмно-синий цвет словно хранит бремя заблудшего человека."

#. ja: エバーキープの最上層、武王の玉座付近で発見された魔法の翼。青き鱗のような羽根は奇跡の子ゾラージャを思わせるが、来歴は謎に包まれている。いずれにせよ、この翼を授かりし者は「武王」の矜持をも身に纏うことだろう
#. de: Magische Flügel, die in der Nähe des Thrones der Krone des Mutes von Neu-Alexandria entdeckt wurden. Ihre blau glitzernden Schuppen erinnern an das Wunderkind Zoraal Ja, doch ihre wahre Herkunft ist von Mysterien umhüllt. Es ist jedoch unbestreitbar, dass ihrem Träger derselbe Stolz zuteil wird wie dem machtbesessenen König selbst.
#. fr: Ces ailes magiques ont été trouvées près du trône au faîte de la Gardienne de l'Éternité. Les plumes bleues ressemblant à des écailles rappellent Zoraal Ja, l'enfant prodige, mais leur histoire reste entourée de mystère. Ce qui est certain, c'est que le porteur de ces ailes aura également la prestance d'un Aurarque de la Force.
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of resolve. Their deep-blue hue exudes the burden of a lost man.
#. column 2: When the army fails in its duty,<br>it is the charge of the King of Resolve<br>to clean up its mess.<br>   - Zoraal Ja
msgctxt "MountTransient:346:0:1"
msgid "Calling to mind Zoraal Ja, King of Resolve of Alexandria, these magicked wings grant their wearer an aura of undying pride. Though they were discovered near the throne on the summit of Everkeep, the truth of their nature is shrouded in mystery."
msgstr "Эти зачарованные крылья напоминают Зораль Джа, царя Решимости Александрии, и наделяют своего носителя неугасимой гордостью. Их нашли у трона на вершине Вечной крепости, но происхождение крыльев окутано тайной."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Hahaha! Endlich, die ultimative Stärke gehört mir!<br><i>Zoraal Ja</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of resolve. Their deep-blue hue exudes the burden of a lost man.
#. column 1: Calling to mind Zoraal Ja, King of Resolve of Alexandria, these magicked wings grant their wearer an aura of undying pride. Though they were discovered near the throne on the summit of Everkeep, the truth of their nature is shrouded in mystery.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:346:0:2"
msgid "When the army fails in its duty,<br>it is the charge of the King of Resolve<br>to clean up its mess.<br>   - Zoraal Ja"
msgstr "Если армия не справляется со своей задачей,<br>царь Решимости должен<br>сам разгрести её беспорядок.<br>   — Зораль Джа"

#. ja: アウトランナーに騎乗する。<br>新生アレクサンドリア連王国製の自律型汎用マシン。表情パターンは意外と豊富
#. de: Rufe deine Auskunftsdrohne als Reittier herbei. Eine autonome Maschine aus Neu-Alexandria, welche überraschend viele Emotionen darstellen kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture trékhoïde, une machine autonome développée par le royaume de Néo-Alexandrie. Pour une raison inconnue, elle peut prendre beaucoup d'expressions différentes.
#. column 1: A general-purpose machine, the outrunner can perform a wide variety of tasks, from the maintenance of facilities and devices to the elimination of dangerous creatures. Its design incorporates a monitor which displays comical expressions in lieu of a face, that it might be more approachable to the public.
#. column 2: Outrunner guide unit identified.<br>   - Mechanical Sentry
msgctxt "MountTransient:347:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your outrunner, a rotund machine built by the Alexandrians."
msgstr "Призвать громоздкого аутраннера, машину, созданную александрийцами."

#. ja: 新生アレクサンドリア連王国製の自律型汎用マシン。施設の清掃から機器のメンテナンス、時には危険生物の駆除まで、あらゆることをこなす。市民に親しまれるよう、躯体正面のモニターにコミカルな表情が表示される
#. de: Eine autonome Maschine aus Neu-Alexandria. Von Gebäudesäuberung über die Instandhaltung anderer Maschinerien bis hin zur Beseitigung von Bestien findet man sie dort an praktisch jeder Straßenecke. Um sie für die Bevölkerung ansprechender zu gestalten, befindet sich auf ihrer Vorderseite ein Bildschirm, über den sie allerlei Gesichtsausdrücke darstellen können.
#. fr: Du ménage à l'entretien des équipements, voire même parfois l'extermination de créatures dangereuses, elle peut tout faire. Elle est également capable d'afficher plusieurs expressions drôles sur son écran, ce qui la rend populaire auprès du public.
#. column 0: Summon forth your outrunner, a rotund machine built by the Alexandrians.
#. column 2: Outrunner guide unit identified.<br>   - Mechanical Sentry
msgctxt "MountTransient:347:0:1"
msgid "A general-purpose machine, the outrunner can perform a wide variety of tasks, from the maintenance of facilities and devices to the elimination of dangerous creatures. Its design incorporates a monitor which displays comical expressions in lieu of a face, that it might be more approachable to the public."
msgstr "Аутраннер — универсальная машина, способная выполнять самые разные задачи: от уборки помещений и обслуживания устройств до уничтожения опасных существ. Вместо лица у него экран, показывающий забавные выражения, чтобы он казался людям приветливее."

#. ja: ピピピッ
#. de: Biep biep biep!
#. fr: Bip bip bip<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your outrunner, a rotund machine built by the Alexandrians.
#. column 1: A general-purpose machine, the outrunner can perform a wide variety of tasks, from the maintenance of facilities and devices to the elimination of dangerous creatures. Its design incorporates a monitor which displays comical expressions in lieu of a face, that it might be more approachable to the public.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:347:0:2"
msgid "Outrunner guide unit identified.<br>   - Mechanical Sentry"
msgstr "Обнаружен аутраннер. Путеводитель.<br>   — Механический часовой"

#. ja: メワピャラに騎乗する。<br>カピバラの成獣。義理堅い性格らしい
#. de: Rufe dein Mehwapyarra herbei. Die ausgewachsene Form eines Capybara. Gilt als äußerst treu.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mehwapyarra. Ce rongeur a un caractère doux et posé.
#. column 1: This fully grown mehwapyarra (“capybara” in certain other parts) was wandering alone in Shaaloani when it was attacked and swallowed whole by the tural vidraal Ttokrrone. Fortunately for the creature, you appeared and put down its devourer before it could be digested, and it now lends you its back out of a sense of duty.
#. column 2: The Fury take these<br>ridiculous flying rodents!<br>   - Estinien
msgctxt "MountTransient:348:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your mehwapyarra. As dutiful as it is laid-back."
msgstr "Призвать мехуапьярру. Она и спокойна, и верна своему слову."

#. ja: シャーローニ荒野を旅していたカピバラの成獣。あるときトラルヴィドラール「トクローネ」に襲われて丸呑みにされるも、どっこい腹の中で生き延びていた。命を救ってくれた冒険者に恩義を感じ、旅に同行することを望んだらしい
#. de: Die ausgewachsene Form der in Shaaloani beheimateten Capybara. Als es vom fürchterlichen Tural Vidraal Ttokrrone angegriffen und verschlungen wurde, dachtest du schon, das wäre es mit ihm gewesen. Doch als du das Biest besiegt hattest, zeigte sich seine niedliche Schnauze wieder und äußerst dankbar obendrein. Seitdem folgt es dir auf deinen Abenteuern auf Schritt und Tritt.
#. fr: Cette créature, appelée cabiaï dans d'autres contrées, se baladait en Shaaloani lorsqu'il a été attaqué et avalé par Ttokrrone, le Tural vidraal. Ayant miraculeusement survécu dans son estomac, il se sent apparemment redevable envers la personne qui l'a sauvé et souhaite l'accompagner dans son périple.
#. column 0: Summon forth your mehwapyarra. As dutiful as it is laid-back.
#. column 2: The Fury take these<br>ridiculous flying rodents!<br>   - Estinien
msgctxt "MountTransient:348:0:1"
msgid "This fully grown mehwapyarra (“capybara” in certain other parts) was wandering alone in Shaaloani when it was attacked and swallowed whole by the tural vidraal Ttokrrone. Fortunately for the creature, you appeared and put down its devourer before it could be digested, and it now lends you its back out of a sense of duty."
msgstr "Взрослая мехуапьярра бродила в одиночестве по Шаалоани, когда её схватил и проглотил целиком ттокррон, туральский видраал. К счастью, ты успел убить хищника, пока тот не переварил добычу. Теперь зверь возит тебя на себе из благодарности за спасение."

#. ja: グルグル…
#. de: Grrh ... Grrh ...
#. fr: Grrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your mehwapyarra. As dutiful as it is laid-back.
#. column 1: This fully grown mehwapyarra (“capybara” in certain other parts) was wandering alone in Shaaloani when it was attacked and swallowed whole by the tural vidraal Ttokrrone. Fortunately for the creature, you appeared and put down its devourer before it could be digested, and it now lends you its back out of a sense of duty.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:348:0:2"
msgid "The Fury take these<br>ridiculous flying rodents!<br>   - Estinien"
msgstr "Чтоб Ярость прибрала этих<br>нелепых летающих грызунов!<br>   — Эстиниен"

#. ja: モノホイールS1に騎乗する。<br>優れた闘士に与えられるという特別な単輪車
#. de: Rufe dein Monorad S1 herbei. Dieses einrädrige Fortbewegungsmittel wird nur an außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>liche Kämpfer übergeben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Monoroue S1, un véhicule spécial que seuls les combattants hors pair sont autorisés à posséder.
#. column 1: A prize Ascension Arcadia bestows upon its champions, this unique one-wheeled vehicle employs an advanced stability system that allows it to traverse any and all terrain. Owing to its complex controls, however, it takes considerable practice to become a competent rider.
#. column 2: Without further ado, let us<br>set the wheels in motion!<br>   - Lady Luck
msgctxt "MountTransient:349:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your monowheel S1, a bold vehicle fit for a champion of the Arcadion."
msgstr "Призвать моноцикл S1 — дерзкий транспорт для чемпиона Аркадиона."

#. ja: アルカディア・ソサエティが優秀な闘士に贈る報奨品。高度な姿勢制御プログラムが組み込まれており、場所を選ばず自在に駆けることが可能。ただし、姿勢制御に難があるため乗りこなすには修練が必要となる
#. de: Eine besondere Prämie, die die Arkadion-Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft ihren fähigsten Kämpfern zur Verfügung stellt. Dieses Gerät ist mit einem hoch ausgeklügelten Programm zur Lageregelung ausgestattet, wodurch auch ohne vorherige Zieleingabe komplett frei gelenkt werden kann. Es benötigt allerdings viel Übung, um die komplexe Steuerung vollständig zu beherrschen.
#. fr: Ce véhicule est un cadeau que la Société de l'Arcadion offre à ses compétiteurs les plus doués. Il est équipé d'un programme de contrôle d'apparence très sophistiqué et il est capable de se diriger librement sans avoir besoin de lui indiquer une destination. Il faut toutefois beaucoup d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment avant de réussir à maîtriser ses commandes complexes.
#. column 0: Summon forth your monowheel S1, a bold vehicle fit for a champion of the Arcadion.
#. column 2: Without further ado, let us<br>set the wheels in motion!<br>   - Lady Luck
msgctxt "MountTransient:349:0:1"
msgid "A prize Ascension Arcadia bestows upon its champions, this unique one-wheeled vehicle employs an advanced stability system that allows it to traverse any and all terrain. Owing to its complex controls, however, it takes considerable practice to become a competent rider."
msgstr "Эту необычную одноколёсную машину Аркадия вручает своим чемпионам в награду. Сложная система стабилизации позволяет ей ехать по любой местности, но освоить непростое управление можно лишь после долгих тренировок."

#. ja: キュイーン
#. de: Vrooom!
#. fr: Vroum<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your monowheel S1, a bold vehicle fit for a champion of the Arcadion.
#. column 1: A prize Ascension Arcadia bestows upon its champions, this unique one-wheeled vehicle employs an advanced stability system that allows it to traverse any and all terrain. Owing to its complex controls, however, it takes considerable practice to become a competent rider.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:349:0:2"
msgid "Without further ado, let us<br>set the wheels in motion!<br>   - Lady Luck"
msgstr "Ну что ж, хватит разговоров,<br>пора пустить колёса в ход!<br>   — Госпожа удача"

#. ja: ロネークに騎乗する。<br>主にサカ・トラルに棲息する四脚獣
#. de: Rufe ein Rroneek als Reittier herbei. Diese haarigen Vierbeiner trifft man vor allem in Xak Tural.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture rroneek, un quadrupède qui vit prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment au Xak Tural.
#. column 1: Found grazing the plains of Xak Tural, this stoutly built beastkin has been prized since ancient times on account of fairly every part of it being a useful resource. Owing to its importance in their lives, many nomadic tribes revere it as their guiding animal, and migrate alongside it with the seasons.
#. column 2: Well, you two look happier than<br>a pair of rroneek in the sun.<br>   - Zemoweni
msgctxt "MountTransient:350:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your rroneek. As your trusty steed, this creature can look forward to living to a ripe old age."
msgstr "Призвать рронека. В роли верного скакуна он наверняка доживёт до глубокой старости."

#. ja: サカ・トラルに棲息する大型の草食動物。角や毛、皮、肉などあらゆる部位に利用価値があり、古くから人々の暮らしを支えてきた。季節ごとに獲物を追って移動する狩猟部族の中には、ロネークを祖霊として祀る者も少なくない
#. de: Ein Pflanzenfresser von großer Statur heimisch in Xak Tural. Durch seine Hörner, Fell, Haut und Fleisch hat er den Bewohnern dieser Gegend schon seit langem großen Nutzen erwiesen. Unter den wandernden Völkern, welche mit den Jahreszeiten ihrer Beute folgen gibt es nicht wenige, welche die Rroneek als Geister ihrer Vorfahren verehren.
#. fr: Ce grand herbivore est endémique du Xak Tural. Chaque partie de son corps est utilisée, y compris les cornes, les poils, la peau et la chair, le rendant in<shy>dis<shy>pen<shy>sa<shy>ble à la vie des habitants. Il est parfois vénéré comme esprit protecteur par les chasseurs à la recherche de proies dans la région.
#. column 0: Summon forth your rroneek. As your trusty steed, this creature can look forward to living to a ripe old age.
#. column 2: Well, you two look happier than<br>a pair of rroneek in the sun.<br>   - Zemoweni
msgctxt "MountTransient:350:0:1"
msgid "Found grazing the plains of Xak Tural, this stoutly built beastkin has been prized since ancient times on account of fairly every part of it being a useful resource. Owing to its importance in their lives, many nomadic tribes revere it as their guiding animal, and migrate alongside it with the seasons."
msgstr "Этот крепкий зверолюд пасётся на равнинах Шак Турала. Издревле люди ценили его почти целиком: в хозяйстве пригодятся и рога, и шерсть, и кожа, и мясо. Многие кочевые племена почитают рронека как священное животное и кочуют вслед за ним по сезонам."

#. ja: ブオーン
#. de: Bhuuu!
#. fr: Crouik<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your rroneek. As your trusty steed, this creature can look forward to living to a ripe old age.
#. column 1: Found grazing the plains of Xak Tural, this stoutly built beastkin has been prized since ancient times on account of fairly every part of it being a useful resource. Owing to its importance in their lives, many nomadic tribes revere it as their guiding animal, and migrate alongside it with the seasons.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:350:0:2"
msgid "Well, you two look happier than<br>a pair of rroneek in the sun.<br>   - Zemoweni"
msgstr "Ну, вы двое выглядите счастливее,<br>чем пара рронек на солнышке.<br>   — Земовени"

#. ja: ウッルに騎乗する。<br>詩竜眷属のドラゴン族。狩猟の中で輝く英傑を好むという
#. de: Rufe Ullr herbei, einen Drachen, dessen Herz sich mit epischen Sagen und Liedern von der Jagd erweichen lässt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Ullr, un dragon ayant un goût prononcé pour le chant et les héros.
#. column 1: Belonging to Ratatoskr's brood, this dragon was searching for a mortal with whom it could weave songs when it chanced to see you in the middle of a hunt. So impressed was it by your prowess, it chose to accompany you on your travels in hopes of witnessing more heroic feats.
#. column 2: Like our esteemed ancestor, I will<br>fill the skies with beauteous songs!<br>   - Ehll Tou
msgctxt "MountTransient:351:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Ullr, a dragon on the hunt for a musical collaboration."
msgstr "Призвать Улля — дракона, который ищет, с кем бы сочинить песню."

#. ja: 人を好む、詩竜眷属のドラゴン族。ともに竜詩を紡ぐに相応しい人物を求めていたところ、狩猟の中で輝きを見せる英傑を発見。その人物とともにさらなる「輝き」を目にしたいと望み、旅路に同行する道を選んだのである
#. de: Ebenso wie seine Vorfahrin Ratatoskr ist auch Ullr den Sterblichen zugetan. Auf der Suche nach einer Seele, die den Versen eines Drachenepos würdig ist, reiste er umher und fand, wonach er suchte. Die uneingeschränkte Hingabe, mit der jene Seele die Jagd betrieb, berührte ihn so sehr, dass er beschloss, sie fortan zu begleiten.
#. fr: À l'image de son ancêtre Ratatosk, Ullr a toujours éprouvé des sentiments affectueux envers les humains. Durant un de ses tours du monde à la recherche d'âmes héroïques dignes d'être célébrées dans ses chants, il a fini par croiser la route d'un<if $gn4>e</if> aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> doté<if $gn4>e</if> d'un courage qu'il n'aurait jamais pu imaginer. Depuis, il ne <if $gn4>la<else>le</if> quitte plus.
#. column 0: Summon forth Ullr, a dragon on the hunt for a musical collaboration.
#. column 2: Like our esteemed ancestor, I will<br>fill the skies with beauteous songs!<br>   - Ehll Tou
msgctxt "MountTransient:351:0:1"
msgid "Belonging to Ratatoskr's brood, this dragon was searching for a mortal with whom it could weave songs when it chanced to see you in the middle of a hunt. So impressed was it by your prowess, it chose to accompany you on your travels in hopes of witnessing more heroic feats."
msgstr "Этот дракон из рода Рататоскр искал смертного, с кем можно сочинять песни, и однажды заметил тебя на охоте. Твои умения его так впечатлили, что он решил сопровождать тебя в странствиях в надежде увидеть новые подвиги."

#. ja: グオォーン！
#. de: Grooorrr!
#. fr: Graooor<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth Ullr, a dragon on the hunt for a musical collaboration.
#. column 1: Belonging to Ratatoskr's brood, this dragon was searching for a mortal with whom it could weave songs when it chanced to see you in the middle of a hunt. So impressed was it by your prowess, it chose to accompany you on your travels in hopes of witnessing more heroic feats.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:351:0:2"
msgid "Like our esteemed ancestor, I will<br>fill the skies with beauteous songs!<br>   - Ehll Tou"
msgstr "Как и наша достославная прародительница,<br>я наполню небеса прекрасными песнями!<br>   — Элл Ту"

#. ja: ケジグラーに騎乗する。<br>マムージャ語で「飛ぶ金」を意味する名の飛行型ゴーレム
#. de: Rufe deinen Qeziigural herbei - die Mamool Ja hatten gute Gründe, diesen Golem „fliegendes Gold“ zu taufen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture qeziigural. En langue mamool ja, le nom de ce golem signifie “or volant”.
#. column 1: Encountered in Cenote Ja Ja Gural, this winged stone construct is outfitted with golden adornments whose engravings bespeak Mamool Ja origins. As its bare body appears to hail from an earlier time, however, it is believed to be a Yok Huy relic that was repurposed and decorated.
#. column 2: Don't indulge them with anything<br>but a face of stony indifference.<br>   - Papa Gruff
msgctxt "MountTransient:352:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your qeziigural, a winged golem whose name means “gold that flies” in the Mamool Ja tongue."
msgstr "Призвать кезиджурала — крылатого голема, чьё название на языке мамул-джа означает «летающее золото»."

#. ja: セノーテ・ジャジャグラルで発見した飛行型ゴーレム。各所に施された彫刻はマムージャ様式ではあるが、素体の構成は古い。どうやら古代ヨカフイ文明の遺産を、後の時代にマムージャ族が装飾したもののようだ
#. de: Dieser fliegende Golem entstammt dem Cenote Ja Ja Gural. Sein Äußeres ist verziert mit Schmuckstücken, die das unverkennbare Muster der Mamool Ja aufweisen und erst später angebracht wurden, denn das Ungetüm selbst ist ein altes Relikt aus der Zeit der Yok Huy.
#. fr: Ce golem volant a été découvert dans le cénote Ja Ja Gural. Les motifs distinctifs des Mamool Ja qui ornent son corps n'ont été ajoutés que plus tard, car cette machine est en réalité une ancienne relique datant de l'époque des Yok Huy.
#. column 0: Summon forth your qeziigural, a winged golem whose name means “gold that flies” in the Mamool Ja tongue.
#. column 2: Don't indulge them with anything<br>but a face of stony indifference.<br>   - Papa Gruff
msgctxt "MountTransient:352:0:1"
msgid "Encountered in Cenote Ja Ja Gural, this winged stone construct is outfitted with golden adornments whose engravings bespeak Mamool Ja origins. As its bare body appears to hail from an earlier time, however, it is believed to be a Yok Huy relic that was repurposed and decorated."
msgstr "Этот крылатый каменный голем найден в Сеноте Ха-Ха-Гурал. Его золотые украшения покрыты узорами в стиле мамул-джа, но само тело куда древнее. Полагают, что это реликвия ёка-хуев, которую позднее переделали и украсили."

#. ja: ゴゴゴ…
#. de: \<rumpel>
#. fr: Clonk...
#. column 0: Summon forth your qeziigural, a winged golem whose name means “gold that flies” in the Mamool Ja tongue.
#. column 1: Encountered in Cenote Ja Ja Gural, this winged stone construct is outfitted with golden adornments whose engravings bespeak Mamool Ja origins. As its bare body appears to hail from an earlier time, however, it is believed to be a Yok Huy relic that was repurposed and decorated.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:352:0:2"
msgid "Don't indulge them with anything<br>but a face of stony indifference.<br>   - Papa Gruff"
msgstr "Не обращай на них внимания.<br>Сохраняй каменное выражение лица.<br>   — Папа Хмур"

#. ja: トータスボーグに騎乗する。<br>オリジェニクスの研究所で開発された陸戦兵器
#. de: Rufe deine Cyberkröte herbei, ein Reptil, das in den Laboren der Origenik zu einer Waffe auf vier Beinen umfunktioniert wurde.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture automatoise, une arme terrestre développée par l'Origenèse.
#. column 1: A weapon of war developed in Origenics, this giant tortoise has been augmented with a reinforced electrope skeleton and servomotors in order to enhance defense and strength. As the underlying creature is ordinarily mild-mannered, it is infused with the soul of a savage predator to lend it ferocity at the onset of battle.
#. column 2: That strikes me as a rather curious thing to be<br>researching, but to each their own, I suppose!<br>   - Knowledgeable Loporrit
msgctxt "MountTransient:353:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your automatoise, a weapon of war developed in Origenics."
msgstr "Призвать автоматоису — боевое оружие, созданное в Ориджениксе."

#. ja: オリジェニクスの研究所で開発された陸戦兵器。大型陸亀にエレクトロープ製の強化骨格とサーボモーターを装着し、防御力と筋力を強化している。本来は温厚な性格のため、戦闘時には肉食獣の魂を注入して獰猛さを付与するらしい
#. de: Eine Riesenschildkröte, die in den Laboren der Origenik mithilfe eines Exoskeletts und Unterstützungsmotors aus Elektrob in eine verheerende Waffe umgewandelt wurde. Entgegen ihrem sonst eher ruhigen Temperament lässt die durch einen Regulator ermöglichte Zufuhr von Bestienseelen sie im Kampf in wilde Raserei verfallen.
#. fr: Cette arme de guerre a été développée par l'Origenèse. Une espèce de grande tortue équipée d'un squelette renforcé par l'électrope, elle possède également un servomoteur qui renforce sa défense et sa puissance. Certains disent qu'à cause de sa nature trop calme pour se battre, on a dû lui insuffler l'âme d'un carnivore pour la rendre plus féroce.
#. column 0: Summon forth your automatoise, a weapon of war developed in Origenics.
#. column 2: That strikes me as a rather curious thing to be<br>researching, but to each their own, I suppose!<br>   - Knowledgeable Loporrit
msgctxt "MountTransient:353:0:1"
msgid "A weapon of war developed in Origenics, this giant tortoise has been augmented with a reinforced electrope skeleton and servomotors in order to enhance defense and strength. As the underlying creature is ordinarily mild-mannered, it is infused with the soul of a savage predator to lend it ferocity at the onset of battle."
msgstr "Эту гигантскую черепаху превратили в боевую машину в Ориджениксе: укрепили её скелет электропой и установили сервомоторы, чтобы повысить защиту и силу. Обычно черепаха кроткая, поэтому перед боем в неё вселяют душу свирепого хищника."

#. ja: トォーッ！
#. de: Tooah!
#. fr: Bang<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your automatoise, a weapon of war developed in Origenics.
#. column 1: A weapon of war developed in Origenics, this giant tortoise has been augmented with a reinforced electrope skeleton and servomotors in order to enhance defense and strength. As the underlying creature is ordinarily mild-mannered, it is infused with the soul of a savage predator to lend it ferocity at the onset of battle.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:353:0:2"
msgid "That strikes me as a rather curious thing to be<br>researching, but to each their own, I suppose!<br>   - Knowledgeable Loporrit"
msgstr "Довольно странно, конечно,<br>такое исследовать... Но каждому своё!<br>   — Знающий лопоррит"

#. ja: マウンテンズーに騎乗する。<br>近東地域の高山に棲息するという希少な怪鳥
#. de: Rufe einen Bergtau-Montisaurus herbei. Seine Schwingen haben ihn von den höchsten Gipfeln des Nahen Ostens hierher getragen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture zu des montagnes, un étrange volatile originaire des montagnes du Proche-Orient.
#. column 1: This subspecies of the monstrous zu is known to inhabit the mountainous regions of the Near East. Seeking to tame the ill-tempered bird, Hannish alchemists fed it a specially concocted brew, which had the desired effect while causing the creature to give off a refreshing citrus aroma.
#. column 2: I can't remember the last time<br>I felt so refreshed!<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:354:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your mountain zu, and make ready to quench your thirst for adventure."
msgstr "Призвать горного зу и приготовиться утолить жажду приключений."

#. ja: 近東の高山地帯に分布する、怪鳥ズーの近縁種。ラザハンの錬金術師たちが、この荒々しい怪鳥を手懐けるために特別な飲料を開発して飲ませたところ、爽やかな柑橘系の香りを放つようになったという
#. de: Seitdem man diesem den Bergregionen des Nahen Ostens entstammenden Vogel zu Zwecken der Zähmung eine speziell angefertigte Mixtur verabreichte, versprüht er den lieblichen Duft von Zitruspflanzen.
#. fr: Cet animal qui a élu domicile dans les régions montagneuses du Proche-Orient est un cousin du zu. Depuis que la créature a bu la boisson spéciale mise au point par les alchimistes de Radz-at-Han afin de tenter de l'apprivoiser, il se dégage d'elle une délicieuse odeur d'agrumes.
#. column 0: Summon forth your mountain zu, and make ready to quench your thirst for adventure.
#. column 2: I can't remember the last time<br>I felt so refreshed!<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:354:0:1"
msgid "This subspecies of the monstrous zu is known to inhabit the mountainous regions of the Near East. Seeking to tame the ill-tempered bird, Hannish alchemists fed it a specially concocted brew, which had the desired effect while causing the creature to give off a refreshing citrus aroma."
msgstr "Этот подвид чудовищной птицы зу обитает в горах Ближнего Востока. Чтобы приручить её скверный нрав, алхимики Радз-ат-Хана напоили птицу особым снадобьем. Оно помогло — и заодно придало ей освежающий цитрусовый аромат."

#. ja: ズー！
#. de: Deeew!
#. fr: Zuuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your mountain zu, and make ready to quench your thirst for adventure.
#. column 1: This subspecies of the monstrous zu is known to inhabit the mountainous regions of the Near East. Seeking to tame the ill-tempered bird, Hannish alchemists fed it a specially concocted brew, which had the desired effect while causing the creature to give off a refreshing citrus aroma.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:354:0:2"
msgid "I can't remember the last time<br>I felt so refreshed!<br>   - Tataru"
msgstr "Не припомню, когда ещё<br>мне было так легко и свежо!<br>   — Татару"

#. ja: バレルテンダーに騎乗する。<br>サカ・トラルの荒野に生息するマッチョムキムキなサボテンダー
#. de: Rufe deinen Kantor herbei. Wie unschwer zu erkennen ist, hat sich diese Kante von einem Kaktor seinen Namen redlich verdient.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture maousse-pampa, un pampa gonflé à bloc originaire des contrées désertiques du Xak Tural.
#. column 1: Native to the arid wilds of Xak Tural, this abnormally well-built sabotender resolved to further hone its flesh after meeting its match in an adventurer. As part of a rigorous training regime, it willingly and tirelessly carries you hither and yon.
#. column 2: Hells, he's every bit as muscular<br>and majestic as I remembered!<br>   - Humphrey
msgctxt "MountTransient:356:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your barreltender, a sabotender possessed of a hulking frame that has earned it its name."
msgstr "Призвать бочкотендера — саботендера с такой мощной фигурой, что он оправдывает своё имя."

#. ja: サカ・トラルの荒野に棲息するマッチョムキムキなサボテンダー。ある冒険者に打ち負かされたのち、自らをさらに鍛えるため旅に出た。トレーニングの一環として人を運ぶことに積極的で、ウエイト代わりの乗り手を求めている
#. de: Seine gestählten Muskeln sind sein ganzer Stolz, doch als ihn ein gewisser Abenteurer dennoch besiegte, entschloss er sich dazu, auf Muckifindungsreise zu gehen. Als Teil seines rigorosen Trainingsplans schleppt er dich nun durch die Gegend.
#. fr: Ce pampa aux gros biscoteaux est originaire des contrées désertiques du Xak Tural. Après avoir été vaincu, il a décidé de poursuivre son en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment en partant à l'aventure avec son adversaire qu'il porte à bout de bras pour gonfler encore plus ses biceps.
#. column 0: Summon forth your barreltender, a sabotender possessed of a hulking frame that has earned it its name.
#. column 2: Hells, he's every bit as muscular<br>and majestic as I remembered!<br>   - Humphrey
msgctxt "MountTransient:356:0:1"
msgid "Native to the arid wilds of Xak Tural, this abnormally well-built sabotender resolved to further hone its flesh after meeting its match in an adventurer. As part of a rigorous training regime, it willingly and tirelessly carries you hither and yon."
msgstr "Этот невероятно мускулистый саботендер родом из засушливых пустошей Шак Турала. После встречи с достойным противником он решил укрепить мышцы ещё больше. Теперь он охотно и неустанно возит тебя повсюду, чтобы тренироваться."

#. ja: パワーーーーー！
#. de: Möchtest du mal meine Muckis fühlen?<br><i>Godbert</i>
#. fr: Maousse costaud<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your barreltender, a sabotender possessed of a hulking frame that has earned it its name.
#. column 1: Native to the arid wilds of Xak Tural, this abnormally well-built sabotender resolved to further hone its flesh after meeting its match in an adventurer. As part of a rigorous training regime, it willingly and tirelessly carries you hither and yon.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:356:0:2"
msgid "Hells, he's every bit as muscular<br>and majestic as I remembered!<br>   - Humphrey"
msgstr "Вот это мышцы! Он точно такой же<br>могучий и величественный, как я помню!<br>   — Хамфри"

#. ja: エッグイーターに騎乗する。<br>ある女商人に祝福されたオオアリクイ。蟻は食べず卵を食べる
#. de: Rufe deinen Eierbär herbei. Frisst Eier und keine Ameisen, sonst hieße er ja „Ameisenbär“.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dévor'œufs, un fourmilier au régime alimentaire surprenant.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this widowmaker has led a pampered life. As it was impractical to feed it the prodigious quantities of ants its kind consumes in the wild, however, it was instead raised on a diet of beaten eggs. This specimen is well accustomed to men, and permits those it trusts to ride upon its back.
#. column 2: We can ill afford to place<br>all our eggs in one basket.<br>   - Erenville
msgctxt "MountTransient:357:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your eggeater, an anteater raised on a luxurious diet of eggs."
msgstr "Призвать яицежора — муравьеда, которого баловали роскошным рационом из яиц."

#. ja: 商人「ロウェナ」による祝福を受け、贅沢な暮らしをしてきたオオアリクイ。野生では一日に数万匹の蟻を食べるが、用意するのが難しいため、溶き卵を与えられて育てられた。よく人に慣れており、信頼関係を築けば背に乗せてくれるだろう
#. de: Als treuer Freund der Händlerin Rowena wurde diesem gigantischen Ameisenbären ein Leben voller Reichtümer und Luxus zuteil. Unter anderem gewöhnte er sich über die Jahre zunehmend an geschlagene Eier statt Ameisen zu fressen, bis er seiner krabbeligen Grundnahrung eines Tages komplett entsagte. Die vielen Proteine halfen ihm, einen starken Rücken zu entwickeln, auf dem er dich nun durch die Lande tragen wird.
#. fr: Ce mammifère a grandi dans l'opulence, sous le regard bien<shy>veil<shy>lant de sa maîtresse, Rowena. Dans la nature, ce genre d'animal peut dévorer jusqu'à plusieurs dizaines de milliers de fourmis par jour, toutefois, face à l'impossibilité de lui fournir un tel festin, ce spécimen fut nourri à base d'œufs brouillés. Il offre aisément sa confiance aux êtres humains et leur permet même de le chevaucher<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your eggeater, an anteater raised on a luxurious diet of eggs.
#. column 2: We can ill afford to place<br>all our eggs in one basket.<br>   - Erenville
msgctxt "MountTransient:357:0:1"
msgid "Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this widowmaker has led a pampered life. As it was impractical to feed it the prodigious quantities of ants its kind consumes in the wild, however, it was instead raised on a diet of beaten eggs. This specimen is well accustomed to men, and permits those it trusts to ride upon its back."
msgstr "Этот муравьед жил в роскоши под покровительством хозяйки Ровены. В дикой природе его сородичи съедают невероятное количество муравьёв, и добывать их было бы непросто. Поэтому его вырастили на взбитых яйцах. Он привык к людям и позволяет ездить на себе тем, кому доверяет."

#. ja: キシャアァ…！
#. de: Moment ... Die Eier dürfen nur von zwei Abenteurern mit den richtigen Eierkappen berührt werden!<br><i>Augustiniel</i>
#. fr: Sluuurrrp...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your eggeater, an anteater raised on a luxurious diet of eggs.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress, Rowena, this widowmaker has led a pampered life. As it was impractical to feed it the prodigious quantities of ants its kind consumes in the wild, however, it was instead raised on a diet of beaten eggs. This specimen is well accustomed to men, and permits those it trusts to ride upon its back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:357:0:2"
msgid "We can ill afford to place<br>all our eggs in one basket.<br>   - Erenville"
msgstr "Нам не по карману складывать<br>все яйца в одну корзину.<br>   — Эренвиль"

#. ja: プヌティーに騎乗する。<br>トラル旅行公司のマスコットとなった、人懐っこい海獣
#. de: Rufe dein Punutiy herbei. Das liebliche Maskottchen der Reiseagentur Tural.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture punutiy, un affectueux animal aquatique, mascotte officielle de Tural Voyages.
#. column 1: Inhabiting the waters of Yok Tural, these gentle giants have been employed by men since olden days to tow boats on the continent's rivers and lakes. This specimen is particularly inquisitive, and having been imbued with the ability to fly, it has further developed a taste for travel.
#. column 2: If the punutiys are happy,<br>then I'm happy too.<br>   - Yubli
msgctxt "MountTransient:358:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your punutiy, and delight onlookers to no end with its winsome charm."
msgstr "Призвать пунутия и бесконечно радовать прохожих его обаянием."

#. ja: ヨカ・トラルの河川や湖、沿岸部に棲息する大型獣。気質が穏やかなこともあり古くから人に利用され、船を曳いてきた。この個体は特に好奇心旺盛らしく、おまじないで飛翔可能になったことから、旅行に興味を抱いているようだ
#. de: Seit jeher nennen diese sanften Riesen die Gewässer Yok Turals ihr Zuhause und halfen seinen Bewohnern mit allerhand Alltagsaufgaben. Dieses Exemplar scheint besonders neugierig zu sein und mit seinen neugewonnenen Flugfähigkeiten will es nun die Welt erkunden.
#. fr: Cet animal aquatique de grande taille vit dans les cours d'eau du Yok Tural. Sa sociabilité naturelle lui a valu d'être domestiqué par les humains pour tirer leurs em<shy>bar<shy>ca<shy>tions. Ce spécimen est tellement curieux et avide de voyages que son rêve de nager dans les cieux a été exaucé.
#. column 0: Summon forth your punutiy, and delight onlookers to no end with its winsome charm.
#. column 2: If the punutiys are happy,<br>then I'm happy too.<br>   - Yubli
msgctxt "MountTransient:358:0:1"
msgid "Inhabiting the waters of Yok Tural, these gentle giants have been employed by men since olden days to tow boats on the continent's rivers and lakes. This specimen is particularly inquisitive, and having been imbued with the ability to fly, it has further developed a taste for travel."
msgstr "Эти мирные гиганты обитают в реках, озёрах и прибрежных водах Йок Турала. С давних времён люди использовали их, чтобы тянуть лодки по рекам и озёрам материка. Этот пунутия особенно любопытен: получив способность летать благодаря заклинанию, он увлёкся путешествиями."

#. ja: プュ～ン、プィィ～
#. de: Hast du ein Herz für Punutiy?<br><i>Yubli</i>
#. fr: Hmm hmmmm
#. column 0: Summon forth your punutiy, and delight onlookers to no end with its winsome charm.
#. column 1: Inhabiting the waters of Yok Tural, these gentle giants have been employed by men since olden days to tow boats on the continent's rivers and lakes. This specimen is particularly inquisitive, and having been imbued with the ability to fly, it has further developed a taste for travel.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:358:0:2"
msgid "If the punutiys are happy,<br>then I'm happy too.<br>   - Yubli"
msgstr "Если пунутии счастливы,<br>то и я счастлива.<br>   — Юбли"

#. ja: アックスビークに騎乗する。<br>ある女商人に祝福された怪鳥。西方トラル大陸の出身らしい
#. de: Rufe deinen Alexandria-Keilschnabel herbei. Ein Vogel, den die Händlerin Rowena besonders gerne hat. Nicht mit denen aus Thanalan zu verwechseln.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture bec-hache, un reptile volant originaire du Tural, très prisé par une certaine marchande.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress Rowena, this reptilian bird has led a pampered life. However, when a customer requested a specimen of the beast of the same name native to Thanalan, it was mistakenly transported all the way from Tural. The error did not come to light until it was too late, and the creature ended up in your care.
#. column 2: How do you hope to survive with<br>even more beaks to feed?<br>   - Sanu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:359:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Alexandrian axe beak, a reptilian bird favored of the merchant Rowena. Not to be confused with the beast native to Thanalan."
msgstr "Призвать александрийского топороклюва, любимца торговки Ровены. Не путать с его тёзкой из Таналана."

#. ja: 商人「ロウェナ」による祝福を受け、贅沢な暮らしをしてきた怪鳥。ザナラーンに棲息する同名の別種を求める客のために、はるか西方のトラル大陸より輸入されてきたが、引き渡し時に間違いが発覚。行き場を失っていたらしい
#. de: Als Favorit der Händlerin Rowena wurde diesem bestialischen Vogel ein Leben voller Reichtümer und Luxus zuteil. Als ein Kunde die gleichnamige Bestie, die auf Thanalan beheimatet ist, bestellte, wurde versehentlich dieses Exemplar den ganzen weiten Weg von Tural aus verschickt. Doch als die Sache ans Licht kam, war es leider schon zu spät und nun darfst du dich um den Keilschnabel kümmern.
#. fr: Recueilli par Rowena, ce spécimen a connu une vie de luxe grâce aux bons soins de sa maîtresse. Lorsqu'un client fit la demande pour un animal similaire originaire du Thanalan, le bec-hache fut acheminé par erreur depuis le Tural. Quand l'erreur fut découverte, il était déjà trop tard et la bête vous a désormais été confiée.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Alexandrian axe beak, a reptilian bird favored of the merchant Rowena. Not to be confused with the beast native to Thanalan.
#. column 2: How do you hope to survive with<br>even more beaks to feed?<br>   - Sanu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:359:0:1"
msgid "Under the patronage of its mistress Rowena, this reptilian bird has led a pampered life. However, when a customer requested a specimen of the beast of the same name native to Thanalan, it was mistakenly transported all the way from Tural. The error did not come to light until it was too late, and the creature ended up in your care."
msgstr "Эта рептилоидная птица жила в роскоши под покровительством хозяйки Ровены. Однажды покупатель попросил топороклюва из Таналана, но ему по ошибке привезли птицу из далёкого Турала. Ошибку обнаружили слишком поздно, и в итоге топороклюв оказался у тебя."

#. ja: ギョエエ！
#. de: Wie soll Ok' Zundo so viele Schnäbel füttern?!<br><i>Sonu Vanu-ooh</i>
#. fr: Gwoeeeh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Alexandrian axe beak, a reptilian bird favored of the merchant Rowena. Not to be confused with the beast native to Thanalan.
#. column 1: Under the patronage of its mistress Rowena, this reptilian bird has led a pampered life. However, when a customer requested a specimen of the beast of the same name native to Thanalan, it was mistakenly transported all the way from Tural. The error did not come to light until it was too late, and the creature ended up in your care.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:359:0:2"
msgid "How do you hope to survive with<br>even more beaks to feed?<br>   - Sanu Vanu"
msgstr "И как ты собираешься прокормить<br>ещё столько клювов?<br>   — Сана Вану"

#. ja: 暗闇の羽衣に騎乗する。<br>暗闇の雲がまとっていた羽衣の断片
#. de: Hülle dich in dein Wolkenkleid der Dunkelheit. Schaurig-schick.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture exhalaison de Ténèbres, une infime partie du Nuage de Ténèbres toujours prête à vous envelopper.
#. column 1: A sliver of the eldritch raiment worn by the Cloud of Darkness. Appearing to be perpetuated by residual aether, it shows no sign of dissipating and allows its wearer to fly freely. Though soft to the touch like the finest wool, the fog that clings to it results in a persistent clamminess.
#. column 2: Darkness shall consume Light!<br>   - Igeyorhm
msgctxt "MountTransient:360:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your shroud of Darkness, a lingering sliver of the Cloud of Darkness's eldritch raiment."
msgstr "Призвать покров Тьмы — уцелевший клочок неземного одеяния Облака Тьмы."

#. ja: 暗闇の雲がまとっていた羽衣の断片。魔力が残留しているのか、霧散せず浮遊し続けている。身にまとえば身体が浮かび上がり、最高級ウールを思わせる心地よさを感じるが、周囲には常に雲が漂うため湿度は高い
#. de: Dieses düstere Gewand wurde aus einem Fetzen des echten Kleides der Wolke der Dunkelheit gewebt. Zweifelsohne schlummert noch immer ein Teil ihrer Magie in ihm, sonst hielte es den Träger kaum so zuverlässig in der Luft. Das Beste daran: wolkenweich und kuschelig, wenn auch nicht jedermanns Geschmack.
#. fr: La magie résiduelle contenue dans cette infime partie du Nuage de Ténèbres lui permet de ne pas se dissiper. Il est si doux à l'intérieur que l'on se croit entouré d'une infinité de fines étoffes de lin. Mais c'est avant tout un nuage, qui augmente fortement le taux d'humidité ambiante.
#. column 0: Summon forth your shroud of Darkness, a lingering sliver of the Cloud of Darkness's eldritch raiment.
#. column 2: Darkness shall consume Light!<br>   - Igeyorhm
msgctxt "MountTransient:360:0:1"
msgid "A sliver of the eldritch raiment worn by the Cloud of Darkness. Appearing to be perpetuated by residual aether, it shows no sign of dissipating and allows its wearer to fly freely. Though soft to the touch like the finest wool, the fog that clings to it results in a persistent clamminess."
msgstr "Обрывок диковинного одеяния Облака Тьмы. Похоже, остатки эфира не дают ему рассеяться, и он позволяет владельцу свободно летать. На ощупь он мягкий, словно тончайшая шерсть, но из-за стелющегося вокруг тумана всё время кажется сырым."

#. ja: ふわっふわ！
#. de: Auf die Verkleidung wird niemand hereinfallen.<br><i>Emet-Selch</i>
#. fr: Frou frou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your shroud of Darkness, a lingering sliver of the Cloud of Darkness's eldritch raiment.
#. column 1: A sliver of the eldritch raiment worn by the Cloud of Darkness. Appearing to be perpetuated by residual aether, it shows no sign of dissipating and allows its wearer to fly freely. Though soft to the touch like the finest wool, the fog that clings to it results in a persistent clamminess.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:360:0:2"
msgid "Darkness shall consume Light!<br>   - Igeyorhm"
msgstr "Тьма поглотит Свет!<br>   — Игейорм"

#. ja: 暗黒領域に騎乗する。<br>暗闇の雲が創り出した領域の一部。長時間乗っても消えない
#. de: Rufe deine dunkle Falle herbei, aber achte bitte gut auf deine Füße. Du wurdest gewarnt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture domaine ténébreux, un fragment de l'arène où vous avez combattu le Nuage de Ténèbres.
#. column 1: A piece of the battlefield created by the Cloud of Darkness, upon which only those recognized by the being may set foot. While it has sent countless foes plummeting into endless void, by triumphing over its maker, you appear to have gained control over it.
#. column 2: A well-maintained airship can mean<br>the difference between life and a<br>horrible, plummetin' death.<br>   - Redbill Engineer
msgctxt "MountTransient:361:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your dais of Darkness. Will not vanish beneath your feet after a set duration."
msgstr "Призвать подиум Тьмы. Он не исчезнет у тебя из-под ног через какое-то время."

#. ja: 暗闇の雲が創り出した領域の一部。領域の主が認めたもののみが存在を許される場であり、多くの敵対者たちを暗黒天空に墜としてきた。しかし、激闘を経て主が霧散した結果、勝者である冒険者が領有権を得たようだ
#. de: Ein waschechtes Stück aus dem Territorium der Wolke der Dunkelheit. Auf ihm dürfen nur jene stehen, die die ausdrückliche Erlaubnis seiner Herrin erhalten haben - und alle anderen stürzen in das schwarze Nichts. Nun, da die Königin gestürzt ist, hat sich diese Falle einen neuen Meister gesucht: dich.
#. fr: Le Nuage de Ténèbres a découpé cette partie de son domaine lors de votre combat. Ce sol est gorgé du sang, de la sueur et des larmes de ceux qui ont osé défier le néant avant vous. Au vu de vos faits d'armes, ce fragment semble avoir décidé de vous servir.
#. column 0: Summon forth your dais of Darkness. Will not vanish beneath your feet after a set duration.
#. column 2: A well-maintained airship can mean<br>the difference between life and a<br>horrible, plummetin' death.<br>   - Redbill Engineer
msgctxt "MountTransient:361:0:1"
msgid "A piece of the battlefield created by the Cloud of Darkness, upon which only those recognized by the being may set foot. While it has sent countless foes plummeting into endless void, by triumphing over its maker, you appear to have gained control over it."
msgstr "Это часть поля боя, созданного Облаком Тьмы. На ней могут стоять лишь те, кого признало само существо. Множество врагов уже падали отсюда в бесконечную пустоту, но, одолев создателя, ты, похоже, завладел этим местом."

#. ja: ゴゴゴゴ…
#. de: Sinkt in die Schwärze wahrer Dunkelheit!<br><i>Wolke der Dunkelheit</i>
#. fr: Grooooon...
#. column 0: Summon forth your dais of Darkness. Will not vanish beneath your feet after a set duration.
#. column 1: A piece of the battlefield created by the Cloud of Darkness, upon which only those recognized by the being may set foot. While it has sent countless foes plummeting into endless void, by triumphing over its maker, you appear to have gained control over it.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:361:0:2"
msgid "A well-maintained airship can mean<br>the difference between life and a<br>horrible, plummetin' death.<br>   - Redbill Engineer"
msgstr "Хорошо ухаживай за дирижаблем —<br>от этого зависит, вернёшься ли ты живым<br>или полетишь вниз и разобьёшься.<br>   — Инженер «Красноклювов»"

#. ja: 風火鍋に騎乗する。<br>天を駆ける火鍋。元は祭器であったらしい
#. de: Rufe deinen fliegenden Eintopf herbei. Ein Kessel, der einst lediglich rituellen Zwecken gedient haben soll. Inzwischen saust er aber durch die Lüfte und macht dabei ordentlich Appetit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture fondue orientale, une marmite volante qui serait à l'origine une relique divine.
#. column 1: Long ago, when a ritual cauldron was accidentally used to cook dinner for the lord of Yanxia, a strange phenomenon occurred which saw the vessel rise into the air like the fiery wheels of divine legend. Thereafter, subsequent generations of rulers took to filling the cauldron with various delicacies, which they enjoyed even as they hovered in the heavens.
#. column 2: What is this? It smells...spicy.<br>   - Erenville
msgctxt "MountTransient:362:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your hovering hot pot. Formerly a ritual cauldron, it now soars the skies while simmering with scrumptious morsels."
msgstr "Призвать парящий котёл. Когда-то он служил для обрядов, а теперь летает по небесам, пока в нём варится что-нибудь вкусненькое."

#. ja: その昔、ヤンサの国主が、祭器である「鼎」を調理に用いたところ、これが神器「風火二輪」の如く浮かび上がるという珍事があった。以来、各時代の支配者たちは、さまざまな具材を投げ込み、天を駆けながら美味を楽しんだという
#. de: Vor langer, langer Zeit soll dieser göttliche Schatz versehentlich zur Zubereitung des Abendessens des damaligen Herrschers von Yanxia missbraucht worden sein. Dabei geschah es wohl, dass der Kessel plötzlich anfing zu schweben. Und so entstand unter den folgenden Herrscher-Generationen der Brauch, seine Lieblingseintöpfe nicht im Sitzen oder Stehen, sondern in der Schwebe zu genießen.
#. fr: Les vieilles légendes de la plaine de Yanxia racontent qu'une ancienne marmite serait devenue une relique divine, capable de voler comme les roues Feu-et-Vent. Elle serait utilisée par les grands de ce monde, son vol gracieux sublimant les ingrédients qu'ils y ajoutent.
#. column 0: Summon forth your hovering hot pot. Formerly a ritual cauldron, it now soars the skies while simmering with scrumptious morsels.
#. column 2: What is this? It smells...spicy.<br>   - Erenville
msgctxt "MountTransient:362:0:1"
msgid "Long ago, when a ritual cauldron was accidentally used to cook dinner for the lord of Yanxia, a strange phenomenon occurred which saw the vessel rise into the air like the fiery wheels of divine legend. Thereafter, subsequent generations of rulers took to filling the cauldron with various delicacies, which they enjoyed even as they hovered in the heavens."
msgstr "Давным-давно правитель Янся случайно использовал ритуальный котёл для приготовления ужина, и тот вдруг взмыл в воздух, словно легендарные Огненные колёса. С тех пор правители наполняли его всевозможными лакомствами и наслаждались ими, паря в небесах."

#. ja: グツグツ…
#. de: Wieso riecht das denn so<nbsp>... extrem scharf?<br><i>Erenville</i>
#. fr: Bloup, bloup...
#. column 0: Summon forth your hovering hot pot. Formerly a ritual cauldron, it now soars the skies while simmering with scrumptious morsels.
#. column 1: Long ago, when a ritual cauldron was accidentally used to cook dinner for the lord of Yanxia, a strange phenomenon occurred which saw the vessel rise into the air like the fiery wheels of divine legend. Thereafter, subsequent generations of rulers took to filling the cauldron with various delicacies, which they enjoyed even as they hovered in the heavens.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:362:0:2"
msgid "What is this? It smells...spicy.<br>   - Erenville"
msgstr "Что это? Пахнет... остро.<br>   — Эренвиль"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・エターナルに騎乗する。<br>次元黄道で発見された魔法の翼
#. de: Rufe deine Flügel der Endlosigkeit als Reittier herbei. Magische Schwingen, die in der Inter<shy>dimen<shy>sio<shy>nalen Ekliptik entdeckt wurden.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes de l'Éternelle, découvertes par hasard dans l'Écliptique dimensionnelle.
#. column 1: Found within the virtual domain created by the Meso Terminal, these armor-clad wings are reminiscent of the dread entity that Sphene had become. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the unwavering determination of a ruler who placed her subjects above all else.
#. column 2: My desire to protect my people<br>transcends all others!<br>   - Sphene
msgctxt "MountTransient:363:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of eternity. Their luminous green hue exudes the determination of a recreated queen."
msgstr "Призвать крылья вечности. Их сияющая зелень излучает решимость воскрешённой королевы."

#. ja: エターナルクイーンとの決戦の地で発見された、魔法の翼。荘厳な装甲は永久人の守護者を思わせるが、その来歴は謎に包まれている。いずれにせよ、この翼を授かりし者は、「永久の女王」の慈愛をも身に纏うことだろう
#. de: Magische Flügel, die am Ort deines Kampfes mit der Ewigen Königin gefunden wurden. Sie strahlen eine Erhabenheit aus, die ihren Träger wie einen wahren Beschützer der Endlosen wirken lässt, ihre Herkunft ist allerdings unbekannt. Allen Würdigen erweisen sie das Geschenk königlicher Liebe, welche einen vom ersten Flügelschlag auf ewig umhüllt.
#. fr: Ces ailes magiques ont été découvertes à l'issue du combat contre la Reine Éternité. Bien que leur exquise armature rappelle la protectrice des Éternels, leur origine est nimbée de mystère. La bienveillance de l'éternelle reine est presque palpable pour tous ceux qui s'en ceignent le dos.
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of eternity. Their luminous green hue exudes the determination of a recreated queen.
#. column 2: My desire to protect my people<br>transcends all others!<br>   - Sphene
msgctxt "MountTransient:363:0:1"
msgid "Found within the virtual domain created by the Meso Terminal, these armor-clad wings are reminiscent of the dread entity that Sphene had become. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the unwavering determination of a ruler who placed her subjects above all else."
msgstr "Эти покрытые бронёй крылья нашли в виртуальном мире, созданном Терминалом Мезо. Они напоминают грозное существо, которым стала Сфена. Происхождение крыльев окутано тайной, но они излучают непоколебимую решимость правительницы, ставившей подданных превыше всего."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich <i>werde</i> mein Volk beschützen.<br><i>Sphene</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of eternity. Their luminous green hue exudes the determination of a recreated queen.
#. column 1: Found within the virtual domain created by the Meso Terminal, these armor-clad wings are reminiscent of the dread entity that Sphene had become. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the unwavering determination of a ruler who placed her subjects above all else.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:363:0:2"
msgid "My desire to protect my people<br>transcends all others!<br>   - Sphene"
msgstr "Желание защитить мой народ<br>сильнее всего остального!<br>   — Сфена"

#. ja: パワーローダーに騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画のために開発された作業用重機
#. de: Steige in deinen Sternenläufer und ebne mit ihm jeden noch so unwirtlichen Planeten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mécano cosmique, une machine de travail utilisée pour l'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this construction machina was developed as a collaboration between Loporrit, Sharlayan, and Garlean engineers. As a result, it exhibits magitek armor influences in its design, particularly in the area of its piloting system.
#. column 2: If I am not mistaken, this would<br>not be the first time you've piloted<br>one of these suits.<br>   - G'nibnpha
msgctxt "MountTransient:364:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina."
msgstr "Призовите свой скафандр и воплотите мечту о пилотировании футуристической двуногой машины."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた作業用重機。設計にはレポリットのみならず、シャーレアンやガレマール帝国出身の技術者も関わったとのこと。そのためか、特に操縦系統などに魔導アーマーからの影響が色濃い
#. de: Ein mechanisches Kraftwerkzeug, das eigens für Projekt Kosmo-Erkundung von den größten Talenten der Loporrit sowie Spezialisten aus Sharlayan und Garlemald entwickelt wurde. Wenig verwunderlich, so weisen die Steuerelemente des Läufers doch klare Ähnlichkeiten mit Magitek-Maschinerie auf.
#. fr: Cet engin, conçu pour le projet d'exploration cosmique, est le fruit de la col<shy>la<shy>bo<shy>ra<shy>tion entre les Loporrites, et des ingénieurs venus de Sharlayan et de Garlemald. De fait, son maniement n'est pas sans rappeler celui des armures magitek.
#. column 0: Summon forth your vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 2: If I am not mistaken, this would<br>not be the first time you've piloted<br>one of these suits.<br>   - G'nibnpha
msgctxt "MountTransient:364:0:1"
msgid "Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this construction machina was developed as a collaboration between Loporrit, Sharlayan, and Garlean engineers. As a result, it exhibits magitek armor influences in its design, particularly in the area of its piloting system."
msgstr "Эту строительную машину создали для программы космических исследований совместными усилиями инженеров-лопорритов, шаллейцев и гарлеанцев. Поэтому в её конструкции, особенно в системе управления, заметно влияние магитехнической брони."

#. ja: ガション、ガション…
#. de: Geht mondklar!<br><i>Searchingway</i>
#. fr: Clonk, clonk...
#. column 0: Summon forth your vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this construction machina was developed as a collaboration between Loporrit, Sharlayan, and Garlean engineers. As a result, it exhibits magitek armor influences in its design, particularly in the area of its piloting system.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:364:0:2"
msgid "If I am not mistaken, this would<br>not be the first time you've piloted<br>one of these suits.<br>   - G'nibnpha"
msgstr "Если не ошибаюсь, вы уже<br>пилотировали такие машины.<br>   — Г'нибнфа"

#. ja: 商のカムイに騎乗する。<br>大商人に保護された大狼。なぜだか天を駆ける
#. de: Rufe deinen geschäftigen Kamuy herbei. Der gesegnete Wolf setzt sich mühelos über die Gesetze der Schwerkraft hinweg.
#. fr: Vous appelez un kamuy de la prospérité, une créature capable de voler, recueillie par une marchande.
#. column 1: During a journey to the Far East, the merchant Rowena came upon and took in this wolf which, having received a divine blessing, is able to lope freely through the sky. In the part of the world whence it hails, a practice exists wherein dogs are sent to pay homage at distant shrines in their masters' stead.
#. column 2: Oho, how enterprising!<br>   - Hasdahd
msgctxt "MountTransient:365:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your venturous kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics."
msgstr "Призовите своего камуя-предпринимателя — волка, благословлённого небесами и не знающего законов гравитации и аэродинамики."

#. ja: 市場調査のため東方に赴いた商人「ロウェナ」が、現地にて保護した大狼。なんらかの存在の加護を受けているらしく天を駆ける。なお、東方には犬に賽銭を持たせて、飼い主に代わって遠方の社に参らせる風習があるようだが……
#. de: Auf einer Reise in den Fernen Osten las die Händlerin Rowena diesen Wolf auf, welcher dank eines göttlichen Segens selbst durch die Lüfte galoppieren kann. In seinen Heimatlanden existiert ein Brauch, bei dem Hunde losgeschickt werden, um anstelle ihrer Herrchen Opfergeld an Schreine weit und fern zu liefern.
#. fr: Rowena a recueilli cet imposant loup à l'occasion d'un voyage d'affaires en Orient. Il est coutume sous ces latitudes de confier ses offrandes aux chiens pour qu'ils aillent les déposer au temple pour leurs maîtres. La capacité de ce loup à voler laisse supposer qu'il aurait été béni par une quelconque divinité.
#. column 0: Summon forth your venturous kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 2: Oho, how enterprising!<br>   - Hasdahd
msgctxt "MountTransient:365:0:1"
msgid "During a journey to the Far East, the merchant Rowena came upon and took in this wolf which, having received a divine blessing, is able to lope freely through the sky. In the part of the world whence it hails, a practice exists wherein dogs are sent to pay homage at distant shrines in their masters' stead."
msgstr "Во время поездки на Дальний Восток торговка Ровена нашла этого волка и взяла его к себе. Получив благословение свыше, он свободно носится по небу. В тех краях существует обычай: собак отправляют к далёким святилищам с подношениями от имени хозяев."

#. ja: チャリーン！
#. de: Oho, wie geschäftstüchtig!<br><i>Hasdahd</i>
#. fr: Aouh, aouh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your venturous kamuy, blessed wolf who shall not be bound by such corporeal laws as gravity or aerodynamics.
#. column 1: During a journey to the Far East, the merchant Rowena came upon and took in this wolf which, having received a divine blessing, is able to lope freely through the sky. In the part of the world whence it hails, a practice exists wherein dogs are sent to pay homage at distant shrines in their masters' stead.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:365:0:2"
msgid "Oho, how enterprising!<br>   - Hasdahd"
msgstr "Ого, какая предприимчивость!<br>   — Хаздад"

#. ja: トルマリンゴーレムに騎乗する。<br>眩い輝きを放つゴーレム
#. de: Rufe deinen Turmalingolem herbei. Dieses Prachtstück wird jede Ge<shy>sell<shy>schaft vor Neid erblassen lassen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture golem de tourmaline, dont l'éclat éblouissant fait tourner les têtes.
#. column 1: This resplendent golem is believed to have been fashioned by a mage of eld, who went to considerable lengths to gather the requisite tourmaline. The variegated hues seen across its body arise from the use of precious bicolored stones, which are highly sought after by collectors.
#. column 2: Finding the gilded tourmaline egg<br>was only the beginning!<br>   - Nonotta
msgctxt "MountTransient:367:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your tourmaline golem, and make yourself the envy of gemstone collectors."
msgstr "Призовите своего турмалинового голема и заставьте коллекционеров драгоценных камней вам завидовать."

#. ja: 眩い輝きを放つゴーレム。古の魔道士がトルマリンを集めて創り上げたものと思われる。部位ごとに異なる色味を帯びるのは、貴重なバイカラーの原石を用いているため。その輝きは好事家にとって垂涎の的となっている
#. de: Dieser prachtvolle Golem soll von einem Magier längst vergessener Zeiten erschaffen worden sein. Die mannigfaltigen Farbfacetten gehen auf die Verwendung von äußerst seltenen zweifarbigen Edelsteinen zurück. Genau dieser Glanz ist es, der den Golem unter Sammlern so unwahrscheinlich begehrt macht.
#. fr: Ce golem qui dégage un éclat éblouissant aurait été créé par un mage ancien à partir de nombreuses tourmalines. Les divers cristaux bruts bicolores d'une grande valeur qui le composent lui donnent une myriade de nuances tout le long de son corps, ce qui lui vaut d'être convoité par un grand nombre de col<shy>lec<shy>tion<shy>neurs.
#. column 0: Summon forth your tourmaline golem, and make yourself the envy of gemstone collectors.
#. column 2: Finding the gilded tourmaline egg<br>was only the beginning!<br>   - Nonotta
msgctxt "MountTransient:367:0:1"
msgid "This resplendent golem is believed to have been fashioned by a mage of eld, who went to considerable lengths to gather the requisite tourmaline. The variegated hues seen across its body arise from the use of precious bicolored stones, which are highly sought after by collectors."
msgstr "Этот великолепный голем, как полагают, создан древним магом, который потратил немало сил, чтобы собрать нужное количество турмалина. Разноцветные оттенки на его теле появились благодаря редким двухцветным камням, за которыми охотятся коллекционеры."

#. ja: キラーン！
#. de: Dich umgibt der Glanz des Triumphs ...<br><i>Urianger</i>
#. fr: Bling bling<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your tourmaline golem, and make yourself the envy of gemstone collectors.
#. column 1: This resplendent golem is believed to have been fashioned by a mage of eld, who went to considerable lengths to gather the requisite tourmaline. The variegated hues seen across its body arise from the use of precious bicolored stones, which are highly sought after by collectors.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:367:0:2"
msgid "Finding the gilded tourmaline egg<br>was only the beginning!<br>   - Nonotta"
msgstr "Найти позолоченное турмалиновое яйцо<br>было только началом!<br>   — Нонотта"

#. ja: コスモフェイスに騎乗する。<br>あなたの暮らしを笑顔で見守る、レポリット製の防衛機構
#. de: Steige auf deine kosmische Contenance auf. Ein Verteidigungssystem der Loporrit, das dir stets mit einem „Lächeln“<nbsp>- wenn man es denn so nennen mag<nbsp>- zur Seite steht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture sourieur cosmique, une machine loporrite censée veiller sur votre bonheur et votre bien-être.
#. column 1: Originally created to protect Smileton, this machina has the appearance of a face that smiles at residents and grimaces at trespassers. When the construction of the settlement was suspended with the forestalling of the Final Days, this unit was repurposed for general support duties.
#. column 2: Let's get out there and<br>serve up some smiles, eh?<br>   - Jammingway
msgctxt "MountTransient:371:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your cosmic countenance, a Loporrit-designed defense system that serves with a smile─albeit an unsettling one."
msgstr "Призовите своё космическое лицо — оборонительную систему, придуманную лопорритами. Она служит с улыбкой, пусть и жутковатой."

#. ja: 楽園都市スマイルトンの防衛機構。住人には笑顔を、侵入者には憤怒の表情をとのコンセプトで設計されたが、終末現象の収束に伴い施設の建設計画が撤回されたことを受けて、本機は生活支援用に改装されることとなった
#. de: Ursprünglich sollte dieses Verteidigungssystem zum Schutz der geplanten Paradiesstadt Smileton eingesetzt werden, wobei es Bewohnern mit einem Lächeln und Eindringlingen mit einer Schreckensgrimasse begegnet wäre. Doch nachdem das Projekt aufgrund der Letzten Tage nie zu Ende gebracht worden war, hat man es nun für kosmische Alltagsausflüge umfunktioniert.
#. fr: Cette machine était utilisée comme sentinelle à Risette-sur-lune. À l'origine, elle devait montrer un visage souriant aux résidents et une expression féroce envers les intrus. Mais lorsque la conception de la ville a été abandonnée une fois l'apocalypse évitée, elle a été reconvertie comme unité d'assistance.
#. column 0: Summon forth your cosmic countenance, a Loporrit-designed defense system that serves with a smile─albeit an unsettling one.
#. column 2: Let's get out there and<br>serve up some smiles, eh?<br>   - Jammingway
msgctxt "MountTransient:371:0:1"
msgid "Originally created to protect Smileton, this machina has the appearance of a face that smiles at residents and grimaces at trespassers. When the construction of the settlement was suspended with the forestalling of the Final Days, this unit was repurposed for general support duties."
msgstr "Эту машину создали для защиты Смайлтона. Жителям она улыбалась, а незваных гостей встречала гримасой ярости. Когда после предотвращения Последних дней строительство поселения отменили, машину переоборудовали для бытовых нужд."

#. ja: スマーイル！
#. de: Sogar ihr Lächeln hat mir Angst eingejagt<nbsp>...<br><i>Gulool Ja</i>
#. fr: Sourieeeez !
#. column 0: Summon forth your cosmic countenance, a Loporrit-designed defense system that serves with a smile─albeit an unsettling one.
#. column 1: Originally created to protect Smileton, this machina has the appearance of a face that smiles at residents and grimaces at trespassers. When the construction of the settlement was suspended with the forestalling of the Final Days, this unit was repurposed for general support duties.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:371:0:2"
msgid "Let's get out there and<br>serve up some smiles, eh?<br>   - Jammingway"
msgstr "Пойдёмте дарить всем улыбки,<br>а? <br>   — Джаммингвей"

#. ja: デモンズ・タブレットに騎乗する。<br>血で刻んだ文様により動き出した魔法の石板。おそらく無害
#. de: Rufe deine Dämonentafel herbei und lasse dich von ihrer amdaporschen Magie beschützen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture muraille démonique, une con<shy>struc<shy>tion de pierre capable de se déplacer grâce aux sillons de sang gravés sur sa surface.
#. column 1: This formerly inanimate block of stone was brought to ghastly life by way of arcane patterns engraved in blood. Though created in bygone times to repel trespassers as a guardian, the removal of its core has rendered it harmless while additionally allowing it to serve as a mode of transport.
#. column 2: How many times now have<br>you and yours hauled us<br>back from the brink?<br>   - Merlwyb
msgctxt "MountTransient:372:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your demon haul, a dreaded guardian-turned-mode of transport."
msgstr "Призовите своего демонического перевозчика — грозного стража, ставшего средством передвижения."

#. ja: 血で刻んだ文様により動き出した魔法の石板。侵入者を退けるための守護者として造られたものだったが、中心部を切り出した結果、無害な存在となった。試しに被ってみたところ、浮いたので移動用に使うことができそうだ
#. de: In Blut geschriebene Inschriften erweckten diese unbewegte Steintafel zum Leben. Einst diente sie einzig und allein als Wächter des Turms des Blutes, doch seit ihr der Kern entnommen wurde, lässt es sich wunderbar mit ihr reiten - abgesehen von dem steinharten Sitzgefühl, natürlich.
#. fr: Grâce aux symboles arcaniques sanglants inscrits sur sa surface, cette créature mi-monstre, mi-mur peut désormais se déplacer. Elle avait été initialement conçue comme une gardienne protégeant contre l'invasion d'intrus, mais sa partie centrale, séparée du reste de la muraille, est désormais (pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment) inoffensive. En tout cas, après vous être glissé<if $gn4>e</if> à l'intérieur, vous avez remarqué qu'elle pouvait flotter dans les airs, devenant ainsi une monture efficace, mais au confort douteux.
#. column 0: Summon forth your demon haul, a dreaded guardian-turned-mode of transport.
#. column 2: How many times now have<br>you and yours hauled us<br>back from the brink?<br>   - Merlwyb
msgctxt "MountTransient:372:0:1"
msgid "This formerly inanimate block of stone was brought to ghastly life by way of arcane patterns engraved in blood. Though created in bygone times to repel trespassers as a guardian, the removal of its core has rendered it harmless while additionally allowing it to serve as a mode of transport."
msgstr "Эту каменную плиту оживили жуткими узорами, вырезанными кровью. Когда-то она служила стражем и отпугивала незваных гостей, но после того, как из неё извлекли сердцевину, стала безвредной. А заодно её теперь можно использовать как транспорт."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ach, da fällt mir ein Stein vom Herzen<nbsp>...<br><i>N'welhi Tia</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Summon forth your demon haul, a dreaded guardian-turned-mode of transport.
#. column 1: This formerly inanimate block of stone was brought to ghastly life by way of arcane patterns engraved in blood. Though created in bygone times to repel trespassers as a guardian, the removal of its core has rendered it harmless while additionally allowing it to serve as a mode of transport.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:372:0:2"
msgid "How many times now have<br>you and yours hauled us<br>back from the brink?<br>   - Merlwyb"
msgstr "Сколько раз вы и ваши товарищи<br>вытаскивали нас из самой<br>безнадёжной передряги?<br>   — Мервиб"

#. ja: ペタロドゥスに騎乗する。<br>なぜかフレンドリーな二足歩行のサメ
#. de: Rufe deinen Petalodus herbei, den laufenden Haifisch, der dich ganz sicher nicht auf seiner Speisekarte hat. Hoffentlich ...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture petalodus, un étrange requin bipède plutôt docile.
#. column 1: Though ancient Nymian legend speaks of mythical sharks possessed of arms and legs, it is unknown whether they bear any connection to the bipedal petalodus. Though its kind are ferocious by nature, for reasons unknown, this particular specimen treats you as an old friend...and here we are.
#. column 2: Shark! Shark! Run for your lives!<br>   - Faire-goer
msgctxt "MountTransient:373:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your petalodus, an ambulatory shark that thinks of you as a friend, not food."
msgstr "Призовите своего петалодона — ходячую акулу, которая считает вас другом, а не обедом."

#. ja: 二足歩行のサメ。海洋都市「ニーム」には、手足を持つサメにまつわる神話が伝わるが関係性は不明。本来は獰猛な存在だが、どこかで会ったことがあるとでも言うかのように友情を示してくれた。わお、すごい、まるで無意味だ！
#. de: In den Legenden Nyms wird an einigen Stellen von Meeresräubern mit Gliedmaßen gesprochen, ob es sich dabei allerdings um dieses bestimmte Exemplar handelt, ist ungewiss. Und obwohl Petalodus als äußerst aggressiv und brutal gelten, scheint dich dein neues Reittier als guten Freund anzusehen.
#. fr: Dans la mythologie de la cité de Nym, un requin possédant des membres tel un humain est parfois mentionné. Toutefois, il est impossible de savoir si cette créature correspond à ce monstre de légende. De nature pourtant féroce, ce requin s'est montré très familier avec vous, comme si vous vous étiez déjà croisés par le passé... Peut-être lors de festivités balnéaires, qui sait<nbsp>?
#. column 0: Summon forth your petalodus, an ambulatory shark that thinks of you as a friend, not food.
#. column 2: Shark! Shark! Run for your lives!<br>   - Faire-goer
msgctxt "MountTransient:373:0:1"
msgid "Though ancient Nymian legend speaks of mythical sharks possessed of arms and legs, it is unknown whether they bear any connection to the bipedal petalodus. Though its kind are ferocious by nature, for reasons unknown, this particular specimen treats you as an old friend...and here we are."
msgstr "Согласно древним нимским легендам, существовали мифические акулы с руками и ногами. Неизвестно, связаны ли они с двуногими петалодонами. Обычно эти акулы свирепы, но этот экземпляр почему-то обращается с вами как со старым другом... Ну вот, приплыли."

#. ja: わお！
#. de: Ah, riechst du das? Der Duft des Meeres!<br><i>Jammingway</i>
#. fr: Waoh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your petalodus, an ambulatory shark that thinks of you as a friend, not food.
#. column 1: Though ancient Nymian legend speaks of mythical sharks possessed of arms and legs, it is unknown whether they bear any connection to the bipedal petalodus. Though its kind are ferocious by nature, for reasons unknown, this particular specimen treats you as an old friend...and here we are.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:373:0:2"
msgid "Shark! Shark! Run for your lives!<br>   - Faire-goer"
msgstr "Акула! Акула! Спасайтесь!<br>   — Гость праздника"

#. ja: スノウストリーマーに騎乗する。<br>紫色の衣装で飾られた雪だるま。永久氷晶の力で溶けることがない
#. de: Rufe deinen Schneefluenzer herbei. Keine Sorge, der ist widerstandsfähiger, als es den Anschein hat.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture streamer de neige, un bonhomme de neige fait de cristaux de glace éternelle, portant des habits d'un pourpre très significatif.
#. column 1: Hollow on the inside and sustained by the power of eternal ice, this snowman garbed in fetching purple promises to keep its rider cool even in the hottest of climes. Rumor holds it is the perfect companion for those who wish to share their adventures with others, as well as those who wish to cheer others along on theirs.
#. column 2: There's something strange about<br>these snowmen, yes, but...I can't<br>quite put my finger on it.<br>   - Isainne
msgctxt "MountTransient:374:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your snowstreamer. Guaranteed not to inconveniently melt while you are inside."
msgstr "Призовите снеговика-стримера. Пока вы внутри, он точно не растает в самый неподходящий момент."

#. ja: 紫色の衣装で飾られた雪だるま。内部に潜り込めば、まるで雪だるまになったかのように動き回ることができる。自らの冒険を広く共有したい人にも、仲間が旅する姿を見守り応援したい人にも最適な逸品だ
#. de: Der Frühling kann kommen, denn dieser hohle Schneemann besteht aus Immerfrost-Kristallen, denen selbst sengende Hitze nichts anhaben kann. Gerüchten zufolge erfreut sich der frostige Freund seit Neuestem gerade bei solchen äußerster Beliebtheit, die ihre Abenteuer mit anderen teilen, oder solchen, die dabei gerne mitfiebern.
#. fr: Un bonhomme de neige fait de cristaux de glace éternelle. Son ingénieuse machinerie interne permet à son passager de l'opérer avec précision. Ses habits pourpres sont reconnaissables de ses admirateurs qui ne manquent jamais de l'encourager dans ses pérégrinations<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your snowstreamer. Guaranteed not to inconveniently melt while you are inside.
#. column 2: There's something strange about<br>these snowmen, yes, but...I can't<br>quite put my finger on it.<br>   - Isainne
msgctxt "MountTransient:374:0:1"
msgid "Hollow on the inside and sustained by the power of eternal ice, this snowman garbed in fetching purple promises to keep its rider cool even in the hottest of climes. Rumor holds it is the perfect companion for those who wish to share their adventures with others, as well as those who wish to cheer others along on theirs."
msgstr "Внутри этот снеговик пуст, а силы ему придаёт вечный лёд. Нарядившись в привлекательный пурпур, он не даст всаднику перегреться даже в самую жару. Говорят, лучше спутника не найти: он подойдёт и тем, кто хочет делиться приключениями, и тем, кто любит поддерживать чужие."

#. ja: サブスクライブ！
#. de: Füüühle den Schneeeeee ... Spüüüre die frostige Seite der Maaacht ...<br><i>Schneemann</i>
#. fr: Abonnez-vous<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your snowstreamer. Guaranteed not to inconveniently melt while you are inside.
#. column 1: Hollow on the inside and sustained by the power of eternal ice, this snowman garbed in fetching purple promises to keep its rider cool even in the hottest of climes. Rumor holds it is the perfect companion for those who wish to share their adventures with others, as well as those who wish to cheer others along on theirs.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:374:0:2"
msgid "There's something strange about<br>these snowmen, yes, but...I can't<br>quite put my finger on it.<br>   - Isainne"
msgstr "В этих снеговиках есть что-то странное, да...<br>Только вот не пойму, что именно.<br>   — Изенн"

#. ja: ピルグリム・プロテクターに騎乗する。<br>旧フッブート領に生息していた白毛の獣。巡礼の旅に出る
#. de: Rufe Pilgers Freund als Reittier herbei. Er wird dich begleiten, egal wohin dich deine Pilgerreise führt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture protecteur des pèlerins, une grande bête blanche originaire de l'ancien royaume de Voeburt.
#. column 1: A white-furred beast native to lands formerly belonging to the Kingdom of Voeburt. They can be domesticated if raised from birth, and were known to escort adherents of the Church of the First Light on pilgrimages. Due to its exceptional docility, this specimen is believed to be descended from such trained creatures.
#. column 2: There is much I could learn<br>from your pilgrimage.<br>   - Hien
msgctxt "MountTransient:379:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth the pilgrim's protector, a wandering worshiper's best friend."
msgstr "Призовите защитника пилигримов — лучшего друга странствующего верующего."

#. ja: ノルヴラント北部、旧フッブート領に生息していた白毛の獣。幼獣の頃から育てることで人に慣れるため、光耀教徒の中には護衛獣として巡礼に同行させる者もいた。この個体はその子孫にあたるようで、非常に従順である
#. de: Diese pelzigen Geschöpfe waren einst im Königreich Voeburt heimisch. Als Jungtiere können sie abgerichtet werden und sind dafür bekannt, Anhänger der Kirche des Strahlenden Lichts auf Pilgerreisen zu begleiten. Aufgrund seiner außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>lichen Fügsamkeit wird angenommen, dass dieses Exemplar von solchen dressierten Tieren abstammt.
#. fr: Cette espèce de bête à fourrure blanche, originaire de l'ancien royaume de Voeburt, est apprivoisée dès son plus jeune âge depuis de nombreuses générations. Docile et obéissante malgré son apparence, elle est depuis toujours habituée à accompagner les fidèles de l'église de l'Aurore en pèlerinage.
#. column 0: Summon forth the pilgrim's protector, a wandering worshiper's best friend.
#. column 2: There is much I could learn<br>from your pilgrimage.<br>   - Hien
msgctxt "MountTransient:379:0:1"
msgid "A white-furred beast native to lands formerly belonging to the Kingdom of Voeburt. They can be domesticated if raised from birth, and were known to escort adherents of the Church of the First Light on pilgrimages. Due to its exceptional docility, this specimen is believed to be descended from such trained creatures."
msgstr "Белошёрстный зверь родом из земель, прежде принадлежавших королевству Вобурт. Если растить его с рождения, он привыкает к людям. Последователи Церкви Первого света брали таких зверей с собой в паломничества для охраны. Этот экземпляр, судя по всему, происходит от дрессированных зверей и отличается необычайным послушанием."

#. ja: グワゥ！
#. de: Was?! Tot?! Aber ... Er wollte zu dem Tempel pilgern, um Buße zu tun, aber<nbsp>... O Rhalgr! Diese Strafe ist zu grausam!<br><i>Ableant</i>
#. fr: Gwaf<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth the pilgrim's protector, a wandering worshiper's best friend.
#. column 1: A white-furred beast native to lands formerly belonging to the Kingdom of Voeburt. They can be domesticated if raised from birth, and were known to escort adherents of the Church of the First Light on pilgrimages. Due to its exceptional docility, this specimen is believed to be descended from such trained creatures.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:379:0:2"
msgid "There is much I could learn<br>from your pilgrimage.<br>   - Hien"
msgstr "Многому я мог бы<br>научиться у вашего паломничества.<br>   — Хиэн"

#. ja: ブランチベアラーに騎乗する。<br>ゴクゴルマ農園で活躍する移動性植物。害虫予防はお手のもの
#. de: Rufe deinen Zweigträger herbei, welcher vogelähnlicher nicht sein könnte. Aber eben nur ähnlich, nicht mehr.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture sylveplume, une majestueuse créature végétale de Gok Golma.
#. column 1: The branchbearer is employed as a companion plant in Gok Golma, where it protects crops by deterring pests with its aetheric emissions. In the past, the species was so aggressive that it was known to actively hunt animals for sustenance, but the Doppro people have succeeded in their domestication.
#. column 2: Truly, a more effective deterrent<br>I could not imagine.<br>   - Alphinaud
msgctxt "MountTransient:381:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your branchbearer. If it looks like a bird, flies like a bird, and cries like a bird, then it...could be a predatorial seedkin disguised as a bird."
msgstr "Призовите ветвеноносца. Похож на птицу, летает и кричит как птица... но, может, это хищное семякин, притворяющееся птицей?"

#. ja: ゴクゴルマ農園で共栄生物として飼育されていたブランチベアラー。エーテル放射による害虫からの保護など、多方面で活躍してきた。なお、元来は養分とするために動物を狩るほど攻撃性の高い種だが、ドプロ族の技により飼いならされている
#. de: Als Begleitpflanze hilft der Zweigträger in Gok Golma mithilfe seiner ätherischen Strahlungen bei der Schädlings<shy>bekämpfung. Wäre diese Pflanze nicht von den Doppro gezähmt worden, würde sie auch heute noch Tiere und wilde Bestien zur Nah<shy>rungs<shy>auf<shy>nahme jagen.
#. fr: Ces plantes migratrices aux formes aviaires sont élevées dans la ferme de Gok Golma. Grâce à leur rayonnement éthéré, elles protègent les cultures des insectes nuisibles. Par le passé, les sylveplumes étaient bien plus agressives et pouvaient chasser les autres animaux, mais grâce à la patience et aux efforts des Doppro, elles sont désormais domestiquées.
#. column 0: Summon forth your branchbearer. If it looks like a bird, flies like a bird, and cries like a bird, then it...could be a predatorial seedkin disguised as a bird.
#. column 2: Truly, a more effective deterrent<br>I could not imagine.<br>   - Alphinaud
msgctxt "MountTransient:381:0:1"
msgid "The branchbearer is employed as a companion plant in Gok Golma, where it protects crops by deterring pests with its aetheric emissions. In the past, the species was so aggressive that it was known to actively hunt animals for sustenance, but the Doppro people have succeeded in their domestication."
msgstr "Ветвеноносец — растение-компаньон с фермы Гок Голма. Эфирное излучение помогает ему отпугивать вредителей и защищать посевы. Изначально этот вид был настолько агрессивен, что охотился на животных ради пищи, однако народ доппро сумел его приручить."

#. ja: ギュィ、ギュィィ
#. de: Ach, verdammt, ich komm auf keinen grünen Zweig.<br><i>Hilda</i>
#. fr: Gyiih, gyihiih<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your branchbearer. If it looks like a bird, flies like a bird, and cries like a bird, then it...could be a predatorial seedkin disguised as a bird.
#. column 1: The branchbearer is employed as a companion plant in Gok Golma, where it protects crops by deterring pests with its aetheric emissions. In the past, the species was so aggressive that it was known to actively hunt animals for sustenance, but the Doppro people have succeeded in their domestication.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:381:0:2"
msgid "Truly, a more effective deterrent<br>I could not imagine.<br>   - Alphinaud"
msgstr "И впрямь, лучшего отпугивателя<br>вредителей не придумаешь.<br>   — Альфино"

#. ja: エアスピナーC9に騎乗する。<br>新生アレクサンドリア連王国製の最新型浮行機
#. de: Rufe deinen Luftraser C9 herbei und manövriere mit der Speerspitze der mobilen Elektrobtechnologie Neu-Alexandrias die Lüfte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture motodrone C9, le modèle dernier cri de véhicule volant produit à Néo-Alexandrie.
#. column 1: The C9 is the latest flying passenger vehicle to be developed in Alexandria. Propelled by six electrope thrusters that serve as wheels when driven on the ground, it performs equally well on land as it does in the air, and is the object of desire for the youths of Solution Nine.
#. column 2: It's almost scary what you<br>can do with electrope...<br>   - Wuk Lamat
msgctxt "MountTransient:382:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your air-wheeler C9, and turn heads all over Solution Nine."
msgstr "Призовите аэромобиль C9 и заставьте всех в Решении Девять оборачиваться вам вслед."

#. ja: 新生アレクサンドリア連王国製の最新型浮行機。地上走行時には車輪として用いることができるエレクトロープ製回転器を六輪備えており、走破性と飛行性能のバランスがいい。ソリューション・ナインの若者にとっては憧れの存在のようだ
#. de: Das Allerneueste, was es auf dem von der Elektrobtechnologie Neu-Alexandrias dominierten Markt für Schwebemobilität so gibt. Dieses Hybridmobil brilliert mit seinem Sechsradantrieb sowohl auf Land als auch in der Luft, was es schnell zum Statussymbol vieler junger Leute in Lösung Neun gemacht hat.
#. fr: Le modèle C9 est le plus récent de la lignée de motodrones produits à Néo-Alexandrie. Propulsé par six roues motrices à l'électrope, il peut se déplacer aussi aisément sur terre que dans les airs. Tous les férus de véhicules motorisés de Solution Neuf rêvent d'en posséder un.
#. column 0: Summon forth your air-wheeler C9, and turn heads all over Solution Nine.
#. column 2: It's almost scary what you<br>can do with electrope...<br>   - Wuk Lamat
msgctxt "MountTransient:382:0:1"
msgid "The C9 is the latest flying passenger vehicle to be developed in Alexandria. Propelled by six electrope thrusters that serve as wheels when driven on the ground, it performs equally well on land as it does in the air, and is the object of desire for the youths of Solution Nine."
msgstr "C9 — новейший летающий пассажирский транспорт, разработанный в Александрии. Шесть электропных двигателей служат ему колёсами на земле, так что он одинаково хорош и в воздухе, и на дороге. Молодёжь Решения Девять мечтает о таком."

#. ja: クォォォォォゥン…
#. de: Der ist wirklich 'ne Wucht.<br><i>Einsames Kind</i>
#. fr: Vwooooooom<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your air-wheeler C9, and turn heads all over Solution Nine.
#. column 1: The C9 is the latest flying passenger vehicle to be developed in Alexandria. Propelled by six electrope thrusters that serve as wheels when driven on the ground, it performs equally well on land as it does in the air, and is the object of desire for the youths of Solution Nine.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:382:0:2"
msgid "It's almost scary what you<br>can do with electrope...<br>   - Wuk Lamat"
msgstr "Страшно подумать,<br>что ещё можно сделать с электропом...<br>   — Вук Ламат"

#. ja: 古式魔道船に騎乗する。<br>魔法によって浮行する古式の魔道船。合計4人が搭乗可能
#. de: Rufe dein antikes Luftschiff herbei, welches mit seinen magischen Flugfähigkeiten dich und drei weitere Verbündete transportieren kann.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre aéronef ancien, une machine propulsée par une magie ancestrale et capable d'accueillir jusqu'à quatre personnes<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Discovered on the Occult Crescent, this ancient airship is powered not by ceruleum like modern vessels, but rather relies on magic to manipulate wind-aspected aether and generate propulsion. As this magic must be provided by passengers, it is recommended to ride in a group in order to avoid exhaustion.
#. column 2: Go as a gale wind to<br>the wrecked airship.<br>   - Sonu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:383:0:0"
msgid "Summon your ancient airship, a magic-propelled vessel capable of bearing you and three companions."
msgstr "Призовите старинный магический корабль, способный перевозить вас и троих спутников."

#. ja: 三日月島で発見された飛行用魔道船。現代の飛空艇と違い青燐ガスを用いず、風属性のエーテルを操作する浮行魔法で空を舞う。搭乗者の魔力を原動力とするため、複数人で乗ったほうが降りたときの疲労感が少ない
#. de: Die Insel Kreszentia beherbergte dieses Schiff scheinbar für Jahrtausende. Und anders als moderne Luftschiffe wird es nicht von konventionellem Treibstoff wie Erdseim angetrieben, sondern nutzt windaspektierten Äther zur Fortbewegung. Da es diesen aber von seinen Passagieren abzweigt, wird empfohlen, als Gruppe zu reisen und somit plötzlichen Schwächeanfällen vorzubeugen. Sicherheit geht eben vor.
#. fr: Cet aéronef des temps anciens a été découvert sur l'île de Lunule. Con<shy>trai<shy>re<shy>ment aux machines garlemaldaises, il n'utilise pas de céruleum comme carburant, mais de l'éther de vent lié à un sort de lévitation. Comme il puise dans les réserves d'énergie de ses passagers pour se déplacer, il est conseillé d'y monter à plusieurs pour éviter de finir com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment à plat après un long voyage.
#. column 0: Summon your ancient airship, a magic-propelled vessel capable of bearing you and three companions.
#. column 2: Go as a gale wind to<br>the wrecked airship.<br>   - Sonu Vanu
msgctxt "MountTransient:383:0:1"
msgid "Discovered on the Occult Crescent, this ancient airship is powered not by ceruleum like modern vessels, but rather relies on magic to manipulate wind-aspected aether and generate propulsion. As this magic must be provided by passengers, it is recommended to ride in a group in order to avoid exhaustion."
msgstr "Этот старинный летающий корабль нашли на Тайном Полумесяце. В отличие от современных судов, он работает не на церулеуме: его движет магия, управляющая эфиром ветра. Поскольку магию должны подпитывать пассажиры, лучше путешествовать компанией, чтобы не вымотаться."

#. ja: ゴウン、ゴウン…
#. de: Flieg wie der Wind!<br><i>Deryk</i>
#. fr: Brooom, brooom<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon your ancient airship, a magic-propelled vessel capable of bearing you and three companions.
#. column 1: Discovered on the Occult Crescent, this ancient airship is powered not by ceruleum like modern vessels, but rather relies on magic to manipulate wind-aspected aether and generate propulsion. As this magic must be provided by passengers, it is recommended to ride in a group in order to avoid exhaustion.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:383:0:2"
msgid "Go as a gale wind to<br>the wrecked airship.<br>   - Sonu Vanu"
msgstr "Ветром помчимся<br>к разбитому кораблю.<br>   — Сона Вану"

#. ja: 高機動型パワーローダーに騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画の功労者に与えられる特別な作業用重機
#. de: Steige in deinen hochmobilen Sternenläufer ein und mache die Oberflächen fremder Planeten mit seiner unbändigen Schubkraft unsicher.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture super mécano cosmique mobile, une machine de travail utilisée pour l'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: Those who have made exceptional contributions to the Cosmic Exploration Initiative are presented with this special vacuum suit, whose chassis and drivetrain have been tuned to increase power output. While proportionately more difficult to maneuver as a result, it is highly regarded among veteran pilots.
#. column 2: Hop into the pilot's seat!<br>We'll begin as soon as<br>you're ready!<br>   - Wedge
msgctxt "MountTransient:385:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your high mobility vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina."
msgstr "Призовите высокомобильный скафандр и воплотите мечту о пилотировании футуристической двуногой машины."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画の功労者に与えられる特別な作業用重機。フレームや主機を見直した結果、通常型よりも出力が向上しているが、それだけに操縦性がピーキーらしい。だが、熟練の操縦者からの評価は極めて高いという
#. de: Dieses Sondermodell des Sternenläufers wird nur den Besten der Besten von Projekt Kosmo-Erkundung zuteil. Im Vergleich zum Standardmodell wurde das Gewicht seines Gehäuses wesentlich überarbeitet, was in deutlich höherer Mobilität resultiert. Das bedeutet aber auch, dass es äußerst empfindlich auf Steuereingaben reagiert. Für Profipiloten ist das jedoch nur ein weiterer Grund, es in den Sternenhimmel zu loben.
#. fr: Cet engin est réservé à ceux dont la con<shy>tri<shy>bu<shy>tion au projet d'exploration cosmique s'est révélée par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement remarquable. Avec son nouveau châssis et son moteur dernier cri, il est encore plus puissant que les modèles utilisés sur la lune. Bien qu'il soit un poil plus complexe à piloter, ce mécano est très apprécié des pilotes ex<shy>pé<shy>ri<shy>men<shy>tés.
#. column 0: Summon forth your high mobility vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 2: Hop into the pilot's seat!<br>We'll begin as soon as<br>you're ready!<br>   - Wedge
msgctxt "MountTransient:385:0:1"
msgid "Those who have made exceptional contributions to the Cosmic Exploration Initiative are presented with this special vacuum suit, whose chassis and drivetrain have been tuned to increase power output. While proportionately more difficult to maneuver as a result, it is highly regarded among veteran pilots."
msgstr "Этот особый скафандр вручают тем, кто внёс выдающийся вклад в проект космических исследований. Раму и ходовую часть усовершенствовали, чтобы увеличить мощность. Управлять им стало сложнее, зато опытные пилоты его очень ценят."

#. ja: ガシュン、ガシュン…
#. de: Klar wie Möhrenbrühe, Chef!<br><i>Drivingway</i>
#. fr: Clonk, clonk...
#. column 0: Summon forth your high mobility vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 1: Those who have made exceptional contributions to the Cosmic Exploration Initiative are presented with this special vacuum suit, whose chassis and drivetrain have been tuned to increase power output. While proportionately more difficult to maneuver as a result, it is highly regarded among veteran pilots.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:385:0:2"
msgid "Hop into the pilot's seat!<br>We'll begin as soon as<br>you're ready!<br>   - Wedge"
msgstr "Занимайте место пилота!<br>Начнём, как только<br>будете готовы!<br>   — Ведж"

#. ja: ホイールローダーに騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた作業用重機
#. de: Nimm auf deinem Sternenebner platz und räume jegliche Hindernisse vor dir mit Leichtigkeit aus dem Weg.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture déblayeuse cosmique, une chargeuse sur pneus utilisée pour l'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this six-wheeled construction machina can traverse the roughest terrain with ease, and boasts ample power for clearing away obstacles with its front-facing blade. It is highly regarded among the Loporrits for its combination of utility and mobility.
#. column 2: You've certainly proven you<br>are not one to let obstacles<br>stand in your path.<br>   - Grynewyda
msgctxt "MountTransient:386:0:0"
msgid "Call into action your warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life."
msgstr "Позовите свой колёсный погрузчик и прокладывайте дорогу по жизни бульдозером."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた作業用重機。どんな荒れ地も踏破する六輪駆動の前方にブレードが設けられており、圧倒的パワーで進路上の障害物を排除することができる。働くクルマとしてレポリットにも大人気
#. de: Dieses sechsrädrige Gefährt wurde ursprünglich für die Kosmo-Erkundung entworfen, um selbst die unwirtlichsten Gegenden durchqueren zu können. Mit seiner enormen Schubkraft und den Klingen an der Vorderseite macht er mit jeglichen Hindernissen kurzen Prozess und ist aufgrund seiner Vielseitigkeit auch unter den Loporrit sehr beliebt.
#. fr: Cette machine exclusivement conçue pour l'exploration cosmique dispose de six roues à toute épreuve, ainsi que d'une lame géante à l'avant pour déblayer n'importe quel type de terrain à une vitesse effarante. Au fil du temps, elle est devenue le véhicule de travail préféré des Loporrites.
#. column 0: Call into action your warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life.
#. column 2: You've certainly proven you<br>are not one to let obstacles<br>stand in your path.<br>   - Grynewyda
msgctxt "MountTransient:386:0:1"
msgid "Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this six-wheeled construction machina can traverse the roughest terrain with ease, and boasts ample power for clearing away obstacles with its front-facing blade. It is highly regarded among the Loporrits for its combination of utility and mobility."
msgstr "Эту шестиколёсную строительную машину создали для проекта космических исследований. Она легко преодолевает самые суровые ландшафты, а мощный передний отвал убирает с пути любые преграды. Лопорриты ценят её за сочетание практичности и манёвренности."

#. ja: ゴウンゴウン…
#. de: Vrooooom!
#. fr: Brooom brooom...
#. column 0: Call into action your warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this six-wheeled construction machina can traverse the roughest terrain with ease, and boasts ample power for clearing away obstacles with its front-facing blade. It is highly regarded among the Loporrits for its combination of utility and mobility.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:386:0:2"
msgid "You've certainly proven you<br>are not one to let obstacles<br>stand in your path.<br>   - Grynewyda"
msgstr "Вы уже доказали, что не из тех,<br>кого преграды остановят.<br>   — Гриневида"

#. ja: ライド・ザ・ナイスヘッドに騎乗する。<br>とあるテーマパークのマスコットキャラクターとされる何か
#. de: Rufe Seine königliche Kleinheit Kleinkopf I. herbei, der dem Maskottchen eines gewissen Freizeitparks <i>erschreckend</i> ähnlich aussieht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Sa Trognesté Boubouille. Sa ressemblance avec la mascotte d'un certain parc d'attractions est troublante...
#. column 1: This uncanny mascot of a forgotten amusement park has no tolerance for unsightly heads, and will stop at nothing to separate those that fail to satisfy him from their bodies. The only way to escape his scrutiny is to ride him, thereby becoming one with his flawless noggin.
#. column 2: I shall not rest until my every subject<br>bears a beauteous noggin!<br>   - His Royal Headness Leonogg I
msgctxt "MountTransient:388:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth His Royal Headness on Parade, that all may bask in the splendor of a well-formed noggin."
msgstr "Призовите Его Головейшество на параде, чтобы все могли полюбоваться безупречной головой."

#. ja: とあるテーマパークのマスコットとされる何か。ダサいアタマが許せないらしく、どこまでも追いかけて、そのアタマを引っこ抜こうとする。ならば、ナイスなヘッドに乗ってしまえ。そうすれば、ナイスヘッドなナカマになれるだろう
#. de: Das Maskottchen eines fürchterlich schönen Freizeitparks, das hässliche Häupter gar nicht abkann und sie bis ans Ende der Welt jagt, um sie auszurupfen. Die einzige Möglichkeit, diesem Schicksal zu entringen, ist, seinen Schön... Kleinkopf selbst zu besteigen und zu reiten.
#. fr: Cette étrange créature, qui semble droit sortie d'un cauchemar, ne supporte pas les bobines qui n'ont pas bonne mine, et peut poursuivre ses victimes in<shy>las<shy>sa<shy>ble<shy>ment jusqu'à réussir à leur arracher la caboche. Pour éviter ce genre de désagrément, mieux vaut simplement chevaucher sa tête et ainsi rejoindre le rang des bonnes bouilles<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth His Royal Headness on Parade, that all may bask in the splendor of a well-formed noggin.
#. column 2: I shall not rest until my every subject<br>bears a beauteous noggin!<br>   - His Royal Headness Leonogg I
msgctxt "MountTransient:388:0:1"
msgid "This uncanny mascot of a forgotten amusement park has no tolerance for unsightly heads, and will stop at nothing to separate those that fail to satisfy him from their bodies. The only way to escape his scrutiny is to ride him, thereby becoming one with his flawless noggin."
msgstr "Этот жутковатый талисман заброшенного парка развлечений терпеть не может некрасивые головы и готов отделить их от тела. Единственный способ скрыться от его придирчивого взгляда — оседлать его и стать частью его безупречной головки."

#. ja: ナイスヘッド！
#. de: Mi-Mi-Mi-Mir fällt die Decke auf den Kopf bei so vielen Blödbirnen!<br><i>Seine königliche Hauptheit Leokopf I.</i>
#. fr: Par ma bouille<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth His Royal Headness on Parade, that all may bask in the splendor of a well-formed noggin.
#. column 1: This uncanny mascot of a forgotten amusement park has no tolerance for unsightly heads, and will stop at nothing to separate those that fail to satisfy him from their bodies. The only way to escape his scrutiny is to ride him, thereby becoming one with his flawless noggin.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:388:0:2"
msgid "I shall not rest until my every subject<br>bears a beauteous noggin!<br>   - His Royal Headness Leonogg I"
msgstr "Не успокоюсь, пока у каждого подданного<br>не будет прекрасной головы!<br>   — Его Высокоголовейшество Леоногг I"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・ナイトフッドに騎乗する。<br>旧アレクサンドリア城内で発見された魔法の翼
#. de: Rufe deine Flügel der Ritterlichkeit als Reittier herbei. Magische Schwingen, die in den Tiefen Burg Alexandrias entdeckt wurden.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes du serment, découvertes par hasard dans le château de l'ancienne Alexandrie.
#. column 1: Found within the ruins of Alexandria Castle, these armor-clad wings are reminiscent of the formidable machine imbued with the memories of Zelenia, former second-in-command of the royal knights of Alexandria. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the passion of a knight who lived to serve her queen.
#. column 2: She was the soul of conviction─<br>and so are we!<br>   - Kenwrec
msgctxt "MountTransient:389:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of the knighthood. Their vibrant red hue exudes the passion of a dutiful knight."
msgstr "Явите крылья рыцарства. Их ярко-красный цвет пылает страстью верного долгу рыцаря."

#. ja: 守護機構「ゼレニア」との決戦の地で発見された、魔法の翼。翼部を覆う装甲はかの兵器が身につけた甲冑を思わせるが、その来歴は謎に包まれている。いずれにせよ、この翼を授かりし者は、「守護者」の信念をも身に纏うことだろう
#. de: Magische Flügel, die am Ort deines Kampfes mit Zelenia gefunden wurden. Die Panzerung, die sie umgibt, ähnelt der Rüstung jener mechanischen Ritterin aus Burg Alexandria, ihre Herkunft ist und bleibt jedoch ein Rätsel. Treue Seelen belohnen die Schwingen mit der Aura eines standfesten Beschützers, welche sich sanft und dennoch bestimmt um einen legt.
#. fr: Ces ailes magiques ont été découvertes à l'issue du combat contre Zelenia. Bien que leur armature renforcée semble indiquer une finalité guerrière, leur origine est nimbée de mystère. Le sens du devoir de la gardienne est presque palpable pour tous ceux qui s'en ceignent le dos.
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of the knighthood. Their vibrant red hue exudes the passion of a dutiful knight.
#. column 2: She was the soul of conviction─<br>and so are we!<br>   - Kenwrec
msgctxt "MountTransient:389:0:1"
msgid "Found within the ruins of Alexandria Castle, these armor-clad wings are reminiscent of the formidable machine imbued with the memories of Zelenia, former second-in-command of the royal knights of Alexandria. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the passion of a knight who lived to serve her queen."
msgstr "Эти крылья в броне нашли в руинах замка Александрии. Они напоминают грозную машину, в которую вселились воспоминания Зелении, бывшей заместительницы командующего королевскими рыцарями Александрии. Их происхождение окутано тайной, но они хранят страсть рыцаря, посвятившей жизнь служению королеве."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Bei meinem Schwert - Ich werde Ihre Hoheit beschützen!<br><i>Zelenia</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of the knighthood. Their vibrant red hue exudes the passion of a dutiful knight.
#. column 1: Found within the ruins of Alexandria Castle, these armor-clad wings are reminiscent of the formidable machine imbued with the memories of Zelenia, former second-in-command of the royal knights of Alexandria. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the passion of a knight who lived to serve her queen.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:389:0:2"
msgid "She was the soul of conviction─<br>and so are we!<br>   - Kenwrec"
msgstr "Она была воплощением верности своему долгу —<br>как и мы!<br>   — Кенрек"

#. ja: 魔導スラッシャーに騎乗する。<br>百蟲綱の魔物を模した帝国製無人魔導兵器。刃を落としているので安全
#. de: Steige auf deinen Magitek-Schlitzer. Ein klingenloses Exemplar der gefürchteten Maschine für weniger Schlitzen und mehr Reiten.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture tailladeur magitek. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment pour vous, ses lames ont été retirées, alors aucun risque de vous couper<nbsp>!
#. column 1: An autonomous imperial warmachina designed in the likeness of a vilekin; the razor-sharp blades fitted onto their forelimbs are said to haunt the dreams of many an enemy soldier. This particular unit was seized by the Eorzean Alliance, and subsequently disarmed for use in transportation.
#. column 2: My expertise is more<br>in hacking and slashing.<br>   - Giott
msgctxt "MountTransient:390:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your magitek slasher. Has been stripped of its blades and is therefore safe to ride."
msgstr "Призовите в бой магитехнического рубаку. Его клинки сняты, так что ездить на нём безопасно."

#. ja: 百蟲綱の魔物を模した帝国製の無人魔導兵器。腕部に装備された刃の斬れ味は鋭く、帝国軍と相対した多くの兵に悪夢を見せたと言われている。エオルゼア同盟軍に鹵獲された後、武装を外され輸送機器として放出されたようだ
#. de: Eine bestialischen Insekten nachempfundene Magitek-Maschine, welche völlig fahrerlos agieren kann. Bei den Feinden des Kaiserreichs ist sie für ihre alles zerschneidenden Klingen berühmt-berüchtigt und durfte nur wieder in den Umlauf gelangen, weil sie die Eorzäische Allianz dieser entledigt und zu einem Lieferfahrzeug umgebaut hat.
#. fr: Cet automate magitek a été conçu par Garlemald pour ressembler à un insecte. Ses lames affûtées installées sur ses bras ont été la source de cauchemar de plus d'un soldat de l'Alliance. Après avoir été capturée, cette unité a été entièrement désarmée pour servir de moyen de transport.
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek slasher. Has been stripped of its blades and is therefore safe to ride.
#. column 2: My expertise is more<br>in hacking and slashing.<br>   - Giott
msgctxt "MountTransient:390:0:1"
msgid "An autonomous imperial warmachina designed in the likeness of a vilekin; the razor-sharp blades fitted onto their forelimbs are said to haunt the dreams of many an enemy soldier. This particular unit was seized by the Eorzean Alliance, and subsequently disarmed for use in transportation."
msgstr "Автономная гарлеанская боевая машина, созданная по образу отвратительного насекомого. Говорят, острые лезвия на передних конечностях не раз являлись солдатам в кошмарах. Эту машину захватил Эорзейский альянс, разоружил и приспособил для перевозки грузов."

#. ja: スラ～ッ！
#. de: Magitek-Schlitzer in Angriffsmodus!
#. fr: Shlak<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your magitek slasher. Has been stripped of its blades and is therefore safe to ride.
#. column 1: An autonomous imperial warmachina designed in the likeness of a vilekin; the razor-sharp blades fitted onto their forelimbs are said to haunt the dreams of many an enemy soldier. This particular unit was seized by the Eorzean Alliance, and subsequently disarmed for use in transportation.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:390:0:2"
msgid "My expertise is more<br>in hacking and slashing.<br>   - Giott"
msgstr "Я больше люблю рубить<br>и кромсать.<br>   — Джиотт"

#. ja: 岩兵ヴーガーに騎乗する。<br>ヨカフイ族に伝わる土木用ゴーレム
#. de: Rufe Vurgar den Treuen als Reittier herbei. Marmor, Stein und Eisen bricht, aber dieser Golem nicht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Vurgar, un golem de pierre employé par les Yok Huy.
#. column 1: In ages past, the Yok Huy employed golems such as this as weapons of war, but following Tuliyollal's founding, they refrained from creating new ones out of their newfound aversion to conflict. In the Yok Huy tongue, the name Vurgar simply means “one who possesses a body of stone.”
#. column 2: If you want the golem restored,<br>you may leave it to my husband!<br>   - Dulia-Chai
msgctxt "MountTransient:393:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth Vurgar the Loyal, and give your enemies twenty seconds to comply."
msgstr "Призовите Вергара Верного и дайте врагам двадцать секунд, чтобы выполнить ваши требования."

#. ja: ヨカフイ族に伝わる岩兵、すなわちゴーレム。ヨカフイ族はかつて岩兵を兵器として利用してきたが、トライヨラ建国後は争いへの忌避感ゆえか新造を控えるようになったらしい。なお、ヴーガーとは「石の身体を持つ者」の意である
#. de: Vor langer Zeit setzten die Yok Huy Golems dieser Art als Kriegswaffen ein. Doch nach der Gründung von Tuliyollal verzichteten sie aufgrund ihrer neu entdeckten Abneigung gegen Konflikte darauf, neue zu erschaffen. In der Sprache der Yok Huy bedeutet der Name Vurgar einfach „der, der einen Körper aus Stein besitzt“.
#. fr: Les Yok Huy employaient tra<shy>di<shy>tion<shy>nel<shy>lement les golems tels que Vurgar dans le domaine de la guerre, mais la fondation du Tuliyollal et la pacification de la région les ont poussés à abandonner leurs velléités belliqueuses. Le nom “Vurgar” lui-même signifie “celui dont le corps est constitué de pierre”.
#. column 0: Summon forth Vurgar the Loyal, and give your enemies twenty seconds to comply.
#. column 2: If you want the golem restored,<br>you may leave it to my husband!<br>   - Dulia-Chai
msgctxt "MountTransient:393:0:1"
msgid "In ages past, the Yok Huy employed golems such as this as weapons of war, but following Tuliyollal's founding, they refrained from creating new ones out of their newfound aversion to conflict. In the Yok Huy tongue, the name Vurgar simply means “one who possesses a body of stone.”"
msgstr "Когда-то народ йок-хуй использовал таких големов как боевое оружие. Но после основания Тулийоллала они, похоже, отказались создавать новых: видимо, разонравились им войны. На языке йок-хуй «Варгар» означает «тот, у кого каменное тело»."

#. ja: ゴゴゴ…
#. de: Unverbrüchliche Treue ist etwas wahrhaft Edles. Auch in noch so fernen Ländern mit noch so fremden Sitten weiß wohl jeder um ihren Wert.<br><i>Yugiri</i>
#. fr: Gogogo...
#. column 0: Summon forth Vurgar the Loyal, and give your enemies twenty seconds to comply.
#. column 1: In ages past, the Yok Huy employed golems such as this as weapons of war, but following Tuliyollal's founding, they refrained from creating new ones out of their newfound aversion to conflict. In the Yok Huy tongue, the name Vurgar simply means “one who possesses a body of stone.”
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:393:0:2"
msgid "If you want the golem restored,<br>you may leave it to my husband!<br>   - Dulia-Chai"
msgstr "Если голема нужно починить,<br>поручите это моему мужу!<br>   — Дулия-Чай"

#. ja: ワニュウドウに騎乗する。<br>東方地域で造られる一種の魔法人形
#. de: Steige auf deinen Wanyudo auf. Ein Albtraum in Radform.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture wanyûdô, un type de marionnette enchantée fabriquée sur les lointaines terres orientales.
#. column 1: Appearing as an oxcart wheel adorned with a demonic face, this automaton originating from the Far East is created in the likeness of mythical apparitions that steal the souls of any who look upon them. While originally intended to repel intruders, it can also serve as a mode of transport for those with sufficient endurance.
#. column 2: Creaky wheels get the<br>grease around here!<br>   - Nitowikwe
msgctxt "MountTransient:394:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your wanyudo, and hold on for dear life as the nightmare rolls on."
msgstr "Призовите своего ванюдо и держитесь крепче: кошмар катится дальше!"

#. ja: 東方地域で造られる一種の魔法人形。牛車の車輪に面が付いた奇妙な姿は、当地に伝わる「見る者の魂を奪う怪異」の伝承を再現しているため。本来は防衛機構として用いられるが、多少の忍耐力があれば乗用にも利用できるだろう
#. de: Dieses dämonische Ochsenkarrenrad wurde einem Sagenwesen fernöstlicher Legenden nachempfunden, welches die Seelen all derjenigen stiehlt, die es erblicken. So grobschlächtig wie es ist, wurde es eigentlich als Schutzmaßnahme vor Eindringlingen entworfen. Besonders ausdauernde Reiter vermögen es allerdings, es als Fahrzeug zweckzuentfremden.
#. fr: Cette marionnette enchantée venue d'Orient reproduit fidèlement un wanyûdô, monstre légendaire en forme de roue de char à laquelle on aurait collé une tête de démon, et dont on dit qu'il aspirerait l'âme de ceux qui ont le malheur de le regarder. À l'origine utilisée comme mécanisme de défense, il est toujours possible de s'en servir comme monture, pour peu que l'on supporte l'inconfort qui en découle.
#. column 0: Summon forth your wanyudo, and hold on for dear life as the nightmare rolls on.
#. column 2: Creaky wheels get the<br>grease around here!<br>   - Nitowikwe
msgctxt "MountTransient:394:0:1"
msgid "Appearing as an oxcart wheel adorned with a demonic face, this automaton originating from the Far East is created in the likeness of mythical apparitions that steal the souls of any who look upon them. While originally intended to repel intruders, it can also serve as a mode of transport for those with sufficient endurance."
msgstr "Этот механизм с демонической личиной похож на колесо бычьей повозки. Его создали на Дальнем Востоке по образу призраков из местных легенд, которые крадут душу каждого, кто на них взглянет. Изначально он служил для защиты от незваных гостей, но при достаточной выдержке на нём можно ездить."

#. ja: シャリーン！
#. de: Deswegen müssen Räder und Gelenke jeden Tag geölt werden.<br><i>Nitowikwe</i>
#. fr: La roue tourne !
#. column 0: Summon forth your wanyudo, and hold on for dear life as the nightmare rolls on.
#. column 1: Appearing as an oxcart wheel adorned with a demonic face, this automaton originating from the Far East is created in the likeness of mythical apparitions that steal the souls of any who look upon them. While originally intended to repel intruders, it can also serve as a mode of transport for those with sufficient endurance.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:394:0:2"
msgid "Creaky wheels get the<br>grease around here!<br>   - Nitowikwe"
msgstr "У нас тут скрипучие колёса<br>смазывают как следует!<br>   — Нитовикве"

#. ja: フォーギヴン・ミミクリーに騎乗する。<br>ピルグリム・トラバースに潜伏していた存在。罪喰いに擬態している
#. de: Rufe die Geläuterte Nachahmung als Reittier herbei. Keine Sorge, sie ist eigentlich kein Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger und wird dich nicht in einen verwandeln.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mimétisme pardonné, une créature in<shy>ha<shy>bi<shy>tuelle aimant se déguiser en purgateur dans le Sanctuaire des pèlerins.
#. column 1: Found prowling Pilgrim's Traverse, this motley creature appeared to be a sin eater at first glance, but is in fact a variety of ambulating plant. It is believed that it learned to assume its present form in order to survive in the Light-flooded First.
#. column 2: I don't think anyone can truly<br>mimic your unique strengths.<br>   - Jessie
msgctxt "MountTransient:395:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your forgiven mimicry. Not actually a sin eater, so it can be ridden without fear of turning those around you into one."
msgstr "Призовите подражателя пожирателя грехов. Он не настоящий пожиратель грехов, так что можно не бояться, что он обратит окружающих в таких же монстров."

#. ja: ピルグリム・トラバースに潜伏していた存在。一見すると罪喰いのようだが、実は移動性植物である。光に満ちた世界での生存戦略として、罪喰いに擬態することを学んだ結果、このような姿になったらしい
#. de: Diese auffällige Kreatur, die auf Pilgers Pfad herumstreifte, sah auf den ersten Blick wie ein Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger aus, ist aber in Wirklichkeit eine wandernde Pflanze. Es wird vermutet, dass sie ihre heutige Form angenommen hat, um in der vom Licht gefluteten Ersten Splitter<shy>welt zu überleben.
#. fr: Ce rôdeur du Sanctuaire des pèlerins ressemble à première vue à un locataire de l'église de l'Aurore, mais il s'agit en réalité d'une plante mobile. Elle semblerait avoir appris à copier l'apparence des purgateurs à la perfection afin de survivre dans un monde dominé par la Lumière.
#. column 0: Summon forth your forgiven mimicry. Not actually a sin eater, so it can be ridden without fear of turning those around you into one.
#. column 2: I don't think anyone can truly<br>mimic your unique strengths.<br>   - Jessie
msgctxt "MountTransient:395:0:1"
msgid "Found prowling Pilgrim's Traverse, this motley creature appeared to be a sin eater at first glance, but is in fact a variety of ambulating plant. It is believed that it learned to assume its present form in order to survive in the Light-flooded First."
msgstr "Этот пёстрый зверь бродил по Пути пилигрима и на первый взгляд казался пожирателем грехов. На самом деле это разновидность передвижного растения. Похоже, оно научилось принимать такой облик, чтобы выжить на залитом Светом Первом осколке."

#. ja: ……！
#. de: Warum etwas erlernen, wenn man einfach andere nachahmen kann?<br><i>Unbekannter Abenteurer</i>
#. fr: ...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your forgiven mimicry. Not actually a sin eater, so it can be ridden without fear of turning those around you into one.
#. column 1: Found prowling Pilgrim's Traverse, this motley creature appeared to be a sin eater at first glance, but is in fact a variety of ambulating plant. It is believed that it learned to assume its present form in order to survive in the Light-flooded First.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:395:0:2"
msgid "I don't think anyone can truly<br>mimic your unique strengths.<br>   - Jessie"
msgstr "Думаю, никому не повторить<br>ваши неповторимые таланты.<br>   — Джесси"

#. ja: パンプキンウォーカーに騎乗する。<br>コンチネンタル・サーカスのダンチョーを模した魔法人形
#. de: Rufe deine Impresario-Marionette herbei und erlebe den fröhlich-furcht<shy>er<shy>re<shy>gen<shy>den Schauer eines Ritts mit ihr.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture citrouille ambulante. Ce pantin enchanté ressemble étrangement à l'impresario du Cirque intercontinental.
#. column 1: Designed in the fiendish likeness of the Impresario, the leader of the Continental Circus, this automaton incorporates an enchantment which allows it to weave festive glamours. Its head also produces a satisfyingly sonorous bonk when struck, for a more mundane sort of amusement.
#. column 2: Hello there, pumpkin!<br>Enjoying the festivities, I hope?<br>   - Continental Circus Publicist
msgctxt "MountTransient:396:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Ambulario, and ride in the delightfully fiendish spirit of All Saints' Wake."
msgstr "Призовите Тыквенного ходока и проникнитесь жутковато-весёлым духом Праздника поминовения усопших."

#. ja: 旅芸人一座「コンチネンタル・サーカス」のダンチョーを模した魔法人形。魔法の術式が組み込まれており、守護天節にちなんだお菓子やカボチャの幻を見せることができる。なお、頭部を叩くとコンコンと良い音が鳴る
#. de: Dem Anführer des Circus Continental nachempfunden, verfügt diese Marionette über eine Verzauberung, die sie ganz im Geiste von Allerschutzheiligen erscheinen lässt. Und als wäre das noch nicht genug, gibt ihr Kopf einen tiefen, äußerst zufriedenstellenden Ton von sich, wenn man ihm nur hart genug eine verpasst.
#. fr: Ce mannequin imposant à l'effigie de l'impresario du Cirque intercontinental peut projeter des illusions de délicieux bonbons ou d'effrayantes citrouilles de la Veillée des saints. Sa tête toute creuse fait un bruit satisfaisant quand on tape dessus.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Ambulario, and ride in the delightfully fiendish spirit of All Saints' Wake.
#. column 2: Hello there, pumpkin!<br>Enjoying the festivities, I hope?<br>   - Continental Circus Publicist
msgctxt "MountTransient:396:0:1"
msgid "Designed in the fiendish likeness of the Impresario, the leader of the Continental Circus, this automaton incorporates an enchantment which allows it to weave festive glamours. Its head also produces a satisfyingly sonorous bonk when struck, for a more mundane sort of amusement."
msgstr "Эта машина создана по демоническому образу антрепренёра, главы Цирка континентов. В неё встроили чары, позволяющие создавать праздничные иллюзии. А если постучать по голове, она издаст приятно звонкий «бум» — для самого обычного развлечения."

#. ja: トリック！
#. de: Siehst du den Kürbis dort? Sieh ihn dir doch bitte mal ganz genau an<nbsp>...<br><i>Gevatter Pierrot</i>
#. fr: Bouh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Ambulario, and ride in the delightfully fiendish spirit of All Saints' Wake.
#. column 1: Designed in the fiendish likeness of the Impresario, the leader of the Continental Circus, this automaton incorporates an enchantment which allows it to weave festive glamours. Its head also produces a satisfyingly sonorous bonk when struck, for a more mundane sort of amusement.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:396:0:2"
msgid "Hello there, pumpkin!<br>Enjoying the festivities, I hope?<br>   - Continental Circus Publicist"
msgstr "Привет, тыквочка!<br>Надеюсь, праздником довольны?<br>   — Глашатай Цирка континентов"

#. ja: シャギーキャットに騎乗する。<br>トラル大陸原産の巨大猫。青いリボンがお気に入り
#. de: Rufe deine Zottelmantel-Katze herbei. Eine riesige, dafür aber umso feinere Katze, deren ganzer Stolz ihre blaue Fliege ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture chat à poil long, un félin turalien géant qui aime les rubans bleus.
#. column 1: Native to Tural, this enormous breed of cat is regarded as a gentle giant on account of its intelligence and mild temperament. While those who have gained its trust are permitted upon its back, would-be riders should be prepared to get fur everywhere when it sheds its shaggy coat during the warmer seasons.
#. column 2: Let us spread a love for<br>all things feline far and<br>wide across the land!<br>   - Neko Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:397:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your shagcoat cat, a gigantic-yet-gentle feline with a penchant for sporting a blue bow tie."
msgstr "Призовите лохматого кота — огромного, но добродушного зверя, обожающего щеголять в синем галстуке-бабочке."

#. ja: トラル大陸原産の巨大猫。非常に賢く温厚であることから「穏やかな巨人」とも呼ばれ、絆を深められれば背に乗ることすらできる。ただし、長毛種の運命として、季節によっては膨大な抜け毛の歓迎を受けることだろう
#. de: Diese auf Tural heimische Katzenart wird aufgrund ihres Intellekts und milden Temperaments als „Sanfter Riese“ bezeichnet. Wen sie als vertrauenswürdig erachtet, lässt sie liebend gern auf ihrem Rücken reiten. Eine Sache gibt es allerdings zu beachten: Wie bei anderen Langhaartieren ist regelmäßiges Kämmen und Pflegen der Fellpracht absolute Pflicht<nbsp>- besonders während der heißeren Monate.
#. fr: Cet énorme chat hirsute, aussi connu sous le nom de “géant affable”, se distingue par son in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence rare au sein de son espèce. Il se lie à tous ceux pour qui il se prend d'affection en les laissant monter sur son dos. Attention toutefois à la saison de la mue, car ses longs poils épais collent énormément aux vêtements.
#. column 0: Summon forth your shagcoat cat, a gigantic-yet-gentle feline with a penchant for sporting a blue bow tie.
#. column 2: Let us spread a love for<br>all things feline far and<br>wide across the land!<br>   - Neko Bugyo
msgctxt "MountTransient:397:0:1"
msgid "Native to Tural, this enormous breed of cat is regarded as a gentle giant on account of its intelligence and mild temperament. While those who have gained its trust are permitted upon its back, would-be riders should be prepared to get fur everywhere when it sheds its shaggy coat during the warmer seasons."
msgstr "Эта огромная кошачья порода родом из Турала. За ум и спокойный нрав её прозвали «кротким великаном». Кот подпускает к себе на спину тех, кому доверяет, но в тёплый сезон линяет так, что шерсть будет повсюду."

#. ja: ウニャー
#. de: Lass uns die Liebe für alle Katzen im ganzen Land verbreiten!<br><i>Katzenminister</i>
#. fr: Miaaaou<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your shagcoat cat, a gigantic-yet-gentle feline with a penchant for sporting a blue bow tie.
#. column 1: Native to Tural, this enormous breed of cat is regarded as a gentle giant on account of its intelligence and mild temperament. While those who have gained its trust are permitted upon its back, would-be riders should be prepared to get fur everywhere when it sheds its shaggy coat during the warmer seasons.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:397:0:2"
msgid "Let us spread a love for<br>all things feline far and<br>wide across the land!<br>   - Neko Bugyo"
msgstr "Давайте разнесём любовь<br>ко всему кошачьему<br>по всему свету!<br>   — Нэко Бугё"

#. ja: セクレトに騎乗する。<br>ハンターの移動をサポートしてくれる騎乗動物
#. de: Rufe deinen treuen Saikrii herbei, der dich bei all deinen Jagdangelegenheiten bestens unterstützt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Seikret, le compagnon préféré des chasseurs des plaines sauvages.
#. column 1: A beast of burden known for its strength and swiftness. Additionally possessed of a superior sense of smell, they are able to track prey over great distances, making them an indispensable hunting companion whence they hail.
#. column 2: So what's the adventure?<br>Monster hunting?<br>   - Yozan
msgctxt "MountTransient:398:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Seikret, the steed of choice for serious hunters."
msgstr "Призовите своего сейкрета — лучшего скакуна для настоящего охотника."

#. ja: 自慢の機動力を活かし、ハンターの移動をサポートしてくれる騎乗動物。嗅覚に優れ、対象の匂いをどこまでも追跡できるため、故郷では狩りに欠かせない存在だったようだ
#. de: Mit seiner unangefochtenen Mobilität hilft dir dieses vogelähnliche Wesen deine Beute in jeden noch so unzugänglichen Winkel Eorzeas zu verfolgen. Hinzu kommt noch sein ausgeprägter Geruchssinn, welches es in seiner Heimat zu <i>dem</i> Begleittier für ernsthafte Jäger gemacht haben soll. Hinter all der Tapferkeit steckt aber vor allem sein Verlangen, seinen Reiter glücklich zu machen und sich so den ein oder anderen Krauler zu verdienen.
#. fr: D'une mobilité à toute épreuve, cet animal ressemblant à un chocobo accompagne les chasseurs partout où leurs missions les envoient. Doté d'un excellent odorat, il peut repérer n'importe quelle proie à très grande distance, ce qui le rend ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment apprécié dans son pays d'origine.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Seikret, the steed of choice for serious hunters.
#. column 2: So what's the adventure?<br>Monster hunting?<br>   - Yozan
msgctxt "MountTransient:398:0:1"
msgid "A beast of burden known for its strength and swiftness. Additionally possessed of a superior sense of smell, they are able to track prey over great distances, making them an indispensable hunting companion whence they hail."
msgstr "Этот вьючный зверь славится силой и быстротой. К тому же у него отличный нюх: он может выслеживать добычу на огромных расстояниях. На родине без него не обходится ни один охотник."

#. ja: キュルル♪
#. de: Krahii!!
#. fr: Kyuuuuuu♪
#. column 0: Summon forth your Seikret, the steed of choice for serious hunters.
#. column 1: A beast of burden known for its strength and swiftness. Additionally possessed of a superior sense of smell, they are able to track prey over great distances, making them an indispensable hunting companion whence they hail.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:398:0:2"
msgid "So what's the adventure?<br>Monster hunting?<br>   - Yozan"
msgstr "Ну что, куда отправимся?<br>На охоту за чудовищами?<br>   — Ёдзан"

#. ja: ネコ荷車に騎乗する。<br>力尽きたハンターを運ぶための荷車。乗っても報酬は減らない
#. de: Lasse dich von dem Notfellwagen durch die Gegend karren. Keine Sorge<nbsp>- die Fahrt verringert keine Auftragsvergütungen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture charrette de l'équipe de soutien, une civière sur roues pour chasseurs mal en point pilotée par des Felynes. Heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, elle ne soustrait aucune récompense.
#. column 1: Featuring a time-tested construction, this cart is purpose-built to bear distressed hunters to safety. No matter how dangerous the destination, the Felynes will never fail to sally forth to the rescue, but it appears some hunters would not be caught dead being carted away.
#. column 2: That was meow-gnificent!<br>   - Felyne
msgctxt "MountTransient:399:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Felyne support team cart, safe in the knowledge that there is no reward penalty for riding it."
msgstr "Призовите тележку отряда поддержки фелинов. Можете не волноваться: награду за поездку не снизят."

#. ja: 力尽きたハンターを運ぶための荷車。どんなに危険な場所であろうと、救助要請ある限り、アイルーたちは荷車と共に出動する。ハンターの中にはこれに乗ることを不名誉と考える者もいるようだが、それはそれこれはこれ
#. de: Ein Abschleppwagen, der zur sicheren Entfernung von ausgelaugten Jägern aus Gefahrenzonen dient. Was der ganze Stolz der feinen Felynen ist, welche den Wagen bewegen, wird von manchen Elitären als Fleck auf der Jägerweste angesehen. Das soll dich aber nicht davon abhalten, deine Fahrt auf dem schaukelnden Holzgefährt vollends zu genießen.
#. fr: Quel que soit le danger, les deux Felynes qui poussent cette charrette viendront au secours des chasseurs à bout de forces et les ramèneront en lieu sûr. Certains parmi ces derniers semblent honteux de bénéficier de cette faveur, mais ils doivent comprendre qu'elle leur donne une occasion sup<shy>plé<shy>men<shy>tai<shy>re de prouver leur valeur.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Felyne support team cart, safe in the knowledge that there is no reward penalty for riding it.
#. column 2: That was meow-gnificent!<br>   - Felyne
msgctxt "MountTransient:399:0:1"
msgid "Featuring a time-tested construction, this cart is purpose-built to bear distressed hunters to safety. No matter how dangerous the destination, the Felynes will never fail to sally forth to the rescue, but it appears some hunters would not be caught dead being carted away."
msgstr "Эту проверенную временем тележку создали специально, чтобы увозить из опасных мест охотников, которые выбились из сил. Как бы опасна ни была дорога, фелины всегда придут на помощь. Правда, некоторые охотники скорее умрут, чем позволят себя увезти на тележке."

#. ja: ニャニャニャ！
#. de: Macht doch nichts!
#. fr: Couic couic...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Felyne support team cart, safe in the knowledge that there is no reward penalty for riding it.
#. column 1: Featuring a time-tested construction, this cart is purpose-built to bear distressed hunters to safety. No matter how dangerous the destination, the Felynes will never fail to sally forth to the rescue, but it appears some hunters would not be caught dead being carted away.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:399:0:2"
msgid "That was meow-gnificent!<br>   - Felyne"
msgstr "Ну и мяу-чно получилось!<br>   — Фелин"

#. ja: ヤーンに騎乗する。<br>異界生まれの羊の精霊。こう見えてとてもパワフル
#. de: Rufe dein Putschi herbei. Ein Schafs-Geist aus einer anderen Welt, dessen niedliches Aussehen nur ein Deckmantel für seine unglaubliche Macht ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture belhamel, l'esprit d'un mouton venu d'un autre monde. Malgré les apparences, il est surpuissant.
#. column 1: Hailing from the Ninth, this unusually proportioned sheep is held to be a benevolent spirit that bestows blessings in exchange for an offering of diamonds. This entity in particular is especially genial and generous, and gladly employs its powers in service to your transportation.
#. column 2: I believe diamonds<br>would be best for that.<br>   - Crystal Merchant
msgctxt "MountTransient:400:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your yan, a sheep spirit whose disarmingly adorable appearance belies its tremendous might."
msgstr "Призовите своего яна — духа овцы, чья обманчиво милая внешность скрывает огромную силу."

#. ja: 第九世界生まれの羊の精霊。当地に伝わる伝承によれば、友好的な精霊であり、ダイヤモンドと引き換えに加護を与えてくれるという。実際、この個体は穏やかで、自慢の力を発揮し、どこにでも連れていってくれる
#. de: Ein etwas deformierter Schafs-Geist, welcher in den Legenden des Neunten Splitters Reisenden im Tausch für Diamanten seinen Segen gibt. Dieses Exemplar ist ein wahres Musterbeispiel seiner Art, denn es lässt dich großzügigerweise auf ihm reiten.
#. fr: D'après la légende, cet esprit amical d'un mouton originaire du neuvième reflet vous offrira sa protection en échange de diamants. Malgré son côté vénal, sa douceur de caractère le rend toujours partant pour vous emmener où vous le désirez.
#. column 0: Summon forth your yan, a sheep spirit whose disarmingly adorable appearance belies its tremendous might.
#. column 2: I believe diamonds<br>would be best for that.<br>   - Crystal Merchant
msgctxt "MountTransient:400:0:1"
msgid "Hailing from the Ninth, this unusually proportioned sheep is held to be a benevolent spirit that bestows blessings in exchange for an offering of diamonds. This entity in particular is especially genial and generous, and gladly employs its powers in service to your transportation."
msgstr "Эта необычная овца родом из Девятого. По легендам, доброжелательные духи её вида даруют благословение в обмен на алмазы. Этот дух особенно приветлив и щедр, а ещё охотно использует свои силы, чтобы перевозить вас."

#. ja: ダイヤモンドちょうだい
#. de: Hm, wie wäre es dann mit einem Diamanten?<br><i>Juwelierin</i>
#. fr: Diamants<nbsp>! Diamants<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your yan, a sheep spirit whose disarmingly adorable appearance belies its tremendous might.
#. column 1: Hailing from the Ninth, this unusually proportioned sheep is held to be a benevolent spirit that bestows blessings in exchange for an offering of diamonds. This entity in particular is especially genial and generous, and gladly employs its powers in service to your transportation.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:400:0:2"
msgid "I believe diamonds<br>would be best for that.<br>   - Crystal Merchant"
msgstr "Думаю, лучше всего<br>подойдёт алмаз.<br>   — Торговец кристаллами"

#. ja: スペースダルメルに騎乗する。<br>異星環境への適応実験に参加していたダルメル
#. de: Rufe dein Weltall-Dhalmel herbei. Es hat sich perfekt an das Leben zwischen den Sternen angepasst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dhalmel de l'espace, un spécimen issu d'expériences scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques liées à l'environnement spatial.
#. column 1: This dhalmel was a subject in adaptability testing for life-forms native to Etheirys. As their kind is found in multifarious lands, from arid wastes to floating isles, they are believed to be highly adaptable, and it is hoped that they will also thrive in interstellar environments.
#. column 2: If some ill misfortune befalls you─<br>say, you're trampled by the dhalmels─<br>know that your remains will not go to waste.<br>   - Atelloune
msgctxt "MountTransient:401:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your interstellar dhalmel, and ride it boldly where no dhalmel has gone before."
msgstr "Призовите своего межзвёздного дальмеля и смело отправляйтесь туда, где ещё не бывал ни один дальмель."

#. ja: 異星環境への適応実験に参加していたダルメル。ある学説によると、ダルメルは非常に環境適応能力が高いとされ、乾燥地帯から浮島まで、様々な土地に根付いている。ならば宇宙でも適応してくれることだろう
#. de: Da Dhalmele sowohl in trockenen Wüsten als auch auf schwebenden Inseln überleben können, ist ihre Anpassungsfähigkeit von großem wissenschaftlichen Interesse. So kam es, das einige Exemplare in die Weiten des Alls gebracht wurden, um ihre Entwicklung in einer gänzlich fremden Umgebung zu beobachten.
#. fr: Selon une théorie, les dhalmels seraient dotés d'une grande capacité d'adaptation et auraient déjà élu domicile dans les lieux les plus variés, allant des régions arides aux îles flottantes. Ce spécimen participait à une expérience sur des environnements extraterrestres, et il semble donc probable que lui et ses congénères soient également aptes à vivre dans l'espace.
#. column 0: Summon forth your interstellar dhalmel, and ride it boldly where no dhalmel has gone before.
#. column 2: If some ill misfortune befalls you─<br>say, you're trampled by the dhalmels─<br>know that your remains will not go to waste.<br>   - Atelloune
msgctxt "MountTransient:401:0:1"
msgid "This dhalmel was a subject in adaptability testing for life-forms native to Etheirys. As their kind is found in multifarious lands, from arid wastes to floating isles, they are believed to be highly adaptable, and it is hoped that they will also thrive in interstellar environments."
msgstr "Этот дальмель участвовал в испытаниях на приспособляемость существ, родившихся на Эорзее. Дальмели живут в самых разных местах — от засушливых пустошей до парящих островов, — поэтому их считают очень выносливыми. Учёные надеются, что они смогут приспособиться и к межзвёздной среде."

#. ja: シューッ、フシューッ！
#. de: Fshuuuuuu!
#. fr: Bip bip... Bwéé...<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your interstellar dhalmel, and ride it boldly where no dhalmel has gone before.
#. column 1: This dhalmel was a subject in adaptability testing for life-forms native to Etheirys. As their kind is found in multifarious lands, from arid wastes to floating isles, they are believed to be highly adaptable, and it is hoped that they will also thrive in interstellar environments.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:401:0:2"
msgid "If some ill misfortune befalls you─<br>say, you're trampled by the dhalmels─<br>know that your remains will not go to waste.<br>   - Atelloune"
msgstr "Если с вами случится беда —<br>скажем, дальмели вас затопчут, —<br>знайте: останки не пропадут зря.<br>   — Ателун"

#. ja: コスモボードに騎乗する。<br>最新技術によって生み出された浮行式ボード
#. de: Steige auf deinen Kosmoschweber und gleite dank neuester technologischer Innovationen auch ohne feste Routen durch die Lüfte.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture cosmo-planche, une planche volante sans roulettes issue des dernières évolutions de la science spatiale.
#. column 1: Originally used to convey workers around Sinus Ardorum as part of the Cosmoliner network, this hovering board has undergone modification to incorporate a crystal power source. The result is a personal mode of transportation that is unbound to set routes, and looks radical besides.
#. column 2: How in the world do they<br>make it hover like that?<br>   - Anxious Girl
msgctxt "MountTransient:402:0:0"
msgid "Deploy your cosmoboard, and shred up the cosmos (figuratively) wherever you go."
msgstr "Разверните космическую доску и покоряйте просторы космоса (в переносном смысле), куда бы ни отправились."

#. ja: 最新技術によって生み出された浮行式ボード。本来は、移動設備「コスモライナー」用に開発されたものだが、これをエーテルラインから外れても利用できるように改造。内蔵クリスタルによる独立運用が可能となった
#. de: Dieses schwebende Brett wurde ursprünglich als Teil des Kosmozappers für den Transport von Projektteilnehmern der Kosmo-Erkundung entworfen. Die neuesten Versionen sind jedoch mit eigenen Kristallen als Energiequelle ausgestattet, wodurch sie nun komplett unabhängig eingesetzt werden können.
#. fr: Cette planche flottante, créée à l'aide des technologies de pointe, a été initialement conçue pour faire partie du réseau de cosmo-navettes. Elle a ensuite été modifiée pour pouvoir être utilisée indépendamment grâce à son cristal intégré.
#. column 0: Deploy your cosmoboard, and shred up the cosmos (figuratively) wherever you go.
#. column 2: How in the world do they<br>make it hover like that?<br>   - Anxious Girl
msgctxt "MountTransient:402:0:1"
msgid "Originally used to convey workers around Sinus Ardorum as part of the Cosmoliner network, this hovering board has undergone modification to incorporate a crystal power source. The result is a personal mode of transportation that is unbound to set routes, and looks radical besides."
msgstr "Эту парящую доску изначально использовали для перевозки рабочих по Заливу Синус Ардорум в составе сети космического экспресса. Позже её модифицировали и оснастили кристаллом-источником энергии. Теперь на ней можно ездить куда угодно, не следуя заданному маршруту. И выглядит она круто."

#. ja: ヒュォォォ…
#. de: Wusch!
#. fr: Pshiouuu...
#. column 0: Deploy your cosmoboard, and shred up the cosmos (figuratively) wherever you go.
#. column 1: Originally used to convey workers around Sinus Ardorum as part of the Cosmoliner network, this hovering board has undergone modification to incorporate a crystal power source. The result is a personal mode of transportation that is unbound to set routes, and looks radical besides.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:402:0:2"
msgid "How in the world do they<br>make it hover like that?<br>   - Anxious Girl"
msgstr "Как же она парит<br>в воздухе?<br>   — Тревожная девушка"

#. ja: ファーストライト・シャンデリアに騎乗する。<br>光耀教会式の浮遊灯に、妖精たちが追加のまじないをかけた品
#. de: Rufe deinen Kronleuchter des Strahlenden Lichts als Reittier herbei. Schon bald wird dir ein Licht aufgehen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture chandelier de la Lumière originelle, un chandelier emblématique de l'église de l'Aurore bénéficiant de capacités augmentées.
#. column 1: A furnishing at the Church of the First Light, this chandelier was imbued with levitation magicks to prevent it from falling and causing injury. In a development the church could not have foreseen, it has since been enhanced by fae enchantments and made able to soar the skies while bearing a rider.
#. column 2: My, how fancy. Though I suppose<br>this is a rather fancy place, isn't it.<br>   - Moogle Suitor
msgctxt "MountTransient:403:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your chandelier of First Light, and live like tomorrow doesn't exist. Like it doesn't exist."
msgstr "Призовите люстру Первого света и живите так, словно завтра не наступит. И ещё раз: не наступит."

#. ja: 光耀教会に設置されていたシャンデリア。落下事故予防のため浮遊魔法がかけられており、浮かぶ。だからといってわざわざこれに乗り空を駆けようなどとは、当時の光耀教関係者は思いもしなかったに違いない
#. de: Dieser Kronleuchter aus einer Kirche des Strahlenden Lichts wurde mit einem Levitationszauber versehen, um zu verhindern, dass er herunterfällt und jemanden verletzt. Seitdem wurde er durch Feenmagie verbessert und kann mutige Helden ohne Höhenangst bis durch den Himmel tragen.
#. fr: Ce chandelier installé dans l'église de l'Aurore a été enchanté par un sort de lévitation pour l'empêcher de tomber. C'est ainsi qu'il parvient à flotter<nbsp>; cependant, il est à noter que les fidèles de l'époque, même dans leurs rêves les plus fous, n'avaient jamais prévu que quelqu'un le chevaucherait un jour.
#. column 0: Summon forth your chandelier of First Light, and live like tomorrow doesn't exist. Like it doesn't exist.
#. column 2: My, how fancy. Though I suppose<br>this is a rather fancy place, isn't it.<br>   - Moogle Suitor
msgctxt "MountTransient:403:0:1"
msgid "A furnishing at the Church of the First Light, this chandelier was imbued with levitation magicks to prevent it from falling and causing injury. In a development the church could not have foreseen, it has since been enhanced by fae enchantments and made able to soar the skies while bearing a rider."
msgstr "Эта люстра украшала Церковь Первого света. На неё наложили заклинание левитации, чтобы она не упала и никого не травмировала. Церковь и представить не могла, что фейские чары однажды усилят магию настолько, что люстра сможет взмывать в небо вместе с наездником."

#. ja: ピカー！
#. de: Es ist so dunkel hier. Sollten wir nicht lieber ein paar Kerzen aufstellen?<br><i>Ryne</i>
#. fr: Fshing<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your chandelier of First Light, and live like tomorrow doesn't exist. Like it doesn't exist.
#. column 1: A furnishing at the Church of the First Light, this chandelier was imbued with levitation magicks to prevent it from falling and causing injury. In a development the church could not have foreseen, it has since been enhanced by fae enchantments and made able to soar the skies while bearing a rider.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:403:0:2"
msgid "My, how fancy. Though I suppose<br>this is a rather fancy place, isn't it.<br>   - Moogle Suitor"
msgstr "Вот это роскошь! Хотя место<br>и само по себе роскошное, верно?<br>   — Поклонник Мугла"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・デスに騎乗する。<br>メインターミナルで発見された魔法の翼
#. de: Rufe deine Flügel des Todes als Reittier herbei. Magische Schwingen, die auf der Spitze des Meso-Systems entdeckt wurden.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes de la mort, découvertes par hasard dans le mésoterminal.
#. column 1: Found within the Meso Terminal, these somber wings are reminiscent of Necron, the dark primal brought forth by the fear of death that had gripped Alexandrians. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, only one who stands unyielding beneath the weight of impending doom can hope to bear them.
#. column 2: You are bound by the limits<br>of flesh. It will betray you.<br>   - Calyx
msgctxt "MountTransient:407:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of death. Their somber hue exudes a sense of impending doom."
msgstr "Явите крылья смерти. Их мрачный цвет предвещает скорую гибель."

#. ja: 蛮神「永遠の闇」のそれとよく似た、魔法の翼。モノクロームの翼は見る者にどこかしら死を連想させるが、その来歴は謎に包まれている。いずれにせよ、この翼を授かりし者は「死の恐怖」をも踏み越える強き心を身に宿すことだろう
#. de: Magische Flügel, die denen des Ewigen Dunkels sehr ähnlich sehen. In monochrome Einfarbigkeit gehüllt, erwecken sie ein Gefühl der Ver<shy>zweif<shy>lung vor dem sicheren Ende, das jeden ereilt, ihre Herkunft ist und bleibt jedoch ein Rätsel. Würdige Träger belohnen sie mit der Stärke, ihre Todesfurcht zu überwinden und sich zu unerreichten Höhen aufzuschwingen.
#. fr: Ces ailes magiques ressemblent à s'y méprendre à celles de l'obscurité éternelle. Bien que leur aspect monochrome évoque la mort, leur origine est enrobée de mystère. Quoi qu'il en soit, ceux qui héritent de ces ailes se voient dotés d'une volonté in<shy>é<shy>bran<shy>la<shy>ble capable de surmonter la peur du trépas...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of death. Their somber hue exudes a sense of impending doom.
#. column 2: You are bound by the limits<br>of flesh. It will betray you.<br>   - Calyx
msgctxt "MountTransient:407:0:1"
msgid "Found within the Meso Terminal, these somber wings are reminiscent of Necron, the dark primal brought forth by the fear of death that had gripped Alexandrians. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, only one who stands unyielding beneath the weight of impending doom can hope to bear them."
msgstr "Эти мрачные крылья нашли в Терминале Мезо. Они напоминают Некрона — тёмного праймала, которого породил страх смерти, охвативший жителей Александрии. Их происхождение скрыто во мраке, и носить их под силу лишь тому, кто не дрогнет перед надвигающейся гибелью."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Nichts wirst du finden als Täuschung, Ver<shy>zweif<shy>lung und Tod.<br><i>Midgardsormr</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of death. Their somber hue exudes a sense of impending doom.
#. column 1: Found within the Meso Terminal, these somber wings are reminiscent of Necron, the dark primal brought forth by the fear of death that had gripped Alexandrians. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, only one who stands unyielding beneath the weight of impending doom can hope to bear them.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:407:0:2"
msgid "You are bound by the limits<br>of flesh. It will betray you.<br>   - Calyx"
msgstr "Тебя сковывают пределы<br>плоти. Она тебя предаст.<br>   — Чашечка"

#. ja: 花人に騎乗する。<br>花人の子株。新天地目指して移動中
#. de: Rufe deinen Blumerich als Reittier herbei. Hoffentlich hast du keine Pollenallergie.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture petit enfleuri, toujours à la recherche d'une nouvelle terre où s'épanouir.
#. column 1: This ambulating plant appears to be an offshoot of the ornamental shrubs you encountered along Pilgrim's Traverse. Though it is unclear whether it desires revenge for its fallen parents or simply wishes to sow its seeds in faraway lands, it has seemingly decided to follow you.
#. column 2: Only the most fearsome<br>bits of shrubbery get given<br>elite mark status.<br>   - Aytienne
msgctxt "MountTransient:408:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your ornamental shrublet. Seeks either revenge or proliferation or both on its way to a new land."
msgstr "Призовите декоративный кустик. Он ищет новую землю — то ли ради мести, то ли чтобы размножиться, то ли и для того и другого."

#. ja: ピルグリム・トラバースの巡礼路で出会った「花人」の子株。親株の復讐のためか、はたまた単により遠くの場所で種子を残したいだけかは定かでないが、巡礼路を軽快に進む冒険者についていくことを決めたようだ
#. de: Diese wandernde Pflanze scheint ein Ableger eines Zierstrauchs zu sein, dem du auf Pilgers Pfad begegnet bist. Sie hat sich entschlossen, dir zu folgen: Um Rache für ihre gefallene Mutterpflanze zu nehmen oder einfach nur ihre Samen in ferne Länder zu tragen, bleibt unklar.
#. fr: Impossible de savoir si ce petit enfleuri vadrouillant dans le Sanctuaire des pèlerins cherchait à se venger de son géniteur, ou s'il espérait simplement répandre son pollen partout où il en avait l'occasion. Une chose est sûre, il a décidé de suivre les aventuriers qui se sont risqués sur la voie du pèlerinage.
#. column 0: Summon forth your ornamental shrublet. Seeks either revenge or proliferation or both on its way to a new land.
#. column 2: Only the most fearsome<br>bits of shrubbery get given<br>elite mark status.<br>   - Aytienne
msgctxt "MountTransient:408:0:1"
msgid "This ambulating plant appears to be an offshoot of the ornamental shrubs you encountered along Pilgrim's Traverse. Though it is unclear whether it desires revenge for its fallen parents or simply wishes to sow its seeds in faraway lands, it has seemingly decided to follow you."
msgstr "Это подвижное растение, похоже, отпрыск декоративных кустов, которых вы встретили на Пути пилигрима. Неизвестно, хочет ли оно отомстить за погибших родителей или просто рассеять семена в далёких краях, но, судя по всему, оно решило следовать за вами."

#. ja: モサモサ……
#. de: Sieh dir nur diese prächtigen Blüten an! Es ist, als möchte diese Pflanze die Königin des Gartens werden.<br><i>Meteion</i>
#. fr: Msah msah...
#. column 0: Summon forth your ornamental shrublet. Seeks either revenge or proliferation or both on its way to a new land.
#. column 1: This ambulating plant appears to be an offshoot of the ornamental shrubs you encountered along Pilgrim's Traverse. Though it is unclear whether it desires revenge for its fallen parents or simply wishes to sow its seeds in faraway lands, it has seemingly decided to follow you.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:408:0:2"
msgid "Only the most fearsome<br>bits of shrubbery get given<br>elite mark status.<br>   - Aytienne"
msgstr "Лишь самые грозные<br>кусты получают<br>статус элитной метки.<br>   — Этьен"

#. ja: スペースリフキンに騎乗する。<br>異星環境への適応実験に参加していたリフキン
#. de: Rufe deinen Weltall-Blättrich herbei. Er hat sich perfekt an das Leben zwischen den Sternen angepasst.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture sangfeuille stellaire, une créature expérimentale capable de s'adapter à d'autres planètes.
#. column 1: This leafkin was a subject in adaptability testing for life-forms native to Etheirys. To the amazement of initiative researchers, the environs of Auxesia appear to highly agree with it, and it not only grew so large as to be able to carry a rider, but developed the ability to fly besides.
#. column 2: Maybe we should take<br>a leaf out of their book?<br>   - Refinery Engineer
msgctxt "MountTransient:409:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your interstellar leafkin, and ride it boldly where no leafkin has gone before."
msgstr "Призовите межзвёздного семякина и смело отправляйтесь туда, где ещё не бывал ни один семякин."

#. ja: 異星環境への適応実験に参加していたリフキン。故郷から遠く離れた惑星アウクセシアに連れてこられたものの、その環境が合っていたのか記録的に大きく成長。ついには、人を乗せて浮かぶことさえできるようになった
#. de: Auch weit fernab seiner eigentlichen Heimat scheint sich dieser Blättrich prächtig wohlzufühlen. Vielleicht etwas zu wohl, denn sein Wachstum auf Auxesia kennt keine Grenzen. So hat er inzwischen derart gewaltige Ausmaße erreicht, dass er dich mit Leichtigkeit durch die Lüfte transportiert.
#. fr: Ce sangfeuille a participé à des expériences scien<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ques afin de mesurer sa résistance à un environnement extraterrestre hostile. Une fois arrivé sur la planète Auxesia, il a connu une croissance surprenante qui l'a rendu capable de porter des personnes et de flotter où bon lui semble.
#. column 0: Summon forth your interstellar leafkin, and ride it boldly where no leafkin has gone before.
#. column 2: Maybe we should take<br>a leaf out of their book?<br>   - Refinery Engineer
msgctxt "MountTransient:409:0:1"
msgid "This leafkin was a subject in adaptability testing for life-forms native to Etheirys. To the amazement of initiative researchers, the environs of Auxesia appear to highly agree with it, and it not only grew so large as to be able to carry a rider, but developed the ability to fly besides."
msgstr "Этот семякин участвовал в испытаниях на приспособляемость существ, родившихся на Эорзее. К удивлению исследователей проекта, условия на планете Ауксезия пришлись ему по душе: он вырос до таких размеров, что может нести на себе всадника, и вдобавок научился летать."

#. ja: ふ～り～！
#. de: Dann ist die Zukunft ab jetzt wieder ein unbeschriebenes Blatt.<br><i>Cid</i>
#. fr: Liiibreee<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your interstellar leafkin, and ride it boldly where no leafkin has gone before.
#. column 1: This leafkin was a subject in adaptability testing for life-forms native to Etheirys. To the amazement of initiative researchers, the environs of Auxesia appear to highly agree with it, and it not only grew so large as to be able to carry a rider, but developed the ability to fly besides.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:409:0:2"
msgid "Maybe we should take<br>a leaf out of their book?<br>   - Refinery Engineer"
msgstr "Может, и нам стоит<br>взять с них пример?<br>   — Инженер перерабатывающего завода"

#. ja: ダイナマイトに騎乗する。<br>ある女商人に祝福された呪具綱の魔物
#. de: Rufe deinen Dynamit als Reittier herbei. Stubenrein wie es ist, sollte dieses Exemplar kein Versicherungsrisiko darstellen. <i>Sollte</i><nbsp>...
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture dynamite, une créature magique ayant reçu la bénédiction d'une certaine marchande.
#. column 1: A variety of fiend that is brought to life when an inanimate rock is imbued with aether. Due to the possibility that it harbors precious stones, this specimen was acquired by Rowena and entrusted to the care of Khloe Aliapoh. As a result, it has become so familiar with people that it is willing to carry a rider.
#. column 2: Oh, d-dear... A swarm of dynamite<br>has drifted inside the burrow!<br>   - Warringway
msgctxt "MountTransient:411:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your dynamite, a soulkin favored of the merchant Rowena. House-trained and should therefore not explode in a fiery conflagration."
msgstr "Призовите свой динамит — любимца торговки Ровены. Приучен к дому, а значит, не должен взрываться с огненным фейерверком."

#. ja: 岩石にエーテルが宿って生まれた呪具綱の魔物。希少な宝石を含有している可能性があるため、商人「ロウェナ」が購入し、クロ・アリアポーに世話を任せていた。その結果、人に懐いて背に乗せるほどになったのだという
#. de: Ein magisches Wesen, das entsteht, wenn man Steine mit Äther durchdringt. Rowena erwarb dieses Exemplar in der Hoffnung, dass es wertvolle Schätze beherbergen könnte. Seitdem kümmert sich Khloe Aliapoh mit äußerster Sorgfalt um sein Wohlbefinden, weshalb es sich anfassen und sogar reiten lässt<nbsp>- ohne zu explodieren!
#. fr: Cette créature magique n'est rien d'autre qu'un rocher ayant pris vie par imprégnation d'éther. Certaines d'entre elles recèlent parfois des joyaux rares, c'est pourquoi Rowena a fait l'acquisition de celle-ci, avant de la laisser aux bons soins de Khloe Aliapoh. Ce spécimen s'est habitué au contact avec les humains, si bien qu'il les laisse volontiers monter sur son dos.
#. column 0: Summon forth your dynamite, a soulkin favored of the merchant Rowena. House-trained and should therefore not explode in a fiery conflagration.
#. column 2: Oh, d-dear... A swarm of dynamite<br>has drifted inside the burrow!<br>   - Warringway
msgctxt "MountTransient:411:0:1"
msgid "A variety of fiend that is brought to life when an inanimate rock is imbued with aether. Due to the possibility that it harbors precious stones, this specimen was acquired by Rowena and entrusted to the care of Khloe Aliapoh. As a result, it has become so familiar with people that it is willing to carry a rider."
msgstr "Этот вид чудовищ появляется, когда эфир вселяется в обычный камень. Ровена купила этот экземпляр, надеясь, что в нём найдутся драгоценности, и поручила заботу о нём Хлое Алиапо. Камень привык к людям и теперь готов возить их на спине."

#. ja: ゴロゴロ
#. de: Die Dynamits haben es irgendwie geschafft, von draußen hereinzukommen!<br><i>Warringway</i>
#. fr: Roul roul...
#. column 0: Summon forth your dynamite, a soulkin favored of the merchant Rowena. House-trained and should therefore not explode in a fiery conflagration.
#. column 1: A variety of fiend that is brought to life when an inanimate rock is imbued with aether. Due to the possibility that it harbors precious stones, this specimen was acquired by Rowena and entrusted to the care of Khloe Aliapoh. As a result, it has become so familiar with people that it is willing to carry a rider.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:411:0:2"
msgid "Oh, d-dear... A swarm of dynamite<br>has drifted inside the burrow!<br>   - Warringway"
msgstr "Ой-ой... В нору пробрался<br>целый рой динамитов!<br>   — Уоррингвей"

#. ja: ランプの精に騎乗する。<br>ランプに宿った使い魔。あまり願い事は叶えてくれない
#. de: Rufe deinen Geist aus der Lampe herbei. Nicht zu verwechseln mit dem Geist aus Legenden, weshalb er keine Wünsche erfüllen kann. Es sei denn, du möchtest irgendwo hingebracht werden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture esprit de la lampe, un être magique qui vit dans une vieille lampe à huile. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, il n'exauce pas les souhaits.
#. column 1: In the region of Corvos, there exists a legend of a lamp-dwelling spirit that grants wishes to its master. As this particular entity is an imitation later brought forth by a sorcerer, it is far from the omnipotent being described in tales, but in accordance with its creator's design, it will dutifully carry you wherever you wish to go.
#. column 2: What child wouldn't have<br>wanted a friend like that?<br>   - Beruru
msgctxt "MountTransient:412:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your genie of the lamp. Not the actual being of legend so cannot grant wishes─unless your wish is to be carried somewhere."
msgstr "Призовите джинна из лампы. Это не легендарный дух, так что желаний он не исполняет — разве что желание куда-нибудь вас отвезти."

#. ja: ランプに宿った使い魔。コルヴォ地方には、所有者の願いを叶えるランプの精の伝承があるが、これは後代の魔道士が再現した品に過ぎず、決して万能ではない。刻まれた術式に従い、主を望む場所に運ぶという指令に愚直に応え続けている
#. de: In Corvos kursiert die Legende von einem Lampengeist, der seinem Herrn alle Wünsche erfüllt. Da es sich bei diesem Exemplar hier um eine von einem Zauberer erschaffene Imitation handelt, ist es bei weitem nicht so mächtig wie sein Vorbild aus den Geschichten, aber es bringt dich gerne überall hin, wo du möchtest.
#. fr: Un esprit magique qui vit dans une ancienne lampe à huile. Selon une vieille légende corvosienne, il pourrait exaucer les vœux de son pro<shy>prié<shy>taire... Mais celui-ci n'est qu'une reproduction moderne réalisée par un mage et ne dispose d'aucun pouvoir aussi grandiose. Il a en revanche été enchanté pour transporter son possesseur où il le souhaite, et c'est déjà pas mal.
#. column 0: Summon forth your genie of the lamp. Not the actual being of legend so cannot grant wishes─unless your wish is to be carried somewhere.
#. column 2: What child wouldn't have<br>wanted a friend like that?<br>   - Beruru
msgctxt "MountTransient:412:0:1"
msgid "In the region of Corvos, there exists a legend of a lamp-dwelling spirit that grants wishes to its master. As this particular entity is an imitation later brought forth by a sorcerer, it is far from the omnipotent being described in tales, but in accordance with its creator's design, it will dutifully carry you wherever you wish to go."
msgstr "В Корвосе существует легенда о духе, живущем в лампе и исполняющем желания хозяина. Но этот дух — лишь поздняя копия, созданная чародеем, и до всемогущества легендарного существа ему далеко. Зато он исправно выполняет волю создателя и доставляет вас куда угодно."

#. ja: ドチラヘ、マイリマショウ
#. de: Welches Kind hätte nicht gerne einen solchen Freund?<br><i>Beruru</i>
#. fr: Où souhaitez-vous aller, maître ?
#. column 0: Summon forth your genie of the lamp. Not the actual being of legend so cannot grant wishes─unless your wish is to be carried somewhere.
#. column 1: In the region of Corvos, there exists a legend of a lamp-dwelling spirit that grants wishes to its master. As this particular entity is an imitation later brought forth by a sorcerer, it is far from the omnipotent being described in tales, but in accordance with its creator's design, it will dutifully carry you wherever you wish to go.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:412:0:2"
msgid "What child wouldn't have<br>wanted a friend like that?<br>   - Beruru"
msgstr "Какой ребёнок не мечтал<br>о таком друге?<br>   — Беруру"

#. ja: ローライダーT1に騎乗する。<br>往年の名車をカスタムしたザ・タイラントの愛車
#. de: Steige in deinen Lowrider T1RANN ein. <i>Die</i> Karosse für wahre Herrscher der Straße.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Lowrider T1, une voiture modifiée et au style résolument rétro qu'affectionne The Tyrant.
#. column 1: This vintage vehicle manufactured in Lindblum once belonged to the president of the Arcadion, who had inherited it from his forebears. It was comprehensively modified with cutting-edge technology for the Tyrant's use, and boasts enhanced flight capabilities as well as the latest comforts, the better to lord it over the peasants.
#. column 2: Not bad for an antique...<br>   - Vitus quo Messalla
msgctxt "MountTransient:413:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your Lowrider T1RANT, and rule the roads with an iron fist (around the custom leather-bound steering wheel)."
msgstr "Вызывайте на подмогу лоурайдер T1RANT и властвуйте на дорогах железной рукой — сжимая кожаный руль, обтянутый на заказ."

#. ja: リンドブルム製の旧型浮行機。アルカディアのオーナーが、先祖から受け継いだ往年の名車を、ザ・タイラントの演出に用いるためにカスタムしたもの。最新技術により、飛行性能からラグジュアリーな内装まで完璧に改造されている
#. de: Dieses Fahrzeug ist ein wahrer Klassiker aus dem alten Lindblum und gehörte einst dem Präsidenten des Arkadion, der es wiederum als Erbstück erhalten hatte. Seitdem der Tyrann es fährt, wurde es mit vielerlei technischen Feinheiten ausgestattet, unter anderem einer Flugfunktion<nbsp>- um das einfache Volk spüren zu lassen, wer über sie herrscht (fliegt).
#. fr: Cette voiture vintage, fabriquée à l'origine à Lindblum, s'est transmise au sein de la famille du pro<shy>prié<shy>taire de l'Arcadion. Celui-ci l'a modifiée pour les besoins de mise en scène de The Tyrant, y ajoutant une fonction de vol et transformant l'intérieur en un modèle de confort et de luxe.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Lowrider T1RANT, and rule the roads with an iron fist (around the custom leather-bound steering wheel).
#. column 2: Not bad for an antique...<br>   - Vitus quo Messalla
msgctxt "MountTransient:413:0:1"
msgid "This vintage vehicle manufactured in Lindblum once belonged to the president of the Arcadion, who had inherited it from his forebears. It was comprehensively modified with cutting-edge technology for the Tyrant's use, and boasts enhanced flight capabilities as well as the latest comforts, the better to lord it over the peasants."
msgstr "Этот старинный автомобиль, выпущенный в Линдблюме, прежде принадлежал президенту Аркадиона, унаследовавшему его от предков. Для Тирана машину основательно переделали, оснастив новейшими технологиями: улучшили лётные характеристики и добавили все современные удобства. Чтобы он мог свысока смотреть на простолюдинов."

#. ja: ブルォォォォォン！
#. de: Ach, sei doch nicht so altbacken.<br><i>Lewin</i>
#. fr: Vrrrouuuuum !
#. column 0: Call into battle your Lowrider T1RANT, and rule the roads with an iron fist (around the custom leather-bound steering wheel).
#. column 1: This vintage vehicle manufactured in Lindblum once belonged to the president of the Arcadion, who had inherited it from his forebears. It was comprehensively modified with cutting-edge technology for the Tyrant's use, and boasts enhanced flight capabilities as well as the latest comforts, the better to lord it over the peasants.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:413:0:2"
msgid "Not bad for an antique...<br>   - Vitus quo Messalla"
msgstr "Неплохо для старушки...<br>   — Вит Кво Мессалла"

#. ja: ウォロンに騎乗する。<br>主にヨカ・トラルの森林地帯で見られる、樹木を愛する巨獣
#. de: Rufe deinen Uolon als Reittier herbei. Eine riesige Bestie, die sich mit einem noch riesigeren Grinsen um den Wald kümmert.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture uolon, un grand monstre amateur de verdure que l'on rencontre prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment dans les régions forestières du Yok Tural.
#. column 1: This enormous beastkin native to the temperate forests of eastern Yok Tural is believed to be closely related to trolls and yetis. Possessed of exceptional intelligence, it has been observed accelerating plant growth by way of peculiar dances and aetheric emissions, a behavior that has earned it the attention of scholars.
#. column 2: I'd have to recommend<br>an uolon bristle hairbrush.<br>   - Vapli
msgctxt "MountTransient:414:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your uolon, a great big beast that tends the forest with a great big grin."
msgstr "Призовите уолона — огромного зверя, который заботится о лесе с широченной улыбкой."

#. ja: 主にヨカ・トラル東部など温暖な森林地帯に分布する巨獣。博物学的にはトロルやイエティの近縁種と見られ、それなりに知能も高い。奇妙な踊りと魔力放出で植物を急速に成長させたとの報告もあり、今後の研究が待たれるところである
#. de: Dieser sanfte Gigant der östlichen Waldgebiete Yok Turals wird allgemein als eine verwandte Art der Trolle und Yetis angesehen. Besonders Naturkundler tendieren dazu, von Uolons fasziniert zu sein, verfügen sie doch über einen ausgesprochenen Intellekt, welcher sich zum Beispiel in ihren kreativen Tänzen beobachten lässt, mit denen sie das Wachstum von Pflanzen beschleunigen.
#. fr: Cette créature imposante vit prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment dans les régions forestières tempérées de l'est du Yok Tural. Il se rapproche du troll ou du yéti sur le plan biologique, et dispose d'un intellect assez développé. Certains rapports ont souligné sa capacité à faire pousser les végétaux très rapidement grâce à une danse étrange<nbsp>; des recherches sur ce phénomène énigmatique sont en cours.
#. column 0: Summon forth your uolon, a great big beast that tends the forest with a great big grin.
#. column 2: I'd have to recommend<br>an uolon bristle hairbrush.<br>   - Vapli
msgctxt "MountTransient:414:0:1"
msgid "This enormous beastkin native to the temperate forests of eastern Yok Tural is believed to be closely related to trolls and yetis. Possessed of exceptional intelligence, it has been observed accelerating plant growth by way of peculiar dances and aetheric emissions, a behavior that has earned it the attention of scholars."
msgstr "Этот огромный зверолюд обитает в умеренных лесах восточного Йок Турала. Считается, что он близок к троллям и йети. Уолоны обладают выдающимся интеллектом; наблюдателям даже доводилось видеть, как они ускоряют рост растений причудливыми танцами и выбросами эфира. Это поведение привлекло внимание учёных."

#. ja: ウォロロロン！
#. de: Ich würde dir eine Uolonhaarbürste ans Herz legen, ja ja.<br><i>Vapli</i>
#. fr: Uololon<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your uolon, a great big beast that tends the forest with a great big grin.
#. column 1: This enormous beastkin native to the temperate forests of eastern Yok Tural is believed to be closely related to trolls and yetis. Possessed of exceptional intelligence, it has been observed accelerating plant growth by way of peculiar dances and aetheric emissions, a behavior that has earned it the attention of scholars.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:414:0:2"
msgid "I'd have to recommend<br>an uolon bristle hairbrush.<br>   - Vapli"
msgstr "Советую щётку для волос из щетины уолона.<br>   — Вапли"

#. ja: 局地用パワーローダーに騎乗する。<br>惑星オイジュス用に調整されたパワーローダー
#. de: Steige in deinen Sternenläufer Mk-O ein. <i>Der</i> Sternenläufer auf Oizys.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mécano cosmique localisé, une machine adaptée aux activités de l'exploration cosmique sur Oizys.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this construction machina was developed to handle the gravitational anomalies that rack Oizys. On account of its considerable bulk, along with its somewhat unwieldy model name, many initiative members have taken to fondly referring to it by the epithet “Big Boy.”
#. column 2: I'm the pilot, not you!<br>   - Rex
msgctxt "MountTransient:415:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your volatile gravity vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina."
msgstr "Призовите свой скафандр с гравитационным вакуумным приводом и осуществите мечту — пилотируйте футуристическую двуногую махину."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた作業用重機。惑星オイジュスの特殊な環境向けに開発されたモデルであり、正式な呼称は別にあるのだが、その大柄な印象から多くの作業員は「ファッティ」という愛称で呼ぶらしい
#. de: Dieser Sternenläufer wurde speziell für Einsätze auf Oizys hergestellt. Seine ver<shy>gleichs<shy>we<shy>ise große Statur hat ihm unter den Mechanikern der Erkundung den Spitznamen „Diggi“ eingebracht.
#. fr: Une machine conçue pour effectuer certaines tâches au sein du projet d'exploration cosmique, ce modèle-ci étant adapté aux conditions environnementales par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>res d'Oizys. Son armature épaisse lui vaut le surnom de “gros patapouf” de la part de nombreux ouvriers.
#. column 0: Summon forth your volatile gravity vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 2: I'm the pilot, not you!<br>   - Rex
msgctxt "MountTransient:415:0:1"
msgid "Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this construction machina was developed to handle the gravitational anomalies that rack Oizys. On account of its considerable bulk, along with its somewhat unwieldy model name, many initiative members have taken to fondly referring to it by the epithet “Big Boy.”"
msgstr "Эту строительную махину создали для программы космических исследований и приспособили к гравитационным аномалиям Ойзиса. Из-за внушительных размеров и громоздкого названия модели участники программы ласково прозвали её „Большим парнем“."

#. ja: ガゴン、ガゴン…
#. de: Ein ungewöhnliches Exemplar.<br><i>G'raha Tia</i>
#. fr: Clonk, clonk...
#. column 0: Summon forth your volatile gravity vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this construction machina was developed to handle the gravitational anomalies that rack Oizys. On account of its considerable bulk, along with its somewhat unwieldy model name, many initiative members have taken to fondly referring to it by the epithet “Big Boy.”
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:415:0:2"
msgid "I'm the pilot, not you!<br>   - Rex"
msgstr "Я пилот, а не ты!<br>   — Рекс"

#. ja: コスモ・アームドウェポンに騎乗する。<br>惑星探索用に調整した多脚型魔導兵器
#. de: Steige in deine Kosmo-Panzerwaffe ein. Eine alte Magitek-Kriegsmaschine aus Garlemald, die für die Kosmo-Erkundung angepasst worden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture arme blindée cosmique, une arme magitek disposant de multiples pattes et utilisée au sein du projet d'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: This imperial warmachina has been adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Its low stance and arachnoid legs combine to provide exceptional stability, allowing it to perform tasks with aplomb on Oizys, a planet where gravitational anomalies are a regularity.
#. column 2: Be sure you're properly armed and<br>armored before beginning your task.<br>   - Nahctahr
msgctxt "MountTransient:416:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your cosmic armored weapon, a deadly imperial warmachina-turned-handy (leggy?) exploration vehicle."
msgstr "Призовите космическое бронированное оружие — смертоносную имперскую боевую махину, переделанную в удобный (и многоногий) вездеход для исследований."

#. ja: ガレマール帝国の魔導兵器「アームドウェポン」を、惑星探索用に調整した機体。低い重心と多脚による安定性により、重力異常が起きがちな惑星オイジュスの環境においても一定のパフォーマンスを発揮できる
#. de: Eine Panzerwaffe aus Garlemald, die für die Kosmo-Erkundung zu einem Mecha umfunktioniert wurde. Ihre zahlreichen Beine und der tiefe Schwerpunkt des Kerns stabilisieren die Waffe und machen sie ideal für den Einsatz in Gebieten mit instabiler Schwerkraft.
#. fr: Cette arme magitek conçue à Garlemald a été reconvertie pour les besoins de l'exploration cosmique. Son centre de gravité bas et ses nombreuses pattes lui confèrent une bonne stabilité, ce qui la rend très efficace pour effectuer des tâches sur Oizys, ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment sujette aux anomalies gravitationelles.
#. column 0: Call into battle your cosmic armored weapon, a deadly imperial warmachina-turned-handy (leggy?) exploration vehicle.
#. column 2: Be sure you're properly armed and<br>armored before beginning your task.<br>   - Nahctahr
msgctxt "MountTransient:416:0:1"
msgid "This imperial warmachina has been adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Its low stance and arachnoid legs combine to provide exceptional stability, allowing it to perform tasks with aplomb on Oizys, a planet where gravitational anomalies are a regularity."
msgstr "Эту имперскую боевую махину приспособили для программы космических исследований. Низкий центр тяжести и паучьи ноги обеспечивают ей исключительную устойчивость — она без труда справляется с работой на Ойзисе, где гравитационные аномалии не редкость."

#. ja: ゴウゥゥゥン…
#. de: Nächste Mal wird vorstellen Neuewaffe!<br><i>Brayflox</i>
#. fr: Bwooooom...
#. column 0: Call into battle your cosmic armored weapon, a deadly imperial warmachina-turned-handy (leggy?) exploration vehicle.
#. column 1: This imperial warmachina has been adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Its low stance and arachnoid legs combine to provide exceptional stability, allowing it to perform tasks with aplomb on Oizys, a planet where gravitational anomalies are a regularity.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:416:0:2"
msgid "Be sure you're properly armed and<br>armored before beginning your task.<br>   - Nahctahr"
msgstr "Перед началом работы убедитесь, что вы как следует вооружены и<br>экипированы.<br>   — Нахтахр"

#. ja: モーグリフロートに騎乗する。<br>紅蓮祭の来場客のために作られたフロート
#. de: Rufe dein Mogry-Schlauchboot herbei. Mit diesem Boot lassen sich sommerliche Spritztouren auf den Wellen alter Be<shy>kannt<shy>schaften unternehmen.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture caravane flottante mog, un matelas gonflable créé à l'occasion des Feux de la Mort.
#. column 1: Created for the Moonfire Faire, the inflatable mograft was originally a simple device for lounging on the water. When an incident occurred which saw riders swept out to sea, however, it was decided that the units would be fitted with wind crystals, that festival-goers may fly to safety in the event of an emergency.
#. column 2: All kinds of things come<br>floating in on the waves.<br>   - Zukin
msgctxt "MountTransient:417:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your inflatable mograft, a flotation device designed with both relaxation and safety in mind."
msgstr "Призовите надувной мографт — плавсредство для отдыха и безопасного времяпрепровождения."

#. ja: 紅蓮祭用の特製フロート。当初はただ水辺に浮かべるだけの存在だったが、離岸流によって流される事故が発生。内部に高純度の風属性クリスタルを組み込むことにより、魔力操作によって浮行可能なよう改良された
#. de: Dieses speziell für den Feuermond-Reigen angefertigte Bötchen war ursprünglich einfache, aufblasbare Unterhaltung für alle Freunde des Sommers. Nachdem aber mehrmals Passagiere bis weit hinaus aufs Meer getrieben worden waren, wurden Windkristalle verbaut, um die Sicherheit aller Sonnenanbeter zu gewährleisten, die in ihm Platz nehmen.
#. fr: À l'origine, cette caravane flottante ne devait servir qu'à se prélasser sur l'eau, en se laissant bercer par les vagues. Mais lorsqu'un incident l'emporta au large, de puissants cristaux de vent furent installés afin de pouvoir ramener le matelas en lieu sûr.
#. column 0: Summon forth your inflatable mograft, a flotation device designed with both relaxation and safety in mind.
#. column 2: All kinds of things come<br>floating in on the waves.<br>   - Zukin
msgctxt "MountTransient:417:0:1"
msgid "Created for the Moonfire Faire, the inflatable mograft was originally a simple device for lounging on the water. When an incident occurred which saw riders swept out to sea, however, it was decided that the units would be fitted with wind crystals, that festival-goers may fly to safety in the event of an emergency."
msgstr "Надувной мографт создали для Праздника Огненного месяца. Поначалу это было простое средство для отдыха на воде, но однажды его пассажиров унесло в открытое море. После этого в каждый мографт встроили кристаллы ветра, чтобы в случае опасности гуляющие могли взлететь в безопасное место."

#. ja: ぷかぷか…
#. de: Die Mädels und Jungs der Wellenläufer passen auf, dass nichts passiert.<br><i>Ethelia</i>
#. fr: Plotch, plotch...
#. column 0: Summon forth your inflatable mograft, a flotation device designed with both relaxation and safety in mind.
#. column 1: Created for the Moonfire Faire, the inflatable mograft was originally a simple device for lounging on the water. When an incident occurred which saw riders swept out to sea, however, it was decided that the units would be fitted with wind crystals, that festival-goers may fly to safety in the event of an emergency.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:417:0:2"
msgid "All kinds of things come<br>floating in on the waves.<br>   - Zukin"
msgstr "Чего только не приносит<br>на волнах!<br>   — Дзюкин"

#. ja: スターライトスレイに騎乗する。<br>星芒祭で作られた大型のソリ。トナカイ付き
#. de: Rufe deinen Sternenlicht-Schlitten herbei. Komplett mit einem Rentier, das dich in festliche Stimmung versetzt.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture traîneau des étoiles, renne inclus, évidemment<nbsp>!
#. column 1: Created for the Starlight Celebration by Gridanian volunteers, this reindeer-drawn sleigh bears the children's touches in the decorative details and more. Ringing the equipped handbell serves not only to brighten spirits, but also unleashes a swirl of twinkling stars to bless all nearby.
#. column 2: Isn't it the best sleigh<br>you've ever seen?<br>   - Aitken
msgctxt "MountTransient:419:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Starlight sleigh. Comes complete with a reindeer to draw you forth in festive cheer."
msgstr "Призовите звёздные сани. Олень в комплекте — для праздничного настроения!"

#. ja: 星芒祭のため、グリダニアの有志が協力して作り上げた大型ソリ。飾り付けをはじめ、細部に子どもたちの一生懸命な仕事ぶりがうかがえる。ベルを鳴らせば気分は上々、星屑の煌めきが聖人の従者を祝福するだろう
#. de: Dieser von Freiwilligen aus Gridania für das Sternenlichtfest gebaute Rentierschlitten trägt die liebevolle Handschrift der Kinder in den dekorativen Details. Das Läuten der angebrachten Handglocke erhellt nicht nur die Stimmung, sondern entfesselt auch einen funkelnden Sternenstaub, der alle in der Nähe segnet.
#. fr: Ce grand traîneau a été fabriqué à Gridania pour la fête des étoiles. On peut remarquer d'un coup d'œil que les décorations ont été confiées à un groupe d'enfants ayant laissé libre cours à leur créativité. Sonnez donc sa clochette pour propager la joie et devenez vous aussi disciple du saint.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Starlight sleigh. Comes complete with a reindeer to draw you forth in festive cheer.
#. column 2: Isn't it the best sleigh<br>you've ever seen?<br>   - Aitken
msgctxt "MountTransient:419:0:1"
msgid "Created for the Starlight Celebration by Gridanian volunteers, this reindeer-drawn sleigh bears the children's touches in the decorative details and more. Ringing the equipped handbell serves not only to brighten spirits, but also unleashes a swirl of twinkling stars to bless all nearby."
msgstr "Эти сани, запряжённые оленем, сделали добровольцы из Гридании к Звёздному празднику. Дети украсили их с большой любовью, и это видно в каждой мелочи. Звон колокольчика поднимает настроение и осыпает всех вокруг мерцающими звёздами."

#. ja: シャンシャンシャン…
#. de: Ist das nicht der beste Schlitten, den du je gesehen hast?<br><i>Aitken</i>
#. fr: Drelin, drelin...
#. column 0: Summon forth your Starlight sleigh. Comes complete with a reindeer to draw you forth in festive cheer.
#. column 1: Created for the Starlight Celebration by Gridanian volunteers, this reindeer-drawn sleigh bears the children's touches in the decorative details and more. Ringing the equipped handbell serves not only to brighten spirits, but also unleashes a swirl of twinkling stars to bless all nearby.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:419:0:2"
msgid "Isn't it the best sleigh<br>you've ever seen?<br>   - Aitken"
msgstr "Ну разве это не лучшие сани,<br>которые ты когда-либо видел?<br>   — Эйткен"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・レガシーに騎乗する。<br>白金の翼を持つ伝説の精霊
#. de: Rufe deinen geflügelten Geist herbei. Ein legendäres Wesen, das sich nur den wirklich Erprobten zeigt.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes de l'héritage, dont le plumage argenté appartiendrait à un esprit légendaire.
#. column 1: Tonawawtan legend speaks of a spirit that favors the strong and bestows wings upon those it deems worthy. Having gifted you several arrays of wings, the being has seen fit to grace your shoulders itself in recognition of the unimaginable trials you have overcome.
#. column 2: I have the makings of a new verse<br>that captures Tural's shining legacy!<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
msgctxt "MountTransient:420:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of legacy, a spirit of legend said to favor the strong."
msgstr "Призовите крылья наследия — духа легенд, который, говорят, благоволит сильным."

#. ja: トナワータ族の伝説に謳われる翼の精霊。勇者として見込んだ者に試練を与え、乗り越えた暁には祝福を与えるという。探求の象徴であり、数多の困難を乗り越えた「真の英雄」でなければ、その背に自ら翼を与えることはない
#. de: Eine Legende der Tonawawta handelt von einem Geist, welcher jene, die sich als würdig erweisen, mit Flügeln und Schwingen belohnt. Da du ihn bereits mehrmals von deiner Stärke überzeugt hast, ist es nun der geflügelte Geist selbst, der dich als ultimative Anerkennung deiner Mühen fortan gen Himmel tragen will.
#. fr: Les légendes tonawawta décrivent un esprit à la recherche d'un parangon de l'héroïsme digne de recevoir ces ailes, à condition de surmonter les multiples épreuves qui lui sont imposées.
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of legacy, a spirit of legend said to favor the strong.
#. column 2: I have the makings of a new verse<br>that captures Tural's shining legacy!<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel
msgctxt "MountTransient:420:0:1"
msgid "Tonawawtan legend speaks of a spirit that favors the strong and bestows wings upon those it deems worthy. Having gifted you several arrays of wings, the being has seen fit to grace your shoulders itself in recognition of the unimaginable trials you have overcome."
msgstr "Легенды Тонаваты рассказывают о духе, который благоволит сильным и дарует крылья достойным. Он уже не раз одаривал вас крыльями, а теперь и сам решил украсить ваши плечи — в знак признания невероятных испытаний, которые вы преодолели."

#. ja: バッサバッサ…
#. de: Das güldene Erbe, das über Tural erstrahlt ...<br><i>Fahrender Sänger</i>
#. fr: Flap, flap...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of legacy, a spirit of legend said to favor the strong.
#. column 1: Tonawawtan legend speaks of a spirit that favors the strong and bestows wings upon those it deems worthy. Having gifted you several arrays of wings, the being has seen fit to grace your shoulders itself in recognition of the unimaginable trials you have overcome.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:420:0:2"
msgid "I have the makings of a new verse<br>that captures Tural's shining legacy!<br>   - The Wandering Minstrel"
msgstr "Уже складывается новый куплет,<br>что воспоёт блистательное наследие Турала!<br>   — Странствующий менестрель"

#. ja: ハーディ＝デイトナに騎乗する。<br>怪物的な馬力を誇る戦闘バイク
#. de: Rufe deine Hardy-Daytona herbei, ein die vierte Wand durchbrechendes Schlachtenmotorrad, auf dem du dich fühlen wirst wie in einem Minispiel.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Hardy-Daytona, une moto de combat au moteur surpuissant.
#. column 1: Designed for battle, the Hardy-Daytona is propelled by a V-type double overhead camshaft engine that produces so much power, it is regarded as a monster of a machine that chooses its rider. Rumor holds it was developed by the weapons division of a mega-corporation, but the truth of its origin cannot be verified.
#. column 2: Try catching us now, ya bastards!<br>   - Burly Man
msgctxt "MountTransient:421:0:0"
msgid "Call into battle your Hardy-Daytona, a lore-bending battlebike that will have you feeling as though you were playing a mini-game."
msgstr "Призовите Харди-Дайтону — боевой мотоцикл, что ломает привычные представления и подарит ощущение, будто вы играете в мини-игру."

#. ja: 怪物的な馬力を誇る戦闘バイク。搭載されたV型DOHエンジンの出力の高さゆえ、乗り手を選ぶモンスターマシンと言われている。一説では、とある大企業の兵器部門が開発したとも伝わるが詳細な来歴は不明
#. de: Für den Kampf konzipiert, wird die Hardy-Daytona von einem V-Motor mit obenliegender Nockenwelle angetrieben, der unglaublich leistungsstark ist. Das Motorrad gilt als Monster, das sich seinen Fahrer selbst aussucht. Gerüchten zufolge soll es von der Abteilung für Waffenentwicklung eines großen Konzerns entwickelt worden sein. Ob das wirklich stimmt, kann allerdings niemand sagen.
#. fr: Cette moto emblématique peut se targuer d'un nombre de chevaux im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nant. La puissance de son moteur en V avec double arbre à cames en fait une machine hors du commun<nbsp>; on dit même qu'elle choisit son pilote, et non l'inverse. Selon une théorie, elle aurait été conçue au sein du département d'armement d'un grand conglomérat industriel, mais nul n'en connaît les détails.
#. column 0: Call into battle your Hardy-Daytona, a lore-bending battlebike that will have you feeling as though you were playing a mini-game.
#. column 2: Try catching us now, ya bastards!<br>   - Burly Man
msgctxt "MountTransient:421:0:1"
msgid "Designed for battle, the Hardy-Daytona is propelled by a V-type double overhead camshaft engine that produces so much power, it is regarded as a monster of a machine that chooses its rider. Rumor holds it was developed by the weapons division of a mega-corporation, but the truth of its origin cannot be verified."
msgstr "Харди-Дайтона создана для боя. Её двигатель V-типа с верхним расположением двух распредвалов настолько мощный, что этот мотоцикл-монстр сам выбирает себе наездника. Говорят, его разработал отдел вооружений одной мегакорпорации, но подтвердить это не удалось."

#. ja: ハーディ！
#. de: Hier könnt ihr uns nicht verfolgen!<br><i>Stämmiger Kerl</i>
#. fr: Hardy<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into battle your Hardy-Daytona, a lore-bending battlebike that will have you feeling as though you were playing a mini-game.
#. column 1: Designed for battle, the Hardy-Daytona is propelled by a V-type double overhead camshaft engine that produces so much power, it is regarded as a monster of a machine that chooses its rider. Rumor holds it was developed by the weapons division of a mega-corporation, but the truth of its origin cannot be verified.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:421:0:2"
msgid "Try catching us now, ya bastards!<br>   - Burly Man"
msgstr "А ну-ка, попробуйте нас догнать, ублюдки!<br>   — Дюжий мужчина"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・ミストに騎乗する。<br>鉄馬車線路で発見された魔法の翼
#. de: Rufe deine Flügel des Nebels als Reittier herbei. Magische Schwingen, die aus dem Wrack des Doomtrains geborgen wurden.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes de brume, découvertes par hasard sur la Voie ferroviaire.
#. column 1: Found along the railroad tracks near Treno, these eldritch wings are reminiscent of the Doomtrain, the monstrous locomotive that had sped nonstop across the Mist Continent for long years. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the steely resolve of one who walks levin-ravaged wastes.
#. column 2: It's a veritable calamity on rails.<br>   - Eyaney
msgctxt "MountTransient:422:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of mist. Their eldritch aura exudes an unstoppable resolve."
msgstr "Призовите крылья тумана. От их жуткой ауры веет несгибаемой волей."

#. ja: 鉄馬車線路で発見された魔法の翼。装甲と漂う霧はどこかグラシャラボラスを思わせるが、その来歴は謎に包まれている。いずれにせよ、この翼を授かりし者は雷降り注ぐ荒野を駆け続ける「鉄の意志」をも身に纏うことだろう
#. de: Diese magischen Flügel hüllen dich einerseits in furchterregende Panzerung, andererseits in phantomartigen Nebel. Sie erinnern stark an die Schreckgestalt des Doomtrains und verleihen ihren Trägern möglicherweise dieselbe, rasante Zer<shy>störungs<shy>kraft.
#. fr: Ces ailes magiques ont été découvertes à l'issue du combat contre Glasya-Labolas. La brume qui enveloppe leur armature rappelle ce dernier, mais leur origine reste nimbée de mystère. Une chose est sûre néanmoins<nbsp>: celui qui les porte hérite de l'esprit fou du train blindé qui parcourt les plaines foudroyées.
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of mist. Their eldritch aura exudes an unstoppable resolve.
#. column 2: It's a veritable calamity on rails.<br>   - Eyaney
msgctxt "MountTransient:422:0:1"
msgid "Found along the railroad tracks near Treno, these eldritch wings are reminiscent of the Doomtrain, the monstrous locomotive that had sped nonstop across the Mist Continent for long years. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the steely resolve of one who walks levin-ravaged wastes."
msgstr "Эти жуткие крылья нашли возле железной дороги неподалёку от Трено. Они напоминают Поезд рока — чудовищный локомотив, который долгие годы без остановки мчался по Туманному континенту. Их происхождение окутано тайной, но от них веет несгибаемой волей того, кто идёт через пустоши, опустошённые молниями."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Ich spinne nicht ... Ich mach's für Treno.<br><i>Eyaney</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of mist. Their eldritch aura exudes an unstoppable resolve.
#. column 1: Found along the railroad tracks near Treno, these eldritch wings are reminiscent of the Doomtrain, the monstrous locomotive that had sped nonstop across the Mist Continent for long years. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, they exude the steely resolve of one who walks levin-ravaged wastes.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:422:0:2"
msgid "It's a veritable calamity on rails.<br>   - Eyaney"
msgstr "Настоящее бедствие на рельсах.<br>   — Эйни"

#. ja: 量産型パワーローダーに騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画のために開発された量産型作業用重機
#. de: Steige in deinen Sternenläufer Mk-A ein. Das „A“ steht für „abgespeckt“.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mécano cosmique de série, une machine produite en masse pour les besoins de l'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this mass-production model construction machina incorporates innovative engineering to minimize manufacturing cost without sacrificing performance. It primarily serves as a mode of transport for initiative members.
#. column 2: We've gone ahead and licensed<br>the design for mass production.<br>   - Biggs
msgctxt "MountTransient:425:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your rapid-fab vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina."
msgstr "Призовите скоростной вакуумный скафандр и осуществите мечту — пилотируйте футуристическую двуногую махину."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた量産型作業用重機。製造コストを低減させるために数々の工夫が施されているが、性能的には原型機と大差はないレベルに仕上がっている。主に一般作業員の乗機として活躍中
#. de: Ein massenproduziertes und somit kostensparendes Sternenläufer-Modell. Das Projektkomitee der Kosmo-Erkundung hat alle Kosten gescheut, um dieses Modell Wirklichkeit werden zu lassen. Es soll jegliche Funktionen des Originals beinhalten, testen durfte das aber noch niemand<nbsp>... Die herkömmlichen Projektmitarbeiter freuen sich jedenfalls, endlich auch eigene Mechas zu bekommen.
#. fr: Cet engin a été produit en masse pour les besoins du projet d'exploration cosmique. Sa conception a été revue pour diminuer autant que possible son coût de fabrication, sans pour autant sacrifier ses fonctionnalités par rapport au prototype d'origine. Ce modèle est couramment utilisé comme moyen de transport par tous les ouvriers du projet... mais les Loporrites n'ont toujours pas le droit de monter dedans.
#. column 0: Summon forth your rapid-fab vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 2: We've gone ahead and licensed<br>the design for mass production.<br>   - Biggs
msgctxt "MountTransient:425:0:1"
msgid "Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this mass-production model construction machina incorporates innovative engineering to minimize manufacturing cost without sacrificing performance. It primarily serves as a mode of transport for initiative members."
msgstr "Эту строительную махину массового производства создали для программы космических исследований. Благодаря новаторским решениям её производство обходится дешевле, а характеристики остались прежними. В основном участники программы используют её как транспорт."

#. ja: ガチョン、ガチョン…
#. de: Ich mach mich dann sofort an die Massenproduktion, damit auch jeder einen bekommen kann!<br><i>Nonotta</i>
#. fr: Clank, clank...
#. column 0: Summon forth your rapid-fab vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 1: Created for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, this mass-production model construction machina incorporates innovative engineering to minimize manufacturing cost without sacrificing performance. It primarily serves as a mode of transport for initiative members.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:425:0:2"
msgid "We've gone ahead and licensed<br>the design for mass production.<br>   - Biggs"
msgstr "Мы уже получили лицензию<br>на массовое производство.<br>   — Биггс"

#. ja: レッドホイールローダーに騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた赤い作業用重機
#. de: Nimm auf deinem Sternenebner Mk-R Platz. Das „R“ steht für „rot“.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture déblayeuse cosmique rouge, un engin de chantier de couleur rouge créé dans le cadre du projet d'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: The six-wheeled warp loader, tireless workhorse of the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, has been reimagined in spirited red. Although it is identical to the original yellow variant in practically every other way, the new color scheme has proven very popular among the Loporrits.
#. column 2: Warp loaders are simply the best!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
msgctxt "MountTransient:426:0:0"
msgid "Call into action your alert red warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life faster."
msgstr "Призовите ярко-красный колёсный погрузчик Телепортации и с лёгкостью прокладывайте себе путь."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた作業用重機「ホイールローダー」を赤く塗装した機体。六輪駆動と前面のブレードは健在だが、特に性能が向上したわけではない。にもかかわらず、その赤い機体はレポリットに大人気である
#. de: Das neueste Modell des allseits beliebten Sternenebners ist rot<nbsp>- und nicht viel mehr! Der Sechsradantrieb des Gefährts sorgt zwar nach wie vor für stabilen Fahrspaß auf unstetem Gelände, aber das war auch schon beim Standardmodell so. Trotzdem scheinen die Loporrit den Mk-R zum Mümmeln gern zu haben.
#. fr: Il s'agit d'une variante de la déblayeuse cosmique, repeinte en rouge. Elle ne dispose d'aucune particularité par rapport au modèle de base, mais elle peut toujours compter sur ses six roues et sa lame frontale pour faire des ravages. Quoi qu'il en soit, ce nouveau coloris semble avoir beaucoup de succès auprès des Loporrites.
#. column 0: Call into action your alert red warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life faster.
#. column 2: Warp loaders are simply the best!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
msgctxt "MountTransient:426:0:1"
msgid "The six-wheeled warp loader, tireless workhorse of the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, has been reimagined in spirited red. Although it is identical to the original yellow variant in practically every other way, the new color scheme has proven very popular among the Loporrits."
msgstr "Шестиколёсный погрузчик Телепортации — неутомимая рабочая лошадка программы космических исследований — теперь сияет задорным красным цветом. Во всём остальном он почти не отличается от жёлтой модели, но новая расцветка пришлась лопорритам по душе."

#. ja: レッド！！
#. de: Rote Rüben, das muss mein Glückstag sein!<br><i>Growingway</i>
#. fr: Rouuuuge !
#. column 0: Call into action your alert red warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life faster.
#. column 1: The six-wheeled warp loader, tireless workhorse of the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, has been reimagined in spirited red. Although it is identical to the original yellow variant in practically every other way, the new color scheme has proven very popular among the Loporrits.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:426:0:2"
msgid "Warp loaders are simply the best!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member"
msgstr "Погрузчики Телепортации — просто лучшие!<br>   — Участник программы космических исследований"

#. ja: ノーブル・マジックカーペットに騎乗する。<br>コルヴォ地方で織られた、貴人用の空飛ぶ絨毯
#. de: Rufe deinen königlichen fliegenden Teppich herbei und lasse Träume wahr werden.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture tapis magique royal, une carpette volante tissée dans la région de Corvos et très prisée par l'aristocratie locale.
#. column 1: According to Corvosi legend, there once lived a king who had a pari for a lover. At the monarch's behest, she wove an array of flying carpets, but his promiscuity led her to set fire to her handiworks in anger. This example was the only one to survive the blaze...or so certain peddlers might claim.
#. column 2: They have carpets.<br><i>Flying</i> carpets!<br>   - G'raha Tia
msgctxt "MountTransient:427:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your royal magicked carpet, and set forth to see the world shining, shimmering, splendid."
msgstr "Призовите королевский волшебный ковёр и отправляйтесь навстречу сияющему, мерцающему, великолепному миру."

#. ja: 魔法仕掛けの空飛ぶ絨毯。コルヴォ地方のおとぎ話によれば、ある王は恋仲にあった「ペリ」という妖精に空飛ぶ絨毯を仕立てさせたが、浮気癖が祟り、怒ったペリにすべてを焼かれたという。嘘か誠か、これは焼け残った一枚だとか
#. de: Laut corvarischen Legenden lebte einst ein König, der eine Pari zur Geliebten hatte. Auf seinen Befehl hin webte sie ihm einige fliegende Teppiche, doch als er sie betrog, ließ sie alle davon in Flammen aufgehen. Einzig dieses Exemplar hat das Feuer überlebt<nbsp>... so behaupten zumindest gewisse Händler.
#. fr: Ce tapis luxueux a subi un enchantement lui permettant de voler. Selon une vieille légende corvosienne, un roi aurait fait tisser plusieurs d'entre eux pour sa bien-aimée, la fée Pari ; mais lorsque celle-ci découvrit le tempérament volage de son amant, elle entra dans une colère noire et brûla tous les tapis qu'il lui avait offerts. Croyez-le ou non, cet exemplaire serait le seul à avoir échappé à sa fureur...
#. column 0: Summon forth your royal magicked carpet, and set forth to see the world shining, shimmering, splendid.
#. column 2: They have carpets.<br><i>Flying</i> carpets!<br>   - G'raha Tia
msgctxt "MountTransient:427:0:1"
msgid "According to Corvosi legend, there once lived a king who had a pari for a lover. At the monarch's behest, she wove an array of flying carpets, but his promiscuity led her to set fire to her handiworks in anger. This example was the only one to survive the blaze...or so certain peddlers might claim."
msgstr "По легенде Корвоса, жил-был король, у которого была возлюбленная пари. По его приказу она соткала множество летающих ковров, но из-за его любвеобильности в гневе сожгла все свои творения. Этот ковёр якобы единственный уцелел в огне… По крайней мере, так утверждают некоторые торговцы."

#. ja: フランフワン♪
#. de: Sie haben Teppiche. <i>Fliegende</i> Teppiche!<br><i>G'raha Tia</i>
#. fr: Fiouuuumh !
#. column 0: Summon forth your royal magicked carpet, and set forth to see the world shining, shimmering, splendid.
#. column 1: According to Corvosi legend, there once lived a king who had a pari for a lover. At the monarch's behest, she wove an array of flying carpets, but his promiscuity led her to set fire to her handiworks in anger. This example was the only one to survive the blaze...or so certain peddlers might claim.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "MountTransient:427:0:2"
msgid "They have carpets.<br><i>Flying</i> carpets!<br>   - G'raha Tia"
msgstr "У них есть ковры.<br><i>Летающие</i> ковры!<br>   — Г'раха Тиа"

#. ja: トラル・スノーマンに騎乗する。<br>トラル大陸の山岳部に伝わる「雪の精霊」を模した雪だるま
#. de: Rufe deinen turalischen Schneemann als Reittier herbei. Ryoqor Terteh zum Anfassen!
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture bonhomme de neige turalien, dont l'apparence est inspirée de l'esprit des neiges qui apparaît dans certaines légendes turaliennes.
#. column 1: A snowman designed in the likeness of Ryoqor Terteh, one of the playful spirits that call Worqor Zormor home. Said spirit is known to disguise itself as a snowman in order to sneak into settlements─a trick which you can now also perform thanks to the enchantment which allows this imitation to carry a single person.
#. column 2: Have you ever beheld such<br>a magnificent snowman!?<br>   - Frost Fanatic
msgctxt "MountTransient:428:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Turali snowman, and frolic as only Ryoqor Terteh can."
msgstr "Призовите тулалийского снеговика и резвитесь, как сам Рёкор Терте."

#. ja: トラル大陸の山岳部に伝わる雪の精霊「リョコー・テーテ」を模した雪だるま。込められた魔法により、人を運ぶことができる。ちなみに、件の精霊は大の遊び好きであり、しばしば雪だるまに化けて人里に入り込むこともあるらしい
#. de: Dieser Schneemann ist einem der verspielten Geister Worqor Zormors, Ryoqor Terteh, nachempfunden. Der kleine Schlingel ist bekannt dafür, sich in der Gestalt eines Schneemanns in Siedlungen ein<shy>zu<shy>schlei<shy>chen<nbsp>- ein Charakterzug, den du mit diesem Reittier nun endlich auch selbst ausleben darfst.
#. fr: Un bonhomme de neige imprégné d'une magie lui permettant de choisir son pro<shy>prié<shy>taire. Il est modelé d'après Ryoqor Terteh, l'esprit des neiges issu des légendes des régions montagneuses du Tural. Ce dernier, très joueur, s'introduit souvent dans les villages en prenant l'apparence d'un simple bonhomme de neige comme celui-ci.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Turali snowman, and frolic as only Ryoqor Terteh can.
#. column 2: Have you ever beheld such<br>a magnificent snowman!?<br>   - Frost Fanatic
msgctxt "MountTransient:428:0:1"
msgid "A snowman designed in the likeness of Ryoqor Terteh, one of the playful spirits that call Worqor Zormor home. Said spirit is known to disguise itself as a snowman in order to sneak into settlements─a trick which you can now also perform thanks to the enchantment which allows this imitation to carry a single person."
msgstr "Снеговик сделан по образу Рёкора Терте — одного из игривых духов Ворквор Зормора. Этот дух любит притворяться снеговиком и пробираться в поселения. Благодаря заклинанию, позволяющему этой копии перевозить одного человека, теперь вы тоже можете проделывать такой трюк."

#. ja: ヒエヒエ！
#. de: Hast du schon diesen grandiosen Schneemann bestaunt?<br><i>Entzückter Handwerker</i>
#. fr: Gla gla<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Turali snowman, and frolic as only Ryoqor Terteh can.
#. column 1: A snowman designed in the likeness of Ryoqor Terteh, one of the playful spirits that call Worqor Zormor home. Said spirit is known to disguise itself as a snowman in order to sneak into settlements─a trick which you can now also perform thanks to the enchantment which allows this imitation to carry a single person.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:428:0:2"
msgid "Have you ever beheld such<br>a magnificent snowman!?<br>   - Frost Fanatic"
msgstr "Вы когда-нибудь видели<br>такого великолепного снеговика!?<br>   — Поклонник снега"

#. ja: ナイトスタリオンに騎乗する。<br>探偵ハルディボイルドの愛機、ナイトスタリオンのレプリカモデル
#. de: Steige auf deinen Nachthengst auf. Ein Nachbau von Hildibrühs abgebrühter Lieblingsmaschine.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture Étalon nocturne, une réplique de la moto de prédilection d'Hildibrut.
#. column 1: This Night Stallion is a replica of Hardiboiled's beloved air-wheeler, though only in appearance, for the detective's vehicle is tuned to produce so much power, it would be dangerous in the hands of any but himself. The output of this model is factory stock, making it far more manageable.
#. column 2: He's a custom job<br>built for yours truly.<br>   - Hardiboiled
msgctxt "MountTransient:429:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Night Stallion, a replica of Hardiboiled's beloved air-wheeler."
msgstr "Призовите Ночного жеребца — копию любимого аэроколеса Хардбойлда."

#. ja: 探偵ハルディボイルドの愛機、ナイトスタリオンのレプリカモデル。原型機は徹底的なカスタムにより操作性がピーキーになり過ぎて、素人には運転が困難となっていたが、こちらは純正仕様であり、機体反応もごく素直である
#. de: Dieser Luftraser ist ein Nachbau von Hildibrühs treuer und vor allem abgebrühter Lieblingsmaschine, dem „Nachthengst“. Da das Original aufgrund seiner schier unbändigen Beschleunigung jeden außer den Meisterdetektiv höchstselbst aus dem Sattel schmeißt, musste diese Version stark gedrosselt werden.
#. fr: Cette copie ressemble en tout point au véhicule tant choyé par l'enquêteur alexandrin. Toutefois, le modèle d'Hildibrut ayant été personnalisé à outrance par son pro<shy>prié<shy>taire, il est pratiquement impossible à utiliser pour un profane. Cette réplique présente donc des réglages d'usine, pour une conduite facile et intuitive.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Night Stallion, a replica of Hardiboiled's beloved air-wheeler.
#. column 2: He's a custom job<br>built for yours truly.<br>   - Hardiboiled
msgctxt "MountTransient:429:0:1"
msgid "This Night Stallion is a replica of Hardiboiled's beloved air-wheeler, though only in appearance, for the detective's vehicle is tuned to produce so much power, it would be dangerous in the hands of any but himself. The output of this model is factory stock, making it far more manageable."
msgstr "Этот Ночной жеребец — лишь внешне точная копия любимого аэроколеса Хардбойлда. Детектив так настроил свой байк, что его чудовищная мощь опасна для любого другого водителя. У этой модели заводские настройки, так что управлять ей куда проще."

#. ja: 200馬力！
#. de: Hehe, willst du auch mal eine Runde auf meinem Liebling drehen?<br><i>Hildibrüh</i>
#. fr: 200 ch<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your Night Stallion, a replica of Hardiboiled's beloved air-wheeler.
#. column 1: This Night Stallion is a replica of Hardiboiled's beloved air-wheeler, though only in appearance, for the detective's vehicle is tuned to produce so much power, it would be dangerous in the hands of any but himself. The output of this model is factory stock, making it far more manageable.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:429:0:2"
msgid "He's a custom job<br>built for yours truly.<br>   - Hardiboiled"
msgstr "Он собран на заказ,<br>специально для меня.<br>   — Хардивойлд"

#. ja: ガードスコーピオンに騎乗する。<br>サソリに似た大型魔導アーマーのレプリカ
#. de: Rufe deinen Wachskorpion in die Schlacht, die giftigste Kampfmaschine weit und breit.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture scorpion gardien, une im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nante armure magitek.
#. column 1: Commissioned to produce a prize for the Gold Saucer, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks opted to create this replica of the magitek scorpion. By forgoing armaments and rethinking materials from the ground up, they succeeded in reducing size and weight and minimizing energy consumption.
#. column 2: Remember to attack<br>while it's tail's up!<br>   - Alliance Soldier
msgctxt "MountTransient:430:0:0"
msgid "Call into action your magitek scorpion. Bears no armaments, so poses no danger whether its tail is up or down."
msgstr "Призовите магитехнического скорпиона. Он безоружен, так что опасности не представляет, поднимет хвост или опустит."

#. ja: 遊技場用の景品を依頼されたガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が、ガレマール帝国製の魔導アーマーを参考に造り上げた機体。武装は撤去し、省エネルギーで動けるよう材質から一新、小型軽量化に成功している
#. de: Als man die Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke bat, einen Preis für eine Attraktion im Gold Saucer zu entwickeln, ließ man sich dort von einer garleischen Kampfmaschine inspirieren<nbsp>- auf die Bewaffnung wurde aus nach<shy>voll<shy>zieh<shy>baren Gründen jedoch verzichtet. Heraus kam ein kompaktes Fortbewegungsmittel, das dank seiner leichten Bauweise äußerst energieeffizient ist.
#. fr: Cette machine a été conçue par les Forges de Garlond pour servir de prix au Gold Saucer. Son apparence est inspirée du scorpion magitek de l'empire de Garlemald. En lui retirant toutes ses armes, les ingénieurs ont réussi à rendre ce modèle bien plus léger et maniable que l'original.
#. column 0: Call into action your magitek scorpion. Bears no armaments, so poses no danger whether its tail is up or down.
#. column 2: Remember to attack<br>while it's tail's up!<br>   - Alliance Soldier
msgctxt "MountTransient:430:0:1"
msgid "Commissioned to produce a prize for the Gold Saucer, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks opted to create this replica of the magitek scorpion. By forgoing armaments and rethinking materials from the ground up, they succeeded in reducing size and weight and minimizing energy consumption."
msgstr "Инженерам компании „Гарлондские мастерские“ поручили создать приз для Золотого блюдца. Они решили сделать копию магитехнического скорпиона. Отказавшись от вооружения и полностью переработав материалы, им удалось уменьшить размеры и вес машины, а также снизить расход энергии."

#. ja: サーチ・アンド・デストロイ！
#. de: Wann wird sie endlich frei sein von dem Gift der Skorpione?<br><i>Jenlyns</i>
#. fr: Localiser et exterminer<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into action your magitek scorpion. Bears no armaments, so poses no danger whether its tail is up or down.
#. column 1: Commissioned to produce a prize for the Gold Saucer, the engineers of Garlond Ironworks opted to create this replica of the magitek scorpion. By forgoing armaments and rethinking materials from the ground up, they succeeded in reducing size and weight and minimizing energy consumption.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:430:0:2"
msgid "Remember to attack<br>while it's tail's up!<br>   - Alliance Soldier"
msgstr "Не забывайте атаковать,<br>пока хвост поднят!<br>   — Солдат Альянса"

#. ja: ロケットパンチに騎乗する。<br>拳型のロケット、あるいはロケットのようなパンチ
#. de: Rufe deinen Raketenschlag herbei. Eine reitbare Rakete, welche die Form einer Faust annimmt<nbsp>- oder andersherum, je nachdem, wie man es dreht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture astéropoing, un missile à la forme de poing, ou serait-ce plutôt un poing doté de propulseurs<nbsp>?
#. column 1: This personal mode of transport assuming the form of a fist was created by Wedge of Garlond Ironworks, who went so far as to give it fully articulated fingers. While the reason for its unconventional design is unclear, it cannot be denied that it boasts a certain awe factor.
#. column 2: I'll warm up when I<br>throw a punch or two.<br>   - Lyse
msgctxt "MountTransient:432:0:0"
msgid "Call into action your rocket punch. A ridable rocket that takes the form of a fist─or vice versa, depending on one's philosophy."
msgstr "Призовите ракетный кулак. Это ракета, на которой можно ездить, в форме кулака — или кулак с ракетным двигателем, смотря как на это посмотреть."

#. ja: ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社の技師、ウェッジが手掛けた個人用飛行機械。なぜか拳型という非効率的なデザインを採用しているが、その理由や着想元については明かされていない。とはいえ力強さは抜群である
#. de: Dieses sonderbare Transportmittel wurde von Wedge von den Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ken entwickelt, der seiner Detailverliebtheit in Form von komplett funktionalen Fingern Ausdruck verliehen hat. Das Warum und Weshalb hinter dem ulkigen Aussehen der Rakete kennt wohl nur Wedge selbst, aber ein gewisser Charme ist ihr nicht abzusprechen.
#. fr: Cet engin volant a été conçu par Wedge des Forges de Garlond. Sa forme semble contraire à tous les principes d'aérodynamique et pourtant, l'ingénieur n'a jamais jugé bon de justifier son choix. Malgré cela, il demeure très im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nant<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into action your rocket punch. A ridable rocket that takes the form of a fist─or vice versa, depending on one's philosophy.
#. column 2: I'll warm up when I<br>throw a punch or two.<br>   - Lyse
msgctxt "MountTransient:432:0:1"
msgid "This personal mode of transport assuming the form of a fist was created by Wedge of Garlond Ironworks, who went so far as to give it fully articulated fingers. While the reason for its unconventional design is unclear, it cannot be denied that it boasts a certain awe factor."
msgstr "Это личное летательное средство в форме кулака создал Ведж из Гарлондских мастерских. Он даже сделал пальцы полностью подвижными. Зачем понадобился такой необычный дизайн, неизвестно, но выглядит он впечатляюще."

#. ja: ロケットパーンチッ！！
#. de: Raketensalve detektiert.<br><i>Alfonse</i>
#. fr: Astérooo-poiiing<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into action your rocket punch. A ridable rocket that takes the form of a fist─or vice versa, depending on one's philosophy.
#. column 1: This personal mode of transport assuming the form of a fist was created by Wedge of Garlond Ironworks, who went so far as to give it fully articulated fingers. While the reason for its unconventional design is unclear, it cannot be denied that it boasts a certain awe factor.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:432:0:2"
msgid "I'll warm up when I<br>throw a punch or two.<br>   - Lyse"
msgstr "Разогреюсь, когда пару раз<br>кому-нибудь врежу.<br>   — Лисе"

#. ja: クーシーに騎乗する。<br>すっかり頼もしくなった、魔獣使いとしてのよき相棒
#. de: Rufe deinen Cu Sith herbei, den besten Freund des Bestienbändigers.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture cu sith, le meilleur ami des dresseurs.
#. column 1: This dog-like beast encountered in the Black Shroud is a surpassing rare sight in Eorzea. After forging a bond with you, the creature went on to show tremendous development, and proved its worth against the fearsome Guttler─a transformation driven in no small part by its desire to bear you upon its back.
#. column 2: You and your Cu Sith have more in common<br>than you might have dreamthought!<br>   - Loosefrox
msgctxt "MountTransient:434:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your Cu Sith, a beastmaster's best friend."
msgstr "Призовите ку-сита — лучшего друга зверовода."

#. ja: 黒衣森で出会った、エオルゼアでは極めて珍しい魔獣。魔獣使いと絆を結び、宿敵たるガトラーにも力を示したことで心身ともにたくましく成長した。その裏には、主人たる冒険者を背に乗せたいとの強い想いもあったようだ
#. de: Diese hundeartige Bestie, der du im Tiefen Wald begegnet bist, ist eine außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>lich seltene Sichtung in Eorzea. Nachdem ihr ein starkes Band geschmiedet habt, hat sich diese Kreatur ebenso außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>lich entwickelt und selbst Guttler besiegen können. Nun scheint Cu Sith von dem innigen Wunsch beseelt, dich auf seinem Rücken durch die Welt zu tragen.
#. fr: Un animal ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment rare en Éorzéa, rencontré par hasard dans la forêt de Sombrelinceul. Votre amitié s'est développée en parallèle des capacités physiques et mentales de l'animal, ce qui vous a permis de vaincre ensemble Dévoreuse. Il a continué de s'améliorer, poussé par son désir profond de vous porter sur son dos en guise de re<shy>mer<shy>cie<shy>ment.
#. column 0: Summon forth your Cu Sith, a beastmaster's best friend.
#. column 2: You and your Cu Sith have more in common<br>than you might have dreamthought!<br>   - Loosefrox
msgctxt "MountTransient:434:0:1"
msgid "This dog-like beast encountered in the Black Shroud is a surpassing rare sight in Eorzea. After forging a bond with you, the creature went on to show tremendous development, and proved its worth against the fearsome Guttler─a transformation driven in no small part by its desire to bear you upon its back."
msgstr "Этот похожий на собаку зверь, которого вы встретили в Чёрной чаще, — большая редкость в Эорзее. После того как он привязался к вам, он заметно окреп и доказал свою силу в схватке с грозным Гаттлером. Не в последнюю очередь им двигало желание возить вас на спине."

#. ja: グルゥ♪
#. de: Sehr schön! Dein Cu Sith steckt voller Tatendrang.<br><i>J'yhuh Tia</i>
#. fr: Graouh<nbsp>!♪
#. column 0: Summon forth your Cu Sith, a beastmaster's best friend.
#. column 1: This dog-like beast encountered in the Black Shroud is a surpassing rare sight in Eorzea. After forging a bond with you, the creature went on to show tremendous development, and proved its worth against the fearsome Guttler─a transformation driven in no small part by its desire to bear you upon its back.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:434:0:2"
msgid "You and your Cu Sith have more in common<br>than you might have dreamthought!<br>   - Loosefrox"
msgstr "Вы с ку-ситом похожи<br>куда больше, чем думаете!<br>   — Лусфрокс"

#. ja: クワイエット・コリブリに騎乗する。<br>三日月島に居着いたコリブリの一種
#. de: Rufe deinen schweigsamen Kolibri herbei und genieße mit ihm die Ruhe der Natur.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture colibri silencieux, un volatile originaire de l'île de Lunule.
#. column 1: Native to the Occult Crescent, this colibri was found whipping Garula into a frenzy, which prompted Ketenramm to intervene and subdue the creature. It was subsequently trained to serve as a beast of burden, and has traded its foul-mouthed cawing for dignified silence.
#. column 2: I'm still hungry enough to eat<br>a whole roasted colibri.<br>   - Wuk Lamat
msgctxt "MountTransient:435:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your colibri callado, a deceptively strong cloudkin that can carry several times its weight."
msgstr "Призовите колибри калладо — маленькую, но сильную птицу, способную нести груз в несколько раз тяжелее себя."

#. ja: 三日月島に棲息していたコリブリ。巨獣ネオガルラをやかましく煽り荒ぶらせていたため、ケテンラムが成敗。手なづけて騎獣代わりにしたらしい。今ではその口の悪さも鳴りを潜め、すっかり無口になっているようだ
#. de: Diese Kolibri-Art ist auf Kreszentia heimisch und für gewöhnlich unvorstellbar laut und gesprächig. Um zu verhindern, dass sie mit ihrem Geschnatter erneut Bestien wie Neo Garula wecken, zähmt und trainiert Ketenramm nun jeden Vogel, den er erwischen kann, persönlich. Heraus kam dabei dieses wortkarge Exemplar, das auch als Reittier-Ersatz verwendet werden kann.
#. fr: Ce colibri passait son temps à provoquer le néo-garula, au point de le rendre totalement enragé. Ketenramm a alors décidé de le neutraliser. Depuis, le vieux navigateur a réussi à apprivoiser l'étrange oiseau. Son exploit le plus remarquable<nbsp>: lui avoir appris à se taire, ce qui n'est pas pour vous déplaire.
#. column 0: Summon forth your colibri callado, a deceptively strong cloudkin that can carry several times its weight.
#. column 2: I'm still hungry enough to eat<br>a whole roasted colibri.<br>   - Wuk Lamat
msgctxt "MountTransient:435:0:1"
msgid "Native to the Occult Crescent, this colibri was found whipping Garula into a frenzy, which prompted Ketenramm to intervene and subdue the creature. It was subsequently trained to serve as a beast of burden, and has traded its foul-mouthed cawing for dignified silence."
msgstr "Этот колибри обитал на Тайном Полумесяце и доводил гарулу до бешенства своими криками. Кетенрамм вмешался и усмирил птицу. Позже её приручили, чтобы использовать как вьючное животное. Теперь вместо сквернословных криков она хранит достойное молчание."

#. ja: しーっ！
#. de: Na warte! Dir stopf ich den vorlauten Schnabel!<br><i>Wuk Lamat</i>
#. fr: Chuuut<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your colibri callado, a deceptively strong cloudkin that can carry several times its weight.
#. column 1: Native to the Occult Crescent, this colibri was found whipping Garula into a frenzy, which prompted Ketenramm to intervene and subdue the creature. It was subsequently trained to serve as a beast of burden, and has traded its foul-mouthed cawing for dignified silence.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:435:0:2"
msgid "I'm still hungry enough to eat<br>a whole roasted colibri.<br>   - Wuk Lamat"
msgstr "Я всё ещё так голодна, что<br>съела бы целого жареного колибри.<br>   — Вук Ламат"

#. ja: ハイドラに騎乗する。<br>ドラゴン族をもとに創られたキメラ生物
#. de: Rufe deine Hydra herbei. Gib nur Acht, dass jeder ihrer Köpfe gut gefüttert ist und sich nicht an einem Passanten vergeht.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture hydre, une chimère draconique.
#. column 1: Appearing to be a three-headed dragon, the hydra is in truth a product of chimerical experiments on dragonkind. While the creature has been blessed with transcendent might and vitality, its intelligence remains that of an ordinary beast, meaning it can be tamed by a skilled beastmaster.
#. column 2: I was bloody <i>sure</i> ye'd<br>be hydra dung by now...<br>   - Gerolt
msgctxt "MountTransient:436:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your hydra. All three heads guaranteed to mean business or your money back."
msgstr "Призовите гидру. Все три головы настроены решительно — или вернём деньги!"

#. ja: 胴体から枝分かれした複数の首を有する多頭竜。その正体はドラゴン族をベースとして創り出されたキメラ生物であり、生命力が向上した反面、知能は獣同然に低くなっている。それゆえ魔獣使いであれば使役もできるはずだ
#. de: Zwar denkt man beim Anblick der Hydra zuerst an einen Drachen mit drei Köpfen, doch in Wahrheit entspringt sie chimärischen Experimenten. Während ihre Lebenskraft und Stärke ihresgleichen suchen, ist die Hydra lediglich so klug wie jede andere Bestie Eorzeas. Soll heißen: Für einen geschickten Bestienbändiger kein Problem.
#. fr: Cet ersatz de dragon a comme particularité de posséder plusieurs têtes reliées à un même corps. En raison de sa nature chimérique, son endurance a été grandement améliorée au prix d'une in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence comparable à celle d'une bête ordinaire, ce qui facilite grandement son domptage.
#. column 0: Summon forth your hydra. All three heads guaranteed to mean business or your money back.
#. column 2: I was bloody <i>sure</i> ye'd<br>be hydra dung by now...<br>   - Gerolt
msgctxt "MountTransient:436:0:1"
msgid "Appearing to be a three-headed dragon, the hydra is in truth a product of chimerical experiments on dragonkind. While the creature has been blessed with transcendent might and vitality, its intelligence remains that of an ordinary beast, meaning it can be tamed by a skilled beastmaster."
msgstr "Гидра похожа на трёхголового дракона, но на самом деле это результат химерических экспериментов над драконьим родом. Ей достались невероятная сила и живучесть, но разум остался на уровне обычного зверя. Умелый зверовод вполне может её приручить."

#. ja: グル、グル、グルル…
#. de: Du wärst gut beraten, dich an die Variante mit nur einem Kopf zu halten.<br><i>Elenyate</i>
#. fr: Grrr... Grrr... Grrrrrr...
#. column 0: Summon forth your hydra. All three heads guaranteed to mean business or your money back.
#. column 1: Appearing to be a three-headed dragon, the hydra is in truth a product of chimerical experiments on dragonkind. While the creature has been blessed with transcendent might and vitality, its intelligence remains that of an ordinary beast, meaning it can be tamed by a skilled beastmaster.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:436:0:2"
msgid "I was bloody <i>sure</i> ye'd<br>be hydra dung by now...<br>   - Gerolt"
msgstr "Я-то был чертовски <i>уверен</i>, что ты<br>уже станешь навозом для гидр...<br>   — Герольт"

#. ja: ダックポーターに騎乗する。<br>三日月島で遭遇した使い魔。鍵師は引退したらしい
#. de: Rufe deinen Schnabelpförtner herbei und lass dich von ihm sicher durch jegliche Türen und Tore kutschieren.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture ornithorynque porteur, un familier venu de l'île de Lunule et spécialiste en serrurerie.
#. column 1: Encountered on the Occult Crescent, this familiar bearing a resemblance to the duckbill (the creature, not the footwear) is believed to have served a sorcerer during the War of the Magi. Originally a locksmith, it has since chosen to become a porter, the better to attend to you.
#. column 2: We have to find that porter<br>right this instant!<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:437:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your duck-billed porter. Has retired from locksmithing, so won't be opening any locks for you."
msgstr "Призовите утконосого носильщика. Он бросил ремесло слесаря, так что замки вам больше не вскроет."

#. ja: カモノハシに似た獣人。身体に浮かぶ紋様から察するに、おそらく魔大戦期の魔道士に仕えた使い魔であると思われる。鍵師の役割を負っていたらしいが、冒険者を新たな主にすると決め、運び屋にジョブチェンジしたようだ
#. de: Ein entenähnliches Familiar, das während des Kriegs der Magi von einem mächtigen Magier beschworen wurde, wie die Muster auf seinem Körper vermuten lassen. Dieses Exemplar hatte nun jedoch genug von seiner bisherigen Arbeit als Schlosswächter der Fork-Türme auf Kreszentia und entschloss sich stattdessen, gemeinsam mit dir auf Abenteuerreise zu gehen.
#. fr: Cette créature anthropomorphe est pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment un familier qui date de l'époque de la Guerre de la magie. Il a longtemps officié en tant que serrurier, mais depuis qu'il vous a choisi comme <if $gn4>maîtresse<else>maître</if>, il a changé de job pour devenir porteur<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your duck-billed porter. Has retired from locksmithing, so won't be opening any locks for you.
#. column 2: We have to find that porter<br>right this instant!<br>   - Tataru
msgctxt "MountTransient:437:0:1"
msgid "Encountered on the Occult Crescent, this familiar bearing a resemblance to the duckbill (the creature, not the footwear) is believed to have served a sorcerer during the War of the Magi. Originally a locksmith, it has since chosen to become a porter, the better to attend to you."
msgstr "Этого похожего на утконоса фамильяра встретили на Тайном Полумесяце. Считается, что во время Войны магов он служил чародею. Раньше он был слесарем, но теперь решил стать носильщиком и помогать вам."

#. ja: カルカルカル！
#. de: Ich bin der Meinung, dass es unzählige Möglichkeiten gibt, wie ein Wächter seine Hingabe zum Ausdruck bringen kann.<br><i>Viraban</i>
#. fr: Brou, brou, brouuu<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Summon forth your duck-billed porter. Has retired from locksmithing, so won't be opening any locks for you.
#. column 1: Encountered on the Occult Crescent, this familiar bearing a resemblance to the duckbill (the creature, not the footwear) is believed to have served a sorcerer during the War of the Magi. Originally a locksmith, it has since chosen to become a porter, the better to attend to you.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:437:0:2"
msgid "We have to find that porter<br>right this instant!<br>   - Tataru"
msgstr "Нам нужно немедленно<br>найти того носильщика!<br>   — Татару"

#. ja: コスモ・アームドウェポン改に騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画のために製造された作業用重機
#. de: Steige in deine Kosmo-Panzerwaffe Mk-II ein. Die zweite Iteration einer alten Magitek-Kriegsmaschine aus Garlemald, die für die Kosmo-Erkundung angepasst worden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture arme blindée cosmique 2.0, une machine améliorée conçue pour le projet d'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: Initiative engineers have modified the cosmic armored weapon, installing two large tanks on its hindquarters and adding the ability to disperse fertilizer over a wide area. In the way it aids the growth of Auxesia's towering trees, it gives the impression of being a beneficial insect.
#. column 2: A hunter ain't worth shite<br>without a smithy to keep<br>him armed and armored.<br>   - Smithy
msgctxt "MountTransient:438:0:0"
msgid "Call into action your cosmic armored weapon beta. Further enhanced for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, as its cheery new color scheme would attest."
msgstr "Призовите космическое бронированное оружие бета-версии. Его усовершенствовали для программы космических исследований — о чём говорит даже новая жизнерадостная расцветка."

#. ja: 作業用重機「コスモ・アームドウェポン」の改良型。背部に大型タンクが2基増設されており、広範囲に薬剤を散布する機能が盛り込まれている。異星の巨大樹木の成長を助ける様子は、益虫のように見えることだろう
#. de: Die zweite Iteration der Kosmo-Panzerwaffe hat nun zwei Reservetanks, welche mit alchemistischen Mitteln befüllt werden können. Im Einsatz auf Auxesia wirken diese vielbeinigen Mechas beim Auftragen dieser auf Baumflächen wie große Nutzinsekten, weshalb sie viele Projektteilnehmer mit Wonne in ihre Herzen geschlossen haben.
#. fr: Cette version perfectionnée de l'arme blindée cosmique possède deux grands réservoirs à l'arrière, qui lui permettent de répandre de l'engrais sur une plus large surface. L'envoûtante danse de ces machines autour des majestueux arbres d'Auxesia évoque celle des insectes pollinisateurs.
#. column 0: Call into action your cosmic armored weapon beta. Further enhanced for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, as its cheery new color scheme would attest.
#. column 2: A hunter ain't worth shite<br>without a smithy to keep<br>him armed and armored.<br>   - Smithy
msgctxt "MountTransient:438:0:1"
msgid "Initiative engineers have modified the cosmic armored weapon, installing two large tanks on its hindquarters and adding the ability to disperse fertilizer over a wide area. In the way it aids the growth of Auxesia's towering trees, it gives the impression of being a beneficial insect."
msgstr "Инженеры программы усовершенствовали космическое бронированное оружие: установили на задней части два больших бака и добавили возможность распылять удобрения на большой площади. Помогая расти исполинским деревьям Ауксезии, оно напоминает полезное насекомое."

#. ja: プシャー！
#. de: Verstehen diese hirnlosen Insekten denn nicht, dass wir denselben Feind haben?<br><i>Estinien</i>
#. fr: Pschhh<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into action your cosmic armored weapon beta. Further enhanced for the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, as its cheery new color scheme would attest.
#. column 1: Initiative engineers have modified the cosmic armored weapon, installing two large tanks on its hindquarters and adding the ability to disperse fertilizer over a wide area. In the way it aids the growth of Auxesia's towering trees, it gives the impression of being a beneficial insect.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:438:0:2"
msgid "A hunter ain't worth shite<br>without a smithy to keep<br>him armed and armored.<br>   - Smithy"
msgstr "Без кузнеца охотнику никуда,<br>нечем будет вооружиться и доспехи починить.<br>   — Кузнец"

#. ja: コスモ・プレデターに騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画のために改良された魔導アーマー
#. de: Steige in deinen Kosmo-Prädator ein. Eine alte Magitek-Kampfmaschine aus Garlemald, die für die Kosmo-Erkundung angepasst worden ist.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture prédateur cosmique, une armure magitek améliorée pour les besoins de l'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: The predator warmachina, known for its deadliness at close quarters, has been adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Its robust arms, originally designed for destruction, proved equally useful for construction and transportation, and its successful repurposing can be attributed to the ingenuity of Garlean engineers.
#. column 2: If it bleeds, we can kill it.<br>   - Ancient Adage
msgctxt "MountTransient:440:0:0"
msgid "Call into action your cosmic predator, another deadly imperial warmachina adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative."
msgstr "Призовите космического хищника — ещё одну смертоносную имперскую боевую махину, приспособленную для программы космических исследований."

#. ja: 接近戦能力に長けた魔導兵器「プレデター」を、惑星探索用に改造した作業用重機。腕部機構を活かし、主に土木工事や運搬作業に用いられた。本機の実用化は、計画機構に参加したガレアン人技師の大きな功績と言えるだろう
#. de: Ein Prädator aus Garlemald, der für die Kosmo-Erkundung zu einem Mecha umfunktioniert wurde. Seine ursprünglich auf den Nahkampf ausgelegten Arme kommen nun vor allem auf den Baustellen und in der Logistik der Kosmo-Erkundung zum Einsatz. Die garleische Mechanikerin, welche die Umrüstung zu verantworten hat, steht beim Projektkomitee nun in allen Ehren.
#. fr: À l'origine, le prédateur était une machine de guerre bien connue pour son efficacité au combat au corps à corps. Toutefois, pour le bien du projet d'exploration cosmique, les ingénieurs garlemaldais ont redoublé de créativité afin que ses puissants bras servent désormais à assister la con<shy>struc<shy>tion et le transport de matériaux lourds.
#. column 0: Call into action your cosmic predator, another deadly imperial warmachina adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative.
#. column 2: If it bleeds, we can kill it.<br>   - Ancient Adage
msgctxt "MountTransient:440:0:1"
msgid "The predator warmachina, known for its deadliness at close quarters, has been adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Its robust arms, originally designed for destruction, proved equally useful for construction and transportation, and its successful repurposing can be attributed to the ingenuity of Garlean engineers."
msgstr "Боевой хищник, опасный в ближнем бою, был приспособлен для программы космических исследований. Его мощные руки, прежде созданные для разрушения, оказались столь же полезны при строительстве и перевозке грузов. Удачной переделке инженеры-гарлеанцы обязаны своей изобретательностью."

#. ja: ガチャン、ガチャン！
#. de: Deine Spezialität ist eher der Nahkampf, richtig?<br><i>Lorens</i>
#. fr: Clang, clang<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into action your cosmic predator, another deadly imperial warmachina adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative.
#. column 1: The predator warmachina, known for its deadliness at close quarters, has been adapted for use in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. Its robust arms, originally designed for destruction, proved equally useful for construction and transportation, and its successful repurposing can be attributed to the ingenuity of Garlean engineers.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:440:0:2"
msgid "If it bleeds, we can kill it.<br>   - Ancient Adage"
msgstr "Если оно кровоточит — мы его убьём.<br>   — Старая поговорка"

#. ja: ウィング・オブ・ニヒリティに騎乗する。<br>無の領域で発見された魔法の翼
#. de: Rufe deine Flügel des Nihilismus als Reittier herbei. Magische Schwingen, die im Nichts-Territorium geborgen wurden.
#. fr: Vous déployez vos ailes du nihilisme, découvertes par hasard dans le néant.
#. column 1: Found in the Unmaking, these unsettling wings are reminiscent of Enuo, the dread voidsent who had made their domain in the ocean's depths. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, only one whose inner light can repel all-consuming nothingness can hope to bear them.
#. column 2: All shall return to nothingness!<br>   - Emperor Xande
msgctxt "MountTransient:444:0:0"
msgid "Manifest your wings of nihility. Their unsettling, tendriled form exudes the bottomless obsession of a voidsent sovereign."
msgstr "Призовите крылья небытия. Их тревожная щупальцеобразная форма источает бездонную одержимость владыки пустотных."

#. ja: 無の領域で発見された、魔法の翼。触手じみた尾羽根など見る者にどこか不安を抱かせる形状だが、その来歴は謎に包まれている。いずれにせよ、この翼を授かりし者は「無への誘い」をも跳ね除ける光を心に宿すことだろう
#. de: Magische Flügel, die am Ort deines Kampfes mit Enuo gefunden wurden. Aus unerklärlichen Gründen wecken sie ein Gefühl der Unsicherheit in all ihren Betrachtern, ihre Herkunft ist und bleibt jedoch ein Rätsel.   Nur die stärksten Seelen, deren inneres Licht selbst dem alles verschlingenden Nichts zu trotzen vermag, sind vor seinen düsteren Einflüssen gefeit.
#. fr: Ces ailes magiques provenant du domaine du néant présentent de terrifiantes rectrices ressemblant à des tentacules. Leur origine reste nimbée de mystère, toutefois s'en parer semble permettre de résister à l'appel du néant.
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of nihility. Their unsettling, tendriled form exudes the bottomless obsession of a voidsent sovereign.
#. column 2: All shall return to nothingness!<br>   - Emperor Xande
msgctxt "MountTransient:444:0:1"
msgid "Found in the Unmaking, these unsettling wings are reminiscent of Enuo, the dread voidsent who had made their domain in the ocean's depths. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, only one whose inner light can repel all-consuming nothingness can hope to bear them."
msgstr "Эти тревожные крылья нашли в Разрушении мира. Они напоминают Энуо — ужасного пустотного, обосновавшегося в морских глубинах. Их происхождение окутано тайной, и носить их сможет лишь тот, чей внутренний свет способен отразить всепоглощающее небытие."

#. ja: …………
#. de: Alles kehrt nun ins Nichts zurück, wie Ihr es Euch erhofftet.<br><i>Zodiark</i>
#. fr: ...
#. column 0: Manifest your wings of nihility. Their unsettling, tendriled form exudes the bottomless obsession of a voidsent sovereign.
#. column 1: Found in the Unmaking, these unsettling wings are reminiscent of Enuo, the dread voidsent who had made their domain in the ocean's depths. While their origin is shrouded in mystery, only one whose inner light can repel all-consuming nothingness can hope to bear them.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:444:0:2"
msgid "All shall return to nothingness!<br>   - Emperor Xande"
msgstr "Всё обратится в ничто!<br>   — Император Занди"

#. ja: 掘採型パワーローダーに騎乗する。<br>惑星パエンナでの作業用に開発された作業用重機
#. de: Steige in deinen Sternenläufer Mk-B ein. Extra für Phaenna zum Buddeln und Graben.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture mécano cosmique excavateur, une machine conçue pour les opérations sur Phaenna.
#. column 1: Created for mining operations in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, the excavating vacuum suit was initially intended to be equipped with a pile bunker. However, this was altered to be a device that harnesses ionic energy on Phaenna, and it ended up going berserk and running amok.
#. column 2: Had I the components from a standard<br>magitek excavator, I could begin fitting<br>them immediately!<br>   - Justa
msgctxt "MountTransient:445:0:0"
msgid "Summon forth your excavating vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina."
msgstr "Призовите экскаваторный вакуумный скафандр и осуществите мечту — пилотируйте футуристическую двуногую махину."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた作業用重機。掘採作業に特化すべく、当初はパイルバンカーの装備が検討されていたが、惑星パエンナの雷気イオンを利用した特殊装置に変更され、さながら狂戦士のように暴れ回った
#. de: Dieser Sternenläufer wurde speziell für Einsätze in den Minen Phaennas hergestellt. Dazu sollte er ursprünglich mit einer Pfahlramme versehen werden, doch die Idee musste letztendlich einer Apparatur zur Sammlung von Ionenenergie auf Phaenna weichen. Infolgedessen ist der Mecha dann allerdings völlig durchgedreht.
#. fr: Cet engin de chantier, spécialisé dans les travaux d'excavation, devait à l'origine être équipé d'un marteau-pilon. Toutefois, il fut remplacé par un module permettant d'emmagasiner les ions de foudre de Phaenna, qui, une fois plein, rendit la machine survoltée et inarrêtable.
#. column 0: Summon forth your excavating vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 2: Had I the components from a standard<br>magitek excavator, I could begin fitting<br>them immediately!<br>   - Justa
msgctxt "MountTransient:445:0:1"
msgid "Created for mining operations in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, the excavating vacuum suit was initially intended to be equipped with a pile bunker. However, this was altered to be a device that harnesses ionic energy on Phaenna, and it ended up going berserk and running amok."
msgstr "Эту буровую машину создали для добычи полезных ископаемых в рамках программы космических исследований. Изначально её собирались оснастить свайным молотом, но вместо него установили устройство, собирающее ионную энергию на Фаэнне. В итоге машина обезумела и принялась громить всё вокруг."

#. ja: ガシュン、ガシュン…
#. de: Leicht, wasserdicht und wunderschön! Kannst du mir einen beschaffen? Bitte!<br><i>Uin Nee</i>
#. fr: Tchonk, tchonk...
#. column 0: Summon forth your excavating vacuum suit, and live the dream of piloting a futuristic bipedal machina.
#. column 1: Created for mining operations in the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, the excavating vacuum suit was initially intended to be equipped with a pile bunker. However, this was altered to be a device that harnesses ionic energy on Phaenna, and it ended up going berserk and running amok.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:445:0:2"
msgid "Had I the components from a standard<br>magitek excavator, I could begin fitting<br>them immediately!<br>   - Justa"
msgstr "Дайте мне детали от обычного<br>магитехнического экскаватора — и я сразу<br>начну его собирать!<br>   — Юста"

#. ja: グレーホイールローダーに騎乗する。<br>コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた灰色の作業用重機
#. de: Nimm auf deinem Sternenebner Mk-G Platz. Das „G“ steht für „grau“.
#. fr: Vous appelez votre monture déblayeuse cosmique grise, un engin de chantier crée pour le projet d'exploration cosmique.
#. column 1: The six-wheeled warp loader, tireless workhorse of the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, has been reimagined in smoldering grey. However, it would be a mistake to assume the color is the only difference, for a cutting-edge ceramic coating has also been applied to the drivetrain, which reduces friction and enhances performance.
#. column 2: Look at the warp loader go!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
msgctxt "MountTransient:446:0:0"
msgid "Call into action your carbide grey warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life faster."
msgstr "Призовите серый карбидный колёсный погрузчик Телепортации и с лёгкостью прокладывайте себе путь."

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画のために作られた作業用重機。ホイールローダーを灰色に塗装し直しただけと思うなかれ、駆動部に特殊な磁器コーティングを施すことで抵抗を減らし、反応速度を向上しているのだという
#. de: „Das neueste Modell des allseits beliebten Sternenebners ist grau<nbsp>- und nicht viel mehr!“<nbsp>- das hätte man gedacht, würde hier stehen. Aber diesmal handelt es sich tatsächlich um eine Verbesserung des Altmodells. Der Neuanstrich mit Porzellanbeschichtung macht den Mecha jetzt nämlich deutlich beweglicher und reaktionsfreudiger in der Handhabung. Und das soll nicht unterschlagen werden.
#. fr: Cette version révisée de la déblayeuse cosmique offre des améliorations notables outre son nouveau coloris. Son revêtement en céramique permet de minimiser la résistance de l'air et d'augmenter sa vitesse de réaction.
#. column 0: Call into action your carbide grey warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life faster.
#. column 2: Look at the warp loader go!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member
msgctxt "MountTransient:446:0:1"
msgid "The six-wheeled warp loader, tireless workhorse of the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, has been reimagined in smoldering grey. However, it would be a mistake to assume the color is the only difference, for a cutting-edge ceramic coating has also been applied to the drivetrain, which reduces friction and enhances performance."
msgstr "Шестиколёсный погрузчик Телепортации — неутомимая рабочая лошадка программы космических исследований — теперь окрашен в дымчато-серый цвет. Но дело не только в окраске: на привод нанесли современное керамическое покрытие, чтобы уменьшить трение и повысить производительность."

#. ja: グレードスリー！
#. de: Hm<nbsp>... Das ist<nbsp>... Porzellan?<br><i>Uin Nee</i>
#. fr: Fwouuush<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Call into action your carbide grey warp loader, and bulldoze your way through life faster.
#. column 1: The six-wheeled warp loader, tireless workhorse of the Cosmic Exploration Initiative, has been reimagined in smoldering grey. However, it would be a mistake to assume the color is the only difference, for a cutting-edge ceramic coating has also been applied to the drivetrain, which reduces friction and enhances performance.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "MountTransient:446:0:2"
msgid "Look at the warp loader go!<br>   - Cosmic Exploration Initiative Member"
msgstr "Вот это разгон у погрузчика!<br>   — Участник программы космических исследований"
